      "company_function": "",
      "company_summary": "Applied Spectral Imaging (ASI) is a global leader in biomedical imaging, specializing in innovative diagnostic solutions for pathology and cytogenetic laboratories. The company offers advanced platforms such as HiBand, HiFISH, and CytoPower for cytogenetics, as well as HiPath Pro and PathFusion for digital pathology, catering to the needs of professionals in healthcare and biomedical imaging.",
