      "key_products": "HiBand, HiFISH, CytoPower, HiPath Pro, PathFusion",
      "polished_summary": "Applied Spectral Imaging (ASI) is a global leader in biomedical imaging, specializing in innovative diagnostic solutions for pathology and cytogenetic laboratories. The company offers advanced platforms such as HiBand, HiFISH, and CytoPower for cytogenetics, as well as HiPath Pro and PathFusion for digital pathology, catering to the needs of professionals in healthcare and biomedical imaging.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Applied Spectral Imaging specializes in biomedical imaging and offers advanced diagnostic solutions specifically for cytogenetics and digital pathology, which directly relates to the spectral sensor market. Their products, such as HiBand, HiFISH, and CytoPower, are designed for spectral imaging applications in healthcare.",
