      "company_summary": "Avantes is a leading manufacturer specializing in fiber optic spectrometers and light sources, delivering high-performance solutions for a diverse range of applications in spectroscopy. Their product lineup includes the SensLine, CompactLine, StarLine, and NIRLine spectrometers, as well as advanced light sources like the AvaLight-DHc and AvaLight-HAL-S-Mini, catering to industries such as agriculture, medical, environmental, and semiconductor. With a focus on research institutions and industrial applications, Avantes is committed to providing innovative tools for precise measurements and data analysis.",
