            "text": "Skip to main content\n\n][1]\nZEISS Group Global\nOpens in another tab [ ][2] [ back ][3]\nGlobal\n* [ About us ][4]\n* [ Products and solutions ][5]\n* [ Careers ][6]\n* [ Contact ][7]\n* [ Contact ][8]\n* ### Related ZEISS Websites\n* [ Annual Report of the ZEISS Group ][9]\n* [ ZEISS Forum ][10]\n[ ][11]\n[ ][12]\n[ ][13]\n\n## For which product or product area would you like to contact us?\n\nBased on your selection, we will guide you to proper contact\n\nYour product interest\n* [Vision Care][14]\n* [Extended Reality][15]\n* [Medical Technology][16]\n* [Semiconductor Manufacturing Technology][17]\n* [Industrial Quality Solutions][18]\n* [Research Microscopy Solutions][19]\n* [Photography][20]\n* [Cinematography][21]\n* [Hunting][22]\n* [Nature Observation][23]\n* [Simulation Projection Solutions][24]\n* [Planetariums][25]\n* [Spectroscopy][26]\n* [OEM Solutions][27]\n* [Digital Solutions][28]\nConfirm product selection\nCancel\nZEISS Group\n\n# Contact & Support\n\n[ Overview ][29]\n\n## Important contacts at a glance\n* [\n[ZEISS Products & Solutions] [ZEISS Products & Solutions]\n\n### Products & Services\n\nDo you have an inquiry about a product or a service request?\n\n][30]\n* [\n[ZEISS Career] [ZEISS Career]\n\n### Jobs & Careers\n\nAre you interested in a job at ZEISS?\n\n][31]\n* [\n[ZEISS Press & Media] [ZEISS Press & Media]\n\n### Press & Media\n\nAre you looking for the right press contact or have a general press inquiry?\n\n][32]\n* [\n[ZEISS Supplier] [ZEISS Supplier]\n\n### Supplier\n\nDo you need information about our purchasing and supplier portal?\n\n][33]\n* [\n[ZEISS Conference Center] [ZEISS Conference Center]\n\n### Conference Center\n\nAre you looking for a state-of-the-art event location for a business event?\n\n][34]\n* [\n[ZEISS Museum] [ZEISS Museum]\n\n### ZEISS Museum\n\nAre you interested in a guided tour in the ZEISS Museum of optics or would like to handover a\ndevice?\n\n][35]\n* [\n[ZEISS History & Archive] [ZEISS History & Archive]\n\n### History & Archive\n\nWould you like to learn more about the history of ZEISS or the older ZEISS products?\n\n][36]\n* [\n[ZEISS CAD Systems] [ZEISS CAD Systems]\n\n### CAD Systems\n\nDo you need information about the Creo Parametric CAD system used at ZEISS?\n\n][37]\n\n## Your general inquiry for ZEISS\n\nZEISS Headquarters Oberkochen | Germany\n[ZEISS Group] [ZEISS Group]\n\nIf you have general questions or requests, please feel free to contact us via the form or visit us\nonsite\n\n**Carl Zeiss AG**\nCarl-Zeiss-Stra\u00dfe 22\n73447 Oberkochen\nGermany\n\nForm is loading...\n\n### Your form is being submitted...\n\nUploading files...\n* Your file(s) couldn't be submitted. Please abort to return to the form.\nAbort\n\nIf you want to have more information on data processing at ZEISS, please refer to our [data\nprotection notice][38].\n\nSubmit\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n* How to apply for a job at ZEISS?\n\nYou can access our online job portal at our [ZEISS career website][39]. For procedural reasons we\nwould kindly ask you to apply directly via our eRecruiting tool.\n\n[ Job openings and applications ][40]\n* Where to find the Annual Report of Carl Zeiss AG and Carl Zeiss Meditec AG?\n\nYou can find the current Annual Report of Carl Zeiss AG on our website:\n[www.zeiss.com/annualreport][41] .\nWe do not offer a printed version anymore. If you are interested in the Annual Report of Carl\nZeiss Meditec AG, please visit the website [www.zeiss.com/meditec-ag][42]\n* How to set up a sponsoring request?\n\nRequests to ZEISS for donations must be submitted via the Carl Zeiss Sponsorship Fund. Before you\nsubmit your application, we would be grateful if you could take a quick look at our guidelines.\n\n[ Sponsor guidelines ][43]\n\n[ Back to top ][44]\nRelated ZEISS Websites\n[ Annual Report of the ZEISS Group ][45] [ ZEISS Forum ][46]\n* Frequently Used\n\n[Sustainability at ZEISS][47] [Innovation at ZEISS][48] [History at a glance][49] [Carl Zeiss\nFoundation][50]\n* About ZEISS\n\n[About][51] [Career][52] [Newsroom][53] [Compliance][54] [Accessibility statement][55]\n* Social Media\n\n[Facebook][56] [Instagram][57] [LinkedIn][58] [YouTube][59] [X][60]\nSelect ZEISS Area\nZEISS Group\n* [Cinematography][61]\n* [Hunting][62]\n* [Nature Observation][63]\n* [Planetariums][64]\n* [Simulation Projection Solutions][65]\n* [Vision Care][66]\n* [Digital Solutions & Software Development][67]\n* [Industrial Quality Solutions][68]\n* [OEM Solutions][69]\n* [Research Microscopy Solutions][70]\n* [Spectroscopy][71]\n* [ZEISS Group][72]\n* [Extended Reality][73]\n* [Medical Technology][74]\n* [Photography][75]\n* [Semiconductor Manufacturing Technology][76]\n* [Sunlens][77]\nSelect website\nGlobal website (English)\n* Select language\n* [ Global website (English) ][78]\n* Select location\nThe content of this page was created with help of Generative AI\n* Legal\n\n[Contact ][79] [Publisher][80] [Legal Notice][81] [Privacy Notice][82] [Cookie Notice][83] [Cookie\nPreferences][84]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.zeiss.com/corporate/en/home.html\n[3]: #\n[4]: https://www.zeiss.com/corporate/en/about-zeiss.html\n[5]: https://www.zeiss.com/corporate/en/products-and-solutions.html\n[6]: https://www.zeiss.com/corporate/en/career.html\n[7]: https://www.zeiss.com/corporate/en/contact.html\n[8]: https://www.zeiss.com/corporate/en/contact.html\n[9]: https://www.zeiss.com/annualreport\n[10]: https://www.zeiss.com/zeissforum\n[11]: #search\n[12]: #\n[13]: #\n[14]: https://www.zeiss.com/vision-care/en/contact-zeiss-vision-care.html\n[15]: https://www.zeiss.com/extended-reality/contact\n[16]: https://www.zeiss.com/meditec/en/about-us/contact-us.html\n[17]: https://www.zeiss.com/semiconductor-manufacturing-technology/smt-contact.html\n[18]: https://www.zeiss.com/metrology/contact.html\n[19]: https://www.zeiss.com/microscopy/service\n[20]: https://www.zeiss.com/photo/service\n[21]: https://www.zeiss.com/cine/service\n[22]: https://www.zeiss.com/hunting/service\n[23]: https://www.zeiss.com/nature/service\n[24]: https://www.zeiss.com/simulation/contact\n[25]: https://www.zeiss.com/planetariums-contact\n[26]: https://www.zeiss.com/spectroscopy/service-support.html\n[27]: https://www.zeiss.com/oem-solutions/contact.html\n[28]: https://www.zeiss.com/digital-innovation/legal-information/contact.html\n[29]: #\n[30]: #productoverlay\n[31]: https://www.zeiss.com/career-contact\n[32]: https://www.zeiss.com/corporate/en/about-zeiss/present/newsroom.html#contacts\n[33]: https://www.zeiss.com/corporate/en/suppliers/zeiss-suppliers.html\n[34]: https://www.zeiss.com/zeiss-forum/our-service/contact.html\n[35]: https://www.zeiss.com/corporate/en/about-zeiss/past/zeiss-museum-of-optics.html#contacts\n[36]: https://www.zeiss.com/corporate/en/about-zeiss/past/history/archives.html#contact\n[37]: https://www.zeiss.com/corporate/en/suppliers/cad-systems.html\n[38]: https://www.zeiss.com/data-protection\n[39]: https://www.zeiss.com/career\n[40]: https://www.zeiss.com/jobs\n[41]: https://www.zeiss.com/annualreport\n[42]: https://www.zeiss.com/meditec-ag\n[43]: https://www.zeiss.com/corporate/en/about-zeiss/present/sustainability/common-good/promotion-fu\nnd.html\n[44]: #to-top\n[45]: https://www.zeiss.com/annualreport\n[46]: https://www.zeiss.com/zeissforum\n[47]: https://www.zeiss.com/corporate/en/about-zeiss/present/sustainability.html\n[48]: https://www.zeiss.com/corporate/en/about-zeiss/future/innovation.html\n[49]: https://www.zeiss.com/corporate/en/about-zeiss/past/history.html\n[50]: https://www.zeiss.com/corporate/en/about-zeiss/present/facts-figures/carl-zeiss-foundation.htm\n[51]: https://www.zeiss.com/corporate/en/about-zeiss.html\n[52]: https://www.zeiss.com/career\n[53]: https://www.zeiss.com/corporate/en/about-zeiss/present/newsroom.html\n[54]: https://www.zeiss.com/compliance\n[55]: https://www.zeiss.com/corporate/en/legal-information/accessibility-statement.html\n[56]: https://www.facebo