      "key_products": "Spectroscopy, Semiconductor Manufacturing Technology, Industrial Quality Solutions, Medical Technology, Research Microscopy Solutions",
      "polished_summary": "Carl Zeiss AG is a leading global technology enterprise specializing in optics and optoelectronics, dedicated to innovation and sustainability. The company offers a diverse range of products, including vision care solutions, semiconductor manufacturing technology, medical devices, industrial quality solutions, and high-quality photography equipment, targeting professionals in healthcare, semiconductor manufacturing, industrial applications, and consumer markets. With a commitment to precision and advanced technology, ZEISS shapes the future of its industries while prioritizing responsible practices.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Carl Zeiss AG is a leading technology enterprise in optics and optoelectronics, which includes the development of spectral sensors and related technologies. Their involvement in semiconductor manufacturing technology and industrial quality solutions indicates a direct connection to the spectral sensor market.",
