      "polished_summary": "HORIBA is a global leader in the development and manufacturing of scientific and analytical instruments, specializing in a diverse range of applications across mobility, energy, environment, life sciences, and healthcare sectors. The company offers innovative solutions such as gas mass flow control, hydrogen energy evaluation, and advanced elemental analysis technologies, catering to industries including automotive, pharmaceuticals, and environmental management. With a commitment to enhancing efficiency and sustainability, HORIBA serves a wide array of markets, including research institutions, industrial processes, and energy solutions.",
      "audit_reasoning": "HORIBA develops and manufactures scientific and analytical instruments, including technologies for elemental analysis such as Glow Discharge Optical Emission Spectroscopy and Energy Dispersive X-ray Fluorescence, which are directly applicable to the spectral sensor market.",
