      "company_summary": "Headwall Photonics is a leader in applied sensing and hyperspectral imaging, delivering innovative solutions that enhance environmental protection, food supply chain integrity, and quality control in pharmaceuticals and manufacturing. The company offers a range of products, including industrial inspection systems, metal detection sensors, and hyperspectral imaging cameras, targeting diverse sectors such as agriculture, recycling, defense, and pharmaceuticals. By transforming invisible data into actionable insights, Headwall empowers organizations to improve operational efficiency and ensure safety across various industries.",
