      "key_products": "Hyperspectral Imaging Cameras, Industrial Inspection Systems, Benchtop Hyperspectral Imaging Kits, Airborne Hyperspectral Payloads, Portable Field Hyperspectral Systems",
      "polished_summary": "Headwall Photonics is a leader in applied sensing and hyperspectral imaging, delivering innovative solutions that enhance environmental protection, food supply chain integrity, and quality control in pharmaceuticals and manufacturing. The company offers a range of products, including industrial inspection systems, metal detection sensors, and hyperspectral imaging cameras, targeting diverse sectors such as agriculture, recycling, defense, and pharmaceuticals. By transforming invisible data into actionable insights, Headwall empowers organizations to improve operational efficiency and ensure safety across various industries.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Headwall Photonics manufactures and develops hyperspectral imaging systems and sensors, which are directly relevant to the spectral sensor market. Their products, such as hyperspectral imaging cameras and industrial inspection systems, are designed for applications in agriculture, pharmaceuticals, and environmental monitoring, making them a key player in this market.",
      "audit_score": 5,
