      "company_function": "",
      "company_summary": "Malvern Panalytical specializes in advanced material characterization technologies, providing innovative solutions for researchers, scientists, and quality control professionals across various industries. Their core products include particle size analyzers like the Mastersizer 3000+ and Zetasizer Advance, as well as X-ray fluorescence spectrometers such as Zetium and XRF analyzers, all designed to optimize the development and analysis of advanced materials. The company serves a diverse clientele, including academic institutions, government laboratories, and material science professionals, helping them make informed decisions that shape the future of their fields.",
