            "url": "https://malvernpanalytical.com/about-us",
            "text": "* [Skip to main content][1]\n* [Skip to footer][2]\n* Language Deutsch English Espa\u00f1ol Fran\u00e7ais Portugu\u00eas \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4 \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e \u7b80\u4f53\u4e2d\u6587 \u7e41\u9ad4\u4e2d\u6587\n* [About us][3]\n* [Academy][4]\n* [Blog][5]\n* [Careers][6]\n* [Store][7]\n* [Contact us][8]\n[Login][9] [Register][10]\n[Edit profile][11]\n[ [Malvern Panalytical] ][12]\n* [Products][13]\n* [Solutions][14]\n* [Events][15]\n* [Resources][16]\n* [Service & support][17]\n* Search\nQuick links\n* [Mastersizer 3000+][18]\n* [Zetium][19]\n* [Zetasizer Advance][20]\n* [Particle size analyzers][21]\n* [X-ray diffractometers][22]\n* [XRF analyzers][23]\nMain navigation\n* [Products][24]\n* [Solutions][25]\n* [Events][26]\n* [Resources][27]\n* [Service & support][28]\n* Language Deutsch English Espa\u00f1ol Fran\u00e7ais Portugu\u00eas \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4 \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e \u7b80\u4f53\u4e2d\u6587 \u7e41\u9ad4\u4e2d\u6587\n* [About us][29]\n* [Academy][30]\n* [Blog][31]\n* [Careers][32]\n* [Store][33]\n* [Contact us][34]\nSearch\n1. [ Home ][35]\n2. [ About us ][36]\n\n# About us\n\n[About us]\n1. [ Introduction ][37]\n2. [ Our people ][38]\n3. [ Our values ][39]\n\nMalvern Panalytical provides market-leading material characterization technologies for the world's\nmost innovative companies, academic institutions, and government laboratories to optimize and\naccelerate the development of advanced materials.\n\nWe support our customers through their biggest challenges by uncovering critical insights into\nmaterial properties. From developing life-saving vaccines and next-generation therapeutics to\nadvancing clean energy solutions and sustainable industrial processes, we give scientists the\nconfidence to make important decisions that shape the world we live in.\n\nWe wake up every day to delight our customers and help them solve the problems that matter. Through\ninnovation, high-quality solutions and workflows, and excellence in customer satisfaction, we help\nreduce lead times, increase repeatability, and deliver data that is actionable and easily\nunderstood.\n\nOur vision is to continue to be a trusted and recognized leader for quality and insights in material\ncharacterization, helping our customers navigate complex scientific topics with accuracy and ease.\n\nWe win customers with performance and keep them with service and insights. We are the \u2018Best\ntogether.\u2019 Our people are experts in their fields, delivering value and innovation for each other\nand for our customers. With diversity in experience and customer-centric thinking, we are the best\nchoice for researchers and scientists seeking competitive advantage in the market.\n\nWe have a high-performance culture - empowering teams, quick decision-making and serving customers\nmore effectively - grounded in agility, clarity, and transparency, with speed and focus critical to\nour success, all shaped by our values: Own it. Aim High. Be True.\n\nWe are committed to helping to solve our customers\u2019 greatest challenges to make the world cleaner,\nhealthier and more productive for the future.\n\nEXPLORE\n\n### [ Contact us ][40]\n\n### [ Meet the experts ][41]\n\n### [ Our policies ][42]\n\n### [ Intellectual property ][43]\n\n### [ Careers ][44]\n\n### [ Early careers ][45]\n\n### [ Malvern Panalytical awards ][46]\n\n### [ Gender Pay Gap Report ][47]\n\n### [ A sustainable future ][48]\n\n### [ Our blog ][49]\n\n## Our people\n\nDiscovery is the fuel of progress. It requires curiosity, an open mind, and a desire to deepen\nknowledge beyond the status quo. Every day we act as partners in discovery to enable customers to\nadvance their solutions and achieve breakthroughs that move their business forward and improve\nmodern living.\n\n## Our values\n\n### Value beyond measure.\n\nSupported by a healthy, high-performance culture shaped by our values \u2013 Own It, Aim High and Be True\n- we collaborate to improve how we work together and how we create value for our customers.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Be True**\n\n**We believe in absolute integrity**. It\u2019s how we win for stakeholders, the environment and each\nother.\n* We do the right things in the right way\n* We speak up when something isn\u2019t right\n* We show care and respect for each other\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Own It**\n\n**We believe in teamwork and keeping our promises**. It\u2019s how we build our brands and businesses.\n* We are decisive and take responsibility\n* We prize diversity and play to everybody\u2019s strengths\n* We put customers at the heart of our business\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Aim High**\n\n**We believe in being bold and positive**. It\u2019s how we perform at our best and achieve greater\nsuccess.\n* We continuously strive to improve\n* We keep an open mind and try new things\n* We help each other succeed\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n* #### Popular links\n* [Particle size analyzers][50]\n* [X-ray diffractometers][51]\n* [XRF analyzers][52]\n* [Image analyzers][53]\n* [Thermal analyzers][54]\n* [BET surface area analyzers][55]\n* [Gas pycnometers][56]\n* #### Support and services\n* [Product support][57]\n* [Events and training][58]\n* [Knowledge center][59]\n* [Software downloads][60]\n* #### Company profile\n* [About Malvern Panalytical][61]\n* [Careers][62]\n* [Brands][63]\n* [Awards][64]\n* [Meet our experts][65]\n* [Code of business ethics][66]\n* [Press releases][67]\n* [Customer stories][68]\n* [Sustainability][69]\n* #### Legal information\n* [Website disclaimer][70]\n* [Terms and conditions][71]\n* [Cookie notice][72]\n* [Third-party privacy notice][73]\n* [Trademarks][74]\n* [Our policies][75]\n* [Anti-slavery and trafficking statement][76]\n[ [Home] ][77]\n* [ [Facebook] ][78]\n* [ [Twitter] ][79]\n* [ [Blog] ][80]\n* [ [Instagram] ][81]\n* [ [LinkedIn] ][82]\n* [ [Youtube] ][83]\n* [Site map][84]\n* [Cookie settings][85]\n\u00a9 Copyright 2026 - Malvern Panalytical Ltd is a [Spectris][86] company\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: #footer\n[3]: /en/about-us\n[4]: https://academy.malvernpanalytical.com\n[5]: /en/learn/knowledge-center/insights\n[6]: /en/about-us/work-with-us\n[7]: https://mystore.malvernpanalytical.com/mystore/s/\n[8]: /en/about-us/contact-us/\n[9]: /en/support/login\n[10]: /en/profile/register\n[11]: /en/profile\n[12]: /en\n[13]: /en/products\n[14]: /en/solutions\n[15]: /en/learn/events-and-training/\n[16]: /en/learn/knowledge-center/\n[17]: /en/support\n[18]: /en/products/product-range/mastersizer-range\n[19]: /en/products/product-range/zetium\n[20]: /en/products/product-range/zetasizer-range/zetasizer-advance-range\n[21]: /en/products/category/particle-size-analyzers\n[22]: /en/products/category/x-ray-diffractometers\n[23]: /en/products/category/x-ray-fluorescence-spectrometers\n[24]: /en/products\n[25]: /en/solutions\n[26]: /en/learn/events-and-training/\n[27]: /en/learn/knowledge-center/\n[28]: /en/support\n[29]: /en/about-us\n[30]: https://academy.malvernpanalytical.com\n[31]: /en/learn/knowledge-center/insights\n[32]: /en/about-us/work-with-us\n[33]: https://mystore.malvernpanalytical.com/mystore/s/\n[34]: /en/about-us/contact-us/\n[35]: /en\n[36]: /en/about-us\n[37]: #introduction\n[38]: #ourpeople\n[39]: #ourvalues\n[40]: /en/about-us/contact-us\n[41]: /en/about-us/meet-the-experts\n[42]: /en/about-us/our-policies\n[43]: /en/about-us/intellectual-property\n[44]: /en/about-us/work-with-us\n[45]: /en/about-us/early-careers\n[46]: /en/about-us/awards\n[47]: /en/about-us/gender-pay-gap-report\n[48]: /en/about-us/sustainable-future\n[49]: /en/about-us/our-blogs\n[50]: /en/products/category/particle-size-analyzers\n[51]: /en/products/category/x-ray-diffractometers\n[52]: /en/products/category/x-ray-fluorescence-spectrometers\n[53]: /en/products/category/image-analyzers\n[54]: /en/products/category/thermal-analyzers\n[55]: /en/products/category/bet-surface-area-analyzers\n[56]: /en/products/category/gas-pycnometers\n[57]: /en/support\n[58]: /en/learn/events-and-training\n[59]: /en/learn/knowledge-center\n[60]: /en/support/software-download\n[61]: /en/about-us\n[62]: /en/about-us/work-with-us\n[63]: /en/about-us/our-brands\n[64]: /en/about-us/awards\n[65]: /en/about-us/meet-the-experts\n[66]: /en/about-us/our-policies\n[67]: https://www.malvernpanalytical.com/en/learn/knowledge-center?size=n_20_n&filters%5B0%5D%5Bfiel\nd%5D=mp_documenttype_title&filters%5B0%5D%5Bvalues%5D%5B0%5D=Press%20Release&filters%5B0%5D%5Btype%5\nD=any&sort-field=date&sort-direction=desc\n[68]: https://www.malvernpanalytical.com/en/learn/knowledge-center?size=n_20_n&filters%5B0%5D%5Bfiel\nd%5D=mp_documenttype_title&filters%5B0%5D%5Bvalues%5D%5B0%5D=Customer%20Story&filters%5B0%5D%5Btype%\n5D=any&sort-field=date&sort-direction=desc\n[69]: /en/about-us/sustainable-future\n[70]: /en/about-us/website-disclaimer\n[71]: /en/about-us/terms-of-sale-and-service\n[72]: /en/about-us/privacy-policy\n[73]: /en/about-us/third-party-privacy-notice\n[74]: /en/about-us/intellectual-property\n[75]: /en/about-us/our-policies\n[76]: /en/about-us/our-policies\n[77]: /en\n[78]: https://facebook.com/MalvernPanalytical\n[79]: https://twitter.com/newsfrom_MP\n[80]: https://www.malvernpanalytical.com/en/learn/knowledge-center?size=n_20_n&filters%5B0%5D%5Bfiel\nd%5D=mp_documenttype_title&filters%5B0%5D%5Bvalues%5D%5B0%5D=Insights&filters%5B0%5D%5Btype%5D=any&s\nort-field=date&sort-direction=desc\n[81]: https://www.instagram.com/malvernpanalytical\n[82]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/malvernpanalytical\n[83]: https://www.youtube.com/c/MalvernPanalytical\n[84]: /en/about-us/site-map\n[85]: #cookies\n[86]: http://www.spectris.com/"
