6 Jan 2026 [For the 3rd year in a row, Halma India receives \u2018Great Place To Work\u2019 certification\n  ][131]\n* 20 Jan 2025 [Halma India receives \u2018Great Place To Work\u2019 certification for the second year in a\n  row][132]\n* 09 Oct 2024 [Monitoring eye health across communities in India ][133]\n* 22 Aug 2024 [Halma India\u2019s annual Reward and Recognition 2024 brings individuals and teams from 24\n  Halma companies together][134]\n* 10 Jul 2024 [Introducing Veiga: A World-class Fire Alarm and Detection System, Made in India, Made\n  for India][135]\n* 01 Jul 2024 [Halma India\u2019s new CSR initiative promotes a healthy community][136]\n\n## Quick links\n* [Who we are][137]\n* [How we grow][138]\n* [Our Companies][139]\n* [Our People][140]\n* [Investors][141]\n* [News][142]\n* [Contact Us][143]\n\n## Contact us\n* **Registered Office:**\n  Prestige Shantiniketan,\n  Gate No. 2, Tower C, 7th Floor,\n  Whitefield Main Road,\n  Mahadevapura, Bengaluru\n  Karnataka 560 048, India.\n  \n  [Tel: +91 80 6747 5300][144]\n  Email:\u00a0[[email\u00a0protected]][145]\n\nConnect with us\n* [LinkedIn][146]\n* [YouTube][147]\n\n## Annual Report 2025\n\n[Download pdf of report now][148]\n\n## Sign Up\n\nStay informed on news and events from Halma.\n\n[Subscribe][149]\n\nConnect with us\n* [LinkedIn][150]\n* [YouTube][151]\n* [Disclaimer][152]\n* [Privacy][153]\n* [Accessibility][154]\n* [Cookie Notice][155]\n* [Cookie settings][156]\n* [Site Map][157]\n* [Standard terms and conditions][158]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026\n\n[animated svg for hover]\n\n[1]: https://www.halma.com/investors\n[2]: /news/halma-india-news\n[3]: javascript:;\n[4]: https://www.halma.com\n[5]: https://www.halma.cn\n[6]: javascript:;\n[7]: /who-we-are\n[8]: /how-we-grow\n[9]: /our-companies\n[10]: /our-companies/advanced\n[11]: /our-companies/ampac\n[12]: /our-companies/apollo\n[13]: /our-companies/avire\n[14]: /our-companies/bea\n[15]: /our-companies/cosasco\n[16]: /our-companies/ffe\n[17]: /our