      "polished_summary": "Ocean Insight is a global leader in life-saving technology, dedicated to fostering a safer, cleaner, and healthier future. Operating in India since 2008, the company offers innovative products and services that address critical challenges such as water pollution and chronic health issues, with a focus on niche technologies across various sectors, including safety, environmental analysis, and healthcare.",
