haracterization][210]\n      * [Pharmaceutical Raw Material Identification][211]\n    * [Medical Device Testing Solutions][212]\n    * [Regulatory & Compliance][213] >\n      * [Cleaning Validation][214]\n    * [Stability Testing][215] >\n      * [Degradation Products][216]\n* Training & Support\n  * [Contact Us][217]\n  * [Customer Training & Education][218] >\n    * [Classroom Training][219]\n    * [OnLine Training][220]\n    * [OnSite Training][221]\n* Resources\n  * [COA Search][222]\n  * [Dealer Portal][223]\n  * [Software Downloads][224]\n  * [Events & Webinars][225]\n  * [Find Resources][226]\n* About\n  * [About PerkinElmer][227]\n  * [Innovation][228]\n  * [Leadership][229]\n  * [Sustainability][230]\n  * [Policies & Supplier Information][231]\n  * [Website Terms & Conditions][232]\n  * [Product Recycling Program][233]\n* Blog & Newsroom\n  * [Blog][234]\n  * [Newsroom][235]\n* [Careers][236]\n* [Buy][237]\n\n\n# We believe in the power of science to transform our world.\n\nTogether with scientists and operators worldwide, we empower progress by providing trusted insights\nand services that accelerate work and amplify impact for a healthier, safer, and more sustainable\nworld.\n\n[Biopharma][238] [Applied Solutions][239] [Food Solutions][240]\n\n\n# We drive efficiency and empower sustainable scientific discovery with nearly 90 years of\n# pioneering innovation.\n\n[Discover More][241]\n\n\n## By your side, globally.\n\nOffices in 35 countries.\n\nCustomers served in 168 countries (direct and through distributors).\n\nManufacturing presence in North-America, Europe and APAC, incl. China.\n\n\n## People power progress.\n\nWe believe great ideas can come from anywhere \u2013 because our customers rely on the ingenuity,\ncreativity, and passion of our people.\n\nWe\u2019re on a mission to transform our world. Will you join us?\n\n[Explore Careers][242]\n\n\n## Conveniently find parts for your instrument and place orders with our new online store.\n\n[Shop Now][243]\n\u276e\n\u276f\n\u00a0\n\n## Insights & News\n\n\n###### [Project Farma Expands PMIS Offering with Oracle Primavera Cloud to Address Growing Pharma\n###### Capital Project Complexity][244]\n\nProject Farma, PerkinElmer\u2019s patient-focused life sciences consulting firm dedicated to accelerating\nmanufacturing for life-changing therapies, today announced a partnership with Oracle Primavera Cloud\n(OPC) to enhance its project controls and capital program delivery capabilities for pharmaceutical\nand biotech organizations.\n\n\n###### [Project Farma Partners with Valkit.ai to Modernize Digital Validation with AI][245]\n\nProject Farma, PerkinElmer\u2019s patient-focused life sciences consulting firm dedicated to accelerating\nmanufacturing for life-changing therapies, today announced its Gold Tier Certified Partner status\nwith Valkit.ai, an AI-powered digital validation platform that streamlines compliance and quality\nprocesses for life sciences organizations.\n\n\n###### [LactoScope 500 Delivers Next-Level Dairy Analysis, for Greater Accuracy, Stability, and\n###### Operational Control][246]\n\nPerten, a PerkinElmer company and global leader in analytical solutions for the food industry, today\nannounced the launch of the LactoScope 500, a next-generation Fourier Transform Infrared\nSpectroscopy (FT\u2011IR) dairy analyzer designed to help medium and large processors move beyond\ntraditional testing limitations for greater control of quality, yield, and efficiency.\n\n\n###### [PacBio and Covaris Announce Joint Workflow Enabling HiFi Sequencing of FFPE Tumor\n###### Samples][247]\n\nPacBio (NASDAQ: PACB), a leading developer of high-quality, highly accurate sequencing solutions,\nand Covaris, a PerkinElmer company and leader in sample preparation technologies, today announced a\njoint workflow enabling robust HiFi sequencing of formalin-fixed, paraffin-embedded (FFPE) tissue\nsamples. This new solution integrates Covaris\u2019 truXTRAC^{\u00ae} FFPE extraction technology with PacBio\u2019s\nKinnex\u2122 library preparation, delivering a streamlined workflow from sample to sequencing.\n\n## **Delivering Solutions That Drive Progress**\n\nOur focus is enabling the most innovative discovery, measurement, and testing solutions across our\nstrategic growth platforms.\u00a0\n\n#### Biopharma\n\n## Biopharma\n\n### [ ONESOURCE ][248]\n\nComprehensive services to enable, accelerate, and pro"
