n\nWe are on a mission to add value to people's everyday lives with our technological innovations. We are constantly looking for ways to help our customers solve global problems - ecological and social aspects are the drivers of our actions.\n\nNIRONE Scanner Platform\n\nApplication Pharma Security\n\nFraudulent drugs harm or kill millions around the world. Our NIRONE solution identifies fake pharmaceuticals within seconds.\n\nLearn more\n\nApplication Product Conformity / Anti-counterfeiting\n\nWith our digital material recognition solution, original articles can be tracked and verified within seconds, without altering or damaging the product.\n\nLearn more\n\nApplication Textile\n\nNIR technology can be applied to textile recycling enabling more efficient sorting with portable hand-held or built-in scanners.\n\nLearn more\n\nApplication Plastic\n\nMiniaturized and affordable NIR sensors and scanners identify plastics and help sort them more accurately.\n\nLearn more\n\nNIRONE SENSOR\n\nOur Near Infrared spectroscopy sensor is innovative, small, robust, inexpensive and intelligent to bring measurements from laboratories to field use.\n\nRead more\n\nTECHNOLOGY\n\nOur miniaturized, portable and cost-effective solution enables fast, accurate and non-destructive measurements, taking this technology to the next level.\n\nRead more\n\nLinkedin\n\nFacebook\n\nLoca\nm-u-t GmbH Wei\u00dfkirchener Str. 2-6 61449 Steinbach Germany\n\nE-mail\nsales@spectralengines.com\n\nLoca\nm-u-t GmbH Wei\u00dfkirchener Str. 2-6 61449 Steinbach Germany\n\nE-mail\nsales@spectralengines.com\n\n\u00a9 m-u-t GmbH | ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nImprint [Skip to content][1]\n* [HOME][2]\n* PRODUCTS & SOLUTIONS\n* [PRODUCTS][3]\n* [NIRONE Sensor X][4]\n* [NIRONE Sensor S][5]\n* [Scanner Platform][6]\n* [NIRONE Scanner][7]\n* [LabScanner][8]\n* [LabScanner Plus][9]\n* [Liquid Scanner][10]\n* [Software/App][11]\n* [TECHNOLOGY][12]\n* [APPLICATIONS][13]\n* [Product Conformity][14]\n* [Pharma Security][15]\n* [Brand Protection / Anti-counterfeiting][16]\n* [Circular Economy][17]\n* [Textile][18]\n* [Plastic][19]\n* [OEM][20]\n* COMPANY\n* [About us][21]\n* [ESG][22]\n* [Partners][23]\n* [News][24]\n* [Order now][25]\n* [SUPPORT][26]\n* [HOME][27]\n* PRODUCTS & SOLUTIONS\n* [PRODUCTS][28]\n* [NIRONE Sensor X][29]\n* [NIRONE Sensor S][30]\n* [Scanner Platform][31]\n* [NIRONE Scanner][32]\n* [LabScanner][33]\n* [LabScanner Plus][34]\n* [Liquid Scanner][35]\n* [Software/App][36]\n* [TECHNOLOGY][37]\n* [APPLICATIONS][38]\n* [Product Conformity][39]\n* [Pharma Security][40]\n* [Brand Protection / Anti-counterfeiting][41]\n* [Circular Economy][42]\n* [Textile][43]\n* [Plastic][44]\n* [OEM][45]\n* COMPANY\n* [About us][46]\n* [ESG][47]\n* [Partners][48]\n* [News][49]\n* [Order now][50]\n* [SUPPORT][51]\nSearch\n* [HOME][52]\n* PRODUCTS & SOLUTIONS\n* [PRODUCTS][53]\n* [NIRONE Sensor X][54]\n* [NIRONE Sensor S][55]\n* [Scanner Platform][56]\n* [NIRONE Scanner][57]\n* [LabScanner][58]\n* [LabScanner Plus][59]\n* [Liquid Scanner][60]\n* [Software/App][61]\n* [TECHNOLOGY][62]\n* [APPLICATIONS][63]\n* [Product Conformity][64]\n* [Pharma Security][65]\n* [Brand Protection / Anti-counterfeiting][66]\n* [Circular Economy][67]\n* [Textile][68]\n* [Plastic][69]\n* [OEM][70]\n* COMPANY\n* [About us][71]\n* [ESG][72]\n* [Partners][73]\n* [News][74]\n* [Order now][75]\n* [SUPPORT][76]\n* [HOME][77]\n* PRODUCTS & SOLUTIONS\n* [PRODUCTS][78]\n* [NIRONE Sensor X][79]\n* [NIRONE Sensor S][80]\n* [Scanner Platform][81]\n* [NIRONE Scanner][82]\n* [LabScanner][83]\n* [LabScanner Plus][84]\n* [Liquid Scanner][85]\n* [Software/App][86]\n* [TECHNOLOGY][87]\n* [APPLICATIONS][88]\n* [Product Conformity][89]\n* [Pharma Security][90]\n* [Brand Protection / Anti-counterfeiting][91]\n* [Circular Economy][92]\n* [Textile][93]\n* [Plastic][94]\n* [OEM][95]\n* COMPANY\n* [About us][96]\n* [ESG][97]\n* [Partners][98]\n* [News][99]\n* [Order now][100]\n* [SUPPORT][101]\n\n## **About** us\n\nWe specialize in MEMS-based near-infrared spectral measurements and offer digital solutions,\nincluding app and cloud platforms, for seamless data processing and analysis. This innovative\ntechnology is used, for example, for rapid material and product identification. Spectral Engines is\na brand of m-u-t GmbH, which belongs to the Nynomic Group.\n\nThe Nynomic Group develops and manufactures non-contact optical measurement systems for a wide range\nof industries, from agriculture and semiconductor manufacturing to medical technology, wood\nprocessing, and fire detection. Its companies cover the entire value chain, from optical components\nto turnkey solutions.\n\nThe companies of Nynomic AG include Avantes B.V., LayTec AG, tec5 AG, LemnaTec GmbH, Sensortherm\nGmbH, m-u-t GmbH (with the Spectral Engines brand), Image Engineering GmbH & Co. KG, MGG\nMicro-Gl\u00fchlampen-Gesellschaft Menzel GmbH, NLIR ApS, Photecture Inc., and art photonics GmbH.\n\n[avantes][avantes]\n[IE][IE]\n[laytec][laytec]\n[lemnatec][lemnatec]\n[mgg][mgg]\n[mut][mut]\n[NLIR][NLIR]\n[photecture][photecture]\n[sensortherm][sensortherm]\n[tec5][tec5]\n[art photonics][art photonics]\n\n### QUALITY AND IT SECURITY\n\nSpectral Engines has established and maintains a quality management system according to the highest\nstandards of our industries.\nOur DIN EN ISO 9001:2015 certification together with years of experience and unique know-how prove\nthe German quality standard.\n* [\n\n#### Z230419_SPECTRAL ENGINES_9001\n\n][102]\n\nISO 27001:2017\nWith our ISO/IEC 27001-certified information security management system (ISMS), we set a strong\nexample for the security of information, data and systems.\n* [\n\n#### Z250708_SPECTRAL_ENGINES_ISO_27001-2022_EN\n\n][103]\n[ ][104] [ Linkedin ][105] [ Facebook ][106]\n* m-u-t GmbH Wei\u00dfkirchener Str. 2-6 61449 Steinbach Germany\n* [ sales@spectralengines.com ][107]\n* m-u-t GmbH Wei\u00dfkirchener Str. 2-6 61449 Steinbach Germany\n* [ sales@spectralengines.com ][108]\n\n\u00a9 **m-u-t GmbH** | ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.\n* [ Privacy Policy ][109]\n* [ Imprint ][110]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://spectralengines.com/\n[3]: #\n[4]: https://spectralengines.com/nirone-sensor-x/\n[5]: https://spectralengines.com/nirone-sensor-s/\n[6]: https://spectralengines.com/scanner-platform/\n[7]: https://spectralengines.com/nirone-scanner/\n[8]: https://spectralengines.com/labscanner/\n[9]: https://spectralengines.com/labscanner-plus/\n[10]: https://spectralengines.com/liquid-scanner/\n[11]: https://spectralengines.com/software-app/\n[12]: https://spectralengines.com/technology/\n[13]: https://spectralengines.com/applications/\n[14]: https://spectralengines.com/applications/product-conformity/\n[15]: https://spectralengines.com/applications/product-conformity/\n[16]: https://spectralengines.com/applications/brand-protection-anti-counterfeiting/\n[17]: https://spectralengines.com/applications/circular-economy/\n[18]: https://spectralengines.com/applications/circular-economy/\n[19]: https://spectralengines.com/applications/identify-plastic-in-seconds/\n[20]: https://spectralengines.com/applications/oem/\n[21]: https://spectralengines.com/about-us/\n[22]: https://spectralengines.com/esg/\n[23]: https://spectralengines.com/partners/\n[24]: https://spectralengines.com/news/\n[25]: https://www.digikey.de/de/supplier-centers/spectral-engines\n[26]: https://spectralengines.com/support/\n[27]: https://spectralengines.com/\n[28]: #\n[29]: https://spectralengines.com/nirone-sensor-x/\n[30]: https://spectralengines.com/nirone-sensor-s/\n[31]: https://spectralengines.com/scanner-platform/\n[32]: https://spectralengines.com/nirone-scanner/\n[33]: https://spectralengines.com/labscanner/\n[34]: https://spectralengines.com/labscanner-plus/\n[35]: https://spectralengines.com/liquid-scanner/\n[36]: https://spectralengines.com/software-app/\n[37]: https://spectralengines.com/technology/\n[38]: https://spectralengines.com/applications/\n[39]: https://spect