            "text": "Innovative Material Sensing | Spectral Engines\n\nSkip to content\n\nHOME\n\nPRODUCTS &#038; SOLUTIONS\n\nPRODUCTS\n\nNIRONE Sensor X\n\nNIRONE Sensor S\n\nScanner Platform\n\nNIRONE Scanner\n\nLabScanner\n\nLabScanner Plus\n\nLiquid Scanner\n\nSoftware/App\n\nTECHNOLOGY\n\nAPPLICATIONS\n\nProduct Conformity\n\nPharma Security\n\nBrand Protection / Anti-counterfeiting\n\nCircular Economy\n\nTextile\n\nPlastic\n\nOEM\n\nCOMPANY\n\nAbout us\n\nESG\n\nPartners\n\nNews\n\nOrder now\n\nSUPPORT\n\nHOME\n\nPRODUCTS &#038; SOLUTIONS\n\nPRODUCTS\n\nNIRONE Sensor X\n\nNIRONE Sensor S\n\nScanner Platform\n\nNIRONE Scanner\n\nLabScanner\n\nLabScanner Plus\n\nLiquid Scanner\n\nSoftware/App\n\nTECHNOLOGY\n\nAPPLICATIONS\n\nProduct Conformity\n\nPharma Security\n\nBrand Protection / Anti-counterfeiting\n\nCircular Economy\n\nTextile\n\nPlastic\n\nOEM\n\nCOMPANY\n\nAbout us\n\nESG\n\nPartners\n\nNews\n\nOrder now\n\nSUPPORT\n\nSearch\n\nHOME\n\nPRODUCTS &#038; SOLUTIONS\n\nPRODUCTS\n\nNIRONE Sensor X\n\nNIRONE Sensor S\n\nScanner Platform\n\nNIRONE Scanner\n\nLabScanner\n\nLabScanner Plus\n\nLiquid Scanner\n\nSoftware/App\n\nTECHNOLOGY\n\nAPPLICATIONS\n\nProduct Conformity\n\nPharma Security\n\nBrand Protection / Anti-counterfeiting\n\nCircular Economy\n\nTextile\n\nPlastic\n\nOEM\n\nCOMPANY\n\nAbout us\n\nESG\n\nPartners\n\nNews\n\nOrder now\n\nSUPPORT\n\nHOME\n\nPRODUCTS &#038; SOLUTIONS\n\nPRODUCTS\n\nNIRONE Sensor X\n\nNIRONE Sensor S\n\nScanner Platform\n\nNIRONE Scanner\n\nLabScanner\n\nLabScanner Plus\n\nLiquid Scanner\n\nSoftware/App\n\nTECHNOLOGY\n\nAPPLICATIONS\n\nProduct Conformity\n\nPharma Security\n\nBrand Protection / Anti-counterfeiting\n\nCircular Economy\n\nTextile\n\nPlastic\n\nOEM\n\nCOMPANY\n\nAbout us\n\nESG\n\nPartners\n\nNews\n\nOrder now\n\nSUPPORT\n\nWHAT WE DO\n\nWe analyze and identify materials on the spot - anywhere, anytime.\n\nWe are on a mission to add value to people's everyday lives with our technological innovations. We are constantly looking for ways to help our customers solve global problems - ecological and social aspects are the drivers of our actions.\n\nNIRONE Scanner Platform\n\nApplication Pharma Security\n\nFraudulent drugs harm or kill millions around the world. Our NIRONE solution identifies fake pharmaceuticals within seconds.\n\nLearn more\n\nApplication Product Conformity / Anti-counterfeiting\n\nWith our digital material recognition solution, original articles can be tracked and verified within seconds, without altering or damaging the product.\n\nLearn more\n\nApplication Textile\n\nNIR technology can be applied to textile recycling enabling more efficient sorting with portable hand-held or built-in scanners.\n\nLearn more\n\nApplication Plastic\n\nMiniaturized and affordable NIR sensors and scanners identify plastics and help sort them more accurately.\n\nLearn more\n\nNIRONE SENSOR\n\nOur Near Infrared spectroscopy sensor is innovative, small, robust, inexpensive and intelligent to bring measurements from laboratories to field use.\n\nRead more\n\nTECHNOLOGY\n\nOur miniaturized, portable and cost-effective solution enables fast, accurate and non-destructive measurements, taking this technology to the next level.\n\nRead more\n\nLinkedin\n\nFacebook\n\nLoca\nm-u-t GmbH Wei\u00dfkirchener Str. 2-6 61449 Steinbach Germany\n\nE-mail\nsales@spectralengines.com\n\nLoca\nm-u-t GmbH Wei\u00dfkirchener Str. 2-6 61449 Steinbach Germany\n\nE-mail\nsales@spectralengines.com\n\n\u00a9 m-u-t GmbH | ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nImprint"
