      "key_products": "NIRONE Sensor X, NIRONE Scanner, LabScanner, Liquid Scanner, Scanner Platform",
      "polished_summary": "Spectral Engines specializes in MEMS-based near-infrared spectral measurements, providing innovative digital solutions for seamless data processing and analysis. Their core product offerings include a range of sensors and scanners, such as the NIRONE Sensor X and LabScanner, designed for rapid material and product identification across various industries, including pharmaceuticals, textiles, and plastics.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Spectral Engines manufactures and develops MEMS-based near-infrared spectral measurement products, including the NIRONE Sensor X and LabScanner, which are directly applicable to the spectral sensor market. Their focus on material identification across various industries further solidifies their relevance.",
