        "industries": "Aerospace; Defense; Energy; Semiconductor; Automotive; Agriculture; Green Building; Solar Energy; Space; Environmental Monitoring; Medical Diagnostics; Food Processing; Mining Operations; Biomedical Technology; Construction",
        "products": "SOC-710 Hyperspectral Camera, SOC-210 Bidirectional Reflectometer, ET-100 Emissometer, 410-Solar Reflectometer, SOC-750 Midwave Infrared Hyperspectral Imager",
        "certifications": "AS9100; ISO9001",
