            "url": "https://surfaceoptics.com",
            "text": "Home - Surface Optics Corporation\n\n1-858-675-7404\n\nEmail Us\n\nSupport\n\nProducts\n\nLab Reflectometers\n\nSOC-100 HDR\n\nSOC-210 Bidirectional Reflectometer\n\n410 Series Reflectometers\n\nSOC-410 DHR Reflectometer\n\n410-VIS-IR Reflectometer\n\n410-Solar Reflectometer\n\n410-Solar-i Reflectometer\n\nET-10 Emissometer\n\nET-100 Emissometer\n\n410-LIDAR Reflectometer\n\nCustom SOC410 Reflectometers\n\nAccessories &#038; Maintenance\n\nSpectral Imaging Systems\n\n710 Series Hyperspectral Cameras\n\nLightShift Multispectral Video\n\nDuoChrome-SM\n\nSOC-750 Midwave Infrared\n\nSOC-760 VNIR-SWIR\n\nSpectral Imaging Resources\n\nServices\n\nOptical Properties Measurement Services\n\nSpectral Reflectance (HDR)\n\nEmissivity\n\nBSDF / Scatter\n\nTransmittance Measurements\n\nASTM Testing\n\nSolar Reflectance (SRI/TSR)\n\nAbsorptance &#038; Thermal Emittance\n\nOptical Properties Measurements Database\n\nVacuum Deposition Coatings\n\nLow Observable / Stealth\n\nLarge Area\n\nRoll-to-Roll\n\nDiamond-Like Carbon\n\nVacuum Deposited Gold (VDG)\n\nAnti-Reflection (AR)\n\nVacuum Deposited Aluminum (VDA)\n\nSpaceflight and Thermal Control\n\nHigh Reflectance\n\nElectro-Optics Engineering\n\nSBIR / STTR\n\nApplications\n\nSpace\n\nDefense\n\nSolar Energy\n\nGreen Building\n\nAgriculture\n\nNews\n\nBlog\n\nPublications\n\nAbout Us\n\nOur Company\n\nCompany History\n\nFacilities\n\nCareers\n\nOur Team\n\nInternational Distributors\n\nTrusted for 50 Years in Optical Properties Characterization\n\nSurface Optics offers a single engineering and manufacturing source for solutions requiring the application, characterization, or control of the optical properties of surfaces.\n\nFounded in 1977 to provide optical property measurement services, today Surface Optics Corporation (SOC) specializes in advanced imaging systems, scientific instruments and thin film vacuum coatings for surface engineering.\n\nSOC is pioneering innovative solutions for our research, aerospace, defense, semiconductor, automotive, and energy customers worldwide.&nbsp;\n\nServices\n\nProducts\n\nHyperspectral and Multispectral Imaging Systems\nThe SOC-710 hyperspectral imaging system stands out with its unique internal line-scanning design, making it the most versatile hyperspectral imaging system for researchers available.\n\nAdvanced Goniometers and Scattering Measurement Services\nThe SOC-210 BDR automates BRDF/BTDF measurements for surfaces, paints, coatings, liquids, and particles, covering a spectral range from 0.35 to 14\u03bcm with interchangeable sources, spectral bandpass filters, and detectors for maximum versatility.\n\nVacuum Deposition Coatings\nand Thin-Film\nOur coatings lab offers large chambers and clean rooms, a custom job environment, one-of-a-kind coating hardware, significant space program heritage, and on-site world-class metrology.&nbsp;\n\nOptical Properties\nMeasurements Lab\n&nbsp;The Optical Properties Measurements Lab at Surface Optics is a leading supplier of reflectance, BRDF, transmittance, solar absorptance and emittance testing services.\n\nPortable Reflectometers\n&amp; Emissometers\nPrecise solar reflectance, absorptance, and thermal emittance measurements, offering benchtop-level accuracy in a user-friendly handheld design. A touchscreen interface streamlines calibration, sample identification, and data display.\n\nAdvanced Goniometers and Scattering Measurement Services\n\nThe SOC-210 BDR automates BRDF/BTDF measurements for surfaces, paints, coatings, liquids, and particles, covering a spectral range from 0.35 to 14\u03bcm with interchangeable sources, spectral bandpass filters, and detectors for maximum versatility.\n\nVacuum Deposition Coatings\nand Thin-Film\n\nOur coatings lab offers large chambers and clean rooms, a custom job environment, one-of-a-kind coating hardware, significant space program heritage, and on-site world-class metrology.&nbsp;\n\nOptical Properties Measurements Lab\n\n&nbsp;The Optical Properties Measurements Lab at Surface Optics is a leading supplier of reflectance, BRDF, transmittance, solar absorptance and emittance testing services.\n\nPortable Reflectometers\n&amp; Emissometers\n\nPrecise solar reflectance, absorptance, and thermal emittance measurements, offering benchtop-level accuracy in a user-friendly handheld design. A touchscreen interface streamlines calibration, sample identification, and data display.\n\nHyperspectral and Multispectral Imaging Systems\n\nThe SOC710 hyperspectral camera stands out with its unique internal line-scanning design, making it the most versatile hyperspectral imaging system for researchers available.\n\nOver 45 years as the leaders in optical properties characterization\n\nSurface Optics Corporation offers a single engineering and manufacturing source for solutions requiring the application, characterization, or control of the optical properties of surfaces.\n\nFounded in 1977 to provide optical property measurement services, today Surface Optics Corporation (SOC) specializes in advanced imaging systems, scientific instruments and thin film vacuum coatings for surface engineering. SOC is pioneering innovative solutions for our research, aerospace, defense, semiconductor, automotive, and energy customers worldwide.&nbsp;\n\nLEARN MORE ABOUT SOC\n\nOur Services\n\nIndustry-leading optical measurement, engineering and thin film coating services\n\nElectro-Optics Engineering\n\nFull-service analytical modeling, optomechanical design and production unit delivery.\n\nOptical Property Measurements\n\nHemispheric directional reflectance (HDR), bidirectional reflectance (BRDF) and emissivity testing.\n\nVacuum Coatings\n\nResistively heated thermal evaporation, electron beam evaporation, and ion beam-assisted deposition.\n\nOUR PRODUCTS\n\nPowerful tools for research &amp; industry applications\n\nWith Surface Optics scientific equipment, you\u2019re assured world-class quality and comprehensive product support from our multi-disciplinary team of experts\n\nLab Reflectometers\n\nHandheld Reflectometers\n\nSpectral Imaging Systems\n\nSOC-100 HDR\nHemispherical Directional Reflectometer\n\nSOC-210 BDR\nBidirectional Reflectometer\n\nSOC410 Series Reflectometers\nOverview of SOC410 Reflectometer and Emissometers\n\n410-DHR Reflectometer\nReflectance .9 to 12 \u03bcm\n\nET100 Emissometer\nThermal Emissivity 1.5 \u2013 21 \u03bcm\n\n410-Solar Reflectometer\nTotal, Specular and Diffuse Reflectance from 330 nm to 2500 nm\n\n410-Solar-i Reflectometer\nTotal Reflectance 330 nm to 2500 nm\n\nET10 Emissometer\nThermal Emissivity 3 \u2013 5 \u03bcm &amp; 8 \u2013 12 \u03bcm\n\n410-LiDAR Reflectometer\nMeasures total reflectance in four sub-bands 850, 905, 940, and 1550 nm\n\n410-Vis-IR Reflectometer &amp; Emissometer\n410-Solar and ET100 dual head package\n\nSOC710 Series Hyperspectral Cameras\nLine-scanning hyperspectral from 400-1700 nm\n\nLightShift Multispectral Video\n16 spectral bands live\n\nSOC750 Midwave Infrared Hyperspectral Imager\n2.0 &#8211; 5.0 \u03bcm spectral range\n\nSOC760 Hyperspectral Imaging System\n400-2500 nm spectral range\n\nDuoChrome SWIR / MWIR Imager\n1.5-2.5 \u00b5m and 3.5-5.0 \u00b5m\n\nRecent News\n\nCustom Spectroscopic Process Monitoring Systems for Aerospace, Defense, and Industrial Manufacturing\n\nRead\n\nSurface Optics at SPIE Defense + Security 2026\n\nRead\n\nSurface Optics Releases New Hyperspectral Imaging Systems: 710-HyCore and 710-OmniCore\n\nRead\n\nConnect with Surface Optics\n\nContact\n\n35+ years of thin-film coating experience for mission-ready solutions\n\nIndustry-leading hyperspectal and multispectral imaging\n\nLong-standing measurements lab\n\nIndustrial spectroscopy, working together to solve the world&#8217;s most pressing problems\n\nHave questions?\n\n1-858-675-7404\n\nEmail Us\n\nSupport\n\nProducts\n\nServices\n\nApplications\n\nNews\n\nAbout Us\n\n&copy; Surface Optics Corporation | Privacy Policy | Terms & Conditions"
          },
