ientific equipment, you\u2019re assured world-class quality and comprehensive\nproduct support from our multi-disciplinary team of experts\n* [\nLab Reflectometers\n][64]\n* [\nHandheld Reflectometers\n][65]\n* [\nSpectral Imaging Systems\n][66]\n* [ [SOC-100 HDR] SOC-100 HDR Hemispherical Directional Reflectometer ][67]\n* [ [SOC-210 BDR] SOC-210 BDR Bidirectional Reflectometer ][68]\n* [ [SOC410 Series Reflectometers ] SOC410 Series Reflectometers Overview of SOC410 Reflectometer\nand Emissometers ][69]\n* [ [410-DHR Reflectometer] 410-DHR Reflectometer Reflectance .9 to 12 \u03bcm ][70]\n* [ [ET100 Emissometer] ET100 Emissometer Thermal Emissivity 1.5 \u2013 21 \u03bcm ][71]\n* [ [410-Solar Reflectometer] 410-Solar Reflectometer Total, Specular and Diffuse Reflectance from\n330 nm to 2500 nm ][72]\n* [ [410-Solar-i Reflectometer] 410-Solar-i Reflectometer Total Reflectance 330 nm to 2500 nm ][73]\n* [ [ET10 Emissometer] ET10 Emissometer Thermal Emissivity 3 \u2013 5 \u03bcm & 8 \u2013 12 \u03bcm ][74]\n* [ [410-LiDAR Reflectometer] 410-LiDAR Reflectometer Measures total reflectance in four sub-bands\n850, 905, 940, and 1550 nm ][75]\n* [ [410-Vis-IR Reflectometer & Emissometer] 410-Vis-IR Reflectometer & Emissometer 410-Solar and\nET100 dual head package ][76]\n* [ [SOC710 Series Hyperspectral Cameras] SOC710 Series Hyperspectral Cameras Line-scanning\nhyperspectral from 400-1700 nm ][77]\n* [ [LightShift Multispectral Video] LightShift Multispectral Video 16 spectral bands live ][78]\n* [ [SOC750 Midwave Infrared Hyperspectral Imager] SOC750 Midwave Infrared Hyperspectral Imager 2.0\n\u2013 5.0 \u03bcm spectral range ][79]\n* [ [SOC760 Hyperspectral Imaging System] SOC760 Hyperspectral Imaging System 400-2500 nm spectral\nrange ][80]\n* [ [DuoChrome SWIR / MWIR Imager] DuoChrome SWIR / MWIR Imager 1.5-2.5 \u00b5m and 3.5-5.0 \u00b5m ][81]\n\n[[Surface Optics Corporation]][82]\n\nHave questions?\n* [ 1-858-675-7404][83]\n* [ Email Us][84]\n* [ Support][85]\n* [Pr