            "url": "https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/410-vis-ir-reflectometer/",
            "text": "* [ 1-858-675-7404][1]\n* [ Email Us][2]\n* [ Support][3]\n[[Surface Optics Corporation]][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [\nLab Reflectometers\n][6]\n* [SOC-100 HDR][7]\n* [SOC-210 Bidirectional Reflectometer][8]\n* [\n410 Series Reflectometers\n][9]\n* [SOC-410 DHR Reflectometer][10]\n* [410-VIS-IR Reflectometer][11]\n* [410-Solar Reflectometer][12]\n* [410-Solar-i Reflectometer][13]\n* [ET-10 Emissometer][14]\n* [ET-100 Emissometer][15]\n* [410-LIDAR Reflectometer][16]\n* [Custom SOC410 Reflectometers][17]\n* [Accessories & Maintenance][18]\n* [\nSpectral Imaging Systems\n][19]\n* [710 Series Hyperspectral Cameras][20]\n* [LightShift Multispectral Video][21]\n* [DuoChrome-SM][22]\n* [SOC-750 Midwave Infrared][23]\n* [SOC-760 VNIR-SWIR][24]\n* [Spectral Imaging Resources][25]\n* [Services][26]\n* [\nOptical Properties Measurement Services\n][27]\n* [Spectral Reflectance (HDR)][28]\n* [Emissivity][29]\n* [BSDF / Scatter][30]\n* [Transmittance Measurements][31]\n* [ASTM Testing][32]\n* [Solar Reflectance (SRI/TSR)][33]\n* [Absorptance & Thermal Emittance][34]\n* [Optical Properties Measurements Database][35]\n* [\nVacuum Deposition Coatings\n][36]\n* [Low Observable / Stealth][37]\n* [Large Area][38]\n* [Roll-to-Roll][39]\n* [Diamond-Like Carbon][40]\n* [Vacuum Deposited Gold (VDG)][41]\n* [Anti-Reflection (AR)][42]\n* [Vacuum Deposited Aluminum (VDA)][43]\n* [Spaceflight and Thermal Control][44]\n* [High Reflectance][45]\n* [\nElectro-Optics Engineering\n][46]\n* [SBIR / STTR][47]\n* [Applications][48]\n* [\nSpace\n][49]\n* [\nDefense\n][50]\n* [\n[Photovoltaic solar panel in desert]\nSolar Energy\n][51]\n* [\nGreen Building\n][52]\n* [\nAgriculture\n][53]\n* [News][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* [Publications][56]\n* [About Us][57]\n* [Our Company][58]\n* [Company History][59]\n* [Facilities][60]\n* [Careers][61]\n* [Our Team][62]\n* [International Distributors][63]\n\n# 410-VIS-IR Reflectometer\n\n## Solar reflectance and thermal emittance measurements\n\nThe 410-Vis-IR joins the ET100 and 410-Solar measurement heads in a single package for measuring\nsolar reflectance/absorptance and thermal emittance. The ET100 measurement head collects directional\nreflectance from 1.5 to 21 \u03bcm to determine directional and total hemispherical emissivity. The\n410-Solar measures reflectance at near-normal incidence from 335-2500nm. Easily switch between\nreflectance and emittance data collection with a single handle for data display and measurement\ncontrols.\n\n[Datasheet][64]\n\n### Complete spectral range\n\nReflectance, absorptance and\nemittance from 350 nm \u2013 21 \u03bcm.\n\n### ASTM Compliant\n\nCompliant with ASTM E903, E408,\nC1549 & E1980.\n\n### No waiting\n\n90 sec warm up, no equilibration\nbetween measurements.\n\n### Easy to use\n\nSimply press port against sample and pull trigger.\n\n### Fast Calibration\n\nOne minute calibration at start of measurement session\n\n### Room temperature samples\n\nCalculate emissivity without heating sample.\n\n## 410-Vis-IR Applications\n\nEvaluation of solar power mirrors\nCharacterizing roofing and construction materials\nRadiative heat transfer\nReflectance target (standard verification)\nA/E for space hardware\nObservatory telescope mirrors\nWafer fab hardware emissivity\nSurface evaluation of electroplated materials\n\n## Easy to Use Onboard Software Interface\n\nThe 410-VIS-IR touchscreen interface provides guided calibration, sample identification, and\nmeasurement data display.\n\n## More Information\n* [\nSpecifications\n][65]\n* [\nPackage\n][66]\n* [\nDownloads\n][67]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u25