500\n\n^{1 }Spectral bands customization is available if a specific spectral band is of interest.\n\n**What is the difference between the 410-Solar and the 410-Solar-i?**\n\nThe 410-Solar provides total, specular and diffuse reflectance. The 410-Solar-i has a larger beam\nsize which increases accuracy for non-uniform surfaces. It has faster measurements, and only\nrequires calibration with one coupon but is limited to providing total solar reflectance without the\nbreakdown of specular and diffuse percentage.\n\n******What are the standard components and accessories?******\n\n***Standard 410-Solar-i Components*\n410-Solar-i Measurement Head with port cap\nGlazed Calibration Coupon (Non-NIST Traceable)\nCommand Module with safety strap\nSecureDigital card reader on a USB cable\nSecureDigital card for data storage, 4 GB\n410-Solar-i operating software\n12 Volt battery cartridge \u2013 2 batteries total\nBattery charger\nPelican Case shipping/storage container\nAccessories container\n1-year warranty\nWorldwide support\n\n***Optional 410-Solar-i Components*\nBenchtop Remote Control Unit \u2013 120VAC\nNIST Traceable Glazed Calibration Coupon\n410-Series Reflectometer Maintenance and Calibration Plan (Non-NIST)\n410-Series Reflectometer Maintenance and Calibration Plan (NIST)\n410-Solar Extended Warranty\nSD Card for Extra Data Storage\nHandheld Command Module \u2013 220VAC\nBenchtop Remote Control Unit \u2013 220VAC\n\n[See 410 Series Accessories for more information on optional components.][68]\n\n******What should I do if my question isn\u2019t answered here?******\n\nCheck the [general 410 Series FAQ][69] for questions that apply to all 410 models or contact our\ntechnical team.\n* [410-Solar-i Datasheet][70]\n* [410 Calibration Plan][71]\n\n## Related Products\n\n### 410-Solar\n\nSpecular and diffuse reflectance handheld measurement equipment\n\n[Learn more][72]\n\n### 410-VIS-IR\n\nSolar reflectance/absorptance and thermal emittance\n\n[LEARN More][73]\n\n### SRI Measurement Services\n\nSolar Reflectance Index measurement services for cool roofing/building\n\n[LEArN More][74]\n\n## Contact For a Quote\n\n[Contact][75]\n[[Surface Optics Corporation]][76]\n\nHave questions?\n* [ 1-858-675-7404][77]\n* [ Email Us][78]\n* [ Support][79]\n* [Products][80]\n* [Services][81]\n* [Applications][82]\n* [News][83]\n* [About Us][84]\n\n\u00a9 Surface Opt"
