            "url": "https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/accessories-maintenance/",
            "text": "* [ 1-858-675-7404][1]\n* [ Email Us][2]\n* [ Support][3]\n[[Surface Optics Corporation]][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [\nLab Reflectometers\n][6]\n* [SOC-100 HDR][7]\n* [SOC-210 Bidirectional Reflectometer][8]\n* [\n410 Series Reflectometers\n][9]\n* [SOC-410 DHR Reflectometer][10]\n* [410-VIS-IR Reflectometer][11]\n* [410-Solar Reflectometer][12]\n* [410-Solar-i Reflectometer][13]\n* [ET-10 Emissometer][14]\n* [ET-100 Emissometer][15]\n* [410-LIDAR Reflectometer][16]\n* [Custom SOC410 Reflectometers][17]\n* [Accessories & Maintenance][18]\n* [\nSpectral Imaging Systems\n][19]\n* [710 Series Hyperspectral Cameras][20]\n* [LightShift Multispectral Video][21]\n* [DuoChrome-SM][22]\n* [SOC-750 Midwave Infrared][23]\n* [SOC-760 VNIR-SWIR][24]\n* [Spectral Imaging Resources][25]\n* [Services][26]\n* [\nOptical Properties Measurement Services\n][27]\n* [Spectral Reflectance (HDR)][28]\n* [Emissivity][29]\n* [BSDF / Scatter][30]\n* [Transmittance Measurements][31]\n* [ASTM Testing][32]\n* [Solar Reflectance (SRI/TSR)][33]\n* [Absorptance & Thermal Emittance][34]\n* [Optical Properties Measurements Database][35]\n* [\nVacuum Deposition Coatings\n][36]\n* [Low Observable / Stealth][37]\n* [Large Area][38]\n* [Roll-to-Roll][39]\n* [Diamond-Like Carbon][40]\n* [Vacuum Deposited Gold (VDG)][41]\n* [Anti-Reflection (AR)][42]\n* [Vacuum Deposited Aluminum (VDA)][43]\n* [Spaceflight and Thermal Control][44]\n* [High Reflectance][45]\n* [\nElectro-Optics Engineering\n][46]\n* [SBIR / STTR][47]\n* [Applications][48]\n* [\nSpace\n][49]\n* [\nDefense\n][50]\n* [\n[Photovoltaic solar panel in desert]\nSolar Energy\n][51]\n* [\nGreen Building\n][52]\n* [\nAgriculture\n][53]\n* [News][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* [Publications][56]\n* [About Us][57]\n* [Our Company][58]\n* [Company History][59]\n* [Facilities][60]\n* [Careers][61]\n* [Our Team][62]\n* [International Distributors][63]\n\n# SOC410 Accessories & Maintenance\n\n## Calibration Coupons\n\nCalibration coupons are reference materials made from stable and homogeneously coated materials with\nprecisely known reflectance properties in the spectral bands of SOC410 Series reflectometers.\nCalibration coupons are necessary to ensure the accuracy of 410 Series reflectance measurements.\n\nPlease use our contact form to request a quote for new calibration coupon(s) and include the serial\nnumber of your instrument so we can confirm the correct calibration coupons for your instrument are\nprovided.\n\n**Not sure if your calibration coupons should be replaced?**\n\nSend a sample data and log file for your instrument and our team will be happy to help assess if\nthere are measurement errors due to compromised calibration coupons.\n\n**NIST Traceable Coupons**\n\nSurface Optics offers both standard and NIST traceable calibration coupons. For standard coupons,\nseveral candidates from each manufacturing run are measured to produce a batch average. NIST\ntraceable coupon(s) is an optional upgrade. NIST traceable coupons are individually measured against\na NIST standard, and a Calibration Certificate is generated for the individual coupon. Calibration\ndata is available for an additional fee.\n\n## Service Plans\n\nGetting your 410 Series Reflectometer tuned and factory calibrated is the best way to ensure that it\nmaintains its high level of measurement integrity throughout the instrument\u2019s lifetime. We recommend\nannual servicing and replacement of calibration coupons to keep your reflectometer operating at peak\nperformance.\n\n## More Information\n* [\nORDERING INFORMATION\n][64]\n* [\nFAQ\n][65]\n* [\nDOWNLOADS\n][66]\n\n### Calibration Coupons\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Mode\u2502**Calibration Coupons**\nl** \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**ET10\u25020410-0100 \u2013 Specular Gold Calibration Coupon (Non-NIST Traceable)\n0** \u2502\n\u25020410-0101 \u2013 Specular Gold Calibration Coupon (NIST Traceable)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**ET10\u25020410-0100 \u2013 Specular Gold Calibration Coupon (Non-NIST Traceable)\n** \u2502\n\u25020410-0101 \u2013 Specular Gold Calibration Coupon (NIST Traceable)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**410-\u25020410-0100 \u2013 Specular Gold Calibration Coupon (Non-NIST Traceable)\nDHR** \u2502\n\u25020410-0101 \u2013 Specular Gold Calibration Coupon (NIST Traceable)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**410-\u25020410-0102 \u2013 Diffuse Calibration Coupon (Non-NIST Traceable)\nSolar*\u2502\n* \u25020410-0103 \u2013 Specular Calibration Coupon (Non-NIST Traceable)\n\u25020410-0104 \u2013 Specular Calibration Coupon (NIST Traceable)\n\u25020410-0106 \u2013 Diffuse Calibration Coupon (NIST Traceable)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**410-\u25020410-0107 \u2013 Glazed Ceramic Calibration Coupon (Non-NIST Traceable)\nSolar-\u2502\ni ** \u25020410-0123 \u2013 Glazed Ceramic Calibration Coupon (NIST Traceable)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**410-\u25020410-0107 \u2013 Glazed Ceramic Calibration Coupon (Non-NIST Traceable)\nLIDAR*\u2502\n* \u25020410-0123 \u2013 Glazed Ceramic Calibration Coupon (NIST Traceable)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n### Accessories\n\nPlease use our contact form or email contact@surfaceoptics.com for more information on replacement\nbatteries, chargers, or alternative configurations,\n\n**What kind of batteries does the 410 Series use and are the batteries considered hazardous goods\nfor shipping? **\n\nNo, the batteries are sealed Nickel Metal Hydride batteries which are considered to be \u201cdry cell\u201d\nbatteries and are not subject to dangerous goods regulation for the purpose of transportation by the\nU.S. Department of Transportation (DOT, the International Civil Aviation Organization (ICAO), the\nInternational Air Transport Association (IATA) or the International Maritime Dangerous Goods\nregulations (IMDG).\n\n**How often should I replace calibration coupons?**\n\nIf the system and calibration standards are handled with care and kept clean of any contaminants,\nrecalibration (or replacement of the calibration standards) is recommended after one year of use or\n2000 uses, at the discretion of the user.\n* [410 Series Maintenance Plan][67]\n\n## Contact us for a quote\n\n[Contact][68]\n[[Surface Optics Corporation]][69]\n\nHave questions?\n* [ 1-858-675-7404][70]\n* [ Email Us][71]\n* [ Support][72]\n* [Products][73]\n* [Services][74]\n* [Applications][75]\n* [News][76]\n* [About Us][77]\n\n\u00a9 Surface Optics Corporation | [Privacy Policy][78] | [Terms & Conditions][79]\n\n[1]: tel:+18586757404\n[2]: https://surfaceoptics.com/contact/\n[3]: https://surfaceoptics.com/support/\n[4]: https://surfaceoptics.com\n[5]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/\n[6]: https://surfaceoptics.com/lab-reflectometers/\n[7]: https://surfaceoptics.com/lab-reflectometers/soc-100-hdr/\n[8]: https://surfaceoptics.com/lab-reflectometers/soc-210-bidirectional-reflectometer/\n[9]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/\n[10]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/410-dhr-reflectometer/\n[11]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/410-vis-ir-reflectometer/\n[12]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/410-solar-reflectometer/\n[13]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/410-solar-i-reflectometer/\n[14]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/et-10-emissometer/\n[15]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/et100-emissometer/\n[16]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/410-lidar-reflectometer/\n[17]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/custom-soc410-reflectometers/\n[18]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/accessories-maintenance/\n[19]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/spectral-imaging-systems/\n[20]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/spectral-imaging-systems/710-series-hyperspectral-cameras/\n[21]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/spectral-imaging-systems/lightshift-multispectral-video-cam\nera/\n[22]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/spectral-imaging-systems/duochrome-sm/\n[23]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/spectral-imaging-systems/soc-750-midwave-infrared-hyperspec\ntral-imager/\n[24]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/spectral-imaging-systems/soc-760/\n[25]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/spectral-imaging-systems/resources/\n[26]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/\n[27]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/\n[28]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/hemispherical-directional-r\neflectance/\n[29]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/emissivity-measurements/\n[30]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/brdf-scatter/\n[31]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/transmittance-measurements/\n[32]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/astm-testing/\n[33]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/solar-reflectance-sri-tsr/\n[34]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/solar-absorptance-thermal-e\nmittance/\n[35]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/database/\n[36]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/vacuum-deposition-coatings/\n[37]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/vacuum-deposition-coatings/low-observable-stealth-coatings/\n[38]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/vacuum-deposition-coatings/la