            "text": "* [ 1-858-675-7404][1]\n* [ Email Us][2]\n* [ Support][3]\n[[Surface Optics Corporation]][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [\nLab Reflectometers\n][6]\n* [SOC-100 HDR][7]\n* [SOC-210 Bidirectional Reflectometer][8]\n* [\n410 Series Reflectometers\n][9]\n* [SOC-410 DHR Reflectometer][10]\n* [410-VIS-IR Reflectometer][11]\n* [410-Solar Reflectometer][12]\n* [410-Solar-i Reflectometer][13]\n* [ET-10 Emissometer][14]\n* [ET-100 Emissometer][15]\n* [410-LIDAR Reflectometer][16]\n* [Custom SOC410 Reflectometers][17]\n* [Accessories & Maintenance][18]\n* [\nSpectral Imaging Systems\n][19]\n* [710 Series Hyperspectral Cameras][20]\n* [LightShift Multispectral Video][21]\n* [DuoChrome-SM][22]\n* [SOC-750 Midwave Infrared][23]\n* [SOC-760 VNIR-SWIR][24]\n* [Spectral Imaging Resources][25]\n* [Services][26]\n* [\nOptical Properties Measurement Services\n][27]\n* [Spectral Reflectance (HDR)][28]\n* [Emissivity][29]\n* [BSDF / Scatter][30]\n* [Transmittance Measurements][31]\n* [ASTM Testing][32]\n* [Solar Reflectance (SRI/TSR)][33]\n* [Absorptance & Thermal Emittance][34]\n* [Optical Properties Measurements Database][35]\n* [\nVacuum Deposition Coatings\n][36]\n* [Low Observable / Stealth][37]\n* [Large Area][38]\n* [Roll-to-Roll][39]\n* [Diamond-Like Carbon][40]\n* [Vacuum Deposited Gold (VDG)][41]\n* [Anti-Reflection (AR)][42]\n* [Vacuum Deposited Aluminum (VDA)][43]\n* [Spaceflight and Thermal Control][44]\n* [High Reflectance][45]\n* [\nElectro-Optics Engineering\n][46]\n* [SBIR / STTR][47]\n* [Applications][48]\n* [\nSpace\n][49]\n* [\nDefense\n][50]\n* [\n[Photovoltaic solar panel in desert]\nSolar Energy\n][51]\n* [\nGreen Building\n][52]\n* [\nAgriculture\n][53]\n* [News][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* [Publications][56]\n* [About Us][57]\n* [Our Company][58]\n* [Company History][59]\n* [Facilities][60]\n* [Careers][61]\n* [Our Team][62]\n* [International Distributors][63]\n\n# Spectral Imaging Systems\n\n### Surface Optics is a leading manufacturer of hyperspectral and multispectral imaging systems for\n### research and industry\n\nSurface Optics specializes in providing state-of-the-art imaging solutions that enable our customers\nto capture and analyze high-quality spectral data for a wide range of applications. Our advanced\ntechnologies deliver exceptional performance, accuracy, and reliability. Our systems are ideal for\nuse in agriculture, environmental monitoring, mineral exploration, and defense applications. With\ndecades of experience and excellent service, we are committed to helping our customers achieve their\nresearch, industry, and security objectives.\n\n[TexasA&M-logo][Harvard-University-logo][spectral-imaging-customer-Pacific_Northwest_National_Labora\ntory_logo][China-Agricultural-University-logo][washington-and-lee-logo][John-Hopkins-logo][Guizhou-U\nniversity-logo][UC-riverside-logo][spectral-imaging-customer-National_Gallery_of_Art_logo][elizabeth\n-city-state-university-logo][University-of-Arizona-logo][cranfield-university-logo][iowa-state-unive\nrsity-logo]\n\n## Spectral Imaging Applications\n\nSurface Optics spectral cameras are Ideal for applications in:\n\nMicroscopy\nAgriculture\nEnvironmental monitoring\nFood processing\nComputer vision, signal & image processing\nSecurity\nMineral exploration\nRemote sensing\nMedical diagnosis\nArt conservation\n\n**OUR PRODUCTS**\n\n## Hyperspectral and Multispectral Cameras\n\nSurface Optics manufactures advanced spectral imaging systems tailored to your needs. Our systems\nfeature a range of spectral and spatial resolutions, spectral responses, imaging speeds, and\nconfiguration options. **[Contact us][64]** to discuss your unique requirements.\n* [\nHyperSpectral Imaging\n][65]\n* [\nMultispectral Video Cameras\n][66]\n* [\nCustom Imagers\n][67]\n* [ [710-E] 710-E 400 \u2013 1000 nm, Most Popular VNIR System ][68]\n* [ [710-sCMOS] 710-sCMOS 400 \u2013 1000 nm, High Spatial Resolution, 16-bit Data ][69]\n* [ [710-SWIR] 710-SWIR 900 \u2013 1700 nm, Near Infrared Spectral Range ][70]\n* [ [LightShift VNIR] LightShift VNIR 400 \u2013 1000 nm, 16-Band ][71]\n* [ [DuoChrome SWIR-MWIR Imager] DuoChrome SWIR-MWIR Imager 1.5 \u2013 2.5 \u00b5m and 3.5 \u2013 5.0 \u00b5m, 2 Bands\n][72]\n* [ [SOC750 MWIR Hyperspectral Imager] SOC750 MWIR Hyperspectral Imager 2.0 \u2013 5.0 \u03bcm, 42 \u2013 64 Bands\n][73]\n* [ [SOC760 VNIR-SWIR Hyperspectral Imaging System] SOC760 VNIR-SWIR Hyperspectral Imaging System\n400 \u2013 2500 nm, 650 Bands ][74]\n\n## Related News\n* [[Custom Spectroscopic Process Monitoring Systems for Aerospace, Defense, and Industrial\nManufacturing]][75]\n\n## [Custom Spectroscopic Process Monitoring Systems for Aerospace, Defense, and Industrial\n## Manufacturing][76]\n\nMay 28, 2026\n* [[Surface Optics Releases New Hyperspectral Imaging Systems: 710-HyCore and 710-OmniCore]][77]\n\n## [Surface Optics Releases New Hyperspectral Imaging Systems: 710-HyCore and 710-OmniCore][78]\n\nMarch 26, 2026\n* [[Transforming Food Manufacturing Inspection with Hyperspectral Imaging ]][79]\n\n## [Transforming Food Manufacturing Inspection with Hyperspectral Imaging ][80]\n\nMarch 4, 2026\n\n# Talk to our experts and get a quote\n\n[Contact us][81]\n[International Suppliers][82]\n[[Surface Optics Corporation]][83]\n\nHave questions?\n* [ 1-858-675-7404][84]\n* [ Email Us][85]\n* [ Support][86]\n* [Products][87]\n* [Services][88]\n* [Applications][89]\n* [News][90]\n* [About Us][91]\n\n\u00a9 Surface Optics Corporation | [Privacy Policy][92] | [Terms & Conditions][93]\n\n[1]: tel:+18586757404\n[2]: https://surfaceoptics.com/contact/\n[3]: https://surfaceoptics.com/support/\n[4]: https://surfaceoptics.com\n[5]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/\n[6]: https://surfaceoptics.com/lab-reflectometers/\n[7]: https://surfaceoptics.com/lab-reflectometers/soc-100-hdr/\n[8]: https://surfaceoptics.com/lab-reflectometers/soc-210-bidirectional-reflectometer/\n[9]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/\n[10]: https://surfaceoptics.com/