            "text": "* [ 1-858-675-7404][1]\n* [ Email Us][2]\n* [ Support][3]\n[[Surface Optics Corporation]][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [\nLab Reflectometers\n][6]\n* [SOC-100 HDR][7]\n* [SOC-210 Bidirectional Reflectometer][8]\n* [\n410 Series Reflectometers\n][9]\n* [SOC-410 DHR Reflectometer][10]\n* [410-VIS-IR Reflectometer][11]\n* [410-Solar Reflectometer][12]\n* [410-Solar-i Reflectometer][13]\n* [ET-10 Emissometer][14]\n* [ET-100 Emissometer][15]\n* [410-LIDAR Reflectometer][16]\n* [Custom SOC410 Reflectometers][17]\n* [Accessories & Maintenance][18]\n* [\nSpectral Imaging Systems\n][19]\n* [710 Series Hyperspectral Cameras][20]\n* [LightShift Multispectral Video][21]\n* [DuoChrome-SM][22]\n* [SOC-750 Midwave Infrared][23]\n* [SOC-760 VNIR-SWIR][24]\n* [Spectral Imaging Resources][25]\n* [Services][26]\n* [\nOptical Properties Measurement Services\n][27]\n* [Spectral Reflectance (HDR)][28]\n* [Emissivity][29]\n* [BSDF / Scatter][30]\n* [Transmittance Measurements][31]\n* [ASTM Testing][32]\n* [Solar Reflectance (SRI/TSR)][33]\n* [Absorptance & Thermal Emittance][34]\n* [Optical Properties Measurements Database][35]\n* [\nVacuum Deposition Coatings\n][36]\n* [Low Observable / Stealth][37]\n* [Large Area][38]\n* [Roll-to-Roll][39]\n* [Diamond-Like Carbon][40]\n* [Vacuum Deposited Gold (VDG)][41]\n* [Anti-Reflection (AR)][42]\n* [Vacuum Deposited Aluminum (VDA)][43]\n* [Spaceflight and Thermal Control][44]\n* [High Reflectance][45]\n* [\nElectro-Optics Engineering\n][46]\n* [SBIR / STTR][47]\n* [Applications][48]\n* [\nSpace\n][49]\n* [\nDefense\n][50]\n* [\n[Photovoltaic solar panel in desert]\nSolar Energy\n][51]\n* [\nGreen Building\n][52]\n* [\nAgriculture\n][53]\n* [News][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* [Publications][56]\n* [About Us][57]\n* [Our Company][58]\n* [Company History][59]\n* [Facilities][60]\n* [Careers][61]\n* [Our Team][62]\n* [International Distributors][63]\n\n# Spectral Imaging Resources\n* [[Precision Agriculture and Hyperspectral Sensors: Monitoring Against Drought, Disease, and\nNutrient Stress]][64]\n\n## [Precision Agriculture and Hyperspectral Sensors: Monitoring Against Drought, Disease, and\n## Nutrient Stress][65]\n\nCrop monitoring for nutrients, water-stress, disease, insect attack and overall plant health is a\nvital aspect of successful agricultural operations. Traditionally this has been carried out by\nvisual examination of crops on the ground or sometimes from the air. However these methods are\nlimited by the ability of the human eye to discriminate between healthy\u2026\n\n[READ MORE: Precision Agriculture and Hyperspectral Sensors: Monitoring Against Drought, Disease,\nand Nutrient Stress][66]\n* [[Hyperspectral Imaging in Art Conservation]][67]\n\n## [Hyperspectral Imaging in Art Conservation][68]\n\nThe need to conserve art has a long history, back to the time when people first realized that the\nart objects they treasured had begun to deteriorate. In the nineteenth century science and art\nfirst began to meet, with scientists of that time looking for methods to preserve valuable works\nof art. Of course today\u2026\n\n[READ MORE: Hyperspectral Imaging in Art Conservation][69]\n\n## **Guides & Tutorials**\n\n#### [How Much Does A Hyperspectral Camera Cost in 2026?][70]\n\nJune 25, 2025\n[Read More][71]\n\n#### [Understanding Plenoptic Division of Wavefront Multispectral Imaging][72]\n\nJanuary 16, 2025\n[Read More][73]\n\n#### [Hyperspectral Microscopy: Techniques and Opportunities][74]\n\nNovember 21, 2024\n[Read More][75]\n\n#### [Important Specifications for Hyperspectral Cameras][76]\n\nJune 19, 2024\n[Read More][77]\n\n#### [A Quick Guide to Hyperspectral Camera Specifications][78]\n\nMarch 9, 2023\n[Read More][79]\n\n## **Guides & Tutorials**\n\n#### [How Much Does A Hyperspectral Camera Cost in 2026?][80]\n\n#### [Understanding Plenoptic Division of Wavefront Multispectral Imaging][81]\n\n#### [Hyperspectral Microscopy: Techniques and Opportunities][82]\n\n#### [Important Specifications for Hyperspectral Cameras][83]\n\n#### [A Quick Guide to Hyperspectral Camera Specifications][84]\n\n## **Case Studies**\n* [[Transforming Food Manufacturing Inspection with Hyperspectral Imaging ]][85]\n\n## [Transforming Food Manufacturing Inspection with Hyperspectral Imaging ][86]\n\nFood manufacturers today face unprecedented demands: greater throughput, stricter safety\nstandards, zero-tolerance defect rates, and expectations for consistent product\nquality. Traditional tools \u2013 RGB cameras, manual sampling, and visual inspection \u2013 struggle to\nkeep pace with these demands. Recent research by Zhao et al. (2023) published in LWT \u2013 Food\nScience and Technology use near-infrared (NIR) hyperspectral imaging combined with\ninterpretable machine learning models to access tomato quality and maturity, which determine the\u2026\n* [[From Degradation to Discovery: Hyperspectral Camera Reveals Lost Artistic Depth]][87]\n\n## [From Degradation to Discovery: Hyperspectral Camera Reveals Lost Artistic Depth][88]\n\nHyperspectral imaging reveals hidden pigment details in Abraham Mignon\u2019s \u201cStill Life with Flowers\nand a Watch,\u201d aiding precise art conservation.\n* [[Hyperspectral Imaging Characterizes Spectral Properties of Tattoo Dyes for Optimized Laser\nRemoval]][89]\n\n## [Hyperspectral Imaging Characterizes Spectral Properties of Tattoo Dyes for Optimized Laser\n## Removal][90]\n\nNew research from the Medical University of Silesia is showing how hyperspectral imaging can help\nmake laser tattoo removal more precise and effective\u2014by analyzing the optical properties of tattoo\ndyes and guiding wavelength selection.\n* [[Revolutionizing Cancer Diagnosis with Hyperspectral Microscopy and Machine Learning]][91]\n\n## [Revolutionizing Cancer Diagnosis with Hyperspectral Microscopy and Machine Learning][92]\n\nResearchers at Tianjin University of Traditional Chinese Medicine use hyperspectral microscopy and\nmachine learning to improve early detection of oral cancer, enabling precise identification of\ncancer stages through spectral analysis of tissue. This breakthrough enhances diagnostic accuracy\nand reduces subjectivity in OSCC assessments.\n* [[Smarter Rapeseed Harvests: Hyperspectral Imaging for Water Content and Maturity Detection]][93]\n\n## [Smarter Rapeseed Harvests: Hyperspectral Imaging for Water Content and Maturity Detection][94]\n\nResearchers at the College of Agronomy, Hunan Agricultural University are applying hyperspectral\nimaging as a powerful tool to improve rapeseed growth, yield, and quality. Their work focuses on\naddressing key challenges in managing rapeseed (Brassica napus L.) production, an important\noilseed crop cultivated worldwide. One of the most critical phases for maximizing seed output is\u2026\n* [[Advancing Paleoclimate Research through Hyperspectral Imaging Microscopy of Tree Rings]][95]\n\n## [Advancing Paleoclimate Research through Hyperspectral Imaging Microscopy of Tree Rings][96]\n\nHyperspectral imaging microscopy enhances tree ring analysis for paleoclimate studies, offering\ngreater accuracy than traditional width indices in humid regions.\n\n## **News**\n\n#### [Surface Optics Releases New Hyperspectral Imaging Systems: 710-HyCore and 710-OmniCore][97]\n\nMarch 26, 2026\n[Read More][98]\n\n#### [Coastal Trident Preview: Advancing UAV Detection with Multispectral Imaging][99]\n\nMay 30, 2025\n[Read More][100]\n\n#### [Surface Optics Wins Phase II SBIR Contract for Hypersonic Missile Detection and Tracking Using\n#### EO/IR Sensors][101]\n\nOctober 25, 2024\n[Read More][102]\n\n#### [Surface Optics Awarded Phase I NAVAIR SBIR Grant to Develop Multispectral Imaging System for\n#### Detection of UAVs][103]\n\nJune 21, 2021\n[Read More][104]\n\n#### [Surface Optics Partners with 4Walls International to Provide SWIR Hyperspectral Data for the\n#### Border Impact Bond][105]\n\nJune 15, 2021\n[Read More][106]\n\n#### [Imaging and Machine Vision Europe Cover Story Features Surface Optics][107]\n\nJanuary 13, 2021\n[Read More][108]\n\n#### [Spectral Imaging Tech Has a New Target: Helping the Energy Industry Monitor, Reduce\n#### Emissions][109]\n\nMay 29, 2019\n[Read More][110]\n\n#### [Surface Optics Gives Sneak Peek of First Commercial Multimodal Snapshot Spectral Imaging and\n#### Polarization Imager at SPIE DCS 2018][111]\n\nApril 27, 2018\n[Read More][112]\n\n#### [Multispectral Technology Advancement Industry Day][113]\n\nOctober 25, 2016\n[Read More][114]\n\n## **Technical Publications**\n\nJafolla, J. C., & Dombrowski, M. S. (2002). Hyperspectral sensor test bed for real-time algorithm\nevaluation. In S. S. Shen & P. E. Lewis (Eds.), *Imaging spectrometry VII* (Proc. SPIE 4480).\n[https://doi.org/10.1117/12.453358][115]\n\n[[Surface Optics Corporation]][116]\n\nHave questions?\n* [ 1-858-675-7404][117]\n* [ Email Us][118]\n* [ Support][119]\n* [Products][120]\n* [Services][121]\n* [Applications][122]\n* [News][123]\n* [About Us][124]\n\n\u00a9 Surface Optics Corporation | [Privacy Policy][125] | [Terms & Conditions][126]\n\n[1]: tel:+18586757404\n[2]: https://surfaceoptics.com/contact/\n[3]: https://surfaceoptics.com/support/\n[4]: https://surfaceoptics.com\n[5]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/\n[6]: https://surfaceoptics.com/lab-reflectometers/\n[7]: https://surfaceoptics.com/lab-reflectometers/soc-100-hdr/\n[8]: https://surfaceoptics.com/lab-reflectometers/soc-210-bidirectional-reflectometer/\n[9]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/\n[10]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/410-dhr-reflectometer/\n[11]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/410-vis-ir-reflectometer/\n[12]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/410-solar-reflectometer/\n[13]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/410-solar-i-reflectometer/\n[14]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/et-10-emissometer/\n[15]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/et100-emissometer/\n[16]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/410-lidar-reflectometer/\n[17]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/custom-soc410-reflectometers/\n[18]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/accessories-maintenance/\n[19]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/spectral-imaging-systems/\n[20]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/spectral-imaging-systems/710-series-hyperspectral-cameras/\n[21]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/spectral-imaging-systems/lightshift-multispectral-video-cam\nera/\n[22]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/spectral-imaging-systems/duochrome-sm/\n[23]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/spectral-imaging-systems/soc-750-midwave-infrared-hyperspec\ntral-imager/\n[24]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/spectral-imaging-systems/soc-760/\n[25]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/spectral-imaging-systems/resources/\n[26]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/\n[27]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/\n[28]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/hemispherical-directional-r\neflectance/\n[29]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/emissivity-measurements/\n[30]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/brdf-scatter/\n[31]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/transmittance-measurements/\n[32]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/astm-testing/\n[33]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/solar-reflectance-sri-tsr/\n[34]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/solar-absorptance-thermal-e\nmittance/\n[35]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/database/\n[36]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/vacuum-deposition-coatings/\n[37]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/vacuum-deposition-coatings/low-observable-stealth-coatings/\n[38]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/vacuum-deposition-coatings/large-area-coatings/\n[39]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/vacuum-deposition-coatings/roll-to-roll-coatings/\n[40]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/vacuum-deposition-coatings/diamond-like-carbon-coating/\n[41]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/vacuum-deposition-coatings/vacuum-deposited-gold-vdg-coatin\ngs/\n[42]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/vacuum-deposition-coatings/antireflection-"
