            "url": "https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/",
            "text": "* [ 1-858-675-7404][1]\n* [ Email Us][2]\n* [ Support][3]\n[[Surface Optics Corporation]][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [\nLab Reflectometers\n][6]\n* [SOC-100 HDR][7]\n* [SOC-210 Bidirectional Reflectometer][8]\n* [\n410 Series Reflectometers\n][9]\n* [SOC-410 DHR Reflectometer][10]\n* [410-VIS-IR Reflectometer][11]\n* [410-Solar Reflectometer][12]\n* [410-Solar-i Reflectometer][13]\n* [ET-10 Emissometer][14]\n* [ET-100 Emissometer][15]\n* [410-LIDAR Reflectometer][16]\n* [Custom SOC410 Reflectometers][17]\n* [Accessories & Maintenance][18]\n* [\nSpectral Imaging Systems\n][19]\n* [710 Series Hyperspectral Cameras][20]\n* [LightShift Multispectral Video][21]\n* [DuoChrome-SM][22]\n* [SOC-750 Midwave Infrared][23]\n* [SOC-760 VNIR-SWIR][24]\n* [Spectral Imaging Resources][25]\n* [Services][26]\n* [\nOptical Properties Measurement Services\n][27]\n* [Spectral Reflectance (HDR)][28]\n* [Emissivity][29]\n* [BSDF / Scatter][30]\n* [Transmittance Measurements][31]\n* [ASTM Testing][32]\n* [Solar Reflectance (SRI/TSR)][33]\n* [Absorptance & Thermal Emittance][34]\n* [Optical Properties Measurements Database][35]\n* [\nVacuum Deposition Coatings\n][36]\n* [Low Observable / Stealth][37]\n* [Large Area][38]\n* [Roll-to-Roll][39]\n* [Diamond-Like Carbon][40]\n* [Vacuum Deposited Gold (VDG)][41]\n* [Anti-Reflection (AR)][42]\n* [Vacuum Deposited Aluminum (VDA)][43]\n* [Spaceflight and Thermal Control][44]\n* [High Reflectance][45]\n* [\nElectro-Optics Engineering\n][46]\n* [SBIR / STTR][47]\n* [Applications][48]\n* [\nSpace\n][49]\n* [\nDefense\n][50]\n* [\n[Photovoltaic solar panel in desert]\nSolar Energy\n][51]\n* [\nGreen Building\n][52]\n* [\nAgriculture\n][53]\n* [News][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* [Publications][56]\n* [About Us][57]\n* [Our Company][58]\n* [Company History][59]\n* [Facilities][60]\n* [Careers][61]\n* [Our Team][62]\n* [International Distributors][63]\n\n# Optical Properties Measurement Services\n\n[optical properties measurements lab]\n\n## The Optical Properties Measurements Lab at Surface Optics is a leading supplier of reflectance,\n## BRDF, transmittance, solar absorptance and emittance testing services.\n\nSurface Optics\u2019 founders pioneered the design of analytical instrumentation for hemispherical and\nbidirectional reflectance measurements and established Surface Optics in 1977 to meet the optical\nproperties testing needs of the aerospace and defense industry. Today our lab serves customers in\ncommercial electronics, solar energy, biomedical technology, computer-generated imagery, cool\nroofing, construction, and many other applications requiring optical data for heat transfer\nmodeling. Surface Optics customers receive the same high-quality testing and analysis we use for our\nown AS9100 coatings lab.\n\nOur mission is to provide accurate measurements with quick turnaround times, affordable costs, and\nsuperior customer support for our unique service offerings. We welcome both U.S. and international\ncustomers.\n\n[GET A QUOTE][64]\n\n### Tell Us About Your Measurement Needs and We\u2019ll Send A Quote\n* Name*\nFirst Last\n* Organization / Company*\n* Email*\n* Phone\n* Message*\n\n## Applications\n\nOur measurement data is used in analysis and modeling for:\n\nVerification of paint and coatings\nDetermination of solar absorptance & thermal emittance\nAircraft and ground target signature modeling\nSimulator scene generation\nSolar energy\nDetermining the specularity of reflective components\nRemote sensing / ground truth\nMilitary\nAerospace\nMirror qualification\n\nOur instruments and procedures are traceable to the National Institute of Standards & Technology.\nSurface Optics is an ASTM Organizational member and we use testing methods consistent with\napplicable ASTM standards.\n\n## Available Testing Services\n\n### Hemispherical Directional Reflectance\n\nMeasures the fraction of the light incident on a sample at a given angle that is reflected back into\nthe hemisphere. Measurements of HDR from 0.3 \u03bcm to 50 \u03bcm. Typical HDR measurements are made out to\n25 \u03bcm. We measure HDR as a function of incident elevation, polarization, wavelength, temperature,\nand provide both the specular and diffuse components.\n\n[MORE INFO][65]\n\n### Scatter, BSDF, BRDF, BTDF\n\nThe bidirectional reflectance (BRDF) and bidirectional transmittance (BTDF) of a surface are defined\nas the ratios of the luminous radiance reflected or transmitted into a unit solid angle to the total\nincident radiance. BRDF/BTDF measurement capabilities span from 0.4 \u03bcm to 14 \u03bcm with a full four\ndegrees of angular freedom (incident elevation and azimuth, and reflected elevation and azimuth).\n\n[MORE INFO][66]\n\n### Emissivity\n\nFrom reflectance measurements (and transmittance where necessary), we generate emittance data as a\nfunction of polarization, wavelength, angle, and temperature.\n\n[MORE INFO][67]\n\n### Solar Absorptance & Thermal Emittance\n\nA/E Solar Absorptance and Emittance Measurement Services\n\n[MORE INFO][68]\n\n### Transmittance\n\nScattered or Collimated Transmittance from Hemispherical Directional Reflectance measurements.\n\n[MORE INFO][69]\n\n### Solar Reflectance (SRI/TSR)\n\nSolar Reflectance Index or Total Solar Reflectance testing.\n\n[MORE INFO][70]\n\n### ASTM Standard Testing\n\nComprehensive optical property testing that adhere to the rigorous standards set by the American\nSociety for Testing and Materials (ASTM).\n\n[MORE INFO][71]\n\n## Other Information\n* [\nFAQ\n][72]\n* [\nDownloads\n][73]\n* [\nLead Times & Sample REQUIREMENTS\n][74]\n* [\nSample DATA\n][75]\n\n**What is the standard lead time for a measurement?**\n\n2-4 weeks. Expedited measurement service available for an additional fee.\n\n**What size should my sample be?**\n\nSample size requirements vary by measurement type but range from 1 in. x 1 in. (2.54 cm x 2.54 cm)\nto less than 4 in. x 4 in. (10.16 cm x 10.16 cm).\n\n**What data output(s) do you provide?**\n\nRaw data is provided in a comma separated .txt file that can be viewed easily in a text editor or\nExcel.\n\n[Surface Optics Measurement Services Brochure][76]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nMeasurement Type \u2502Avg Lead Time \u2502Sample Size\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nUnpolarized spectral reflectance measurements \u25022 weeks \u2502< 4\u2033 square, flat\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPolarized single angle spectral reflectance \u2013 0.3 to 25 microns \u25022 weeks \u25021 x 1.5\u2033, flat\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPolarized single angle spectral reflectance \u2013 2.0 to 25 microns \u25022 weeks \u2502< 4\u2033 square, flat\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPolarized multi angle spectral reflectance \u2013 0.3 to 25 microns \u25023 weeks \u25021 x 1.5\u2033, flat\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2