            "text": "* [ 1-858-675-7404][1]\n* [ Email Us][2]\n* [ Support][3]\n[[Surface Optics Corporation]][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [\nLab Reflectometers\n][6]\n* [SOC-100 HDR][7]\n* [SOC-210 Bidirectional Reflectometer][8]\n* [\n410 Series Reflectometers\n][9]\n* [SOC-410 DHR Reflectometer][10]\n* [410-VIS-IR Reflectometer][11]\n* [410-Solar Reflectometer][12]\n* [410-Solar-i Reflectometer][13]\n* [ET-10 Emissometer][14]\n* [ET-100 Emissometer][15]\n* [410-LIDAR Reflectometer][16]\n* [Custom SOC410 Reflectometers][17]\n* [Accessories & Maintenance][18]\n* [\nSpectral Imaging Systems\n][19]\n* [710 Series Hyperspectral Cameras][20]\n* [LightShift Multispectral Video][21]\n* [DuoChrome-SM][22]\n* [SOC-750 Midwave Infrared][23]\n* [SOC-760 VNIR-SWIR][24]\n* [Spectral Imaging Resources][25]\n* [Services][26]\n* [\nOptical Properties Measurement Services\n][27]\n* [Spectral Reflectance (HDR)][28]\n* [Emissivity][29]\n* [BSDF / Scatter][30]\n* [Transmittance Measurements][31]\n* [ASTM Testing][32]\n* [Solar Reflectance (SRI/TSR)][33]\n* [Absorptance & Thermal Emittance][34]\n* [Optical Properties Measurements Database][35]\n* [\nVacuum Deposition Coatings\n][36]\n* [Low Observable / Stealth][37]\n* [Large Area][38]\n* [Roll-to-Roll][39]\n* [Diamond-Like Carbon][40]\n* [Vacuum Deposited Gold (VDG)][41]\n* [Anti-Reflection (AR)][42]\n* [Vacuum Deposited Aluminum (VDA)][43]\n* [Spaceflight and Thermal Control][44]\n* [High Reflectance][45]\n* [\nElectro-Optics Engineering\n][46]\n* [SBIR / STTR][47]\n* [Applications][48]\n* [\nSpace\n][49]\n* [\nDefense\n][50]\n* [\n[Photovoltaic solar panel in desert]\nSolar Energy\n][51]\n* [\nGreen Building\n][52]\n* [\nAgriculture\n][53]\n* [News][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* [Publications][56]\n* [About Us][57]\n* [Our Company][58]\n* [Company History][59]\n* [Facilities][60]\n* [Careers][61]\n* [Our Team][62]\n* [International Distributors][63]\n\n# Hemispherical Directional Reflectance\n\n## Non-contact, non-destructive specular reflectance and transmittance characterization\n\nHemispherical directional reflectance (HDR) measures the fraction of the light incident on a sample\nat a given angle that is reflected back into the hemisphere. Typical HDR measurements are made out\nto 25 \u03bcm. We measure HDR as a function of reflected polar angle, polarization, wavelength,\ntemperature, and provide both the specular and diffuse components.\n\n[GET A QUOTE][64]\nCary 5000\n\n## Instrumentation\n\n**Cary 5000 UV-Vis-NIR spectrophotometer with a DRA 2500 attachment**\n* Measure 175 to 3300 nm using a PbSmart NIR detector for extended photometric range\n* Extended dynamic range by attenuating the reference beam more in line with the sample absorbance\n* Maximum light throughput using Schwarzchild coupling optics for higher accuracy at low\ntransmission levels\n* Minimal noise and stray light using a floating aluminum casting and double Littrow monochromator\n\nSOC-100 Hemispherical Directional Reflectometer\n\n**SOC-100 HDR**\n* Parallel, perpendicular & unpolarized reflectance at 12 user-selected angles between 8\u00b0 and 80\u00b0.\n* Separation of the reflectance into diffuse and specular components.\n* Collimated and scattered transmittance at 0\u00b0 incidence.\n* Directional emittance as a function of wavelength and temperature beyond 500\u00b0C.\n* Total hemispherical emittance as a function of temperature.\n\n## Related News\n* [[Optical Measurement of Z93 Thermal Coating on the International Space Station]][65]\n\n## [Optical Measurement of Z93 Thermal Coating on the International Space Station][66]\n\nSeptember 23, 2020\n* [[Measurement and analysis of optical surface properties for input to ShipIR]][67]\n\n## [Measurement and analysis of optical surface properties for input to ShipIR][68]\n\nApril 22, 2009\n* [[Extended performance infrared directional reflectometer for the measurement of total, diffuse\nand specular reflectance]][69]\n\n## [Extended performance infrared directional reflectometer for the measurement of total, diffuse\n## and specular reflectance][70]\n\nOctober 7, 1994\n\n## Contact us to discuss your Measurement needs\n\n[Contact][71]\n[[Surface Optics Corporation]][72]\n\nHave questions?\n* [ 1-858-675-7404][73]\n* [ Email Us][74]\n* [ Support][75]\n* [Products][76]\n* [Services][77]\n* [Applications][78]\n* [News][79]\n* [About Us][80]\n\n\u00a9 Surface Optics Corporation | [Privacy Policy][81] | [Terms & Conditions][82]\n\n[1]: tel:+18586757404\n[2]: https://surfaceoptics.com/contact/\n[3]: https://surfaceoptics.com/support/\n[4]: https://surfaceoptics.com\n[5]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/\n[6]: https://surfaceoptics.com/lab-reflectometers/\n[7]: https://surfaceoptics.com/lab-reflectometers/soc-100-hdr/\n[8]: https://surfaceoptics.com/lab-reflectometers/soc-210-bidirectional-reflectometer/\n[9]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/\n[10]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/410-dhr-reflectometer/\n[11]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/410-vis-ir-reflectometer/\n[12]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/410-solar-reflectometer/\n[13]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/410-solar-i-reflectometer/\n[14]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/et-10-emissometer/\n[15]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/et100-emissometer/\n[16]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/410-lidar-reflectometer/\n[17]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/custom-soc410-reflectometers/\n[18]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/410-series/accessories-maintenance/\n[19]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/spectral-imaging-systems/\n[20]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/spectral-imaging-systems/710-series-hyperspectral-cameras/\n[21]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/spectral-imaging-systems/lightshift-multispectral-video-cam\nera/\n[22]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/spectral-imaging-systems/duochrome-sm/\n[23]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/spectral-imaging-systems/soc-750-midwave-infrared-hyperspec\ntral-imager/\n[24]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/spectral-imaging-systems/soc-760/\n[25]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/spectral-imaging-systems/resources/\n[26]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/\n[27]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/\n[28]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/hemispherical-directional-r\neflectance/\n[29]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/emissivity-measurements/\n[30]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/brdf-scatter/\n[31]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/transmittance-measurements/\n[32]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/astm-testing/\n[33]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/solar-reflectance-sri-tsr/\n[34]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/solar-absorptance-thermal-e\nmittance/\n[35]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/optical-properties-measurements/database/\n[36]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/vacuum-deposition-coatings/\n[37]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/vacuum-deposition-coatings/low-observable-stealth-coatings/\n[38]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/vacuum-deposition-coatings/large-area-coatings/\n[39]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/vacuum-deposition-coatings/roll-to-roll-coatings/\n[40]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/vacuum-deposition-coatings/diamond-like-carbon-coating/\n[41]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/vacuum-deposition-coatings/vacuum-deposited-gold-vdg-coatin\ngs/\n[42]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/vacuum-deposition-coatings/antireflection-ar-coatings/\n[43]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/vacuum-deposition-coatings/vacuum-deposited-aluminum-coatin\ngs/\n[44]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/vacuum-deposition-coatings/spaceflight-and-thermal-control-\ncoatings/\n[45]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/vacuum-deposition-coatings/high-reflectance-coatings/\n[46]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/electro-optics-engineering/\n[47]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/electro-optics-engineering/sbir-sttr/\n[48]: https://surfaceoptics.com/applications/\n[49]: https://surfaceoptics.com/applications/space/\n[50]: https://surfaceoptics.com/applications/defense/\n[51]: https://surfaceoptics.com/applications/solar-energy/\n[52]: https://surfaceoptics.com/applications/green-building/\n[53]: https://surfaceoptics.com/applications/agriculture/\n[54]: https://surfaceoptics.com/news/\n[55]: https://surfaceoptics.com/news/\n[56]: https://surfaceoptics.com/publications/\n[57]: https://surfaceoptics.com/company/\n[58]: https://surfaceoptics.com/company/\n[59]: https://surfaceoptics.com/company/company-history/\n[60]: https://surfaceoptics.com/company/facilities/\n[61]: https://surfaceoptics.com/company/careers/\n[62]: https://surfaceoptics.com/company/meet-our-team/\n[63]: https://surfaceoptics.com/company/international-distributors/\n[64]: https://surfaceoptics.com/contact/\n[65]: https://surfaceoptics.com/optical-measurement-z93-thermal-coating-iss-spectroscopy-magazine/\n[66]: https://surfaceoptics.com/optical-measurement-z93-thermal-coating-iss-spectroscopy-magazine/\n[67]: https://surfaceoptics.com/measurement-and-analysis-of-optical-surface-properties-for-input-to-\nshipir/\n[68]: https://surfaceoptics.com/measurement-and-analysis-of-optical-surface-properties-for-input-to-\nshipir/\n[69]: https://surfaceoptics.com/extended-performance-infrared-directional-reflectometer-for-the-meas\nurement-of-total-diffuse-and-specular-reflectance/\n[70]: https://surfaceoptics.com/extended-performance-infrared-directional-reflectometer-for-the-meas\nurement-of-total-diffuse-and-specular-reflectance/\n[71]: https://surfaceoptics.com/contact/\n[72]: https://surfaceoptics.com\n[73]: tel:+18586757404\n[74]: https://surfaceoptics.com/contact/\n[75]: https://surfaceoptics.com/support/\n[76]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/\n[77]: https://surfaceoptics.com/services/\n[78]: https://surfaceoptics.com/applications/\n[79]: https://surfaceoptics.com/news/\n[80]: https://surfaceoptics.com/company/\n[81]: /privacy-policy/\n[82]: /terms/"
