            "text": "* [ 1-858-675-7404][1]\n* [ Email Us][2]\n* [ Support][3]\n[[Surface Optics Corporation]][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [\nLab Reflectometers\n][6]\n* [SOC-100 HDR][7]\n* [SOC-210 Bidirectional Reflectometer][8]\n* [\n410 Series Reflectometers\n][9]\n* [SOC-410 DHR Reflectometer][10]\n* [410-VIS-IR Reflectometer][11]\n* [410-Solar Reflectometer][12]\n* [410-Solar-i Reflectometer][13]\n* [ET-10 Emissometer][14]\n* [ET-100 Emissometer][15]\n* [410-LIDAR Reflectometer][16]\n* [Custom SOC410 Reflectometers][17]\n* [Accessories & Maintenance][18]\n* [\nSpectral Imaging Systems\n][19]\n* [710 Series Hyperspectral Cameras][20]\n* [LightShift Multispectral Video][21]\n* [DuoChrome-SM][22]\n* [SOC-750 Midwave Infrared][23]\n* [SOC-760 VNIR-SWIR][24]\n* [Spectral Imaging Resources][25]\n* [Services][26]\n* [\nOptical Properties Measurement Services\n][27]\n* [Spectral Reflectance (HDR)][28]\n* [Emissivity][29]\n* [BSDF / Scatter][30]\n* [Transmittance Measurements][31]\n* [ASTM Testing][32]\n* [Solar Reflectance (SRI/TSR)][33]\n* [Absorptance & Thermal Emittance][34]\n* [Optical Properties Measurements Database][35]\n* [\nVacuum Deposition Coatings\n][36]\n* [Low Observable / Stealth][37]\n* [Large Area][38]\n* [Roll-to-Roll][39]\n* [Diamond-Like Carbon][40]\n* [Vacuum Deposited Gold (VDG)][41]\n* [Anti-Reflection (AR)][42]\n* [Vacuum Deposited Aluminum (VDA)][43]\n* [Spaceflight and Thermal Control][44]\n* [High Reflectance][45]\n* [\nElectro-Optics Engineering\n][46]\n* [SBIR / STTR][47]\n* [Applications][48]\n* [\nSpace\n][49]\n* [\nDefense\n][50]\n* [\n[Photovoltaic solar panel in desert]\nSolar Energy\n][51]\n* [\nGreen Building\n][52]\n* [\nAgriculture\n][53]\n* [News][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* [Publications][56]\n* [About Us][57]\n* [Our Company][58]\n* [Company History][59]\n* [Facilities][60]\n* [Careers][61]\n* [Our Team][62]\n* [International Distributors][63]\n\n# Vacuum Deposition Coatings\n\n## Surface Optics is a focused provider of vacuum deposition coatings for the aerospace and defense\n## industries. We have over 30 years of space hardware coating experience.\n\nOur coatings lab offers large chambers and clean rooms, a custom job environment, one-of-a-kind\ncoating hardware, significant space program heritage, and on-site world-class metrology. We\nmanufacture vacuum deposited coatings using several techniques standard in the coating industry:\nresistively heated thermal evaporation, electron beam evaporation, and ion beam assisted deposition.\n\nUtilize our standard coating services or work with us to develop a custom solution that meets your\nneeds. We perform batch-to-batch adjustment and verification with our [in-house measurement\nlab][64]. Our ability to scale, test, and measure within the same facility allows us to rapidly\nbring your development project from prototype to production. Capability to scale for high volume\nproduction and large substrates.\n\n### [Spaceflight and Thermal Control][65]\n\nProven expertise with space hardware\n\n### [Low Observable / Stealth][66]\n\nSpectrally tailored coatings and paint\n\n### [Vacuum Deposited Aluminum][67]\n\nStandard, Protected Al, & Enhanced UV\n\n### [Anti-Reflective][68]\n\nVisible AR coatings\n\n### [Roll-to-Roll][69]\n\nFlexible substrate coatings\n\n### [Diamond-Like Carbon][70]\n\nLow absorption protective coatings\n\n### [Vacuum Deposited Gold][71]\n\nProtected gold coatings\n\n### [Large Area][72]\n\nSubstrates up to 3m\n\n### [High Reflectance][73]\n\nUltra-High IR Reflectance Coatings\n\n[Boeing-logo][nexolve-gradient-logo-full-color-rgb][Northrop_Grumman-logo][Orbitall-ATK-logo][Genera\nl-Atomics-logo][johns-hopkins-university-logo][Raytheon Company\nLogo][Ball-Corporation-logo][Lockheed-Martin-logo][l3-harris-logo][NASA-logo][Jet-Propulsion-Laborat\nory-logo]\n\n## Applications\n\nOur thin-film vacuum coating processes are used to produce:\n\nEMI/EMP shielded windows\nGraphite antenna coatings\nLow emittance thermal shields\nSatellite telescope low emittance thermal protective coating\nLenses and bandpass filters\nProtected metal mirrors\nHigh durability exo-atmospheric IR coating\nVisually reflective, microwave transparent coating\nSignature/thermal control of vehicles\nHigh temperature coatings for composite structures\nDielectric mirrors\nMicro-optic, directionally coated, IR low emissive coating\nHigh efficiency silver-based lens coating\n\n## Facilities\n\nOur **ISO9001 **and **AS9100** registered coating facility is designed to handle projects of all\nsizes efficiently and cost-effectively. Whether you\u2019re working on small-scale R&D prototypes or\nlarge-scale production runs, we offer flexible solutions with our versatile coating chambers.\n\n5 meter chamber 3.3 meter chamber (motion controlled e-beam IAD) 1.8 meter chamber (motion\ncontrolled e-beam IAD) R&D chamber\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Coating Technology** \u2502**Applications** \u2502**Technology Status**\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nMulti-source E-beam \u2502Reflective & Transmissive coatings: optical, IR, \u2502Industry standard\nEvaporation \u2502RF \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nCrystal Rate Monitoring for\u2502Allow crystals to be changed automatically. Dual \u2502Proprietary\nHigh Volume Production \u2502head with up to 48 crystals per e-beam source \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nIon Assisted Deposition \u2502Layer stacking of higher density material \u2502Industry standard\n\u2502(crystalline), index control, durability \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u250