            "url": "https://surfaceoptics.com/services/vacuum-deposition-coatings/large-area-coatings/",
            "text": "* [ 1-858-675-7404][1]\n* [ Email Us][2]\n* [ Support][3]\n[[Surface Optics Corporation]][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [\nLab Reflectometers\n][6]\n* [SOC-100 HDR][7]\n* [SOC-210 Bidirectional Reflectometer][8]\n* [\n410 Series Reflectometers\n][9]\n* [SOC-410 DHR Reflectometer][10]\n* [410-VIS-IR Reflectometer][11]\n* [410-Solar Reflectometer][12]\n* [410-Solar-i Reflectometer][13]\n* [ET-10 Emissometer][14]\n* [ET-100 Emissometer][15]\n* [410-LIDAR Reflectometer][16]\n* [Custom SOC410 Reflectometers][17]\n* [Accessories & Maintenance][18]\n* [\nSpectral Imaging Systems\n][19]\n* [710 Series Hyperspectral Cameras][20]\n* [LightShift Multispectral Video][21]\n* [DuoChrome-SM][22]\n* [SOC-750 Midwave Infrared][23]\n* [SOC-760 VNIR-SWIR][24]\n* [Spectral Imaging Resources][25]\n* [Services][26]\n* [\nOptical Properties Measurement Services\n][27]\n* [Spectral Reflectance (HDR)][28]\n* [Emissivity][29]\n* [BSDF / Scatter][30]\n* [Transmittance Measurements][31]\n* [ASTM Testing][32]\n* [Solar Reflectance (SRI/TSR)][33]\n* [Absorptance & Thermal Emittance][34]\n* [Optical Properties Measurements Database][35]\n* [\nVacuum Deposition Coatings\n][36]\n* [Low Observable / Stealth][37]\n* [Large Area][38]\n* [Roll-to-Roll][39]\n* [Diamond-Like Carbon][40]\n* [Vacuum Deposited Gold (VDG)][41]\n* [Anti-Reflection (AR)][42]\n* [Vacuum Deposited Aluminum (VDA)][43]\n* [Spaceflight and Thermal Control][44]\n* [High Reflectance][45]\n* [\nElectro-Optics Engineering\n][46]\n* [SBIR / STTR][47]\n* [Applications][48]\n* [\nSpace\n][49]\n* [\nDefense\n][50]\n* [\n[Photovoltaic solar panel in desert]\nSolar Energy\n][51]\n* [\nGreen Building\n][52]\n* [\nAgriculture\n][53]\n* [News][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* [Publications][56]\n* [About Us][57]\n* [Our Company][58]\n* [Company History][59]\n* [Facilities][60]\n* [Careers][61]\n* [Our Team][62]\n* [International Distributors][63]\n\n# Large Area Coatings\n\nSOC uses an electron beam (Ebeam) evaporation, physical vapor deposition (PVD) process to coat large\narea coatings up to 2.5-3m in diameter (depending on geometry) in a batch system, or 60\u201d wide in our\nRoll to Roll system.\n\nAll batch and roll to roll processes can be scaled up from a development system capable of coating\nup to 3 development trials per day. The ability to scale, test, and measure within the same facility\nallows us to bring your development project from prototype to production rapidly.\n\nWe can perform batch-to-batch adjustment and verification with an in-house measurement lab.\n\nAll work is performed in an ISO9001 clean room environment. AS9100 certified facility.\n\nScalability: Excellent\n\n### 5m & 3m Chamber Key Coating Technologies\n* **Multisource ebeam evaporation: **Reflective & Transmissive Coatings, optical, IR, RF\n* **High volume crystal rate monitoring: **Automatic changing with dual head with up to 48 crystals\nper source for continuous processing\n* **Multihead Ion Assisted Deposition: **Index control, durability\n* **Jori Source Deposition for dielectric layers: **Mechanical protection, stress and emissivity\nmanagement\n* **Reflective Coatings: **Tailored thermal control properties\n* **Low Temperature coating of flexible polymer substrates**\n\n## CONTACT OUR TEAM TO DISCUSS YOUR PROJECT\n\n[Contact][64]\n[[Surface Optics Corporation]][65]\n\nHave questions?\n* [ 1-858-675-7404][66]\n* [ Email Us][67]\n* [ Support][68]\n* [Products][69]\n* [Services][70]\n* [Applications][71]\n* [News][72]\n* [About Us][73]\n\n\u00a9 Surface Optics Corporation | [Privacy Policy][74] | [Terms & Conditions][75]\n\n[1]: tel:+18586757404\n[2]: https://surfaceoptics.com/contact/\n[3]: https://surfaceoptics.com/support/\n[4]: https://surfaceoptics.com\n[5]: https://surfaceoptics.com/products/\n[6]: https://surfaceoptics.com/lab-reflectometers/\n[7]: https://surfaceoptics.com/lab-reflectometers/soc-100-hdr/\n[8]: https://surfaceoptics.com/lab-reflectometers/soc-210-bidirectional-reflectometer/\n[9]: https://sur