      "key_products": "SOC-710 Hyperspectral Camera, SOC-210 Bidirectional Reflectometer, ET-100 Emissometer, 410-Solar Reflectometer, SOC-750 Midwave Infrared Hyperspectral Imager",
      "polished_summary": "Surface Optics Corporation specializes in advanced imaging systems, scientific instruments, and thin film vacuum coatings for surface engineering, focusing on the application, characterization, and control of optical properties of surfaces. With a robust portfolio that includes lab and portable reflectometers, emissometers, and hyperspectral cameras, the company serves diverse markets such as aerospace, defense, solar energy, and materials science, providing innovative solutions for research and quality control. Trusted for over 50 years, Surface Optics Corporation is dedicated to delivering precise and reliable measurement tools to meet the evolving needs of its customers.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Surface Optics Corporation manufactures advanced imaging systems and scientific instruments, including hyperspectral cameras and reflectometers, which are directly applicable to the spectral sensor market. Their focus on optical properties characterization and measurement services aligns well with the needs of this market.",
