            "text": "[[Teledyne Technologies: EverywhereYouLook]][1]\nOpen menu Open search\n\n\n**You may not realize it, but Teledyne enables\nmany of the products and services you use every day.**\n\n[Disclosure under California Transparency in Supply Chains Act and Other Acts][2]\n\n[2021 Corporate Social Responsibility Report][3]\n\n[2022 Corporate Social Responsibility Report][4]\n\n[Teledyne Corporate Social Responsibility Report 2022 Supplement][5]\n[Teledyne Corporate Social Responsibility Report 2023 Supplement][6]\n[Teledyne Corporate Social Responsibility Report 2024 Supplement][7]\n[2025 Supplier and Service Provider Bulletin][8]\n\n[Corporate Governance][9]\n\n[Notice of Injunction][10]\n\n\n\n\n[1]: /en-us\n[2]: /en-us/About-Us/Documents/Teledyne%20Transparency%20in%20Supply%20Chain%20UK%202015%20Slavery%2\n0Act%20Disclosure.pdf\n[3]: /en-us/About-Us/Documents/Teledyne%20Technologies%202021%20Corporate%20Social%20Responsibility%\n20Report.pdf\n[4]: /who-we-are/corporate-social-responsibility\n[5]: https://www.teledyne.com/en-us/About-Us/Documents/Teledyne%20Corporate%20Social%20Responsibilit\ny%20Report%202022%20Supplement.pdf\n[6]: https://www.teledyne.com/en-us/About-Us/Documents/Teledyne%20Corporate%20Social%20Responsibilit\ny%20Report%202023%20Supplement.pdf\n[7]: https://www.teledyne.com/en-us/About-Us/Documents/Teledyne%20Corporate%20Social%20Responsibilit\ny%20Report%202024%20Supplement.pdf\n[8]: /en-us/About-Us/Documents/Teledyne-2025-Supplier-and-Service-Provider-Bulletin.pdf\n[9]: /who-we-are/corporate-governance\n[10]: /en-us/Pages/20241220-notice-of-injunction.aspx"
