      "polished_summary": "Teledyne Technologies is a leading provider of sophisticated instrumentation, digital imaging, and software solutions that enable a wide range of applications across various industries. The company serves diverse markets, including aerospace, defense, environmental monitoring, and industrial automation, delivering innovative products and services that enhance everyday technologies and processes. Through a commitment to corporate social responsibility, Teledyne emphasizes transparency and sustainability in its operations and supply chain.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Teledyne Technologies manufactures sophisticated instrumentation and digital imaging solutions, which are relevant to the spectral sensor market. Their focus on environmental monitoring and industrial automation indicates a direct involvement in applications that utilize spectral sensors.",
