            "text": "[ Skip to main content ][1]\n[ [Home] ][2]\n* [Products][3]\n* [Markets][4]\n* [Company][5]\n* [News Room][6]\n* [Investors][7]\n* [Search][8]\nBack\n\n#### Products\n\nWelcome to our catalog, a showcase of Exosens\u2019 cutting-edge technologies\n\n[ All products & Services ][9]\n\nApplications\n\n[ Analytical ][10] [ Environment ][11] [ Imaging defense ][12] [ Industrial & NDT ][13] [ Laser &\nOptical Metrology ][14] [ Night vision ][15] [ Nuclear & Radiation ][16] [ Scientific ][17] [\nSurveillance ][18]\n\nTechnologies\n\n[ Wavefront / QWLSI ][19] [ Gamma and Neutron ][20] [ X-Ray ][21] [ Ultraviolet ][22] [ Visible\n][23] [ Shortwave Infrared ][24] [ Midwave Infrared ][25] [ Longwave Infrared ][26] [ Ion & Electron\n][27]\n\nProduct types\n\n[ [Cameras] Cameras ][28] [ [Detectors & Sensors] Detectors & Sensors ][29] [ [Image Intensifier\nTubes] Image Intensifier Tubes ][30] [ [Measurement Systems] Measurement Systems ][31] [ [Services]\nServices ][32]\nBack\n\n#### Markets\n\nExosens, global leader in amplification, detection and imaging technologies\n\n[ Markets ][33]\n[ [Defense & Surveillance] Defense & Surveillance ][34] [ [Life Sciences & Environment] Life\nSciences & Environment ][35] [ [Industrial Control] Industrial Control ][36] [ [Nuclear] Nuclear\n][37]\nBack\n\n#### Company\n\nExosens, your trusted partner for innovative Amplification, Detection and Imaging technology\nsolutions for a safer world\n\n[ Our company ][38]\n[About Exosens] [ About Exosens ][39]\n[Innovation] [ Innovation ][40]\n[CSR] [ CSR ][41]\n[Careers] [ Careers ][42]\n[Resources] [ Resources ][43]\n[Partners] [ Partners ][44]\n[Exosens companies] [ Exosens companies ][45]\nBack\n\n#### Investors\n\nExosens is listed on compartment A of Euronext Paris regulated market (Ticker: EXENS; ISIN:\nFR001400Q9V2)\n\n[ Investors home ][46]\n[ Word from the CEO ][47] [ Company overview ][48] [ Shareholding ][49] [ Exosens Share ][50] [\nFinancial publications and events ][51] [ Regulated information ][52] [ Investor contact ][53] [\nGeneral shareholders\u2019s meeting ][54]\n* [My Exosens][55]\n* [Contact][56]\nen\n* [English][57]\n* [Fran\u00e7ais][58]\n[ [Home] ][59]\n* [My Exosens][60]\n* [Contact][61]\nen\n* [English][62]\n* [Fran\u00e7ais][63]\n* [Products][64]\n* [Markets][65]\n* [Company][66]\n* [News Room][67]\n* [Investors][68]\n* [Search][69]\nBack\n\n#### Products\n\nWelcome to our catalog, a showcase of Exosens\u2019 cutting-edge technologies\n\n[ All products & Services ][70]\n\nApplications\n\n[ Analytical ][71] [ Environment ][72] [ Imaging defense ][73] [ Industrial & NDT ][74] [ Laser &\nOptical Metrology ][75] [ Night vision ][76] [ Nuclear & Radiation ][77] [ Scientific ][78] [\nSurveillance ][79]\n\nTechnologies\n\n[ Wavefront / QWLSI ][80] [ Gamma and Neutron ][81] [ X-Ray ][82] [ Ultraviolet ][83] [ Visible\n][84] [ Shortwave Infrared ][85] [ Midwave Infrared ][86] [ Longwave Infrared ][87] [ Ion & Electron\n][88]\n\nProduct types\n\n[ [Cameras] Cameras ][89] [ [Detectors & Sensors] Detectors & Sensors ][90] [ [Image Intensifier\nTubes] Image Intensifier Tubes ][91] [ [Measurement Systems] Measurement Systems ][92] [ [Services]\nServices ][93]\nBack\n\n#### Markets\n\nExosens, global leader in amplification, detection and imaging technologies\n\n[ Markets ][94]\n[ [Defense & Surveillance] Defense & Surveillance ][95] [ [Life Sciences & Environment] Life\nSciences & Environment ][96] [ [Industrial Control] Industrial Control ][97] [ [Nuclear] Nuclear\n][98]\nBack\n\n#### Company\n\nExosens, your trusted partner for innovative Amplification, Detection and Imaging technology\nsolutions for a safer world\n\n[ Our company ][99]\n[About Exosens] [ About Exosens ][100]\n[Innovation] [ Innovation ][101]\n[CSR] [ CSR ][102]\n[Careers] [ Careers ][103]\n[Resources] [ Resources ][104]\n[Partners] [ Partners ][105]\n[Exosens companies] [ Exosens companies ][106]\nBack\n\n#### Investors\n\nExosens is listed on compartment A of Euronext Paris regulated market (Ticker: EXENS; ISIN:\nFR001400Q9V2)\n\n[ Investors home ][107]\n[ Word from the CEO ][108] [ Company overview ][109] [ Shareholding ][110] [ Exosens Share ][111] [\nFinancial publications and events ][112] [ Regulated information ][113] [ Investor contact ][114] [\nGeneral shareholders\u2019s meeting ][115]\n\n# Telops\n\n## Hyperspectral and Infrared Innovation\n\nPhotonis, Xenics and El-Mul are now unified under the Exosens brand. [Read more \u2192][116]\n1. [ Home ][117]\n2. [ All brands ][118]\n3. Telops\n\n[Copy] [Mail] [Whatsapp] [LinkedIn]\n\nTelops, now known as Exosens, is a renowned brand in hyperspectral imaging systems and infrared\ncameras, located in Quebec City, Canada. Telops/Exosens specializes in the design and manufacture of\nhigh-performance systems for defense, industrial, and academic research applications. Additionally,\nit offers R&D services in optical systems development, tailored to meet the specific needs of its\ncustomers. If you require state-of-the-art thermal imaging solutions, our company offers the right\ntechnologies to meet your exacting standards.\n\nSince its establishment in 2000, Telops, now operating under Exosens, has built a reputation for\nexcellence in personnel quality and an innovative approach to the challenges of the optics and\nphotonics field. Today, the expertise of Telops\u2019 (Exosens) scientists, engineers, and technicians,\nand the exceptional performance of its infrared cameras and hyperspectral imagers, are recognized\ninternationally. Whether you are seeking equipment, expertise, or subcontracting for your optical\nsystems projects, Telops/Exosens is dedicated to surpassing your high expectations and transforming\nthem into successful outcomes.\n\nTelops\u2019 global presence is strengthened by an efficient worldwide network of distribution and\nrepresentative agents. The company understands the significance of accessibility and customer\nsupport, aiming to provide seamless experiences for clients regardless of their location.\n\nPassion drives Telops, now known as Exosens, and it takes pride in exceeding expectations. Customers\ntrust Telops/Exosens for its technical expertise, exceptional product quality, and unwavering\ncommitment to customer satisfaction. By choosing us, customers select a partner dedicated to their\nsuccess.\n\nRead more\n[Telops]\n\nTelops designs and manufactures high-performance hyperspectral imaging systems and infrared cameras\nfor defense, industrial, and academic research applications.\n\n### Our products\n\nFrom SWIR to LWIR, Telops (Exosens) product portfolio includes advanced infrared imaging\ntechnologies designed for a wide range of demanding applications. \u00a0 The company also provides\nstate-of-the-art hyperspectral imaging solutions that combine spatial and spectral analysis to\nidentify materials, detect gases, and characterize scenes based on their unique spectral signatures.\n\nExplore our product lines below to discover how our technologies can support your needs.\n\n### Multispectral and High-Speed Imaging\n\n[Camera Modules][119]\n\n[High-Dynamic Range Cameras][120]\n\n[High-Speed FAST Cameras][121]\n\n[Multispectral Cameras][122]\n\n[Radia Infrared Cameras][123]\n\n### Hyperspectral Imaging\n\n[Hyperspectral Imaging Cameras][124]\n\n[Atmospheric sounder][125]\n\n[Spatially-resolved infrared spectrometer][126]\n\n[Versatile Spectroradiometer][127]\n\nStay connected\n\nStay informed and connected to the latest news from Exosens by signing up.\n\nSubscribe\n[Exosens]\n[ Back to top][128]\n[filet]\n* Product Types Laser & Optical Metrology Night vision Analytical Environment Imaging defense\n  Industrial & NDT Nuclear & Radiation Scientific Surveillance\n* Applications Cameras Detectors & Sensors Image Intensifier Tubes Measurement Systems Services\n* Company\n* Contact\n* Markets\n* News Room\n* Technologies\n* Resources\n* Careers\n* Certifications\n* Ethics and compliance\n* FAQ\n* Privacy and cookies\n* Terms & Conditions\n* Sitemap\n* \u00a9 Exosens 2026, All Rights Reserved.\n\nFollow us on\n* [ [Facebook] ][129]\n* [ [LinkedIn] ][130]\n* [ [Youtube] ][131]\n* [ [Instagram] ][132]\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: /\n[3]: /all-products\n[4]: /all-markets\n[5]: /about-exosens\n[6]: /news-room\n[7]: /investors\n[8]: /search\n[9]: /all-products\n[10]: /applications/analytical\n[11]: /applications/environment\n[12]: /applications/imaging-defense\n[13]: /applications/industrial-ndt\n[14]: /applications/laser-optical-metrology\n[15]: /applications/night-vision\n[16]: /applications/nuclear-radiation\n[17]: /applications/scientific\n[18]: /applications/surveillance\n[19]: /technologies/wavefront-qwlsi\n[20]: /technologies/gamma-and-neutron-technology\n[21]: /technologies/x-ray-technology\n[22]: /technologies/ultra-violet-technology\n[23]: /technologies/visible-technology\n[24]: /all-technologies/infrared-technology/shortwave-infrared-technology\n[25]: /technologies/midwave-infrared-technology\n[26]: /technologies/longwave-infrared-technology\n[27]: /technologies/ions-electrons-detection-technology\n[28]: /product-types/cameras\n[29]: /product-types/detectors-sensors\n[30]: /product-types/image-intensifier-tubes\n[31]: /product-types/measurement-systems\n[32]: /product-types/services\n[33]: /all-markets\n[34]: /markets/defense-surveillance\n[35]: /markets/life-sciences-environment\n[36]: /markets/industrial-control\n[37]: /markets/nuclear\n[38]: /about-exosens\n[39]: /about-exosens\n[40]: /company/exosens-innovation\n[41]: /company/corporate-social-responsibility\n[42]: /company/career\n[43]: /company/resource-center\n[44]: /company/partners\n[45]: /company/exosens-companies\n[46]: /investors\n[47]: /investors/word-ceo\n[48]: /investors/company-overview\n[49]: /investors/shareholding\n[50]: /investors/exosens-share\n[51]: /financial-publications-and-events\n[52]: /investors/regulatory-information\n[53]: /investors/investor-contact\n[54]: /investors/regulatory-i