      "company_summary": "Ams Osram is a global leader in innovative light and sensor solutions, offering a diverse portfolio that includes LEDs, drivers, lasers, photodetectors, and sensor solutions tailored for various applications. The company serves multiple industries, including automotive, healthcare, consumer electronics, and industrial sectors, providing cutting-edge technology for illumination, sensing, and visualization. With a commitment to excellence, Ams Osram delivers high-performance products that meet the evolving needs of its customers.",
