        "crawl_text": "ams-OSRAM AG Vienna Stock Exchange Publicly traded company Europe North America Asia Premstaetten/Graz (Austria) Austria ams OSRAM is positioned as a leader in sensor and lighting technologies, serving a diverse range of industries. ams OSRAM is a global leader in innovative light and sensor solutions | ams OSRAM\n\nProducts\n\nProducts\n\nProduct Selector\n\nLEDs\n\nLEDs\n\nWhite LEDs\n\nColor LEDs\n\nUV-C LEDs\n\nIR LEDs\n\nMulti color LEDs\n\nLED modules\n\nLED accessories\n\nDrivers\n\nDrivers\n\nLED drivers\n\nLasers\n\nLasers\n\nColor lasers (EEL)\n\nColor lasers (VCSEL)\n\nIR lasers (EEL)\n\nIR lasers (VCSEL)\n\nPhotodetectors\n\nPhotodetectors\n\nPhotodiodes\n\nPhototransistors\n\nMulti chips\n\nMulti chips\n\nOptical modules\n\nSensor solutions\n\nSensor solutions\n\nActive noise cancellation\n\nAmbient light, color, spectral & proximity sensors\n\nAnalog frontend\n\nBattery management\n\nCMOS image sensors\n\nCapacitive sensors\n\nDirect time-of-flight sensors (dToF)\n\nOptical force sensors\n\nPosition sensors\n\nTemperature sensors\n\nX-ray sensors\n\nInterfaces\n\nInterfaces\n\nSensor interfaces\n\nASICs\n\nFull-Service Foundry\n\nLamps\n\nLamps\n\nAutomotive\n\nBoards, kits & accessories\n\nProduct families\n\nApplications\n\nApplications\n\nAutomotive & mobility\n\nAutomotive & mobility\n\nApplication block diagrams\n\nExterior lighting\n\nHeadlights\n\nAdaptive driving beam\n\nDaytime running lights\n\nSide marker & turn indicator\n\nRear combination light\n\nGround illumination\n\nIntelligent signal display\n\nCar body illumination\n\nExterior sensing\n\nExterior sensing for ADAS\n\nRain light tunnel sensing\n\nInterior lighting & sensing\n\nAmbient lighting\n\nFunctional illumination\n\nDisplay backlighting\n\nProjection\n\nSmart surface\n\nAmbient light sensing\n\nIn-cabin sensing\n\nDrivetrain, chassis & body sensing\n\nPosition & angle sensing\n\nBattery management system\n\nAutomotive aftermarket\n\nIndustrial\n\nIndustri