]\n* [ Reports and presentations ][142]\n* [ Share trading information ][143]\n* [ Analyst estimates ][144]\n* [ Investor calendar ][145]\n* [ Share capital ][146]\n* [ Fixed income / public debt ][147]\n* [ General meeting ][148]\n* [ Corporate governance ][149]\n* [ Investor relations contacts ][150]\n* [ OSRAM investor relations ][151]\n* [ Executive committee ][152]\n* [ Executive committee ][153]\n* [ Aldo Kamper ][154]\n* [ Rainer Irle ][155]\n* [ Mark Hamersma ][156]\n* [ Jens Milnikel ][157]\n* [ Adam Wu ][158]\n* [ Supervisory board ][159]\n* [ Sustainability ][160]\n* [ Sustainability ][161]\n* [ Environment ][162]\n* [ Society ][163]\n* [ Governance ][164]\n* [ Sustainability documents ][165]\n* [ Product stewardship ][166]\n* [ Public funded r&d ][167]\n* [ Public funded r&d ][168]\n* [ European projects ][169]\n* [ National projects ][170]\n* [ IPCEI ][171]\n* [ Locations & distribution ][172]\n* [ Locations & distribution ][173]\n* [ Headquarters ][174]\n* [ Design, application & test centers ][175]\n* [ Channel partners ][176]\n* [ Sales offices & branches ][177]\n\u2014 [ Login ][178] \u2014\n[english][179] [\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][180] [deutsch][181] [\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][182]\n\u2014 [ams-osram.com][183] [ams-osram.cn (\u4e2d\u6587)][184] \u2014\n* Products\n[ ][185] [ ][186]\n**Choose your language:**\n[english][187] [\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][188] [deutsch][189] [\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][190]\n** Choose your site: ** [ams-osram.com][191] [ams-osram.cn (\u4e2d\u6587)][192]\n[ ][193]\n* Products\n\n# Products\n\nWe offer a unique product and technology portfolio for sensing, illumination and visualization.\n\n[Select product][194]\n\n## Our product portfolio\n\n## LEDs\n\nFrom color light-emitting diodes (LEDs) to infrared LEDs, our leading-edge LEDs enable you to create\ninnovative solutions that open new markets from automotive lighting to UV-C treatment.\n\n[Select product][195] [Read more][196]\n[A colorful, wavy light pattern on a dark background.]\n\n## Drivers\n\nLED drivers from a global lighting leader.\n\n[Select product][197] [Read more][198]\n[A close-up of a blue LED display showing a grid of dots.]\n\n## Lasers\n\nFrom colored single-mode to multi-mode edge-emitting laser diodes, our best-in-class lasers enable\ninnovative solutions for consumer, automotive, industrial and medical applications.\n\n[Select product][199] [Read more][200]\n[A person looking at a screen.]\n\n## Photodetectors\n\nFrom photodiodes to phototransistors, our market-leading photodetectors underpin disruptive\napplications across markets with their best-in-class performance and quality.\n\n[Select product][201] [Read more][202]\n[Close-up view of a blue-lit circuit board.]\n\n## Multi chips\n\nSaving space with combining several dies in one package.\n\n[Select product][203] [Read more][204]\n[Abstract lines and circuits in orange and yellow on a black background.]\n\n## Sensor solutions\n\nFrom ambient light to CMOS imaging sensors, ams OSRAM sensor solutions are at the heart of the\nproducts and technologies that define our world today.\n\n[Select product][205] [Read more][206]\n[Close-up of an eye with a digital interface overlay.]\n\n## Interfaces\n\nFrom power management ICs to sensor interfaces, our leading-edge interfaces enable innovative\nsolutions for mobile devices and wearables, smart home and buildings, digital health, and\nhigh-precision battery sensor interfaces for electric vehicles.\n\n[Select product][207] [Read more][208]\n[Close-up view of a microchip with intricate circuitry patterns.]\n\n## Full-Service Foundry\n\nOur foundry offers high-performance analog and mixed-signal semiconductor manufacturing capabilities\nfor automotive, medical, industrial and consumer applications.\n\n[Read more][209]\n[Silicon wafer with multiple microchips etched onto its surface.]\n\n## ASICs and customized solutions\n\nYour trusted partner for ASICs (Application Specific Integrated Circuits).\n\n[Read more][210]\n[Rows of computer servers or storage units in a data center.]\n\n## Lamps\n\nams OSRAM offers best-in-class automotive lighting products for OEM and Aftermarket customers.\n\n[Read more][211]\n[Busy urban intersection with pedestrians, cyclists, and cars surrounded by orange sensor-like\ncircles.]\n\n## Boards, kits & accessories\n\nTake a look at our application boards, kits and related accessories for demonstration or evaluation\nof key product features.\n\n[Select product][212] [Read more][213]\n[Close-up of an electronic circuit board with microchips and resistors.]\n\n## Product families\n\nams OSRAM offers a comprehensive sensing, illumination and visualization portfolio for consumer,\nautomotive, healthcare and industrial applications. Browse through our product families.\n\n[Select product][214] [Read more][215]\n[View of Earth from space at night with illuminated cities and network-like connections.]\nJoin our Newsletter [ Subscribe ][216]\nHidden\n[ ][217]\n\nams-OSRAM AG\nTobelbader Stra\u00dfe 30\n8141 Premstaetten\nAustria\n\nPhone: [+43 3136 500-0][218]\n\n[About ams OSRAM][219]\n* [Newsroom][220]\n* [Investor relations][221]\n* [Sustainability][222]\n* [Locations & distribution][223]\n* [Careers][224]\n* [Accessibility][225]\n\n[Support][226]\n* [Product Selector][227]\n* [Download center][228]\n* [Tools][229]\n* [Customer queries][230]\n* [Technical support][231]\n* [Partner network][232]\n* [Whistleblowing][233]\n\n\u00a9 2026 ams-OSRAM AG. All rights reserved.\n* [Privacy policy][234]\n* [Terms of use][235]\n* [Terms of trade][236]\n* [Imprint][237]\n* [Cookie policy][238]\n* [AI Policy][239]\n* [\u7ca4ICP\u590710066670\u53f7][240]\n* [ ][241]\n* [ ][242]\n* [ ][243]\n* [ ][244]\n* [ ][245]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: https://ams-osram.com/products\n[3]: https://ams-osram.com/products\n[4]: https://ams-osram.com/products/product-selector\n[5]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds\n[6]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds\n[7]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/white-leds\n[8]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/color-leds\n[9]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/uv-c-leds\n[10]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/ir-leds\n[11]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/multi-color-leds\n[12]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/led-modules\n[13]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/led-accessories\n[14]: https://ams-osram.com/products/drivers\n[15]: https://ams-osram.com/products/drivers\n[16]: https://ams-osram.com/products/drivers/led-drivers\n[17]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers\n[18]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers\n[19]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers/color-lasers-eel\n[20]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers/color-lasers-vcsel\n[21]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers/ir-lasers-eel\n[22]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers/ir-lasers-vcsel\n[23]: https://ams-osram.com/products/photodetectors\n[24]: https://ams-osram.com/products/photodetectors\n[25]: https://ams-osram.com/products/photodetectors/photodiodes\n[26]: https://ams-osram.com/products/photodetectors/phototransistors\n[27]: https://ams-osram.com/products/multi-chips\n[28]: https://ams-osram.com/products/multi-chips\n[29]: https://ams-osram.com/products/multi-chips/optical-modules\n[30]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions\n[31]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions\n[32]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/active-noise-cancellation\n[33]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/ambient-light-color-spectral-proximity-sensors\n[34]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/analog-frontend\n[35]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/battery-management\n[36]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/cmos-image-sensors\n[37]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/capacitive-sensors\n[38]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/direct-time-of-flight-sensors-dtof\n[39]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/optical-force-sensors\n[40]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/position-sensors\n[41]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/temperature-sensors\n[42]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/x-ray-sensors\n[43]: https://ams-osram.com/products/interfaces\n[44]: https://ams-osram.com/products/interfaces\n[45]: https://ams-osram.com/products/interfaces/sensor-interfaces\n[46]: https://ams-osram.com/products/asics\n[47]: https://ams-osram.com/products/full-service-foundry\n[48]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lamps\n[49]: https://ams-osram.com/pr"
