]\n* [ Reports and presentations ][142]\n* [ Share trading information ][143]\n* [ Analyst estimates ][144]\n* [ Investor calendar ][145]\n* [ Share capital ][146]\n* [ Fixed income / public debt ][147]\n* [ General meeting ][148]\n* [ Corporate governance ][149]\n* [ Investor relations contacts ][150]\n* [ OSRAM investor relations ][151]\n* [ Executive committee ][152]\n* [ Executive committee ][153]\n* [ Aldo Kamper ][154]\n* [ Rainer Irle ][155]\n* [ Mark Hamersma ][156]\n* [ Jens Milnikel ][157]\n* [ Adam Wu ][158]\n* [ Supervisory board ][159]\n* [ Sustainability ][160]\n* [ Sustainability ][161]\n* [ Environment ][162]\n* [ Society ][163]\n* [ Governance ][164]\n* [ Sustainability documents ][165]\n* [ Product stewardship ][166]\n* [ Public funded r&d ][167]\n* [ Public funded r&d ][168]\n* [ European projects ][169]\n* [ National projects ][170]\n* [ IPCEI ][171]\n* [ Locations & distribution ][172]\n* [ Locations & distribution ][173]\n* [ Headquarters ][174]\n* [ Design, application & test centers ][175]\n* [ Channel partners ][176]\n* [ Sales offices & branches ][177]\n\u2014 [ Login ][178] \u2014\n[english][179] [\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][180] [deutsch][181] [\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][182]\n\u2014 [ams-osram.com][183] [ams-osram.cn (\u4e2d\u6587)][184] \u2014\n* [ Products ][185]\n* LEDs\n[ ][186] [ ][187]\n**Choose your language:**\n[english][188] [\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][189] [deutsch][190] [\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][191]\n** Choose your site: ** [ams-osram.com][192] [ams-osram.cn (\u4e2d\u6587)][193]\n[ ][194]\n* [ Products ][195]\n* LEDs\n\n# LEDs\n\nOur LED portfolio includes LEDs from automotive lighting to UV-C treatment.\n\n## LEDs - spectrum of infinite possibilities\n\nLight is all around us. It is everywhere we go. Our comprehensive portfolio addresses LEDs for\nvarious applications from automotive lighting to UV-C treatment. Simply for the purpose of lighting\nup or accentuating a structure. Signaling that a road may be crossed safely, an ambulance is\napproaching or marking the runway for planes.\n\nFrom enhancing our well-being and health, to cultivating plants. ams OSRAM offers a spectrum of\ninfinite possibilities of high-quality products in the field of illumination, visualization and\nsensor technology. Our extensive technological know-how and our passion for innovation make us a\nglobal leader also in the field of LEDs.\n\n[Select product][196]\n[LED product series]\n\n## Our LEDs portfolio\n\n## White LEDs\n\nExplore our wide range of products and solutions for your application. A vast array of innovative\nLEDs and components with unique features. Created with the highest commitment to quality, discover\nams OSRAM's industry leading white LED portfolio.\n\n[Select product][197] [Read more][198]\n\n## Color LEDs\n\nColor LEDs from ams OSRAM. Discover our portfolio's potential for your application. Comprehensive\nform factors in a multitude of available colors.\n\n[Select product][199] [Read more][200]\n\n## UV-C LEDs\n\nLIGHTS ON, GERMS GONE. UV-C Technology from ams OSRAM. Our advanced UV-C LED solutions make UV-C\ntreatment of water, air and surfaces easy and accessible. For private, business and public spaces.\n\n[Select product][201] [Read more][202]\n\n## IR LEDs\n\nA unique IR LED portfolio. Reach the highest level of reliability, safetey and quality with IR LEDs\nfrom ams OSRAM.\n\n[Select product][203] [Read more][204]\n\n## Multi color LEDs\n\nA strong portfolio of multi color LEDs. Maximize your design possibilities. ams OSRAM offers key\ncomponents for various applications.\n\n[Select product][205] [Read more][206]\n\n## LED modules\n\nDiscover how LED modules from ams can help you optimize your lighting solutions.\n\n[Select product][207] [Read more][208]\n\n## LED accessories\n\nSecondary optics for different LED lighting applications.\n\n[Select product][209] [Read more][210]\nJoin our Newsletter [ Subscribe ][211]\nHidden\n[ ][212]\n\nams-OSRAM AG\nTobelbader Stra\u00dfe 30\n8141 Premstaetten\nAustria\n\nPhone: [+43 3136 500-0][213]\n\n[About ams OSRAM][214]\n* [Newsroom][215]\n* [Investor relations][216]\n* [Sustainability][217]\n* [Locations & distribution][218]\n* [Careers][219]\n* [Accessibility][220]\n\n[Support][221]\n* [Product Selector][222]\n* [Download center][223]\n* [Tools][224]\n* [Customer queries][225]\n* [Technical support][226]\n* [Partner network][227]\n* [Whistleblowing][228]\n\n\u00a9 2026 ams-OSRAM AG. All rights reserved.\n* [Privacy policy][229]\n* [Terms of use][230]\n* [Terms of trade][231]\n* [Imprint][232]\n* [Cookie policy][233]\n* [AI Policy][234]\n* [\u7ca4ICP\u590710066670\u53f7][235]\n* [ ][236]\n* [ ][237]\n* [ ][238]\n* [ ][239]\n* [ ][240]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: https://ams-osram.com/products\n[3]: https://ams-osram.com/products\n[4]: https://ams-osram.com/products/product-selector\n[5]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds\n[6]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds\n[7]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/white-leds\n[8]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/color-leds\n[9]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/uv-c-leds\n[10]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/ir-leds\n[11]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/multi-color-leds\n[12]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/led-modules\n[13]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/led-accessories\n[14]: https://ams-osram.com/products/drivers\n[15]: https://ams-osram.com/products/drivers\n[16]: https://ams-osram.com/products/drivers/led-drivers\n[17]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers\n[18]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers\n[19]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers/color-lasers-eel\n[20]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers/color-lasers-vcsel\n[21]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers/ir-lasers-eel\n[22]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers/ir-lasers-vcsel\n[23]: https://ams-osram.com/products/photodetectors\n[24]: https://ams-osram.com/products/photodetectors\n[25]: https://ams-osram.com/products/photodetectors/photodiodes\n[26]: https://ams-osram.com/products/photodetectors/phototransistors\n[27]: https://ams-osram.com/products/multi-chips\n[28]: https://ams-osram.com/products/multi-chips\n[29]: https://ams-osram.com/products/multi-chips/optical-modules\n[30]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions\n[31]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions\n[32]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/active-noise-cancellation\n[33]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/ambient-light-color-spectral-proximity-sensors\n[34]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/analog-frontend\n[35]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/battery-management\n[36]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/cmos-image-sensors\n[37]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/capacitive-sensors\n[38]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/direct-time-of-flight-sensors-dtof\n[39]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/optical-force-sensors\n[40]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/position-sensors\n[41]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/temperature-sensors\n[42]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/x-ray-sensors\n[43]: https://ams-osram.com/products/interfaces\n[44]: https://ams-osram.com/products/interfaces\n[45]: https://ams-osram.com/products/interfaces/sensor-interfaces\n[46]: https://ams-osram.com/products/asics\n[47]: https://ams-osram.com/products/full-service-foundry\n[48]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lamps\n[49]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lamps\n[50]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lamps/automotive-lamps\n[51]: https://ams-osram.com/products/boards-kits-accessories\n[52]: https://ams-osram.com/products/product-families\n[53]: https://ams-osram.com/applications\n[54]: https://ams-osram.com/applications\n[55]: https://ams-osram.com/applications/automotive-mobility\n[56]: https://ams-osram.com/applications/automotive-mobility\n[57]: https://ams-osram.com/applications/automotive-mobility/application-block-diagrams\n[58]: https://ams-osram.com/applications/automotive-mobility/exterior-lighting\n[59]: https://ams-osram.com/applications/automotive-mobility/headlights\n[60]: https://ams-osram.com/applications/automotive-mobility/adaptive-driving-beam\n[61]: https://ams-osram.com/applications/automotive-mobility/daytime-running-lights\n[62]: https://ams-osram.com/applications/automotive-mobility/side-marker-turn-indicator\n[63]: https://ams-osram.com/applications/automotive-mobility/rear-combination-light\n[64]: https://ams-osram.com/ap"
