]\n* [ Reports and presentations ][142]\n* [ Share trading information ][143]\n* [ Analyst estimates ][144]\n* [ Investor calendar ][145]\n* [ Share capital ][146]\n* [ Fixed income / public debt ][147]\n* [ General meeting ][148]\n* [ Corporate governance ][149]\n* [ Investor relations contacts ][150]\n* [ OSRAM investor relations ][151]\n* [ Executive committee ][152]\n* [ Executive committee ][153]\n* [ Aldo Kamper ][154]\n* [ Rainer Irle ][155]\n* [ Mark Hamersma ][156]\n* [ Jens Milnikel ][157]\n* [ Adam Wu ][158]\n* [ Supervisory board ][159]\n* [ Sustainability ][160]\n* [ Sustainability ][161]\n* [ Environment ][162]\n* [ Society ][163]\n* [ Governance ][164]\n* [ Sustainability documents ][165]\n* [ Product stewardship ][166]\n* [ Public funded r&d ][167]\n* [ Public funded r&d ][168]\n* [ European projects ][169]\n* [ National projects ][170]\n* [ IPCEI ][171]\n* [ Locations & distribution ][172]\n* [ Locations & distribution ][173]\n* [ Headquarters ][174]\n* [ Design, application & test centers ][175]\n* [ Channel partners ][176]\n* [ Sales offices & branches ][177]\n\u2014 [ Login ][178] \u2014\n[english][179] [\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][180] [deutsch][181] [\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][182]\n\u2014 [ams-osram.com][183] [ams-osram.cn (\u4e2d\u6587)][184] \u2014\n* [ Products ][185]\n* [ LEDs ][186]\n* White LEDs\n[ ][187] [ ][188]\n**Choose your language:**\n[english][189] [\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][190] [deutsch][191] [\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][192]\n** Choose your site: ** [ams-osram.com][193] [ams-osram.cn (\u4e2d\u6587)][194]\n[ ][195]\n* [ Products ][196]\n* [ LEDs ][197]\n* White LEDs\n\n# White LEDs\n\nLight up your world.\n\n## Our white LEDs portfolio\n\n## Illumination\n\nTurning the world a brighter place is what we have to offer. It is the ability to transform rooms\ninto cosy homes, buildings into spectacular landmarks and blind spots into save bets. From\ncustomized to standardized demands. For but not limited to, general lighting applications ranging\nfrom Outdoor and Indoor Lighting, Horticulture Lighting to Industrial Lighting solutions.\n\n[Select product][198]\n[A lit-up bridge at night.]\n\n## Automotive & mobility\n\nIntegrated mobility solutions are key for solving countless future challenges. We,\nat ams OSRAM, provide the best-in-class product portfolio with the full bandwidth of latest mobility\ntechnologies and innovations. For but not limited to mobility applications for automotive and\ntransportation.\n\n[Select product][199]\n[A smart car with blue and yellow lights.]\n\n## Visualization\n\nOpening up eyes to new possibilities is what we have to offer. With leading LED technology we're\nenabling the most powerful and efficient solutions. For but not limited to visualization\napplications requiring high brightness out of a small form factor.\n\n[Select product][200]\n[A hand wearing a smart glove projecting a hologram of a globe.]\n\n## White LEDs product list\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\nDevic\u2502Description \u2502Pro\u2502Pro\u2502Col\u2502CRI\u2502Ele\u2502Ele\u2502Bri\u2502Bri\u2502Bri\u2502Bri\u2502Bea\u2502Ope\u2502Ope\u2502Dim\u2502Dim\u2502Dim\u2502Bri\ne \u2502 \u2502duc\u2502duc\u2502or \u2502 \u2502ctr\u2502ctr\u2502ght\u2502ght\u2502ght\u2502ght\u2502m \u2502rat\u2502rat\u2502ens\u2502ens\u2502ens\u2502ght\nname \u2502 \u2502t \u2502t \u2502of \u2502 \u2502ica\u2502ica\u2502nes\u2502nes\u2502nes\u2502nes\u2502ang\u2502ing\u2502ing\u250