]\n* [ Reports and presentations ][142]\n* [ Share trading information ][143]\n* [ Analyst estimates ][144]\n* [ Investor calendar ][145]\n* [ Share capital ][146]\n* [ Fixed income / public debt ][147]\n* [ General meeting ][148]\n* [ Corporate governance ][149]\n* [ Investor relations contacts ][150]\n* [ OSRAM investor relations ][151]\n* [ Executive committee ][152]\n* [ Executive committee ][153]\n* [ Aldo Kamper ][154]\n* [ Rainer Irle ][155]\n* [ Mark Hamersma ][156]\n* [ Jens Milnikel ][157]\n* [ Adam Wu ][158]\n* [ Supervisory board ][159]\n* [ Sustainability ][160]\n* [ Sustainability ][161]\n* [ Environment ][162]\n* [ Society ][163]\n* [ Governance ][164]\n* [ Sustainability documents ][165]\n* [ Product stewardship ][166]\n* [ Public funded r&d ][167]\n* [ Public funded r&d ][168]\n* [ European projects ][169]\n* [ National projects ][170]\n* [ IPCEI ][171]\n* [ Locations & distribution ][172]\n* [ Locations & distribution ][173]\n* [ Headquarters ][174]\n* [ Design, application & test centers ][175]\n* [ Channel partners ][176]\n* [ Sales offices & branches ][177]\n\u2014 [ Login ][178] \u2014\n[english][179] [\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][180] [deutsch][181] [\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][182]\n\u2014 [ams-osram.com][183] [ams-osram.cn (\u4e2d\u6587)][184] \u2014\n* [ Products ][185]\n* [ LEDs ][186]\n* UV-C LEDs\n[ ][187] [ ][188]\n**Choose your language:**\n[english][189] [\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][190] [deutsch][191] [\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][192]\n** Choose your site: ** [ams-osram.com][193] [ams-osram.cn (\u4e2d\u6587)][194]\n[ ][195]\n* [ Products ][196]\n* [ LEDs ][197]\n* UV-C LEDs\n\n# UV-C LEDs\n\nDisinfection with the power of light!\n\n## Clean air, surfaces and water - UV-C LED technology from ams OSRAM\n\nAnalogous to general lighting, UV-C LED technology is gaining momentum and heralding the start of a\nnew era. In recent years, major progress has been made in the field of semiconductor light sources,\nunlocking entirely new system approaches and applications in the field of disinfection. By replacing\ntraditional Mercury lamps with advanced UV-C LED technology, UV disinfection systems can become more\neffective, durable and practical.\n\nUV-C LEDs provide a variety of benefits compared to traditional lighting technologies, such as:\n* Mercury-free: designed for eco-friendly and sustainable UV-C treatment solutions\n* Chemical-free: on-demand purification without the use of chemicals\n* Flexibility: compact designs due to their small footprint\n* Instant-on functionality: immediate full optical output power, dimming and switching options\n* Durability: superior lifetime as well as enhanced robustness towards mechanical influences\n* Efficacy: emission wavelengths can be tailored to provide the optimal germicidal treatment\n\nUV-C LED technology is changing the way we disinfect air, surfaces and water in a variety of\napplications. ams OSRAMs unique portfolio is tailored to the needs of the individual applications at\nthe right balance of germicidal efficacy, quality, efficiency and price performance.\n\n[Select product][198] [More about UV-C treatment][199]\n\n## Featured Products\n\n### OSRAM OSLON\u2122 UV 3535, SU CULFP1.VC\n\nThe ams OSRAM OSLONTM UV 3535 series combines exceptional wall-plug efficiency, high optical output,\nand extended lifetime with superior germicidal performance in a compact form factor, enabling\nversatile, eco-friendly UV-C disinfection and treatment solutions. Its robust, space-efficient\ndesign supports flexible system integration for efficient and eco-friendly UV-C solutions.\nDetails and Datasheet\n][200] [\n\n### OSRAM OSLON\u2122 UV 3535, SU CULBN2.VC\n\nThe ams OSRAM OSLONTM UV 3535 series combines exceptional wall-plug efficiency, high optical output,\nand extended lifetime with superior germicidal performance in a compact form factor, enabling\nversatile, eco-friendly UV-C disinfection and treatment solutions. Its robust, space-efficient\ndesign supports flexible system integration for efficient and eco-friendly UV-C solutions.\nDetails and Datasheet\n][201] [\n\n### OSRAM OSLON\u2122 UV 3535, SU CULCN1.VC\n\nThe ams OSRAM OSLONTM UV 3535 series combines exceptional wall-plug efficiency, high optical output,\nand extended lifetime with superior germicidal performance in a compact form factor, enabling\nversatile, eco-friendly UV-C disinfection and treatment solutions. Its robust, space-efficient\ndesign supports flexible system integration for efficient and eco-friendly UV-C solutions.\nDetails and Datasheet\n][202]\n\n## UV-C LEDs product list\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nDevic\u2502Description \u2502Pro\u2502Pro\u2502Col\u2502Ele\u2502Elect\u2502Bri\u2502Ope\u2502Ope\u2502Dime\u2502Dime\u2502Dime\ne \u2502 \u2502duc\u2502duc\u2502or \u2502ctr\u2502rical\u2502ght\u2502rat\u2502rat\u2502nsio\u2502nsio\u2502nsio\nname \u2502 \u2502t \u2502t \u2502of \u2502ica\u2502power\u2502nes\u2502ing\u2502ing\u2502n/Di\u2502n/Di\u2502n/Di\n\u2502 \u2502Are\u2502Typ\u2502emi\u2502l \u2502/Elec\u2502s/R\u2502tem\u2502tem\u2502mens\u2502mens\u2502mens\n\u2502 \u2502a \u2502e \u2502ssi\u2502pow\u2502trica\u2502adi\u2502per\u2502per\u2502ion \u2502ion \u2502ion\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502on \u2502er \u2502l \u2502ant\u2502atu\u2502atu\u2502leng\u2502widt\u2502heig\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502power\u2502flu\u2502re \u2502re \u2502th \u2502h \u2502ht\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502c