options and opening up new\napplications in down lighting, architectural and stage and studio. The TIR lens collimates the LED\nlight into efficient, well-controlled light beams that maximize the usable lumens in the target\narea. Not only does this lighting solution provide the throw or distance required for these lighting\napplications, it does so with a smooth, high quality beam of superior intensity uniformity, color\nover angle mixing, and with an absence of discomfort glare or shadows.\nDetails and Datasheet\n][199]\nJoin our Newsletter [ Subscribe ][200]\nHidden\n[ ][201]\n\nams-OSRAM AG\nTobelbader Stra\u00dfe 30\n8141 Premstaetten\nAustria\n\nPhone: [+43 3136 500-0][202]\n\n[About ams OSRAM][203]\n* [Newsroom][204]\n* [Investor relations][205]\n* [Sustainability][206]\n* [Locations & distribution][207]\n* [Careers][208]\n* [Accessibility][209]\n\n[Support][210]\n* [Product Selector][211]\n* [Download center][212]\n* [Tools][213]\n* [Customer queries][214]\n* [Technical support][215]\n* [Partner network][216]\n* [Whistleblowing][217]\n\n\u00a9 2026 ams-OSRAM AG. All rights reserved.\n* [Privacy policy][218]\n* [Terms of use][219]\n* [Terms of trade][220]\n* [Imprint][221]\n* [Cookie policy][222]\n* [AI Policy][223]\n* [\u7ca4ICP\u590710066670\u53f7][224]\n* [ ][225]\n* [ ][226]\n* [ ][227]\n* [ ][228]\n* [ ][229]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: https://ams-osram.com/products\n[3]: https://ams-osram.com/products\n[4]: https://ams-osram.com/products/product-selector\n[5]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds\n[6]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds\n[7]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/white-leds\n[8]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/color-leds\n[9]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/uv-c-leds\n[10]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/ir-leds\n[11]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/multi-color-leds\n[12]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/led-modules\n[13]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/led-accessories\n[14]: https://ams-osram.com/products/drivers\n[15]: