]\n* [ Reports and presentations ][142]\n* [ Share trading information ][143]\n* [ Analyst estimates ][144]\n* [ Investor calendar ][145]\n* [ Share capital ][146]\n* [ Fixed income / public debt ][147]\n* [ General meeting ][148]\n* [ Corporate governance ][149]\n* [ Investor relations contacts ][150]\n* [ OSRAM investor relations ][151]\n* [ Executive committee ][152]\n* [ Executive committee ][153]\n* [ Aldo Kamper ][154]\n* [ Rainer Irle ][155]\n* [ Mark Hamersma ][156]\n* [ Jens Milnikel ][157]\n* [ Adam Wu ][158]\n* [ Supervisory board ][159]\n* [ Sustainability ][160]\n* [ Sustainability ][161]\n* [ Environment ][162]\n* [ Society ][163]\n* [ Governance ][164]\n* [ Sustainability documents ][165]\n* [ Product stewardship ][166]\n* [ Public funded r&d ][167]\n* [ Public funded r&d ][168]\n* [ European projects ][169]\n* [ National projects ][170]\n* [ IPCEI ][171]\n* [ Locations & distribution ][172]\n* [ Locations & distribution ][173]\n* [ Headquarters ][174]\n* [ Design, application & test centers ][175]\n* [ Channel partners ][176]\n* [ Sales offices & branches ][177]\n\u2014 [ Login ][178] \u2014\n[english][179] [\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][180] [deutsch][181] [\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][182]\n\u2014 [ams-osram.com][183] [ams-osram.cn (\u4e2d\u6587)][184] \u2014\n* [ Products ][185]\n* [ Drivers ][186]\n* LED drivers\n[ ][187] [ ][188]\n**Choose your language:**\n[english][189] [\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][190] [deutsch][191] [\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][192]\n** Choose your site: ** [ams-osram.com][193] [ams-osram.cn (\u4e2d\u6587)][194]\n[ ][195]\n* [ Products ][196]\n* [ Drivers ][197]\n* LED drivers\n\n# LED drivers\n\nLED drivers from a global lighting leader.\n\n## Automotive LED Drivers\n\nAs one of the leading semiconductor companies in analog mixed signal products with a strong position\nin automotive LEDs, ams Osram is introducing advanced LED drivers for the highly demanding\nautomotive dynamic lighting applications on the vehicle interior and exterior using synergies and\nexpertise in drivers and LEDs.\n\nOne example are drivers supporting the Open System Protocol (OSP) provided by ams OSRAM for\nhigh-speed dynamic lighting applications in software defined vehicles.\n\n[Select product][198]\n[Car dashboard with advanced lighting representing automotive LED driver technology.]\n\n## Consumer LED Drivers\n\nams OSRAM is a leading provider of cutting-edge optical sensing and light source solutions for\nconsumer applications. Our customized drivers are designed to be compact, energy-efficient, and\ninherently eye-safe. They can operate independently or in combination with ams OSRAM LEDs or lasers.\n\nIn the rapidly growing AR/VR/MR sector, ams OSRAM consumer LED drivers are ideal for powering\nnear-eye displays and enabling eye-tracking functionalities.\n\n[Select product][199]\n[Person with smart glasses]\n\n## Specialty LED Drivers\n\nams OSRAM specialty LED drivers are widely utilized in a variety of white goods and home appliances,\nthanks to their exceptional quality, performance, and long-term reliability.\n\nWith built-in safety features and autonomous intelligence, ams OSRAM specialty LED drivers are the\nideal choice for applications ranging from status LEDs to mini displays.\n\n[Select product][200]\n[A silver washing machine]\nJoin our Newsletter [ Subscribe ][201]\nHidden\n[ ][202]\n\nams-OSRAM AG\nTobelbader Stra\u00dfe 30\n8141 Premstaetten\nAustria\n\nPhone: [+43 3136 500-0][203]\n\n[About ams OSRAM][204]\n* [Newsroom][205]\n* [Investor relations][206]\n* [Sustainability][207]\n* [Locations & distribution][208]\n* [Careers][209]\n* [Accessibility][210]\n\n[Support][211]\n* [Product Selector][212]\n* [Download center][213]\n* [Tools][214]\n* [Customer queries][215]\n* [Technical support][216]\n* [Partner network][217]\n* [Whistleblowing][218]\n\n\u00a9 2026 ams-OSRAM AG. All rights reserved.\n* [Privacy policy][219]\n* [Terms of use][220]\n* [Terms of trade][221]\n* [Imprint][222]\n* [Cookie policy][223]\n* [AI Policy][224]\