]\n* [ Reports and presentations ][142]\n* [ Share trading information ][143]\n* [ Analyst estimates ][144]\n* [ Investor calendar ][145]\n* [ Share capital ][146]\n* [ Fixed income / public debt ][147]\n* [ General meeting ][148]\n* [ Corporate governance ][149]\n* [ Investor relations contacts ][150]\n* [ OSRAM investor relations ][151]\n* [ Executive committee ][152]\n* [ Executive committee ][153]\n* [ Aldo Kamper ][154]\n* [ Rainer Irle ][155]\n* [ Mark Hamersma ][156]\n* [ Jens Milnikel ][157]\n* [ Adam Wu ][158]\n* [ Supervisory board ][159]\n* [ Sustainability ][160]\n* [ Sustainability ][161]\n* [ Environment ][162]\n* [ Society ][163]\n* [ Governance ][164]\n* [ Sustainability documents ][165]\n* [ Product stewardship ][166]\n* [ Public funded r&d ][167]\n* [ Public funded r&d ][168]\n* [ European projects ][169]\n* [ National projects ][170]\n* [ IPCEI ][171]\n* [ Locations & distribution ][172]\n* [ Locations & distribution ][173]\n* [ Headquarters ][174]\n* [ Design, application & test centers ][175]\n* [ Channel partners ][176]\n* [ Sales offices & branches ][177]\n\u2014 [ Login ][178] \u2014\n[english][179] [\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][180] [deutsch][181] [\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][182]\n\u2014 [ams-osram.com][183] [ams-osram.cn (\u4e2d\u6587)][184] \u2014\n* [ Products ][185]\n* Photodetectors\n[ ][186] [ ][187]\n**Choose your language:**\n[english][188] [\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][189] [deutsch][190] [\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][191]\n** Choose your site: ** [ams-osram.com][192] [ams-osram.cn (\u4e2d\u6587)][193]\n[ ][194]\n* [ Products ][195]\n* Photodetectors\n\n# Photodetectors\n\nShaping the world with detector solutions. Leading manufacturers around the globe rely on ams OSRAM\u2019\nsensing know-how for advanced systems design.\n\n## Photodiodes and phototransistors\n\nams OSRAM offers a wide range of high performing photodiodes and phototransistors covering the\nspectral range from UV to near- infrared.\nNot only do we offer broadband detectors but also products designed to filter for specific\nwavelength or for example have the same response characteristic as the human eye. Our products\nsupport the various markets from automotive, industry, consumer and medical & health with regards to\nperformance and quality.\n\n[Select product][196]\n[A person washes their hand at a sink with a photodiode]\n\n## Our photodiodes and phototransistors portfolio\n\n## Photodiodes\n\nVarious markets from automotive, industry; consumer and medical & health require specifically\ndesigned photodiodes to yield products with outstanding performance.\n\n[Select product][197] [Read more][198]\n\n## Phototransistors\n\nams OSRAM offers a wide range of phototransistors in very small footprinted packages with an\noutstanding ability to amplify the detected signal.\n\n[Select product][199] [Read more][200]\nJoin our Newsletter [ Subscribe ][201]\nHidden\n[ ][202]\n\nams-OSRAM AG\nTobelbader Stra\u00dfe 30\n8141 Premstaetten\nAustria\n\nPhone: [+43 3136 500-0][203]\n\n[About ams OSRAM][204]\n* [Newsroom][205]\n* [Investor relations][206]\n* [Sustainability][207]\n* [Locations & distribution][208]\n* [Careers][209]\n* [Accessibility][210]\n\n[Support][211]\n* [Product Selector][212]\n* [Download center][213]\n* [Tools][214]\n* [Customer queries][215]\n* [Technical support][216]\n* [Partner network][217]\n* [Whistleblowing][218]\n\n\u00a9 2026 ams-OSRAM AG. All rights reserved.\n* [Privacy policy][219]\n* [Terms of use][220]\n* [Terms of trade][221]\n* [Imprint][222]\n* [Cookie policy][223]\n* [AI Policy][224]\n* [\u7ca4ICP\u590710066670\u53f7][225]\n* [ ][226]\n* [ ][227]\n* [ ][228]\n* [ ][229]\n* [ ][230]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: https://ams-osram.com/products\n[3]: https://ams-osram.com/products\n[4]: https://ams-osram.com/products/product-selector\n[5]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds\n[6]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds\n[7]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/white-leds\n[8]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/color-leds\n[9]: https://ams-osram.com/pro