]\n* [ Reports and presentations ][142]\n* [ Share trading information ][143]\n* [ Analyst estimates ][144]\n* [ Investor calendar ][145]\n* [ Share capital ][146]\n* [ Fixed income / public debt ][147]\n* [ General meeting ][148]\n* [ Corporate governance ][149]\n* [ Investor relations contacts ][150]\n* [ OSRAM investor relations ][151]\n* [ Executive committee ][152]\n* [ Executive committee ][153]\n* [ Aldo Kamper ][154]\n* [ Rainer Irle ][155]\n* [ Mark Hamersma ][156]\n* [ Jens Milnikel ][157]\n* [ Adam Wu ][158]\n* [ Supervisory board ][159]\n* [ Sustainability ][160]\n* [ Sustainability ][161]\n* [ Environment ][162]\n* [ Society ][163]\n* [ Governance ][164]\n* [ Sustainability documents ][165]\n* [ Product stewardship ][166]\n* [ Public funded r&d ][167]\n* [ Public funded r&d ][168]\n* [ European projects ][169]\n* [ National projects ][170]\n* [ IPCEI ][171]\n* [ Locations & distribution ][172]\n* [ Locations & distribution ][173]\n* [ Headquarters ][174]\n* [ Design, application & test centers ][175]\n* [ Channel partners ][176]\n* [ Sales offices & branches ][177]\n\u2014 [ Login ][178] \u2014\n[english][179] [\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][180] [deutsch][181] [\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][182]\n\u2014 [ams-osram.com][183] [ams-osram.cn (\u4e2d\u6587)][184] \u2014\n* [ Products ][185]\n* Sensor solutions\n[ ][186] [ ][187]\n**Choose your language:**\n[english][188] [\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][189] [deutsch][190] [\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][191]\n** Choose your site: ** [ams-osram.com][192] [ams-osram.cn (\u4e2d\u6587)][193]\n[ ][194]\n* [ Products ][195]\n* Sensor solutions\n\n# Sensor solutions\n\nLeading manufacturers around the globe rely on ams OSRAM sensing know-how for advanced systems\ndesign.\n\n## ams OSRAM sensor solutions\n\nams OSRAM sensor solutions are at the heart of the products and technologies that define our world\ntoday \u2013 from smartphones and wearable devices to smart homes and buildings, industrial automation,\nmedical technology, and connected vehicles. Our products drive applications requiring small form\nfactor, low power, highest sensitivity and multi-sensor integration. Our ambient light, color,\nspectral and proximity sensors are ideal for mobile and wearable devices, are becoming ubiquitous\nacross a growing number of fields.\n\nOur 3D sensors range all three technologies \u2013 structured light, time of flight, and active stereo\nvision \u2013 for greater flexibility and choice. Our CMOS imaging sensors feature high frame rates for a\nwide range of demanding professional and industrial applications. Our high performance sensors are a\nkey enabler for the multitude of evolving applications needing face recognition, biometric\nauthentication, gesture recognition, robotics navigation, advanced driver assistance systems, and in\nAR/VR. Our precise and miniaturized sensors for digital health are optimal for temperature, vital\nsign sensing an even highly-reliable diagnostic technologies, like reusable lateral flow test\ndevices. While our sensing solutions for x-ray and computed tomography (CT) enable crystal clear\nimages with a low dose of radiation.\n\n[Select product][196]\n[A cityscape at dusk with illuminated buildings and highways, overlaid with icons connected by lines\nrepresenting smart city connectivity.]\n\n## Our sensor solutions\n\n## Ambient light, color spectral and proximity sensors\n\nIndustry\u2019s broadest portfolio of high-performance and high-sensitivity digital discrete and\nintegrated module optical sensors including ambient light sensors, RGB and XYZ color sensors,\nspectral sensors and proximity sensors.\n\n[Select product][197] [Read more][198]\n\n## Direct time-of-flight sensors (dToF)\n\nams OSRAM direct time-of-flight (dToF) sensors offer fast, precise distance measurement up to 5\nmeters, in a compact fully integrated module.\n\n[Select product][199] [Read more][200]\n\n## CMOS image sensors\n\nInnovative small form factor, high sensitivity and power efficient CMOS image sensors.\n\n[Select product][201] [Read more][202]\n\n## X-ray sensors\n\nBest-in-class sensing solutions enable x-ray equipment to render more accurate images with better\ncontrast while limiting noise and distortion.\n\n[Select product][203] [Read more][204]\n\n## Position sensors\n\nams OSRAM magnetic and inductive sensor ICs deliver best-in-class, effective and true stray field\nimmune position sensing.\n\n[Select product][205] [Read more][206]\n\n## Capacitive sensors\n\nHighly accurate capacitive sensors enable reliable and accurate presence sensing of humans.\n\n[Select product][207] [Read more][208]\n\n## Temperature sensors\n\nHigh accuracy and miniaturized temperature senor offers extremely low power consumption.\n\n[Select product][209] [Read more][210]\n\n## Active noise cancellation\n\nams OSRAM digital advanced noise cancellation (ANC) technology supports all kinds of earbuds and\nheadphone form factors.\n\n[Select product][211] [Read more][212]\n\n## Battery management\n\nHigh performance power management solutions for automotive battery monitoring.\n\n[Select product][213] [Read more][214]\n\n## Analog frontend\n\nWith the help of our cutting-edge analog frontend ICs, you may generate high-quality digital signals\nstraight from LEDs, photodiodes, and skin electrodes.\n\n[Select product][215] [Read more][216]\nJoin our Newsletter [ Subscribe ][217]\nHidden\n[ ][218]\n\nams-OSRAM AG\nTobelbader Stra\u00dfe 30\n8141 Premstaetten\nAustria\n\nPhone: [+43 3136 500-0][219]\n\n[About ams OSRAM][220]\n* [Newsroom][221]\n* [Investor relations][222]\n* [Sustainability][223]\n* [Locations & distribution][224]\n* [Careers][225]\n* [Accessibility][226]\n\n[Support][227]\n* [Product Selector][228]\n* [Download center][229]\n* [Tools][230]\n* [Customer queries][231]\n* [Technical support][232]\n* [Partner network][233]\n* [Whistleblowing][234]\n\n\u00a9 2026 ams-OSRAM AG. All rights reserved.\n* [Privacy policy][235]\n* [Terms of use][236]\n* [Terms of trade][237]\n* [Imprint][238]\n* [Cookie policy][239]\n* [AI Policy][240]\n* [\u7ca4ICP\u590710066670\u53f7][241]\n* [ ][242]\n* [ ][243]\n* [ ][244]\n* [ ][245]\n* [ ][246]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: https://ams-osram.com/products\n[3]: https://ams-osram.com/products\n[4]: https://ams-osram.com/products/product-selector\n[5]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds\n[6]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds\n[7]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/white-leds\n[8]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/color-leds\n[9]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/uv-c-leds\n[10]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/ir-leds\n[11]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/multi-color-leds\n[12]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/led-modules\n[13]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/led-accessories\n[14]: https://ams-osram.com/products/drivers\n[15]: https://ams-osram.com/products/drivers\n[16]: https://ams-osram.com/products/drivers/led-drivers\n[17]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers\n[18]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers\n[19]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers/color-lasers-eel\n[20]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers/color-lasers-vcsel\n[21]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers/ir-lasers-eel\n[22]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers/ir-lasers-vcsel\n[23]: https://ams-osram.com/products/photodetectors\n[24]: https://ams-osram.com/products/photodetectors\n[25]: https://ams-osram.com/products/photodetectors/photodiodes\n[26]: https://ams-osram.com/products/photodetectors/phototransistors\n[27]: https://ams-osram.com/products/multi-chips\n[28]: https://ams-osram.com/products/multi-chips\n[29]: https://ams-osram.com/products/multi-chips/optical-modules\n[30]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions\n[31]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions\n[32]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/active-noise-cancellation\n[33]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/ambient-light-color-spectral-proximity-sensors\n[34]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/analog-frontend\n[35]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/battery-management\n[36]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/cmos-image-sensors\n[37]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/capacitive-sensors\n[38]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/direct-time-of-flight-sensors-dtof\n[39]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/optical-force-sensors\n[40]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/position-sensors\n[41]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/temperatur"
