]\n* [ Reports and presentations ][142]\n* [ Share trading information ][143]\n* [ Analyst estimates ][144]\n* [ Investor calendar ][145]\n* [ Share capital ][146]\n* [ Fixed income / public debt ][147]\n* [ General meeting ][148]\n* [ Corporate governance ][149]\n* [ Investor relations contacts ][150]\n* [ OSRAM investor relations ][151]\n* [ Executive committee ][152]\n* [ Executive committee ][153]\n* [ Aldo Kamper ][154]\n* [ Rainer Irle ][155]\n* [ Mark Hamersma ][156]\n* [ Jens Milnikel ][157]\n* [ Adam Wu ][158]\n* [ Supervisory board ][159]\n* [ Sustainability ][160]\n* [ Sustainability ][161]\n* [ Environment ][162]\n* [ Society ][163]\n* [ Governance ][164]\n* [ Sustainability documents ][165]\n* [ Product stewardship ][166]\n* [ Public funded r&d ][167]\n* [ Public funded r&d ][168]\n* [ European projects ][169]\n* [ National projects ][170]\n* [ IPCEI ][171]\n* [ Locations & distribution ][172]\n* [ Locations & distribution ][173]\n* [ Headquarters ][174]\n* [ Design, application & test centers ][175]\n* [ Channel partners ][176]\n* [ Sales offices & branches ][177]\n\u2014 [ Login ][178] \u2014\n[english][179] [\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][180] [deutsch][181] [\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][182]\n\u2014 [ams-osram.com][183] [ams-osram.cn (\u4e2d\u6587)][184] \u2014\n* [ Products ][185]\n* [ Sensor solutions ][186]\n* Active noise cancellation\n[ ][187] [ ][188]\n**Choose your language:**\n[english][189] [\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][190] [deutsch][191] [\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][192]\n** Choose your site: ** [ams-osram.com][193] [ams-osram.cn (\u4e2d\u6587)][194]\n[ ][195]\n* [ Products ][196]\n* [ Sensor solutions ][197]\n* Active noise cancellation\n\n# Active noise cancellation\n\n\u201cHear what you want to hear\u201d \u2013 with the digital augmented hearing companion\n\n## Analog and digital active noise cancellation\n\nams OSRAM analog and digital active noise cancellation solutions provide high-quality audio\nperformance while offering a combination of small size, low system cost and ultra-low power\nconsumption. ams OSRAM power and communication interfaces for smart earbuds deliver simultaneous\naccessory charging and communication between a charger cradle, earpiece and mobile phone.\n\n[Select product][198]\n[A person lying on a bed wearing an orange shirt.]\n\n## Active noise cancellation\n\nams OSRAM analog and digital active noise cancellation (ANC) solutions deliver class leading ambient\nnoise reduction, significantly improving sound quality for portable consumer devices.\n\n[Select product][199]\n[A person running outdoors in an orange jacket.]\n\n## Active noise cancellation product list\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\nDevic\u2502Description \u2502Pro\u2502Pro\ne \u2502 \u2502duc\u2502duc\nname \u2502 \u2502t \u2502t\n\u2502 \u2502Are\u2502Typ\n\u2502 \u2502a \u2502e\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ams \u2502Analog ANC solution\n\nActive Noise Cancellation technology maximizes the \u2502Sen\u2502Act\nAS341\u2502end-user experience in today's advanced world of mobile communications, enabling \u2502sor\u2502ive\n2 \u2502crystal clear sound during phone conversations or music listening regardless of the \u2502sol\u2502Noi\nActiv\u2502surrounding environment noise.\n\nA highly integrated system in \u2502uti\u2502se\ne \u2502combination with lowest power consumption on the market plus a cost-effective price \u2502ons\u2502Can\nNoise\u2502model makes the AS3412 ideally suited for smartphones or other mobile devices.\n\u2502 \u2502cel\nCance\u2502\n\nThe AS3412 is targeting feed-forward topology and is able to effectively \u2502 \u2502lat\nllati\u2502reduce ambient noise up to 3 kHz. Used in a true wireless ear piece AS3412 even \u2502 \u2502ion\non][2\u2502enables state of the art hybrid noise cancellation. \u2502 \u2502\n00] \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ams \u2502Analog ANC solution\n\nIntegrated active noise cancellation solution with \u2502Sen\u2502Act\nAS341\u2502integrated bypass function addressing feedforward architecture for stereo wired \u2502sor\u2502ive\n5 \u2502headsets, suitable for music, video or mobile use. \u2502sol\u2502Noi\nActiv\u2502 \u2502uti\u2502se\ne \u2502 \u2502ons\u2502Can\nNoise\u2502 \u2502 \u2502cel\nCance\u2502 \u2502 \u2502lat\nllati\u2502 \u2502 \u2502ion\non][2\u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n01] \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ams \u2502Analog ANC solution\n\nIntegrated active noise cancellation solution with\u2502Sen\u2502Act\nAS343\u2502integrated bypass function addressing feedback and hybrid architectures for stereo \u2502sor\u2502ive\n5 \u2502wired headsets, suitable for music, video or mobile use. \u2502sol\u2502Noi\nActiv\u2502 \u2502uti\u2502se\ne \u2502 \u2502ons\u2502Can\nNoise\u2502 \u2502 \u2502cel\nCance\u2502 \u2502 \u2502lat\nllati\u2502 \u2502 \u2502ion\non][2\u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n02] \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ams \u2502The AS3460 is a low power, small size Digital Augmented Hearing companion device. It \u2502Sen\u2502Act\nAS346\u2502allows the customer to enable ANC and Hearing Augmentation on all form factors. Loose \u2502sor\u2502ive\n0][20\u2502fit -, closed fit earbuds and neckbands, on- and over the ear headphones.\nThis \u2502sol\u2502Noi\n3] \u2502unique combination of optimized hard- and software, for the first time in the market, \u2502uti\u2502se\n\u2502enables ANC on loose fit earbuds.\n\u2502ons\u2502Can\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502cel\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502lat\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502ion\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n## Featured Products\n\n### ams AS3460\n\nThe AS3460 is a low power, small size Digital Augmented Hearing companion device. It allows the\ncustomer to enable ANC and Hearing Augmentation on all form factors. Loose fit -, closed fit earbuds\nand neckbands, on- and over the ear headphones. This unique combination of optimized hard- and\nsoftware, for the first time in the market, enables ANC on loose fit earbuds.\nDetails and Datasheet\n][204] [\n\n### ams AS3435 Active Noise Cancellation\n\nAnalog ANC solution Integrated active noise cancellation solution with integrated bypass function\naddressing feedback and hybrid architectures for stereo wired headsets, suitable for music, video or\nmobile use.\nDetails and Datasheet\n][205]\nJoin our Newsletter [ Subscribe ][206]\nHidden\n[ ][207]\n\nams-OSRAM AG\nTobelbader Stra\u00dfe 30\n8141 Premstaetten\nAustria\n\nPhone: [+43 3136 500-0][208]\n\n[About ams OSRAM][209]\n* [Newsroom][210]\n* [Investor relations][211]\n* [Sustainability][212]\n* [Locations & distribution][213]\n* [Careers][214]\n* [Accessibility][215]\n\n[Support][216]\n* [Product Selector][217]\n* [Download center][218]\n* [Tools][219]\n* [Customer queries][220]\n* [Technical support][221]\n* [Partner network][222]\n* [Whistleblowing][223]\n\n\u00a9 2026 ams-OSRAM AG. All rights reserved.\n* [Privacy policy][224]\n* [Terms of use][225]\n* [Terms of trade][226]\n* [Imprint][227]\n* [Cookie policy][228]\n* [AI Policy][229]\n* [\u7ca4ICP\u590710066670\u53f7][230]\n* [ ][231]\n* [ ][232]\n* [ ][233]\n* [ ][234]\n* [ ][235]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: https://ams-osram.com/products\n[3]: https://ams-osram.com/products\n[4]: https://ams-osram.com/products/product-selector\n[5]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds\n[6]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds\n[7]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/white-leds\n[8]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/color-leds\n[9]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/uv-c-leds\n[10]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/ir-leds\n[11]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/multi-color-leds\n[12]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/led-modules\n[13]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/led-accessories\n[14]: https://ams-osram.com/products/drivers\n[15]: https://ams-osram.com/products/drivers\n[16]: https://ams-osram.com/products/drivers/led-drivers\n[17]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers\n[18]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers\n[19]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers/color-lasers-eel\n[20]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers/color-lasers-vcsel\n[21]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers/ir-lasers-eel\n[22]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers/ir-lasers-vcsel\n[23]: https://ams-osram.com/products/photodetectors\n[24]: https://ams-osram.com/products/photodetectors\n[25]: https://ams-osram.com/products/photodetectors/photodiodes\n[26]: https://ams-osram.com/products/photodetectors/phototransistors\n[27]: https://ams-osram.com/products/multi-chips\n[28]: https://ams-osram.com/products/multi-chips\n[29]: https://ams-osram.com/products/multi-chips/optical-modules\n[30]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions\n[31]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions\n[32]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions"
