]\n* [ Reports and presentations ][142]\n* [ Share trading information ][143]\n* [ Analyst estimates ][144]\n* [ Investor calendar ][145]\n* [ Share capital ][146]\n* [ Fixed income / public debt ][147]\n* [ General meeting ][148]\n* [ Corporate governance ][149]\n* [ Investor relations contacts ][150]\n* [ OSRAM investor relations ][151]\n* [ Executive committee ][152]\n* [ Executive committee ][153]\n* [ Aldo Kamper ][154]\n* [ Rainer Irle ][155]\n* [ Mark Hamersma ][156]\n* [ Jens Milnikel ][157]\n* [ Adam Wu ][158]\n* [ Supervisory board ][159]\n* [ Sustainability ][160]\n* [ Sustainability ][161]\n* [ Environment ][162]\n* [ Society ][163]\n* [ Governance ][164]\n* [ Sustainability documents ][165]\n* [ Product stewardship ][166]\n* [ Public funded r&d ][167]\n* [ Public funded r&d ][168]\n* [ European projects ][169]\n* [ National projects ][170]\n* [ IPCEI ][171]\n* [ Locations & distribution ][172]\n* [ Locations & distribution ][173]\n* [ Headquarters ][174]\n* [ Design, application & test centers ][175]\n* [ Channel partners ][176]\n* [ Sales offices & branches ][177]\n\u2014 [ Login ][178] \u2014\n[english][179] [\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][180] [deutsch][181] [\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][182]\n\u2014 [ams-osram.com][183] [ams-osram.cn (\u4e2d\u6587)][184] \u2014\n* [ Products ][185]\n* [ Sensor solutions ][186]\n* Battery management\n[ ][187] [ ][188]\n**Choose your language:**\n[english][189] [\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][190] [deutsch][191] [\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][192]\n** Choose your site: ** [ams-osram.com][193] [ams-osram.cn (\u4e2d\u6587)][194]\n[ ][195]\n* [ Products ][196]\n* [ Sensor solutions ][197]\n* Battery management\n\n# Battery management\n\nHigh performance power management solutions for automotive battery monitoring.\n\n## Automotive battery sensor interfaces\n\nElectric vehicles need to measure very precisely the traction battery\u2019s state of charge and state of\nhealth in order to make an accurate estimate of the vehicle\u2019s range. Shunt resistor-based,\nzero-offset battery sensing solutions from ams OSRAM enable automotive battery management systems to\nmake the very accurate current and voltage measurements which are required in this application.\n\nams OSRAM offers a data acquisition IC for battery management, the AS8510, and a companion IC chip,\nthe AS8525, for current measurement at the positive pole of vehicle battery.\n\n[Select product][198]\n[A white electric vehicle is parked at a charging station with a cable plugged into its front-side\ncharging port.]\nJoin our Newsletter [ Subscribe ][199]\nHidden\n[ ][200]\n\nams-OSRAM AG\nTobelbader Stra\u00dfe 30\n8141 Premstaetten\nAustria\n\nPhone: [+43 3136 500-0][201]\n\n[About ams OSRAM][202]\n* [Newsroom][203]\n* [Investor relations][204]\n* [Sustainability][205]\n* [Locations & distribution][206]\n* [Careers][207]\n* [Accessibility][208]\n\n[Support][209]\n* [Product Selector][210]\n* [Download center][211]\n* [Tools][212]\n* [Customer queries][213]\n* [Technical support][214]\n* [Partner network][215]\n* [Whistleblowing][216]\n\n\u00a9 2026 ams-OSRAM AG. All rights reserved.\n* [Privacy policy][217]\n* [Terms of use][218]\n* [Terms of trade][219]\n* [Imprint][220]\n* [Cookie policy][221]\n* [AI Policy][222]\n* [\u7ca4ICP\u590710066670\u53f7][223]\n* [ ][224]\n* [ ][225]\n* [ ][226]\n* [ ][227]\n* [ ][228]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: https://ams-osram.com/products\n[3]: https://ams-osram.com/products\n[4]: https://ams-osram.com/products/product-selector\n[5]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds\n[6]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds\n[7]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/white-leds\n[8]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/color-leds\n[9]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/uv-c-leds\n[10]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/ir-leds\n[11]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/multi-color-leds\n[12]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/led-modules\n[13]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/led-accessories\n[14]: https://ams-osram.com/products/drivers\n[15]: https:/