]\n* [ Reports and presentations ][142]\n* [ Share trading information ][143]\n* [ Analyst estimates ][144]\n* [ Investor calendar ][145]\n* [ Share capital ][146]\n* [ Fixed income / public debt ][147]\n* [ General meeting ][148]\n* [ Corporate governance ][149]\n* [ Investor relations contacts ][150]\n* [ OSRAM investor relations ][151]\n* [ Executive committee ][152]\n* [ Executive committee ][153]\n* [ Aldo Kamper ][154]\n* [ Rainer Irle ][155]\n* [ Mark Hamersma ][156]\n* [ Jens Milnikel ][157]\n* [ Adam Wu ][158]\n* [ Supervisory board ][159]\n* [ Sustainability ][160]\n* [ Sustainability ][161]\n* [ Environment ][162]\n* [ Society ][163]\n* [ Governance ][164]\n* [ Sustainability documents ][165]\n* [ Product stewardship ][166]\n* [ Public funded r&d ][167]\n* [ Public funded r&d ][168]\n* [ European projects ][169]\n* [ National projects ][170]\n* [ IPCEI ][171]\n* [ Locations & distribution ][172]\n* [ Locations & distribution ][173]\n* [ Headquarters ][174]\n* [ Design, application & test centers ][175]\n* [ Channel partners ][176]\n* [ Sales offices & branches ][177]\n\u2014 [ Login ][178] \u2014\n[english][179] [\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][180] [deutsch][181] [\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][182]\n\u2014 [ams-osram.com][183] [ams-osram.cn (\u4e2d\u6587)][184] \u2014\n* [ Products ][185]\n* [ Sensor solutions ][186]\n* Capacitive sensors\n[ ][187] [ ][188]\n**Choose your language:**\n[english][189] [\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][190] [deutsch][191] [\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][192]\n** Choose your site: ** [ams-osram.com][193] [ams-osram.cn (\u4e2d\u6587)][194]\n[ ][195]\n* [ Products ][196]\n* [ Sensor solutions ][197]\n* Capacitive sensors\n\n# Capacitive sensors\n\nams OSRAM's highly accurate capacitive sensors enable reliable and accurate presence sensing of\nhumans.\n\n## Presence sensing with a capacitive sensor\n\nWith the rise of automated driving, hands-on-wheel detection is gaining importance. Beside comfort,\nthe main motivation of driver assistance systems is a safer driving experience. ams OSRAM's\ncapacitive sensor provides flexible, reliable and long-lasting capacitive sensing for human\ninteraction detection and can also be used in various applications in the automotive sector for\nother types of measurements, such as fluid levels. ams OSRAM's I&Q demodulation-based capacitive\nsensors, separate the measured capacitance into the parasitic resistive and capacitive part.\nTherefore the sensors are ideal for detecting human presence or interaction, as well as sensing\ndifferent liquids and fluid levels.\n\n[Select product][198]\n\n## Featured Products\n\n### ams AS8580 Capacitive Sensor\n\nAS8580 is a capacitive sensor detecting the change of capacitance in different applications. The\ncapacitive sensor measures the relative change of capacitance. This can be used for capacitive touch\napplications, proximity or human presence detection, fluid level and quality measurements as well as\nmany other applications. AS8580 captures the sinusoidal current response caused by a forced\nsinusoidal voltage. Based on that, the change of capacitance in various applications can be\ndetected. Besides capacitive changes, the resistive component in various applications can be\ndetected as well. This can be useful e.g. to determine/compensate (environmental) disturbances such\nas moisture, which changes a parallel resistive component along with a change in capacitance. This\nhigh precision performance sensor also supports a multitude of diagnostic features that meet\nstandard ASIL B functional safety requirements. The capacitive sensing IC is specifically designed\nto work under high electromagnetic disturbances (EMC) due to adjustable frequencies. AS8580 has a\nSPI Interface for reading measurement values and configuration. It is available in TSSOP-14 package\nand operates with 5V.\nDetails and Datasheet\n][199] [\n\n### ams AS8579 Capacitive Sensor\n\nThe AS8579 is a capacitive sensor that detects the change of capacity in different applications. The\ncapacitive sensor measures the impedance that originates between a conducting surface (metallic\nobject) and a human being. The IC captures the current of a metal object and applies algorithms to\ndetermine the capacitive and resistive information. The outcome information can be read through a\nSPI Interface that can be also used for IC configuration. This high precision performance sensor\nalso supports a multitude of diagnostic features that meet standard functional safety requirements.\nThe capacitive sensing IC is specifically designed to function in an electro-magnetic environment\n(EMC) with high magnetic disturbances. This allows the sensor to distinguish in a hands-on\napplication if the driver\u2018s hand is on the steering wheel or not. The AS8579 is available in an\nSSOP24 package and operates at a supply voltage of 5V.\nDetails and Datasheet\n][200]\nJoin our Newsletter [ Subscribe ][201]\nHidden\n[ ][202]\n\nams-OSRAM AG\nTobelbader Stra\u00dfe 30\n8141 Premstaetten\nAustria\n\nPhone: [+43 3136 500-0][203]\n\n[About ams OSRAM][204]\n* [Newsroom][205]\n* [Investor relations][206]\n* [Sustainability][207]\n* [Locations & distribution][208]\n* [Careers][209]\n* [Accessibility][210]\n\n[Support][211]\n* [Product Selector][212]\n* [Download center][213]\n* [Tools][214]\n* [Customer queries][215]\n* [Technical support][216]\n* [Partner network][217]\n* [Whistleblowing][218]\n\n\u00a9 2026 ams-OSRAM AG. All rights reserved.\n* [Privacy policy][219]\n* [Terms of use][220]\n* [Terms of trade][221]\n* [Imprint][222]\n* [Cookie policy][223]\n* [AI Policy][224]\n* [\u7ca4ICP\u590710066670\u53f7][225]\n* [ ][226]\n* [ ][227]\n* [ ][228]\n* [ ][229]\n* [ ][230]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: https://ams-osram.com/products\n[3]: https://ams-osram.com/products\n[4]: https://ams-osram.com/products/product-selector\n[5]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds\n[6]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds\n[7]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/white-leds\n[8]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/color-leds\n[9]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/uv-c-leds\n[10]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/ir-leds\n[11]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/multi-color-leds\n[12]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/led-modules\n[13]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/led-accessories\n[14]: https://ams-osram.com/products/drivers\n[15]: https://ams-osram.com/products/drivers\n[16]: https://ams-osram.com/products/drivers/led-drivers\n[17]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers\n[18]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers\n[19]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers/color-lasers-eel\n[20]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers/color-lasers-vcsel\n[21]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers/ir-lasers-eel\n[22]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lasers/ir-lasers-vcsel\n[23]: https://ams-osram.com/products/photodetectors\n[24]: https://ams-osram.com/products/photodetectors\n[25]: https://ams-osram.com/products/photodetectors/photodiodes\n[26]: https://ams-osram.com/products/photodetectors/phototransistors\n[27]: https://ams-osram.com/products/multi-chips\n[28]: https://ams-osram.com/products/multi-chips\n[29]: https://ams-osram.com/products/multi-chips/optical-modules\n[30]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions\n[31]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions\n[32]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/active-noise-cancellation\n[33]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/ambient-light-color-spectral-proximity-sensors\n[34]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/analog-frontend\n[35]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/battery-management\n[36]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/cmos-image-sensors\n[37]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/capacitive-sensors\n[38]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/direct-time-of-flight-sensors-dtof\n[39]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/optical-force-sensors\n[40]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/position-sensors\n[41]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/temperature-sensors\n[42]: https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/x-ray-sensors\n[43]: https://ams-osram.com/products/interfaces\n[44]: https://ams-osram.com/products/interfaces\n[45]: https://ams-osram.com/products/interfaces/sensor-interfaces\n[46]: https://ams-osram.com/products/asics\n[47]: https://ams-osram.com/products/full-service-foundry\n[48]: https://ams-osram.com/products/lamps\n[49]: https://ams-os"
