]\n* [ Reports and presentations ][142]\n* [ Share trading information ][143]\n* [ Analyst estimates ][144]\n* [ Investor calendar ][145]\n* [ Share capital ][146]\n* [ Fixed income / public debt ][147]\n* [ General meeting ][148]\n* [ Corporate governance ][149]\n* [ Investor relations contacts ][150]\n* [ OSRAM investor relations ][151]\n* [ Executive committee ][152]\n* [ Executive committee ][153]\n* [ Aldo Kamper ][154]\n* [ Rainer Irle ][155]\n* [ Mark Hamersma ][156]\n* [ Jens Milnikel ][157]\n* [ Adam Wu ][158]\n* [ Supervisory board ][159]\n* [ Sustainability ][160]\n* [ Sustainability ][161]\n* [ Environment ][162]\n* [ Society ][163]\n* [ Governance ][164]\n* [ Sustainability documents ][165]\n* [ Product stewardship ][166]\n* [ Public funded r&d ][167]\n* [ Public funded r&d ][168]\n* [ European projects ][169]\n* [ National projects ][170]\n* [ IPCEI ][171]\n* [ Locations & distribution ][172]\n* [ Locations & distribution ][173]\n* [ Headquarters ][174]\n* [ Design, application & test centers ][175]\n* [ Channel partners ][176]\n* [ Sales offices & branches ][177]\n\u2014 [ Login ][178] \u2014\n[english][179] [\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][180] [deutsch][181] [\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][182]\n\u2014 [ams-osram.com][183] [ams-osram.cn (\u4e2d\u6587)][184] \u2014\n* [ Products ][185]\n* [ Interfaces ][186]\n* Sensor interfaces\n[ ][187] [ ][188]\n**Choose your language:**\n[english][189] [\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][190] [deutsch][191] [\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][192]\n** Choose your site: ** [ams-osram.com][193] [ams-osram.cn (\u4e2d\u6587)][194]\n[ ][195]\n* [ Products ][196]\n* [ Interfaces ][197]\n* Sensor interfaces\n\n# Sensor interfaces\n\nHigh accuracy sensor interface ICs even when operating in harsh environments.\n\n## High-performance customized ASICs\n\nTo achieve smaller, more energy-efficient, or more robust ICs for their new products \u2013 or simply to\nprotect their IP or supply chain in competitive markets \u2013 hundreds of customers have partnered with\nus for their high-performance application specific integrated circuits (ASIC) over the last 40\nyears. Beyond advanced manufacturing at the European wafer fab in Premstaetten, Austria, hundreds\nof functional-technical experts give our customers reliable, easy access to everything you could\nneed to create your own customized solutions and help you to orchestrate the many moving parts \u2013 all\nin one place.\n\n[Custom ASIC][198]\n\n## Sensor Interface ICs\n\nSensor interface ICs enable a system to read out information from the input signal generated by\ncomplex sensors, providing a suitable output signal that is easy for a host system to display or\nprocess. ams OSRAM sensor interfaces offer high accuracy, precision and sensitivity even when\noperating in harsh environments.\n\n[Select product][199]\nJoin our Newsletter [ Subscribe ][200]\nHidden\n[ ][201]\n\nams-OSRAM AG\nTobelbader Stra\u00dfe 30\n8141 Premstaetten\nAustria\n\nPhone: [+43 3136 500-0][202]\n\n[About ams OSRAM][203]\n* [Newsroom][204]\n* [Investor relations][205]\n* [Sustainability][206]\n* [Locations & distribution][207]\n* [Careers][208]\n* [Accessibility][209]\n\n[Support][210]\n* [Product Selector][211]\n* [Download center][212]\n* [Tools][213]\n* [Customer queries][214]\n* [Technical support][215]\n* [Partner network][216]\n* [Whistleblowing][217]\n\n\u00a9 2026 ams-OSRAM AG. All rights reserved.\n* [Privacy policy][218]\n* [Terms of use][219]\n* [Terms of trade][220]\n* [Imprint][221]\n* [Cookie policy][222]\n* [AI Policy][223]\n* [\u7ca4ICP\u590710066670\u53f7][224]\n* [ ][225]\n* [ ][226]\n* [ ][227]\n* [ ][228]\n* [ ][229]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: https://ams-osram.com/products\n[3]: https://ams-osram.com/products\n[4]: https://ams-osram.com/products/product-selector\n[5]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds\n[6]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds\n[7]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/white-leds\n[8]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/color-leds\n[9]: https://ams-osram.com/products/leds/uv-c-leds\n[1