]\n* [ Reports and presentations ][142]\n* [ Share trading information ][143]\n* [ Analyst estimates ][144]\n* [ Investor calendar ][145]\n* [ Share capital ][146]\n* [ Fixed income / public debt ][147]\n* [ General meeting ][148]\n* [ Corporate governance ][149]\n* [ Investor relations contacts ][150]\n* [ OSRAM investor relations ][151]\n* [ Executive committee ][152]\n* [ Executive committee ][153]\n* [ Aldo Kamper ][154]\n* [ Rainer Irle ][155]\n* [ Mark Hamersma ][156]\n* [ Jens Milnikel ][157]\n* [ Adam Wu ][158]\n* [ Supervisory board ][159]\n* [ Sustainability ][160]\n* [ Sustainability ][161]\n* [ Environment ][162]\n* [ Society ][163]\n* [ Governance ][164]\n* [ Sustainability documents ][165]\n* [ Product stewardship ][166]\n* [ Public funded r&d ][167]\n* [ Public funded r&d ][168]\n* [ European projects ][169]\n* [ National projects ][170]\n* [ IPCEI ][171]\n* [ Locations & distribution ][172]\n* [ Locations & distribution ][173]\n* [ Headquarters ][174]\n* [ Design, application & test centers ][175]\n* [ Channel partners ][176]\n* [ Sales offices & branches ][177]\n\u2014 [ Login ][178] \u2014\n[english][179] [\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][180] [deutsch][181] [\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][182]\n\u2014 [ams-osram.com][183] [ams-osram.cn (\u4e2d\u6587)][184] \u2014\n* [ Products ][185]\n* Full-Service Foundry\n[ ][186] [ ][187]\n**Choose your language:**\n[english][188] [\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e][189] [deutsch][190] [\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4][191]\n** Choose your site: ** [ams-osram.com][192] [ams-osram.cn (\u4e2d\u6587)][193]\n[ ][194]\n* [ Products ][195]\n* Full-Service Foundry\n\n# Full-Service Foundry\n\nSemiconductor manufacturing and beyond. Turnkey solution partner you can rely on.\n\n[Contact our foundry team ][196]\n[Our technology portfolio][197]\n[Why work with us][198]\n[Markets we serve][199]\n[Support we offer][200]\n\n## Reliable semiconductor manufacturing and beyond\n\nAre you designing highly innovative mixed-signal ICs for challenging applications? Do you need an\nexperienced and reliable manufacturing and supply chain partner?\n\nams OSRAM shares the manufacturing ecosystem of a global leader in sensors and emitters to deliver a\nfull-service foundry offering for CMOS \u2013 drawing on four decades of expertise \u2013 especially in\nautomotive, industrial, medical and consumer applications. We prioritize reliability through\nhigh-quality, secure supply, sourcing options and European-based manufacturing.\n\nAs your trusted partner, we:\n* Specialize in manufacturing of innovative mixed-signal ICs\n* Ensure reliable sourcing via global partnerships\n* Maintain automotive-certified and medical grade operations\n\nBeyond silicon, we offer wafer sort, packaging, final test, and advanced technologies like Through\nSilicon Vias (TSV), die stitching, and optical filters.\n\nContact our foundry team to discover how we can support your IC development, product launch and\nsupply chain management.\n\n[Contact our foundry team][201]\n\n## Technology portfolio\n\nWe aspire to be your foundry of choice for mixed-signal designs using industry-standard processes \u2013\n110nm, 180nm and 350nm analog and mixed signal CMOS, High-Voltage CMOS and BICMOS plus specialty\nprocess options like RF, low-noise, high-voltage and BCD. As all base processes are compatible with\nmajor semiconductor manufacturers, alternative sourcing can be accommodated with minimal effort.\n\n[> CMOS][202]\n\n[> Optical filters][203]\n\nBeyond silicon is taken to the next level with advanced packaging solutions like Through Silicon\nVias (TSV), a technology which can be implemented electrically and optically, enabling more complex\nand dense structures in CMOS design. Another example of our specialized technologies is our\nstitching technology, which allows merging multiple reticles on a wafer during the photolithographic\nprocess. Additionally, we offer expertise in trench dicing and 3D-IC integration, as well as diverse\ntypes of optical filters.\n\nIn terms of delivery formats, we offer unsorted or sorted 8-inch wafers as well as final-tested\npackaged ICs (e.g. in tape and reel).\n\n[Close-up of a glowing microchip on a blue printed circuit board with active orange signal lights.]\n\n## Ways you benefit from our application-tailored foundry services, technologies and support\n\nOver 100 customers with more than 300 products in volume production attest to our commitment to your\nbusiness success. ams OSRAM provides a comprehensive support ecosystem for your high performance\nmixed-signal ICs for industrial, automotive, medical and consumer applications.\n\nWe can help you ease and accelerate market entry while protecting your IP. You benefit from:\n\n### Specialized technology portfolio\n\nReliable, high-quality, medical grade competence paired with automotive-qualified facilities based\nin Europe. We deliver industry-standard 110nm, 180nm and 350nm CMOS, High-Voltage CMOS, and BICMOS\nprocesses, plus specialty options such as RF, low-noise, high-voltage and BCD, backed by precise\ncharacterization and advanced design tools.\n\n[Microchips on a silicon wafer.]\n\n### Full-service foundry offering\n\nOur turnkey services offer a one-stop shop solution for wafer production on 200mm (8-inch) wafers,\nassembly, and mixed-signal test capabilities (wafer sort and final test), supply chain management,\nand second-source options. With 100+ experts, our dedicated foundry team delivers design support, IP\nconsultations, ESD/EMV assistance, test engineering, industrialization, operations, and QA\nexpertise.\n\n[Close-up of a semiconductor wafer with multiple integrated circuits.]\n\n### Beyond silicon fabrication\n\nOur comprehensive service and application-tailored technology package for fabless semiconductor\ncompanies goes beyond industry-standard foundry services to offer specialized technologies like\nThrough Silicon Vias, Die Stitching, Optical Filters, Trench Dicing and 3D-IC Integration for\nautomotive, medical, industrial and consumer markets. Additionally, with 40 years of analog\nexpertise, an extensive IP portfolio and high-accuracy simulation models, you have a wealth of\nknowledge to tap into while implementing your design.\n\n[High-tech machine working on a semiconductor component.]\n\n### Secure, lasting supply\n\nWith ams OSRAM you get a secure and long-term supply chain through in-house wafer manufacturing,\ntesting facilities, strong partnerships, and full compatibility with world\u2019s leading semiconductor\nmanufacturers. Additionally, our post-wafer processing services, such as sawing, sorting, and\npackaging, guarantee a complete and efficient solution tailored to your requirements.\n\n[Technicians in cleanroom suits operating semiconductor manufacturing equipment.]\n\n## Markets we serve \u2013 a specialized partner you can rely on\n\nDiscover how we can help turn your design into reality. Our foundry is your ideal partner for\nhigh-performance mixed-signal processes for automotive, medical, industrial and consumer\napplications, prioritizing reliability through European-based manufacturing, secure supply and dual\nsourcing options. We are equipped to meet your requirements for extended product life cycles and\nlong-term process availability. As a trusted supplier in the automotive and medical markets, ams\nOSRAM ensures a reliable, long-term supply of its process technologies, with availability easily\nlasting 15 years and beyond. In addition, we also have a long and successful track record delivering\nto very challenging, extremely fast-moving, and painstakingly cost-sensitive household-names\ncustomers in consumer applications. Lastly, our extensive experience in highly regulated and\nexport-controlled markets further reinforces our commitment to delivering quality and stability to\nour partners in aerospace applications.\n\n[> Automotive][204]\n\n[> Medical][205]\n\n[> Industrial & consumer][206]\n\n## Reliable semiconductor manufacturing and beyond. The full-service foundry partner you can rely\n## on.\n\nWhy do fabless semiconductor manufacturers work with ams OSRAM? We help you to turn your ideas into\nIC solutions. Our dedicated team, [**extensive IP portfolio**][207] and high-accuracy simulation\nmodels, ensure effective development cycle. With ams OSRAM you also get a secure long-term supply\nchain through in-house wafer manufacturing, advanced testing facilities, strong partnerships, and\nfull compatibility with world\u2019s l"
          },
