      "company_summary": "Cubert Hyperspectral is a leading manufacturer of hyperspectral video cameras utilizing innovative snapshot technology to deliver real-time imaging solutions. Their product lineup includes advanced cameras such as the Ultris X20 and Ultris X20 Plus, designed for a range of applications across industries including medical, defense, industrial machine vision, and remote sensing. Additionally, Cubert offers the CUVIS Software Package for processing and analyzing hyperspectral data, further enhancing their commitment to shaping the future of imaging technology.",
