      "key_products": "Ultris X20, Ultris X20 Plus, Ultris XMR, Ultris 5, CUVIS Software Package",
      "polished_summary": "Cubert Hyperspectral is a leading manufacturer of hyperspectral video cameras utilizing innovative snapshot technology to deliver real-time imaging solutions. Their product lineup includes advanced cameras such as the Ultris X20 and Ultris X20 Plus, designed for a range of applications across industries including medical, defense, industrial machine vision, and remote sensing. Additionally, Cubert offers the CUVIS Software Package for processing and analyzing hyperspectral data, further enhancing their commitment to shaping the future of imaging technology.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Cubert Hyperspectral manufactures hyperspectral video cameras and provides software for processing hyperspectral data, which are directly relevant to the spectral sensor market. Their products, such as the Ultris X20 and Ultris X20 Plus, are designed specifically for applications in various industries including medical, defense, and remote sensing.",
