      "polished_summary": "Andor Technology, part of the Oxford Instruments Group, specializes in advanced imaging and spectroscopy solutions, offering a diverse range of scientific cameras, microscopy systems, and software tailored for applications in life sciences, physical sciences, and industrial sectors. Their innovative products, including sCMOS and EMCCD cameras, as well as modular spectroscopy systems, cater to researchers and professionals seeking high-resolution and high-speed imaging capabilities across various fields such as cancer research, neuroscience, and materials science.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Andor Technology manufactures advanced imaging and spectroscopy solutions, including scientific cameras and modular spectroscopy systems, which are directly applicable to the spectral sensor market. Their products are designed for high-resolution and high-speed imaging, catering to various scientific applications, making them a relevant participant in this market.",
