      "polished_summary": "Edmund Optics is a leading provider of precision optical components and systems, specializing in custom and volume optical manufacturing. The company offers a wide range of products including optical lenses, filters, mirrors, and prisms, catering to diverse industries such as imaging, laser technology, and scientific research. With a commitment to quality and innovation, Edmund Optics serves engineers and researchers globally, providing expert guidance and support for their optical needs.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Edmund Optics manufactures and supplies a wide range of optical components, including optical filters, lenses, and mirrors, which are essential for spectral sensing applications. Their focus on precision optical manufacturing directly aligns with the needs of the spectral sensor market.",
