      "key_products": "FluoTime 300, Luminosa, HydraHarp 500, PicoHarp 330, PMA Hybrid Series",
      "polished_summary": "PicoQuant is a leading manufacturer of advanced optical measurement systems, specializing in time-resolved fluorescence and photoluminescence techniques for scientific research. The company offers a range of innovative products, including microscopes, spectrometers, and time tagging electronics, catering to researchers in life sciences, materials science, quantum optics, and quantum computing. With a commitment to precision and flexibility, PicoQuant supports cutting-edge research across multiple disciplines.",
      "audit_reasoning": "PicoQuant is a leading manufacturer of advanced optical measurement systems, including spectrometers and microscopes, which are directly relevant to the spectral sensor market. Their products, such as the FluoTime 300 and Luminosa, are specifically designed for time-resolved fluorescence and photoluminescence techniques, making them key players in this field.",
