      "polished_summary": "Coherent is a leading provider of advanced optical solutions, specializing in end-to-end optical connectivity and photonic innovation. The company focuses on powering next-generation AI networks, hyperscale datacenters, and global communications through its engineered materials and high-precision laser solutions, catering to a diverse range of industrial and technological markets.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Coherent manufactures advanced optical solutions and high-precision laser solutions, which are integral to the development of spectral sensors and related technologies. Their focus on optical connectivity and photonic innovation aligns with the needs of the spectral sensor market.",
