      "polished_summary": "OptoSigma is a leading provider of optical components and systems, specializing in high-quality products such as mirrors, prisms, lenses, and beamsplitters. The company serves a diverse range of markets, including scientific research, industrial applications, and laser technology, offering innovative solutions tailored to meet the needs of its global clientele. With a commitment to excellence, OptoSigma ensures optimal performance and precision in all its optical products.",
      "audit_reasoning": "OptoSigma manufactures and supplies optical components such as mirrors, prisms, and lenses, which are essential for spectral sensor applications. Their focus on high-quality optical products aligns with the needs of the spectral sensor market.",
