      "company_summary": "Photonetc is a Quebec-based company specializing in the design and manufacture of advanced imaging technologies tailored for the life sciences, materials science, and industrial sectors. Their innovative product lineup includes state-of-the-art instruments such as short-wave infrared plate readers, tunable bandpass filters, and high-resolution cameras, all engineered to deliver exceptional sensitivity and clarity for a wide range of applications. With a commitment to enhancing imaging capabilities, Photonetc empowers researchers and industries to explore the universe of the invisible.",
