n\n[Join us][57]\n[][58]\n[][59]\n[][60]\n[][61]\n[][62]\n[][63]\n\n\u00a9 Photon etc.\n[Terms and Conditions of Sale][64] \u2022 [Privacy Policy][65] \u2022 [Website Terms and Conditions][66]\n\n[Conception Web Marie-Claude Germain][67]\n\nManage Consent\nTo provide the best possible experience, we use technologies such as cookies to store and/or access\ninformation on devices. Consenting to these technologies will allow us to process data such as\nbrowsing behavior or unique identifiers on this site. Not consenting or withdrawing your consent may\nnegatively affect certain features and functions.\nFunctional Functional Always active\nTechnical access or storage is strictly necessary for the legitimate interest of enabling the use of\na specific service explicitly requested by the subscriber or user, or for the sole purpose of\ntransmitting a communication over an electronic communications network.\nPreferences Preferences\nTechnical access or storage is necessary for the legitimate interest of storing preferences that are\nnot requested by the subscriber or internet user.\nStatistics Statistics\nStorage or technical access used exclusively for statistical purposes. Storage or technical access\nused exclusively for anonymous statistical purposes. In the absence of a subpoena, voluntary\ncompliance by your internet service provider, or additional records from a third party, information\nstored or retrieved for this purpose alone generally cannot be used to identify you.\nMarketing Marketing\nTechnical access or storage is necessary to create user profiles for the purpose of serving\nadvertisements, or to track the user across a website or multiple websites with similar marketing\npurposes.\n* [Manage options][68]\n* [Manage services][69]\n* [Manage {vendor_count} vendors][70]\n* [Read more about these purposes][71]\nAccept Refuse View Preferences Save preferences [View Preferences][72]\n* [{title}][73]\n* [{title}][74]\n* [{title}][75]\nManage Consent\nTo provide the best possible experience, we use technologies such as cookies to store and/or access\ninformation on devices. Consenting to these technologies will allow us to process data such as\nbrowsing behavior or unique identifiers on this site. Not consenting or withdrawing your consent may\nnegatively affect certain features and functions.\nFunctional Functional Always active\nTechnical access or storage is strictly necessary for the legitimate interest of enabling the use of\na specific service explicitly requested by the subscriber or user, or for the sole purpose of\ntransmitting a communication over an electronic communications network.\nPreferences Preferences\nTechnical access or storage is necessary for the legitimate interest of storing preferences that are\nnot requested by the subscriber or internet user.\nStatistics Statistics\nStorage or technical access used exclusively for statistical purposes. Storage or technical access\nused exclusively for anonymous statistical purposes. In the absence of a subpoena, voluntary\ncompliance by your internet service provider, or additional records from a third party, information\nstored or retrieved for this purpose alone generally cannot be used to identify you.\nMarketing Marketing\nTechnical access or storage is necessary to create user profiles for the purpose of serving\nadvertisements, or to track the user across a website or multiple websites with similar marketing\npurposes.\n* [Manage options][76]\n* [Manage services][77]\n* [Manage {vendor_count} vendors][78]\n* [Read more about these purposes][79]\nAccept Refuse View Preferences Save preferences [View Preferences][80]\n* [{title}][81]\n* [{title}][82]\n* [{title}][83]\nManage Consent Manage Consent\n\n[1]: https://www.photonetc.com/\n[2]: #\n[3]: https://www.photonetc.com/applications/\n[4]: https://www.photonetc.com/products/\n[5]: #\n[6]: https://www.photonetc.com/fr/a-propos/\n[7]: https://www.photonetc.com/about-us/contact/\n[8]: #\n[9]: https://www.photonetc.com/applications/\n[10]: https://www.photonetc.com/products/\n[11]: #\n[12]: https://www.photonetc.com/fr/a-propos/\n[13]: https://www.photonetc.com/about-us/contact/\n[14]: https://www.photonetc.com/fr/ressources/articles-scientifiques\n[15]: https://www.photonetc.com/fr/ressources/articles-scientifiques\n[16]: https://www.photonetc.com/fr/ressources/livres-blancs/\n[17]: https://www.photonetc.com/fr/ressources/livres-blancs/\n[18]: https://www.photonetc.com/resources/videos/\n[19]: https://www.photonetc.com/resources/videos/\n[20]: https://www.photonetc.com/resources/raman-shift-calculator/\n[21]: https://www.photonetc.com/resources/raman-shift-calculator/\n[22]: https://www.photonetc.com/about-us/who-we-are/\n[23]: https://www.photonetc.com/about-us/who-we-are/\n[24]: https://www.photonetc.com/about-us/team/\n[25]: https://www.photonetc.com/about-us/team/\n[26]: https://www.photonetc.com/about-us/careers/\n[27]: https://www.photonetc.com/about-us/careers/\n[28]: https://www.photonetc.com/about-us/distributors/\n[29]: https://www.photonetc.com/about-us/distributors/\n[30]: https://www.photonetc.com/about-us/technologies/hyperspectral-imaging/\n[31]: https://www.photonetc.com/about-us/technologies/hyperspectral-imaging/\n[32]: https://www.photonetc.com/about-us/technologies/infrared-imaging/\n[33]: https://www.photonetc.com/about-us/technologies/infrared-imaging/\n[34]: https://www.photonetc.com/about-us/technologies/special-projects/\n[35]: https://www.photonetc.com/about-us/technologies/special-projects/\n[36]: https://www.photonetc.com/about-us/news/\n[37]: https://www.photonetc.com/about-us/news/\n[38]: https://www.photonetc.com/about-us/news/\n[39]: https://www.photonetc.com/about-us/news/\n[40]: https://www.photonetc.com/about-us/contact/\n[41]: https://www.photonetc.com/about-us/contact/\n[42]: https://www.photonetc.com/life-sciences/\n[43]: https://www.photonetc.com/application/domains/cardiovascular-neurological-research/\n[44]: https://www.photonetc.com/