            "text": "[][1]\n* [About us][2]\n* [Applications][3]\n* [Products][4]\n* [Resources][5]\n* [FR][6]\n[Contact][7]\n* [About us][8]\n* [Applications][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Resources][11]\n* [FR][12]\n\nSpectroscopy & Tunable Filters\n\n#### Plate Reader\n\nDedicated short-wave infrared plate reader\n\n#### Superconitnuum Filter\n\nState-of-the-art non-dispersive tunable bandpass filter\n\nSoftware & Customization\n\n#### Special Projects\n\nCustom solutions for a variety of applications\n\n#### PHySpec Software\n\nDesigned to control the full range of Photon instruments, etc.\n\nPreclinical\n\n#### Bioluminescence Imaging\n\nDesigned to pick up even the faintest broadcast signals with exceptional sensitivity\n\n#### NIR-I & NIR-II Imaging\n\nUnmatched image clarity and sub-millimeter resolution in depth\n\nCameras\n\n#### SWIR Cameras\n\nNext-generation SWIR & InGaAs imaging solutions\n\n#### eSWIR Cameras\n\nExtended-range short-wave infrared cameras\n\nHyperspectral Imaging\n\n#### Linescan Cameras\n\nDesigned for high-throughput industrial sorting and continuous flow analysis\n\n#### Area Spectral Imaging\n\nCombines micro- and macro-level data to generate comprehensive data cubes\n\n#### Microscopy\n\nHigh-resolution spatial and spectral characterization at the microscopic scale\n\n### Discover the universe of the invisible\n\n[Join us][13]\n\nResources\n\n[\uf1ea][14]\n\n#### [Scientific Papers][15]\n\nPublications resulting from research projects in applied sciences, nanotechnology, and cutting-edge\nscientific innovation.\n\n[\uf518][16]\n\n#### [White Papers][17]\n\nPublished by Photon etc. in the fields of life sciences, advanced materials, and industrial\ndevelopment.\n\n[\uf167][18]\n\n#### [Videos][19]\n\nExplore how Photon etc.\u2019s technologies are transforming research and industry.\n\n[\ue0e7][20]\n\n#### [Raman Shift Calculator][21]\n\nRaman spectrum conversion application: wavelength, wavenumber, frequency, and bandwidth.\n\nAbout us\n\n[\ue089][22]\n\n#### [Who we are][23]\n\nA Quebec-based company specializing in the design and manufacture of advanced imaging technologies\n\n[\uf0c0][24]\n\n#### [Team][25]\n\nPhysicists, optical, electronic, and mechanical engineers, developers, technicians, and visionaries.\n\n[\uf234][26]\n\n#### [Careers][27]\n\nEverybody is welcome to bring new inventions at Photon etc.\n\n[\uf59f][28]\n\n#### [Distributors][29]\n\nAn international distribution network capable of responding quickly to requests in their respective\nregions.\n\nTechnologies\n\n[\uf75b][30]\n\n#### [Hyperspectral Imaging][31]\n\nA non-destructive testing technique that utilizes the electromagnetic spectrum.\n\n[\uf7c0][32]\n\n#### [Infrared Imaging][33]\n\nPowerful technology that captures images outside the visible light spectrum\n\n[\ue037][34]\n\n#### [Special Projects][35]\n\nDevelopment and innovation in imaging systems.\n\nEtc.\n\n[\uf1ea][36]\n\n#### [News][37]\n\nCheck out the latest news, innovations, and announcements from Photon etc.\n\n[\uf073][38]\n\n#### [Events][39]\n\nFollow our conferences, scientific exhibitions, and participation in international events.\n\n[\ue076][40]\n\n#### [Contact][41]\n\nPlease contact our team with any questions, requests for information, or collaboration\nopportunities.\n\n[][42]\n\nLife Sciences\n\n#### [Cardiovascular & Neurological Research][43]\n\n#### [Preclinical Drug Discovery & Pharmacokinetics][44]\n\n#### [Advanced Materials & Nanosensor Development][45]\n\n#### [Oncology & Surgical Guidance][46]\n\n[][47]\n\nMaterials Science\n\n#### [Semiconductors & Optoelectronics ][48]\n\n#### [Photovoltaics & Solar Materials][49]\n\n#### [Nanomaterials and Thin-Films][50]\n\n#### [Optical Metrology and Spectroscopy][51]\n\n[][52]\n\nIndustrial\n\n#### [Waste & Recycling][53]\n\n#### [Defence & Security][54]\n\n#### [Mining & Geology][55]\n\n#### [Agri-food][56]\n\nTeam\n* [ Photon etc. ][57]\n* 5\n* About us\n* 5\n* Team\n\n### A Professional Team\n\nThe Photon etc. team represents an array of physicists, optical, electronic and mechanical\nengineers, and software developers supported by qualified technicians, a dynamic sales and marketing\ndepartment and a group of visionary managers.\n\nA great team accompanied by a large network of partners who distribute our products worldwide.\n\nBy supporting researchers in the life sciences and advancing breakthroughs in cancer diagnosis,\nwe\u2019re transforming scientific visions into reality with our cutting-edge technology. I couldn\u2019t ask\nfor a more fulfilling calling.\n\n#### Wendy Chung\n\nproduct line manager \u2013 life sciences\n\n## Partners\n\n#### Become a distributor\n\n#### Join our international network of partners specializing in optics and photonics.\n\nTogether, let\u2019s help make advanced imaging technologies accessible to researchers and industries\naround the world.\n\n[Distributors][58]\n\n#### Become part of the Photon etc. team\n\n#### Ready to bring your skills to a dynamic team environment?\n\nLooking to put your talents to work within a dynamic team? We are always on the lookout for\nself-motivated, experienced, creative, and meticulous professionals.\n\n[Available positions][59]\n\n#### Photon etc.\n\n5795 Av. de Gasp\u00e9, #222\nMontr\u00e9al, QC, H2S 2X3\nCanada\n\n[Join us][60]\n[][61]\n[][62]\n[][63]\n[][64]\n[][65]\n[][66]\n\n\u00a9 Photon etc.\n[Terms and Conditions of Sale][67] \u2022 [Privacy Policy][68] \u2022 [Website Terms and Conditions][69]\n\n[Conception Web Marie-Claude Germain][70]\n\nManage Consent\nTo provide the best possible experience, we use technologies such as cookies to store and/or access\ninformation on devices. Consenting to these technologies will allow us to process data such as\nbrowsing behavior or unique identifiers on this site. Not consenting or withdrawing your consent may\nnegatively affect certain features and functions.\nFunctional Functional Always active\nTechnical access or storage is strictly necessary for the legitimate interest of enabling the use of\na specific service explicitly requested by the subscriber or user, or for the sole purpose of\ntransmitting a communication over an electronic communications network.\nPreferences Preferences\nTechnical access or storage is necessary for the legitimate interest of storing preferences that are\nnot requested by the subscriber or internet user.\nStatistics Statistics\nStorage or technical access used exclusively for statistical purposes. Storage or technical access\nused exclusively for anonymous statistical purposes. In the absence of a subpoena, voluntary\ncompliance by your internet service provider, or additional records from a third party, information\nstored or retrieved for this purpose alone generally cannot be used to identify you.\nMarketing Marketing\nTechnical access or storage is necessary to create user profiles for the purpose of serving\nadvertisements, or to track the user across a website or multiple websites with similar marketing\npurposes.\n* [Manage options][71]\n* [Manage services][72]\n* [Manage {vendor_count} vendors][73]\n* [Read more about these purposes][74]\nAccept Refuse View Preferences Save preferences [View Preferences][75]\n* [{title}][76]\n* [{title}][77]\n* [{title}][78]\nManage Consent\nTo provide the best possible experience, we use technologies such as cookies to store and/or access\ninformation on devices. Consenting to these technologies will allow us to process data such as\nbrowsing behavior or unique identifiers on this site. Not consenting or withdrawing your consent may\nnegatively affect certain features and functions.\nFunctional Functional Always active\nTechnical access or storage is strictly necessary for the legitimate interest of enabling the use of\na specific service explicitly requested by the subscriber or user, or for the sole purpose of\ntransmitting a communication over an electronic communications network.\nPreferences Preferences\nTechnical access or storage is necessary for the legitimate interest of storing preferences that are\nnot requested by the subscriber or internet user.\nStatistics Statistics\nStorage or technical access used exclusively for statistical purposes. Storage or technical access\nused exclusively for anonymous statistical purposes. In the absence of a subpoena, voluntary\ncompliance by your internet service provider, or additional records from a third party, information\nstored or retrieved for this purpose alone generally cannot be used to identify you.\nMarketing Marketing\nTechnical access or storage is necessary to create user profiles for the purpose of serving\nadvertisements, or to track the user across a website or multiple websites with similar marketing\npurposes.\n* [Manage options][79]\n* [Manage services][80]\n* [Manage {vendor_count} vendors][81]\n* [Read more about these purposes][82]\nAccept Refuse View Preferences Save preferences [View Preferences][83]\n* [{title}][84]\n* [{title}][85]\n* [{title}][86]\nManage Consent Manage Consent\n\n[1]: https://www.photonetc.com/\n[2]: #\n[3]: https://www.photonetc.com/applications/\n[4]: https://www.photonetc.com/products/\n[5]: #\n[6]: https://www.photonetc.com/fr/a-propos/equipe/\n[7]: https://www.photonetc.com/about-us/contact/\n[8]: #\n[9]: https://www.photonetc.com/applications/\n[10]: https://www.photonetc.com/products/\n[11]: #\n[12]: https://www.photonetc.com/fr/a-propos/equipe/\n[13]: https://www.photonetc.com/about-us/contact/\n[14]: https://www.photonetc.com/fr/ressources/articles-scientifiques\n[15]: https://www.photonetc.com/fr/ressources/articles-scientifiques\n[16]: https://www.photonetc.com/fr/ressources/livres-blancs/\n[17]: https://www.photonetc.com/fr/ressources/livres-blancs/\n[18]: https://www.photonetc.com/resources/videos/\n[19]: https://www.photonetc.com/resources/videos/\n[20]: https://www.photonetc.com/resources/raman-shift-calculator/\n[21]: https://www.photonetc.com/resources/raman-shift-calculator/