      "key_products": "SWIR Cameras, Tunable Bandpass Filters, Area Spectral Imaging, NIR-I & NIR-II Imaging, Bioluminescence Imaging",
      "polished_summary": "Photonetc is a Quebec-based company specializing in the design and manufacture of advanced imaging technologies tailored for the life sciences, materials science, and industrial sectors. Their innovative product lineup includes state-of-the-art instruments such as short-wave infrared plate readers, tunable bandpass filters, and high-resolution cameras, all engineered to deliver exceptional sensitivity and clarity for a wide range of applications. With a commitment to enhancing imaging capabilities, Photonetc empowers researchers and industries to explore the universe of the invisible.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Photonetc specializes in the design and manufacture of advanced imaging technologies, including spectral sensors and cameras specifically for applications in life sciences and materials science. Their products such as SWIR cameras and tunable bandpass filters are directly relevant to the spectral sensor market.",
