      "polished_summary": "Shanghai Optics specializes in the design, manufacturing, and assembly of high-quality optical components and systems. Their extensive product range includes lenses, filters, mirrors, prisms, and custom optical solutions, catering to diverse industries such as medical optics, imaging, and optical engineering. With a focus on precision and innovation, Shanghai Optics serves clients seeking advanced optical technologies and reliable optical assemblies.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Shanghai Optics specializes in the design and manufacturing of optical components and systems, including lenses and filters, which are essential for spectral sensors. Their focus on optical engineering and custom optical solutions aligns directly with the needs of the spectral sensor market.",
