      "company_summary": "Si-Ware Systems is a deep-tech innovation powerhouse specializing in advanced sensing technologies that seamlessly integrate the physical and digital worlds. The company offers a range of cutting-edge products, including compact FT-NIR and MIR sensors, development kits, and versatile analysis platforms, catering to manufacturers and developers across industries such as agri-food, industrial automation, pharmaceuticals, and environmental monitoring. Through its innovative solutions, Si-Ware enhances perception, automation, and interaction in various applications.",
