 white plus symbol in the center.]\nCareers\n][27]\n[Contact][28][Order Now][29]\n[Cookie settings]\nteam\n\n# Meet the visionaries behind Si-Ware Systems\n\nSi-Ware Systems' leadership team combines visionary thinking with deep industry expertise. With a\nstrong foundation in a variety of disciplines\u2014including spectroscopy, technology, and business\nmanagement\u2014they drive our strategic direction and innovation. Committed to integrity, excellence,\nand collaboration, our leaders foster a culture of creativity and continuous improvement, ensuring\nSi-Ware Systems remains at the forefront of technological advancements.\n\nConnect with our leaders\n][30]\n[Group of business colleagues seated around a conference table in a high-rise office during sunset.]\n\n### Message From Our CEO\n\norem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur. Turpis magna tempus viverra viverra lobortis. Eget sed\naliquam viverra non placerat scelerisque magna. A id cras molestie scelerisque tellus duis in.\nSuspendisse pretium diam massa diam neque eget. Egestas vivamus integer duis sem rhoncus duis\nvolutpat. Scelerisque phasellus rhoncus urna cras. Vulputate est ipsum interdum et. Massa fusce quam\nin vestibulum magna. Pellentesque eget potenti turpis luctus sapien enim posuere. In tempus eu\nullamcorper odio leo.\n\n## Our Executive Team\n\n### Dr. Hisham Haddara\n\nChairman, CEO\n\nread bio\n][31]\n\n### Dr. Bassam Saadany\n\nCo-founder, CTO\n\nread bio\n][32]\n\n### Ahmed Badr\n\nCOO & EVP\n\nread bio\n][33]\n\n### Dr. Mostafa Medhat\n\nCCO\n\nread bio\n][34]\n\n### Prof. Diaa Khalil\n\nChief Innovation Officer\n\nread bio\n][35]\n\n### Amr El Mosallamy\n\nVP of Finance\n\nread bio\n][36]\n\n### Dr. Yasser Sabry\n\nVP of Sensor Systems Technology\n\nread bio\n][37]\n\n### Mohamed Elarabawy\n\nVP of Manufacturing\n\nread bio\n][38]\n\n### Yang Jiang\n\nVP of Sales & Strategic Partnerships - APAC\n\nread bio\n][39]\n\n### Tomi V\u00e4\u00e4n\u00e4nen\n\nVP Sales, EMEA\n\nread bio\n][40]\n\n## Our Board members\n\n### Dr. Hisham Haddara\n\nChairman, CEO\n\nread bio\n][41]\n\n### Ahmed El Alfi\n\nBoard of Directors, Member\n\nread bio\n][42]\n\n### Dr. Bassam Saadany\n\nCo-founder, CTO\n\nread bio\n][43]\n\n## Ready to Power Your System with Next-Gen Spectral Sensing Technology?\n\nComplete the form, and one of our experts will contact you to discuss your needs and demonstrate how\nSi-Ware\u2019s sensing technologies can help optimize performance, streamline analysis, and enhance your\nproducts or operations.\n\n[Home][44][Technology][45][News][46][Insights][47][About us][48]\n\nProducts\n\n[Si-NIR Mini][49][Si-NIR Matrix][50][Si-NIR StreamLine][51][AgriLIMS][52][CropScout][53]\n\n101 Jefferson Drive, 1st Floor Menlo Park, CA 94025, USA\n\n][54][\n][55][\n[LinkedIn icon]\n][56][\n][57]\n[Privacy Policy][58]\n[Terms & Conditions][59]\n\n[1]: /material-sensing/si-nir-mini\n[2]: /material-sensing/si-nir-matrix\n[3]: /products/si-nir-mini-dvk\n[4]: /products/si-nir-matrix-dvk\n[5]: /products/si-nir-fibersense\n[6]: /compare\n[7]: /all-products\n[8]: /material-sensing/si-nir-streamline\n[9]: /products/si-nir-overline\n[10]: /compare\n[11]: /all-products\n[12]: /products/si-nir-flex\n[13]: /products/si-mir-core\n[14]: /products/si-mir-widerange\n[15]: /compare\n[16]: /all-products\n[17]: /software/agrilims\n[18]: /sensing-solutions/cropscout\n[19]: /technology\n[20]: /insights/blogs\n[21]: /insights/application-notes\n[22]: /company/about-us\n[23]: /company/team\n[24]: /company/news\n[25]: /company/distributors\n[26]: /company/certifications\n[27]: https://siwaresystems.recruitee.com/\n[28]: /contact\n[29]: https://shop.si-ware.com/\n[30]: #\n[31]: /team-members/dr-hisham-haddara\n[32]: /team-members/bassam-saadany\n[33]: /team-members/ahmed-badr\n[34]: /team-members/mostafa-medhat\n[35]: /team-members/prof-diaa-khalil\n[36]: /team-members/amr-el-mosallamy\n[37]: /team-members/yasser-sabry\n[38]: /team-members/mohamed-elarabawy\n[39]: /team-members/yang-jiang\n