 white plus symbol in the center.]\nCareers\n][27]\n[Contact][28][Order Now][29]\n[Cookie settings]\nour distributors\n\n# Navigate our Global Network\n\nConnect with reliable partners for NeoSpectra products and services in your area\n\n### TriKr Technologies( Suzhou)Co., Ltd\n\nRoom 203,No. 4 building,No.89 Weixin Road,SIP ,Suzhou\n\nChina\n\n(+86) 512 65787425\n\nAPAC\n\n[Visit Site][30]\n\n### AOC Korea Corp.\n\n(07293) #1008, 116, Mullraebuk-ro, Yeongdeungpo-gu, Seoul-City\n\nSouth Korea\n\n(+82) 262 272 795\n\nAPAC\n\n[Visit Site][31]\n\n## Ready to Power Your System with Next-Gen Spectral Sensing Technology?\n\nComplete the form, and one of our experts will contact you to discuss your needs and demonstrate how\nSi-Ware\u2019s sensing technologies can help optimize performance, streamline analysis, and enhance your\nproducts or operations.\n\n[Home][32][Technology][33][News][34][Insights][35][About us][36]\n\nProducts\n\n[Si-NIR Mini][37][Si-NIR Matrix][38][Si-NIR StreamLine][39][AgriLIMS][40][CropScout][41]\n\n101 Jefferson Drive, 1st Floor Menlo Park, CA 94025, USA\n\n][42][\n][43][\n[LinkedIn icon]\n][44][\n][45]\n[Privacy Policy][46]\n[Terms & Conditions][47]\n\n[1]: /material-sensing/si-nir-mini\n[2]: /material-sensing/si-nir-matrix\n[3]: /products/si-nir-mini-dvk\n[4]: /products/si-nir-matrix-dvk\n[5]: /products/si-nir-fibersense\n[6]: /compare\n[7]: /all-products\n[8]: /material-sensing/si-nir-streamline\n[9]: /products/si-nir-overline\n[10]: /compare\n[11]: /all-products\n[12]: /products/si-nir-flex\n[13]: /products/si-mir-core\n[14]: /products/si-mir-widerange\n[15]: /compare\n[16]: /all-products\n[17]: /software/agrilims\n[18]: /sensing-solutions/cropscout\n[19]: /technology\n[20]: /insights/blogs\n[21]: /insights/application-notes\n[22]: /company/about-us\n[23]: /company/team\n[24]: /company/news\n[25]: /company/distributors\n[26]: /company/certifications\n[27]: https://siwaresystems.recruitee.com/\n[28]: /contact\n[29]: https://shop.si-ware.com/\n[30]: https://www.trikrgroup.com/\n[31]: http://www.aockorea.com\n[32]: /\n[33]: /technology\n[34]: /company/news\n[35]: /insights/blogs\n[36]: /company/about-us\n[37]: /material-sensing/si-nir-mini\n[38]: /material-sensing/si-nir-matrix\n[39]: /material-sensing/si-nir-streamline\n[40]: /software/agrilims\n[41]: /sensing-solutions/cropscout\n[42]: https://www.facebook.com/SiWareSystems\n[43]: https://twitter.com/siwaresystems\n[44]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/si-ware-systems/\n[45]: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPx_Gys4B6hSLw_JY3CkU5w\n[46]: /policies/privacy-policy\n[47]: /policies/terms-and-conditions"
