            "text": "Products\nOEM Sensor\nIntegration-Ready Sensors\nDeployable Device\nField-Ready Analyzers\nInnovation Kit\nEmerging Tech Exploration\nOther\nInnovative solutions & software\nSi-NIR Mini\nThe smallest FT-NIR sensor built for integration\n][1][\nSi-NIR Matrix\nCompact OEM sensor delivering consistent readings from inconsistent materials\n][2][\nSi-NIR Mini DVK\nEasiest & fastest way to assess the world\u2019s smallest FT-NIR\n][3][\nSi-NIR Matrix DVK\nPlug-and-play toolkit for quick evaluation and prototyping of heterogeneous material analysis\n][4][\nSi-NIR FiberSense\nRemote FT-NIR spectral sensing through robust fiber connectivity\n][5]\nStart Comparing\n][6][\nAll Products\n][7]\nSi-NIR StreamLine\nAdaptable Process-deployable FT-NIR for in-line, on-line use in factories and fields\n][8][\nSi-NIR OverLine\nRugged FT-NIR for contactless continuous analysis of materials in motion\n][9]\nStart Comparing\n][10][\nAll Products\n][11]\nSi-NIR Flex\nDevelopment platform for NIR analysis with configurable setup\n][12][\nSi-MIR Core\nCompact MIR sensor enabling accurate transmission-based analysis\n][13][\nSi-MIR WideRange\nMulti-purpose MIR spectral sensing platform covering key fingerprint regions\n][14]\nStart Comparing\n][15][\nAll Products\n][16]\nSensing Software Platform\nAgriLIMS\nTech with ag labs in mind\n][17]\nTurnkey Sensing Solutions\nCropScout\nCrop Care on Autopilot\n][18]\n[Technology][19]\nInsights\nBlogs\n][20][[Orange icon of a notepad with three horizontal lines representing text.]\nApplication Notes\n][21]\nCompany\nAbout Us\n][22][\nTeam\n][23][[Orange and gray stylized speech bubble icon with horizontal lines representing text.]\nNews\n][24][[Orange distribution network icon with interconnected nodes around a central circle containing\na location pin.]\nDistributors\n][25][[Orange rectangular image with two stylized white shapes resembling the letter 'E' rotated and\nstacked.]\nCertifications\n][26][[Orange briefcase icon with a white plus symbol in the center.]\nCareers\n][27]\n[Contact][28][Order Now][29]\n[Cookie settings]\n[Person using a laptop displaying virtual quality rating and user review interfaces with star\nratings and checklists.]\ncompany\n\n# certifications\n\nAt Si-Ware Systems, we are committed to delivering reliable, high-performance sensor solutions that\nmeet the highest quality and safety standards. Our certifications demonstrate our dedication to\nglobal compliance, product integrity, and continuous improvement.\n\nOpen Search Field\nFilter\nAll\n][30]\nGeneral\nThank you! Your submission has been received!\nOops! Something went wrong while submitting the form.\n[General ][31]\n[Si-Ware Systems ISO/IEC 27001:2013 Certification][32]\nISO/IEC 27001:2013 is the international standard for Information Security Management Systems (ISMS),\nensuring the confidentiality, integrity, and availability of information. This certification\nconfirms that Si-Ware Systems has established and maintains a robust framework for managing\nsensitive data securely across its FT-NIR spectroscopy operations. The scope includes end-to-end\nsolutions\u2014from planning and design to support, monitoring, and continuous improvement\u2014demonstrating\nSi-Ware's commitment to data security and risk management.\nView Certification\n][33]\nDownload Patent\n][34][\nRead more\n][35]\n[General ][36]\n[Si-Ware Systems SOC 2 Type I Certification][37]\nSOC 2 Type I is a widely recognized standard for data security, availability, processing integrity,\nconfidentiality, and privacy, based on the AICPA Trust Services Criteria. This certification\nconfirms that Si-Ware Systems has implemented and documented the necessary controls to protect\ncustomer data and support secure operations. The assessment, completed by an independent CPA firm,\nreflects Si-Ware\u2019s ongoing commitment to maintaining robust information security and operational\nexcellence across its platforms and services.\nView Certification\n][38]\nDownload Patent\n][39][\nRead more\n][40]\n[General ][41]\n[Si-Ware Systems ISO9001 Certificate][42]\nISO 9001 is an internationally recognized standard for Quality Management Systems (QMS). It outlines\ncriteria for a QMS and is based on principles like customer focus, leadership, process approach, and\ncontinual improvement. Certification demonstrates a commitment to providing quality products and\nservices, enhancing customer satisfaction, and continuous improvement.\nView Certification\n][43]\nDownload Patent\n][44][\nRead more\n][45]\n\n## Ready to Power Your System with Next-Gen Spectral Sensing Technology?\n\nComplete the form, and one of our experts will contact you to discuss your needs and demonstrate how\nSi-Ware\u2019s sensing technologies can help optimize performance, streamline analysis, and enhance your\nproducts or operations.\n\n[Home][46][Technology][47][News][48][Insights][49][About us][50]\n\nProducts\n\n[Si-NIR Mini][51][Si-NIR Matrix][52][Si-NIR StreamLine][53][AgriLIMS][54][CropScout][55]\n\n101 Jefferson Drive, 1st Floor Menlo Park, CA 94025, USA\n\n][56][\n][57][\n[LinkedIn icon]\n][58][\n][59]\n[Privacy Policy][60]\n[Terms & Conditions][61]\n\n[1]: /material-sensing/si-nir-mini\n[2]: /material-sensing/si-nir-matrix\n[3]: /products/si-nir-mini-dvk\n[4]: /products/si-nir-matrix-dvk\n[5]: /products/si-nir-fibersense\n[6]: /compare\n[7]: /all-products\n[8]: /material-sensing/si-nir-streamline\n[9]: /products/si-nir-overline\n[10]: /compare\n[11]: /all-products\n[12]: /products/si-nir-flex\n[13]: /products/si-mir-core\n[14]: /products/si-mir-widerange\n[15]: /compare\n[16]: /all-products\n[17]: /software/agrilims\n[18]: /sensing-solutions/cropscout\n[19]: /technology\n[20]: /insights/blogs\n[21]: /insights/application-notes\n[22]: /company/about-us\n[23]: /company/team\n[24]: /company/news\n[25]: /company/distributors\n[26]: /company/certifications\n[27]: https://siwaresystems.recruitee.com/\n[28]: /contact\n[29]: https://shop.si-ware.com/\n[30]: #\n[31]: #\n[32]: https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68120a8da81e7482ac6b6aa2/681c916f741a6b71762f63d8__Certific\nate%20SI-WARE%20ISO%2027001-2013%20-%201503%20-%2020-Jun-2022-2025.pdf\n[33]: https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68120a8da81e7482ac6b6aa2/681c916f741a6b71762f63d8__Certific\nate%20SI-WARE%20ISO%2027001-2013%20-%201503%20-%2020-Jun-2022-2025.pdf\n[34]: #\n[35]: #\n[36]: #\n[37]: https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68120a8da81e7482ac6b6aa2/681c916f25cb762920cefd46__Si-Ware%\n20SOC2%20Certificate%20Signed.pdf\n[38]: https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68120a8da81e7482ac6b6aa2/681c916f25cb762920cefd46__Si-Ware%\n20SOC2%20Certificate%20Signed.pdf\n[39]: #\n[40]: #\n[41]: #\n[42]: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MhLS7iqVI-rOP3SlTpeHdeiHXDVRE8wA/view\n[43]: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MhLS7iqVI-rOP3SlTpeHdeiHXDVRE8wA/view\n[44]: #\n[45]: #\n[46]: /\n[47]: /technology\n[48]: /company/news\n[49]: /insights/blogs\n[50]: /company/about-us\n[51]: /material-sensing/si-nir-mini\n[52]: /material-sensing/si-nir-matrix\n[53]: /material-sensing/si-nir-streamline\n[54]: /software/agrilims\n[55]: /sensing-solutions/cropscout\n[56]: https://www.facebook.com/SiWareSystems\n[57]: https://twitter.com/siwaresystems\n[58]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/si-ware-systems/\n[59]: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPx_Gys4B6hSLw_JY3CkU5w\n[60]: /policies/privacy-policy\n[61]: /policies/terms-and-conditions"
