 white plus symbol in the center.]\nCareers\n][27]\n[Contact][28][Order Now][29]\n[Cookie settings]\nAll Product\n][30]\nSi-NIR Flex\n\n# Si-NIR Flex\n\nFT-NIR Development platform with configurable setup for flexible material analysis experimentation\n\n**Ready to explore how this fits your solution?**\n\nLet\u2019s Explore Together\n][31]\n[Overview][32][Specifications][33]\n\n## **What Is **\n\n## Si-NIR Flex\n\n## ** sensor ?**\n\nSi-NIR Flex is an FT-NIR spectral sensor featuring a separate light source and a spectrometer\nmodule. This configuration provides researchers and developers the flexibility to explore Si-Ware\u2019s\nminiaturized NIR technology across various optical setups, alignments, path lengths, and sample\ninterface designs.\n\nWhile optimized for transmission measurements that provide the highest signal-to-noise ratio, the\nconfiguration can also be arranged for other sample interaction geometries.\n\nWant to see how this can power your next innovation?\n\nExplore the Possibilities\n][34]\n\n## Key Features & Advantages\n\n\u221a Wide spectral range\n\n\u221a Designed to enable flexible experimentation setups\n\n\u221a Plug & play and easy-to-use\n\n## **Material Analysis Capabilities**\n\nSample Types\n\n**Solids**: Films, thin polymers, tablets, and powders pressed or in cuvettes\n\n**Liquids**: Oils, beverages, alcohols, and aqueous solutions in cuvettes or flow cells\n\nMeasurement Mode\nDiscrete\nSampling Method\n\nTransmission, diffuse reflectance, and transflectance\n\nNeed help validating your material performance?\n\nDiscuss Your Application\n][35]\n\n## **technical specifications**\n\nParameter\nValue\nSpectral Range\n\n1,350 - 2,500 nm\n\nOptical Interface\n\nSeparate light source and spectral sensing modules\n\nSNR\n\n>2,000:1\n\nResolution\n\n16 nm\n\nPhotodetector\n\nExtended InGaAs\n\nConnectivity\n\nUSB-C\n\nDimensions\n\nSpectrometer W 63.5 x L 85 x H 47 mm\u00b3\n\nLight source: W 50 \u00d7 L 102 \u00d7 H 47.5 mm\u00b3\n\nWeight\n\nSpectrometer 210g\n\nSource 280 g\n\nSoftware\n\nSi-Spect\n\nNeed more technical details for your application?\n\nGet Expert Guidance\n][36][\nRequest a Quote\n][37]\n\n## Ready to Power Your System with Next-Gen Spectral Sensing Technology?\n\nComplete the form, and one of our experts will contact you to discuss your needs and demonstrate how\nSi-Ware\u2019s sensing technologies can help optimize performance, streamline analysis, and enhance your\nproducts or operations.\n\n[Home][38][Technology][39][News][40][Insights][41][About us][42]\n\nProducts\n\n[Si-NIR Mini][43][Si-NIR Matrix][44][Si-NIR StreamLine][45][AgriLIMS][46][CropScout][47]\n\n101 Jefferson Drive, 1st Floor Menlo Park, CA 94025, USA\n\n][48][\n][49][\n[LinkedIn icon]\n][50][\n][51]\n[Privacy Policy][52]\n[Terms & Conditions][53]\n\n[1]: /material-sensing/si-nir-mini\n[2]: /material-sensing/si-nir-matrix\n[3]: /products/si-nir-mini-dvk\n[4]: /products/si-nir-matrix-dvk\n[5]: /products/si-nir-fibersense\n[6]: /compare\n[7]: /all-products\n[8]: /material-sensing/si-nir-streamline\n[9]: /products/si-nir-overline\n[10]: /compare\n[11]: /all-products\n[12]: /products/si-nir-flex\n[13]: /products/si-mir-core\n[14]: /products/si-mir-widerange\n[15]: /compare\n[16]: /all-products\n[17]: /software/agrilims\n[18]: /sensing-solutions/cropscout\n[19]: /technology\n[20]: /insights/blogs\n[21]: /insights/application-notes\n[22]: /company/about-us\n[23]: /company/team\n[24]: /company/news\n[25]: /company/distributors\n[26]: /company/certifications\n[27]: https://siwaresystems.recruitee.com/\n[28]: /contact\n[29]: https://shop.si-ware.com/\n[30]: /all-products\n[31]: #book-demo\n[32]: #overview\n[33]: #specifications\n[34]: #book-demo\n[35]: #book-demo\n[36]: #book-demo\n[37]: #book-demo\n[38]: /\n[39]: /technology\n[40]: /company/news\n[41]: /insights/blogs\n[42]: /company/about-us\n[43]: /material-sensing/si-nir-mini\n[44]: /material-sensing/si-nir-matrix\n[45]: /material-sensing/si-nir-streamline\n[46]: /so