            "text": "Products\nOEM Sensor\nIntegration-Ready Sensors\nDeployable Device\nField-Ready Analyzers\nInnovation Kit\nEmerging Tech Exploration\nOther\nInnovative solutions & software\nSi-NIR Mini\nThe smallest FT-NIR sensor built for integration\n][1][\nSi-NIR Matrix\nCompact OEM sensor delivering consistent readings from inconsistent materials\n][2][\nSi-NIR Mini DVK\nEasiest & fastest way to assess the world\u2019s smallest FT-NIR\n][3][\nSi-NIR Matrix DVK\nPlug-and-play toolkit for quick evaluation and prototyping of heterogeneous material analysis\n][4][\nSi-NIR FiberSense\nRemote FT-NIR spectral sensing through robust fiber connectivity\n][5]\nStart Comparing\n][6][\nAll Products\n][7]\nSi-NIR StreamLine\nAdaptable Process-deployable FT-NIR for in-line, on-line use in factories and fields\n][8][\nSi-NIR OverLine\nRugged FT-NIR for contactless continuous analysis of materials in motion\n][9]\nStart Comparing\n][10][\nAll Products\n][11]\nSi-NIR Flex\nDevelopment platform for NIR analysis with configurable setup\n][12][\nSi-MIR Core\nCompact MIR sensor enabling accurate transmission-based analysis\n][13][\nSi-MIR WideRange\nMulti-purpose MIR spectral sensing platform covering key fingerprint regions\n][14]\nStart Comparing\n][15][\nAll Products\n][16]\nSensing Software Platform\nAgriLIMS\nTech with ag labs in mind\n][17]\nTurnkey Sensing Solutions\nCropScout\nCrop Care on Autopilot\n][18]\n[Technology][19]\nInsights\nBlogs\n][20][[Orange icon of a notepad with three horizontal lines representing text.]\nApplication Notes\n][21]\nCompany\nAbout Us\n][22][\nTeam\n][23][[Orange and gray stylized speech bubble icon with horizontal lines representing text.]\nNews\n][24][[Orange distribution network icon with interconnected nodes around a central circle containing\na location pin.]\nDistributors\n][25][[Orange rectangular image with two stylized white shapes resembling the letter 'E' rotated and\nstacked.]\nCertifications\n][26][[Orange briefcase icon with a white plus symbol in the center.]\nCareers\n][27]\n[Contact][28][Order Now][29]\n[Cookie settings]\nAll Product\n][30]\nSi-MIR WideRange\n\n# Si-MIR WideRange\n\nMulti-purpose mid-infrared(FT-MIR) spectral sensing platform reaching the fingerprint region\n\n**Ready to explore how this fits your solution?**\n\nLet\u2019s Explore Together\n][31]\n[Overview][32][Specifications][33][Downloads][34]\n\n## **What Is **\n\n## Si-MIR WideRange\n\n## ** sensor ?**\n\nSi-MIR WideRange is a mid-infrared sensing device designed for researchers and developers exploring\nSi-Ware\u2019s miniaturized FT-IR technology in applications that require a broad spectral range,\nreaching the fingerprint region.\n\nIt covers the full 2\u201310 \u00b5m range and features a flexible source and detector layout that supports\noptical experimentation across gases, liquids, and solids. Its modular design, stable operation, and\nultra-wide spectral range make it suitable for assessing feasibility on diverse materials and for\ndefining requirements for new material sensing applications and solutions.\n\nWant to see how this can power your next innovation?\n\nExplore the Possibilities\n][35]\n\n## Key Features & Advantages\n\n\u221a Wide spectral range\n\n\u221a Designed to enable flexible experimentation setups\n\n\u221a Plug & play and easy-to-use\n\n## **Material Analysis Capabilities**\n\nSample Types\n\nThin solids, liquids, gases\n\nMeasurement Mode\nDiscrete\nSampling Method\n\nTransmission\n\nNeed help validating your application\n\nDiscuss Your Application\n][36]\n\n## **technical specifications**\n\nParameter\nValue\nSpectral Range\n\n5,000\u20131,000 cm-\u00b9 (2 - 10 \u03bcm)\n\nOptical Interface\n\nSeparate light source and spectral sensing modules\n\nSNR\n\n5,000:1\n\nResolution\n\n42 or 66 cm\u207b\u00b9\n\nPhotodetector\n\nCooled InAsSb\n\nConnectivity\n\nUSB-mini\n\nDimensions\n\nLight source: W 116 \u00d7 L 118 \u00d7 H 115 mm\u00b3\n\nSpectrometer module: W 116 \u00d7 L 118 \u00d7 H 115 mm\u00b3\n\nWeight\n\nLight source: 380 g\n\nSpectrometer module: 980 g\n\nSoftware\n\nSpetroMOST\n\nNeed more technical details for your application?\n\nGet Expert Guidance\n][37][\nRequest a Quote\n][38]\n\n## Product Related Resources\n\nSi-MIR WideRange Brochure\nEnglish\nPDF\n\n## Ready to Power Your System with Next-Gen Spectral Sensing Technology?\n\nComplete the form, and one of our experts will contact you to discuss your needs and demonstrate how\nSi-Ware\u2019s sensing technologies can help optimize performance, streamline analysis, and enhance your\nproducts or operations.\n\n[Home][39][Technology][40][News][41][Insights][42][About us][43]\n\nProducts\n\n[Si-NIR Mini][44][Si-NIR Matrix][45][Si-NIR StreamLine][46][AgriLIMS][47][CropScout][48]\n\n101 Jefferson Drive, 1st Floor Menlo Park, CA 94025, USA\n\n][49][\n][50][\n[LinkedIn icon]\n][51][\n][52]\n[Privacy Policy][53]\n[Terms & Conditions][54]\n\n[1]: /material-sensing/si-nir-mini\n[2]: /material-sensing/si-nir-matrix\n[3]: /products/si-nir-mini-dvk\n[4]: /products/si-nir-matrix-dvk\n[5]: /products/si-nir-fibersense\n[6]: /compare\n[7]: /all-products\n[8]: /material-sensing/si-nir-streamline\n[9]: /products/si-nir-overline\n[10]: /compare\n[11]: /all-products\n[12]: /products/si-nir-flex\n[13]: /products/si-mir-core\n[14]: /products/si-mir-widerange\n[15]: /compare\n[16]: /all-products\n[17]: /software/agrilims\n[18]: /sensing-solutions/cropscout\n[19]: /technology\n[20]: /insights/blogs\n[21]: /insights/application-notes\n[22]: /company/about-us\n[23]: /company/team\n[24]: /company/news\n[25]: /company/distributors\n[26]: /company/certifications\n[27]: https://siwaresystems.recruitee.com/\n[28]: /contact\n[29]: https://shop.si-ware.com/\n[30]: /all-products\n[31]: #book-demo\n[32]: #overview\n[33]: #specifications\n[34]: #download\n[35]: #book-demo\n[36]: #book-demo\n[37]: #book-demo\n[38]: #book-demo\n[39]: /\n[40]: /technology\n[41]: /company/news\n[42]: /insights/blogs\n[43]: /company/about-us\n[44]: /material-sensing/si-nir-mini\n[45]: /material-sensing/si-nir-matrix\n[46]: /material-sensing/si-nir-streamline\n[47]: /software/agrilims\n[48]: /sensing-solutions/cropscout\n[49]: https://www.facebook.com/SiWareSystems\n[50]: https://twitter.com/siwaresystems\n[51]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/si-ware-systems/\n[52]: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPx_Gys4B6hSLw_JY3CkU5w\n[53]: /policies/privacy-policy\n[54]: /policies/terms-and-conditions"
