            "text": "Products\nOEM Sensor\nIntegration-Ready Sensors\nDeployable Device\nField-Ready Analyzers\nInnovation Kit\nEmerging Tech Exploration\nOther\nInnovative solutions & software\nSi-NIR Mini\nThe smallest FT-NIR sensor built for integration\n][1][\nSi-NIR Matrix\nCompact OEM sensor delivering consistent readings from inconsistent materials\n][2][\nSi-NIR Mini DVK\nEasiest & fastest way to assess the world\u2019s smallest FT-NIR\n][3][\nSi-NIR Matrix DVK\nPlug-and-play toolkit for quick evaluation and prototyping of heterogeneous material analysis\n][4][\nSi-NIR FiberSense\nRemote FT-NIR spectral sensing through robust fiber connectivity\n][5]\nStart Comparing\n][6][\nAll Products\n][7]\nSi-NIR StreamLine\nAdaptable Process-deployable FT-NIR for in-line, on-line use in factories and fields\n][8][\nSi-NIR OverLine\nRugged FT-NIR for contactless continuous analysis of materials in motion\n][9]\nStart Comparing\n][10][\nAll Products\n][11]\nSi-NIR Flex\nDevelopment platform for NIR analysis with configurable setup\n][12][\nSi-MIR Core\nCompact MIR sensor enabling accurate transmission-based analysis\n][13][\nSi-MIR WideRange\nMulti-purpose MIR spectral sensing platform covering key fingerprint regions\n][14]\nStart Comparing\n][15][\nAll Products\n][16]\nSensing Software Platform\nAgriLIMS\nTech with ag labs in mind\n][17]\nTurnkey Sensing Solutions\nCropScout\nCrop Care on Autopilot\n][18]\n[Technology][19]\nInsights\nBlogs\n][20][[Orange icon of a notepad with three horizontal lines representing text.]\nApplication Notes\n][21]\nCompany\nAbout Us\n][22][\nTeam\n][23][[Orange and gray stylized speech bubble icon with horizontal lines representing text.]\nNews\n][24][[Orange distribution network icon with interconnected nodes around a central circle containing\na location pin.]\nDistributors\n][25][[Orange rectangular image with two stylized white shapes resembling the letter 'E' rotated and\nstacked.]\nCertifications\n][26][[Orange briefcase icon with a white plus symbol in the center.]\nCareers\n][27]\n[Contact][28][Order Now][29]\n[Cookie settings]\n\n### Who we are\n\n# Bridging Physical & Digital Worlds Through Innovation\n\nSi-Ware Systems is a deep-tech innovation powerhouse that redefines how the world senses, processes,\nand responds to the world around us. We develop and integrate cutting-edge sensing technologies\u2014from\nMEMS and optical components to embedded processing, AI, and intelligent software\u2014that bridge the\nphysical and digital worlds to expand the boundaries of perception, automation, and\ninteraction\u2014shaping the future of how humans, machines, and environments co-exist and evolve.\n\n[Logo with left half showing molecular structure and right half showing binary code over blue\nbackground.]\n[Pyramid diagram with five layers labeled from bottom to top: Core Technology, Sensors, Devices, AI\nEnabled Software, and Solutions at the apex.]\n\n### What we do\n\n## Delivering Scalable Sensing Solutions Built on Proprietary Technologies\n\nSi-Ware delivers world-class sensing technologies, built on proprietary IPs in Material Sensing,\nInertial Sensing, Sensor Fusion, and Sensing Control SaaS. We offer OEM sensing components, advanced\nsensing devices, sensor management software, and integrated end-to-end sensing solutions\u2014available\nas both standard products and custom-developed, fit-for-purpose solutions.\n\n### Our History\n\n## From an IC design house to an innovative Sensing technology powerhouse\n\nWith each breakthrough, we\u2019ve added depth\u2014advancing our technology stack while also strengthening\nproductization, cross-functional collaboration, and global execution capabilities.\n\n## 2004\n\nFounded as semiconductor company offering IC design services & MEMS Technology development.\n\n## 2005\n\nIC chip design service provider\n\n## 2007\n\nMEMS based sensor & timing technology IP provider\n\n## 2014\n\nLaunch of Si-Ware Systems\u2019 first product \u2013 Spectral sensing module\n\n## 2019\n\nAcquisition of Si-Ware Systems\u2019 IC business (Goodix) & Spin-off timing business (Pearl)\n\n## 2020\n\nLaunch of Si-Ware Systems\u2019 first standalone device: NeoSpectra Scanner\n\n## 2022\n\nLaunch of Si-Ware Systems\u2019 first Hardware enabled SaaS platform: NeoSpectra Cloud Portal\n\n## 2025\n\nSi-Ware Systems\u2019 NeoSpectra business acquired by Buchi\n\n## 2026\n\nThe launch of Si-Ware Systems\u2019 comprehensive NIR & MIR portfolio\n\n### Our approach\n\n## We Stay At The Forefront Of Innovation\n\nWe invest heavily in research and development and take pride in our collaborative approach, working\nclosely with our customers to understand their needs and provide solutions that bring value to their\nday to day operations. Our goal is to build long-lasting partnerships based on trust, reliability,\nand mutual success. By leveraging our deep knowledge and extensive experience in multidisciplinary\ntechnology areas, we enable our customers with state-of-the-art technology that reduce costs, save\ntime, and Improve quality for their business.\n\n[Two electronic sensor modules with lenses mounted on green circuit boards.]\n20+\nyears of innovations\n130+\npatents\n15,000+\nsensors delivered\n[Abstract digital icon resembling a fingerprint combined with network signal waves in blue tones.]\n\n### Our awards\n\n## Accomplishments And Industry Recognition\n\nSi-Ware Systems has received numerous awards for our innovative products, technological\nadvancements, and business excellence. These accolades reflect our commitment to delivering\nexceptional solutions to our customers.\n\n### Our people\n\n## We Have A Diverse Team\n\nOur leadership team's diverse backgrounds span various disciplines, including engineering, business\ndevelopment, product management, and operations. This multidisciplinary approach enables us to have\na holistic view of the market and develop comprehensive solutions that address the needs of\ndifferent industries and applications.\n\nKnow our leadership team\n][30]\n\n## Our Customers & Partners\n\nSi-Ware Systems is trusted by a large base of customers and partners representing industry leaders\naround the world in a wide range of industries.\n\n### Your career\n\n## Success Driven By Teamwork\n\nWith a talented team of engineers, scientists, and professionals, our diverse and experienced\nworkforce is dedicated to delivering the highest quality solutions and exceeding customer\nexpectations. We foster a culture of collaboration, innovation, and continuous learning to fuel our\ncollective growth and success.\n\nWant to become part of our team?\n][31]\nNews & insights\n\n## our latest news\n\nOctober 16, 2025\n\n### Si-Ware Systems Launches the Most Adaptable Inline FT-NIR Sensor for Real-Time Process\n### Monitoring\n\n][32]\nJune 30, 2025\n\n### Si-Ware Systems Expands to Saudi Arabia with New Office, Supported by NTDP Relocate Grant\n\n][33]\nMay 14, 2025\n\n### BUCHI Acquires Si-Ware Systems\u2019 NeoSpectra Platform to Establish a Fully Integrated Quality\n### Assurance Ecosystem Based on NIR\n\n][34]\nJanuary 28, 2025\n\n### Si-Ware Systems Introduces Cost-Effective High-Performance In-line Process Analyzer, in\n### Partnership with USTECH INNOVATIONS LLC\n\n][35]\nNovember 13, 2024\n\n### Si-Ware Systems & Rock River Laboratory Offer Superior Greenhouse Efficiency With CropScout\n\n][36]\nNovember 7, 2024\n\n### Si-Ware Systems Launches New Holistic On-Site Analysis Tool for Instant Sample Verification:\n### NeoSpectra Conformity Solution\n\n][37]\nOctober 10, 2024\n\n### Chevron and Si-Ware Systems Announce Multiple R&D Projects for Improved Environmental and\n### Operational Efficiency\n\n][38]\nSeptember 19, 2024\n\n### NutriLab Joins NeoSpectra LabStore, Expanding Options for Quick On-Site Analysis of Feed and\n### Feed Ingredients\n\n][39]\nJuly 3, 2024\n\n### BUCHI extends NIR offering with NeoSpectra handhelds\n\n][40]\nJanuary 15, 2024\n\n### NeoSpectra and Eurofins QTA Collaborate to Advance On-Site Analysis Solutions for the Food\n### Industry\n\n][41]\nMarch 3, 2024\n\n### Advancing Dairy Nutrition: NeoSpectra & Cargill's Cloud-Based NIR Solution\n\n][42]\nJune 3, 2024\n\n### Ametller Origen Partners with NeoSpectra to Implement Innovative On-Site Food Testing Solutions\n\n][43]\nOctober 24, 2022\n\n### Si-Ware\u2019s NeoSpectra Platform Wins Product Showdown Award at the 2022 MEMS and Sensors Executive\n### Congress\n\n][44]\nJanuary 8, 2019\n\n### Si-Ware's NeoSpectra is the first spectrometer built into beauty product\n\n][45]\nOctober 7, 2019\n\n### Si-Ware Systems moves world's smallest spectral sensor into volume production\n\n][46]\nOctober 18, 2016\n\n### Si-Ware Systems launches European distribution of NeoSpectra sensor for handheld and inline\n### material analysis\n\n][47]\nJanuary 24, 2017\n\n### Si-Ware Systems introduces first fully integrated chip-sized spectral sensor for industrial and\n### consumer markets\n\n][48]\nMarch 8, 2016\n\n### Si-Ware Systems launches volume production of NeoSpectra Sensor for material analysis\n\n][49]\nFebruary 6, 2015\n\n### Si-Ware Systems' FT-IR spectrometer wins prestigious Prism award in the Test, Measurement,\n### Metrology category\n\n][50]\nApril 18, 2017\n\n### Si-Ware Systems announces NeoSpectra Micro Development Kits\n\n][51]\nSeptember 5, 2023\n\n### Si-Ware Systems and Eigenvector Research Announce the Integration of Solo Software with\n### NeoSpectra Platform for Enhanced NIR Calibration Model Development\n\n][52]\nNovember 30, 2022\n\n### Si-Ware Partners with Eurofins Agro to Explore Applications for Feeds and Forages\n\n][53]\nSeptember 28, 2021\n\n### New Partnership: Si-Ware Systems and Dairyland Laboratories partner to launch in-field dairy\n### feed analysis solution\n\n][54]\nJuly 13, 2023\n\n### Si-Ware Systems and Dairyland Laboratories Join Forces to Provide Holistic End-to-End Analytical\n### Solution to Feed Mills\n\n][55]\nMarch 13, 2023\n\n### Rock River Laboratory Advances its Feed Analysis Services Using the NeoSpectra Platform\n\n][56]\nFebruary 16, 2023\n\n### Si-Ware Partners with Cargill to Provide NeoSpectra Feed Analysis Solutions to the Dairy\n### Industry\n\n][57]\nSeptember 16, 2019\n\n### Si-Ware launches small, lightweight NeoSpectra Scanner for in-field material analysis\n\n][58]\nApril 21, 2022\n\n### New Partnership: NeoSpectra by Si-Ware Partners with AB Vista\u2019s Aunir to Offer Customers\n### Affordable NIR Calibration Choices for In-Field Analysis\n\n][59]\nFebruary 9, 2015\n\n### NeoSpectra sensors are used to help solve the world's food demand problems\n\n][60]\nMarch 31, 2022\n\n### New Partnership: NeoSpectra by Si-Ware and NutriControl provides customers with improved\n### solutions for accurate in-field materials analysis\n\n][61]\nMay 12, 2022\n\n### NeoSpectra by Si-Ware Signs New Distribution Agreement with Labnutris Laboratory to Offer\n### Portable Solutions to Farms, Processors, and Food Producers\n\n][62]\nOctober 6, 2022\n\n### Si-Ware Partners with AB Vista to Offer the NeoSpectra Platform to the Animal Feed Industry\n\n][63]\nJuly 20, 2022\n\n### NeoSpectra by Si-Ware Puts Customers, Technology First with Website Redesign\n\n][64]\nSeptember 30, 2022\n\n### NeoSpectra by Si-Ware Launches the NeoSpectra LabStore\n\n][65]\nSeptember 26, 2017\n\n### NeoSpectra Micro wins SEMI's MEMS & Sensor Technology Showcase award in Europe\n\n][66]\n\n## Ready to Power Your System with Next-Gen Spectral Sensing Technology?\n\nComplete the form, and one of our experts will contact you to discuss your needs and demonstrate how\nSi-Ware\u2019s sensing technologies can help optimize performance, streamline analysis, and enhance your\nproducts or operations.\n\n[Home][67][Technology][68][News][69][Insights][70][About us][71]\n\nProducts\n\n[Si-NIR Mini][72][Si-NIR Matrix][73][Si-NIR StreamLine][74][AgriLIMS][75][CropScout][76]\n\n101 Jefferson Drive, 1st Floor Menlo Park, CA 94025, USA\n\n][77][\n][78][\n[LinkedIn icon]\n][79][\n][80]\n[Privacy Policy][81]\n[Terms & Conditions][82]\n\n[1]: /material-sensing/si-nir-mini\n[2]: /material-sensing/si-nir-matrix\n[3]: /products/si-nir-mini-dvk\n[4]: /products/si-nir-matrix-dvk\n[5]: /products/si-nir-fibersense\n[6]: /compare\n[7]: /all-products\n[8]: /material-sensing/si-nir-streamline\n[9]: /products/si-nir-overline\n[10]: /compare\n[11]: /all-products\n[12]: /products/si-nir-flex\n[13]: /products/si-mir-core\n[14]: /products/si-mir-widerange\n[15]: /compare\n[16]: /all-products\n[17]"
          },
          {
            "url": "https://si-ware.com/contact",
            "text": "Products\nOEM Sensor\nIntegration-Ready Sensors\nDeployable Device\nField-Ready Analyzers\nInnovation Kit\nEmerging Tech Exploration\nOther\nInnovative solutions & software\nSi-NIR Mini\nThe smallest FT-NIR sensor built for integration\n][1][\nSi-NIR Matrix\nCompact OEM sensor delivering consistent readings from inconsistent materials\n][2][\nSi-NIR Mini DVK\nEasiest & fastest way to assess the world\u2019s smallest FT-NIR\n][3][\nSi-NIR Matrix DVK\nPlug-and-play toolkit for quick evaluation and prototyping of heterogeneous material analysis\n][4][\nSi-NIR FiberSense\nRemote FT-NIR spectral sensing through robust fiber connectivity\n][5]\nStart Comparing\n][6][\nAll Products\n][7]\nSi-NIR StreamLine\nAdaptable Process-deployable FT-NIR for in-line, on-line use in factories and fields\n][8][\nSi-NIR OverLine\nRugged FT-NIR for contactless continuous analysis of materials in motion\n][9]\nStart Comparing\n][10][\nAll Products\n][11]\nSi-NIR Flex\nDevelopment platform for NIR analysis with configurable setup\n][12][\nSi-MIR Core\nCompact MIR sensor enabling accurate transmission-based analysis\n][13][\nSi-MIR WideRange\nMulti-purpose MIR spectral sensing platform covering key fingerprint regions\n][14]\nStart Comparing\n][15][\nAll Products\n][16]\nSensing Software Platform\nAgriLIMS\nTech with ag labs in mind\n][17]\nTurnkey Sensing Solutions\nCropScout\nCrop Care on Autopilot\n][18]\n[Technology][19]\nInsights\nBlogs\n][20][[Orange icon of a notepad with three horizontal lines representing text.]\nApplication Notes\n][21]\nCompany\nAbout Us\n][22][\nTeam\n][23][[Orange and gray stylized speech bubble icon with horizontal lines representing text.]\nNews\n][24][[Orange distribution network icon with interconnected nodes around a central circle containing\na location pin.]\nDistributors\n][25][[Orange rectangular image with two stylized white shapes resembling the letter 'E' rotated and\nstacked.]\nCertifications\n][26][[Orange briefcase icon with a white plus symbol in the center.]\nCareers\n][27]\n[Contact][28][Order Now][29]\n[Cookie settings]\nContact Us\n\n# Get in touch\n\nHave questions or need assistance with our solutions? Our team is here to help! Fill out the form\nbelow or contact us directly, and we'll respond promptly.\nThank you for choosing Si-Ware Systems!\n\nFollow us on\n[[Facebook icon linking to Si-Ware Systems company profile]][30][[LinkedIn icon linking to Si-Ware\nSystems company profile]][31][[Twitter logo]][32]\n[Abstract blue and orange communication icons including email, chat, phone, and mobile device\narranged with curved lines.]\n\n### Offices\n\n# USA\n\n101 Jefferson Drive, 1st Floor Menlo Park, CA 94025\n\n][33][+1 650 257 9680][34]\n\n# France\n\n16 Rue Portalis, Paris 75008\n\n][35][\n+33 757 905 138][36]\n\n# EGYPT\n\n3, Khaled Ibn Al-Waleed St.Sheraton, Heliopolis, Cairo 11361\n\n][37][+20 222 68 47 04][38]\n[Home][39][Technology][40][News][41][Insights][42][About us][43]\n\nProducts\n\n[Si-NIR Mini][44][Si-NIR Matrix][45][Si-NIR StreamLine][46][AgriLIMS][47][CropScout][48]\n\n101 Jefferson Drive, 1st Floor Menlo Park, CA 94025, USA\n\n][49][\n][50][\n[LinkedIn icon]\n][51][\n][52]\n[Privacy Policy][53]\n[Terms & Conditions][54]\n\n[1]: /material-sensing/si-nir-mini\n[2]: /material-sensing/si-nir-matrix\n[3]: /products/si-nir-mini-dvk\n[4]: /products/si-nir-matrix-dvk\n[5]: /products/si-nir-fibersense\n[6]: /compare\n[7]: /all-products\n[8]: /material-sensing/si-nir-streamline\n[9]: /products/si-nir-overline\n[10]: /compare\n[11]: /all-products\n[12]: /products/si-nir-flex\n[13]: /products/si-mir-core\n[14]: /products/si-mir-widerange\n[15]: /compare\n[16]: /all-products\n[17]: /software/agrilims\n[18]: /sensing-solutions/cropscout\n[19]: /technology\n[20]: /insights/blogs\n[21]: /insights/application-notes\n[22]: /company/about-us\n[23]: /company/team\n[24]: /company/news\n[25]: /company/distributors\n[26]: /company/certifications\n[27]: https://siwaresystems.recruitee.co