      "key_products": "Si-NIR Mini, Si-NIR Matrix, Si-MIR Core, Si-NIR StreamLine, Si-NIR FiberSense",
      "polished_summary": "Si-Ware Systems is a deep-tech innovation powerhouse specializing in advanced sensing technologies that seamlessly integrate the physical and digital worlds. The company offers a range of cutting-edge products, including compact FT-NIR and MIR sensors, development kits, and versatile analysis platforms, catering to manufacturers and developers across industries such as agri-food, industrial automation, pharmaceuticals, and environmental monitoring. Through its innovative solutions, Si-Ware enhances perception, automation, and interaction in various applications.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Si-Ware Systems manufactures advanced spectral sensors, including FT-NIR and MIR sensors, which are directly applicable to the spectral sensor market. Their products, such as the Si-NIR Mini and Si-MIR Core, are designed for various applications including industrial automation and environmental monitoring, making them a key player in this market.",
