to provide top-end, flexible solutions.\n  \n  [Learn More][163] \u00a0\u203a\n* Shop Zygo Store\n  Visit Zygo's online store to access all products, parts, and more\n  [Shop Now][164] \u00a0\u203a\n* [carousel_banner_aerospace]\n  Solutions for the Aerospace Industry\n  \n  Zygo-Navitar offers the leading metrology and imaging solutions to aerospace customers through\n  precision manufacturing to ensure the highest level of quality control and regulation compliance.\n  \n  [Learn More][165] \u00a0\u203a\n* BioFilm Measurement\n  The ZeGage Optical Profiler employs low\u00a0coherence interference patterns to measure surface\n  profiles with nanometer precision, making it ideal for capturing the detailed topography of\n  biofilms.\n  [BioFilm][166] \u00a0\u203a\n* Respected Worldwide for Leading Edge Optical Solutions\n  \n  We consistently and repeatedly deliver high-energy laser components and systems under extremely\n  tight manufacturing tolerances. Learn more about our capabilities within the defense industry.\n  \n  [Learn More][167] \u00a0\u203a\n* [career]\n  Work With Us\n  \n  Zygo is home to some of the most brilliant minds and top talent in our industry. Join our team!\n  \n  [Search Jobs][168] \u00a0\u203a\nWhat's New at ZYGO\n[[...]][169]\n[Large-Area Superpolishing of Optical Flats: When Angstrom-Level Precision Matters][170]\nJune 08, 2026\n[Bare\u2011Polished Additively-Manufactured SiC Fast Steering Mirrors for Directed Energy][171]\nMay 29, 2026\n[Protection Against Residual Currents - White Light Interferometer Testing of RCCB Functional\nSurfaces][172]\nMay 18, 2026\n[Measuring Off-Axis Parabolic Mirrors][173]\nMay 13, 2026\n[ZYGO SHOWCASES ADVANCED 3D OPTICAL METROLOGY SOLUTIONS AT OPTATEC 2026][174]\nApril 15, 2026\n[Brilliantly Boring Optics \u2013 Amazing Results, Boring Consistency][175]\nMarch 06, 2026\n[Characterizing a Plane Parallel Window with a Multiple Surface Tester (MST)][176]\nMarch 06, 2026\n[Computer Generated Hologram (CGH) Data Processing][177]\nMarch 06, 2026\n\n### Upcoming Events\n* Jul 07 -\n  Jul 9, 2026\n  [SPIE Astronomical Telescopes + Instrumentation 2026][178]\n  Denmark\n* Jul 19 -\n  Jul 22, 2026\n  [UGIM 2026][179]\n  USA\n* Aug 11 -\n  Aug 13, 2026\n  [Space and Missile Defense Symposium][180]\n  United States\n* Aug 23 -\n  Aug 26, 2026\n  [Small Sat][181]\n  United States\n* Aug 25 -\n  Aug 27, 2026\n  [SPIE Optics & Photonics][182]\n  United States\n\n\u00d7\nForgotPassword\n\n##### Submit to reset password\n\nEmail*\n\u00d7\nWelcome!\n\n##### If you do not have a user account for this website, please click the REGISTER button below.\n\nEmail\nPassword\n[Forgot Password][183]\nSign In [Register][184]\n\n\nFirst Name\nLast Name\nLabel\nPhone Number\nLabel\nE-mail Address\nLabel\nCompany or Organization\nLabel\nJob Title or Function\nStreet Address\nCity\nCountry Afghanistan Aland Islands Albania Algeria Andorra Angola Anguilla Antarctica Antigua and\nBarbuda Argentina Armenia Aruba Australia Austria Azerbaijan Bahamas Bahrain Banglades"
