      "polished_summary": "Zygo is a leading provider of advanced optical metrology solutions, specializing in 3D optical profilers and laser interferometers. The company offers a diverse range of products, including the Nexview\u2122 and Verifire\u2122 series, designed for precision measurements in industries such as aerospace, automotive, semiconductor, and medical devices. With a commitment to innovation and quality, Zygo serves a global market by delivering cutting-edge technology and comprehensive support for various optical applications.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Zygo manufactures advanced optical metrology solutions, including 3D optical profilers and laser interferometers, which are directly relevant to the spectral sensor market. Their products are designed for precision measurements in various industries, indicating a strong alignment with the target market.",
