ver. with every pulse.\n\n[Learn more][166]\n\nweb seminar Expert talk with ChemiLytics\n\nComplex matrices: Mastering digestion and measurement in ICP-OES and AAS\n\n**July 2, 2026 10:00 AM CEST**\n\n[Sign up for free][167]\n\nweb seminar from expert task to lab routine\n\nMembrane protein purification and analysis simplified\n\nJune 30, 2026 4:00 PM CEST (7:30 PM IST)\n\n[Register for free][168]\n\nslide left\n* together\n* PlasmaQuant 9200 series\n* PULSEspencer\n* web seminar\n* web-seminar\nslide right\n\n# your partner in sucessful lab analysis\n\n**As a global and leading supplier of analytical instrumentation, molecular biology instruments,\nliquid handling and laboratory automation technologies, Analytik Jena empowers laboratories around\nthe world to work quickly and successfully - from routine analysis to specialized tasks in the\nfields of chemistry, pharmaceuticals, medicine and life science, food safety and agriculture, water\nand wastewater analysis, environmental analysis and much more.**\n\n## precision and reliability for your lab workflow\n\n[\n\nChemical Analysis\n\nLearn more\n\n][169]\n[\n\nLife Science\n\nLearn more\n\n][170]\n[\n\nLiquid Handling & Automation\n\nLearn more\n\n][171]\n\n## at home in many different worlds the best solutions for applications in your industry\n\n## more about us\n\n[\n\nCustomers\n\nSuccess Stories\n\nLearn More\n\n][172]\n[\n\nEndress + Hauser\n\nAnalytik Jena within the Endress+Hauser Group\n\nVisit Endress + Hauser\n\n][173]\n[\n\nService & Support\n\nLearn more\n\n][174]\n[\n\nEndress + Hauser\n\nAnalytik Jena within the Endress+Hauser Group\n\nVisit Endress + Hauser\n\n][175]\n[\nlab-loving people Contact\n][176] [ Back to top ][177]\n[Analytik Jena Logo]\n\nFollow Analytik Jena\n* [ Facebook ][178]\n* [ LinkedIn ][179]\n* [ YouTube ][180]\n* [ Instagram ][181]\n\nCountry\n* India\n* [Global][182]\n* [Germany][183]\n* [United States][184]\n* [France][185]\n* [Russia][186]\n* [Japan][187]\n* [Korea][188]\n* 