**July 2, 2026 10:00 AM CEST**\n\n[Sign up for free][167]\n\nweb seminar from expert task to lab routine\n\nMembrane protein purification and analysis simplified\n\nJune 30, 2026 4:00 PM CEST (7:30 PM IST)\n\n[Register for free][168]\n\nslide left\n* together\n* PlasmaQuant 9200 series\n* PULSEspencer\n* web seminar\n* web-seminar\nslide right\n\n# your partner in sucessful lab analysis\n\n**As a global and leading supplier of analytical instrumentation, molecular biology instruments,\nliquid handling and laboratory automation technologies, Analytik Jena empowers laboratories around\nthe world to work quickly and successfully - from routine analysis to specialized tasks in the\nfields of chemistry, pharmaceuticals, medicine and life science, food safety and agriculture, water\nand wastewater analysis, environmental analysis and much more.**\n\n## precision and reliability for your lab workflow\n\n[\n\nChemical Analysis\n\nLearn more\n\n][169]\n[\n\nLife Science\n\nLearn more\n\n][170]\n[\n\nLiquid Handling & Automation\n\nLearn more\n\n][171]\n\n## at home in many different worlds the best solutions for applications in your industry\n\n## more about us\n\n[\n\nCustomers\n\nSuccess Stories\n\nLearn More\n\n][172]\n[\n\nEndress + Hauser\n\nAnalytik Jena within the Endress+Hauser Group\n\nVisit Endress + Hauser\n\n][173]\n[\n\nService & Support\n\nLearn more\n\n][174]\n[\n\nEndress + Hauser\n\nAnalytik Jena within the Endress+Hauser Group\n\nVisit Endress + Hauser\n\n][175]\n[\nlab-loving people Contact\n][176] [ Back to top ][177]\n[Analytik Jena Logo]\n\nFollow Analytik Jena\n* [ Facebook ][178]\n* [ LinkedIn ][179]\n* [ YouTube ][180]\n* [ Instagram ][181]\n\nCountry\n* India\n* [Global][182]\n* [Germany][183]\n* [United States][184]\n* [France][185]\n* [Russia][186]\n* [Japan][187]\n* [Korea][188]\n* [China][189]\n\nCookie settings\n\nCheck and adjust your cookie settings here.\n\n[Edit settings][190]\n* [Products][191]\n  * [Chemical Analysis][192]\n  * [Life Science][193]\n  * [Liquid Handling & Automation][194]\n* [Industries & Solutions][195]\n  * [Industries][196]\n  * [Solutions][197]\n  * [Focus Applications][198]\n  * [Applications][199]\n  * [Product Finder][200]\n* [Knowledge][201]\n  * [e-Learning][202]\n  * [Whitepapers][203]\n  * [Applications][204]\n  * [Focus Applications][205]\n  * [Standards & Norms \u2013 Product Finder][206]\n  * [Brochures & Flyers][207]\n  * [Blog][208]\n  * [Q & A][209]\n  * [Extranet][210]\n* [Service & Support][211]\n  * [Service Overview][212]\n  * [Application Support][213]\n  * [Technical Support][214]\n  * [Modular Service Contracts][215]\n  * [Contact us][216]\n  * [Replacement Upgrade Options][217]\n* [Company][218]\n  * [About][219]\n  * [Customers][220]\n  * [Partners][221]\n  * [News & Press][222]\n  * [Events][223]\n  * [Global Contacts][224]\n  * [Certifications][225]\n  * [Careers][226]\n* [Imprint][227]\n* [Privacy Policy][228]\n* [Contact][229]\n* [Conditions of Use][230]\n* [Warranty Conditions][231]\n* [Terms & Conditions][232]\n* [Code of Conduct][233]\n\n\u00a9\u00a0Analytik Jena GmbH+Co.\u00a0KG 2026\n\nThis website uses cookies\n\nTo optimize our website and offer you relevant content and personalized advertising, we access\ninformation (e.g. device recognition, browser information) in your terminal device and store this\ninformation (such as cookies or other technologies) in your terminal device. In this way, we measure\nhow and with what you use our offers. We also share the (personal) data collected in the process\nwith third parties. By clicking \u201cAccept all\u201d, you agree (revocable at any time for the future) to\nthe storage and data processing.\n\nIn the [settings][234] you can individually adjust your voluntary consent at any time or\ngrant/withdraw consent for individual purposes. You can find more information in the [privacy\npolicy][235].\n\nIf you are under 16 and wish to give your consent to voluntary services, you must ask your legal\nguardian for permission.\n\nNote on data transfer outside the EU: In some cases, data might be processed outside the European\nUnion in the context of the use of third-party services. This only takes place if the special\nrequirements of Art. 44 et seq. GDPR are fulfilled. Data is transmitted for the purpose of compiling\nstatistics and implementing marketing measures. Further information can be found in our [privacy\npolicy][236].\n* [Imprint][237]\n* [Privacy Policy][238]\nSelect all Only necessary Adjust settings\n\nConsent Management\n\nWe respect your right to privacy. You can decide for yourself which types of cookies you want to\naccept when visiting the website and which not.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nCate\u2502Description                                                                               \u2502Stat\ngory\u2502                                                                                          \u2502us  \n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2