      "polished_summary": "FLIR Systems is a leading provider of advanced thermal imaging and sensing solutions, specializing in handheld and fixed thermal cameras, gas detection systems, and portable inspection software. The company serves a diverse range of markets, including first responders, industrial applications, transportation, and security, offering innovative products designed to enhance safety, efficiency, and operational effectiveness across various sectors.",
