      "company_summary": "GL Optic specializes in rehousing vintage and modern lenses for professional filmmaking, transforming them into robust, cinema-grade tools with enhanced durability and precise focus control. The company offers a diverse range of products, including the innovative MKV housing, specialty lenses, and comprehensive lens sets, catering to cinematographers and filmmakers seeking high-quality optical solutions for their productions. With a commitment to preserving the unique character of beloved lenses while ensuring compatibility with industry standards, GL Optic empowers creatives to elevate their cinematography.",
