        "crawl_text": "[SHOP][1][MKV][2][LEGACY][3][FAQs][4][CONTACT][5][CREDITS][6]\n0\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nProduct Name\nOption 1 / Option 2 / Option 3\nProduct Discount (-$0)\nCOUPON1 (-$0)\n$0\n$0\n-\nThank you! Your submission has been received!\nOops! Something went wrong while submitting the form.\n+\nThere's Literally Nothing Here\nSubtotal\n$0\nOrder Discount\n-$0\nCOUPON2\n-$0\nDeposit\n$0\n[Checkout][7]\nSpecialty Lenses\nLens Sets\nZoom Lenses\n0\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nProduct Name\nOption 1 / Option 2 / Option 3\nProduct Discount (-$0)\nCOUPON1 (-$0)\n$0\n$0\n-\nThank you! Your submission has been received!\nOops! Something went wrong while submitting the form.\n+\nThere's Literally Nothing Here\nSubtotal\n$0\nOrder Discount\n-$0\nCOUPON2\n-$0\nTotal\n$0\n[Checkout][8]\n[\nFAQs\n][9][\nLegacy\n][10][\nMKV\n][11][\nContact\n][12][\nCredits\n][13]\n[\nBuild Your Set\n][14][\nSpecialty\n][15][\nZooms\n][16]\n[\n][17]\n\n# MEET\u00a0THE\u00a0MKV\n\nThe Mk V's revolutionary design isn't just about aesthetics and performance. Its expanded 110mm\nhousing and meticulously engineered internals allow us to delve deeper, break down, and rehouse a\nwider range of coveted vintage lenses than ever before. This translates to an unparalleled selection\n\u2013 explore a universe of creative possibilities with over 20 coveted vintage prime sets and 5 classic\nzoom lenses. From legendary names like Zeiss Super Speeds to Mamiya 645N, the Mk V empowers you to\ntell your stories with iconic vintage optics paralleled with the enduring performance of\nmeticulously crafted modern mechanics.\n\n[\nLearn\u00a0More\n][18][\nShop\u00a0The\u00a0MKV\n][19]\n\n## Specialty Lenses\n\nExplore our range of CANON & LAOWA SINGLE\u00a0LENSES\n\nProfessionally rehoused and tuned by GLO, these single lenses are a great option for completing your\nexisting sets or for smaller projects.\n\n[\nShow\u00a0Now\n][20]\n\n## Lens Sets\n\nWe've got you covered from Angenieux to zeiss\n\nExplore GLO's extensive collection of rehoused lens sets. From vintage to modern, from Soviet to\nJapanese, we've got them all.\nBuild your set today.\n\n[\nShop\u00a0Now\n][21]\n\n## Zoom Lenses\n\nversatile, adaptable - explore our selection of zoom lenses.\n\nThe GLO rehoused zoom lenses are reliable and high quality alternatives to lens sets, allowing you\nto be more agile on set, while saving on budget.\n\n[\nShop\u00a0Now\n][22]\n\n# STEP\u00a01\n\n# PICKING\u00a0DONOR\u00a0GLASS\n\nRehousing a lens transforms your favorite optics, both vintage and modern, into robust, cinema-grade\ntools, perfect for professional filmmaking. By upgrading to the GL Optics MKV housing, you gain\nprecise focus control, enhanced durability, and compatibility with industry-standard gear. This\nprocess ensures your lenses can handle the demands of a film set while delivering consistent\nperformance across all your focal lengths. Whether you're looking to preserve the unique character\nof a beloved lens or create a uniform, high-quality lens set for your productions, rehousing offers\na cost-effective solution that elevates your cinematography to the next level.\n\n### Brands we support\n\nAsahi\nAngenieux\nCanon\nLeica\nLomo\nLaowa\nMamiya\nMinolta\nNikon\nPentax\nRubin\nZeiss\n... and more\n\n# STEP\u00a02\n\n# REHOUSING\n\nGL Optics carefully extract the most valuable part of your donor lens - The Glass. The glass in many\ncases is good enough for professional production, what makes these donor lenses unsuitable are their\nout of standards housings with short focus rotation, non uniform front diameters, and inferior\ninternal mechanisms. In some cases, GL optics will add certain in house developed optical elements\nto correct for undesirable qualities such as chromatic aberrations, focus breathing and vignetting.\n\n# STEP\u00a03\n\n# GO MAKE HISTORY\n\nAnd Voila, you now have a rehoused lens with a wide focus rotation angle, premium finishes, accurate\nmarkings, consistent front diameter, and a modern sleek design. We have retained the soul of your\nlens, and made it fit seamlessly into a modern production environment. Ready to get started?\n\n[\nShop\u00a0The\u00a0MKV\n][23]\n[[Untitled UI logotext]][24]\nJoin our newsletter to stay up to date on new releases.\nWe care [SHOP][1][MKV][2][LEGACY][3][FAQs][4][CONTACT][5][CREDITS][6]\n0\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nProduct Name\nOption 1 / Option 2 / Option 3\nProduct Discount (-$0)\nCOUPON1 (-$0)\n$0\n$0\n-\nThank you! Your submission has been received!\nOops! Something went wrong while submitting the form.\n+\nThere's Literally Nothing Here\nSubtotal\n$0\nOrder Discount\n-$0\nCOUPON2\n-$0\nDeposit\n$0\n[Checkout][7]\nSpecialty Lenses\nLens Sets\nZoom Lenses\n0\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nProduct Name\nOption 1 / Option 2 / Option 3\nProduct Discount (-$0)\nCOUPON1 (-$0)\n$0\n$0\n-\nThank you! Your submission has been received!\nOops! Something went wrong while submitting the form.\n+\nThere's Literally Nothing Here\nSubtotal\n$0\nOrder Discount\n-$0\nCOUPON2\n-$0\nTotal\n$0\n[Checkout][8]\n[\nFAQs\n][9][\nLegacy\n][10][\nMKV\n][11][\nContact\n][12][\nCredits\n][13]\n[\nBuild Your Set\n][14][\nSpecialty\n][15][\nZooms\n][16]\n[\n][17]\n\n# MEET\u00a0THE\u00a0MKV\n\nThe Mk V's revolutionary design isn't just about aesthetics and performance. Its expanded 110mm\nhousing and meticulously engineered internals allow us to delve deeper, break down, and rehouse a\nwider range of coveted vintage lenses than ever before. This translates to an unparalleled selection\n\u2013 explore a universe of creative possibilities with over 20 coveted vintage prime sets and 5 classic\nzoom lenses. From legendary names like Zeiss Super Speeds to Mamiya 645N, the Mk V empowers you to\ntell your stories with iconic vintage optics paralleled with the enduring performance of\nmeticulously crafted modern mechanics.\n\n[\nLearn\u00a0More\n][18][\nShop\u00a0The\u00a0MKV\n][19]\n\n## Specialty Lenses\n\nExplore our range of CANON & LAOWA SINGLE\u00a0LEN