India\u2019s most advanced state of the art manufacturing hub\nfor all kinds of Optics and Optical Instruments. The company has rich history of designing and\ndeveloping optics for complex systems ranging from night vision binoculars to highly advanced laser\ncutting optics along with contribution to many more high end optical systems in field of defence and\nmedical.\n\nDirector\u2019s Sh. Hitesh Kumar Sharma and late Sh. Dinesh Kumar Sharma with combined experience of more\nthen 50 years are continuing the legacy to deliever industry standard optics across all industrial\nverticals PAN India. The company committed approach to provide nothing less then world class optics\nand designing complex optical systems has garnered it various accolades from government and\nnon-government organisations and has now become the first choice for many when it comes to buying\noptics.\n\n### Need help? Call our award-winning support team at +91-9988166725, 9888877542, 9216112732\n\n#### Products\n* [ Optical Lenses ][127]\n* [ Optical Mirrors ][128]\n* [ Optical Filters ][129]\n* [ Windows & Diffusers ][130]\n\n#### Products\n* [ Prisms ][131]\n* [ Beamsplitters ][132]\n* [ Parallel Plates & Wedges ][133]\n* [ Imaging Telecentric Lenses ][134]\n\n#### Know More\n* [ About Us ][135]\n* [ Facilities ][136]\n* Partners\n* [ Contact Us ][137]\n\n\u00a9 Accurate Optics India 2024. All rights reserved\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: tel:+91-9988166725\n[3]: tel:+91-9888877542\n[4]: tel:+91-9216112732\n[5]: mailto:accurateoptics136@gmail.com\n[6]: https://www.accurateopticsindia.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/ISO-Certification.pdf\n[7]: https://www.facebook.com/accurateoptics\n[8]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/accurateoptics/\n[9]: https://www.instagram.com/accurateoptics/\n[10]: https://www.pinterest.com/accurateoptics/%20\n[11]: #\n[12]: https://www.accurateopticsindia.com/optical-lenses/\n[13]: https://www.accurateopticsindia.com/optical-mirrors/\n[14]: https://www.accurateopticsindia.com/opti