        "crawl_text": "Advanced Photonics India India 619, Nirmal Lifestyles Corporate Center, LBS Marg Mulund West, Mumbai 400080, Maharashtra, India India Pan-India Skip to content\n\nHome\n\nAbout Expand\n\nFrom the desk of director\n\nAbout Team\n\nProducts\n\nProjects\n\nResources Expand\n\nVideos\n\nCalculators\n\nPrincipal\n\nAchievements\n\nMake In India\n\nContact Us\n\nToggle Menu\n\nProviding Precision\nLaser Solutions\n\nAbout Company\n\nSince its inception in 1989 we have maintained our focus on the Photonics, bringing best products and services in Indian market from all over the world.\nApart from sales and service business, we are also evolving as a major system integrator in the niche photonics technology.\n\nRead More\n\nProducts\n\nServing the Photonics fraternity since 1989&#8230;\n\nMAKE IN INDIA - FIBER OPTICS EDUCATIONAL KIT\n\nDesigned and Developed by Advanced Photonics, India\n\nLearning Basics of Fiber Optics through Experiments Theory to Lab to Applications\nThis kit has been designed by our engineers based on their experience while performing fiber optic related experiments during their post graduate programme in photonics. Unlike most of the project kits available in market, these experiments are not simply plug-in or turn-key type where students just need to vary inputs and record corresponding outputs to plot a graph &#8230;..\n\nRead More\n\nQuick Links\n\n+ Home\n\n+ About Us\n\n+ Projects\n\n+ Principal\n\n+ Achivements\n\nProducts\n\n+ Lasers\n\n+ Incoherent Light Sources\n\n+ Optics &amp; Opto-Machanics\n\n+ Fiber Optics\n\n+ Motion Control\n\n+ Spectroscopy &amp; Imaging\n\n+ Measurement &amp; Manipulation\n\n+ Quantum Technology\n\n+ Sky Imager\n\n+ Photonics Assembly &amp; Testing\n\nQuick Links\n\n+ Home\n\n+ About Us\n\n+ Projects\n\n+ Principal\n\n+ Achivements\n\nConnect with Us\n\nCorporate Office :\n\n619, Nirmal Lifestyles Corporate Center,\nLBS Marg Mulund West, Mumbai 400080\n\nEmail :\n\nsales@advancedphotonicsindia.com\n\nPhone :+91-22-3504 8294\n\n\u00a9 copyright all rights reserved by A. P. India.\n\nSite powered by Om Visuals\n\nHome\n\nAbout Toggle child menu Expand\n\nFrom the desk of director\n\nAbout Team\n\nProducts\n\nProjects\n\nResources Toggle child menu Expand\n\nVideos\n\nCalculators\n\nPrincipal\n\nAchievements\n\nMake In India\n\nContact Us [Skip to content][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [About[Expand]][3]\n* [From the desk of director][4]\n* [About Team][5]\n* [Products][6]\n* [Projects][7]\n* Resources[Expand]\n* [Videos][8]\n* [Calculators][9]\n* [Principal][10]\n* [Achievements][11]\n* [Make In India][12]\n* [Contact Us][13]\n[Toggle Menu]\n\n## About\n\n## From Director's Desk\n\n## B M Prasad\n\n## PhD (IIT Mumbai)\n\n**Dear Researcher, **\n\nIt is a great moment for me to bring out our new website. We continuously strive to bring newer and\nbetter products for benefit of our customers.\nSince inception in 1989, we have maintained our focus in the field of photonics and lasers. I\npersonally feel photonics is a great field. At Advanced Photonics we work very hard to bring\nproducts and services related to this field. We are the only company which has complete offering\nlight source, optics and optical hardware and optical detection system. We are a team of very well\nqualified and highly motivated technical people. Apart from selling standard equipment we undertake\nprojects that involve complete solution and systems integration.\nPlease be assured that if you can think of problem which will involve photonics solution in most\nlikelihood we will be the one who will be able to supply you the products. Please give us a call for\nany of your research problems which can be solved using tools from photonics, we shall be happy to\nassist with products and solutions.\n\n## Quick Links\n\n## [+ Home][14]\n\n## [+ About Us][15]\n\n## [+ Projects][16]\n\n## [+ Principal][17]\n\n## [+ Achivements][18]\n\n## Products\n\n## [+ Lasers][19]\n\n## [+ Incoherent Light Sources][20]\n\n## [+ Optics & Opto-Machanics][21]\n\n## [+ Fiber Optics][22]\n\n## [+ Motion Control][23]\n\n## [+ Spectroscopy & Imaging][24]\n\n## [+ Measurement & Manipulation][25]\n\n## [+ Quantum Technology][26]\n\n## [+ Sky Imager][27]\n\n## [+ Photonics Assembly & Testing][28]\n\n## Quick Links\n\n## [+ Home][29]\n\n## [+ About Us][30]\n\n## [+ Projects][31]\n\n## [+ Principal][32]\n\n## [+ Achivements][33]\n\n## Connect with Us\n\n## Corporate Office :\n\n## 619, Nirmal Lifestyles Corporate Center, LBS Marg Mulund West, Mumbai 400080\n\n## Email :\n\n## sales@advancedphotonicsindia.com\n\n**Phone**:+91-22-3504 8294\n\n## \u00a9 copyright all rights reserved by A. P. India.\n\n## Site powered by Om Visuals\n* [Home][34]\n* [About][35]Toggle child menu[Expand]\n* [From the desk of director][36]\n* [About Team][37]\n* [Products][38]\n* [Projects][39]\n* ResourcesToggle child menu[Expand]\n* [Videos][40]\n* [Calculators][41]\n* [Principal][42]\n* [Achievements][43]\n* [Make In India][44]\n* [Contact Us][45]\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: https://advancedphotonicsindia.com/\n[3]: https://advancedphotonicsindia.com/about/\n[4]: https://advancedphotonicsindia.com/about/\n[5]: https://advancedphotonicsindia.com/about-team/\n[6]: https://advancedphotonicsindia.com/products/\n[7]: https://advancedphotonicsindia.com/projects/\n[8]: https://advancedphotonicsindia.com/videos/\n[9]: https://advancedphotonicsindia.com/literature-2/\n[10]: https://advancedphotonicsindia.com/principal/\n[11]: https://advancedphotonicsindia.com/achievements/\n[12]: https://advancedphotonicsindia.com/light-sources-2/\n[13]: https://advancedphotonicsindia.com/contact-us/\n[14]: https://advancedphotonicsindia.com/\n[15]: https://advancedphotonicsindia.com/about/\n[16]: https://advancedphotonicsindia.com/projects/\n[17]: https://advancedphotonicsindia.com/principal/\n[18]: https://advancedphotonicsindia.com/achievements/\n[19]: https://advancedphotonicsindia.com/lasers/\n[20]: https://advancedphotonicsindia.com/incohere