      "key_products": "Lasers, Spectroscopy & Imaging, Fiber Optics, Quantum Technology, Photonics Assembly & Testing",
      "polished_summary": "Advanced Photonics India has been a leader in precision laser solutions and photonics technology since 1989, catering to a diverse range of sectors including education, research, telecommunications, healthcare, and manufacturing. The company offers an extensive portfolio of products such as lasers, incoherent light sources, optics and opto-mechanics, fiber optics, and advanced measurement tools, serving research institutions, educational institutes, and various industries that require innovative photonics applications.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Advanced Photonics India manufactures and offers a wide range of photonics products, including lasers, incoherent light sources, optics, and spectroscopy tools, which are directly relevant to the spectral sensor market. They also engage in system integration for photonics technology, further solidifying their relevance.",
