      "website": "agatesensors.com",
      "is_seed": false,
      "company_function": "vendor",
      "company_summary": "Agate Sensors is a pioneering company specializing in ultra-miniaturized hyperspectral intelligence, offering the world's first software-defined hyperspectral platform. Their innovative technology delivers lab-grade precision in a compact, mass-manufacturable format, enabling applications across diverse sectors such as defense, advanced imaging, and wearables. By providing programmable sensing capabilities that adapt and evolve through AI, Agate Sensors is poised to unlock new layers of insight and enhance decision-making in demanding environments.",
