      "key_products": "Custom Optics, Stock Glass Optics, Plastic Optics, Beamsplitters, Lenses",
      "polished_summary": "Alignoptics is a leading provider of affordable stock and custom optical components, specializing in tailored solutions to meet diverse customer specifications. Their product offerings include custom optics, pre-manufactured glass optics, and lightweight plastic optics, catering to industries such as aerospace, education, medical, and scientific research. With a commitment to competitive pricing and quality, Alignoptics serves businesses seeking both standard and specialized optical solutions.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Alignoptics manufactures and supplies a variety of optical components, including custom optics and stock glass optics, which are relevant to the spectral sensor market. Their products cater to industries such as aerospace, medical, and scientific research, indicating a direct involvement in sectors that utilize spectral sensors.",
