            "text": "[Back to top][1]\n[ [CRESCENT COMPONENTS AND SYSTEMS] ][2]\n[CRESCENT COMPONENTS AND SYSTEMS\nGST : 07ASTPG2703P1ZA][3]\n\nCall us now :08045476033\n\n[[Send Inquiry] Send Inquiry][4]\n* [Home Page][5]\n* [Company Profile][6]\n* [ Our Products ][7]\n  * [Optics-Optical Components][8]\n    * [Convex and Concave Spherical Lenses][9]\n    * [Optical Wedge / Optical Flat][10]\n    * [Neutral Density Filter][11]\n    * [Flat Mirrors][12]\n    * [Achromatic Lenses][13]\n    * [Mounted Linear Polarizers][14]\n    * [Mounted Optical Interference Filter][15]\n    * [Cylindrical Lenses][16]\n    * [Plate Beam Splitters][17]\n    * [Optical Windows][18]\n  * [Opto-Mechanical Mounts ][19]\n    * [Pedestal Posts][20]\n    * [Micro meter Head][21]\n    * [Mounting Posts. Post Holders and Base Plates][22]\n    * [Pedestal Post Clamp][23]\n    * [Polariser Mount][24]\n    * [He Ne Laser Mounts][25]\n    * [Mount for Prisms and Cube Beam Splitters][26]\n    * [Mount For Square / Rectangular Optics][27]\n    * [Lens Mount][28]\n    * [Iris Diaphragms - Variable Apertures with Mount][29]\n    * [Kinematic Mirror Mount][30]\n  * [Lasers ][31]\n    * [He Ne Laser][32]\n    * [Fiber Coupled Diode Laser][33]\n    * [Fiber Laser][34]\n    * [Blue Diode Laser module 450nm][35]\n    * [Red Diode Laser Module 635nm][36]\n    * [Green Diode Laser Module 532nm][37]\n    * [IR Diode Laser Module 808nm][38]\n    * [Diode Pumped Solid State Lasers 1064nm][39]\n    * [Laser Protection Goggles][40]\n  * [Opto-mechanical Assemblies][41]\n    * [Circular Variable Neutral Density Filters][42]\n    * [Spatial Filter Assembly][43]\n    * [Laser Beam Expander][44]\n  * [Manual and Motorised Stages, Lab Jack][45]\n    * [Linear Translation Stages][46]\n    * [35mm Linear Translation Stage][47]\n    * [Lab Jack][48]\n  * [Optical Breadboard and Vibration Isolation Table][49]\n    * [Honeycomb Breadboard Optical table][50]\n  * [Laser Detection and Measurement][51]\n    * [Laser Power Meter][52]\n  * [Imaging Systems][53]\n    * [Microscopic Camera][54]\n  * [Adaptive Optics][55]\n    * [Tip Tilt Mirror][56]\n    * [Lenslet Array][57]\n  * [Phase Singular Optics][58]\n    * [Spiral Phase Plate / Vortex Lens][59]\n    * [Zero Order Vortex Half Wave Retarder][60]\n  * [Interferometers][61]\n    * [Michaelson Interferometer][62]\n    * [Mach Zehnder Interferometer][63]\n  * [Laser Protection Eye Wear Goggles][64]\n* [Contact Us][65]\n[[Banner]][66] [[Banner]][67] [[Banner]][68] [[Banner]][69]\n**We specialise in Scientific Components and Equipment, Spatial Filter Assembly, Beam Expander,\nSpherical Lenses, Achromatic Lenses, Optical / Fiber Optical Components, Lasers / Radiation Sources,\nSpectrometers / Radiometers, Opto mechanical Mounts / Assemblies, Optical Detectors / Imaging\nSystems, Optical Metrology / Interferometers, Adaptive Optical Components / Modules, Optical\n/Electronic Equipment.**\n[[Lens Mount]][70]\n[Lens Mount][71]\n[[Lenslet Array]][72]\n[Lenslet Array][73]\n[[Zero Order Vortex Half Wave Retarder]][74]\n[Zero Order Vortex Half Wave Retarder][75]\nHOT PRODUCTS\n[[Achromatic Lenses]][76]\n[Achromatic Lenses][77]\n[ Send Inquiry][78]\n[[Spatial Filter Assembly]][79]\n[Spatial Filter Assembly][80]\n[ Send Inquiry][81]\n[[Kinematic Mirror Mount]][82]\n[Kinematic Mirror Mount][83]\n[ Send Inquiry][84]\n[[Pedestal Post Clamp]][85]\n[Pedestal Post Clamp][86]\n[ Send Inquiry][87]\n[[He Ne Laser Mounts]][88]\n[He Ne Laser Mounts][89]\n[ Send Inquiry][90]\n[[Mount For Square / Rectangular Optics]][91]\n[Mount For Square / Rectangular Optics][92]\n[ Send Inquiry][93]\n[[Fiber Coupled Diode Laser]][94]\n[Fiber Coupled Diode Laser][95]\n[ Send Inquiry][96]\n[[Iris Diaphragms - Variable Apertures with Mount]][97]\n[Iris Diaphragms - Variable Apertures with Mount][98]\n[ Send Inquiry][99]\nMost Popular Products\n[[Flat Mirrors]][100]\n[Flat Mirrors][101]\n[ Send Inquiry][102]\n[[Spiral Phase Plate / Vortex Lens]][103]\n[Spiral Phase Plate / Vortex Lens][104]\n[ Send Inquiry][105]\n[[Lab Jack]][106]\n[Lab Jack][107]\n[ Send Inquiry][108]\n[[He Ne Laser]][109]\n[He Ne Laser][110]\n[ Send Inquiry][111]\n[[Mounted Optical Interference Filter]][112]\n[Mounted Optical Interference Filter][113]\n[ Send Inquiry][114]\n[[Mounted Linear Polarizers]][115]\n[Mounted Linear Polarizers][116]\n[ Send Inquiry][117]\n\n**About Us**\n\nDuring the years of our operation in the industry as an\u00a0**OEM and supplier**, we,\u00a0**Crescent\nComponents And Systems**\u00a0aim to continuously develop innovative products like **Optical Components,\nOpto-mechanical Mounts & Assemblies, Spherical Lenses, Achromatic Lenses, Lasers, Interferometers,\nAdaptive Optical Sub-modules, Spatial Filter Assembly, Beam Expander, etc.** using state-of-the-art\ntechnologies and resources, available to us. With technologically advanced machines and tools, we\nare able to develop products of impressive quality and then offer these to our customers at highly\ncompetitive prices. The employees of our company possess deep knowledge of their respective domains.\nWe strive day and night to ensure that all the requirements of our customers are fulfilled within\nthe committed time frame.\n\n**Quality Assurance**\n\nOur\u00a0Delhi (India)\u00a0based business entity brings an admirable array of superior grade products by\nmaintaining the highest level of quality standards. This is why, we procure only high quality\nmaterial and ensure that we render our customers reliable and quality products.. Our quality\nsupervisors keep a close eye over our every stage of production process for achieving unparalleled\nproduct quality. For this reason, they conduct different quality tests for every batch of our\nproducts\n\n**Working Hard Since Establishment**\n\nStrengthening the fact that hard work is the key to success, people of our company have been making\nefforts since our establishment for not only meeting the expectations of our customers, but\nexceeding it in every possible manner. We give our cent percent to deliver the best-in-class range\nof products and services to our customers. Following are the reasons based upon which we always stay\nat the competitive forefront:\n\n* State-of-the-art technology\n* An adroit team of professionals\n* Modern infrastructural base\n* Commitment to business ethics\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**CCS Brocure Main\u00a0**\u2502**CCS Brocure Optics\u00a0**\u2502**CCS Brocure Opto Mechanics\u00a0**\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\nCRESCENT COMPONENTS AND SYSTEMS\nGST : 07ASTPG2703P1ZA\n[Send Inquiry][118]\n[[send inq]Send Inquiry][119]\n\n\n## Quick Links\n* [Home Page][120]\n* [Company Profile][121]\n* [ Our Products ][122]\n* [Contact Us][123]\n* [Sitemap][124]\n\n## Our Products\n* [Optics-Optical Components][125]\n* [Opto-Mechanical Mounts ][126]\n* [Lasers ][127]\n* [Opto-mechanical Assemblies][128]\n* [Manual and Motorised Stages, Lab Jack][129]\n* [Optical Breadboard and Vibration Isolation Table][130]\n* [Laser Detection and Measurement][131]\n* [Imaging Systems][132]\n* [Adaptive Optics][133]\n* [Phase Singular Optics][134]\n*