      "polished_summary": "Crescent Components specializes in providing high-quality scientific components and equipment, including optical and fiber optical components, lasers, and opto-mechanical assemblies. Their extensive product range features items such as spherical and achromatic lenses, beam expanders, and optical detectors, catering to industries that require precision optical solutions and advanced imaging systems. With a commitment to innovation and quality, Crescent Components serves a diverse clientele in the scientific and engineering sectors.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Crescent Components manufactures and supplies a wide range of optical components, lasers, and opto-mechanical assemblies, which are directly applicable to the spectral sensor market. Their products include optical detectors and imaging systems, which are essential for spectral sensing applications.",
