      "polished_summary": "CRFS specializes in advanced radio frequency (RF) solutions, offering a comprehensive suite of products and services including spectrum monitoring, direction finding, and RF recording. The company serves a diverse range of clients, including military and electronic warfare operators, security and intelligence agencies, system integrators, defense contractors, and spectrum regulators, providing them with cutting-edge technology to enhance their operational capabilities.",
      "audit_reasoning": "CRFS specializes in RF solutions and spectrum monitoring, which does not align with the spectral sensor market. Their focus is on radio frequency technology rather than spectral sensing.",
