      "polished_summary": "Figspec is a leading manufacturer of hyperspectral imaging technology, specializing in a diverse range of products including portable hyperspectral cameras, aerial imaging systems, and multispectral cameras. The company serves various industries such as agriculture, food safety, and industrial inspection, providing advanced solutions for non-destructive testing and analysis through innovative spectral imaging techniques. With a commitment to quality and cutting-edge technology, Figspec aims to enhance the capabilities of its clients in observing and analyzing the world through spectral data.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Figspec is a leading manufacturer of hyperspectral imaging technology, producing a wide range of products such as portable hyperspectral cameras and aerial imaging systems specifically designed for applications in agriculture, food safety, and industrial inspection. Their focus on spectral imaging techniques directly aligns with the target market of spectral sensors.",
