      "polished_summary": "Mouser is a global distributor of electronic components, specializing in providing a wide range of products for engineers and purchasing professionals in various industries. The company offers an extensive selection of semiconductors, passive components, and development tools, catering to the needs of sectors such as automotive, industrial, and consumer electronics. With a commitment to innovation and customer service, Mouser supports design engineers and buyers by delivering the latest technologies and solutions.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Mouser is primarily a distributor of electronic components and does not manufacture or develop spectral sensors or specialized components directly for the spectral sensor market. Their focus is on a broad range of electronic components for various industries, which does not specifically include spectral sensors.",
