      "company_summary": "Newport Corporation is a leading provider of advanced technology solutions for the photonics and laser markets, specializing in a diverse range of products and services tailored for research and industrial applications. Their offerings include innovative laser instruments such as ultrafast variable beam attenuators and fixed wavelength variable beam splitters, as well as educational kits designed for graduate students to explore ultrafast laser techniques. Targeting research laboratories, institutions, and graduate students, Newport is committed to enhancing capabilities in the fields of photonics and laser technology.",
