      "is_seed": false,
      "company_function": "manufacturer",
      "company_summary": "Novacomponent is a precision optical component manufacturer that serves a diverse range of industries, including aerospace, medical, and scientific research. The company specializes in a variety of optical products, such as aspherical lenses, ball lenses, and optical assemblies, catering to the needs of researchers, engineers, and manufacturers worldwide. With a commitment to quality and innovation, Novacomponent provides tailored solutions to meet the specific requirements of its clients across multiple sectors.",
