          {
            "url": "https://www.novacomponent.com/about/",
            "text": "[ info@novacomponent.com ][1]\nPrecision Optical Components Manufacturer\n[ [Nova Component] [Nova Component] ][2] [Home][3]\n[ Products ][4]\nAll Categories\n[View All Products][5] [Aspherical Lens][6] [Ball Lens][7] [Cylindrical Lens][8] [Hemispherical\nLens][9] [Infrared Optics][10] [Laser Diode Module][11] [Laser Optics][12] [Optical Assembly][13]\n[Optical Design][14] [Optical Filter][15] [Optical Mirror][16] [Optical Prism][17] [Optical\nReticle][18] [Optical Window][19] [Polarization Optics][20] [Special Optics][21] [Spherical\nLens][22]\n[ Applications ][23]\nAll Applications\n[View All Applications][24] [Aerospace & Defense][25] [Automotive][26] [Industrial Automation][27]\n[Laser Processing][28] [Medical & Healthcare][29] [Optical Communication][30] [Scientific\nResearch][31] [Semiconductor][32]\n[Resources][33] [About Us][34] [Contact][35]\n[Get Quote][36]\n[Home][37] [Products][38] [Applications][39] [About Us][40] [Contact][41] [Get Quote][42]\n[Home][43] About Us\n\n# About Nova Component\n\nPrecision optical component manufacturer \u2014 serving customers across industrial, medical, aerospace,\nand research sectors worldwide.\n\nOur Story\n\n## Built on Precision & Technical Depth\n\nNova Component is a team of optical engineers and manufacturing specialists focused on one thing:\nmaking precision optical components right. Based in Beijing, we serve customers globally \u2014 from\nresearch labs and startups to established manufacturers and system integrators.\n\nOur manufacturing facility is equipped with CNC grinding and polishing equipment, precision vacuum\ncoating systems, and cleanroom space for assembly and testing. We work across a wide diameter range\n\u2014 from sub-millimeter micro-optics to large-format components \u2014 in a broad selection of optical\nmaterials.\n\nEvery component is inspected and tested before delivery. We maintain documented quality procedures\nfrom incoming material to final packing, and are happy to share our quality documentation,\ninspection reports, and test data with customers as part of our standard process.\n\nProduct Categories\n89+\nStandard Products\n\u03bb/10\nSurface Accuracy\n600mm\nMax. Diameter\n\n## Our Core Values\n\nThe principles that guide every decision and every component we manufacture.\n\n### Quality First\n\nISO 9001:2015 certified quality management system. Every optical component undergoes rigorous\ninspection from raw material to final delivery.\n\n### Global Perspective\n\nServing researchers, engineers, and manufacturers in over 50 countries. We understand international\nstandards and deliver accordingly.\n\n### Custom Solutions\n\nNo two applications are the same. Our engineering team works closely with customers to design and\nmanufacture custom optical components.\n\n### Technical Excellence\n\nOur engineers average 15+ years of experience. Continuous investment in R&D keeps us at the\nforefront of optical manufacturing technology.\n\n### Customer Partnership\n\nWe view our customers as partners. Clear communication, transparent pricing, and responsive support\nare the foundations of every relationship.\n\n### Sustainability\n\nCommitted to responsible manufacturing. Our facility uses energy-efficient equipment and recycling\nprograms for optical glass and coating materials.\n\n## What We Build\n\nA record of what we're equipped to deliver, and how we approach our work.\n\n### Precision Optics Manufacturing\n\nFrom CNC grinding and polishing to magnetorheological finishing (MRF), we produce spherical,\naspheric, cylindrical, and freeform optics in a broad range of optical materials \u2014 BK7, UVFS,\nGermanium, Sapphire, CaF\u2082, ZnSe, and more.\n\n### Advanced Optical Coatings\n\nMulti-layer anti-reflection (AR) coatings, high-reflection (HR) mirror coatings, and specialized\nbandpass filters in our vacuum coating chambers \u2014 tailored to specific wavelengths and power levels.\n\n### Full Optical Testing\n\nEvery component is measured \u2014 interferometry for surface accuracy, spectrophotometry for\ntransmission, and profilometry for surface finish. We provide inspection reports as standard for\ncustom orders.\n\n### Custom Design & OEM\n\nOur in-house engineering team provides optical system design services using Zemax and CODE V, and\nworks with customers on custom component specifications, drawings, and prototyping for OEM volumes.\n\n### Global Customer Support\n\nWe ship internationally and work directly with customers on technical requirements, material\nselection, and application engineering \u2014 no middlemen, no delays in getting answers.\n\n## Certifications & Standards\n\nOur quality management system meets the most rigorous international standards across multiple\nindustries.\n\n### ISO 9001:2015\n\nQuality Management System\n\n### ISO 13485\n\nMedical Devices QMS\n\n### AS9100D\n\nAerospace Standard\n\n### RoHS Compliant\n\nEnvironmental Standards\n\n## Manufacturing Capabilities\n\nOur facility is equipped with advanced optical manufacturing and testing equipment.\n\n### Grinding & Polishing\n\nCNC spherical grinding, aspheric grinding, and magnetorheological finishing (MRF) for sub-nanometer\nsurface quality.\n\n### Precision Coating\n\nMulti-layer AR coatings, high-reflection mirrors, bandpass and notch filters in our ISO-classified\nvacuum coating chambers.\n\n### Optical Testing\n\nInterferometry, spectrophotometry, surface profilometry, and MTF testing for complete optical\ncharacterization.\n\n### Diameter Range\n\nManufacturing capability from 0.5mm micro-optics to 600mm large-format precision optics in a variety\nof optical materials.\n\n### Cleanroom Assembly\n\nClass-1000 cleanroom for assembling multi-element optics, optical cages, and precision mounting\nsystems.\n\n### Custom Design\n\nIn-house optical design team with Zemax and CODE V expertise for custom component design and system\nintegration.\n\n## Our Team\n\nA team of engineers and technicians with deep expertise in optical manufacturing and design.\n\n### Optical Engineering\n\nDesign & Application\n\nSpecialists in lens design, system integration, and application engineering across laser, imaging,\nand IR optics.\n\n### Process Engineering\n\nManufacturing Technology\n\nExpertise in CNC grinding, polishing, MRF finishing, and aspheric manufacturing for tight-tolerance\noptical components.\n\n### Coating Technology\n\nThin-Film Engineering\n\nExperienced in multi-layer AR coatings, high-reflection mirrors, and specialized filter design for\ndemanding wavelengths.\n\n### Quality & Inspection\n\nMetrology & Documentation\n\nTrained metrologists using interferometry, spectrophotometry, and profilometry to verify every\ncritical specification.\n\n## Want to Work With Us?\n\nWhether you need standard components or custom solutions, our team is ready to support your next\noptical project.\n\n[Contact Our Team ][44] [View Our Products][45]\nNOVA COMPONENT\n\nNova Component is a leading manufacturer of precision optical components, serving industries\nworldwide with high quality lenses, prisms, mirrors, filters, and custom optical solutions.\n\n#### Quick Links\n* [Home][46]\n* [Products][47]\n* [Applications][48]\n* [Resources][49]\n* [About Us][50]\n* [Contact][51]\n\n#### Product Categories\n* [Aspherical Lens][52]\n* [Ball Lens][53]\n* [Cylindrical Lens][54]\n* [Hemispherical Lens][55]\n* [Infrared Optics][56]\n* [Laser Diode Module][57]\n\n#### Contact Us\n* Optics Industrial Park, Changping District, Beijing, China\n* [+86 123 4567 890][58]\n* [info@novacomponent.com][59]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Nova Component. All rights reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][60] [Terms of Service][61]\n\n[1]: mailto:info@novacomponent.com\n[2]: https://www.novacomponent.com/\n[3]: https://www.novacomponent.com/\n[4]: https://www.novacomponent.com/products/\n[5]: https://www.novacomponent.com/products/\n[6]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/aspherical-lens/\n[7]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/ball-lens/\n[8]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/cylindrical-lens/\n[9]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/hemispherical-lens/\n[10]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/infrared-optics/\n[11]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/laser-diode-module/\n[12]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/laser-optics/\n[13]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/optical-assembly/\n[14]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/optical-design/\n[15]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/optical-filter/\n[16]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/optical-mirror/\n[17]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/optical-prism/\n[18]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/optical-reticle/\n[19]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/optical-window/\n[20]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/polarization-optics/\n[21]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/special-optics/\n[22]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/spherical-lens/\n[23]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/\n[24]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/\n[25]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/aerospace-defense/\n[26]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/automotive/\n[27]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/industrial-automation/\n[28]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/laser-processing/\n[29]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/medical-healthcare/\n[30]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/optical-communication/\n[31]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/scientific-research/\n[32]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/semiconductor/\n[33]: https://www.novacomponent.com/resources/\n[34]: https://www.novacomponent.com/about/\n[35]: https://www.novacomponent.com/contact/\n[36]: https://www.novacomponent.com/contact/\n[37]: https://www.novacomponent.com/\n[38]: https://www.novacomponent.com/products/\n[39]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/\n[40]: https://www.novacomponent.com/about/\n[41]: https://www.novacomponent.com/contact/\n[42]: https://www.novacomponent.com/contact/\n[43]: https://www.novacomponent.com/\n[44]: https://www.novacomponent.com/contact/\n[45]: https://www.novacomponent.com/products/\n[46]: https://www.novacomponent.com/\n[47]: https://www.novacomponent.com/products/\n[48]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/\n[49]: https://www.novacomponent.com/resources/\n[50]: https://www.novacomponent.com/about/\n[51]: https://www.novacomponent.com/contact/\n[52]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/aspherical-lens/\n[53]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/ball-lens/\n[54]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/cylindrical-lens/\n[55]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/hemispherical-lens/\n[56]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/infrared-optics/\n[57]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/laser-diode-module/\n[58]: tel:+86 123 4567 890\n[59]: mailto:info@novacomponent.com\n[60]: #\n[61]: #"
          },
          {
            "url": "https://www.novacomponent.com/contact/",
            "text": "[ info@novacomponent.com ][1]\nPrecision Optical Components Manufacturer\n[ [Nova Component] [Nova Component] ][2] [Home][3]\n[ Products ][4]\nAll Categories\n[View All Products][5] [Aspherical Lens][6] [Ball Lens][7] [Cylindrical Lens][8] [Hemispherical\nLens][9] [Infrared Optics][10] [Laser Diode Module][11] [Laser Optics][12] [Optical Assembly][13]\n[Optical Design][14] [Optical Filter][15] [Optical Mirror][16] [Optical Prism][17] [Optical\nReticle][18] [Optical Window][19] [Polarization Optics][20] [Special Optics][21] [Spherical\nLens][22]\n[ Applications ][23]\nAll Applications\n[View All Applications][24] [Aerospace & Defense][25] [Automotive][26] [Industrial Automation][27]\n[Laser Processing][28] [Medical & Healthcare][29] [Optical Communication][30] [Scientific\nResearch][31] [Semiconductor][32]\n[Resources][33] [About Us][34] [Contact][35]\n[Get Quote][36]\n[Home][37] [Products][38] [Applications][39] [About Us][40] [Contact][41] [Get Quote][42]\n[Home][43] Contact\n\n# Get in Touch\n\nReady to start your optical project? Contact our team for product inquiries, custom solutions, and\ncompetitive quotes.\n\n### Call Us\n\nMon\u2013Fri, 9:00 AM \u2013 6:00 PM CST\n\n[+86 123 4567 890][44]\n\n### Email Us\n\nWe respond within 24 hours\n\n[info@novacomponent.com][45]\n\n### Visit Us\n\nFactory & Sales Office\n\nOptics Industrial Park, Changping District, Beijing, China\n\nSend Us a Message\n\nFill out the form below and our team will get back to you within one business day.\n\nFull Name *\nEmail Address *\nCompany / Organization\nPhone Number\nProduct Interest Select a category or product... Spherical Lens Aspheric Lens Cylindrical Lens Prism\nMirror Optical Filter Optical Window Waveplate Polarizer Beamsplitter Lens Assembly Laser Module\nOther Lens Types Custom Optical Component Multiple Products\nEstimated Quantity Select quantity range... 1 \u2013 10 pieces 11 \u2013 50 pieces 51 \u2013 200 pieces 201 \u2013 1,000\npieces 1,001 \u2013 5,000 pieces 5,000+ pieces Prototype / Sample Mass Production\nYour Message *\nCustom Requirements (Optional)\n\nSend Message\n\nBy submitting this form, you agree to our Privacy Policy. We will never share your information.\n\n### Message Sent Successfully!\n\nThank you for contacting Nova Component. Our team has received your inquiry and will respond within\n**1 business day**.\n\nWhat happens next?\n* Our technical team reviews your inquiry\n* You receive a detailed quote via email\n* We discuss specifications and timelines\n\n[Browse Products][46] Send Another Message\n\n### Response Commitment\n* **Within 24 hours** for all product inquiries\n* **48 hours** for detailed technical questions\n* **Same day** for urgent manufacturing requests\n\n### Direct Contact\n\nSales Inquiries\n\n[info@novacomponent.com][47]\n\nTechnical Support\n\n[info@novacomponent.com][48]\n\nPhone\n\n[+86 123 4567 890][49]\n\n### Factory & Office\n\nNova Component Co., Ltd.\n\nOptics Industrial Park, Changping District, Beijing, China\n\n**Business Hours:**\nMonday \u2013 Friday: 9:00 AM \u2013 6:00 PM (CST)\nSaturday: 9:00 AM \u2013 1:00 PM (CST)\nSunday: Closed\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\nQuick answers to common inquiries about our products and services.\n\nWhat is your minimum order quantity (MOQ)?\nOur standard MOQ varies by product type. For standard spherical lenses and windows, MOQ starts at 1\npiece. For custom-coated or specialty components, MOQ may start at 5\u201310 pieces. Prototype and sample\norders are always welcome \u2014 please contact us for specific requirements.\nWhat materials do you work with?\nWe work with a wide range of optical materials including: optical glass (BK7, D263T, Fused Silica,\nPyrex), crystalline materials (Sapphire, Ge, Si, CaF2, ZnSe), specialty glass (Schott, Ohara, CDGM),\nand polymer optics (PMMA, PC). Contact us if you need a specific material not listed here.\nWhat are your typical lead times?\nLead times vary by product complexity and order volume. Standard catalog items: 1\u20132 weeks.\nCustom-coated components: 2\u20134 weeks. Complex multi-element assemblies: 4\u20138 weeks. Rush orders are\navailable for an additional fee. We provide firm delivery schedules with every quote.\nCan you manufacture custom optical components?\nYes. We specialize in custom optical component manufacturing. Our in-house optical design team uses\nZemax and CODE V for system design. We can manufacture components to your exact specifications\nincluding custom diameters, radii, materials, surface qualities, and coating requirements. Submit\nyour specifications via this form or email our engineering team directly.\nDo you offer international shipping?\nAbsolutely. We ship to over 50 countries worldwide via DHL, FedEx, UPS, and dedicated freight\nforwarders. All shipments are carefully packaged with anti-static and shock-resistant materials. We\nhandle all export documentation including customs declarations, Certificates of Origin, and\ncommercial invoices.\nWhat surface quality can you achieve?\nWe routinely achieve surface qualities from 40-20 (MIL-PRF-13830B) to 10-5 (\u03bb/10 @ 632.8nm)\ndepending on component type and material. Our interferometric testing ensures every precision\nsurface meets specification before shipment. We provide full test reports with each order.\nNOVA COMPONENT\n\nNova Component is a leading manufacturer of precision optical components, serving industries\nworldwide with high quality lenses, prisms, mirrors, filters, and custom optical solutions.\n\n#### Quick Links\n* [Home][50]\n* [Products][51]\n* [Applications][52]\n* [Resources][53]\n* [About Us][54]\n* [Contact][55]\n\n#### Product Categories\n* [Aspherical Lens][56]\n* [Ball Lens][57]\n* [Cylindrical Lens][58]\n* [Hemispherical Lens][59]\n* [Infrared Optics][60]\n* [Laser Diode Module][61]\n\n#### Contact Us\n* Optics Industrial Park, Changping District, Beijing, China\n* [+86 123 4567 890][62]\n* [info@novacomponent.com][63]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Nova Component. All rights reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][64] [Terms of Service][65]\n\n[1]: mailto:info@novacomponent.com\n[2]: https://www.novacomponent.com/\n[3]: https://www.novacomponent.com/\n[4]: https://www.novacomponent.com/products/\n[5]: https://www.novacomponent.com/products/\n[6]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/aspherical-lens/\n[7]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/ball-lens/\n[8]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/cylindrical-lens/\n[9]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/hemispherical-lens/\n[10]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/infrared-optics/\n[11]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/laser-diode-module/\n[12]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/laser-optics/\n[13]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/optical-assembly/\n[14]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/optical-design/\n[15]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/optical-filter/\n[16]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/optical-mirror/\n[17]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/optical-prism/\n[18]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/optical-reticle/\n[19]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/optical-window/\n[20]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/polarization-optics/\n[21]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/special-optics/\n[22]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/spherical-lens/\n[23]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/\n[24]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/\n[25]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/aerospace-defense/\n[26]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/automotive/\n[27]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/industrial-automation/\n[28]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/laser-processing/\n[29]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/medical-healthcare/\n[30]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/optical-communication/\n[31]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/scientific-research/\n[32]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/semiconductor/\n[33]: https://www.novacomponent.com/resources/\n[34]: https://www.novacomponent.com/about/\n[35]: https://www.novacomponent.com/contact/\n[36]: https://www.novacomponent.com/contact/\n[37]: https://www.novacomponent.com/\n[38]: https://www.novacomponent.com/products/\n[39]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/\n[40]: https://www.novacomponent.com/about/\n[41]: https://www.novacomponent.com/contact/\n[42]: https://www.novacomponent.com/contact/\n[43]: https://www.novacomponent.com/\n[44]: tel:+86 123 4567 890\n[45]: mailto:info@novacomponent.com\n[46]: https://www.novacomponent.com/products/\n[47]: mailto:info@novacomponent.com\n[48]: mailto:info@novacomponent.com\n[49]: tel:+86 123 4567 890\n[50]: https://www.novacomponent.com/\n[51]: https://www.novacomponent.com/products/\n[52]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/\n[53]: https://www.novacomponent.com/resources/\n[54]: https://www.novacomponent.com/about/\n[55]: https://www.novacomponent.com/contact/\n[56]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/aspherical-lens/\n[57]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/ball-lens/\n[58]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/cylindrical-lens/\n[59]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/hemispherical-lens/\n[60]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/infrared-optics/\n[61]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/laser-diode-module/\n[62]: tel:+86 123 4567 890\n[63]: mailto:info@novacomponent.com\n[64]: #\n[65]: #"
