2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n## Product Description\n\nMainly used for infinite conjugate applications, laser applications, and imaging systems. Features\none flat and one concave surface.\n\n### Related Products in Spherical Lens\n\n[Rectangular Spherical Lens][47][Plano-Convex Lens][48][Meniscus Lens][49][Biconcave\nLens][50][Biconvex Lens][51][Micro Spherical Lens][52][Hemispherical Lens / Dome Lens][53][High\nLaser Power Spherical Lens][54]\n\n### Applications & Industries\n\n[Laser Processing][55][Semiconductor][56][Automotive][57][Aerospace & Defense][58][Medical &\nHealthcare][59][Scientific Research][60]\n\n### Technical Resources\n\n#### Understanding Optical Surface Quality: Scratch-Dig Standards Explained\n\n6 min read\n][61][\n\n#### Optical Coating Guide: AR, HR, and Partial Reflection Coatings\n\n5 min read\n][62][\n\n#### Dimensional Tolerances in Precision Lens Manufacturing: What Actually Matters\n\n8 min read\n][63][\n\n#### How to Select the Right Lens Type for Your Optical System\n\n7 min read\n][64]\n\n### Guides & Resources\n\n[Medical Grade Spherical Lenses for Surgical & Diagnostic Equipment][65][Hemispherical Lens \u2014\nPrecision Optical Hemispherical Lens Manufacturer | Nova Component][66][Precision Optical Prisms for\nScientific Research & Laboratory Instruments][67][Infrared Optics \u2014 Precision Optical Infrared\nOptics Manufacturer | Nova Component][68]\n\n## Related Products\n\n[Biconvex Lens]\nSpherical Lens\n\n### Biconvex Lens\n\nBiconvex lenses have two convex surfaces and are used for magnification, optical, and laser systems.\n\