u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nClear Aperture \u2502> 90% of diameter\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nCentering \u25023 arc min\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nCoating \u2502Single MgF2, Multi-layer AR coating\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nEffective Focal Length\u2502Range from 3 to 500mm (SD1A series)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n## Product Description\n\nUsed for collimating divergent light or focusing collimated light.\n\n### Related Products in Spherical Lens\n\n[Hemispherical Lens / Dome Lens][47][Micro Spherical Lens][48][Rectangular Spherical\nLens][49][Meniscus Lens][50][Large Size Spherical Lens][51][Biconcave Lens][52][High Laser Power\nSpherical Lens][53][Achromatic Doublet Lens][54]\n\n### Applications & Industries\n\n[Scientific Research][55][Laser Processing][56][Medical & Healthcare][57][Automotive][58][Optical\nCommunication][59][Semiconductor][60]\n\n### Technical Resources\n\n#### Dimensional Tolerances in Precision Lens Manufacturing: What Actually Matters\n\n8 min read\n][61][\n\n#### Optical Coating Guide: AR, HR, and Partial Reflection Coatings\n\n5 min read\n][62][\n\n#### Understanding Optical Surface Quality: Scratch-Dig Standards Explained\n\n6 min read\n][63][\n\n#### How to Select the Right Lens Type for Your Optical System\n\n7 min read\n][64]\n\n### Guides & Resources\n\n[Polarization Optics \u2014 Precision Optical Polarization Optics Manufacturer | Nova\nComponent][65][Optical Assembly \u2014 Precision Optical Optical Assembly Manufacturer | Nova\nComponent][66][Aspherical Lens \u2014 Precision Optical Aspherical Lens Manufacturer | Nova\nComponent][67][Optical Reticle \u2014 Precision Optical Optical Reticle Manufacturer | Nova\nComponent][68]\n\n## Related Products\n\n[Plano-Concave Lens]\nSpherical Lens\n\n### Plano-Concave Lens\n\nMainly used for infinite conjugate applications, laser applications, and imaging systems. Features\none flat and one concave surface.\n\nPROD0017\n][69] [\n[Achromatic Doublet Lens]\nSpherical Lens\n\n### Achromatic Doublet Lens\n\nAchromatic lenses consist of two lens elements cemented together, mainly used to reduce spherical\naberration, coma, and chromatic aberration.\n\nPROD0009\n][70] [\n[Biconcave Lens]\nSpherical Lens\n\n### Biconcave Lens\n\nNegative focal length biconcave lenses, used for beam expanders, optical imaging, and laser systems.\n\nPROD0010\n][71] [\n[Hemispherical Lens / Dome Lens]\nSpherical Lens\n\n### Hemispherical Lens / Dome Lens\n\nOptical domes are lenses with two concentric spheres. Concentricity is critical. Widely used for\ndetectors and optical sensors.\n\nPROD0013\n][72]\n\n## Request Quote\n\nFill out the form below to request a quote\n\n### Inquiry Submitted!\n\nWe will contact you within 24 hours with a quote.\n\nName *\nEmail *\nCompany\nPhone\nQuantity Needed *\nAdditional Requirements\n**Product:** Plano-Convex Lens (PROD0018)\nSubmit Inquiry\nNOVA COMPONENT\n\nNova Component is a leading manufacturer of precision optical components, serving industries\nworldwide with high quality lenses, prisms, mirrors, filters, and custom optical solutions.\n\n#### Quick Links\n* [Home][73]\n* [Products][74]\n* [Applications][75]\n* [Resources][76]\n* [About Us][77]\n* [Contact][78]\n\n#### Product Categories\n* [Aspherical Lens][79]\n* [Ball Lens][80]\n* [Cylindrical Lens][81]\n* [Hemispherical Lens][82]\n* [Infrared Optics][83]\n* [Laser Diode Module][84]\n\n#### Contact Us\n* Optics Industrial Park, Changping District, Beijing, China\n* [+86 123 4567 890][85]\n* [info@novacomponent.com][86]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Nova Component. All rights reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][87] [Terms of Service][88]\n\n[1]: mailto:info@novacomponent.com\n[2]: https://www.novacomponent.com/\n[3]: https://www.novacomponent.com/\n[4]: https://www.novacomponent.com/products/\n[5]: https://www.novacomponent.com/products/\n[6]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/aspherical-lens/\n[7]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/ball-lens/\n[8]: https://www.novaco