            "text": "[ info@novacomponent.com ][1]\nPrecision Optical Components Manufacturer\n[ [Nova Component] [Nova Component] ][2] [Home][3]\n[ Products ][4]\nAll Categories\n[View All Products][5] [Aspherical Lens][6] [Ball Lens][7] [Cylindrical Lens][8] [Hemispherical\nLens][9] [Infrared Optics][10] [Laser Diode Module][11] [Laser Optics][12] [Optical Assembly][13]\n[Optical Design][14] [Optical Filter][15] [Optical Mirror][16] [Optical Prism][17] [Optical\nReticle][18] [Optical Window][19] [Polarization Optics][20] [Special Optics][21] [Spherical\nLens][22]\n[ Applications ][23]\nAll Applications\n[View All Applications][24] [Aerospace & Defense][25] [Automotive][26] [Industrial Automation][27]\n[Laser Processing][28] [Medical & Healthcare][29] [Optical Communication][30] [Scientific\nResearch][31] [Semiconductor][32]\n[Resources][33] [About Us][34] [Contact][35]\n[Get Quote][36]\n[Home][37] [Products][38] [Applications][39] [About Us][40] [Contact][41] [Get Quote][42]\n[Home][43] / [Products][44] / Rectangular Spherical Lens\n[Rectangular Spherical Lens]\nProduct ID:\nPROD0019\n\n# Rectangular Spherical Lens\n\nCNC machining centers for the production of custom-shaped lenses including rectangular spherical\nlenses.\n\nCustom Sizes Available\nISO 9001 Certified\nFast Delivery\nQuality Guaranteed\nRequest Quote [ Contact Us ][45]\n\n### Need Help?\n\nContact our sales team for specifications, customization, and quotes.\n\n[ info@novacomponent.com ][46]\nTechnical Specifications\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nShape \u2502Rectangular / Irregular\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nMachining \u2502CNC Precision Machining\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nMaterial \u2502Optical Glass, UVFS, CaF2\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nCustomization\u2502Full custom per customer drawings\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n## Product Description\n\nCNC machining centers for the production of custom-shaped lenses including rectangular spherical\nlenses.\n\n### Related Products in Spherical Lens\n\n[Meniscus Lens][47][Micro Spherical Lens][48][Biconvex Lens][49][Hemispherical Lens / Dome\nLens][50][Biconcave Lens][51][Plano-Convex Lens][52][Plano-Concave Lens][53][High Laser Power\nSpherical Lens][54]\n\n### Applications & Industries\n\n[Scientific Research][55][Automotive][56][Optical Communication][57][Medical & Healthcare][58][Laser\nProcessing][59][Industrial Automation][60]\n\n### Technical Resources\n\n#### How to Select the Right Lens Type for Your Optical System\n\n7 min read\n][61][\n\n#### Optical Coating Guide: AR, HR, and Partial Reflection Coatings\n\n5 min read\n][62][\n\n#### Dimensional Tolerances in Precision Lens Manufacturing: What Actually Matters\n\n8 min read\n][63][\n\n#### Understanding Optical Surface Quality: Scratch-Dig Standards Explained\n\n6 min read\n][64]\n\n### Guides & Resources\n\n[Optical Assembly \u2014 Precision Optical Optical Assembly Manufacturer | Nova Component][65][Precision\nOptical Prisms for Scientific Research & Laboratory Instruments][66][Optical Prism \u2014 Precision\nOptical Optical Prism Manufacturer | Nova Component][67][Cylindrical Lens \u2014 Precision Optical\nCylindrical Lens Manufacturer | Nova Component][68]\n\n## Related Products\n\n[High Laser Power Spherical Lens]\nSpherical Lens\n\n### High Laser Power Spherical Lens\n\nLaser coatings can withstand standard 12,000W lasers. Lenses are mainly made of fused silica with\nlaser threshold > 70J/cm\u00b2.\n\nPROD0014\n][69] [\n[Biconcave Lens]\nSpherical Lens\n\n### Biconcave Lens\n\nNegative focal length biconcave lenses, used for beam expanders, optical imaging, and laser systems.\n\nPROD0010\n][70] [\n[Micro Spherical Lens]\nSpherical Lens\n\n### Micro Spherical Lens\n\nProduces micro lenses with a minimum diameter of 0.1mm made from optical glass substrates.\n\nPROD0016\n][71] [\n[Large Size Spherical Lens]\nSpherical Lens\n\n### Large Size Spherical Lens\n\nCustomizes large-size spherical lenses up to 600mm. Materials include BK7, Fused Silica, and CaF2.\n\nPROD0012\n][72]\n\n## Request Quote\n\nFill out the form below to request a quote\n\n### Inquiry Submitted!\n\nWe will contact you within 24 hours with a quote.\n\nName *\nEmail *\nCompany\nPhone\nQuantity Needed *\nAdditional Requirements\n**Product:** Rectangular Spherical Lens (PROD0019)\nSubmit Inquiry\nNOVA COMPONENT\n\nNova Component is a leading manufacturer of precision optical components, serving industries\nworldwide with high quality lenses, prisms, mirrors, filters, and custom optical solutions.\n\n#### Quick Links\n* [Home][73]\n* [Products][74]\n* [Applications][75]\n* [Resources][76]\n* [About Us][77]\n* [Contact][78]\n\n#### Product Categories\n* [Aspherical Lens][79]\n* [Ball Lens][80]\n* [Cylindrical Lens][81]\n* [Hemispherical Lens][82]\n* [Infrared Optics][83]\n* [Laser Diode Module][84]\n\n#### Contact Us\n* Optics Industrial Park, Changping District, Beijing, China\n* [+86 123 4567 890][85]\n* [info@novacomponent.com][86]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Nova Component. All rights reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][87] [Terms of Service][88]\n\n[1]: mailto:info@novacomponent.com\n[2]: https://www.novacomponent.com/\n[3]: https://www.novacomponent.com/\n[4]: https://www.novacomponent.com/products/\n[5]: https://www.novacomponent.com/products/\n[6]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/aspherical-lens/\n[7]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/ball-lens/\n[8]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/cylindrical-lens/\n[9]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/hemispherical-lens/\n[10]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/infrared-optics/\n[11]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/laser-diode-module/\n[12]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/laser-optics/\n[13]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/optical-assembly/\n[14]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/optical-design/\n[15]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/optical-filter/\n[16]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/optical-mirror/\n[17]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/optical-prism/\n[18]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/optical-reticle/\n[19]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/optical-window/\n[20]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/polarization-optics/\n[21]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/special-optics/\n[22]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/spherical-lens/\n[23]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/\n[24]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/\n[25]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/aerospace-defense/\n[26]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/automotive/\n[27]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/industrial-automation/\n[28]: https://www.novacomponent.com/applications/laser-processing/\n[29]: h