cal Lens][47][Meniscus Cylindrical Lens][48][Plano-Concave Cylindrical\nLens][49][Biconvex Cylindrical Lens][50][Cylindrical Rod Lens][51][Biconcave Cylindrical Lens][52]\n\n### Applications & Industries\n\n[Automotive][53][Laser Processing][54][Aerospace & Defense][55][Scientific Research][56][Medical &\nHealthcare][57][Optical Communication][58]\n\n### Technical Resources\n\n#### Understanding Optical Surface Quality: Scratch-Dig Standards Explained\n\n6 min read\n][59][\n\n#### Dimensional Tolerances in Precision Lens Manufacturing: What Actually Matters\n\n8 min read\n][60][\n\n#### How to Select the Right Lens Type for Your Optical System\n\n7 min read\n][61][\n\n#### Optical Coating Guide: AR, HR, and Partial Reflection Coatings\n\n5 min read\n][62]\n\n### Guides & Resources\n\n[Optical Reticle \u2014 Precision Optical Optical Reticle Manufacturer | Nova Component][63][Polarization\nOptics \u2014 Precision Optical Polarization Optics Manufacturer | Nova Component][64][Laser Diode Module\n\u2014 Precision Optical Laser Diode Module Manufacturer | Nova Component][65][Spherical Lens \u2014 Precision\nOptical Spherical Lens Manufacturer | Nova Component][66]\n\n## Related Products\n\n[Plano-Concave Cylindrical Lens]\nCylindrical Lens\n\n### Plano-Concave Cylindrical Lens\n\nUsed as magnifiers, objectives, and condensing systems. Coated versions also available.\n\nPROD0024\n][67] [\n[Meniscus Cylindrical Lens]\nCylindrical Lens\n\n### Meniscus Cylindrical Lens\n\nA cylindrical lens with one convex surface and one concave surface.\n\nPROD0023\n][68] [\n[Plano-Convex Cylindrical Lens]\nCylindrical Lens\n\n### Plano-Convex Cylindrical Lens\n\nUsed for optical, laser, and scanner systems. Available in various geometries (circular, square,\nrectangular).\n\nPROD0025\n][69] [\n[Cylindrical Rod Lens]\nCylindrical Lens\n\n### Cylindrical Rod Lens\n\nMainly used for sensors, light guides, endoscopes, and laser systems. Polishing is available for end\nfaces or cylindrical surfaces.\n\nPROD0026\n][70]\n\n## Request Quote\n\nFill out the form below to request a quote\n\n### Inquiry Submitted!\n\nWe will contact you within 24 hours with a quote.\n\nName *\nEmail *\nCompany\nPhone\nQuantity Needed *\nAdditional Requirements\n**Product:** Achromatic Cylindrical Lens (PROD0020)\nSubmit Inquiry\nNOVA COMPONENT\n\nNova Component is a leading manufacturer of precision optical components, serving industries\nworldwide with high quality lenses, prisms, mirrors, filters, and custom optical solutions.\n\n#### Quick Links\n* [Home][71]\n* [Products][72]\n* [Applications][73]\n* [Resources][74]\n* [About Us][75]\n* [Contact][76]\n\n#### Product Categories\n* [Aspherical Lens][77]\n* [Ball Lens][78]\n* [Cylindrical Lens][79]\n* [Hemispherical Lens][80]\n* [Infrared Optics][81]\n* [Laser Diode Module][82]\n\n#### Contact Us\n* Optics Industrial Park, Changping District, Beijing, China\n* [+86 123 4567 890][83]\n* [info@novacomponent.com][84]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Nova Component. All rights reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][85] [Terms of Service][86]\n\n[1]: mailto:info@novacomponent.com\n[2]: https://www.novacomponent.com/\n[3]: https://www.novacomponent.com/\n[4]: https://www.novacomponent.com/products/\n[5]: https://www.novacomponent.com/products/\n[6]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/aspherical-lens/\n[7]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/ball-lens/\n[8]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/cylindrical-lens/\n[9]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/hemispherical-lens/\n[10]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/infrared-optics/\n[11]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/laser-diode-module/\n[12]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/laser-optics/\n[13]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/optical-assembly/\n[14]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/optical-design/\n[15]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/optical-filter/\n[16]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/optical-mirror/\n[17]: https://www.novacomponent.com/categ