            "text": "[ info@novacomponent.com ][1]\nPrecision Optical Components Manufacturer\n[ [Nova Component] [Nova Component] ][2] [Home][3]\n[ Products ][4]\nAll Categories\n[View All Products][5] [Aspherical Lens][6] [Ball Lens][7] [Cylindrical Lens][8] [Hemispherical\nLens][9] [Infrared Optics][10] [Laser Diode Module][11] [Laser Optics][12] [Optical Assembly][13]\n[Optical Design][14] [Optical Filter][15] [Optical Mirror][16] [Optical Prism][17] [Optical\nReticle][18] [Optical Window][19] [Polarization Optics][20] [Special Optics][21] [Spherical\nLens][22]\n[ Applications ][23]\nAll Applications\n[View All Applications][24] [Aerospace & Defense][25] [Automotive][26] [Industrial Automation][27]\n[Laser Processing][28] [Medical & Healthcare][29] [Optical Communication][30] [Scientific\nResearch][31] [Semiconductor][32]\n[Resources][33] [About Us][34] [Contact][35]\n[Get Quote][36]\n[Home][37] [Products][38] [Applications][39] [About Us][40] [Contact][41] [Get Quote][42]\n[Home][43] / [Products][44] / Biconcave Cylindrical Lens\n[Biconcave Cylindrical Lens]\nProduct ID:\nPROD0021\n\n# Biconcave Cylindrical Lens\n\nFocuses or expands light on a single axis. Used in metrology, laser scanning, and spectroscopy to\nfocus light into a thin line.\n\nCustom Sizes Available\nISO 9001 Certified\nFast Delivery\nQuality Guaranteed\nRequest Quote [ Contact Us ][45]\n\n### Need Help?\n\nContact our sales team for specifications, customization, and quotes.\n\n[ info@novacomponent.com ][46]\nTechnical Specifications\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u