u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nDiameter \u25020.5mm to 50mm\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSphericity \u2502< 1\u03bcm\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSurface Quality\u250240/20\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nApplication \u2502Fiber coupling, laser collimation, optical measurement\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n## Product Description\n\nFused silica ball lenses for high-precision optical measurement and coupling systems.\n\n### Related Products in Ball Lens\n\n[Hemispherical Lens][47][Zinc Selenide (ZnSe) Ball Lens][48][Sapphire Ball Lens][49][Fused\nSilica][50][Silicon Ball Lens][51][Ruby Ball Lens][52][BK7 Ball Lens][53]\n\n### Applications & Industries\n\n[Scientific Research][54][Industrial Automation][55][Laser Processing][56][Optical\nCommunication][57][Aerospace & Defense][58][Medical & Healthcare][59]\n\n### Technical Resources\n\n#### How to Select the Right Lens Type for Your Optical System\n\n7 min read\n][60][\n\n#### Understanding Optical Surface Quality: Scratch-Dig Standards Explained\n\n6 min read\n][61][\n\n#### Optical Coating Guide: AR, HR, and Partial Reflection Coatings\n\n5 min read\n][62][\n\n#### Dimensional Tolerances in Precision Lens Manufacturing: What Actually Matters\n\n8 min read\n][63]\n\n### Guides & Resources\n\n[Special Optics \u2014 Precision Optical Special Optics Manufacturer | Nova Component][64][Hemispherical\nLens \u2014 Precision Optical Hemispherical Lens Manufacturer | Nova Component][65][Polarization Optics \u2014\nPrecision Optical Polarization Optics Manufacturer | Nova Component][66][Cylindrical Lens \u2014\nPrecision Optical Cylindrical Lens Manufacturer | Nova Component][67]\n\n## Related Products\n\n[Ruby Ball Lens]\nBall Lens\n\n### Ruby Ball Lens\n\nRuby ball and hemispherical lenses are mainly used for fiber coupling, laser collimation, and\ncommunications.\n\nPROD0034\n][68] [\n[Silicon Ball Lens]\nBall Lens\n\n### Silicon Ball Lens\n\nFeatures low dispersion, low density, and excellent thermal stability, making it ideal for\nlightweight, high-performance systems.\n\nPROD0036\n][69] [\n[Zinc Selenide (ZnSe) Ball Lens]\nBall Lens\n\n### Zinc Selenide (ZnSe) Ball Lens\n\nZnSe ball and hemispherical lenses commonly used in infrared (IR) optics.\n\nPROD0037\n][70] [\n[BK7 Ball Lens]\nBall Lens\n\n### BK7 Ball Lens\n\nCommonly used for fiber coupling and laser collimation due to short focal length and small size.\n\nPROD0030\n][71]\n\n## Request Quote\n\nFill out the form below to request a quote\n\n### Inquiry Submitted!\n\nWe will contact you within 24 hours with a quote.\n\nName *\nEmail *\nCompany\nPhone\nQuantity Needed *\nAdditional Requirements\n**Product:** Fused Silica Ball Lens (PROD0031)\nSubmit Inquiry\nNOVA COMPONENT\n\nNova Component is a leading manufacturer of precision optical components, serving industries\nworldwide with high quality lenses, prisms, mirrors, filters, and custom optical solutions.\n\n#### Quick Links\n* [Home][72]\n* [Products][73]\n* [Applications][74]\n* [Resources][75]\n* [About Us][76]\n* [Contact][77]\n\n#### Product Categories\n* [Aspherical Lens][78]\n* [Ball Lens][79]\n* [Cylindrical Lens][80]\n* [Hemispherical Lens][81]\n* [Infrared Optics][82]\n* [Laser Diode Module][83]\n\n#### Contact Us\n* Optics Industrial Park, Changping District, Beijing, China\n* [+86 123 4567 890][84]\n* [info@novacomponent.com][85]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Nova Component. All rights reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][86] [Terms of Service][87]\n\n[1]: mailto:info@novacomponent.com\n[2]: https://www.novacomponent.com/\n[3]: https://www.novacomponent.com/\n[4]: https://www.novacomponent.com/products/\n[5]: https://www.novacomponent.com/products/\n[6]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/aspherical-lens/\n[7]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/ball-lens/\n[8]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/cylindrical-lens/\n[9]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/hemispherical-lens/\n[10]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/infrared-optics/\n[11]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/laser-diode-module/\n[12]: https://www.novacomponent.com/category/laser-optics/\n