| Nova Component][67]\n\n## Related Products\n\n[Zinc Selenide (ZnSe) Ball Lens]\nBall Lens\n\n### Zinc Selenide (ZnSe) Ball Lens\n\nZnSe ball and hemispherical lenses commonly used in infrared (IR) optics.\n\nPROD0037\n][68] [\n[Sapphire Ball Lens]\nBall Lens\n\n### Sapphire Ball Lens\n\nSapphire offers excellent optical transmission quality for ball and hemispherical lenses.\n\nPROD0035\n][69] [\n[Silicon Ball Lens]\nBall Lens\n\n### Silicon Ball Lens\n\nFeatures low dispersion, low density, and excellent thermal stability, making it ideal for\nlightweight, high-performance systems.\n\nPROD0036\n][70] [\n[Hemispherical Lens]\nBall Lens\n\n### Hemispherical Lens\n\nMainly used for optical measurement, imaging, projection, and endoscopy. Diameters range from 0.6mm\nto 200mm.\n\nPROD0033\n][71]\n\n## Request Quote\n\nFill out the form below to request a quote\n\n### Inquiry Submitted!\n\nWe will contact you within 24 hours with a quote.\n\nName *\nEmail *\nCompany\nPhone\nQuantity Needed *\nAdditional Requirements\n**Product:** Ruby Ball Lens (PROD0034)\nSubmit Inquiry\nNOVA COMPONENT\n\nNova Component is a leading manufacturer of precision optical components, serving industries\nworldwide with high quality lenses, prisms, mirrors, filters, and custom optical solutions.\n\n#### Quick Links\n* [Home][72]\n* [Products][73]\n* [Applications][74]\n* [Resources][75]\n* [About Us][76]\n* [Contact][77]\n\n#### Product Categories\n* [Aspherical Lens][78]\n* [Ball Lens][79]\n* [Cylindrical Lens][80]\n* [Hemispherical Lens][81]\n* [Infrared Optics][82]\n* [Laser Diode Module][83]\n\n#### Contact Us\n* Optics Industrial Park, Changping District, Beijing, China\n* [+86 123 4567 890][84]\n* [info@novacomponent.com][85]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Nova Component. All rights reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][86] [Terms of Service][87]\n\n[1]: mailto:info@novacomponent.com\n[2]: https://www.novacomponent.com/\n[3]: https://www.novacomponent.com/\n[4]: https://www.novacomponent.com/products/\n[5]: ht