            "text": "[ info@novacomponent.com ][1]\nPrecision Optical Components Manufacturer\n[ [Nova Component] [Nova Component] ][2] [Home][3]\n[ Products ][4]\nAll Categories\n[View All Products][5] [Aspherical Lens][6] [Ball Lens][7] [Cylindrical Lens][8] [Hemispherical\nLens][9] [Infrared Optics][10] [Laser Diode Module][11] [Laser Optics][12] [Optical Assembly][13]\n[Optical Design][14] [Optical Filter][15] [Optical Mirror][16] [Optical Prism][17] [Optical\nReticle][18] [Optical Window][19] [Polarization Optics][20] [Special Optics][21] [Spherical\nLens][22]\n[ Applications ][23]\nAll Applications\n[View All Applications][24] [Aerospace & Defense][25] [Automotive][26] [Industrial Automation][27]\n[Laser Processing][28] [Medical & Healthcare][29] [Optical Communication][30] [Scientific\nResearch][31] [Semiconductor][32]\n[Resources][33] [About Us][34] [Contact][35]\n[Get Quote][36]\n[Home][37] [Products][38] [Applications][39] [About Us][40] [Contact][41] [Get Quote][42]\n[Home][43] / [Products][44] / Silicon Ball Lens\n[Silicon Ball Lens]\nProduct ID:\nPROD0036\n\n# Silicon Ball Lens\n\nFeatures low dispersion, low density, and excellent thermal stability, making it ideal for\nlightweight, high-performance systems.\n\nCustom Sizes Available\nISO 9001 Certified\nFast Delivery\nQuality Guaranteed\nRequest Quote [ Contact Us ][45]\n\n### Need Help?\n\nContact our sales team for specifications, customization, and quotes.\n\n[ info@novacomponent.com ][46]\nTechnical Specifications\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nMaterial \u2502Single Crystal Silicon\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSpectral Range\u25021\u20137\u03bcm\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nApplication \u2502IR optics, weight-sensitive systems\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n## Product Description\n\nFeatures low dispersion, low density, and excellent thermal stability, making it ideal for\nlightweight, high-performance systems.\n\n### Related Products in Ball Lens\n\n[Zinc Selenide (ZnSe) Ball Lens][47][Hemispherical Lens][48][BK7 Ball Lens][49][Sapphire Ball\nLens][50][Ruby Ball Lens][51][Fused Silica Ball Lens][52][Fused Silica][53]\n\n### Applications & Industries\n\n[Scientific Research][54][Industrial Automation][55][Optical Communication][56][Laser\nProcessing][57][Medical & Healthcare][58][Semiconductor][59]\n\n### Technical Resources\n\n#### Understanding Optical Surface Quality: Scratch-Dig Standards Explained\n\n6 min read\n][60][\n\n#### Optical Coating Guide: AR, HR, and Partial Reflection Coatings\n\n5 min read\n][61][\n\n#### How to Select the Right Lens Type for Your Optical System\n\n7 min read\n][62][\n\n#### Dimensional Tolerances in Precision Lens Manufacturing: What Actually Matters\n\n8 min read\n][63]\n\n### Guides & Resources\n\n[Optical Filters for Telecommunications & Data Communication Networks][64][Aspherical Lens \u2014\nPrecision Optical Aspherical Lens Manufacturer | Nova Component][65][Precision Optical Prisms for\nScientific Research & Laboratory Instruments][66][Optical Prism \u2014 Precision Optical Optical Prism\nManufacturer | Nova Component][67]\n\n## Related Products\n\n[Fused Silica]\nBall Lens\n\n### Fused Silica\n\nUsed for fiber coupling, laser collimation, and optical measurement.\n\nPROD0032\n][68] [\n[Zinc Selenide (ZnSe) Ball Lens]\nBall Lens\n\n### Zinc Selenide (ZnSe) Ball Lens\n\nZnSe ball and hemispherical lenses commonly used in infrared (IR) optics.\n\nPROD0037\n][69] [\n[BK7 Ball Lens]\nBall Lens\n\n### BK7 Ball Lens\n\nCommonly used for fiber coupling and laser collimation due to short focal length and small size.\n\nPROD0030\n][70] [\n[Sapphire Ball Lens]\nBall Lens\n\n### Sapphire Ball Lens\n\nSapphire offers excellent optical transmission quality for ball and hemispherical lenses.\n\nPROD0035\n][71]\n\n## Request Quote\n\nFill out the form below to request a quote\n\n### Inquiry Submitted!\n\nWe will contact you within 24 hours with a quote.\n\nName *\nEmail *\nCompany\nPhone\nQuantity Needed *\nAdditional Requirements\n**Product:** Silicon Ball Lens (PROD0036)\nSubmit Inquiry\nNOVA COMPONENT\n\nNova Component is a leading manufacturer of precision optical components, serving industries\nworldwide with high quality lenses, prisms, mirrors, filters, and custom optical solutions.\n\n#### Quick Links\n* [Home][72]\n* [Products][73]\n* [Applications][74]\n* [Resources][75]\n* [About Us][76]\n* [Contact][77]\n\n#### Product Categories\n* [Aspherical Lens][78]\n* [Ball Lens][79]\n* [Cylindrical Lens][80]\n* [Hemispherical Lens][81]\n* [Infrared Optics][82]\n* [Laser Diode Module][83]\n\n#### Contact Us\n* Optics Industrial Park, Changping District, Beijing, China\n* [+86 123 4567 890][84]\n* [info@novacomponent.com][85]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Nova Component. All rights reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][86] [Terms of Service][87]\n\n[1]: mailto:info@novacomponent.com\n[2]: https://www.novacomponent.com/\n[3]: https://www.no