      "key_products": "Aspherical Lens, Optical Filter, Optical Assembly, Infrared Optics, Laser Diode Module",
      "polished_summary": "Novacomponent is a precision optical component manufacturer that serves a diverse range of industries, including aerospace, medical, and scientific research. The company specializes in a variety of optical products, such as aspherical lenses, ball lenses, and optical assemblies, catering to the needs of researchers, engineers, and manufacturers worldwide. With a commitment to quality and innovation, Novacomponent provides tailored solutions to meet the specific requirements of its clients across multiple sectors.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Novacomponent manufactures precision optical components, including lenses and optical assemblies, which are directly applicable to the spectral sensor market. Their focus on custom optical solutions and advanced manufacturing techniques aligns well with the needs of the spectral sensor industry.",
