      "company_function": "manufacturer",
      "company_summary": "PhotonDelta is a non-profit organization dedicated to advancing the end-to-end value chain for photonic chips, focusing on the design, development, and manufacturing of innovative solutions that enhance various industries. Their core product, photonic chips, serves a wide range of applications across sectors such as automotive and mobility, data and telecom, food and agriculture, and medical and healthcare, contributing to a better world through integrated photonics innovation.",
