            "url": "https://photondelta.com/contact",
            "text": "* [PhotonDelta][1]\n* Back\n* [AboutWho We Are][2]\n* [Mission & VisionOur Values][3]\n* [Team & GovernanceMeet the Team][4]\n* [Insights, Achievements, and Impact from the Past Year\nAnnual Report 2025][5]\n* [Ecosystem][6]\n* Back\n* [Ecosystem PartnersA Growing Network of Integrated Photonics Innovators][7]\n* [Ecosystem OverviewConnecting Innovators Across the Value Chain][8]\n* [Join Our EcosystemConnect, Collaborate, and Grow with the Ecosystem][9]\n* [Value ChainFrom Design to Real-World Impact][10]\n* [\nPhotonFirst and Curtiss-Wright Announce Collaboration to Bring Integrated Fibre Optic Sensing to\nFlight Test Instrumentation][11]\n* [Photonic Chips][12]\n* Back\n* [Automotive & Mobility][13]\n* [Data & Telecom][14]\n* [Food & Agriculture][15]\n* [Medical & Healthcare][16]\n* [\nBuilding InP-Based Photonic Integrated Circuits with SMART Photonics][17]\n* [Innovation][18]\n* Back\n* [ProjectsAccelerating Integrated Photonic Innovation Through Innovation Programmes][19]\n* [\nFrom Foundation to Scale: Progress, Pressure, and the Next Phase for Photonics][20]\n* [Activities][21]\n* Back\n* [InternationalisationConnecting the Ecosystem to Global Markets and Opportunities][22]\n* [Human CapitalDeveloping, Attracting, and Connecting Photonics Talent][23]\n* [FundingSupporting Early-Stage Integrated Photonics Startups with Growth Capital][24]\n* [PIC Summit EuropeEurope\u2019s Leading Integrated Photonics Event][25]\n* [PhotonJobsConnecting Talent to Ppportunities in the Dutch Photonic Chip Industry.][26]\n* [PhotonStudioTransforming Opportunities into Startups][27]\n* [Global Photonics Engineering ContestDesign the Next Generation Application with Integrated\nPhotonics][28]\n* [News & Insights][29]\n* Back\n* [NewsDiscover the latest industry and ecosystem updates.][30]\n* [Downloads/ReportsInsights, Reports, and Industry Resources][31]\n* [Events CalendarBrowse Upcoming Events and Networking Opportunities][32]\n* [CareersJoin the Team][33]\n* [Scaling Integrated Photonics for Global Impact\nPIC Summit Europe 2026][34]\n* [Contact][35]\nClear\nPopular searches[Ecosystem][36][Supply Chain][37][Prototyping][38][Photonic Integrated Chips\n(PICs)][39]\n\n# We are located in the Netherlands, but we connect and collaborate worldwide.\n\nPhotonDelta Foundation\n\nHigh Tech Campus 32\n5656 AE Eindhoven\nThe Netherlands\n\n[office@photondelta.com][40]\n[+31 (0) 639 003 325][41]\n\nMedia relations\n\n[pr@photondelta.com][42]\n\nFunding\n\n[funding@photondelta.com][43]\n\nHuman capital\n\n[humancapital@photondelta.com][44]\n\nCareers\n\n[View open positions][45]\n\n[PhotonDelta]\n\n##### PhotonDelta\n\nHigh Tech Campus 32 5656 AE Eindhoven The Netherlands[office@photondelta.com][46] [+31 (0) 639 003\n325][47]\n* [Downloads][48]\n* [News][49]\n* [Events][50]\n* [Careers][51]\n[ [PhotonDelta on LinkedIn] ][52] [ [PhotonDelta on Twitter] ][53]\n\n## Subscribe to our newsletter\n\nSign up here to receive the latest news from PhotonDelta \u2013 your monthly update about funding\nopportunities, partner news, events, and more.\n\n[Subscribe to newsletter][54]\n[Privacy Policy][55]\n\nWe use functional cookies to make the site work properly. We also place analytical cookies and\nthird-party cookies to measure website visits and show relevant advertisements.\n\nAcceptSettings\n\n## Cookie settings\n\nCustomize your cookie settings to choose how we use your data for a better experience.\n\nFunctional\n\nThese cookies are essential for the website to function properly, enabling core features like\nsecurity, accessibility, and user preferences.\n\nAnalytical\n\nThese cookies help us understand how visitors interact with our site by collecting anonymous data,\nallowing us to improve performance and user experience.\n\nAdvertising\n\nThese cookies are used to deliver personalized ads and track browsing activity across websites to\nshow relevant content based on your interests.\n\nAccept settings\n\n[1]: https://www.photondelta.com/about/\n[2]: https://www.photondelta.com/about/\n[3]: https://photondelta.com/about/#vision\n[4]: https://photondelta.com/about/#the-team\n[5]: https://photondelta.com/downloads/\n[6]: https://www.photondelta.com/ecosystem/\n[7]: https://www.photondelta.com/ecosystem-partners/\n[8]: https://photondelta.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Ecosystem-Overview-2026.png\n[9]: https://www.photondelta.com/join-our-ecosystem/\n[10]: https://www.photondelta.com/value-chain/\n[11]: https://photondelta.com/news/photonfirst-curtiss-wright-aerospace-sensing/\n[12]: https://www.photondelta.com/photonic-chips/\n[13]: https://www.photondelta.com/key-markets/automotive-and-mobility/\n[14]: https://www.photondelta.com/key-markets/data-and-telecom/\n[15]: https://www.photondelta.com/key-markets/food-and-agriculture/\n[16]: https://www.photondelta.com/key-markets/medical-and-healthcare/\n[17]: https://photondelta.com/news/building-inp-based-photonic-integrated-circuits-with-smart-photon\nics/\n[18]: https://www.photondelta.com/innovation/\n[19]: https://www.photondelta.com/projects/\n[20]: https://photondelta.com/news/laurens-weers-next-phase-integrated-photonics/\n[21]: https://www.photondelta.com/our-activities/\n[22]: https://www.photondelta.com/internationalisation-2/\n[23]: https://www.photondelta.com/human-capital/\n[24]: https://www.photondelta.com/funding/\n[25]: https://www.picsummiteurope.com/event/2026/home\n[26]: https://www.photonjobs.nl/\n[27]: https://www.photonstudio.nl/\n[28]: https://www.wevolver.com/article/global-photonics-engineering-contest-2026\n[29]: https://www.photondelta.com/news/\n[30]: https://www.photondelta.com/news/\n[31]: /downloads\n[32]: /events\n[33]: https://www.photondelta.com/careers/\n[34]: https://www.picsummiteurope.com/event/2026/home\n[35]: https://www.photondelta.com/contact/\n[36]: https://www.photondelta.com?s=Ecosystem\n[37]: https://www.photondelta.com?s=Supply Chain\n[38]: https://www.photondelta.com?s=Prototyping\n[39]: https://www.photondelta.com?s=Photonic Integrated Chips (PICs)\n[40]: mailto:office@photondelta.com\n[41]: tel:+31 (0) 639 003 325\n[42]: mailto:pr@photondelta.com\n[43]: mailto:funding@photondelta.com\n[44]: mailto:humancapital@photondelta.com\n[45]: https://www.photondelta.com/careers/\n[46]: mailto:office@photondelta.com\n[47]: tel:+31 (0) 639 003 325\n[48]: /downloads\n[49]: https://www.photondelta.com/news/\n[50]: /events\n[51]: /careers\n[52]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/photondelta\n[53]: https://twitter.com/photondelta\n[54]: https://www.photondelta.com/newsletter/\n[55]: https://www.photondelta.com/privacy-policy/"
