      "key_products": "Photonic Chips",
      "polished_summary": "PhotonDelta is a non-profit organization dedicated to advancing the end-to-end value chain for photonic chips, focusing on the design, development, and manufacturing of innovative solutions that enhance various industries. Their core product, photonic chips, serves a wide range of applications across sectors such as automotive and mobility, data and telecom, food and agriculture, and medical and healthcare, contributing to a better world through integrated photonics innovation.",
      "audit_reasoning": "PhotonDelta is focused on the design, development, and manufacturing of photonic chips, which are directly relevant to the spectral sensor market. Their activities support the integrated photonics industry, which includes applications in sensing technologies.",
