      "company_summary": "Pixxel is pioneering a full-stack space infrastructure designed to monitor the planet and promote sustainability through advanced hyperspectral imaging technology. Their core offerings include a constellation of hyperspectral imaging satellites that provide critical insights into Earth\u2019s ecosystems and the Earth Observation Studio, which transforms raw satellite data into actionable intelligence. Targeting industries such as agriculture, energy, government, environment, forestry, and mining, Pixxel is committed to driving progress in Earth observation for a sustainable future.",
