        "crawl_text": "Pixxel Space Technologies World Economic Forum Technology Pioneers 2024 TIME\u2019s Best Inventions 2023 Top Ten Innovative Space Companies 2023 Via Satellite Top 10 hottest satellite companies 2023 Bengaluru, India Bengaluru, India California, USA India USA Bengaluru, India Pixxel founded in 2019 with a vision to build a health monitor for the planet and expand humanity\u2019s reach into space. First satellite launched in April 2022 with SpaceX. Partnership with the US National Reconnaissance Office announced in March 2023. Building a hyperspectral satellite constellation to monitor Earth. Developing advanced analytics for actionable intelligence. PRODUCTS\n[Hyperspectral imagery][1][Earth Observation Studio][2]\nSOLUTIONS\n[Agriculture][3][Energy][4][Environment][5][Forestry][6][Mining][7][Government][8][\nView all\n][9]\nRESOURCES\n[knowledge hub\n][10][Newsroom][11][Earth Day Challenge\n][12][Hyperspectral Academy][13][webinars\n][14][events\n][15]\nCOMPANY\n[About Us][16][The Shakuntala Initiative][17][Team][18][Careers][19]\n[PARTNERS][20]\nSUPPORt\n[Contact Us\n][21][Customer Support][22]\n[order imagery][23]\nLogin\n][24]\n\n# Get In Touch\n\nHave a question or need more information?\nConnect with the Pixxel team to learn about our hyperspectral imaging\nsolutions, satellites, or career opportunities.\n\n## What Can We Help you With?\n\nContact Sales\n][25][\nBecome A Reseller\n][26][\nMedia Queries\n][27][\nGeneral Enquiry\n][28]\nCan't find what you're looking for?\nReach out to us at [contact@pixxel.space][29]\n[Become a part of the Pixxel team]\n\n## Join The Pixxel team\n\nEvery role at Pixxel is designed to create meaningful impact. If you're driven by purpose and\npassionate about shaping the future of Earth observation, we'd love for you to join our journey.\n\nview current openings\n][30]\n\n## Our Offices\n\n#### Bengaluru, India\n\n2JHJ+756, Swami Narayani Clinic Rd,\n3rd Block, HBR Layout, Bengaluru 560043\n][31][\n\n#### Bengaluru, India\n\nThird Floor, 722, Chinmaya Mission Hospital\nroad,Stage 2, Indiranagar, Bengaluru 560038\n][32][\n\n#### California, USA\n\n2301, Rosecrans Ave, Suite 4150,\nEl Segundo, CA 90245\n][33]\n\n## Subscribe to\n## our newsletter\n\nGet the latest from Pixxel in *Hypersphere*, our newsletter featuring news, partner insights, and\nexclusive event invitations.\n\nsign up now\n][34]\n\nSee what others miss.\nAct when it matters.\n\nget in touch\n][35]\n[X icon]\n][36][\n][37][\n[YouTube icon]\n][38][\n[Instagram icon]\n][39]\nPRODUCTS\n[Hyperspectral Imagery][40][Earth Observation Studio][41]\nSOLUTIONS\n[agriculture][42][energy][43][environment][44][forestry][45][government][46][mining][47]\nRESOURCES\n[knowledge hub][48][Newsroom][49][Hyperspectral Academy][50][webinars][51][events][52]\nCOMPANY\n[about us][53][The Shakuntala Initiative][54][team][55][careers][56]\nPARTNERS\n[Partner Ecosystem][57][Partner Portal][58]\nSUPPORT\n[support services][59][Support Portal][60]\nRETURNS\n[fY 21-22][61][fY 22-23][62][fY 23-24][63][fY 24-25][64]\nLOGINS\n[aurora][65]\n[\u00a9 2025 Pixxel, All rights reserved.][66]\n[Privacy Policy][67][ Aurora and Orderdesk][68][Sitemap][69]\n[Built at Parallel][70]\n\n[1]: /hyperspectral-imagery\n[2]: /aurora\n[3]: /solution/agriculture\n[4]: /solution/energy\n[5]: /solution/environment\n[6]: /solution/forestry\n[7]: /solution/mining\n[8]: /solution/government\n[9]: /solutions\n[10]: /knowledge-hub\n[11]: /newsroom\n[12]: /earth-day-quiz\n[13]: /hyperspectral-academy\n[14]: /webinars\n[15]: /events\n[16]: /about-us\n[17]: /the-shakuntala-initiative-by-pixxel\n[18]: /team\n[19]: /careers\n[20]: /partners\n[21]: /contact\n[22]: /support\n[23]: https://aurora.pixxel.space/\n[24]: #\n[25]: https://share.hsforms.com/1XtdSIZWqS7CorrSwLEYyvw4sbnm\n[26]: https://share.hsforms.com/1pgIWPV9-RhGp9kfU1KemTg4sbnm\n[27]: mailto:media@pixxel.space\n[28]: https://share.hsforms.com/1WY9K48lcSGKsZUqeo-qUGA4sbnm\n[29]: mailto:contact@pixxel.space?subject=Contact%20Pixxel\n[30]: https://pixxel.darwinbox.in/ms/candidate/careers\n[31]: https://g.co/kgs/9YeGb9W\n[32]: https://g.co/kgs/kwRULro\n[33]: https://g.co/kgs/RMU9NxJ\n[34]: https://share.hsforms.com/1TAy-X0bJTa-XgV5uk8VWCA4sbnm\n[35]: /contact\n[36]: https://x.com/pixxelspace\n[37]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/pixxelspace/\n[38]: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsW5GnmfBBqlIelSCZJC4xw\n[39]: https://www.instagram.com/pixxel.space/?hl=en\n[40]: /hyperspectral-imagery\n[41]: /aurora\n[42]: /solution/agriculture\n[43]: /solution/energy\n[44]: /solution/environment\n[45]: /solution/forestry\n[46]: /solution/government\n[47]: /solution/mining\n[48]: /knowledge-hub\n[49]: /newsroom\n[50]: /hyperspectral-academy\n[51]: /webinars\n[52]: /events\n[53]: /about-us\n[54]: /the-shakuntala-initiative-by-pixxel\n[55]: /team\n[56]: /careers\n[57]: /partners\n[58]: https://pixxel-partner.com/login\n[59]: /support\n[60]: https://support.pixxel.space/hc/en-us\n[61]: /annualreports/fy-21-22\n[62]: /annualreports/fy-22-23\n[63]: /annualreports/fy-23-24\n[64]: /annualreports/fy-24-25\n[65]: https://aurora.pixxel.space/\n[66]: /\n[67]: /privacy-policy\n[68]: /privacy-policy#aurora-and-order-desk\n[69]: /sitemap.xml\n[70]: https://www.parallelhq.com/ PRODUCTS\n[Hyperspectral imagery][1][Earth Observation Studio][2]\nSOLUTIONS\n[Agriculture][3][Energy][4][Environment][5][Forestry][6][Mining][7][Government][8][\nView all\n][9]\nRESOURCES\n[knowledge hub\n][10][Newsroom][11][Earth Day Challenge\n][12][Hyperspectral Academy][13][webinars\n][14][events\n][15]\nCOMPANY\n[About Us][16][The Shakuntala Initiative][17][Team][18][Careers][19]\n[PARTNERS][20]\nSUPPORt\n[Contact Us\n][21][Customer Support][22]\n[order imagery][23]\nLogin\n][24]\n\n# The Right Mix Of People,\n# Passion And Experience\n\nFrom building India\u2019s first Hyperloop pod to developing advanced satellites, missiles, and lunar\nlanders and rovers, our team has consistently pushed the frontiers of exploration.\n\n## Turning Experience\n## Into Impact\n\nAt Pixxel, we bring together deep expertise across engineering, research, design, project\nmanagement, brand, and business. Our teams work collaboratively to make space technology practical,\npurposeful, and accessible, bridging the gap between cutting-edge innovation and real-world impact.\n\nWe are united by the belief that space exploration is not just about reaching new frontiers. It is\nabout transforming our understanding of Earth and our place within it.\n\n## Leadership\n\n### Awais Ahmed\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n#### Founder and CEO\n\n][25]\n\n### Kshitij Khandelwal\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n#### Founder and CTO\n\n][26]\n\n### Eiji Yafuso\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n#### Chief Science Officer\n\n][27]\n\n### Manas Gupta\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n#### VP, Electronics\n\n][28]\n\n### Tejaswi Hareesh\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n#### VP, Mechanics\n\n][29]\n\n### Ryan Mckinney\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n#### Chief Revenue Officer\n\n][30]\n\n### Ravi Suhag\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n#### SVP, Engineering\n\n][31]\n\n### Srishti Bajpai\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n#### SVP, Finance\n\n][32]\n\n### Tanya Pallavi\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n#### Head of People Practices\n\n][33]\n\n### Allyson Jenkins\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n#### VP, Public Sector\n\n][34]\n\n### Abhilash Bhat\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n#### Chief of Staff\n\n][35]\n\n### Neerja Shah\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n#### Director, Brand & Comms\n\n][36]\n\n### Jeremy Kravitz\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n#### VP, Analytics\n\n][37]\n\n## Advisors\n\n### Preston Dunlap\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n][38]\n\n### Jordan Noone\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n][39]\n\n### Godard\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n][40]\n\n### Ryan Johnson\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n][41]\n\n## Drive the Next Leap\n## In Earth Observation\n\nWork with a team of innovators and explorers tackling climate challenges, sustainability, and\nexpanding the frontiers of space.\n\nBUILD with us\n][42]\n\n## Knowledge Hub\n\nDiscover how Pixxel\u2019s Earth Observation solutions drive real-world impact.\n\nJune 16, 2026\nBlog\n\n### Hyperspectral Intelligence in Agriculture\n\n[Read more][43]\nRead more\n][44]\nApril 30, 2026\nStorymaps\n\n### The Hyperspectral Advantage for Defense and Intelligence\n\n[Read more][45]\nRead more\n][46]\nFebruary 15, 2026\nStorymaps\n\n### Hyperspectral Imaging for Fire Assessment\n\n[Read more][47]\nRead more\n][48]\nview all\n][49]\n\nSee what others miss.\nAct when it matters.\n\nget in touch\n][50]\n[X icon]\n][51][\n][52][\n[YouTube icon]\n][53][\n[Instagram icon]\n][54]\nPRODUCTS\n[Hyperspectral Imagery][55][Earth Observation Studio][56]\nSOLUTIONS\n[agriculture][57][energy][58][environment][59][forestry][60][government][61][mining][62]\nRESOURCES\n[knowledge hub][63][Newsroom][64][Hyperspectral Academy][65][webinars][66][events][67]\nCOMPANY\n[about us][68][The Shakuntala Initiative][69][team][70][careers][71]\nPARTNERS\n[Partner Ecosystem][72][Partner Portal][73]\nSUPPORT\n[support services][74][Support Portal][75]\nRETURNS\n[fY 21-22][76][fY 22-23][77][fY 23-24][78][fY 24-25][79]\nLOGINS\n[aurora][80]\n[\u00a9 2025 Pixxel, All rights reserved.][81]\n[Privacy Policy][82][ Aurora and Orderdesk][83][Sitemap][84]\n[Built at Parallel][85]\n\n[1]: /hyperspectral-imagery\n[2]: /aurora\n[3]: /solution/agriculture\n[4]: /solution/energy\n[5]: /solution/environment\n[6]: /solution/forestry\n[7]: /solution/mining\n[8]: /solution/government\n[9]: /solutions\n[10]: /knowledge-hub\n[11]: /newsroom\n[12]: /earth-day-quiz\n[13]: /hyperspectral-academy\n[14]: /webinars\n[15]: /events\n[16]: /about-us\n[17]: /the-shakuntala-initiative-by-pixxel\n[18]: /team\n[19]: /careers\n[20]: /partners\n[21]: /contact\n[22]: /support\n[23]: https://aurora.pixxel.space/\n[24]: #\n[25]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/awaisahmedna/\n[26]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/khandelwalkshitij/\n[27]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/eiji-yafuso-9ab79/\n[28]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/guptamanas1/\n[29]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/tejaswi-hareesh/\n[30]: https