            "text": "PRODUCTS\n[Hyperspectral imagery][1][Earth Observation Studio][2]\nSOLUTIONS\n[Agriculture][3][Energy][4][Environment][5][Forestry][6][Mining][7][Government][8][\nView all\n][9]\nRESOURCES\n[knowledge hub\n][10][Newsroom][11][Earth Day Challenge\n][12][Hyperspectral Academy][13][webinars\n][14][events\n][15]\nCOMPANY\n[About Us][16][The Shakuntala Initiative][17][Team][18][Careers][19]\n[PARTNERS][20]\nSUPPORt\n[Contact Us\n][21][Customer Support][22]\n[order imagery][23]\nLogin\n][24]\n\n# Get In Touch\n\nHave a question or need more information?\nConnect with the Pixxel team to learn about our hyperspectral imaging\nsolutions, satellites, or career opportunities.\n\n## What Can We Help you With?\n\nContact Sales\n][25][\nBecome A Reseller\n][26][\nMedia Queries\n][27][\nGeneral Enquiry\n][28]\nCan't find what you're looking for?\nReach out to us at [contact@pixxel.space][29]\n[Become a part of the Pixxel team]\n\n## Join The Pixxel team\n\nEvery role at Pixxel is designed to create meaningful impact. If you're driven by purpose and\npassionate about shaping the future of Earth observation, we'd love for you to join our journey.\n\nview current openings\n][30]\n\n## Our Offices\n\n#### Bengaluru, India\n\n2JHJ+756, Swami Narayani Clinic Rd,\n3rd Block, HBR Layout, Bengaluru 560043\n][31][\n\n#### Bengaluru, India\n\nThird Floor, 722, Chinmaya Mission Hospital\nroad,Stage 2, Indiranagar, Bengaluru 560038\n][32][\n\n#### California, USA\n\n2301, Rosecrans Ave, Suite 4150,\nEl Segundo, CA 90245\n][33]\n\n## Subscribe to\n## our newsletter\n\nGet the latest from Pixxel in *Hypersphere*, our newsletter featuring news, partner insights, and\nexclusive event invitations.\n\nsign up now\n][34]\n\nSee what others miss.\nAct when it matters.\n\nget in touch\n][35]\n[X icon]\n][36][\n][37][\n[YouTube icon]\n][38][\n[Instagram icon]\n][39]\nPRODUCTS\n[Hyperspectral Imagery][40][Earth Observation Studio][41]\nSOLUTIONS\n[agriculture][42][energy][43][environ