ng\n[48]: /knowledge-hub\n[49]: /newsroom\n[50]: /hyperspectral-academy\n[51]: /webinars\n[52]: /events\n[53]: /about-us\n[54]: /the-shakuntala-initiative-by-pixxel\n[55]: /team\n[56]: /careers\n[57]: /partners\n[58]: https://pixxel-partner.com/login\n[59]: /support\n[60]: https://support.pixxel.space/hc/en-us\n[61]: /annualreports/fy-21-22\n[62]: /annualreports/fy-22-23\n[63]: /annualreports/fy-23-24\n[64]: /annualreports/fy-24-25\n[65]: https://aurora.pixxel.space/\n[66]: /\n[67]: /privacy-policy\n[68]: /privacy-policy#aurora-and-order-desk\n[69]: /sitemap.xml\n[70]: https://www.parallelhq.com/"
