            "url": "https://www.pixxel.space/team",
            "text": "PRODUCTS\n[Hyperspectral imagery][1][Earth Observation Studio][2]\nSOLUTIONS\n[Agriculture][3][Energy][4][Environment][5][Forestry][6][Mining][7][Government][8][\nView all\n][9]\nRESOURCES\n[knowledge hub\n][10][Newsroom][11][Earth Day Challenge\n][12][Hyperspectral Academy][13][webinars\n][14][events\n][15]\nCOMPANY\n[About Us][16][The Shakuntala Initiative][17][Team][18][Careers][19]\n[PARTNERS][20]\nSUPPORt\n[Contact Us\n][21][Customer Support][22]\n[order imagery][23]\nLogin\n][24]\n\n# The Right Mix Of People,\n# Passion And Experience\n\nFrom building India\u2019s first Hyperloop pod to developing advanced satellites, missiles, and lunar\nlanders and rovers, our team has consistently pushed the frontiers of exploration.\n\n## Turning Experience\n## Into Impact\n\nAt Pixxel, we bring together deep expertise across engineering, research, design, project\nmanagement, brand, and business. Our teams work collaboratively to make space technology practical,\npurposeful, and accessible, bridging the gap between cutting-edge innovation and real-world impact.\n\nWe are united by the belief that space exploration is not just about reaching new frontiers. It is\nabout transforming our understanding of Earth and our place within it.\n\n## Leadership\n\n### Awais Ahmed\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n#### Founder and CEO\n\n][25]\n\n### Kshitij Khandelwal\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n#### Founder and CTO\n\n][26]\n\n### Eiji Yafuso\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n#### Chief Science Officer\n\n][27]\n\n### Manas Gupta\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n#### VP, Electronics\n\n][28]\n\n### Tejaswi Hareesh\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n#### VP, Mechanics\n\n][29]\n\n### Ryan Mckinney\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n#### Chief Revenue Officer\n\n][30]\n\n### Ravi Suhag\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n#### SVP, Engineering\n\n][31]\n\n### Srishti Bajpai\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n#### SVP, Finance\n\n][32]\n\n### Tanya Pallavi\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n#### Head of People Practices\n\n][33]\n\n### Allyson Jenkins\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n#### VP, Public Sector\n\n][34]\n\n### Abhilash Bhat\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n#### Chief of Staff\n\n][35]\n\n### Neerja Shah\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n#### Director, Brand & Comms\n\n][36]\n\n### Jeremy Kravitz\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n#### VP, Analytics\n\n][37]\n\n## Advisors\n\n### Preston Dunlap\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n][38]\n\n### Jordan Noone\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n][39]\n\n### Godard\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n][40]\n\n### Ryan Johnson\n\n[LinkedIn icon]\n\n][41]\n\n## Drive the Next Leap\n## In Earth Observation\n\nWork with a team of innovators and explorers tackling climate challenges, sustainability, and\nexpanding the frontiers of space.\n\nBUILD with us\n][42]\n\n## Knowledge Hub\n\nDiscover how Pixxel\u2019s Earth Observation solutions drive real-world impact.\n\nJune 16, 2026\nBlog\n\n### Hyperspectral Intelligence in Agriculture\n\n[Read more][43]\nRead more\n][44]\nApril 30, 2026\nStorymaps\n\n### The Hyperspectral Advantage for Defense and Intelligence\n\n[Read more][45]\nRead more\n][46]\nFebruary 15, 2026\nStorymaps\n\n### Hyperspectral Imaging for Fire Assessment\n\n[Read more][47]\nRead more\n][48]\nview all\n][49]\n\nSee what others miss.\nAct when it matters.\n\nget in touch\n][50]\n[X icon]\n][51][\n][52][\n[YouTube icon]\n][53][\n[Instagram icon]\n][54]\nPRODUCTS\n[Hyperspectral Imagery][55][Earth Observation Studio][56]\nSOLUTIONS\n[agriculture][57][energy][58][environment][59][forestry][60][government][61][mining][62]\nRESOURCES\n[knowledge hub][63][Newsroom][64][Hyperspectral Academy][65][webinars][66][events][67]\nCOMPANY\n[about us][68][The Shakuntala Initiative][69][team][70][careers][71]\nPARTNERS\n[Partner Ecosystem][72][Partner Portal][73]\nSUPPORT\n[support services][74][Support Portal][75]\nRETURNS\n[fY 21-22][76][fY 22-23][77][fY 23-24][78][fY 24-25][79]\nLOGINS\n[aurora][80]\n[\u00a9 2025 Pixxel, All rights reserved.][81]\n[Privacy Policy][82][ Aurora and Orderdesk][83][Sitemap][84]\n[Built at Parallel][85]\n\n[1]: /hyperspectral-imagery\n[2]: /aurora\n[3]: /solution/agriculture\n[4]: /solution/energy\n[5]: /solution/environment\n[6]: /solution/forestry\n[7]: /solution/mining\n[8]: /solution/government\n[9]: /solutions\n[10]: /knowledge-hub\n[11]: /newsroom\n[12]: /earth-day-quiz\n[13]: /hyperspectral-academy\n[14]: /webinars\n[15]: /events\n[16]: /about-us\n[17]: /the-shakuntala-initiative-by-pixxel\n[18]: /team\n[19]: /careers\n[20]: /partners\n[21]: /contact\n[22]: /support\n[23]: https://aurora.pixxel.space/\n[24]: #\n[25]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/awaisahmedna/\n[26]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/khandelwalkshitij/\n[27]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/eiji-yafuso-9ab79/\n[28]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/guptamanas1/\n[29]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/tejaswi-hareesh/\n[30]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/ryan-mckinney-b5aa70/\n[31]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/ravisuhag/\n[32]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/srishti-bajpai-02578039/\n[33]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/tanya-pallavi-she-her-b3180425/\n[34]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/allysonjenkins/\n[35]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/abhilashbhat/\n[36]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/neerjashah/\n[37]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/jeremy-kravitz-07bb5612a/\n[38]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/preston-dunlap/\n[39]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/jordan-noone/\n[40]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/ggodardg/\n[41]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/ryanlarsjohnson\n[42]: https://pixxel.darwinbox.in/ms/candidate/careers\n[43]: /knowledge-hub/hyperspectral-intelligence-in-agriculture\n[44]: /knowledge-hub/hyperspectral-intelligence-in-agriculture\n[45]: /knowledge-hub/the-hyperspectral-advantage-for-defense-and-intelligence\n[46]: /knowledge-hub/the-hyperspectral-advantage-for-defense-and-intelligence\n[47]: /knowledge-hub/hyperspectral-imaging-for-fire-assessment\n[48]: /knowledge-hub/hyperspectral-imaging-for-fire-assessment\n[49]: /knowledge-hub\n[50]: /contact\n[51]: https://x.com/pixxelspace\n[52]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/pixxelspace/\n[53]: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsW5GnmfBBqlIelSCZJC4xw\n[54]: https://www.instagram.com/pixxel.space/?hl=en\n[55]: /hyperspectral-imagery\n[56]: /aurora\n[57]: /solution/agriculture\n[58]: /solution/energy\n[59]: /solution/environment\n[60]: /solution/forestry\n[61]: /solution/government\n[62]: /solution/mining\n[63]: /knowledge-hub\n[64]: /newsroom\n[65]: /hyperspectral-academy\n[66]: /webinars\n[67]: /events\n[68]: /about-us\n[69]: /the-shakuntala-initiative-by-pixxel\n[70]: /team\n[71]: /careers\n[72]: /partners\n[73]: https://pixxel-partner.com/login\n[74]: /support\n[75]: https://support.pixxel.space/hc/en-us\n[76]: /annualreports/fy-21-22\n[77]: /annualreports/fy-22-23\n[78]: /annualreports/fy-23-24\n[79]: /annualreports/fy-24-25\n[80]: https://aurora.pixxel.space/\n[81]: /\n[82]: /privacy-policy\n[83]: /privacy-policy#aurora-and-order-desk\n[84]: /sitemap.xml\n[85]: https://www.parallelhq.com/"
