            "url": "https://www.pixxel.space/about-us",
            "text": "PRODUCTS\n[Hyperspectral imagery][1][Earth Observation Studio][2]\nSOLUTIONS\n[Agriculture][3][Energy][4][Environment][5][Forestry][6][Mining][7][Government][8][\nView all\n][9]\nRESOURCES\n[knowledge hub\n][10][Newsroom][11][Earth Day Challenge\n][12][Hyperspectral Academy][13][webinars\n][14][events\n][15]\nCOMPANY\n[About Us][16][The Shakuntala Initiative][17][Team][18][Careers][19]\n[PARTNERS][20]\nSUPPORt\n[Contact Us\n][21][Customer Support][22]\n[order imagery][23]\nLogin\n][24]\n\n# Reimagining Earth Observation For A New Era\n\nWe're building a full-stack space infrastructure to monitor the planet, advance sustainability, and\npower the future of space-driven progress.\n\n## Seeing the Unseen\n\n#### Satellites. Software. Systems.\n#### Seamlessly Connected.\n\n## Hyperspectral Imagery\n\n### Our constellation of hyperspectral imaging satellites provides unparalleled insights into\n### Earth\u2019s ecosystems.\n\n][25][\n\n## Earth Observation Studio\n\n### Aurora by Pixxel, our cutting-edge Earth Observation Studio transforms raw satellite data into\n### actionable intelligence.\n\n][26]\n\n# Some Names Carry History.\n# \u200d Some Signal Beginnings.\n\n### Our Mission\n\n## Build A Health Monitor For The Planet\n\nWe\u2019re utilsing cutting-edge hyperspectral imaging to reveal what others can\u2019t: subtle, early signals\nof change in Earth\u2019s ecosystems, resources, and atmosphere.\n\nWith this level of detail, we help decision-makers act faster, manage smarter, and respond to\nthreats before they escalate. From crop health and water quality to pollution and climate impact,\nwe\u2019re building the intelligence layer the planet urgently needs.\n\n### Our Vision\n\n## Accelerate Humanity\u2019s\n## Expansion Into Space\n\nPixxel\u2019s vision is to make in-space resources accessible and help build a more resilient Earth.\n\nOur hyperspectral satellite constellation will monitor the planet in detail and map resource-rich\nzones across the solar system, paving the way for asteroidal discovery. In time, this will enable\nheavy industry to shift off-planet, easing Earth\u2019s burden and opening new frontiers.\n\nWe see a future where space technology drives global progress, empowers environmental solutions, and\nmakes interplanetary life possible.\n\n[Pixxel's vision: accelerate humanity's expansion into space]\n\n## Key Milestones\n\n2019\n2020\n2021\n2022\n2023\n2024\n2025\nFebruary 27, 2019\n\n### Pixxel Founded\n\nPixxel founded with the vision to build a health monitor for the planet and expand humanity\u2019s reach\ninto space\n\nAugust 19, 2020\n\n### Seed Funding Round\n\nLightspeed, India Partners, Blume Ventures, GrowX Ventures, Techstars, Omnivore VC and more ($8M)\n\nJanuary 20, 2021\n\n### First Office Opened\n\nPixxel sets up its first official office in Indiranagar, Bengaluru, marking a foundational step in\nits journey\n\nMarch 28, 2022\n\n### Series A Funding Round\n\nRadical Ventures, In-Q-Tel, Seraphim Space, Sparta LLC and others ($27M)\n\nApril 1, 2022\n\n### First Satellite Launch (Shakuntala)\n\nPixxel\u2019s first hyperspectral demo satellite launches with SpaceX\n\nNovember 26, 2022\n\n### Third Satellite Launch (Anand)\n\nPixxel launches its third demo hyperspectral satellite with ISRO\n\nFebruary 27, 2023\n\n### Pixxel Unveils First Light Images\n\nFirst hyperspectral images from Pixxel\u2019s demo satellites shared publicly\n\nMarch 23, 2023\n\n### Pixxel\u2013NRO Partnership Announced\n\nPixxel to support the US National Reconnaissance Office with hyperspectral data\n\nJune 1, 2023\n\n### Series B Funding Round\n\nGoogle and existing investors join in ($36M)\n\nJune 26, 2023\n\n### MoU Signed With MNCFC and MoA&FW\n\nCollaboration to enhance agricultural monitoring using hyperspectral data\n\nJuly 25, 2023\n\n### iDEX Prime (Space) Grant Awarded\n\nPixxel to build miniaturised multi-payload satellites for the Indian Air Force\n\nJanuary 15, 2024\n\n### Megapixxel Facility Launch\n\nPixxel\u2019s satellite manufacturing and integration facility opens in Bengaluru, India\n\nFebruary 20, 2024\n\n### MoU With The Indian Institute of Astrophysics\n\nTo utilise testing facilities and collaborate on scientific research\n\nFebruary 28, 2024\n\n### DIU & iDEX Maritime ISR Challenge Award\n\nPixxel wins first prize at INDUS-X summit highlighting the usage of hyperspectral imagery to detect\nocean surface oil spills\n\nAugust 5, 2024\n\n### Aurora Public Launch\n\nPixxel\u2019s Earth Observation Studio Aurora by Pixxel launches for public use\n\nSeptember 9, 2024\n\n### NASA Contract Awarded To Support Earth Science Research\n\nPart of NASA\u2019s $476M CSDA program to provide hyperspectral data\n\nDecember 9, 2024\n\n### Series B Extension Funding\n\nM&G Catalyst and Glade Brook Capital Partners join along with existing backers ($24M)\n\nJanuary 7, 2025\n\n### MoU signed With SI Imaging Services (SIIS)\n\nPixxel to introduce hyperspectral satellite data capabilities in South Korea through a strategic\npartnership\n\nJanuary 15, 2025\n\n### Three Fireflies Launch\n\nPixxel\u2019s first three commercial resolution hyperspectral satellites enter orbit with SpaceX\n\nMarch 18, 2025\n\n### Fireflies First Light\n\nFirst hyperspectral images from the Fireflies satellites revealed\n\nJune 11, 2025\n\n### iDEX grant for MWIR and Hyperspectral Payload\n\nPixxel signs SPARK Grant agreement to develop advanced payloads for the Indian Air Force\u2019s\nminiaturised satellites\n\n## Investors\n\n## Recognition\n\nWorld Economic Forum Technology Pioneers 2024\n\n][27][\n\nAwais and Kshitij in Entrepreneur 35u35\n\n][28][\n\nTIME\u2019s Best Inventions 2023\n\n][29][\n\nTop Ten Innovative Space Companies 2023\n\n][30][\n\nVia Satellite Top 10 hottest satellite companies 2023\n\n][31][\n\nAwais named in MIT Innovators 35u35 2023\n\n][32]\n\n## Explore careers\n## at pixxel\n\nJoin us to build what\u2019s next in space technology and help solve some of Earth\u2019s biggest challenges!\n\nSHAPE THE future\n][33]\n\n## Knowledge Hub\n\nDiscover how Pixxel\u2019s Earth Observation solutions drive real-world impact.\n\nJune 16, 2026\nBlog\n\n### Hyperspectral Intelligence in Agriculture\n\n[Read more][34]\nRead more\n][35]\nApril 30, 2026\nStorymaps\n\n### The Hyperspectral Advantage for Defense and Intelligence\n\n[Read more][36]\nRead more\n][37]\nFebruary 15, 2026\nStorymaps\n\n### Hyperspectral Imaging for Fire Assessment\n\n[Read more][38]\nRead more\n][39]\nview all\n][40]\n\nSee what others miss.\nAct when it matters.\n\nget in touch\n][41]\n[X icon]\n][42][\n][43][\n[YouTube icon]\n][44][\n[Instagram icon]\n][45]\nPRODUCTS\n[Hyperspectral Imagery][46][Earth Observation Studio][47]\nSOLUTIONS\n[agriculture][48][energy][49][environment][50][forestry][51][government][52][mining][53]\nRESOURCES\n[knowledge hub][54][Newsroom][55][Hyperspectral Academy][56][webinars][57][events][58]\nCOMPANY\n[about us][59][The Shakuntala Initiative][60][team][61][careers][62]\nPARTNERS\n[Partner Ecosystem][63][Partner Portal][64]\nSUPPORT\n[support services][65][Support Portal][66]\nRETURNS\n[fY 21-22][67][fY 22-23][68][fY 23-24][69][fY 24-25][70]\nLOGINS\n[aurora][71]\n[\u00a9 2025 Pixxel, All rights reserved.][72]\n[Privacy Policy][73][ Aurora and Orderdesk][74][Sitemap][75]\n[Built at Parallel][76]\n\n[1]: /hyperspectral-imagery\n[2]: /aurora\n[3]: /solution/agriculture\n[4]: /solution/energy\n[5]: /solution/environment\n[6]: /solution/forestry\n[7]: /solution/mining\n[8]: /solution/government\n[9]: /solutions\n[10]: /knowledge-hub\n[11]: /newsroom\n[12]: /earth-day-quiz\n[13]: /hyperspectral-academy\n[14]: /webinars\n[15]: /events\n[16]: /about-us\n[17]: /the-shakuntala-initiative-by-pixxel\n[18]: /team\n[19]: /careers\n[20]: /partners\n[21]: /contact\n[22]: /support\n[23]: https://aurora.pixxel.space/\n[24]: #\n[25]: /hyperspectral-imagery\n[26]: /aurora\n[27]: https://initiatives.weforum.org/technology-pioneers/organization-details/pixxel/0016800000Zgvj\nPAAR\n[28]: https://www.entrepreneur.com/en-in/entrepreneurs/the-satellite-heroes/469719\n[29]: https://time.com/collection/best-inventions-2023/6326945/pixxel-hyperspectral-imaging-satellit\nes/\n[30]: https://www.fastcompany.com/90849109/most-innovative-companies-space-2023\n[31]: https://interactive.satellitetoday.com/via/march-2023/the-10-hottest-satellite-companies-in-20\n[32]: https://www.technologyreview.com/innovator/awais-ahmed/\n[33]: https://pixxel.darwinbox.in/ms/candidate/careers\n[34]: /knowledge-hub/hyperspectral-intelligence-in-agriculture\n[35]: /knowledge-hub/hyperspectral-intelligence-in-agriculture\n[36]: /knowledge-hub/the-hyperspectral-advantage-for-defense-and-intelligence\n[37]: /knowledge-hub/the-hyperspectral-advantage-for-defense-and-intelligence\n[38]: /knowledge-hub/hyperspectral-imaging-for-fire-assessment\n[39]: /knowledge-hub/hyperspectral-imaging-for-fire-assessment\n[40]: /knowledge-hub\n[41]: /contact\n[42]: https://x.com/pixxelspace\n[43]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/pixxelspace/\n[44]: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsW5GnmfBBqlIelSCZJC4xw\n[45]: https://www.instagram.com/pixxel.space/?hl=en\n[46]: /hyperspectral-imagery\n[47]: /aurora\n[48]: /solution/agriculture\n[49]: /solution/energy\n[50]: /solution/environment\n[51]: /solution/forestry\n[52]: /solution/government\n[53]: /solution/mining\n[54]: /knowledge-hub\n[55]: /newsroom\n[56]: /hyperspectral-academy\n[57]: /webinars\n[58]: /events\n[59]: /about-us\n[60]: /the-shakuntala-initiative-by-pixxel\n[61]: /team\n[62]: /careers\n[63]: /partners\n[64]: https://pixxel-partner.com/login\n[65]: /support\n[66]: https://support.pixxel.space/hc/en-us\n[67]: /annualreports/fy-21-22\n[68]: /annualreports/fy-22-23\n[69]: /annualreports/fy-23-24\n[70]: /annualreports/fy-24-25\n[71]: https://aurora.pixxel.space/\n[72]: /\n[73]: /privacy-policy\n[74]: /privacy-policy#aurora-and-order-desk\n[75]: /sitemap.xml\n[76]: https://www.parallelhq.com/"
