            "url": "https://www.pixxel.space/solutions",
            "text": "PRODUCTS\n[Hyperspectral imagery][1][Earth Observation Studio][2]\nSOLUTIONS\n[Agriculture][3][Energy][4][Environment][5][Forestry][6][Mining][7][Government][8][\nView all\n][9]\nRESOURCES\n[knowledge hub\n][10][Newsroom][11][Earth Day Challenge\n][12][Hyperspectral Academy][13][webinars\n][14][events\n][15]\nCOMPANY\n[About Us][16][The Shakuntala Initiative][17][Team][18][Careers][19]\n[PARTNERS][20]\nSUPPORt\n[Contact Us\n][21][Customer Support][22]\n[order imagery][23]\nLogin\n][24]\n\n# Solutions\n\nPixxel's hyperspectral imagery is more frequent, consistent and of higher quality, giving you the\nadvantage of targeted monitoring, localised problem detection, and hyper optimised solutions in\nevery sector globally.\n\n## Agriculture\n\nEarly stress detection\n\nCrop species classification\n\nCrop yield prediction\n\nSoil nutrient analysis\n\n[Know more][25]\n\n## Energy\n\nOil spill detection\n\nPipeline monitoring\n\nVessel tracking\n\nHydrocarbon estimation\n\n[Know more][26]\n\n## Government\n\nPlan urban infrastructure\n\nMap road networks\n\nNatural disaster response\n\nNatural resource planning\n\n[Know more][27]\n\n## Environment\n\nHabitat mapping\n\nPollution & stress level quantification\n\nCarbon sequestration\n\nVegetation detection\n\n[Know more][28]\n\n## Forestry\n\nTree species classification\n\nEarly vegetation stress detection\n\nAbove-ground biomass estimation\n\nForest fire detection and mitigation\n\n[Know more][29]\n\n## Mining\n\nMineral detection\n\nMine site closure\n\nIllegal mining prevention\n\nEnvironmental compliance\n\n[Know more][30]\n\n## Turn Satellite Data\n## into Action with Pixxel\n\nHarness cutting-edge hyperspectral imagery and advanced analytics to make faster, informed\ndecisions. Start leveraging Earth observation data for your business today!\n\nget in touch\n][31]\n\nSee what others miss.\nAct when it matters.\n\nget in touch\n][32]\n[X icon]\n][33][\n][34][\n[YouTube icon]\n][35][\n[Instagram icon]\n][36]\nPRODUCTS\n[Hyperspectral Imagery][37][Earth Observation Studio][38]\nSOLUTIONS\n[agriculture][39][energy][40][environment][41][forestry][42][government][43][mining][44]\nRESOURCES\n[knowledge hub][45][Newsroom][46][Hyperspectral Academy][47][webinars][48][events][49]\nCOMPANY\n[about us][50][The Shakuntala Initiative][51][team][52][careers][53]\nPARTNERS\n[Partner Ecosystem][54][Partner Portal][55]\nSUPPORT\n[support services][56][Support Portal][57]\nRETURNS\n[fY 21-22][58][fY 22-23][59][fY 23-24][60][fY 24-25][61]\nLOGINS\n[aurora][62]\n[\u00a9 2025 Pixxel, All rights reserved.][63]\n[Privacy Policy][64][ Aurora and Orderdesk][65][Sitemap][66]\n[Built at Parallel][67]\n\n[1]: /hyperspectral-imagery\n[2]: /aurora\n[3]: /solution/agriculture\n[4]: /solution/energy\n[5]: /solution/environment\n[6]: /solution/forestry\n[7]: /solution/mining\n[8]: /solution/government\n[9]: /solutions\n[10]: /knowledge-hub\n[11]: /newsroom\n[12]: /earth-day-quiz\n[13]: /hyperspectral-academy\n[14]: /webinars\n[15]: /events\n[16]: /about-us\n[17]: /the-shakuntala-initiative-by-pixxel\n[18]: /team\n[19]: /careers\n[20]: /partners\n[21]: /contact\n[22]: /support\n[23]: https://aurora.pixxel.space/\n[24]: #\n[25]: /solution/agriculture\n[26]: /solution/energy\n[27]: /solution/government\n[28]: /solution/environment\n[29]: /solution/forestry\n[30]: /solution/mining\n[31]: /contact\n[32]: /contact\n[33]: https://x.com/pixxelspace\n[34]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/pixxelspace/\n[35]: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsW5GnmfBBqlIelSCZJC4xw\n[36]: https://www.instagram.com/pixxel.space/?hl=en\n[37]: /hyperspectral-imagery\n[38]: /aurora\n[39]: /solution/agriculture\n[40]: /solution/energy\n[41]: /solution/environment\n[42]: /solution/forestry\n[43]: /solution/government\n[44]: /solution/mining\n[45]: /knowledge-hub\n[46]: /newsroom\n[47]: /hyperspectral-academy\n[48]: /webinars\n[49]: /events\n[50]: /about-us\n[51]: /the-shakuntala-initiative-by-pixxel\n[52]: /team\n[53]: /careers\n[54]: /partners\n[55]: https://pixxel-partner.com/login\n[56]: /support\n[57]: https://support.pixxel.space/hc/en-us\n[58]: /annualreports/fy-21-22\n[59]: /annualreports/fy-22-23\n[60]: /annualreports/fy-23-24\n[61]: /annualreports/fy-24-25\n[62]: https://aurora.pixxel.space/\n[63]: /\n[64]: /privacy-policy\n[65]: /privacy-policy#aurora-and-order-desk\n[66]: /sitemap.xml\n[67]: https://www.parallelhq.com/"
