.com/channel/UCsW5GnmfBBqlIelSCZJC4xw\n[54]: https://www.instagram.com/pixxel.space/?hl=en\n[55]: /hyperspectral-imagery\n[56]: /aurora\n[57]: /solution/agriculture\n[58]: /solution/energy\n[59]: /solution/environment\n[60]: /solution/forestry\n[61]: /solution/government\n[62]: /solution/mining\n[63]: /knowledge-hub\n[64]: /newsroom\n[65]: /hyperspectral-academy\n[66]: /webinars\n[67]: /events\n[68]: /about-us\n[69]: /the-shakuntala-initiative-by-pixxel\n[70]: /team\n[71]: /careers\n[72]: /partners\n[73]: https://pixxel-partner.com/login\n[74]: /support\n[75]: https://support.pixxel.space/hc/en-us\n[76]: /annualreports/fy-21-22\n[77]: /annualreports/fy-22-23\n[78]: /annualreports/fy-23-24\n[79]: /annualreports/fy-24-25\n[80]: https://aurora.pixxel.space/\n[81]: /\n[82]: /privacy-policy\n[83]: /privacy-policy#aurora-and-order-desk\n[84]: /sitemap.xml\n[85]: https://www.parallelhq.com/"
