            "text": "[[Precision Optical Logo]][1]\n\nITAR registered and ROHS & REACH compliant\n\nISO 9001:2015 certification\nView or download:\n[ANAB][2] and [RvA][3]\nEmail Us\nSales@precisionoptical.com\n][4]\n[Call Us\n949.631.6800][5]\nMenu\n* [Optics][6]\n* [Custom Prisms][7]\n* [Corner Cube Retroreflectors][8]\n* [Porro Prisms / Right Angle Prisms][9]\n* [Beamsplitters][10]\n* [Penta Prisms][11]\n* [Other Optics][12]\n* [Optical Flats][13]\n* [Large Optical Flats][14]\n* [Optical Flats and Wedges][15]\n* [Optical Windows and Mirrors][16]\n* [Mounted Reference Flats][17]\n* [Alignment Cubes][18]\n* [Catalog Optics][19]\n* [Assembly & Integration][20]\n* [Coatings][21]\n* [Mirrors][22]\n* [Protected / Enhanced Aluminum][23]\n* [Protected / Enhanced Silver][24]\n* [Dielectric Broadband][25]\n* [Cold / Hot][26]\n* [AR Coatings][27]\n* [Single-Layer AR][28]\n* [V-Coat][29]\n* [Double V-Coat][30]\n* [Broadband (UV, VIS, NIR, SWIR, EX)][31]\n* [Beamsplitters][32]\n* [Non-Polarizing Beamsplitter][33]\n* [Polarizing Beamsplitter][34]\n* [Broadband Polarizing Beamsplitter][35]\n* [Filters][36]\n* [Shortwave Pass][37]\n* [Longwave Pass][38]\n* [Band Pass][39]\n* [Neutral Density][40]\n* [Technology][41]\n* [E-Beam][42]\n* [Ion Beam Sputtering (IBS)][43]\n* [Thermal Evaporation][44]\n* [Plasma Assist][45]\n* [Ion Assist][46]\n* [Equipment][47]\n* [Coating Chambers][48]\n* [Counter Rotating Uniformity Masking][49]\n* [Laminar Flow Hood Stations][50]\n* [Nitrogen Generating System][51]\n* [Thermal, Humidity, and Environmental Chambers][52]\n* [Large Optical Lifting System][53]\n* [Spectrophotometers][54]\n* [Design][55]\n* [Thin Film Software][56]\n* [Custom Tooling][57]\n* [Laser Damage & Durability][58]\n* [QA & Metrology][59]\n* [Specifications and Tolerances][60]\n* [Interferometric Testing][61]\n* [Angular Testing][62]\n* [Mechanical Testing][63]\n* [Spectral Testing][64]\n* [Environmental Testing][65]\n* [Services][66]\n* [Engineering][67]\n* [Materials Qualification][68]\n* [Fabrication][69]\n* [Polishing][70]\n* [Coatings][71]\n* [Assembly][72]\n* [Metrology][73]\n* [CNC Machining][74]\n* [Optical Packaging][75]\n* [About Us][76]\n* [About Precision Optical][77]\n* [Our Facilities][78]\n* [Education and Outreach][79]\n* [Industries We Serve][80]\n* [Military & Defense][81]\n* [Astronomy & Aerospace][82]\n* [Laser][83]\n* [Metrology][84]\n* [Biomedical][85]\n* [Semi-Conductor][86]\n* [News][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n* [949.631.6800][89]\n[Sales@precisionoptical.com][90]\n[More Options][91]\nName(Required)\nEmail(Required)\nPhone\nCompany\nMessage\nCAPTCHA\n* * Search Search\n\n# Engineering Services\n\n# Engineering Services\n* [Engineering Services][92]\n* [Materials Qualification][93]\n* [Optical Fabrication][94]\n* [Optical Polishing][95]\n* [Assembly Services][96]\n* [Metrology Services][97]\n* [CNC Machining Services][98]\n* [Optical Packaging][99]\n\nPrecision Optical utilizes a diverse portfolio of engineering tools to develop successful\nmanufacturing processes. Our engineers combine state-of-the-art technology with traditional optical\nfabrication techniques to provide effective solutions for the most critical optical design\nrequirements. Emphasis is placed on optimizing all areas of component manufacturing, including\n[**optical alignment**][100], dimensions, surface form,\n\ncosmetic quality, and **[thin film coatings][101]**. Our engineering and **[sales teams][102]** work\nclosely with customers to determine tolerancing options that optimize performance and minimize costs\nof optical components.\n\nPrecision Optical can also offer engineering services to support our customers. Our experienced\nengineering team can assist in early stage development of customer designs, custom solutions for\nexisting designs, and/or overall design of optical components, optical sub-components, and\n**[optical assemblies][103]**. Please **[contact us][104]**, if there is interest in our **[design\nsupport][105]** capabilities.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n### Service Types & Software\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n* **\u2022 Kubotek KeyCreator 3D Modeling Software **\n* **\u2022 5th Axis CNC Machining Capabilities with Mastercam CAD/CAM Software **\n* **\u2022 TurboCad 2D Modeling Software **\n* **\u2022 3D Printing and Rapid Prototyping with Apex Software **\n* **\u2022 Measuremind 3D Multisensor and Quadra Check 5000 CMM Measurement Software **\n* **\u2022 4D 4Sight, Zygo MetroPro 9, Mx, and Vision 32 Interferometer Analysis Software **\n* **\u2022 Interferometer Stitching Hardware/Software **\n* **\u2022 Optilayer, FilmStar & TFCalc Thin Film Design Software **\n* **\u2022 UV Winlab Spectrophotometer and 3G Rail Mounted Laser Analysis Software **\n* **\u2022 Custom Camera Mounted Collimators & Alignment Telescopes **\n* **\u2022 Epilog Laser Etching with CorelDraw Software **\n* **\u2022 Ilis Strainscope Stress Birefringence Analysis and Software **\n* **\u2022 Extensive Experience with Traditional Optical Manufacturing and Inspection Techniques **\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[[Precision Optical Logo White][Precision Optical Logo White]][106]\n[[Precision Optical Logo White][Precision Optical Logo White]][107]\nPrecision Optical\n320 Kalmus Drive\nCosta Mesa, CA 92626\nUSA\n[949.631.6800][108]\n[Sales@precisionoptical.com][109]\n\n#### Who We Are\n\nPrecision Optical is a world-leading manufacturer of custom prisms and optical assemblies. Our\ncutting edge technology allows us to achieve a level of precision that few others in the industry\ncan match.[ Contact us today][110] to learn more.\n\n#### Navigation\n* [> Home][111]\n* [> Optics][112]\n* [> Coatings][113]\n* [> QA & Metrology][114]\n* [> Services][115]\n* [> Industries][116]\n* [> About Us][117]\n* [> News][118]\n* [> Contact Us][119]\n\nDownload or view our [Terms & Conditions.][120]\n\n#### Latest News\n\n[Precision Optical to Exhibit at SPIE Defense & Security in National Harbor 2026][121]\n\nApril 20, 2026\n\n[Precision Optical (The Prism Specialists) to Exhibit at SPIE Photonics West 2026 in San Francisco,\nCA][122]\n\nJanuary 12, 2026\n\n[Precision Optical to Exhibit at SPIE OptiFab 2025 in Rochester, NY][123]\n\nOctober 13, 2025\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: https://www.precisionoptical.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/ISO_9001-ENG-1