            "url": "https://www.precisionoptical.com/services/metrology-services/",
            "text": "[[Precision Optical Logo]][1]\n\nITAR registered and ROHS & REACH compliant\n\nISO 9001:2015 certification\nView or download:\n[ANAB][2] and [RvA][3]\nEmail Us\nSales@precisionoptical.com\n][4]\n[Call Us\n949.631.6800][5]\nMenu\n* [Optics][6]\n* [Custom Prisms][7]\n* [Corner Cube Retroreflectors][8]\n* [Porro Prisms / Right Angle Prisms][9]\n* [Beamsplitters][10]\n* [Penta Prisms][11]\n* [Other Optics][12]\n* [Optical Flats][13]\n* [Large Optical Flats][14]\n* [Optical Flats and Wedges][15]\n* [Optical Windows and Mirrors][16]\n* [Mounted Reference Flats][17]\n* [Alignment Cubes][18]\n* [Catalog Optics][19]\n* [Assembly & Integration][20]\n* [Coatings][21]\n* [Mirrors][22]\n* [Protected / Enhanced Aluminum][23]\n* [Protected / Enhanced Silver][24]\n* [Dielectric Broadband][25]\n* [Cold / Hot][26]\n* [AR Coatings][27]\n* [Single-Layer AR][28]\n* [V-Coat][29]\n* [Double V-Coat][30]\n* [Broadband (UV, VIS, NIR, SWIR, EX)][31]\n* [Beamsplitters][32]\n* [Non-Polarizing Beamsplitter][33]\n* [Polarizing Beamsplitter][34]\n* [Broadband Polarizing Beamsplitter][35]\n* [Filters][36]\n* [Shortwave Pass][37]\n* [Longwave Pass][38]\n* [Band Pass][39]\n* [Neutral Density][40]\n* [Technology][41]\n* [E-Beam][42]\n* [Ion Beam Sputtering (IBS)][43]\n* [Thermal Evaporation][44]\n* [Plasma Assist][45]\n* [Ion Assist][46]\n* [Equipment][47]\n* [Coating Chambers][48]\n* [Counter Rotating Uniformity Masking][49]\n* [Laminar Flow Hood Stations][50]\n* [Nitrogen Generating System][51]\n* [Thermal, Humidity, and Environmental Chambers][52]\n* [Large Optical Lifting System][53]\n* [Spectrophotometers][54]\n* [Design][55]\n* [Thin Film Software][56]\n* [Custom Tooling][57]\n* [Laser Damage & Durability][58]\n* [QA & Metrology][59]\n* [Specifications and Tolerances][60]\n* [Interferometric Testing][61]\n* [Angular Testing][62]\n* [Mechanical Testing][63]\n* [Spectral Testing][64]\n* [Environmental Testing][65]\n* [Services][66]\n* [Engineering][67]\n* [Materials Qualification][68]\n* [Fabrication][69]\n* [Polishing][70]\n* [Coatings][71]\n* [Assembly][72]\n* [Metrology][73]\n* [CNC Machining][74]\n* [Optical Packaging][75]\n* [About Us][76]\n* [About Precision Optical][77]\n* [Our Facilities][78]\n* [Education and Outreach][79]\n* [Industries We Serve][80]\n* [Military & Defense][81]\n* [Astronomy & Aerospace][82]\n* [Laser][83]\n* [Metrology][84]\n* [Biomedical][85]\n* [Semi-Conductor][86]\n* [News][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n* [949.631.6800][89]\n[Sales@precisionoptical.com][90]\n[More Options][91]\nName(Required)\nEmail(Required)\nPhone\nCompany\nMessage\nCAPTCHA\n* * Search Search\n\n# Metrology Services\n\n# Metrology Services\n* [Engineering Services][92]\n* [Materials Qualification][93]\n* [Optical Fabrication][94]\n* [Optical Polishing][95]\n* [Assembly Services][96]\n* [Metrology Services][97]\n* [CNC Machining Services][98]\n* [Optical Packaging][99]\n\nPrecision Optical has over 200 years of combined [**metrology experience**,][100] and it shows in\nthe superior quality and consistency of our metrology services. Using interferometry, surface\nprofilometery, spectrophotometry, autocollimation, coordinate measurement machines, environmental\ntesting equipment, and traditional mechanical inspection equipment, Precision Optical is ideally\nequipped to offer a vast array of metrology services for both plano and spherical elements. Our\nability to support these services with detailed inspection reports, First Article Inspection (FAI),\nQualification Unit Testing, Acceptance Test Procedures, proper supporting documentation (NIST & PTB\ntraceable), and custom detailed reporting and presentations, ensures that Precision Optical will\nexceed your expectations.\n\nPrecision Optical metrology services include, are not limited to, the following:\n* [**Spherical surface form and radius measurement**][101];\n* [**Large aperture (600mm) interferometric inspection**][102][;][103]\n* **[Material qualification (inclusions,striae, birefringence, homogeneity)][104]**\n* **[Surface roughness inspection][105];**\n* **[CMM inspection][106];**\n* **[Surface quality inspection and mapping][107];**\n* **[Spectral testing][108];**\n* **[Mechanical testing][109];**\n* **[Angular testing][110]; **and\n* **[Environmental testing][111].**\n\nSpecific interferometric testing can include surface figure, irregularity, transmitted wavefront\nerror, 90\u00b0 internal and external measurements, beam deviation, wedge magnitude, corner cube, slope\nmagnitude, [**homogeneity testing**][112], multiple-region analysis, and **[3-flat testing][113]**.\n\nPlease **[contact us][114]** to discuss your needs for metrology services!\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n### Metrology Service Hardware & Software\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n* **\u2022 Measuremind 3D Multisensor and Quadra Check 5000 CMM Measurement Software **\n* **\u2022 Zygo MetroPro 9, Mx, Vision 32 and 4D 4Sight Interferometer Analysis Software **\n* **\u2022 PrismMaster, OptiAngle and Goniomatik Angular Analysis Software **\n* **\u2022 Optilayer, FilmStar & TFCalc Thin Film Design Software **\n* **\u2022 UV Winlab Spectrophotometer and 3G Rail Mounted Laser Analysis Software **\n* **\u2022 Custom Camera Mounted Collimators & Alignment Telescopes **\n* **\u2022 Interferometer Stitching Hardware/Software **\n* **\u2022 Ilis Strainscope Stress Birefringence Analysis and Software **\n* **\u2022 Extensive Experience with Traditional Optical Inspection Techniques **\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[[Precision Optical Logo White][Precision Optical Logo White]][115]\n[[Precision Optical Logo White][Precision Optical Logo White]][116]\nPrecision Optical\n320 Kalmus Drive\nCosta Mesa, CA 92626\nUSA\n[949.631.6800][117]\n[Sales@precisionoptical.com][118]\n\n#### Who We Are\n\nPrecision Optical is a world-leading manufacturer of custom prisms and optical assemblies. Our\ncutting edge technology allows us to achieve a level of precision that few others in the industry\ncan match.[ Contact us today][119] to learn more.\n\n#### Navigation\n* [> Home][120]\n* [> Optics][121]\n* [> Coatings][122]\n* [> QA & Metrology][123]\n* [> Services][124]\n* [> Industries][125]\n* [> About Us][126]\n* [> News][127]\n* [> Contact Us][128]\n\nDownload or view our [Terms & Conditions.][129]\n\n#### La