      "polished_summary": "Precision Optical is a leading manufacturer specializing in custom prisms and optical assemblies, leveraging advanced technology to deliver precision-engineered solutions for the Defense, Aerospace, Biomedical, and Semiconductor industries. In addition to its core products, the company offers a range of services including CNC machining, optical coatings, and metrology, catering to manufacturers and developers in optics and related fields.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Precision Optical manufactures custom prisms and optical assemblies, which are essential components in spectral sensor applications. Their focus on optical fabrication and coatings aligns directly with the needs of the spectral sensor market.",
