      "polished_summary": "Ross Optical is a leading supplier of specialty optics and optical assemblies, catering to diverse industries such as medical devices and automation. The company offers a wide range of products, including custom optics, micro optics, and complex optical assemblies, all supported by advanced engineering and fabrication capabilities. With a commitment to quality and precision, Ross Optical serves OEMs by providing innovative solutions that meet specific optical requirements.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Ross Optical manufactures and supplies specialty optics and optical assemblies, which are directly relevant to the spectral sensor market. Their offerings include custom optics, micro optics, and complex optical assemblies, which are essential components in various applications including medical devices and automation.",
