      "company_summary": "RP Photonics is an independent company specializing in photonics, laser technology, and fiber optics, renowned for its innovative solutions and exceptional customer service. The company offers advanced simulation software, including RP Fiber Power, RP Resonator, RP ProPulse, and RP Coating, designed for engineers and researchers in the photonics and laser technology sectors. Additionally, RP Photonics provides technical consulting services, delivering expertise in product design and problem-solving for companies within the photonics industry.",
