      "key_products": "RP Fiber Power, RP ProPulse, RP Resonator, RP Coating",
      "polished_summary": "RP Photonics is an independent company specializing in photonics, laser technology, and fiber optics, renowned for its innovative solutions and exceptional customer service. The company offers advanced simulation software, including RP Fiber Power, RP Resonator, RP ProPulse, and RP Coating, designed for engineers and researchers in the photonics and laser technology sectors. Additionally, RP Photonics provides technical consulting services, delivering expertise in product design and problem-solving for companies within the photonics industry.",
      "audit_reasoning": "RP Photonics specializes in photonics and laser technology, offering advanced simulation software and technical consulting services that are directly applicable to the spectral sensor market. Their products, such as RP Fiber Power and RP ProPulse, are relevant to the design and optimization of photonic systems.",
