      "key_products": "Hyperspectral Imaging, Colour Measurement, Gloss and Appearance Measurement, Light and Display Measurement, Vision Quality Control",
      "polished_summary": "Sensing is a leading provider of color measurement and quality control solutions, specializing in a range of measurement instruments tailored for industries such as graphic arts, light and display, and vision quality control. Their product offerings include advanced tools for precise color measurement, gloss and appearance assessment, controlled lighting environments, and hyperspectral imaging, all designed to ensure high standards of quality and performance in visual outputs.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Sensing specializes in color measurement and quality control solutions, including hyperspectral imaging, which is directly relevant to the spectral sensor market. Their product offerings are tailored for industries that require precise measurement and quality assurance, making them a key player in this field.",
