      "company_summary": "Sensorix Automation specializes in high-quality sensors and control solutions for various industries across India, leveraging over 20 years of experience in the field. As authorized channel partners of renowned global brands such as SICK, Adel System, and Lenze, the company offers advanced automation products that enhance manufacturing operations, ensure process accuracy, and provide reliable performance in sectors including automotive, pharmaceuticals, food and beverage, and logistics. With a commitment to customer satisfaction, Sensorix Automation also delivers dedicated technical assistance and after-sales support.",
