 provide a reliable\nsolution for the purchasing of optical components and processed glass from China.\n\nIts offer soon expanded, including custom optics manufacturing with key suppliers with price and\nlead-time advantages.\n\nIn 2010, Sinoptix merged with the Belgium company AGC Business Consulting, which is operationally\nlocated in Shanghai, China. This strengthened Sinoptix\u2019s ability to handle complex projects and\noffer integration gain for both structures.\n\nIn 2011, Sinoptix developed a new department within its company, named Sinoptix Distribution,\nspecifically concentrating on supporting "
