      "company_summary": "Specmeters, operating under Spectrum Technologies, Inc., specializes in advanced environmental monitoring solutions, offering a wide range of products including weather stations, soil moisture meters, and data loggers. Their innovative tools are designed to enhance data collection and visualization for professionals in agriculture, horticulture, and environmental research, enabling users to make informed decisions based on real-time data.",
