      "company_summary": "Spectrafy specializes in advanced solar and atmospheric sensors that provide accurate, affordable, and reliable measurements for various applications. Their innovative product lineup includes state-of-the-art sensors like the SolarSIM series, designed to enhance solar resource measurement for photovoltaic (PV) applications, meteorological research, and agricultural studies. By combining multi-spectral measurement with proprietary algorithms, Spectrafy delivers unmatched functionality and precision in spectral data analysis.",
