      "polished_summary": "Spectrafy specializes in advanced solar and atmospheric sensors that provide accurate, affordable, and reliable measurements for various applications. Their innovative product lineup includes state-of-the-art sensors like the SolarSIM series, designed to enhance solar resource measurement for photovoltaic (PV) applications, meteorological research, and agricultural studies. By combining multi-spectral measurement with proprietary algorithms, Spectrafy delivers unmatched functionality and precision in spectral data analysis.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Spectrafy manufactures advanced solar and atmospheric sensors specifically designed for spectral data analysis, which directly aligns with the target market of spectral sensors. Their product lineup includes various models of the SolarSIM series, which are tailored for solar resource measurement and other applications, demonstrating their relevance in this market.",
