      "company_summary": "Spectraldynamics is a leading global provider of advanced systems and software for vibration testing, structural dynamics, and acoustic analysis. The company specializes in innovative vibration control solutions and data acquisition systems, catering to manufacturers in industries such as aerospace, automotive, electronics, and defense. Their product lineup includes the SIPS\u2122 Vibration Control System, VIDAS\u2122 Data Acquisition System, and various data analysis software tools, all designed to enhance testing accuracy and reliability for electronic and mechanical products.",
      "operational_presence": "Not stated on website",
