        "crawl_text": "Spectral Dynamics, Inc. ISO 9001:2015 1500 Wyatt Drive Suite 14, Santa Clara, CA 95054-1522 [ [Spectral Dynamics Inc.] ][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [About SD][3]\n* [History of Spectral Dynamics][4]\n* [ Shakers ][5]\n\n### Shakers\n* [Overview][6]\n* [Water Cooled][7]\n* [Air Cooled][8]\n* [Vibration Shaker Systems Buyer's Guide][9]\n\n### Options\n* [Slip Tables & Head Expanders][10]\n* [Shock Test Machines][11]\n* [Hydraulic Exciters][12]\n* [ Vibration Controllers ][13]\n\n### Multiple/Single Axis\n* [Jaguar\u2122][14]\n\n### Single Axis\n* [Panther][15]\n* [Puma\u2122][16]\n* [Lynx\u2122][17]\n* [ Advanced Solutions ][18]\n\n### ARPG Products\n* [SIPS\u2122][19]\n* [VIDAS\u2122][20]\n* [IMPAX-SD-LAB\u2122][21]\n\n### P.I.N.D. System\n* [Felix\u2122 Computer Aided Test System][22]\n\n### Advanced Solutions\n* [Shock Test Systems][23]\n* [BalanceTool\u2122][24]\n\n### High Speed Data Acquisition\n* [VIDAS\u2122][25]\n\n### Data Analysis\n* [CATS\u2122][26]\n* [STAR Modal\u2122][27]\n* [STAR Acoustics\u2122][28]\n* [Support][29]\n\n### Service & Information\n* [Vibration Control Buyer\u2019s Guide][30]\n* [Request Product Information][31]\n* [Contact SD][32]\n* [Customer Training][33]\n* [Domestic US Service][34]\n\n### Software Support\n* [Panther Software Tutorials ][35]\n* [Spectral Dynamics Software FAQs][36]\n* [CATS / STAR Modal\u2122 Help][37]\n\n### Additional Support\n* [Related Links][38]\n* [Technical Library][39]\n* [Spectral Dynamics Vibration Calculator][40]\n1. You are here:\n2. [Home][41]\n3. Advanced Solutions\n4. ARPG Products\n5. [SIPS\u2122][42]\nSearch\nSearch\n\n## Smart Interface Panel System (SIPS)\n\nSystem (SIPS\u2122) accommodates front-end wiring and special function signal conditioning requirements\nfor differential or single-ended constant voltage / constant current, bridge completion, shunt cal,\nAC/DC coupling, and remote sense.\n\n**CV & CI[SIPS]**\n** The SIPS-CV/CC16, 16 channel Smart Interface Panel System (SIPS), includes; a 16 channel 5.25\"\nrack mount chassis with back planes, two Model 4311 Processor Cards, two AI/Control interface cards,\nCable restraint panel, 16 Model 1202 Channel cards with software selectable Constant Current (0-20mA\nw/24V), software enabled Constant Voltage Excitation, Constant Voltage continuous drive current in\nexcess of 100mA per channel, remote sensor, red power - remote & software group excitation kill, AC\ncoupling, bridge completion, and shunt cal & special impedance matching network termination.\nResistance values user supplied and configured through the user interface connector. Each SIPS\nsystem also includes a user interface kit containing connectors (16ea 15 pin \"D\", 18ea 9 Pin \"D\",\n2ea 15 Pin HD \"D\"), back shells & jacking screws. Six or 8 foot extended bandwidth cabling kits and\nscaled power supply kits are also available.\n\n**CV[SIPS]**\n** The SIPS-CV16, 16 channel SIPS, includes; a 5.25\" rack mount chassis with back planes, two Model\n4311 Processor Cards, two AI/Control interface cards, a Cable Restraint Panel, 16 Model 1201 Channel\ncard with software enabled Constant Voltage Excitation, Constant Voltage continuous drive current in\nexcess of 100mA per channel, remote sensor, red power - remote & software group excitation kill, AC\ncoupling, bridge completion, shunt cal and special impedance matching network termination.\nResistance values user supplied and configured through user interface connector. Each SIPS system\nalso includes user interface kit containing connectors (16ea 15 pin \"D\", 18ea 9 Pin \"D\", 2ea 15 Pin\nHD \"D\"), back shells & jacking screws. Six or 8 foot extended bandwidth cabling kits and scaled\npower supply kits are also available.\n\n## Ready to Evaluate Vibration Control Systems?\n\nContact Spectral Dynamics to discuss your specific testing requirements and explore how our advanced\nvibration control solutions can benefit your laboratory.\n\n[ Request Information ][43]\n\nSpectral Dynamics, Inc. is a leading worldwide supplier of systems and software for vibration\ntesting, structural dynamics, and acoustic analysis. Spectral Dynamics' products are used for design\nverification, product testing and process improvement by manufacturers of all types of electronic\nand mechanical products.\n\n1500 Wyatt Drive Suite 14\nSanta Clara, CA 95054-1522\nTel: (800) 778-8755\n[sales@spectraldynamics.com][44]\n[service@spectraldynamics.com][45]\n\n### Vibration Controllers\n* [Panther ][46]\n* [ Lynx ][47]\n* [Puma ][48]\n* [Jaguar][49]\n\n### Advanced Solutions\n* [Felix - P.I.N.D.][50]\n* [Shock Test Systems][51]\n\n### Support\n* [Contact][52]\n* [Product Information][53]\n* [Domestic U.S. Service][54]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Spectral Dynamics Inc. [Privacy Policy][55]\n\n[Download our ISO 9001:2015 certificate][56] | [Sitemap][57]\n\n[[Link to Spectral Dynamics Facebook Page]][58][[Link to Spectral Dynamics Google\nresults.]][59][[Link to Spectral Dynamics Youtube Page]][60]\n\n[1]: https://www.spectraldynamics.com/\n[2]: /\n[3]: /home/about-sd\n[4]: /pdf/History_of_Spectral_Dynamics.pdf\n[5]: javascript:;\n[6]: /shakers/overview\n[7]: /shakers/water-cooled\n[8]: /shakers/air-cooled\n[9]: /shakers/vibration-shaker-systems-buyers-guide\n[10]: /shakers/slip-tables-head-expanders\n[11]: /shakers/shock-test-machines\n[12]: /shakers/hydraulic-exciters\n[13]: javascript:;\n[14]: /vibration-controllers/multiple-axis/jaguar\n[15]: /panther\n[16]: /vibration-controllers/single-axis/puma\n[17]: /vibration-controllers/single-axis/lynx\n[18]: javascript:;\n[19]: /solutions/arpg-products/sips\n[20]: /solutions/arpg-products/vidas\n[21]: /solutions/arpg-products/impax-sd-lab\n[22]: /solutions/pind-system/felix\n[23]: /solutions/shock-test-systems\n[24]: /solutions/balancetool-home\n[25]: /solutions/arpg-products/vidas\n[26]: /solutions/analyzer/cats\n[27]: /solutions/analyzer/star-modal\n[28]: /solutions/analyzer/star-acoustics\n[29]: /support\n[30]: /support/vibration-control-buyers-guide\n[31]: /support/request-product-information\n[32]: /support/contact-sd\n[33]: /support/customer-training\n[34]: /support/domestic-us-service\n[35]: /support/panther-software-tutorials\n[36]: /support/spectral-dynamics-software/faqs\n[37]: /support/cats-modal-star-modal/faqs\n[38]: /support/related-links\n[39]: /support/technical-library\n[40]: /support/free-vibration-calculator-download\n[41]: /\n[42]: /solutions/arpg-products/sips\n[43]: /support/request-product-information\n[44]: mailto:sales@spectraldynamics.com\n[45]: mailto:service@spectraldynamics.com\n[46]: /panther\n[47]: /vibration-controllers/single-axis/lynx\n[48]: /vibration-controllers/single-axis/puma\n[49]: /vibration-controllers/multiple-axis/jaguar\n[50]: /solutions/p-i-n-d-system/felix-computer-aided-test-system\n[51]: /solutions/shock-test-systems\n[52]: /support/contact-sd\n[53]: /support/request-product-information\n[54]: /support/domestic-us-service\n[55]: /index.php/support/privacy-policy\n[56]: /pdf/Spectral_Dynamics_2023_ISO_9001_2015_Management_System_Certificate.pdf\n[57]: /sitemap\n[58]: https://www.facebook.com/Spectral-Dynamics-116990255000523/\n[59]: https://www.google.com/search?rlz=1C1CHBF_enUS945US945&q=Spectral+Dynamics&stick=H4sIAAAAAAAAA\nONgecR4iZFb4OWPe8JSJxgnrTl5jfEgIxdXcEZ-uWteSWZJpZALFxuUpcIlKMWrn65vaJhhVllUlWSarMEgxc-FKiQloiXEWdy38\n8n6KS7eglf3CwfragY8V4oxCth1ado5Ni9BBiAoOx_sIGUkeH7ukUU7lgrZawlxsXsW--QnJ-YIJl__a1WQt8JeS5iLIySxIj8vP\n7dS0IuJ4cCD_-_tlTg5gbodbpx8Za_F0LRvxSE2Fg5GAYYgmCPSciuLsjIyingWsQoGF6QmlxQl5ii4VOYl5mYmFwMA_u693-wAA\nAA&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjGldTl57fvAhUOFTQIHSDKAVcQ6RN6BAgOEAE&biw=1296&bih=739\n[60]: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCEPFhx_26dmu19mxRRBhYWg [ [Spectral Dynamics Inc.] ][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [About SD][3]\n* [History of Spectral Dynamics][4]\n* [ Shakers ][5]\n\n### Shakers\n* [Overview][6]\n* [Water Cooled][7]\n* [Air Cooled][8]\n* [Vibration Shaker Systems Buyer's Guide][9]\n\n### Options\n* [Slip Tables & Head Expanders][10]\n* [Shock Test Machines][11]\n* [Hydraulic Exciters][12]\n* [ Vibration Controllers ][13]\n\n### Multiple/Single Axis\n* [Jaguar\u2122][14]\n\n### Single Axis\n* [Panther][15]\n* [Puma\u2122][16]\n* [Lynx\u2122][17]\n* [ Advanced Solutions ][18]\n\n### ARPG Products\n* [SIPS\u2122][19]\n* [VIDAS\u2122][20]\n* [IMPAX-SD-LAB\u2122][21]\n\n### P.I.N.D. System\n* [Felix\u2122 Computer Aided Test System][22]\n\n### Advanced Solutions\n* [Shock Test Systems][23]\n* [BalanceTool\u2122][24]\n\n### High Speed Data Acquisition\n* [VIDAS\u2122][25]\n\n### Data Analysis\n* [CATS\u2122][26]\n* [STAR Modal\u2122][27]\n* [STAR Acoustics\u2122][28]\n* [Support][29]\n\n### Service & Information\n* [Vibration Control Buyer\u2019s Guide][30]\n* [Request Product Information][31]\n* [Contact SD][32]\n* [Customer Training][33]\n* [Domestic US Service][34]\n\n### Software Support\n* [Panther Software Tutorials ][35]\n* [Spectral Dynamics Software FAQs][36]\n* [CATS / STAR Modal\u2122 Help][37]\n\n### Additional Support\n* [Related Links][38]\n* [Technical Library][39]\n* [Spectral Dynamics Vibration Calculator][40]\n1. You are here:\n2. [Home][41]\n3. Advanced Solutions\n4. ARPG Products\n5. [VIDAS\u2122][42]\nSearch\nSearch\n\n## VIDAS\n\nSpectral Dynamics' VXI Data Acquisition System (VIDAS) is a high bandwidth measurement system that\npushes the limits of transducers and techniques.\n[[vxiblast]][43]\nVIDAS System Solution from The Advanced Research Products Group (ARPG\u2122) of Spectral Dynamics offers\nVIDAS (VXI Data Acquisition System), high performance VXI hardware & software solutions. VIDAS\ncombines dynamically scalable channel count versatility with features you need and critical\nperformance for your testing demands. Our products offer superior fidelity and excellent\nchannel-to-channel phase match for the most accurate measurements in the industry.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Highlights:** \u2502**Applications:** \u2502[VX\n* Up to 1024 independent channels \u2502* Acoustic Shock Measurement \u2502I]\n* Modular, scalable design \u2502* Aircraft power system testing \u2502\n* High powered VXI instrumentation chassis \u2502* Real-time knock analysis \u2502\n* Full bandwidth flat response: \u2502* Component test stands \u2502\n* 0.1dB DC to 1 MHz \u2502* Rocket testing \u2502\n* 2.2MHz @3dB \u2502* FAA seat testing \u2502\n* Up to 5M samples/sec/ch sample rate \u2502* Highway structures development \u2502\n* Bandwidth licensing enables cost savings while providing \u2502* Explosive shock studies \u2502\nfuture growth path \u2502* Electromagnetic propulsion \u2502\n* Automated end-to-end calibration \u2502 research \u2502\n* Full bridge completion available \u2502* Calibration labs \u2502\n* Remote application control capability with pipes/socket \u2502* Hopkinson bar testing \u2502\nserver \u2502* Gas turbine testing \u2502\n* Passive Input Panel system (PIPS\u2122)or Smart Interface Panel \u2502 \u2502\nSystem (SIPS\u2122) accommodates front-end wiring and special \u2502 \u2502\nfunction signal conditioning requirements. \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n**ARPG VIDAS Systems incorporate VXI instrumentation with a fully integrated WinXP native software\npackage called IMPAX-SD\u2122**. It uses build-on-demand database technology to automatically manage and\nconfigure your testing environment for measurement, control, reporting and correlating data timing\nfor high-speed and transient testing applications. IMPAX-SD eliminates manual setup/calibration\noperations, gives lightning fast data display, and\ninstant review. Real-time snapshot FIFOs allow DAS channel monitoring for reconfiguring your test on\nthe fly.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**VXI Model VX2805C\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nA complete integrated 8 channel data recording VXI module. Each channel includes a bridge signal\nconditioner, a low pass filter, a 16-bit 5.0M samples/sec/ch ADC, and 16M samples of PS-RAM storage\nper channel.\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[View Data Sheet (PDF)][44]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2022 8 Channels Per Module\n\u2022 Each Channel Includes:\nSignal Conditioning, Filter, ADC and Memory\n\u2022 16-Bit Resolution\n\u2022 High Dynamic Range\n\u2022 Up to 5M Samples/s/ch\n\u2022 Simultaneous Sampling\n\u2022 Dual Ported Memory Access (2.5M S/s "
      },
