            "text": "[ [Spectral Dynamics Inc.] ][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [About SD][3]\n* [History of Spectral Dynamics][4]\n* [ Shakers ][5]\n\n### Shakers\n* [Overview][6]\n* [Water Cooled][7]\n* [Air Cooled][8]\n* [Vibration Shaker Systems Buyer's Guide][9]\n\n### Options\n* [Slip Tables & Head Expanders][10]\n* [Shock Test Machines][11]\n* [Hydraulic Exciters][12]\n* [ Vibration Controllers ][13]\n\n### Multiple/Single Axis\n* [Jaguar\u2122][14]\n\n### Single Axis\n* [Panther][15]\n* [Puma\u2122][16]\n* [Lynx\u2122][17]\n* [ Advanced Solutions ][18]\n\n### ARPG Products\n* [SIPS\u2122][19]\n* [VIDAS\u2122][20]\n* [IMPAX-SD-LAB\u2122][21]\n\n### P.I.N.D. System\n* [Felix\u2122 Computer Aided Test System][22]\n\n### Advanced Solutions\n* [Shock Test Systems][23]\n* [BalanceTool\u2122][24]\n\n### High Speed Data Acquisition\n* [VIDAS\u2122][25]\n\n### Data Analysis\n* [CATS\u2122][26]\n* [STAR Modal\u2122][27]\n* [STAR Acoustics\u2122][28]\n* [Support][29]\n\n### Service & Information\n* [Vibration Control Buyer\u2019s Guide][30]\n* [Request Product Information][31]\n* [Contact SD][32]\n* [Customer Training][33]\n* [Domestic US Service][34]\n\n### Software Support\n* [Panther Software Tutorials ][35]\n* [Spectral Dynamics Software FAQs][36]\n* [CATS / STAR Modal\u2122 Help][37]\n\n### Additional Support\n* [Related Links][38]\n* [Technical Library][39]\n* [Spectral Dynamics Vibration Calculator][40]\n1. You are here:\n2. [Home][41]\n3. Advanced Solutions\n4. PIND System\n5. [Felix\u2122 Computer Aided Test System][42]\nSearch\nSearch\n\n# Spectral Dynamics' FELIX^{\u2122} PIND System - Advanced Technology That\u2019s Easy To Use\n\n## How the Felix^{\u2122} P.I.N.D. System Works\n\n**Computer Aided Test System for\nPARTICLE IMPACT NOISE DETECTION**\n\n##### \u2022 Windows 11\n\n##### \u2022 Easy Calibration\n\n##### \u2022 Digital Power Amplifier\n\n[Download Brochure][43] [Request Product Information][44]\n\n## FELIX^{\u2122} PIND System Architecture & Capabilities\n* Precision Shaker with a crystal sensor system\n* DPA600 digital Amplifier and Felix\u2122 controller system\n* Computer system with Felix\u2122 software\n* STU (Sensitivity Test Unit) unit to verify that the system is functional.\n\n## FELIX^{\u2122} PIND System: Five Essential Operations\n* Vibrate a test article\n* Shock a test article\n* Detect any particle contaminants within the cavity\n* Display the detected impact signals created by the loose particles\n* Record the motion environment and the acoustic signals detected\n\n## Hardware & Software Features of the FELIX PIND System\n\nFor over fifty years the PIND Products Group of SPECTRAL DYNAMICS, INC. has given users simple,\nreliable, and inexpensive tools to perform Particle Impact Noise Detection (PIND) testing to\nincrease the reliability of electronic components.\nOur non-destructive high frequency acoustic test monitors for loose particles moving inside high\nreliability internal cavity electronic components such as relays, transistors, hybrids, integrated\ncircuits, and switches \u2013 particles that have the potential of causing short circuits and serious\nmalfunctions in system operations.\nA shaker is used as a linear motor to excite loose particles to move within the component cavity.\nUpon striking the lid of the cavity, some of the particle kinetic energy (\u00bdmv2) is converted to a\nwide band acoustic pressure wave that travels through the lid, through the attachment media, and\nonto the top surface of the Impact Detection Sensor. The acoustic wave is detected by the sensitive\nultrasonic crystal or crystals within the sensor and converted to an electrical signal. To keep the\nparticle moving, a very accurate shock, generated internal to the shaker and controlled by the\ncomputer, monitoring the motion of the sensor, is employed.\n\n[ [Advanced PIND Detection with the FELIX System] ][45]\n\n### [Advanced PIND Detection with the FELIX System][46]\n\n[ Read more: Advanced PIND... ][47]\n\n[ [Advanced PIND Testing Technology in the FELIX System] ][48]\n\n### [Advanced PIND Testing Technology in the FELIX System][49]\n\n[ Read more: Advanced PIND... ][50]\n\n[ [FELIX PIND System: Four Independent Data Acquisition Channels] ][51]\n\n### [FELIX PIND System: Four Independent Data Acquisition Channels][52]\n\n[ Read more: FELIX PIND... ][53]\n\n[ [Single and Multiple Crystal Sensors for PIND Testing with the FELIX System] ][54]\n\n### [Single and Multiple Crystal Sensors for PIND Testing with the FELIX System][55]\n\n[ Read more: Single and... ][56]\n\n[ [Unique Features & Programmable Software] ][57]\n\n### [Unique Features & Programmable Software][58]\n\n[ Read more: Unique... ][59]\n\n[ [Vibration and Shock Capabilities of the FELIX PIND System] ][60]\n\n### [Vibration and Shock Capabilities of the FELIX PIND System][61]\n\n[ Read more: Vibration and... ][62]\n\nSpectral Dynamics, Inc. is a leading worldwide supplier of systems and software for vibration\ntesting, structural dynamics, and acoustic analysis. Spectral Dynamics' products are used for design\nverification, product testing and process improvement by manufacturers of all types of electronic\nand mechanical products.\n\n1500 Wyatt Drive Suite 14\nSanta Clara, CA 95054-1522\nTel: (800) 778-8755\n[sales@spectraldynamics.com][63]\n[service@spectraldynamics.com][64]\n\n### Vibration Controllers\n* [Panther ][65]\n* [ Lynx ][66]\n* [Puma ][67]\n* [Jaguar][68]\n\n### Advanced Solutions\n* [Felix - P.I.N.D.][69]\n* [Shock Test Systems][70]\n\n### Support\n* [Contact][71]\n* [Product Information][72]\n* [Domestic U.S. Service][73]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Spectral Dynamics Inc. [Privacy Policy][74]\n\n[Download our ISO 9001:2015 certificate][75] | [Sitemap][76]\n\n[[Link to Spectral Dynamics Facebook Page]][77][[Link to Spectral Dynamics Google\nresults.]][78][[Link to Spectral Dynamics Youtube Page]][79]\n\n[1]: https://www.spectraldynamics.com/\n[2]: /\n[3]: /home/about-sd\n[4]: /pdf/History_of_Spectral_Dynamics.pdf\n[5]: javascript:;\n[6]: /shakers/overview\n[7]: /shakers/water-cooled\n[8]: /shakers/air-cooled\n[9]: /shakers/vibration-shaker-systems-buyers-guide\n[10]: /shakers/slip-tables-head-expanders\n[11]: /shakers/shock-test-machines\n[12]: /shakers/hydraulic-exciters\n[13]: javascript:;\n[14]: /vibration-controllers/multiple-axis/jaguar\n[15]: /panther\n[16]: /vibration-controllers/single-axis/puma\n[17]: /vibration-controllers/single-axis/lynx\n[18]: javascript:;\n[19]: /solutions/arpg-products/sips\n[20]: /solutions/arpg-products/vidas\n[21]: /solutions/arpg-products/impax-sd-lab\n[22]: /solutions/pind-system/felix\n[23]: /solutions/shock-test-systems\n[24]: /solutions/balancetool-home\n[25]: /solutions/arpg-products/vidas\n[26]: /solutions/analyzer/cats\n[27]: /solutions/analyzer/star-modal\n[28]: /solutions/analyzer/star-acoustics\n[29]: /support\n[30]: /support/vibration-control-buyers-guide\n[31]: /support/request-product-information\n[32]: /support/contact-sd\n[33]: /support/customer-training\n[34]: /support/domestic-us-service\n[35]: /support/panther-software-tutorials\n[36]: /support/spectral-dynamics-software/faqs\n[37]: /support/cats-modal-star-modal/faqs\n[38]: /support/related-links\n[39]: /support/technical-library\n[40]: /support/free-vibration-calculator-download\n[41]: /\n[42]: /solutions/pind-system/felix\n[43]: /pdf/felix/Felix_PIND_Brochure_Version_A.pdf\n[44]: /support/request-product-information\n[45]: /solutions/pind-system/felix/pind-detection\n[46]: /solutions/pind-system/felix/pind-detection\n[47]: /solutions/pind-system/felix/pind-detection\n[48]: /solutions/pind-system/felix/advanced-technology\n[49]: /solutions/pind-system/felix/advanced-technology\n[50]: /solutions/pind-system/felix/advanced-technology\n[51]: /solutions/pind-system/felix/four-unique-channels-of-data-acquisition\n[52]: /solutions/pind-system/felix/four-unique-channels-of-data-acquisition\n[53]: /solutions/pind-system/felix/four-unique-channels-of-data-acquisition\n[54]: /solutions/pind-system/felix/single-multple-crystal-sensors\n[55]: /solutions/pind-system/felix/single-multple-crystal-sensors\n[56]: /solutions/pind-system/felix/single-multple-crystal-sensors\n[57]: /solutions/pind-system/felix/unique-features-programmable-software\n[58]: /solutions/pind-system/felix/unique-features-programmable-software\n[59]: /solutions/pind-system/felix/unique-features-programmable-software\n[60]: /solutions/pind-system/felix/vibration-shock\n[61]: /solutions/pind-system/felix/vibration-shock\n[62]: /solutions/pind-system/felix/vibration-shock\n[63]: mailto:sales@spectraldynamics.com\n[64]: mailto:service@spectraldynamics.com\n[65]: /panther\n[66]: /vibration-controllers/single-axis/lynx\n[67]: /vibration-controllers/single-axis/puma\n[68]: /vibration-controllers/multiple-axis/jaguar\n[69]: /solutions/p-i-n-d-system/felix-computer-aided-test-system\n[70]: /solutions/shock-test-systems\n[71]: /support/contact-sd\n[72]: /support/request-product-information\n[73]: /support/domestic-us-service\n[74]: /index.php/support/privacy-policy\n[75]: /pdf/Spectral_Dynamics_2023_ISO_9001_2015_Management_System_Certificate.pdf\n[76]: /sitemap\n[77]: https://www.facebook.com/Spectral-Dynamics-116990255000523/\n[78]: https://www.google.com/search?rlz=1C1CHBF_enUS945US945&q=Spectral+Dynamics&stick=H4sIAAAAAAAAA\nONgecR4iZFb4OWPe8JSJxgnrTl5jfEgIxdXcEZ-uWteSWZJpZALFxuUpcIlKMWrn65vaJhhVllUlWSarMEgxc-FKiQloiXEWdy38\n8n6KS7eglf3CwfragY8V4oxCth1ado5Ni9BBiAoOx_sIGUkeH7ukUU7lgrZawlxsXsW--QnJ-YIJl__a1WQt8JeS5iLIySxIj8vP\n7dS0IuJ4cCD_-_tlTg5gbodbpx8Za_F0LRvxSE2Fg5GAYYgmCPSciuLsjIyingWsQoGF6QmlxQl5ii4VOYl5mYmFwMA_u693-wAA\nAA&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjGldTl57fvAhUOFTQIHSDKAVcQ6RN6BAgOEAE&biw=1296&bih=739\n[79]: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCEPFhx_26dmu19mxRRBhYWg"
