            "text": "[ [Spectral Dynamics Inc.] ][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [About SD][3]\n* [History of Spectral Dynamics][4]\n* [ Shakers ][5]\n\n### Shakers\n* [Overview][6]\n* [Water Cooled][7]\n* [Air Cooled][8]\n* [Vibration Shaker Systems Buyer's Guide][9]\n\n### Options\n* [Slip Tables & Head Expanders][10]\n* [Shock Test Machines][11]\n* [Hydraulic Exciters][12]\n* [ Vibration Controllers ][13]\n\n### Multiple/Single Axis\n* [Jaguar\u2122][14]\n\n### Single Axis\n* [Panther][15]\n* [Puma\u2122][16]\n* [Lynx\u2122][17]\n* [ Advanced Solutions ][18]\n\n### ARPG Products\n* [SIPS\u2122][19]\n* [VIDAS\u2122][20]\n* [IMPAX-SD-LAB\u2122][21]\n\n### P.I.N.D. System\n* [Felix\u2122 Computer Aided Test System][22]\n\n### Advanced Solutions\n* [Shock Test Systems][23]\n* [BalanceTool\u2122][24]\n\n### High Speed Data Acquisition\n* [VIDAS\u2122][25]\n\n### Data Analysis\n* [CATS\u2122][26]\n* [STAR Modal\u2122][27]\n* [STAR Acoustics\u2122][28]\n* [Support][29]\n\n### Service & Information\n* [Vibration Control Buyer\u2019s Guide][30]\n* [Request Product Information][31]\n* [Contact SD][32]\n* [Customer Training][33]\n* [Domestic US Service][34]\n\n### Software Support\n* [Panther Software Tutorials ][35]\n* [Spectral Dynamics Software FAQs][36]\n* [CATS / STAR Modal\u2122 Help][37]\n\n### Additional Support\n* [Related Links][38]\n* [Technical Library][39]\n* [Spectral Dynamics Vibration Calculator][40]\n1. You are here:\n2. [Home][41]\n3. Advanced Solutions\n4. [Shock Test Systems][42]\nSearch\nSearch\n\n### AutoShock II^{\u2122} Automated Shock Test Systems\n\nThe AutoShock-II \u2122 is a fully automated series of shock test systems used to measure and identify\nproduct fragility levels and evaluate protective packaging. With the simulation of real world shock\npulses, including half sine, square wave and sawtooth pulse shapes, as well as impact energy levels,\nmanufacturers can systematically test and optimize product design and packaging. L.A.B. Equipment,\nInc.\u2019s fully automated computer controlled shock and data analysis test systems are the critical\npath in accomplishing this optimization.\n\n[Want to find out more about this product? Click here to visit our line of L.A.B. Equipment\nAutoShock II\u2122 Shock Test Systems. ][43]\n\n###\n### SD-Series^{\u2122} Mechanical Shock Test Systems\n\nThe need for products to survive various shock levels in an operating environment requires in-house\ntesting of products during the design and evaluation stages. L.A.B. Equipment, Inc.\u2019s SD-series of\nmechanical free-fall test systems produces accurate and repeatable half sine, square-wave and\nsawtooth pulses in accordance with military and industry specifications.\n\n[Want to find out more about this product? Click here to visit our line of L.A.B. Equipment\nSD-Series\u2122 Shock Test Systems.][44]\n\n###\n### STM Series^{\u2122} Shock Test Systems\n\nThe STM Series\u2122 is a fully automated closed-loop control system that is controlled via the Impala\u2122\nControl and Data Acquisition system. With the wide range of STM Series\u2122 systems, you can easily\nperform very short duration pulses (0.5msec), to long duration \u00bd Sine pulses of up to 30msec.\n\nThe versatility of the STM Series\u2122 allows for payloads from 5kg to several hundred kilograms and all\nare capable of delivering repeatable shocks as well as a rate of up to 60 shock cycles per minute.\n\nThe STM Series\u2122 is perfect for all your product reliability needs.\n\n[Want to find out more about this product? Click here to visit our line of L.A.B. Equipment STM\nSeries\u2122 Shock Test Systems. ][45]\n\nSpectral Dynamics, Inc. is a leading worldwide supplier of systems and software for vibration\ntesting, structural dynamics, and acoustic analysis. Spectral Dynamics' products are used for design\nverification, product testing and process improvement by manufacturers of all types of electronic\nand mechanical products.\n\n1500 Wyatt Drive Suite 14\nSanta Clara, CA 95054-1522\nTel: (800) 778-8755\n[sales@spectraldynamics.com][46]\n[service@spectraldynamics.com][47]\n\n### Vibration Controllers\n* [Panther ][48]\n* [ Lynx ][49]\n* [Puma ][50]\n* [Jaguar][51]\n\n### Advanced Solutions\n* [Felix - P.I.N.D.][52]\n* [Shock Test Systems][53]\n\n### Support\n* [Contact][54]\n* [Product Information][55]\n* [Domestic U.S. Service][56]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Spectral Dynamics Inc. [Privacy Policy][57]\n\n[Download our ISO 9001:2015 certificate][58] | [Sitemap][59]\n\n[[Link to Spectral Dynamics Facebook Page]][60][[Link to Spectral Dynamics Google\nresults.]][61][[Link to Spectral Dynamics Youtube Page]][62]\n\n[1]: https://www.spectraldynamics.com/\n[2]: /\n[3]: /home/about-sd\n[4]: /pdf/History_of_Spectral_Dynamics.pdf\n[5]: javascript:;\n[6]: /shakers/overview\n[7]: /shakers/water-cooled\n[8]: /shakers/air-cooled\n[9]: /shakers/vibration-shaker-systems-buyers-guide\n[10]: /shakers/slip-tables-head-expanders\n[11]: /shakers/shock-test-machines\n[12]: /shakers/hydraulic-exciters\n[13]: javascript:;\n[14]: /vibration-controllers/multiple-axis/jaguar\n[15]: /panther\n[16]: /vibration-controllers/single-axis/puma\n[17]: /vibration-controllers/single-axis/lynx\n[18]: javascript:;\n[19]: /solutions/arpg-products/sips\n[20]: /solutions/arpg-products/vidas\n[21]: /solutions/arpg-products/impax-sd-lab\n[22]: /solutions/pind-system/felix\n[23]: /solutions/shock-test-systems\n[24]: /solutions/balancetool-home\n[25]: /solutions/arpg-products/vidas\n[26]: /solutions/analyzer/cats\n[27]: /solutions/analyzer/star-modal\n[28]: /solutions/analyzer/star-acoustics\n[29]: /support\n[30]: /support/vibration-control-buyers-guide\n[31]: /support/request-product-information\n[32]: /support/contact-sd\n[33]: /support/customer-training\n[34]: /support/domestic-us-service\n[35]: /support/panther-software-tutorials\n[36]: /support/spectral-dynamics-software/faqs\n[37]: /support/cats-modal-star-modal/faqs\n[38]: /support/related-links\n[39]: /support/technical-library\n[40]: /support/free-vibration-calculator-download\n[41]: /\n[42]: /solutions/shock-test-systems\n[43]: https://www.labequipment.com/autoshock-ii/\n[44]: https://www.labequipment.com/sd-series/\n[45]: https://www.labequipment.com/stm-shock-test-machines/\n[46]: mailto:sales@spectraldynamics.com\n[47]: mailto:service@spectraldynamics.com\n[48]: /panther\n[49]: /vibration-controllers/single-axis/lynx\n[50]: /vibration-controllers/single-axis/puma\n[51]: /vibration-controllers/multiple-axis/jaguar\n[52]: /solutions/p-i-n-d-system/felix-computer-aided-test-system\n[53]: /solutions/shock-test-systems\n[54]: /support/contact-sd\n[55]: /support/request-product-information\n[56]: /support/domestic-us-service\n[57]: /index.php/support/privacy-policy\n[58]: /pdf/Spectral_Dynamics_2023_ISO_9001_2015_Management_System_Certificate.pdf\n[59]: /sitemap\n[60]: https://www.facebook.com/Spectral-Dynamics-116990255000523/\n[61]: https://www.google.com/search?rlz=1C1CHBF_enUS945US945&q=Spectral+Dynamics&stick=H4sIAAAAAAAAA\nONgecR4iZFb4OWPe8JSJxgnrTl5jfEgIxdXcEZ-uWteSWZJpZALFxuUpcIlKMWrn65vaJhhVllUlWSarMEgxc-FKiQloiXEWdy38\n8n6KS7eglf3CwfragY8V4oxCth1ado5Ni9BBiAoOx_sIGUkeH7ukUU7lgrZawlxsXsW--QnJ-YIJl__a1WQt8JeS5iLIySxIj8vP\n7dS0IuJ4cCD_-_tlTg5gbodbpx8Za_F0LRvxSE2Fg5GAYYgmCPSciuLsjIyingWsQoGF6QmlxQl5ii4VOYl5mYmFwMA_u693-wAA\nAA&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjGldTl57fvAhUOFTQIHSDKAVcQ6RN6BAgOEAE&biw=1296&bih=739\n[62]: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCEPFhx_26dmu19mxRRBhYWg"
