          {
            "url": "https://www.spectraldynamics.com/solutions/balancetool-home/being-organized-made-simple",
            "text": "[ [Spectral Dynamics Inc.] ][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [About SD][3]\n* [History of Spectral Dynamics][4]\n* [ Shakers ][5]\n\n### Shakers\n* [Overview][6]\n* [Water Cooled][7]\n* [Air Cooled][8]\n* [Vibration Shaker Systems Buyer's Guide][9]\n\n### Options\n* [Slip Tables & Head Expanders][10]\n* [Shock Test Machines][11]\n* [Hydraulic Exciters][12]\n* [ Vibration Controllers ][13]\n\n### Multiple/Single Axis\n* [Jaguar\u2122][14]\n\n### Single Axis\n* [Panther][15]\n* [Puma\u2122][16]\n* [Lynx\u2122][17]\n* [ Advanced Solutions ][18]\n\n### ARPG Products\n* [SIPS\u2122][19]\n* [VIDAS\u2122][20]\n* [IMPAX-SD-LAB\u2122][21]\n\n### P.I.N.D. System\n* [Felix\u2122 Computer Aided Test System][22]\n\n### Advanced Solutions\n* [Shock Test Systems][23]\n* [BalanceTool\u2122][24]\n\n### High Speed Data Acquisition\n* [VIDAS\u2122][25]\n\n### Data Analysis\n* [CATS\u2122][26]\n* [STAR Modal\u2122][27]\n* [STAR Acoustics\u2122][28]\n* [Support][29]\n\n### Service & Information\n* [Vibration Control Buyer\u2019s Guide][30]\n* [Request Product Information][31]\n* [Contact SD][32]\n* [Customer Training][33]\n* [Domestic US Service][34]\n\n### Software Support\n* [Panther Software Tutorials ][35]\n* [Spectral Dynamics Software FAQs][36]\n* [CATS / STAR Modal\u2122 Help][37]\n\n### Additional Support\n* [Related Links][38]\n* [Technical Library][39]\n* [Spectral Dynamics Vibration Calculator][40]\n1. You are here:\n2. [Home][41]\n3. Advanced Solutions\n4. [BalanceTool\u2122][42]\n5. [Being Organized Made Simple][43]\nSearch\nSearch\n\n## Being Organized Made Simple\n\n**ODBC Compliant Test Database**\n\nBalanceTool\u2122 can automatically add relevant information regarding a test into an ODBC compliant\ndatabase such as Microsoft Access\u2122. With the ability to organize thousands of tests and the tools\nneeded to view just those of interest, you\u2019ll never be searching for lost files again.\n\nBalanceTool\u2122 can simplify things even further by automatically naming and relocating files in a\nclear and concise manner, prior to adding to the database.\n\n**Engine Database**\n\nOnce the parameters for an engine type have been entered, adding to the database allows for easy\nrecall. It also allows the software to continuously learn its characteristics, therefore improving\nits ability to balance.\n\n**Weights Database**\n\nWeights are added into a database with information such as part number and mass, they are then\ntagged to one or more engine types. From there BalanceTool\u2122 does the rest, automatically displaying\nrelevant weights at the right time, ready to be dragged into place, or to be used in automatic\ncomputations.\n\n## Ready to Evaluate Vibration Control Systems?\n\nContact Spectral Dynamics to discuss your specific testing requirements and explore how our advanced\nvibration control solutions can benefit your laboratory.\n\n[ Request Information ][44]\n\nSpectral Dynamics, Inc. is a leading worldwide supplier of systems and software for vibration\ntesting, structural dynamics, and acoustic analysis. Spectral Dynamics' products are used for design\nverification, product testing and process improvement by manufacturers of all types of electronic\nand mechanical products.\n\n1500 Wyatt Drive Suite 14\nSanta Clara, CA 95054-1522\nTel: (800) 778-8755\n[sales@spectraldynamics.com][45]\n[service@spectraldynamics.com][46]\n\n### Vibration Controllers\n* [Panther ][47]\n* [ Lynx ][48]\n* [Puma ][49]\n* [Jaguar][50]\n\n### Advanced Solutions\n* [Felix - P.I.N.D.][51]\n* [Shock Test Systems][52]\n\n### Support\n* [Contact][53]\n* [Product Information][54]\n* [Domestic U.S. Service][55]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Spectral Dynamics Inc. [Privacy Policy][56]\n\n[Download our ISO 9001:2015 certificate][57] | [Sitemap][58]\n\n[[Link to Spectral Dynamics Facebook Page]][59][[Link to Spectral Dynamics Google\nresults.]][60][[Link to Spectral Dynamics Youtube Page]][61]\n\n[1]: https://www.spectraldynamics.com/\n[2]: /\n[3]: /home/about-sd\n[4]: /pdf/History_of_Spectral_Dynamics.pdf\n[5]: javascript:;\n[6]: /shakers/overview\n[7]: /shakers/water-cooled\n[8]: /shakers/air-cooled\n[9]: /shakers/vibration-shaker-systems-buyers-guide\n[10]: /shakers/slip-tables-head-expanders\n[11]: /shakers/shock-test-machines\n[12]: /shakers/hydraulic-exciters\n[13]: javascript:;\n[14]: /vibration-controllers/multiple-axis/jaguar\n[15]: /panther\n[16]: /vibration-controllers/single-axis/puma\n[17]: /vibration-controllers/single-axis/lynx\n[18]: javascript:;\n[19]: /solutions/arpg-products/sips\n[20]: /solutions/arpg-products/vidas\n[21]: /solutions/arpg-products/impax-sd-lab\n[22]: /solutions/pind-system/felix\n[23]: /solutions/shock-test-systems\n[24]: /solutions/balancetool-home\n[25]: /solutions/arpg-products/vidas\n[26]: /solutions/analyzer/cats\n[27]: /solutions/analyzer/star-modal\n[28]: /solutions/analyzer/star-acoustics\n[29]: /support\n[30]: /support/vibration-control-buyers-guide\n[31]: /support/request-product-information\n[32]: /support/contact-sd\n[33]: /support/customer-training\n[34]: /support/domestic-us-service\n[35]: /support/panther-software-tutorials\n[36]: /support/spectral-dynamics-software/faqs\n[37]: /support/cats-modal-star-modal/faqs\n[38]: /support/related-links\n[39]: /support/technical-library\n[40]: /support/free-vibration-calculator-download\n[41]: /\n[42]: /solutions/balancetool-home\n[43]: /solutions/balancetool-home/being-organized-made-simple\n[44]: /support/request-product-information\n[45]: mailto:sales@spectraldynamics.com\n[46]: mailto:service@spectraldynamics.com\n[47]: /panther\n[48]: /vibration-controllers/single-axis/lynx\n[49]: /vibration-controllers/single-axis/puma\n[50]: /vibration-controllers/multiple-axis/jaguar\n[51]: /solutions/p-i-n-d-system/felix-computer-aided-test-system\n[52]: /solutions/shock-test-systems\n[53]: /support/contact-sd\n[54]: /support/request-product-information\n[55]: /support/domestic-us-service\n[56]: /index.php/support/privacy-policy\n[57]: /pdf/Spectral_Dynamics_2023_ISO_9001_2015_Management_System_Certificate.pdf\n[58]: /sitemap\n[59]: https://www.facebook.com/Spectral-Dynamics-116990255000523/\n[60]: https://www.google.com/search?rlz=1C1CHBF_enUS945US945&q=Spectral+Dynamics&stick=H4sIAAAAAAAAA\nONgecR4iZFb4OWPe8JSJxgnrTl5jfEgIxdXcEZ-uWteSWZJpZALFxuUpcIlKMWrn65vaJhhVllUlWSarMEgxc-FKiQloiXEWdy38\n8n6KS7eglf3CwfragY8V4oxCth1ado5Ni9BBiAoOx_sIGUkeH7ukUU7lgrZawlxsXsW--QnJ-YIJl__a1WQt8JeS5iLIySxIj8vP\n7dS0IuJ4cCD_-_tlTg5gbodbpx8Za_F0LRvxSE2Fg5GAYYgmCPSciuLsjIyingWsQoGF6QmlxQl5ii4VOYl5mYmFwMA_u693-wAA\nAA&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjGldTl57fvAhUOFTQIHSDKAVcQ6RN6BAgOEAE&biw=1296&bih=739\n[61]: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCEPFhx_26dmu19mxRRBhYWg"
