      "company_summary": "Sumitomo Electric Industries, Ltd. is a global leader with over 120 years of experience, operating across diverse sectors including Energy and Environment, Infocommunications, Automotive, Electronics, and Industrial Materials. The company offers a wide range of products and systems, such as fusion splicers, network-related devices, batteries, and FTTx solutions, catering to various industries including telecommunications, automotive, and industrial equipment. Through its commitment to innovation, Sumitomo Electric continues to provide advanced solutions that meet the evolving needs of its customers worldwide.",
