215]\n[Search by Business Segment][216]\n[Automotive]\nAutomotive\n][217]\n[Electronics]\nElectronics\n][218]\n[infocommunications]\nInfo-communications\n][219]\n[Redox_Flow_Bettery]\nEnvironment & Energy\n][220]\n[Industrial_materials]\nIndustrial Materials\n][221]\nCompany\n[Company Top][222]\n* [Company Profile][223]\n* [At a Glance][224]\n* [History][225]\n* [Corporate Philosophy][226]\n* [Brand & Corporate Identity][227]\n* [At a glance][228]\n[Management][229]\n* [President's Message][230]\n* [Management][231]\n* [Skills Matrix of Directors and Audit & Supervisory Board Members][232]\n[Strategy & Governance][233]\n* [Glorious Excellent Company][234]\n* [Long-term vision \"Sumitomo Electric Group 2030 VISION\"][235]\n* [Mid-term Management Plan 2028][236]\n* [Corporate Governance][237]\n* [GX Strategy][238]\n[Get in Touch][239]\n* [Exhibitions][240]\n* [Offices & Group Companies][241]\n* [Compliance Hotlines][242]\n[Learn more about Sumitomo Electric][243]\n[Sumitomo_Electric_grid_design]\n* [ Products ][244]\n* Systems\n* [Products][245]\n\n# IT Asset Management and Security Measures\n\nProducts\n\n### MCore\u2122 (IT asset /security integration management system)\n\nMCore\u2122 is a total, seamless solution from IT asset management to security and quarantine.\n\n[MCore\u2122 (IT asset /security integration management system)]\nProducts\n\n### Quarantine systems\n\nPCs that are connected without authorization as well as PCs that are used in violation of in-house\npolicies are isolated from the in-house network to ensure security. Users are guided from quarantine\nto restoration while minimizing the risk of business suspension.\n\n[Quarantine systems]\nProducts\n\n### MCore\u2122 (IT asset /security integration management system)\n\nMCore\u2122 is a total, seamless solution from IT asset management to security and quarantine. The\nsynergy of IT asset management and security management in an integrated environment helps reduce the\nburden and cost on users.\n\n[MCore\u2122MDM (mobile device management system)]\n* iOS is a trademark or registered trademark of Cisco Technology, Inc. in the U.S. and other\ncountries, and is used under license.\n* Android is a trademark or registered trademark of Google Inc. in the U.S. and other countries.\n[SEI]\n[[Sumitomo Electric]][246]\n[Products][247]\n* [Search by Business Segment][248]\n* [Search by Material etc.][249]\n* [Search from alphabetical list][250]\n[Company][251]\n* [Company Top][252]\n* [Management][253]\n* [Strategy & Governance][254]\n* [Get in Touch][255]\n[R&D][256]\n* [R&D Vision][257]\n* [Environment and Energy][258]\n* [Infocommunications][259]\n* [Automotive][260]\n* [Electronics][261]\n* [Industrial Materials][262]\n* [Analysis Technology][263]\n* [Others][264]\n* [R&D Organization][265]\n* [TECHNICAL REVIEW][266]\n[Sustainability][267]\n* [Sustainability Top][268]\n* [Environment][269]\n* [Social][270]\n* [Governance][271]\n[Publications][272]\n* [Press Release and News][273]\n* [id - eMagazine][274]\n* [President's Blog][275]\n* [Technical Review][276]\n* [Articles from Sumitomo Electric][277]\n* [Integrated Report][278]\n* [Company Profile][279]\n* [CSR Book][280]\n[IR][281]\n* [Stock Information][282]\n* [General Meeting of Shareholders][283]\n* [IR Library][284]\n* [Financial Highlights][285]\n* [IR Calendar of Events][286]\n* [FAQ][287]\n* [Forward-looking Statement][288]\n[Careers][289]\n* [Job Opportunities][290]\n* [Global HRM Policy][291]\n* [Global Executive Program][292]\n* [Our People][293]\n* [Global Internship Program][294]\n\nFollow us\n* [[Linkedin]][295]\n* [[Toutube]][296]\n* [Global Privacy Policy][297]\n* [Terms of Use][298]\n* [Social Media Policy][299]\n* [Cookies][300]\n\nRegion & Language:\n\n[Global | EN][301]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Sumitomo Electric Industries, Ltd.\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /all-products\n[3]: javascript:void(0);\n[4]: /all-industries\n[5]: /all-industries\n[6]: /all-products\n[7]: javascript:void(0);\n[8]: javascript:void(0);\n[9]: /raw