215]\n[Search by Business Segment][216]\n[Automotive]\nAutomotive\n][217]\n[Electronics]\nElectronics\n][218]\n[infocommunications]\nInfo-communications\n][219]\n[Redox_Flow_Bettery]\nEnvironment & Energy\n][220]\n[Industrial_materials]\nIndustrial Materials\n][221]\nCompany\n[Company Top][222]\n* [Company Profile][223]\n* [At a Glance][224]\n* [History][225]\n* [Corporate Philosophy][226]\n* [Brand & Corporate Identity][227]\n* [At a glance][228]\n[Management][229]\n* [President's Message][230]\n* [Management][231]\n* [Skills Matrix of Directors and Audit & Supervisory Board Members][232]\n[Strategy & Governance][233]\n* [Glorious Excellent Company][234]\n* [Long-term vision \"Sumitomo Electric Group 2030 VISION\"][235]\n* [Mid-term Management Plan 2028][236]\n* [Corporate Governance][237]\n* [GX Strategy][238]\n[Get in Touch][239]\n* [Exhibitions][240]\n* [Offices & Group Companies][241]\n* [Compliance Hotlines][242]\n[Learn more about Sumitomo Electric][243]\n[Company top page]\n* Company Top\n* Company Top\n\n# All Company\n\nCompany\n\n## A global company with over 120 years history\n\nFounded 1897 in Osaka, Japan, Sumitomo Electric has extensive business operations in five\nindustries: Energy and Environment, Infocommunications, Automotive, Electronics, Industrial\nMaterials.\n\n[Company Profile]\n\n## Company Profile\n\n][244]\n* [ Sumitomo Electric At a Glance ][245]\n* [ History ][246]\n* [ Corporate Philosophy ][247]\n* [ Brand & Corporate Identity ][248]\n[Structure & Leadership]\n\n## Structure & Leadership\n* [ President\u2019s Message ][249]\n* [ Management ][250]\n\n[2030v]\n\n## Strategy & Governance\n* [ Glorious Excellent Company ][251]\n* [ Long-term vision \"Sumitomo Electric Group 2030 VISION\" ][252]\n* [ Mid-term Management Plan 2028 ][253]\n* [ Corporate Governance ][254]\n\n[Investor Relations]\n\n## Investor Relations\n\n][255]\n* [ Financial Highlights ][256]\n* [ Stock Information ][257]\n* [ IR Events Calendar ][258]\n* [ IR FAQs ][259]\n* [ News & Press ][260]\n[Get In Touch]\n\n## Get In Touch\n* [ Offices & Group Companies ][261]\n* [ Exhibitions & Conferences Calendar ][262]\n* [ Contact Us ][263]\n\nHighlights\n\n## Highlights Description\n\n[Sumitomo_Electric_id]\n\n## id - eMagazine\n\nid introduces the reader to various topics, such as our efforts to overcome challenges, ways of\ndoing business, and historic turning points, to portray the Sumitomo Electric Group\u2019s contributions\nto society.\n* [ Learn More About id e-magazine ][264]\n\n[Sumitomo_Electric_President's_Blog]\n\n## President\u2019s Blog\n* [ Learn More About Our President\u2019s Blog ][265]\n\n[history]\n\n## 120th Anniversary History\n* [ 120th Anniversary History Movie ][266]\n\nNEWS & PR\n\n## The Latest about Sumitomo Electric\n\n## Press Releases & News\n* [Press Releases][267]\n* [Investor Relations][268]\n* [Timely Disclosure][269]\n\n[Notice Regarding Conclusion of an Absorption-type Split Agreement regarding an Absorption-type\nSplit (Simplified Absorption-type Split) between Sumitomo Electric Industries, Ltd. and Sumitomo\nRiko Co., Ltd. (213 KB)][270]\n\n26 June 2026\n* [Press Releases][271]\n* [Exhibitions][272]\n* [Products & Technology][273]\n\n[Sumitomo Electric to Exhibit at the 4th China International Supply Chain Expo (CISCE 2026),\nShowcasing Advanced Technologies in Three Key Areas: Digital & AI, Energy, and Mobility][274]\n\n16 June 2026\n* [Investor Relations][275]\n\n[Convocation Notice of the 156th Ordinary General Meeting of Shareholders][276]\n\n29 May 2026\n* [Press Releases][277]\n* [Business Activities][278]\n\n[Sumitomo Electric Group announces its Mid-term Management Plan 2028][279]\n\n12 May 2026\n* [Press Releases][280]\n* [Timely Disclosure][281]\n\n[Mid-term Management Plan 2028 (0.6 MB)][282]\n\n12 May 2026\n\n[See All Press Releases & News][283]\n\n##### Company Profile\n\n## Overview about Sumitomo Electric and various data\n\nUsing our connectivity and transmission technologies, we will contribute to creating an even better\nsociety.\n\n[Sumitomo_Electric_Company_Profile]\n\n##### PDF\n##### 5.4 MB\n\nDownload Company Profile 2025\n][284]\n[View Sumitomo Electric At a Glance][285]\n[Sumitomo_Electric_Company_Profile]\n\n##### PDF\n##### 5.4 MB\n\nDownload Company Profile 2025\n][286]\nCompany Profile (Video)\n[SEI]\n[[Sumitomo Electric]][287]\n[Products][288]\n* [Search by Business Segment][289]\n* [Search by Material etc.][290]\n* [Search from alphabetical list][291]\n[Company][292]\n* [Company Top][293]\n* [Management][294]\n* [Strategy & Governance][295]\n* [Get in Touch][296]\n[R&D][297]\n* [R&D Vision][298]\n* [Environment and Energy][299]\n* [Infocommunications][300]\n* [Automotive][301]\n* [Electronics][302]\n* [Industrial Materials][303]\n* [Analysis Technology][304]\n* [Others][305]\n* [R&D Organization][306]\n* [TECHNICAL REVIEW][307]\n[Sustainability][308]\n* [Sustainability Top][309]\n* [Environment][310]\n* [Social][311]\n* [Governance][312]\n[Publications][313]\n* [Press Release and News][314]\n* [id - eMagazine][315]\n* [President's Blog][316]\n* [Technical Review][317]\n* [Articles from Sumitomo Electric][318]\n* [Integrated Report][319]\n* [Company Profile][320]\n* [CSR Book][321]\n[IR][322]\n* [Stock Information][323]\n* [General Meeting of Shareholders][324]\n* [IR Library][325]\n* [Financial Highlights][326]\n* [IR Calendar of Events][327]\n* [FAQ][328]\n* [Forward-looking Statement][329]\n[Careers][330]\n* [Job Opportunities][331]\n* [Global HRM Policy][332]\n* [Global Executive Program][333]\n* [Our People][334]\n* [Global Internship Program][335]\n\nFollow us\n* [[Linkedin]][336]\n* [[Toutube]][337]\n* [Global Privacy Policy][338]\n* [Terms of Use][339]\n* [Social Media Policy][340]\n* [Cookies][341]\n\nRegion & Language:\n\n[Global | EN][342]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Sumitomo Electric Industries, Ltd.\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /all-products\n[3]: javascript:void(0);\n[4]: /all-industries\n[5]: /all-industries\n[6]: /all-products\n[7]: javasc