215]\n[Search by Business Segment][216]\n[Automotive]\nAutomotive\n][217]\n[Electronics]\nElectronics\n][218]\n[infocommunications]\nInfo-communications\n][219]\n[Redox_Flow_Bettery]\nEnvironment & Energy\n][220]\n[Industrial_materials]\nIndustrial Materials\n][221]\nCompany\n[Company Top][222]\n* [Company Profile][223]\n* [At a Glance][224]\n* [History][225]\n* [Corporate Philosophy][226]\n* [Brand & Corporate Identity][227]\n* [At a glance][228]\n[Management][229]\n* [President's Message][230]\n* [Management][231]\n* [Skills Matrix of Directors and Audit & Supervisory Board Members][232]\n[Strategy & Governance][233]\n* [Glorious Excellent Company][234]\n* [Long-term vision \"Sumitomo Electric Group 2030 VISION\"][235]\n* [Mid-term Management Plan 2028][236]\n* [Corporate Governance][237]\n* [GX Strategy][238]\n[Get in Touch][239]\n* [Exhibitions][240]\n* [Offices & Group Companies][241]\n* [Compliance Hotlines][242]\n[Learn more about Sumitomo Electric][243]\n[Sumitomo Electric Company Profile Banner]\n* [ Publications ][244]\n* Company Profile\n* [Publications][245]\n\n## 120 years of innovation,\n## in keeping with the Sumitomo Spirit\n\nSince the Company\u2019s founding in 1897, Sumitomo Electric has continued to take on challenges towards\na \u2018Glorious Excellent Company\u2019.\n\nkey profile\n\n## Key Company Profile\n\n###### Company Name\n\n#### Sumitomo Electric Industries, Ltd.\n\n###### Head Office\n\n#### 4-5-33, Kitahama, Chuo-ku, Osaka, Japan\n\n###### Established on\n\n#### April 1897\n\n###### Capital Stock\n\n#### 99,737 million yen\n\n###### Net Sales\n\n#### Consolidated: 5,110,171 million yen\n#### Non-Consolidated: 1,919,882 million yen\n#### (as of March 2026)\n\n###### Employees\n\n#### Consolidated: 302,972\n#### Non-Consolidated: 7,209\n#### (as of the end of March 2026)\n\n###### President\n\n#### Osamu Inoue\n\n[Discover more about Sumitomo Electric with \"At a Glance\"][246]\nCompany Profile (Video)\n\n### YouTube Channel\n\nSumitomo Electric Group\u2019s products, technologies, employees\u2019 activities etc. are also introduced in\nthe Sumitomo Electric Group YouTube channel.\n\n[Sumitomo Electric Group YouTube Channel][247]\n\n##### Company Profile CATALOG\n\n## Overview about Sumitomo Electric and various data\n\nUsing our connectivity and transmission technologies, we will contribute to creating an even better\nsociety.\n\n[Sumitomo_Electric_Company_Profile]\n\n##### PDF\n##### 5.4 MB\n\nDownload Company Profile 2025\n][248]\n[View Sumitomo Electric At a Glance][249]\n[Sumitomo_Electric_Company_Profile]\n\n##### PDF\n##### 5.4 MB\n\nDownload Company Profile 2025\n][250]\n\n### Discover the Sumitomo Spirit\n\n[history]\n\n## Historic Milestones\n\n][251]\n[Corporate Philosophy]\n\n## Corporate Philosophy\n\n][252]\n[SEI at a Glance]\n\n## Sumitomo Electric\n## At a Glance\n\n][253]\n\n##### Integrated Report\n\n## A Greater Connectivity through Concerted Efforts\n\nAbout Various Activity of Sumitomo Electric\n\n[Integrated Report2025]\n\n##### PDF\n##### 7.4 MB\n\nDownload Integrated Report 2025\n][254]\n[Learn More Sumitomo Electric Integrated Report][255]\n[Integrated Report2025]\n\n##### PDF\n##### 7.4 MB\n\nDownload Integrated Report 2025\n][256]\n\n##### CSR Book\n\n## Concerted Efforts in Meeting Social Demands\n\nWith the concerted efforts of the entire group, we will work to make society \u201cenvironmentally\nfriendly,\u201d \u201csafe and secure,\u201d and \u201ccomfortable with much potential for growth.\u201d\n\n[CSR Book2025]\n\n##### PDF\n##### 4.7 MB\n\nDownload CSR Book 2025\n][257]\n[Learn more about Sumitomo Electric's CSR activity][258]\n[CSR Book2025]\n\n##### PDF\n##### 4.7 MB\n\nDownload CSR Book 2025\n][259]\n\n## President\u2019s Message\n\nOsamu Inoue\n\nPresident & COO\n\n[Sumitomo Electric President Inoue]\n[Read more President\u2019s Message][260]\n[Sumitomo Electric President Inoue]\n[SEI]\n[[Sumitomo Electric]][261]\n[Products][262]\n* [Search by Business Segment][263]\n* [Search by Material etc.][264]\n* [Search from alphabetical list][265]\n[Company][266]\n* [Company Top][267]\n* [Management][268]\n* [Strategy & Governance][269]\n* [Get in Touch][270]\n[R&D][271]\n* [R&D Vision][272]\n* [Environment and Energy][273]\n* [Infocommunications][274]\n* [Automotive][275]\n* [Electronics][276]\n* [Industrial Materials][277]\n* [Analysis Technology][278]\n* [Others][279]\n* [R&D Organization][280]\n* [TECHNICAL REVIEW][281]\n[Sustainability][282]\n* [Sustainability Top][283]\n* [Environment][284]\n* [Social][285]\n* [Governance][286]\n[Publications][287]\n* [Press Release and News][288]\n* [id - eMagazine][289]\n* [President's Blog][290]\n* [Technical Review][291]\n* [Articles from Sumitomo Electric][292]\n* [Integrated Report][293]\n* [Company Profile][294]\n* [CSR Book][295]\n[IR][296]\n* [Stock Information][297]\n* [General Meeting of Shareholders][298]\n* [IR Library][299]\n* [Financial Highlights][300]\n* [IR Calendar of Events][301]\n* [FAQ][302]\n* [Forward-looking Statement][303]\n[Careers][304]\n* [Job Opportunities][305]\n* [Global HRM Policy][306]\n* [Global Executive Program][307]\n* [Our People][308]\n* [Global Internship Program][309]\n\nFollow us\n* [[Linkedin]][310]\n* [[Toutube]][311]\n* [Global Privacy Policy][312]\n* [Terms of Use][313]\n* [Social Media Policy][314]\n* [Cookies][315]\n\nRegion & Language:\n\n[Global | EN][316]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Sumitomo Electric Industries, Ltd.\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /all-products\n[3]: javascript:void(0);\n[4]: /all-industries\n[5]: /all-industries\n[6]: /all-products\n[7]: javascript:void(0);\n[8]: javascript:void(0);\n[9]: /raw-materials\n[10]: /metals-alloy\n[11]: /semiconductor\n[12]: /diamonds\n[13]: /ceramics\n[14]: /powders\n[15]: /components\n[16]: /wires\n[17]: /tubes-tapes\n[18]: /optical-components\n[19]: /metal-components\n[20]: /electrical-components\n[21]: /module\n[22]: /thermal-modulesdevices\n[23]: /products/poreflon\n[24]: /optical-modules\n[25]: /cables\n[26]: /end