215]\n[Search by Business Segment][216]\n[Automotive]\nAutomotive\n][217]\n[Electronics]\nElectronics\n][218]\n[infocommunications]\nInfo-communications\n][219]\n[Redox_Flow_Bettery]\nEnvironment & Energy\n][220]\n[Industrial_materials]\nIndustrial Materials\n][221]\nCompany\n[Company Top][222]\n* [Company Profile][223]\n* [At a Glance][224]\n* [History][225]\n* [Corporate Philosophy][226]\n* [Brand & Corporate Identity][227]\n* [At a glance][228]\n[Management][229]\n* [President's Message][230]\n* [Management][231]\n* [Skills Matrix of Directors and Audit & Supervisory Board Members][232]\n[Strategy & Governance][233]\n* [Glorious Excellent Company][234]\n* [Long-term vision \"Sumitomo Electric Group 2030 VISION\"][235]\n* [Mid-term Management Plan 2028][236]\n* [Corporate Governance][237]\n* [GX Strategy][238]\n[Get in Touch][239]\n* [Exhibitions][240]\n* [Offices & Group Companies][241]\n* [Compliance Hotlines][242]\n[Learn more about Sumitomo Electric][243]\n[Corporate Branding - Sumitomo Electric]\n* [ Company ][244]\n* [ Company Top ][245]\n* Brand & Corporate Identity\n* [Company Top][246]\n\n## Connect with Innovation\n\nIn this tag line, we carry the following message to society:\n\nThe Sumitomo Electric Group moves forward hand-in-hand\nin its contribution to the development of society\nby connecting with continuous innovation.\n\nTAGLINE\n\n## Connect with Innovation\n\nAs part of the Sumitomo Electric Group\u2019s branding strategy, this tag line briefly expresses the\nvalue and functionality that the Sumitomo Electric Group provides in the course of developing\ntowards its ideal state of a Glorious Excellent Company.\n\n\u201cConnect\u201d represents our determination to contribute to the development of society by connecting\nsociety, stakeholders, and the value generated through our business activities.\n\n\u201cInnovation\u201d represents our endeavor to further refine our core technologies that cover every stage\nof production from material engineering to manufacturing processes and our entrepreneurship to\npromptly respond to changes in society.\n\n[Sumitomo_Electric_Grid_Design]\n\n## \u201cVisual Identity\u201d\n\n- Visual Identity of Sumitomo Electric Group -\n\n## Our Brand Visual Identity\n\nIn 2015, the Sumitomo Electric Group established and introduced a more consistent visual identity in\norder to better visually represent the features of the Group and impress customers in various\nsituations.\n\nBasic Elements\n\n## Sumitomo Electric Logo\n\n[Sumitomo Electric English logo]\nSumitomo Electric - English logo\n[Sumitomo Electric Japanese logo]\nSumitomo Electric - Japanese Logo\nBrand Value\n\n## Our brand value\n\nIn formulating its visual identity, the Sumitomo Electric Group identified the four brand values\nbelow that underpin Sumitomo Electric\u2019s unique qualities.\n* **Visionary**\n\nLong-term, continuous perspective with a view to the future\n* **Committed**\n\nSerious commitment and integrity\n* **Diverse**\n\nRespect for diversity\n* **Innovative**\n\nCreation of new values with an innovative mind\n\nGlobal Design Application\n\n## Sumitomo Electric Group Grid Design\n\n[Sumitomo_Electric_Grid_Design]\n\nThe Sumitomo Electric Group\u2019s corporate design was established to convey the brand values\n(Visionary, Committed, Diverse, Innovative) and visually represent the Sumitomo Electric Group.\nThe corporate design is intended to standardize the unique image of Sumitomo Electric around the\nworld and strengthen the brand power of the entire Group. Specifically, lines are extended in four\ndirections, as if stretching copper wires, from the igeta mark that symbolizes the Sumitomo Business\nSpirit such as banji-nissei (Committed). The corporate design also represents the long-term and\ncontinuous perspective, the image of a path that leads to the future (Visionary), as well as new\nbusinesses and values that are created based on Sumitomo\u2019s copper mine operations (Innovative). The\nvisual identity (VI), including the format, corporate font, and photo style, is applied in\naccordance with the global design rules.\n\n[Corporate Philosophy][247] [History][248] [Sumitomo Electric At a Glance][249]\n[SEI]\n[[Sumitomo Electric]][250]\n[Products][251]\n* [Search by Business Segment][252]\n* [Search by Material etc.][253]\n* [Search from alphabetical list][254]\n[Company][255]\n* [Company Top][256]\n* [Management][257]\n* [Strategy & Governance][258]\n* [Get in Touch][259]\n[R&D][260]\n* [R&D Vision][261]\n* [Environment and Energy][262]\n* [Infocommunications][263]\n* [Automotive][264]\n* [Electronics][265]\n* [Industrial Materials][266]\n* [Analysis Technology][267]\n* [Others][268]\n* [R&D Organization][269]\n* [TECHNICAL REVIEW][270]\n[Sustainability][271]\n* [Sustainability Top][272]\n* [Environment][273]\n* [Social][274]\n* [Governance][275]\n[Publications][276]\n* [Press Release and News][277]\n* [id - eMagazine][278]\n* [President's Blog][279]\n* [Technical Review][280]\n* [Articles from Sumitomo Electric][281]\n* [Integrated Report][282]\n* [Company Profile][283]\n* [CSR Book][284]\n[IR][285]\n* [Stock Information][286]\n* [General Meeting of Shareholders][287]\n* [IR Library][288]\n* [Financial Highlights][289]\n* [IR Calendar of Events][290]\n* [FAQ][291]\n* [Forward-looking Statement][292]\n[Careers][293]\n* [Job Opportunities][294]\n* [Global HRM Policy][295]\n* [Global Executive Program][296]\n* [Our People][297]\n* [Global Internship Program][298]\n\nFollow us\n* [[Linkedin]][299]\n* [[Toutube]][300]\n* [Global Privacy Policy][301]\n* [Terms of Use][302]\n* [Social Media Policy][303]\n* [Cookies][304]\n\nRegion & Language:\n\n[Global | EN][305]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Sumitomo Electric Industries, Ltd.\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /all-products\n[3]: javascript:void(0);\n[4]: /all-industries\n[5]: /all-industries\n[6]: /all-products\n[7]: javascript:void(0);\n[8]: javascript:void(0);\n[9]: /raw-materials\n[10]: /metals-alloy\n[11]: /semiconductor\n[12]: /diamonds\n[13]: /ceramics\n[14]: /powders\n[15]: /components\n[16]: /wires\n[17]: /tubes-tapes\n[18]: /optical-components\n[19]: /metal-components\n[20]: /electrical-components\n[21]: /module\n[22]: /thermal-modulesdevices\n[23]: /products/poreflon\n[24]: /optical-modules\n[25]: /cables\n[26]: /end-products\n[27]: https://global-sei.com/sumitomo-electric-splicers/\n[28]: /network-related-devices\n[29]: /diamond-cbn-tools\n[30]: /cutting-tools\n[31]: /batteries\n[32]: /systems\n[33]: https://global-sei.com/fttx/\n[34]: /power-energy-systems\n[35]"
