215]\n[Search by Business Segment][216]\n[Automotive]\nAutomotive\n][217]\n[Electronics]\nElectronics\n][218]\n[infocommunications]\nInfo-communications\n][219]\n[Redox_Flow_Bettery]\nEnvironment & Energy\n][220]\n[Industrial_materials]\nIndustrial Materials\n][221]\nCompany\n[Company Top][222]\n* [Company Profile][223]\n* [At a Glance][224]\n* [History][225]\n* [Corporate Philosophy][226]\n* [Brand & Corporate Identity][227]\n* [At a glance][228]\n[Management][229]\n* [President's Message][230]\n* [Management][231]\n* [Skills Matrix of Directors and Audit & Supervisory Board Members][232]\n[Strategy & Governance][233]\n* [Glorious Excellent Company][234]\n* [Long-term vision \"Sumitomo Electric Group 2030 VISION\"][235]\n* [Mid-term Management Plan 2028][236]\n* [Corporate Governance][237]\n* [GX Strategy][238]\n[Get in Touch][239]\n* [Exhibitions][240]\n* [Offices & Group Companies][241]\n* [Compliance Hotlines][242]\n[Learn more about Sumitomo Electric][243]\n[Strategy]\n* [ Company ][244]\n* Strategy & Governance\n* [Company][245]\n\n# Strategy & Governance\n\n[GEC]\n\n### Glorious Excellent Company\n\nThe Sumitomo Electric Group is working to develop into a corporate group with a solid corporate\nphilosophy and sustainable growth potential, with the aim of becoming a \"Glorious Excellent\nCompany.\"\n\n[Discover more][246]\n[2030V]\n\n### Long-term vision \"Sumitomo Electric Group 2030 VISION\"\n\nWe have prepared \"Sumitomo Electric Group 2030 Vision,\" which is a long-term vision targeting 2030.\nThe Sumitomo Electric Group will strive to enhance our corporate value with stakeholders\u2019 support to\nbe \u201cGlorious Excellent Company.\u201d\n\n[Discover more][247]\n[25M]\n\n### Mid-term Management Plan 2025\n\nSumitomo Electric Industries, Ltd. has prepared the \u201cMid-term Management Plan 2025\u201d, a three-year\naction plan for FY2023-FY2025 in line with our long-term vision \u201cSumitomo Electric Group 2030\nVision\u201d. Under the plan, which carries the slogan \"Creating a Green Society through our Connecting\nand Supporting Technologies\u201d, the Sumitomo Electric Group (SEG) will work on growth strategies and\nstrengthening our business foundations with the integrated capabilities of the Group. By\ndeterminedly seizing business opportunities towards the \u201cAdvancement of a Decarbonized Society\u201d and\n\u201cEvolution of the Information Society\u201d, SEG will appropriately distribute the results of this growth\nto our multistakeholder partnerships.\n\n[Discover More][248]\n[Corporate Governance]\n\n### Corporate Governance\n\nUnder our corporate philosophy of the Sumitomo Spirit and the Sumitomo Electric Group Corporate\nPrinciples, our group maintains its everlasting basic policy of contributing to society through our\nfair business practices.\n\n[Discover more][249]\n[SEI]\n[[Sumitomo Electric]][250]\n[Products][251]\n* [Search by Business Segment][252]\n* [Search by Material etc.][253]\n* [Search from alphabetical list][254]\n[Company][255]\n* [Company Top][256]\n* [Management][257]\n* [Strategy & Governance][258]\n* [Get in Touch][259]\n[R&D][260]\n* [R&D Vision][261]\n* [Environment and Energy][262]\n* [Infocommunications][263]\n* [Automotive][264]\n* [Electronics][265]\n* [Industrial Materials][266]\n* [Analysis Technology][267]\n* [Others][268]\n* [R&D Organization][269]\n* [TECHNICAL REVIEW][270]\n[Sustainability][271]\n* [Sustainability Top][272]\n* [Environment][273]\n* [Social][274]\n* [Governance][275]\n[Publications][276]\n* [Press Release and News][277]\n* [id - eMagazine][278]\n* [President's Blog][279]\n* [Technical Review][280]\n* [Articles from Sumitomo Electric][281]\n* [Integrated Report][282]\n* [Company Profile][283]\n* [CSR Book][284]\n[IR][285]\n* [Stock Information][286]\n* [General Meeting of Shareholders][287]\n* [IR Library][288]\n* [Financial Highlights][289]\n* [IR Calendar of Events][290]\n* [FAQ][291]\n* [Forward-looking Statement][292]\n[Careers][293]\n* [Job Opportunities][294]\n* [Global HRM Policy][295]\n* [Global Executive Program][296]\n* [Our People][297]\n* [Global Internship Program][298]\n\nFollow us\n* [[Linkedin]][299]\n* [[Toutube]][300]\n* [Global Privacy Policy][301]\n* [Terms of Use][302]\n* [Social Media Policy][303]\n* [Cookies][304]\n\nRegion & Language:\n\n[Global | EN][305]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Sumitomo Electric Industries, Ltd.\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /all-products\n[3]: javascript:void(0);\n[4]: /all-industries\n[5]: /all-industries\n[6]: /all-products\n[7]: javascript:void(0);\n[8]: javascript:void(0);\n[9]: /raw-materials\n[10]: /metals-alloy\n[11]: /semiconductor\n[12]: /diamonds\n[13]: /ceramics\n[14]: /powders\n[15]: /components\n[16]: /wires\n[17]: /tubes-tapes\n[18]: /optical-components\n[19]: /metal-components\n[20]: /electrical-components\n[21]: /module\n[22]: /thermal-modulesdevices\n[23]: /products/poreflon\n[24]: /optical-modules\n[25]: /cables\n[26]: /end-products\n[27]: https://global-sei.com/sumitomo-electric-splicers/\n[28]: /network-related-devices\n[29]: /diamond-cbn-tools\n[30]: /cutting-tools\n[31]: /batteries\n[32]: /systems\n[33]: https://global-sei.com/fttx/\n[34]: /power-energy-systems\n[35]: /communication-systems\n[36]: https://global-sei.com/data-center-solutions/\n[37]: https://global-sei.com/infocommunication-products-portal/\n[38]: /products/it-asset\n[39]: javascript:void(0);\n[40]: javascript:void(0);\n[41]: /automotive\n[42]: /electronics\n[43]: /info-communications\n[44]: /environment-energy\n[45]: /industrial-materials\n[46]: /company\n[47]: javascript:void(0);\n[48]: /company\n[49]: /company\n[50]: /company/profile\n[51]: /company/glance\n[52]: /company/history\n[53]: /company/vision\n[54]: /company/brand-corporate-identity\n[55]: /company/glance\n[56]: /company/management\n[57]: /company/presidents-message\n[58]: /company/management\n[59]: /company/skillsmatrix\n[60]: /company/strategy-governance\n[61]: /company/gec\n[62]: /company/segvision2030\n[63]: /company/segmid-term2028\n[64]: