215]\n[Search by Business Segment][216]\n[Automotive]\nAutomotive\n][217]\n[Electronics]\nElectronics\n][218]\n[infocommunications]\nInfo-communications\n][219]\n[Redox_Flow_Bettery]\nEnvironment & Energy\n][220]\n[Industrial_materials]\nIndustrial Materials\n][221]\nCompany\n[Company Top][222]\n* [Company Profile][223]\n* [At a Glance][224]\n* [History][225]\n* [Corporate Philosophy][226]\n* [Brand & Corporate Identity][227]\n* [At a glance][228]\n[Management][229]\n* [President's Message][230]\n* [Management][231]\n* [Skills Matrix of Directors and Audit & Supervisory Board Members][232]\n[Strategy & Governance][233]\n* [Glorious Excellent Company][234]\n* [Long-term vision \"Sumitomo Electric Group 2030 VISION\"][235]\n* [Mid-term Management Plan 2028][236]\n* [Corporate Governance][237]\n* [GX Strategy][238]\n[Get in Touch][239]\n* [Exhibitions][240]\n* [Offices & Group Companies][241]\n* [Compliance Hotlines][242]\n[Learn more about Sumitomo Electric][243]\n[Long term vision\u300cSumitomo Electric Group 2030 Vision\u300dheader]\n* [ Company ][244]\n* [ Strategy & Governance ][245]\n* Mid-term Management Plan 2028\n* [Strategy & Governance][246]\n\n# Mid-term Management Plan 2028\n\nJump To:\n[General Overview][247] [\uff13 Pillars][248] [Business Strategies\uff08Main Topics in the three Key\nAreas\uff09][249] [Financial Goals][250] [\u201dGoho Yoshi\u201d (Five-Way Win) ][251]\n\n## Mid-term Management Plan 2028\n\n[PDF Download][252]\n\nSumitomo Electric Industries, Ltd. is pleased to announce its \u201cMid-term Management Plan 2028,\u201d a\nthree-year plan covering FY2026-FY2028.\nThe summary includes the following. For further details, please refer to the PDF above.\n\n### General Overview\n\nBased on the Sumitomo Business Spirit and Sumitomo Electric Group Corporate Principles, SEG will\nfurther strengthen its business foundation consisting of three Key Driving Forces and three Key\nSources of Capital, while advancing its businesses primarily in three key areas as well as\ninterconnected areas.\nSEG will enhance our competitiveness by leveraging the integrated capabilities of SEG to respond\nwith precision to global changes and by capturing demand for GX and DX, with the aim of achieving\nnet sales of 6 trillion yen, operating profit of 600 billion yen, and before-tax ROIC of >15% by\n2028.\n\n### \uff13 Pillars\n\n### (1)Demonstrate the integrated capabilities of SEG\n\n### (2)Respond with precision to trends in the global business environment\n\n### (3)Capture green and digital-related demand\n\n### Business Strategies\uff08Main Topics in the three Key Areas\uff09\n\n## (1)Digital and AI\n\n**SEG aims to increase our share of the hyperscale data center market,**\n**primarily in North America, by introducing a wide range of high-performance products to support\nadvanced digital infrastructure**\n\n## (2)Energy\n\n**SEG will strengthen our cable manufacturing and installation capabilities globally, aiming to\nexpand incoming orders as a \u201clocal company.\u201d**\n\n## (3)Mobility\n\n**Leveraging our strength as a world leader in wiring harnesses, SEG aims to become a \u201cglobal\nmobility supplier\u201d through the integrated capabilities of SEG.**\n\n### Financial Goals\n\n### \u201dGoho Yoshi\u201d (Five-Way Win)\n\n### - Multistakeholder Capitalism -\n\n\u201cGoho Yoshi\u201d (Five-Way Win) is a concept that has been part of the Sumitomo Electric Group for some\ntime and is based on the Sumitomo Corporate Philosophy.\nWe are committed to sustainable growth and medium- to long-term value creation by sharing prosperity\nwith our multiple stakeholders: customers, employees, suppliers, regional communities, and\nshareholders/investors.\nIn this Mid-term Management Plan 2028, we have set specific and quantitative targets for the sharing\nof returns with multiple stakeholders, and are determined to achieve them.\n\n[PDF Download][253]\n\n### Related Infomation\n\n[Long-term vision \"Sumitomo Electric Group 2030 VISION\"][254]\n[SEI]\n[[Sumitomo Electric]][255]\n[Products][256]\n* [Search by Business Segment][257]\n* [Search by Material etc.][258]\n* [Search from alphabetical list][259]\n[Company][260]\n* [Company Top][261]\n* [Management][262]\n* [Strategy & Governance][263]\n* [Get in Touch][264]\n[R&D][265]\n* [R&D Vision][266]\n* [Environment and Energy][267]\n* [Infocommunications][268]\n* [Automotive][269]\n* [Electronics][270]\n* [Industrial Materials][271]\n* [Analysis Technology][272]\n* [Others][273]\n* [R&D Organization][274]\n* [TECHNICAL REVIEW][275]\n[Sustainability][276]\n* [Sustainability Top][277]\n* [Environment][278]\n* [Social][279]\n* [Governance][280]\n[Publications][281]\n* [Press Release and News][282]\n* [id - eMagazine][283]\n* [President's Blog][284]\n* [Technical Review][285]\n* [Articles from Sumitomo Electric][286]\n* [Integrated Report][287]\n* [Company Profile][288]\n* [CSR Book][289]\n[IR][290]\n* [Stock Information][291]\n* [General Meeting of Shareholders][292]\n* [IR Library][293]\n* [Financial Highlights][294]\n* [IR Calendar of Events][295]\n* [FAQ][296]\n* [Forward-looking Statement][297]\n[Careers][298]\n* [Job Opportunities][299]\n* [Global HRM Policy][300]\n* [Global Executive Program][301]\n* [Our People][302]\n* [Global Internship Program][303]\n\nFollow us\n* [[Linkedin]][304]\n* [[Toutube]][305]\n* [Global Privacy Policy][306]\n* [Terms of Use][307]\n* [Social Media Policy][308]\n* [Cookies][309]\n\nRegion & Language:\n\n[Global | EN][310]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Sumitomo Electric Industries, Ltd.\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /all-products\n[3]: javascript:void(0);\n[4]: /all-industries\n[5]: /all-industries\n[6]: /all-products\n[7]: javascript:void(0);\n[8]: javascript:void(0);\n[9]: /raw-materials\n[10]: /metals-alloy\n[11]: /semiconductor\n[12]: /diamonds\n[13]: /ceramics\n[14]: /powders\n[15]: /components\n[16]: /wires\n[17]: /tubes-tapes\n[18]: /optical-components\n[19]: /metal-components\n[20]: /electrical-components\n[21]: /module\n[22]: /thermal-