215]\n[Search by Business Segment][216]\n[Automotive]\nAutomotive\n][217]\n[Electronics]\nElectronics\n][218]\n[infocommunications]\nInfo-communications\n][219]\n[Redox_Flow_Bettery]\nEnvironment & Energy\n][220]\n[Industrial_materials]\nIndustrial Materials\n][221]\nCompany\n[Company Top][222]\n* [Company Profile][223]\n* [At a Glance][224]\n* [History][225]\n* [Corporate Philosophy][226]\n* [Brand & Corporate Identity][227]\n* [At a glance][228]\n[Management][229]\n* [President's Message][230]\n* [Management][231]\n* [Skills Matrix of Directors and Audit & Supervisory Board Members][232]\n[Strategy & Governance][233]\n* [Glorious Excellent Company][234]\n* [Long-term vision \"Sumitomo Electric Group 2030 VISION\"][235]\n* [Mid-term Management Plan 2028][236]\n* [Corporate Governance][237]\n* [GX Strategy][238]\n[Get in Touch][239]\n* [Exhibitions][240]\n* [Offices & Group Companies][241]\n* [Compliance Hotlines][242]\n[Learn more about Sumitomo Electric][243]\n* [ Company ][244]\n* [ Strategy & Governance ][245]\n* Corporate Governance\n* [Strategy & Governance][246]\nOverview\n\n## Corporate Governance\n\n## Basic Views\n\nThe unchanging basic policy of Sumitomo Electric Industries, Ltd. is to contribute to society\nthrough fair business activities based on the Sumitomo Spirit and the Sumitomo Electric Group\nCorporate Principles.\nAdhering to this basic philosophy, we aim to achieve sustainable growth and enhance corporate value\nof the Sumitomo Electric Group over the medium to long term as well as to steadily return the\nresults to all of its stakeholders as a going concern based on the concept of \u201cMultistakeholder\nCapitalism\u201d which focusing on contributing to the public benefit and mutual prosperity with all of\nour stakeholders. We thus work to ensure and enhance the transparency and fairness of management\nbased on proper corporate governance.\n\n### Corporate Governance Guidelines\n\nWe have established these \u201cCorporate Governance Guidelines\u201d setting forth our basic ideas and policy\nconcerning corporate governance.\n\n[PDF Download\uff08177KB\uff09][247]\n\n### Corporate Governance Report\n\nWe disclose specific measures based on the \u201cCorporate Governance Guidelines\u201d in the \u201cCorporate\nGovernance Report.\u201d\n\n[PDF Download\uff081357KB\uff09][248]\n[Cooprate Governance system]\n\n### Sumitomo Electric Group's corporate governance structure\n\n[SEI]\n[[Sumitomo Electric]][249]\n[Products][250]\n* [Search by Business Segment][251]\n* [Search by Material etc.][252]\n* [Search from alphabetical list][253]\n[Company][254]\n* [Company Top][255]\n* [Management][256]\n* [Strategy & Governance][257]\n* [Get in Touch][258]\n[R&D][259]\n* [R&D Vision][260]\n* [Environment and Energy][261]\n* [Infocommunications][262]\n* [Automotive][263]\n* [Electronics][264]\n* [Industrial Materials][265]\n* [Analysis Technology][266]\n* [Others][267]\n* [R&D Organization][268]\n* [TECHNICAL REVIEW][269]\n[Sustainability][270]\n* [Sustainability Top][271]\n* [Environment][272]\n* [Social][273]\n* [Governance][274]\n[Publications][275]\n* [Press Release and News][276]\n* [id - eMagazine][277]\n* [President's Blog][278]\n* [Technical Review][279]\n* [Articles from Sumitomo Electric][280]\n* [Integrated Report][281]\n* [Company Profile][282]\n* [CSR Book][283]\n[IR][284]\n* [Stock Information][285]\n* [General Meeting of Shareholders][286]\n* [IR Library][287]\n* [Financial Highlights][288]\n* [IR Calendar of Events][289]\n* [FAQ][290]\n* [Forward-looking Statement][291]\n[Careers][292]\n* [Job Opportunities][293]\n* [Global HRM Policy][294]\n* [Global Executive Program][295]\n* [Our People][296]\n* [Global Internship Program][297]\n\nFollow us\n* [[Linkedin]][298]\n* [[Toutube]][299]\n* [Global Privacy Policy][300]\n* [Terms of Use][301]\n* [Social Media Policy][302]\n* [Cookies][303]\n\nRegion & Language:\n\n[Global | EN][304]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Sumitomo Electric Industries, Ltd.\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /all-products