215]\n[Search by Business Segment][216]\n[Automotive]\nAutomotive\n][217]\n[Electronics]\nElectronics\n][218]\n[infocommunications]\nInfo-communications\n][219]\n[Redox_Flow_Bettery]\nEnvironment & Energy\n][220]\n[Industrial_materials]\nIndustrial Materials\n][221]\nCompany\n[Company Top][222]\n* [Company Profile][223]\n* [At a Glance][224]\n* [History][225]\n* [Corporate Philosophy][226]\n* [Brand & Corporate Identity][227]\n* [At a glance][228]\n[Management][229]\n* [President's Message][230]\n* [Management][231]\n* [Skills Matrix of Directors and Audit & Supervisory Board Members][232]\n[Strategy & Governance][233]\n* [Glorious Excellent Company][234]\n* [Long-term vision \"Sumitomo Electric Group 2030 VISION\"][235]\n* [Mid-term Management Plan 2028][236]\n* [Corporate Governance][237]\n* [GX Strategy][238]\n[Get in Touch][239]\n* [Exhibitions][240]\n* [Offices & Group Companies][241]\n* [Compliance Hotlines][242]\n[Learn more about Sumitomo Electric][243]\n[Contact Us]\n* [ Company ][244]\n* Get in Touch\n* [Company][245]\n\n# Get in Touch\n\n### Get in touch with the Sumitomo Electric team\n\n[exhibitions.png]\n\n### Exhibitions\n\nSumitomo Electric participates every year to international exhibitions to share with the world the\nlatest technology achieved to support the society development. Come to our exhibitions to discover\nmore about our products and get in contact with us.\n\n[Discover the next exhibitions][246]\n[group companies.png]\n\n### Group Companies\n\nThe Sumitomo Electric group has more than 400 group companies, with a team of 280,000 employees\nworking in more than 40 countries worldwide. Discover more about our group and get in touch with\ngroup companies in your country.\n\n[Discover our group companies][247]\n[Compliance.png]\n\n### Compliance Hotlines\n\nIf you happen to know of any non-complying act or any suspected violation in the Sumitomo Electric\nGroup, please it to the internal or external compliance hotline from the following link.\n\n[Check our compliance hotlines][248]\n\n### Contact Us\n\nIf you have any question about Sumitomo Electric and our products, please feel free to contact our\nexpert team.\n\n[Contact our team][249]\n\n### Follow us to stay updated with the latest news\n\n[Sumitomo Electric LinkedIn]\n* [ Follow Us ][250]\n[Sumitomo Electric Youtube Channel]\n* [ Subscribe ][251]\n[Sumitomo Electric Twitter]\n* [ Follow Us ][252]\n[SEI]\n[[Sumitomo Electric]][253]\n[Products][254]\n* [Search by Business Segment][255]\n* [Search by Material etc.][256]\n* [Search from alphabetical list][257]\n[Company][258]\n* [Company Top][259]\n* [Management][260]\n* [Strategy & Governance][261]\n* [Get in Touch][262]\n[R&D][263]\n* [R&D Vision][264]\n* [Environment and Energy][265]\n* [Infocommunications][266]\n* [Automotive][267]\n* [Electronics][268]\n* [Industrial Materials][269]\n* [Analysis Technology][270]\n* [Others][271]\n* [R&D Organization][272]\n* [TECHNICAL REVIEW][273]\n[Sustainability][274]\n* [Sustainability Top][275]\n* [Environment][276]\n* [Social][277]\n* [Governance][278]\n[Publications][279]\n* [Press Release and News][280]\n* [id - eMagazine][281]\n* [President's Blog][282]\n* [Technical Review][283]\n* [Articles from Sumitomo Electric][284]\n* [Integrated Report][285]\n* [Company Profile][286]\n* [CSR Book][287]\n[IR][288]\n* [Stock Information][289]\n* [General Meeting of Shareholders][290]\n* [IR Library][291]\n* [Financial Highlights][292]\n* [IR Calendar of Events][293]\n* [FAQ][294]\n* [Forward-looking Statement][295]\n[Careers][296]\n* [Job Opportunities][297]\n* [Global HRM Policy][298]\n* [Global Executive Program][299]\n* [Our People][300]\n* [Global Internship Program][301]\n\nFollow us\n* [[Linkedin]][302]\n* [[Toutube]][303]\n* [Global Privacy Policy][304]\n* [Terms of Use][305]\n* [Social Media Policy][306]\n* [Cookies][307]\n\nRegion & Language:\n\n[Global | EN][308]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Sumitomo Electric Industries, Ltd.\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /all-products\n[3]: javasc