      "polished_summary": "Tempris is a leading innovator in wireless in-process product temperature control for lyophilization, boasting over 15 years of experience in the pharmaceutical sector. The company offers advanced solutions such as LyoCONNECT and LyoINSIGHT, which provide real-time product temperature monitoring and actionable process intelligence, facilitating seamless integration from research and development to GMP production. Tempris is dedicated to enhancing product-centric process optimization and regulatory compliance in the lyophilization process.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Tempris develops advanced solutions for temperature monitoring in the lyophilization process, which is directly relevant to the spectral sensor market. Their products like LyoCONNECT and LyoINSIGHT are designed for real-time product temperature monitoring, making them significant players in this niche.",
