      "company_summary": "TriOS is a leading manufacturer of high-quality optical measuring technology, specializing in spectral sensors designed for environmental and water monitoring applications. Their product range includes photometers, fluorometers, radiometers, and comprehensive monitoring systems, catering to diverse sectors such as environmental monitoring agencies, water treatment facilities, and marine research organizations. With a commitment to precision and innovation, TriOS provides robust solutions that enhance water quality management and support scientific research.",
