            "text": "[ Skip to content ][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [Applications][3]\n* [Drinking water][4]\n* [Waste water][5]\n* [Environment][6]\n* [Industry][7]\n* [Marine & Science][8]\n* [Scrubber][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Sensors][11]\n* [Photometers][12]\n* [Fluorometer][13]\n* [Radiometers][14]\n* [eCHEM][15]\n* [TW Master series][16]\n* [Controller][17]\n* [Accessories][18]\n* [Systems][19]\n* [SEPIA][20]\n* [About TriOS][21]\n* [Product History][22]\n* [News][23]\n* [Events][24]\n* [Locations][25]\n* [Sustainability][26]\n* [Company History][27]\n* [Career][28]\n* [Contact][29]\n* [RMA form][30]\n* [Sales Team][31]\n* [[English]][32]\n* [[Deutsch]][33]\n\n###### [ Member Area ][34]\n\nSearch for:Search Button\n* [Home][35]\n* [Applications][36]\n* [Drinking water][37]\n* [Waste water][38]\n* [Environment][39]\n* [Industry][40]\n* [Marine & Science][41]\n* [Scrubber][42]\n* [Products][43]\n* [Sensors][44]\n* [Photometers][45]\n* [Fluorometer][46]\n* [Radiometers][47]\n* [eCHEM][48]\n* [TW Master series][49]\n* [Controller][50]\n* [Accessories][51]\n* [Systems][52]\n* [SEPIA][53]\n* [About TriOS][54]\n* [Product History][55]\n* [News][56]\n* [Events][57]\n* [Locations][58]\n* [Sustainability][59]\n* [Company History][60]\n* [Career][61]\n* [Contact][62]\n* [RMA form][63]\n* [Sales Team][64]\n* [[English]][65]\n* [[Deutsch]][66]\n\n###### [ Member Area ][67]\n\nSearch for:Search Button\n\n# About TriOS\n\nFor over two decades TriOS is equipping partners in science and nature conservation with\nhigh-quality measuring devices for environmental and water monitoring and has always put great value\nto the knowledge exchange with research partners and users. The company\u2019s expertise stems from this\nexchange and a constant desire for growth and improvement. Although our roots lie in radiometry, we\nwere able to expand our portfolio to the areas of photometry, fluorometry, nephelometry and\nelectrochemistry. We not only offer our customers single sensors but also whole system-constructions\nfor application-specific uses in various areas.\n\nWe are proud that not only our products contribute to research and preservation of the environment\nbut also our company that commits to sustainability and compensation of our own emissions.\n\nTriOS unites all production stages on the company site in Rastede. Starting with research and\ndevelopment, the production of components in the mechanics and electronics workshop up to the final\nproduct design, all processes lie within the company. This is how an active exchange of information\nand ideas across the departments can be lived and a great pool of ideas, creativity and competence\nis created. Production materials of highest quality and a precise construction always have the\nhighest priority in all our process stages.\n\nDiscover the variety of the TriOS product range and convince yourself of the high quality of all our\nproducts.\n\n## Our Processes\n\nIdea\n\nProduction\n\nElectronics & Assembly\n\nProduct Tests\n\nProduct Launch\n\nImplementation in Applications\n\nFeedback of Customers\n\n## Areas of Application\n\n## Measurable Parameters for TriOS photometers and fluorometers\n\n### TriOS\n\nTriOS Mess- und Datentechnik GmbH has been developing and producing optical sensors for water\nanalysis for more than 25 years.\n\n[Imprint][68]\n[Privacy policy][69]\n[Contact][70]\n[Terms and conditions][71]\n\n## Cookie settings\n* [Change settings][72]\n* [Cookie History][73]\n* [Revoking consent][74]\n\n### Address\n\nTriOS Mess- und Datentechnik GmbH\nB\u00fcrgermeister-Br\u00f6tje-Str. 25\n26180 Rastede\nphone +49 (0)4402 69670-0\nfax +49 (0)4402 69670-20\n\n### Follow us\n\n[LinkedIn][75]\n\n[Facebook][76]\n\n[Instagram][77]\n\n### Memberships\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://trios.de/en/home/\n[3]: https://trios.de/en/applications/\n[4]: https://trios.de/en/drinking-water/\n[5]: https://trios.de/en/wastewater/\n[6]: https://trios.de/en/environment/\n[7]: https://trios.de/en/industry/\n[8]: https://trios.de/en/marine-science/\n[9]: https://trios.de/en/scrubber/\n[10]: https://trios.de/en/products/\n[11]: https://trios.de/en/sensors/\n[12]: https://trios.de/en/sensors#photometer\n[13]: https://trios.de/en/sensors#fluorometer\n[14]: https://trios.de/en/sensors#radiometer\n[15]: https://trios.de/en/sensors#echem\n[16]: https://trios.de/en/tw-master-series/\n[17]: https://trios.de/en/controller/\n[18]: https://trios.de/en/accessories/\n[19]: https://trios.de/en/systems/\n[20]: https://sepia-sensors.com\n[21]: https://trios.de/en/about-trios/\n[22]: https://trios.de/en/product-history/\n[23]: https://trios.de/en/news-2/\n[24]: https://trios.de/en/events/\n[25]: https://trios.de/en/locations/\n[26]: https://trios.de/en/sustainability/\n[27]: https://trios.de/en/company-history/\n[28]: https://trios.de/en/career/\n[29]: https://trios.de/en/contact/\n[30]: https://trios.de/en/rma/\n[31]: https://trios.de/en/sales-team/\n[32]: #pll_switcher\n[33]: https://trios.de/ueber-trios/\n[34]: https://members.trios.de/\n[35]: https://trios.de/en/home/\n[36]: https://trios.de/en/applications/\n[37]: https://trios.de/en/drinking-water/\n[38]: https://trios.de/en/wastewater/\n[39]: https://trios.de/en/environment/\n[40]: https://trios.de/en/industry/\n[41]: https://trios.de/en/marine-science/\n[42]: https://trios.de/en/scrubber/\n[43]: https://trios.de/en/products/\n[44]: https://trios.de/en/sensors/\n[45]: https://trios.de/en/sensors#photometer\n[46]: https://trios.de/en/sensors#fluorometer\n[47]: https://trios.de/en/sensors#radiometer\n[48]: https://trios.de/en/sensors#echem\n[49]: https://trios.de/en/tw-master-series/\n[50]: https://trios.de/en/controller/\n[51]: https://trios.de/en/accessories/\n[52]: https://trios.de/en/systems/\n[53]: https://sepia-sensors.com\n[54]: https://trios.de/en/about-trios/\n[55]: https://trios.de/en/product-history/\n[56]: https://trios.de/en/news-2/\n[57]: https://trios.de/en/events/\n[58]: https://trios.de/en/locations/\n[59]: https://tri