            "text": "[ Skip to content ][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [Applications][3]\n* [Drinking water][4]\n* [Waste water][5]\n* [Environment][6]\n* [Industry][7]\n* [Marine & Science][8]\n* [Scrubber][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Sensors][11]\n* [Photometers][12]\n* [Fluorometer][13]\n* [Radiometers][14]\n* [eCHEM][15]\n* [TW Master series][16]\n* [Controller][17]\n* [Accessories][18]\n* [Systems][19]\n* [SEPIA][20]\n* [About TriOS][21]\n* [Product History][22]\n* [News][23]\n* [Events][24]\n* [Locations][25]\n* [Sustainability][26]\n* [Company History][27]\n* [Career][28]\n* [Contact][29]\n* [RMA form][30]\n* [Sales Team][31]\n* [[English]][32]\n* [[Deutsch]][33]\n\n###### [ Member Area ][34]\n\nSearch for:Search Button\n* [Home][35]\n* [Applications][36]\n* [Drinking water][37]\n* [Waste water][38]\n* [Environment][39]\n* [Industry][40]\n* [Marine & Science][41]\n* [Scrubber][42]\n* [Products][43]\n* [Sensors][44]\n* [Photometers][45]\n* [Fluorometer][46]\n* [Radiometers][47]\n* [eCHEM][48]\n* [TW Master series][49]\n* [Controller][50]\n* [Accessories][51]\n* [Systems][52]\n* [SEPIA][53]\n* [About TriOS][54]\n* [Product History][55]\n* [News][56]\n* [Events][57]\n* [Locations][58]\n* [Sustainability][59]\n* [Company History][60]\n* [Career][61]\n* [Contact][62]\n* [RMA form][63]\n* [Sales Team][64]\n* [[English]][65]\n* [[Deutsch]][66]\n\n###### [ Member Area ][67]\n\nSearch for:Search Button\n\n## Company History\n\nThe company has its origins in the University of Oldenburg. This is where the first ideas about the\npilot-product RAMSES came up. By now a team of 60 employees is working on research and development,\nproduction and marketing of the products on over 4000 square meters. It has always been of high\nimportance for us to offer the highest quality and to stay in harmony with nature itself. All\nproduction stages are located on the company site in Rastede.\n\n## History\n\n1998\nFoundation\n\nFounded as a University Spin-off\n\n1999\nFirst office\n\nFirst office on 150m\u00b2 in Oldenburg\n\n2002\nOffice expansion\n\nOffice expansion to 450m\u00b2\n\n2008\nNano Technology\n\nIntroduction of Nano Technology to improve the quality of the sensors\n\n2011\nNew Headquarters in Rastede\n\nOpening of new Headquarters on 1400+700m\u00b2 in Rastede\n\n2014\nEstablishment of active sales division\n2015\nExpansion and Awards\n\nExpansion of production and logistics by further 2500m\u00b2\n\nAwarded with the European Business Award as National Champion in the category \"enviromental and\ncorporate sustainability\"\n\n2016\nMore awards\n\nAwarded with the European Business Award as National Champion in the category \"growth strategy\"\n\n2019\nContinued company growth\n\nNew buildings added to the facilities.\nNumber of employees: ~90.\n\n2024\nFoundation\n\nFoundation of subsidiaries in Oceania and Southeast Asia:\n\nTriOS Analytics Southeast Asia and TriOS Analytics Oceania.\n\n### TriOS\n\nTriOS Mess- und Datentechnik GmbH has been developing and producing optical sensors for water\nanalysis for more than 25 years.\n\n[Imprint][68]\n[Privacy policy][69]\n[Contact][70]\n[Terms and conditions][71]\n\n## Cookie settings\n* [Change settings][72]\n* [Cookie History][73]\n* [Revoking consent][74]\n\n### Address\n\nTriOS Mess- und Datentechnik GmbH\nB\u00fcrgermeister-Br\u00f6tje-Str. 25\n26180 Rastede\nphone +49 (0)4402 69670-0\nfax +49 (0)4402 69670-20\n\n### Follow us\n\n[LinkedIn][75]\n\n[Facebook][76]\n\n[Instagram][77]\n\n### Memberships\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://trios.de/en/home/\n[3]: https://trios.de/en/applications/\n[4]: https://trios.de/en/drinking-water/\n[5]: https://trios.de/en/wastewater/\n[6]: https://trios.de/en/environment/\n[7]: https://trios.de/en/industry/\n[8]: https://trios.de/en/marine-science/\n[9]: https://trios.de/en/scrubber/\n[10]: https://trios.de/en/products/\n[11]: https://trios.de/en/sensors/\n[12]: https://trios.de/en/sensors#photometer\n[13]: https://trios.de/en/sensors#fluorometer\n[14]: https://trios.de/en/sensors#radiometer\n[15]: https://trios.de/en/sensors#echem\n[16]: https://trios.de/en/tw-master-series/\n[17]: https://trios.de/en/controller/\n[18]: https://trios.de/en/accessories/\n[19]: https://trios.de/en/systems/\n[20]: https://sepia-sensors.com\n[21]: https://trios.de/en/about-trios/\n[22]: https://trios.de/en/product-history/\n[23]: https://trios.de/en/news-2/\n[24]: https://trios.de/en/events/\n[25]: https://trios.de/en/locations/\n[26]: https://trios.de/en/sustainability/\n[27]: https://trios.de/en/company-history/\n[28]: https://trios.de/en/career/\n[29]: https://trios.de/en/contact/\n[30]: https://trios.de/en/rma/\n[31]: https://trios.de/en/sales-team/\n[32]: #pll_switcher\n[33]: https://trios.de/firmengeschichte/\n[34]: https://members.trios.de/\n[35]: https://trios.de/en/home/\n[36]: https://trios.de/en/applications/\n[37]: https://trios.de/en/drinking-water/\n[38]: https://trios.de/en/wastewater/\n[39]: https://trios.de/en/environment/\n[40]: https://trios.de/en/industry/\n[41]: https://trios.de/en/marine-science/\n[42]: https://trios.de/en/scrubber/\n[43]: https://trios.de/en/products/\n[44]: https://trios.de/en/sensors/\n[45]: https://trios.de/en/sensors#photometer\n[46]: https://trios.de/en/sensors#fluorometer\n[47]: https://trios.de/en/sensors#radiometer\n[48]: https://trios.de/en/sensors#echem\n[49]: https://trios.de/en/tw-master-series/\n[50]: https://trios.de/en/controller/\n[51]: https://trios.de/en/accessories/\n[52]: https://trios.de/en/systems/\n[53]: https://sepia-sensors.com\n[54]: https://trios.de/en/about-trios/\n[55]: https://trios.de/en/product-history/\n[56]: https://trios.de/en/news-2/\n[57]: https://trios.de/en/events/\n[58]: https://trios.de/en/locations/\n[59]: https://trios.de/en/sustainability/\n[60]: https://trios.de/en/company-history/\n[61]: https://trios.de/en/career/\n[62]: https://trios.de/en/contact/\n[63]: https://trios.de/en/rma/\n[64]: https://trios.de/en/sales-team/\n[65]: #pll_switcher\n[66]: https://trios.de/firmengeschichte/\n[67]: https://members.trios.de/\n[68]: https://trios.de/en/imprint/\n[69]: https://trios.de/en/privacy-policy/\n[70]: https://trios.de/en/contact/\n[71]: https://trios.de/en/general-terms-and-conditions/\n[72]: #consent-change\n[73]: #consent-history\n[74]: #consent-revoke\n[75]: https://de.linkedin.com/company/trios-mess-und-datentechnik-gmbh\n[76]: https://www.facebook.com/triosgmbh/\n[77]: https://www.instagram.com/triosanalytics/"
