e Windows\n\nBeam Splitters\n\nMetallic Cube Beam Splitters\n\nMetallic Plate Beam Splitters\n\nVariable Beam Splitters (Mounted)\n\nBeam Samplers\n\nOptical Filter\n\nAbsorptive Neutral Density Filters (Mounted)\n\nReflective Neutral Density Filters\n\nMirrors / Reflectors\n\nPlano Aluminium Mirrors\n\nPlano Silver Mirrors\n\nConcave Mirrors\n\nBroadband Metallic Mirrors\n\nCustom Mirrors\n\nDiffusers\n\nLinear Film Polarizers\n\nWave Plates / Retarders\n\nZero-Order Wave Plates\n\nCemented True Zero Order Wave Plates\n\nBeam Expanders\n\nBeam Expanders\n\nVariable Beam Expanders\n\nOthers\n\nCondensers\n\nGlass Magnifier\n\nOptical Glass Blanks\n\nGlass Moulds\n\nOptical Glasses\n\nOpto Mechanical Assembly\n\nTelescopes\n\nNight Vision Optics\n\nOptical Mounts\n\nWafer / Substrate\n\nOptical Coating\n\nQuality Control\n\nPlant & Machinery\n\nIndustry We Serve\n\nContact Us\n\nGet A Quote\n\nContact Info\n\nD-1, Industrial Estate, Ramnagar, Roorkee, Uttarakhand 247667, India\n\n9897152595\n\n9837039970\n\ninfo@universaloptics.co.in\n\nuniopt@hotmail.com\n\nWelcome To\nUniversal Optics\n\nUniversal Optics offers a huge assortment of optical component that enabled in setting a benchmark of quality and performance in the worldwide market.\n\nKnow More\n\nWelcome To\nUniversal Optics\n\nUniversal Optics offers a huge assortment of optical component that enabled in setting a benchmark of quality and performance in the worldwide market.\n\nKnow More\n\nWelcome To\nUniversal Optics\n\nUniversal Optics offers a huge assortment of optical component that enabled in setting a benchmark of quality and performance in the worldwide market.\n\nKnow More\n\n58+\n\nYears of Experience\n\nAbout Universal Optics\n\nEstablished in 1965, Universal Optics is a leading manufacturer of precision optics components, specializing in the design, development, and production of high-quality optical solutions. With over five decades of experience, we have garnered a reputation for excellence and innovation in the optics industry.\n\nUniversal Optics offers a huge assortment of optical component that enabled in setting a benchmark of quality and performance in the worldwide market. The company is primarily engaged in the manufacturing, supplying and exporting of optical component. In addition to this, the company is also recognized as one of the top-notch Meniscus Lenses Exporters and Optic Lenses Suppliers in India. All the optical component and Infrared Optical Filters are designed to meet both Indian as well as international quality norms. We have a huge business network that is spread in every nook and corner of the world. Moreover, serving quality products have also enabled us in acquiring strong foothold in the market of U.S.A., U.K., Australia, Brazil and Canada.\n\nKnow More\n\nVision\n\nUniversal Optics envisions becoming a globally recognized name synonymous with precision optics components, driven by technological advancements, customer-centric approach, and a passion for excellence.\n\nMission\n\nOur mission is to provide cutting-edge precision optics components that empower our customers to excel in their respective industries. We are committed to delivering the highest quality products and services while fostering a culture of continuous improvement and customer satisfaction.\n\nCore Values\n\nQuality: We maintain uncompromising quality standards in our products, ensuring optimal performance, durability, and reliability for our customers. Integrity: Upholding the highest ethical standards in all our operations, we foster trust and transparency with our stakeholders.\n\nProducts We Offer\n\nUniversal Optics offers an extensive range of precision optics components, catering to diverse industries and applications. Our product portfolio includes but is not limited to:\n\nLenses\n\nWe manufacture a wide variety of lenses, including spherical lenses, cylindrical lenses, aspheric lenses, and custom-designed lenses to meet specific requirements.\n\nKnow More\n\nPrisms\n\nOur precision-crafted prisms encompass various types such as wedge prisms, beam-splitting prisms, corner cubes, and more.\n\nKnow More\n\nOptical Windows\n\nOur Optical Glass Windows are used for protecting fragile optical components inside an assembly.\n\nKnow More\n\nBeam Splitters\n\nWe have carved a niche as one of the most staggering Optical Beam Splitter Manufacturers and Suppliers in India.\n\nKnow More\n\nBeam Samplers\n\nWe are known in the market amongst reputed and eminent industry for manufacturing and supplying a wide range of Beam Samplers ...\n\nKnow More\n\nOptical Filter\n\nWe offer the finest quality Optical Interference Filters in the market. Colored glass filters are optical ...\n\nKnow More\n\nMirrors / Reflectors\n\nWe bring forth high precision Reflectiors and Mirrors in the global as well as domestic market. The company is one of the prominent ...\n\nKnow More\n\nDiffusers\n\nDiffusers are cutting-edge tools created to disperse and scatter light, converting direct, harsh light into a gentle, even glow ...\n\nKnow More\n\nLinear Film Polarizers\n\nLight polarization can be filtered and managed using linear film polarizers, which are optical devices. These flexible, thin films are ...\n\nKnow More\n\nWave Plates / Retarders\n\nRetarders and wave plates are optical tools used to change the polarization state of light. These delicate, transparent plates are employed ...\n\nKnow More\n\nBeam Expanders\n\nThe best option for laser and precision optics applications is a beam expander. Our Beam Expanders provide exceptional performance and ...\n\nKnow More\n\nCondensers\n\nCondensers will enhance the performance of your optical system. Our condensers improve image resolution, brightness, and contrast because ...\n\nKnow More\n\nRaw Material Capabilities\n\nAll Type of Optical Glasses\n\nSapphire\n\nFused quartz fused silica\n\nSilicon(Si)\n\nGermanium (Ge)\n\nZinc Sulphide (Zns)\n\nZinc Selenide (Znse)\n\nCaF2 Substrate\n\nBaF2 Substrate\n\nNd: YAG crystal\n\nOther IR and UV Material\n\nMgF2 Substrate\n\nCapabilities\n\nParameter\nCommercial\nPrecision\n\nThickness\n0.1 mm\n0.01 mm\n\nRadlus\n0.5%\n\nIndex\n0.001\n0.0001\n\nV-Number\n0.1%\n\nEcenricity\n3 Min. of Arc\n30 Sec. of Arc\n\nTilt\n1 arc min\n10 arc sec\n\nIrregularity\n1 ring\n0.25 ring\n\nSurface\n60:40\n10:5\n\nQuality Control\n\nWe maintain uncompromising quality standards in our products, ensuring optimal performance, durability, and reliability for our customers.\n\nQuality Control\n\nUniversal Optics philosophy is to ensure trust for their clients with ISO and Essilor international standard quality control system for all the lenses produced in the Roorkee facility. It\u2019s one of the first lens companies in India to be ISO certified in quality systems.\n\nQuality Assurance\n\nBeing a quality centric enterprise, various stringent quality checks are made under the supervision of our quality control executives. Moreover, the working of the optical equipments is also checked so as to ensure delivery of quality products to the clients.\n\nKnow More\n\n0 +\n\nYear of Experience\n\n0 +\n\nProducts\n\n0 +\n\nHappy Customer\n\nProducts Showcase\n\nManufacturer & Supplier of Optical Lenses, Prisms, Optical Filters, Optical Windows, Beam Splitters, Beam Samplers, Reflectiors and Mirrors, G universaloptics.co.in Universal Optics - Manufacturer & Supplier of Optical Lenses, Prisms, Optical Filters, Optical Windows, Beam Splitters, Beam Samplers, Reflectiors and Mirrors, Glass Magnifier, Glass Moulds, Optical Glasses, Opto-Mechanical Components, Telescopes, Optical Machinery\n\n9897152595 / 9837039970\n\ninfo@universaloptics.co.in / uniopt@hotmail.com\n\nFollow us on:\n\nHome Page\n\nAbout Us\n\nCompany Overview\n\nVision & Mission\n\nFounder's Message\n\nProprietor's Message\n\nOur Certification\n\nProducts\n\nLenses\n\nPlano Convex Lens\n\nDouble Convex Lens\n\nPlano Concave Lens\n\nDouble Concave Lens\n\nPositive Meniscus Lens\n\nNe