      "key_products": "Plano Convex Lens, Optical Filters, Beam Splitters, Right Angle Prisms, Mirrors",
      "polished_summary": "Universal Optics is a premier manufacturer of precision optical components, dedicated to the design, development, and production of high-quality optical solutions. The company offers a diverse range of products, including plano convex lenses, right angle prisms, optical windows, beam splitters, optical filters, and mirrors, catering to industries such as optics, electronics, and telecommunications. With a focus on serving optics manufacturers, researchers, and optical device designers, Universal Optics is committed to delivering innovative and reliable optical solutions.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Universal Optics is a manufacturer of precision optical components, including lenses, prisms, optical filters, and mirrors, which are directly relevant to the spectral sensor market. Their focus on high-quality optical solutions positions them as a key player in this industry.",
