      "company_function": "manufacturer",
      "company_summary": "UQG Optics Ltd is a UK-based manufacturer specializing in a wide range of optical components, including windows, filters, mirrors, lenses, and prisms. The company caters to optical industry professionals and general optics customers across the UK, Europe, North America, and Asia, offering both stock and custom optical products, as well as a variety of optical services such as assembly, precision cutting, and coating.",
      "operational_presence": "[Skip to content][1] * [ Register ][2] * [Login][3] * [ Basket 0 items - \u00a30.00 ][4] * [ Quote][5] * [ Search ][6] [currency flag GBP] [currency flag EUR] [cu...; Accept No thanks [1]: #content [2]: /my-account/ [3]: /my-account/ [4]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/basket/ [5]: /request-quote/ [6]: /?s...",
