        "crawl_text": "UQG Optics Ltd ISO 9001:2015 Registered, Cyber Essentials Certified, JOSCAR Accredited Europe North America Asia ISO 9001:2015 Registered Cyber Essentials Certified JOSCAR Accredited RoHS Compliance REACH Compliance RoHS REACH The Norman Industrial Estate, 99 \u2013 101 Cambridge Road, Milton, Cambridge, CB24 6AT, England United Kingdom Europe North America Asia Europe North America Asia [Skip to content][1]\n* [ Register ][2]\n* [Login][3]\n* [ Basket 0 items - \u00a30.00 ][4]\n* [ Quote][5]\n* [ Search ][6]\n[currency flag GBP] [currency flag EUR] [currency flag USD]\n[[currency flag select GBP]][7] [[currency flag select EUR]][8] [[currency flag select USD]][9]\n[ [UQG Optics] ][10]\n\nSuppliers of Custom and Stock Optics\n\n[ +44 (0) 1223 420329 ][11]\n\n[ sales@uqgoptics.com ][12]\n* [Custom][13]\n* [Products][14]\n* [Optical Windows][15]\n* [Technical Glasses][16]\n* [Laboratory][17]\n* [Optical Filters][18]\n* [Optical Lenses][19]\n* [Optical Mirrors][20]\n* [Optical Prisms][21]\n* [Services][22]\n* [Optical Assembly][23]\n* [Glass Dicing][24]\n* [Glass Polishing & Lapping][25]\n* [Glass Grinding & Cutting Services][26]\n* [Optical Coatings][27]\n* [Custom Optical Components][28]\n* [Optical Components][29]\n* [Materials][30]\n* [Quality][31]\n* [ISO Quality Statement][32]\n* [Testing and Quality Control][33]\n* [RoHS and REACH Compliance][34]\n* [Cyber Essentials Certified][35]\n* [JOSCAR Accredited][36]\n* [About][37]\n* [History][38]\n* [UQG Team][39]\n* [R&D Optics][40]\n* [OEM Optics][41]\n* [Our Charity][42]\n* [Industries][43]\n* [Defence & Aerospace][44]\n* [Electronics & Optoelectronics][45]\n* [Engineering & Industrial Manufacturing][46]\n* [Entertainment & Design Lighting][47]\n* [Instrumentation][48]\n* [Medical][49]\n* [Oil & Gas][50]\n* [University & Research Centers][51]\n* [Blog][52]\n* [Contact][53]\n* [Customer Support][54]\n\n[Home][55] > Services\n\n# Services\n\n[Optical Services Banner][Optical Services Banner]\n\n## UQG Optics offers finishing and processing of glasses, optical components assembly and precision\n## cutting services on all optical components.\n\nUQG have the technology and experience to add something more than just the component. In our testing\nand calibration department, we can test a filter for transmission using our spectrophotometer or\nusing our interferometer to check a window for flatness. This is only achieved with the in house\noptical production and test facilities UQG can offer to its customers.\n\nAn express service is provided when times are short to customization of stock products to custom\nmade sizes. The micro dicing department can cut wafers and glasses up to 300mm diameter and an\nextensive range of optical polishing and grinding machines can process customer\u2019s components,\nsubstrates or materials.\n\nExperienced in the selection of the most suitable adhesive for glass to metal assembly, in our clean\nroom we typically mount and bond windows and filters into mounts and housings.\n\nUQG optical services are widely used throughout the optical industry and our facility can offer many\noptical engineering and services.\n\n**UQG optical services are widely used throughout the optical industry and our facility can offer\nmany optical engineering and services. [Contact us][56] today.**\n\n### Services we supply:\n* [\n[Opitcal Components Assembly][Opitcal Components Assembly]\n\n## Optical Assembly Services\n\n][57]\n* [\n[Glass Dicing Services][Glass Dicing Services]\n\n## Glass Dicing\n\n][58]\n* [\n[Glass Polishing and Lapping Services][Glass Polishing and Lapping Services]\n\n## Glass Polishing & Lapping\n\n][59]\n* [\n[Optical Glass Grinding and Cutting][Optical Glass Grinding and Cutting]\n\n## Glass Grinding & Cutting Services\n\n][60]\n* [\n[Optical Coatings Services][Optical Coatings Services]\n\n## Optical Coatings\n\n][61]\n* [\n[Optical Components Made to Custom Specifications][Optical Components Made to Custom\nSpecifications]\n\n## Custom Optical Components\n\n][62]\n\nShare\n\nWelcome to **UQG Optics**! It looks like you are visiting from the US. Select your preferred\ncurrency below to see appropriate pricing. [Contact us][63] for additional support or to discuss\nspecific requirements.\n\n[[currency flag select]][64] [[currency flag select]][65] [[currency flag select]][66]\n\nWelcome to **UQG Optics**! It looks like you are visiting from outside the UK. Select your preferred\ncurrency below to see appropriate pricing. [Contact us][67] for additional support or to discuss\nspecific requirements.\n\n[[currency flag select]][68] [[currency flag select]][69] [[currency flag select]][70]\n\n### Give us a call...\n\nIf you cannot find what you are looking for, please contact us\n\n[+00 44 (0) 1223 420329][71] | [info@uqgoptics.com][72] | [sales@uqgoptics.com][73]\n\n**UQG Ltd\n**The Norman Industrial Estate\n99 \u2013 101 Cambridge Road\nMilton, Cambridge CB24 6AT\nEngland\n\nEmail [info@uqgoptics.com][74]\nEmail [sales@uqgoptics.com][75]\nTel +44 (0) 1223 420329\nFax +44 (0) 1223 420506\n\n[ Join our newsletter][76]\n* [Delivery Prices][77]\n* [Returns Policy][78]\n* [Privacy Policy][79]\n* [Terms & Conditions][80]\n* [Cookie Policy][81]\n\nFollow us...\n\n[ [Linkedin icon] ][82]\n\nOur payment system uses a valid 256-bit SSL certificate.\n\n[Verisign logo][Verisign logo]\n\n**We accept online payment in Pounds, Euros and US Dollars.**\n\n**To open up a credit account please contact our sales office.**\n\nWe accept the following forms of payment\n\n[Payment Options][Payment Options]\n\n**Accreditations:**\n\n[Joscar Registered - Cyber Essentials Certified - ISO 9001:2015 Registered - ASCB][Joscar Registered\n- Cyber Essentials Certified - ISO 9001:2015 Registered - ASCB]\n\n**A member of:**\n\n[Optica - Formerly OSA - SPIE][Optica - Formerly OSA - SPIE]\n\nCopyright 2026 UQG Optics. All rights reserved. Website by [Granite 5][83]\n\n[Suppliers of Custom and Stock Optical Components][84]\n\nWe use optional cookies to review analytics that help us to improve our website experience. By\nclicking accept, you are giving consent for us to do this. You can find out more and manage cookies\nin our [privacy policy][85].\n\nAccept No thanks\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: /my-account/\n[3]: /my-account/\n[4]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/basket/\n[5]: /request-quote/\n[6]: /?s=\n[7]: ?wcj-currency=GBP\n[8]: ?wcj-currency=EUR\n[9]: ?wcj-currency=USD\n[10]: https://www.uqgoptics.com\n[11]: tel:+441223420329\n[12]: mailto:sales@uqgoptics.com\n[13]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/custom-optical-components/\n[14]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/catalogue/\n[15]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/catalogue/optical-windows/\n[16]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/catalogue/technical-glasses/\n[17]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/catalogue/laboratory/\n[18]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/catalogue/filters/\n[19]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/catalogue/lenses/\n[20]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/catalogue/mirrors/\n[21]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/catalogue/prisms/\n[22]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/services/\n[23]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/assembly/\n[24]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/dicing/\n[25]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/glass-polishing-lapping/\n[26]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/grinding-cutting/\n[27]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/optical-coatings/\n[28]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/custom-optical-components/\n[29]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/optical-components/\n[30]: /materials/\n[31]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/quality/\n[32]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/quality/iso-quality-statement/\n[33]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/quality/testing-and-quality-control/\n[34]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/quality/rohs-and-reach-compliance/\n[35]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/cyber-essentials-certified/\n[36]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/quality/joscar-accredited/\n[37]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/about/\n[38]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/history/\n[39]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/uqg-team/\n[40]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/rd-optics/\n[41]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/oem-optics/\n[42]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/our-charity/\n[43]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/industries/\n[44]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/industries/defence-and-aerospace/\n[45]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/industries/electronics-and-optoelectronics/\n[46]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/industries/engineering-and-industrial-manufacturing/\n[47]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/industries/entertainment-and-design-lighting/\n[48]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/industries/instrumentation/\n[49]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/industries/medical/\n[50]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/industries/oil-and-gas/\n[51]: https://www.uqgoptics.com/industries/university-and-research-centers/\n[52]: [Skip to content][1]\n* [ Register ][2]\n* [Login][3]\n* [ Basket 0 items - \u00a30.00 ][4]\n* [ Quote][5]\n* [ Search ][6]\n[currency flag GBP] [currency flag EUR] [currency flag USD]\n[[currency flag select GBP]][7] [[currency flag select EUR]][8] [[currency flag select USD]][9]\n[ [UQG Optics] ][10]\n\nSuppliers of Custom and Stock Optics\n\n[ +44 (0) 1223 420329 ][11]\n\n[ sales@uqgoptics.com ][12]\n* [Custom][13]\n* [Products][14]\n* [Optical Windows][15]\n* [Technical Glasses][16]\n* [Laboratory][17]\n* [Optical Filters][18]\n* [Optical Lenses][19]\n* [Optical Mirrors][20]\n* [Optical Prisms][21]\n* [Services][22]\n* [Optical Assembly][23]\n* [Glass Dicing][24]\n* [Glass Polishing & Lapping][25]\n* [Glass Grinding & Cutting Services][26]\n* [Optical Coatings][27]\n* [Custom Optical Components][28]\n* [Optical Components][29]\n* [Materials][30]\n* [Quality][31]\n* [ISO Quality Statement][32]\n* [Testing and Quality Control][33]\n* [RoHS and REACH Compliance][34]\n* [Cyber Essentials Certified][35]\n* [JOSCAR Accredited][36]\n* [About][37]\n* [History][38]\n* [UQG Team][39]\n* [R&D Optics][40]\n* [OEM Optics][41]\n* [Our Charity][42]\n* [Industries][43]\n* [Defence & Aerospace][44]\n* [Electronics & Optoelectronics][45]\n* [Engineering & Industrial Manufacturing][46]\n* [Entertainment & Design Lighting][47]\n* [Instrumentation][48]\n* [Medical][49]\n* [Oil & Gas][50]\n* [University & Research Centers][51]\n* [Blog][52]\n* [Contact][53]\n* [Customer Support][54]\n\n[Home][55] > About UQG Optics Ltd\n\n# About UQG Optics Ltd\n\n[Optical Components and Services][Optical Components and Services]\n\n### UQG Optics Ltd is a UK-headquartered optical components manufacturer. We supply a large range of\n### optical windows, filters, mirrors, lenses and prisms from stock to customers in the UK, Europe,\n### North America and Asia.\n\nIn over six decades of continuous business, UQG Optics has built a solid reputation based on a\ndedicated team that goes to extraordinary lengths to deliver outstanding service and product\nquality.\n\nOur optical components are mostly manufactured in-house using modern machining technology. We supply\nfrom stock but also manufacture customised and bespoke product to any specification.\n\nWith a diverse range of machines for optical fabrication and glass machining, we can supply\nprototypes, small quantities and large volumes of product.\n\nWhen necessary, we also source products from our network of proven certified suppliers.\n\n## Capabilities\n\nUQG Optics have a diverse range of machines for optical fabrication and glass machining. Supplying\nprototypes/small quantities to volume production. We make a standard stock range of products or\nto custom/bespoke designs. Our engineering production capabilities can be seen on our [optical\nservices][56] page.\n\n**Meet the team behind UQG\u2019s decades of success.**\n\n[Download our \u201cAt-A-Glance-Guide\u201d to UQG Optics products, materials and services >][57]\n\n### Founder\n\n[Charles Biggs]\n\n#### Charles Biggs\n\nFounder (1910 \u2013 1984)\n\n### Our Experienced Team\n\n[Colin Biggs][Colin Biggs]\n\n#### Colin Biggs\n\nCEO/President\nColin continues to guide the company with his 50 years of experience.\n\n[Kelvin Biggs][Kelvin Biggs]\n\n#### Kelvin Biggs\n\nManaging Director/Sales Director\nKelvin will deal with new sales enquiries and technical advice for your stock or custom product.\n\n[Ray Harris][Ray Harris]\n\n#### Ray Harris\n\nProduction Manager\n\nShare\n\nWelcome to **UQG Optics**! It looks like you are visiting from the US. Select your preferred\ncurrency below to see appropriate pricing. [Contact us][58] for additional support or to discuss\nspecific requirements.\n\n[[currency flag select]][59] [[curren"
