      "key_products": "BK7 Right Angle Prism, Beamsplitter Plate 50/50, Optical Filters, Optical Lenses, Optical Mirrors",
      "polished_summary": "UQG Optics Ltd is a UK-based manufacturer specializing in a wide range of optical components, including windows, filters, mirrors, lenses, and prisms. The company caters to optical industry professionals and general optics customers across the UK, Europe, North America, and Asia, offering both stock and custom optical products, as well as a variety of optical services such as assembly, precision cutting, and coating.",
      "audit_reasoning": "UQG Optics Ltd manufactures and supplies a wide range of optical components, including filters, lenses, and prisms, which are directly applicable to the spectral sensor market. They also provide specialized optical services such as assembly and testing, which further supports their relevance in this field.",
