        "crawl_text": "* [Exhibitor FAQs][1]\n* [Floor Plan][2]\n* [Industry Insights][3]\n* [Sponsors][4]\n* [Supporters][5]\n* [Contact Us][6]\n[ [Space Tech Expo Europe] ][7]\n[ [Space Tech Expo Europe] ][8]\n\n## 17 \u2013 19 November 2026//Bremen, Germany\n* [HOME][9]\n* [WHAT'S ON][10]\n* [EXHIBIT][11]\n* [EXHIBITOR LIST][12]\n* [CONFERENCE][13]\n* [PLAN YOUR VISIT][14]\n* [REGISTER NOW][15]\n* [HOME][16]\n* [WHAT'S ON][17]\n* [EXHIBIT][18]\n* [EXHIBITOR LIST][19]\n* [CONFERENCE][20]\n* [PLAN YOUR VISIT][21]\n* [REGISTER NOW][22]\n* * [Floor Plan][23]\n  * [Industry Insights][24]\n  * [Supporters][25]\n  * [Exhibitor FAQs][26]\n  * [Contact Us][27]\n\n[ [Space Tech Expo Europe] ][28]\n\n## 17 \u2013 19 November 2026//Bremen, Germany\n\n# EUROPE'S LARGEST B2B SPACE EVENT\n\n### **Registration is now live!**\n\n[REGISTER NOW][29]\n[BOOK YOUR STAND ][30]\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\n## EUROPE'S LARGEST B2B SPACE EVENT\n\n**Registration is now live!**\n\n[REGISTER NOW][31]\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\n## Download the 2025 Post Show Report\n\nWe don\u2019t need to remind you that 2025 has been a truly remarkable year for Space Tech Expo Europe.\nBut we couldn\u2019t resist sharing the highlights with you in our Post Show Report!\u00a0\n\nPacked with key insights from 2025, it includes essential statistics, visitor profiles, conference\nhighlights, and impressive year-on-year growth metrics. Discover why exhibiting at Europe\u2019s largest\nB2B space event next year is an opportunity you simply can\u2019t afford to miss.\n\n[DOWNLOAD THE POST SHOW REPORT][32]\n[ [Post Show Report] ][33]\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\n## CONNECTING EUROPE'S SPACE SUPPLY CHAIN\n\nWelcome to Space Tech Expo Europe, the premier gathering for space engineering and technology. Get\nready to ignite your network, engage with top industry players, and discover the latest advancements\nin one convenient location. Join us for an unparalleled opportunity to elevate your expertise and\nforge meaningful connections in the ever-evolving world of space technology.\n\nFrom launch services, satellite operations, communications and ground systems, to materials\nsuppliers, subsystems, engineering services, components, software suppliers and more, this is where\nthe European space community converges to source solutions, build partnerships, and drive progress.\n\nDon\u2019t miss the chance to attend Europe\u2019s largest B2B space event.\n\n## Call For Speakers 2026\n\nThe 2026 Call for Speakers \u00a0is now closed. \u00a0For more information please contact\n[[email\u00a0protected]][34]\n\n\u00a0\n\n## CONNECTING EUROPE'S SPACE SUPPLY CHAIN\n\nWelcome to Space Tech Expo Europe, **the premier gathering for space engineering and technology**.\nGet ready to ignite your network, engage with top industry players, and discover the latest\nadvancements in one convenient location. Join us for an unparalleled opportunity to elevate your\nexpertise and forge meaningful connections in the ever-evolving world of space technology.\n\nFrom launch services, satellite operations, communications and ground systems, to materials\nsuppliers, subsystems, engineering services, components, software suppliers and more, this is where\n**the European space community converges to source solutions, build partnerships, and drive\nprogress.**\n\n## Call For Speakers 2026\n\nThe 2026 Call for Speakers \u00a0is now closed. \u00a0For more information please contact\n[[email\u00a0protected]][35]\n\n[APPLY NOW][36]\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\n## A GLOBAL STAGE FOR GLOBAL PLAYERS\n\nWhether you\u2019re tackling engineering challenges or exploring next-gen capabilities, the exhibition\nhall provides full access to satellite operations, launch services, subsystems, materials suppliers,\nmanufacturing, communications and ground systems, components, engineering services, optics, and so\nmuch more.\n\n[Exhibitor logos]\n[2026 EXHIBITOR LIST][37]\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\n## A GLOBAL STAGE FOR GLOBAL PLAYERS\n\nWhether you\u2019re tackling engineering challenges or exploring next-gen capabilities, the exhibition\nhall provides full access to satellite operations, launch services, subsystems, materials suppliers,\nmanufacturing, communications and ground systems, components, engineering services, optics, and so\nmuch more.\n\n[ * [Exhibitor FAQs][1]\n* [Floor Plan][2]\n* [Industry Insights][3]\n* [Sponsors][4]\n* [Supporters][5]\n* [Contact Us][6]\n[ [Space Tech Expo Europe] ][7]\n[ [Space Tech Expo Europe] ][8]\n\n## 17 \u2013 19 November 2026//Bremen, Germany\n* [HOME][9]\n* [WHAT'S ON][10]\n* [EXHIBIT][11]\n* [EXHIBITOR LIST][12]\n* [CONFERENCE][13]\n* [PLAN YOUR VISIT][14]\n* [REGISTER NOW][15]\n* [HOME][16]\n* [WHAT'S ON][17]\n* [EXHIBIT][18]\n* [EXHIBITOR LIST][19]\n* [CONFERENCE][20]\n* [PLAN YOUR VISIT][21]\n* [REGISTER NOW][22]\n* * [Floor Plan][23]\n  * [Industry Insights][24]\n  * [Supporters][25]\n  * [Exhibitor FAQs][26]\n  * [Contact Us][27]\n\n[ [Space Tech Expo Europe] ][28]\n\n## 17 \u2013 19 November 2026//Bremen, Germany\n\n# EUROPE'S LARGEST B2B SPACE EVENT\n\n### **Registration is now live!**\n\n[REGISTER NOW][29]\n[BOOK YOUR STAND ][30]\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\n## EUROPE'S LARGEST B2B SPACE EVENT\n\n**Registration is now live!**\n\n[REGISTER NOW][31]\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\n## Download the 2025 Post Show Report\n\nWe don\u2019t need to remind you that 2025 has been a truly remarkable year for Space Tech Expo Europe.\nBut we couldn\u2019t resist sharing the highlights with you in our Post Show Report!\u00a0\n\nPacked with key insights from 2025, it includes essential statistics, visitor profiles, conference\nhighlights, and impressive year-on-year growth metrics. Discover why exhibiting at Europe\u2019s largest\nB2B space event next year is an opportunity you simply can\u2019t afford to miss.\n\n[DOWNLOAD THE POST SHOW REPORT][32]\n[ [Post Show Report] ][33]\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\n## CONNECTING EUROPE'S SPACE SUPPLY CHAIN\n\nWelcome to Space Tech Expo Europe, the premier gathering for space engineering and technology. Get\nready to ignite your network, engage with top industry players, and discover the latest advancements\nin one convenient location. Join us for an unparalleled opportunity to elevate your expertise and\nforge meaningful connections in the ever-evolving world of space technology.\n\nFrom launch services, satellite operations, communications and ground systems, to materials\nsuppliers, subsystems, engineering services, components, software suppliers and more, this is where\nthe European space community converges to source solutions, build partnerships, and drive progress.\n\nDon\u2019t miss the chance to attend Europe\u2019s largest B2B space event.\n\n## Call For Speakers 2026\n\nThe 2026 Call for Speakers \u00a0is now closed. \u00a0For more information please contact\n[[email\u00a0protected]][34]\n\n\u00a0\n\n## CONNECTING EUROPE'S SPACE SUPPLY CHAIN\n\nWelcome to Space Tech Expo Europe, **the premier gathering for space engineering and technology**.\nGet ready to ignite your network, engage with top industry players, and discover the latest\nadvancements in one convenient location. Join us for an unparalleled opportunity to elevate your\nexpertise and forge meaningful connections in the ever-evolving world of space technology.\n\nFrom launch services, satellite operations, communications and ground systems, to materials\nsuppliers, subsystems, engineering services, components, software suppliers and more, this is where\n**the European space community converges to source solutions, build partnerships, and drive\nprogress.**\n\n## Call For Speakers 2026\n\nThe 2026 Call for Speakers \u00a0is now closed. \u00a0For more information please contact\n[[email\u00a0protected]][35]\n\n[APPLY NOW][36]\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\n## A GLOBAL STAGE FOR GLOBAL PLAYERS\n\nWhether you\u2019re tackling engineering challenges or exploring next-gen capabilities, the exhibition\nhall provides full access to satellite operations, launch services, subsystems, materials suppliers,\nmanufacturing, communications and ground systems, components, engineering services, optics, and so\nmuch more.\n\n[Exhibitor logos]\n[2026 EXHIBITOR LIST][37]\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\n## A GLOBAL STAGE FOR GLOBAL PLAYERS\n\nWhether you\u2019re tackling engineering challenges or exploring next-gen capabilities, the exhibition\nhall provides full access to satellite operations, launch services, subsystems, materials suppliers,\nmanufacturing, communications and ground systems, components, engineering services, optics, and so\nmuch more.\n\n[ [Exhibitor Logos] ][38]\n[2026 EXHIBITOR LIST][39]\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\n## WHY VISIT?\n\n### FIND NEW CONNECTIONS\n\n95% of visitors last year gained new connections in their network. This could be your opportunity to\nmake those meaningful industry connections!\n\n### DEVELOP TECHNICAL KNOWLEDGE\n\nDelve into four conferences to expand your knowledge and stay ahead in the ever-evolving industry\nlandscape by immersing yourself in insightful sessions.\n\n### GET BUSINESS DONE\n\nWe attract top-tier exhibitors in the international space industry. Last year 87% of visitors\nattended to network with exhibitors, access new products, and meet suppliers.\n\n## BOOK YOUR MEETINGS IN ADVANCE with B2B matchmaking\n\nThis is your opportunity to book bespoke, face-to-face meetings, resulting in hundreds of new\nindustry contacts and potential partnerships. B2B matchmaking is a free online platform where you\ncan pre-book one-to-one meetings on the show floor with new prospective clients, partners and\nindustry suppliers.\n\n**We recommend setting up your profile as soon as possible, to allow plenty of time for other\nparticipants to view your profile before you can begin accepting and requesting meetings on Tuesday\n22 October.**\n\n[Book B2B meetings][40]\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\n## ATTEND OUR CONFERENCES\n\nExplore the exciting world of space at our four conferences and learn about the latest trends,\nchallenges, and opportunities.\n\nLearn directly from Europe\u2019s space leaders and technical pioneers. The 2025 event featured four\nhigh-impact conferences, each tailored to the core needs of engineers, innovators, and program leads\nacross civil, commercial, and defense space sectors. We also introduced The Skills Lab for 2025\nwhich is an array of masterclasses and workshops designed to enhance your skills within the\nindustry.\n\n[ [Industry Conference] ][41]\n[ [Smallsats Conference] ][42]\n[ [Connectivity Conference] ][43]\n[Tech Forum]\n\u00a0\n[VIEW THE 2025 AGENDA][44]\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\n## 2025 SPEAKERS INCLUDED:\n\n[Space Tech Expo Europe Conference Speakers ]\n[Space Tech Expo Europe Conference Speakers ]\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\n[10th Anniversary]\n\n## 10 Years in Bremen\n\nIt\u2019s incredible to think that Space Tech Expo Europe is celebrating its 10th year \u2013 and what a\ndecade it has been here and for the industry! Our 10 years in Bremen have brought together the\nEuropean space community in ways we could barely have imagined. We launched in 2015 with 100\nexhibitors and have now grown to over 950 exhibiting companies represented in 2025. We want to\nsincerely thank the City of Bremen for their amazing support over the last decade, and of course all\nof the exhibitors and attendees that have made the show the largest B2B space event in Europe!\n\n# *GET THE LATEST NEWS*\n\n***Don't miss a thing - join our mailing list and be the first to hear speaker updates, tech\npreviews, and exciting opportunities at Space Tech Expo Europe!***\n\nInput captcha\nType the charatchers above:\nSubmit\n\nView our [privacy policy,][45] to understand how we collect, protect and manage your personal\ninformation\n\n*\u201cI had the privilege of attending Space Tech Expo Europe 2024, and it was truly an incredible\nexperience. The event provided a vibrant platform to connect with the European SpaceTech ecosystem,\nbringing together space agencies, clusters, incubators, corporations, and startups. I\u2019m deeply\ngrateful for the valuable opportunities to engage, exchange ideas, and explore potential\ncollaborations in the ever-evolving space industry.\u201d\u00a0*\n\n**Jess Wang, Industrial Technology Research Institute, Project Specialist \u00a0**\n\n[ATTENDEE REVIEWS][46]\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\n## Dive into the world of space innovation\n\n[ [What's on] ][47]\n[ [Exhibitor List] ][48]\n[ [Floor Plan] ][49]\n[ [Conferences] ][50]\n[ [Plan your visit] ][51]\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n\n## Our sister show\n\n[[Space Tech Expo USA]][52]\n\n[View Space Tech Expo USA][53]\n\u00a0\n\n## Venue Address\n\nCONGRESS BREMEN - Messe Bremen, Hallen 4, 5, 6, 7 & 4.1\nFindorffstrasse 101\n28215 Bremen\nPhone: +49 (0) 421 3505-0\n\n## Contact Us\n\nEmail: [[email\u00a0protected] ][54]\nPhone (Europe): +44 (0) 2"
