      "polished_summary": "Norsk Elektro Optikk specializes in advanced optical solutions and technologies for the aerospace and space sectors. The company focuses on providing innovative products and services that cater to satellite operations, launch services, and various engineering applications within the European space community. By participating in prominent industry events like Space Tech Expo Europe, Norsk Elektro Optikk aims to connect with key players and drive progress in space technology.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Norsk Elektro Optikk specializes in advanced optical solutions and technologies, which are relevant to the spectral sensor market, particularly in aerospace and space applications. Their focus on innovative products for satellite operations indicates a direct involvement in the target market.",
