        "crawl_text": "top of page\n[[Silicon Photonics Manufacturing Standards]][1]\n* * [JOIN US][2]\n  * [APC Open Supply Chain Ecosystem ][3]\n  * [Members A-Z][4]\n  * [Newest Members][5]\n  * [Executive Leadership][6]\n  * [Membership Dues + Joining Info][7]\n  * [Purpose + Mission ][8]\n  * [Membership Goals][9]\n  * [Organization Overview][10]\n  * [Industry Leadership][11]\n  * [Industry Partners][12]\n  * [Contact Us][13]\n* * [Industry Standards Importance][14]\n  * [Silicon Photonic Manufacturing Standards][15]\n  * [Co-Packaged Optics (CPO) Standards][16]\n  * [Multi-Core Fiber Standards Working Group][17]\n* * [Press Release][18]\n  * [APC Webcasts][19]\n  * [APC Videos][20]\n* [PECC Summit 2026][21]\n* [Log In][22]\n[[NNT-Banner-bckgrd.jpg]][23]\n\n# Photonics-Electronics Convergence.\n\n[nnt-logo-reverse.png]\n\n# APC Welcomes NTT Innovative Devices\n\n[SEE ALL MEMBERS ][24]\n[APC-darkside-extended.jpg]\n\n# Join the Advanced Photonics Coalition Today\n\nThe Advanced Photonics Coalition unites the industry to advance next-generation optical\ntechnologies. We standardize silicon photonics, enable co-packaged optics, and drive the future of\nhigh-speed computing and communications.\n\n[JOIN US ][25]\n[LEARN MORE ][26]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Advanced Photonics Coalition. All right reserved.\u00a0\n\nbottom of page\n\n[1]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org\n[2]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/application-form\n[3]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/apc-ecosystem\n[4]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/members-a-z\n[5]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/newest-members\n[6]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/executive-leadership\n[7]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/joining-information\n[8]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/purpose\n[9]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/membership-goals\n[10]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/organization-overview\n[11]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/industry-leadership\n[12]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/industry-partners\n[13]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/coalition-office\n[14]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/photonics-standards-groups\n[15]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/silicon-photonics-manufacturing-standards\n[16]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/co-packaged-optics-standards\n[17]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/multi-core-fiber-working-group\n[18]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/press-release\n[19]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/webcasts\n[20]: https://www.youtube.com/@advanced-photonics-coalition/videos\n[21]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/pecc-summit\n[22]: https://members.advanced-photonics.org/wg/Members_of_APC/workgroup/home\n[23]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/members-a-z\n[24]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/members-a-z\n[25]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/application-form\n[26]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/purpose top of page\n[[Silicon Photonics Manufacturing Standards]][1]\n* * [JOIN US][2]\n  * [APC Open Supply Chain Ecosystem ][3]\n  * [Members A-Z][4]\n  * [Newest Members][5]\n  * [Executive Leadership][6]\n  * [Membership Dues + Joining Info][7]\n  * [Purpose + Mission ][8]\n  * [Membership Goals][9]\n  * [Organization Overview][10]\n  * [Industry Leadership][11]\n  * [Industry Partners][12]\n  * [Contact Us][13]\n* * [Industry Standards Importance][14]\n  * [Silicon Photonic Manufacturing Standards][15]\n  * [Co-Packaged Optics (CPO) Standards][16]\n  * [Multi-Core Fiber Standards Working Group][17]\n* * [Press Release][18]\n  * [APC Webcasts][19]\n  * [APC Videos][20]\n* [PECC Summit 2026][21]\n* [Log In][22]\n[[NNT-Banner-bckgrd.jpg]][23]\n\n# Photonics-Electronics Convergence.\n\n[nnt-logo-reverse.png]\n\n# APC Welcomes NTT Innovative Devices\n\n[SEE ALL MEMBERS ][24]\n[APC-darkside-extended.jpg]\n\n# Join the Advanced Photonics Coalition Today\n\nThe Advanced Photonics Coalition unites the industry to advance next-generation optical\ntechnologies. We standardize silicon photonics, enable co-packaged optics, and drive the future of\nhigh-speed computing and communications.\n\n[JOIN US ][25]\n[LEARN MORE ][26]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Advanced Photonics Coalition. All right reserved.\u00a0\n\nbottom of page\n\n[1]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org\n[2]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/application-form\n[3]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/apc-ecosystem\n[4]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/members-a-z\n[5]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/newest-members\n[6]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/executive-leadership\n[7]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/joining-information\n[8]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/purpose\n[9]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/membership-goals\n[10]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/organization-overview\n[11]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/industry-leadership\n[12]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/industry-partners\n[13]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/coalition-office\n[14]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/photonics-standards-groups\n[15]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/silicon-photonics-manufacturing-standards\n[16]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/co-packaged-optics-standards\n[17]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/multi-core-fiber-working-group\n[18]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/press-release\n[19]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/webcasts\n[20]: https://www.youtube.com/@advanced-photonics-coalition/videos\n[21]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/pecc-summit\n[22]: https://members.advanced-photonics.org/wg/Members_of_APC/workgroup/home\n[23]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/members-a-z\n[24]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/members-a-z\n[25]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/application-form\n[26]: https://www.advanced-photonics.org/purpose advanced-photonics.org top of page\n[[Silicon Photonics Manufacturing Standards]][1]\n* * [JOIN US][2]\n  * [APC Open Supply Chain Ecosystem ][3]\n  * [Members A-Z][4]\n  * [Newest Members][5]\n  * [Executive Leadersh