      "polished_summary": "Advanced Photonics is a leading organization dedicated to advancing next-generation optical technologies through the standardization of silicon photonics and the development of co-packaged optics. By uniting industry stakeholders, the coalition aims to drive innovation in high-speed computing and communications, fostering collaboration and establishing critical manufacturing standards within the photonics sector.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Advanced Photonics is focused on advancing optical technologies, specifically in the area of silicon photonics and co-packaged optics, which are directly relevant to the spectral sensor market. They are involved in standardization and collaboration within the photonics sector, indicating a role in integrating systems and driving innovation in this field.",
      "audit_score": 4,
