nObject Detection Classification\n\nSemantic Segmentation\n\nInstance Segmentation\n\npylon AI Platform\n\nVisualApplets for Visual FPGA Programming\n\nOTHER PRODUCTS\n\nClose OTHER PRODUCTS\n\nOpen OTHER PRODUCTS\n\nMachine Vision Illumination\n\nMachine Vision Illumination\n\nSCHNEIDER-KREUZNACH Products\n\nSCHNEIDER-KREUZNACH Lenses\n\nMachine Vision Lense\n\nFUJINON Machine Vision Lense\n\nComputar Machine Vision Lense\n\nTAMRON Machine Vision Lense\n\nEdmund Focal Length Lenses\n\nMotorized Lens\n\nPuls Power Supply\n\nPuls Power Supply\n\nPuls 1 Phase Power Supplies\n\nPuls 3 Phase Power Supplies\n\nPuls DC/DC Converter\n\nAS-Interface\u00ae Power Supply\n\nDeviceNet Power Supply\n\nPuls Add-On Units\n\nOPTO Telecentric Lenses\n\nOPTO Telecentric Lenses 1/3&quot; TO 2/3&quot; SENSORS\n\nOPTO Telecentric Lenses UP TO 4/3&quot; SENSORS\n\nOPTO Telecentric Lenses VERY LARGE &amp; LINESCAN SENSORS\n\nOPTO 360\u00b0 VIEW LENSES\n\nChromasens camera\n\nLine Scan Camera allPIXA 4k \u2013 NH\n\nLine Scan Camera allPIXA pro\n\nLine Scan Camera allPIXA wave\n\nChromasens 3D-Line Scan Camera 3DPIXA\n\nMulti-Spectral Camera truePIXA\n\nCorona II LED Line Scan Light\n\nMachine Vision Systems\n\nMachine Vision Systems\n\nAdvantech product\n\nINDUSTRIAL CAMERA\n\nClose INDUSTRIAL CAMERA\n\nOpen INDUSTRIAL CAMERA\n\nAREA SCAN CAMERA\n\nINSPECTION CAMERA\n\nMACHINE VISION CAMERA\n\nAPPLICATION\n\nClose APPLICATION\n\nOpen APPLICATION\n\nMedical Science\n\nAutomotive\n\nElectronics\n\nManufacturing\n\nSpecial Purpose Machine (SPM)\n\nPharma\n\nFood/ Beverage\n\nCONTACT\n\nBLOG\n\nFollowing our recent acquisition from Basler AG, this website will soon be transitioned to a new website from April 2026 onwards.\nVisit our new website for expanded solutions and updated product information.\n\nBASLER Camera\nBasler Camera Dealer\n\nWorld Renowned Industrial Cameras by BASLER\nKnow more\n\nBasler AG Acquires 76% Stake in Alpha TechSys Automation in India\n\nRead More\n\nCustomer Services\n\nWe will supply systems, Products &amp; services that consistently meet expectations of the customers - from concept to commissioning.\n\nLong term partnership\n\nWe strive to establish mutually rewarding relationship with our customers and principals.\n\nPan India sales support\n\nOraganisation foothold in the national market\n\nEnquire Now\n\nName\n\nNumber\n\nEmail\n\nMessage\n\nSend\n\nBasler Camera\n\nAuthorized Basler Camera Distributor for India Region.\n\nWe are an authorized distributor for Basler Camera in India. Basler is a global provider of premium quality industrial cameras for a wide range of applications. Founded in 1988, Basler has the longest experience in machine vision.\nBasler is the largest unit volume producer of digital cameras for industrial applications in the world. Basler camera used in industrial mass production, medical technology, the life sciences, retail applications, as well as in intelligent traffic systems.\n\nBasler Camera\n\nBasler Camera\n\nBasler offers a wide range of cameras suitable for robotic applications.\nEither for pick and place, packaging and palletizing, or quality inspection Small, flexible, and cost-efficient 2D Basler cameras offer shock robustness and high stability.\nThey are available in diverse resolutions, speed, and interface options just as your application demands.\nNow there is a simple way to program and control your applications with a framework for easy graphical robot programming: drag&amp;bot.\ndrag &amp; bot enables workers to use robots in production without expert know-how.\n\nIt is independent of different robot brands and models. In contrast to existing solutions, robot programs can be created much faster.\nAs a result, drag&amp;bot enables cost-efficient automation. Thanks to the integration of the Basler pylon Camera Software Suite and\npylon-ROS-camera driver, it takes just a few mouse clicks to set up your robot system with Basler cameras.\nThe intuitive graphic user interface of drag&amp;bot guides you through each step. Via drag&amp;drop, program sequences can easily be built.The parameters of a functional blog are defined by using wizards. Modules enhance drag&amp;bot with pre-programmed software functionality.\nWithin the Component Manager, cameras can be installed and calibrated with just a few clicks through step-by-step instructions and a user-friendly interface.Access multiple camera parameters directly within the Operator Panel without using an additional camera SDK. Among others, set automatic exposure time, gain, sharpness, and denoising directly with drag&amp;bot.drag&amp;bot even offers pre-programmed vision modules. Robots can localize and pick objects. Even unsorted parts can be identified with the hel [Skip to content][1]\n\n[Basler Camera][2]\n\n**Phone:**[+91 7620083094 | ][3]**Email:**[info@alphatechsys.co.in][4]\n* [Home][5]\n* [About Us][6]\n* [STRENGTH][7]\n* [CLIENTS][8]\n* [CAREER][9]\n* [INDUSTRIES][10]\n* [PRODUCTS][11]\n* [Basler Products][12]\n* [machine vision systems][13]\n* [Cognex Machine Vision][14]\n* [Machine vision Lense][15]\n* [Fujinon Lens][16]\n* [Computar Machine Vision][17]\n* [Tamron Machine vision lenses][18]\n* [Edmund][19]\n* [Motorized Lens][20]\n* [OPTO Telecentric Lenses][21]\n* [Chromasens][22]\n* [Machine Vision Illumination][23]\n* [Puls][24]\n\n#### [BASLER][25]\n\nBasler Products\n][26]\nBasler Area Scan Cameras\n][27]\nBasler Line Scan Cameras\n][28]\nBasler SWIR cameras\n][29]\nBasler 3D Cameras\n][30]\nBasler Microscopy Cameras\n][31]\n\n#### [BASLER Acquisition Cards][32]\n\nBasler Frame Grabber\n][33]\nBasler PC cards\n][34]\n\n#### [SCHNEIDER-KREUZNACH Products][35]\n\nSCHNEIDER-KREUZNACH Lenses\n][36]\n\n#### [Chromasens camera][37]\n\nChromasens Line Scan Camera allPIXA 4k \u2013 NH\n][38]\nChromasens Line Scan Camera allPIXA pro\n][39]\nChromasens Line Scan Camera allPIXA wave\n][40]\nChromasens 3D-Line Scan Camera 3DPIXA\n][41]\nChromasens Multi-Spectral Camera truePIXA\n][42]\nChro