TS\n\nMachine Vision Illumination\n\nMachine Vision Illumination\n\nSCHNEIDER-KREUZNACH Products\n\nSCHNEIDER-KREUZNACH Lenses\n\nMachine Vision Lense\n\nFUJINON Machine Vision Lense\n\nComputar Machine Vision Lense\n\nTAMRON Machine Vision Lense\n\nEdmund Focal Length Lenses\n\nMotorized Lens\n\nPuls Power Supply\n\nPuls Power Supply\n\nPuls 1 Phase Power Supplies\n\nPuls 3 Phase Power Supplies\n\nPuls DC/DC Converter\n\nAS-Interface\u00ae Power Supply\n\nDeviceNet Power Supply\n\nPuls Add-On Units\n\nOPTO Telecentric Lenses\n\nOPTO Telecentric Lenses 1/3&quot; TO 2/3&quot; SENSORS\n\nOPTO Telecentric Lenses UP TO 4/3&quot; SENSORS\n\nOPTO Telecentric Lenses VERY LARGE &amp; LINESCAN SENSORS\n\nOPTO 360\u00b0 VIEW LENSES\n\nChromasens camera\n\nLine Scan Camera allPIXA 4k \u2013 NH\n\nLine Scan Camera allPIXA pro\n\nLine Scan Camera allPIXA wave\n\nChromasens 3D-Line Scan Camera 3DPIXA\n\nMulti-Spectral Camera truePIXA\n\nCorona II LED Line Scan Light\n\nMachine Vision Systems\n\nMachine Vision Systems\n\nAdvantech product\n\nINDUSTRIAL CAMERA\n\nClose INDUSTRIAL CAMERA\n\nOpen INDUSTRIAL CAMERA\n\nAREA SCAN CAMERA\n\nINSPECTION CAMERA\n\nMACHINE VISION CAMERA\n\nAPPLICATION\n\nClose APPLICATION\n\nOpen APPLICATION\n\nMedical Science\n\nAutomotive\n\nElectronics\n\nManufacturing\n\nSpecial Purpose Machine (SPM)\n\nPharma\n\nFood/ Beverage\n\nCONTACT\n\nBLOG\n\nFollowing our recent acquisition from Basler AG, this website will soon be transitioned to a new website from April 2026 onwards.\nVisit our new website for expanded solutions and updated product information.\n\nBASLER Camera\nBasler Camera Dealer\n\nWorld Renowned Industrial Cameras by BASLER\nKnow more\n\nBasler AG Acquires 76% Stake in Alpha TechSys Automation in India\n\nRead More\n\nCustomer Services\n\nWe will supply systems, Products &amp; services that consistently meet expectations of the customers - from concept to commissioning.\n\nLong term partnership\n\nWe strive to establish mutually rewarding relationship with our customers and principals.\n\nPan India sales support\n\nOraganisation foothold in the national market\n\nEnquire Now\n\nName\n\nNumber\n\nEmail\n\nMessage\n\nSend\n\nBasler Camera\n\nAuthorized Basler Camera Distributor for India Region.\n\nWe are an authorized distributor for Basler Camera in India. Basler is a global provider of premium quality industrial cameras for a wide range of applications. Founded in 1988, Basler has the longest experience in machine vision.\nBasler is the largest unit volume producer of digital cameras for industrial applications in the world. Basler camera used in industrial mass production, medical technology, the life sciences, retail applications, as well as in intelligent traffic systems.\n\nBasler Camera\n\nBasler Camera\n\nBasler offers a wide range of cameras suitable for robotic applications.\nEither for pick and place, packaging and palletizing, or quality inspection Small, flexible, and cost-efficient 2D Basler cameras offer shock robustness and high stability.\nThey are available in diverse resolutions, speed, and interface options just as your application demands.\nNow there is a simple way to program and control your applications with a framework for easy graphical robot programming: drag&amp;bot.\ndrag &amp; bot enables workers to use robots in production without expert know-how.\n\nIt is independent of different robot brands and models. In contrast to existing solutions, robot programs can be created much faster.\nAs a result, drag&amp;bot enables cost-efficient automation. Thanks to the integration of the Basler pylon Camera Software Suite and\npylon-ROS-camera driver, it takes just a few mouse clicks to set up your robot system with Basler cameras.\nThe intuitive graphic user interface of drag&amp;bot guides you through each step. Via drag&amp;drop, program sequences can easily be built.The parameters of a functional blog are defined by using wizards. Modules enhance drag&amp;bot with pre-programmed software functionality.\nWithin the Component Manager, cameras can be installed and calibrated with just a few clicks through step-by-step instructions and a user-friendly interface.Access multiple camera parameters directly within the Operator Panel without using an additional camera SDK. Among others, set automatic exposure time, gain, sharpness, and denoising directly with drag&amp;bot.drag&amp;bot even offers pre-programmed vision modules. Robots can localize and pick objects. Even unsorted parts can be identified with the help of a Basler 2D camera. As you can see, the combination of drag&amp;bot and Basler cameras offers numerous advantages:Easy installation, programming, and operation of your industrial robot. Independent of robot brand or model Intuitive guidance and operating tools\nJust a few clicks to install and calibrate Basler cameras with easy access to vision features and no need to use an additional camera SDK.\n\nAlpha Techsys Automation (Part of Basler Group) plays an important role in helping Technological growth in Emerging Indian Machine Vision Market.\n\nBasler Area Scan Cameras\n\nWe supply Basler Area scan Cameras in India\n\nRead More\n\nBasler Line Scan Cameras\n\nWe supply Basler Line scan Cameras in India\n\nRead More\n\nBasler SWIR cameras\n\nWe supply Basler SWIR Cameras in India\n\nRead More\n\nBasler 3D Cameras\n\nWe supply Basler 3D Cameras in India\n\nRead More\n\nProducts and Solutions for Complete Machine Vision Automation\n\nAlpha TechSys (Part of Basler Group) is technology leader in Machine Vision Automation Technology. In this area, Alpha Techsys Automation is consistently developing a role as a total solutions supplier with solutions for Machine Vision Automation Technology.Being Industry Leader\u2026.\nAlpha Techsys Automation (Part of Basler Group) plays an important role in helping Technological growth within new and emerging Indian Machine Vision Market.\nOur customer proximity and long-term partnership recognizes as leading MACHINE VISION COMPONENTS AND CAMERA INSPECTION SYSTEM company in India.\nAlpha Techsys Automation (Part of Basler Group) partners with the best in-class technology providers in the industry in order to support &amp; deliver latest Machine Vision Technologies for our clients across India.\nWe owe our success and high levels of customer satisfaction to the many years of close cooperation with reliable manufacturers and partners.\n\nOur team of vision experts are continuously engaged to find the reliable and most efficient imaging solution for our customers.\n\nTo do this, we merge Machine Vision and Industrial Automation into one solution.\n\nThese solutions can be used in all areas of key industries including; automotive, robotics, printing, pharmaceutical, bio-technology, process industries, textile, packaging, and assembly handling.\n\nProducts\n\nBASLER CAMERA\n\nBasler is the largest unit volume producer of digital cameras for industrial applications in the world.\n\nRead More\n\nCHROMASENS CAMERA\n\nChromasens produces line scan cameras, spectral cameras, 3D stereo cameras and LED illumination systems.\n\nRead More\n\nBASLER Acquisition Cards\n\nWe are authorized partner for Basler products for Indian territory.\n\nRead More\n\nOPTO Telecentric Lens\n\nWe supply 1/3&#8243; TO 2/3&#8243; SENSORS,\nUP TO 4/3&#8243; SENSORS and\nVERY LARGE &#038; LINESCAN SENSORS\n\nRead More\n\nMachine Vision Systems\n\nALPHA TECHSYS is engaged in manufacturing and development of Machine Vision Systems.\n\nRead More\n\nMachine Vision Illumination\n\nSelecting the most suitable illumination is one of the most crucial factors in designing a vision system\n\nRead More\n\nMachine Vision Lenses\n\nAlphaTechSys supply world renowned brands for machine vision lenses in India\n\nRead More\n\nPuls Power Supply\n\nWe provide Puls Power Supply in India. PULS is the only company worldwide focused on DIN rail power supplies.\n\nRead More\n\nApplication\n\nMedical Science\n\nVision System for Cannula Inspection\n\nRead More\n\nAutomotive\n\nVision System for Gasket Element Monitoring\n\nRead More\n\nElectronics\n\nVision System for Code Reading &#038; Foil Inspection\n\nRead More\n\nManufacturing\n\nVision System for Terminal Box Inspection\n\nRead More\n\nSpecial Purpose Machine (SPM)\n\nVision System for Defect Detection &amp; Clamp Measurement\n\nRead More\n\nPharma\n\nVision System for Syringe Bottles Inspection\n\nRead More\n\nFood/ Beverage\n\nVision System for counting Tetra Packs\n\nRead More\n\nIf you need industrial solution, We are available for you\n\nWe provide innovative solutions for sustainable progress. Our professional team works to increa"
