IXA\n][184]\nMulti-Spectral Camera truePIXA\n][185]\nCorona II LED Line Scan Light\n][186]\n\n#### [Machine Vision Systems][187]\n\nMachine Vision Systems\n][188]\n\n#### [Advantech product][189]\n* [ INDUSTRIAL CAMERA ][190] Close INDUSTRIAL CAMERA Open INDUSTRIAL CAMERA\n* [AREA SCAN CAMERA ][191]\n* [INSPECTION CAMERA ][192]\n* [MACHINE VISION CAMERA ][193]\n* APPLICATION\nClose APPLICATION Open APPLICATION\n* [Medical Science ][194]\n* [Automotive ][195]\n* [Electronics ][196]\n* [Manufacturing ][197]\n* [Special Purpose Machine (SPM) ][198]\n* [Pharma ][199]\n* [Food/ Beverage ][200]\n* [ CONTACT ][201]\n* [ BLOG ][202]\n\n## About Us\n\nOne stop solution for all your industrial needs.\n\n## ABOUT US\n\n\u201c**Alpha Techsys Automation (Part of Basler Group)\u201c came to an existence to work as a buffer between\nmanufacturers and customers in the field of Industrial Automation.**Where regular supplier comes to\ntheir limits, we add value as a partner for you \u2013 from simple solutions to high end technology\nproduct solutions. We at Alpha TechSys (Part of Basler Group) summarized for you how to combine the\nindividual components to create an individual solution.We provide components, integration and\ntechnical consultation for organizations working in a variety of industries including automotive,\nprinting, Food-Beverages, pharmaceutical, bio-technology, renewable energy, research & development\ncenters.Alpha TechSys (Part of Basler Group) support team guarantees the qualified distribution and\nfirst level support for all types of customers.\n\n### About Us\n\nAlpha TechSys is technology leader in Machine Vision Automation Technology. In this area, Alpha\nTechsys Automation is consistently developing a role as a total solutions supplier with solutions\nfor Machine Vision Automation Technology.\n\n### Products\n\nBasler Camera\n][203]\nMachine vision Lense\n][204]\nChromasens camera\n][205]\nEuresys Products\n][206]\nMachine Vision Systems\n][207]\nMachine Vi