e 2 X UV\n][129]\n[3D Cameras][130]\nBasler ToF Cameras\n][131]\nBasler Stereo Cameras\n][132]\nBasler RGB-D Cameras\n][133]\n[Fixed Focal Lenses][134]\nC-Mount Lenses\n][135]\nS-Mount Lenses\n][136]\nF-Mount Lenses\n][137]\n[Telecentric Lenses][138]\nLenses with Coaxial Illumination\n][139]\nLenses without Coaxial Illumination\n][140]\n[Balser Acquisition Cards][141]\nBasler Frame grabbers\n][142]\nPC cards\n][143]\n[pylon vTools for Image Processing][144]\nColor Blob Analysis\n][145]\nGeometric Pattern Matching\n][146]\nBarcode Reader\n][147]\nMeasurements\n][148]\nCalibration and Rectification\n][149]\nTemplate Matching\n][150]\n[pylon AI for Image Analysis][151]\nObject Detection Classification\n][152]\nSemantic Segmentation\n][153]\nInstance Segmentation\n][154]\npylon AI Platform\n][155]\n[VisualApplets for Visual FPGA Programming][156]\n* OTHER PRODUCTS\nClose OTHER PRODUCTS Open OTHER PRODUCTS\n\n#### [Machine Vision Illumination][157]\n\nMachine Vision Illumination\n][158]\n\n#### [SCHNEIDER-KREUZNACH Products][159]\n\nSCHNEIDER-KREUZNACH Lenses\n][160]\n\n#### [Machine Vision Lense][161]\n\nFUJINON Machine Vision Lense\n][162]\nComputar Machine Vision Lense\n][163]\nTAMRON Machine Vision Lense\n][164]\nEdmund Focal Length Lenses\n][165]\nMotorized Lens\n][166]\n\n#### [Puls Power Supply][167]\n\nPuls Power Supply\n][168]\nPuls 1 Phase Power Supplies\n][169]\nPuls 3 Phase Power Supplies\n][170]\nPuls DC/DC Converter\n][171]\nAS-Interface\u00ae Power Supply\n][172]\nDeviceNet Power Supply\n][173]\nPuls Add-On Units\n][174]\n\n#### [OPTO Telecentric Lenses][175]\n\nOPTO Telecentric Lenses 1/3\" TO 2/3\" SENSORS\n][176]\nOPTO Telecentric Lenses UP TO 4/3\" SENSORS\n][177]\nOPTO Telecentric Lenses VERY LARGE & LINESCAN SENSORS\n][178]\nOPTO 360\u00b0 VIEW LENSES\n][179]\n\n#### [Chromasens camera][180]\n\nLine Scan Camera allPIXA 4k \u2013 NH\n][181]\nLine Scan Camera allPIXA pro\n][182]\nLine Scan Camera allPIXA wave\n][183]\nChromasens 3D-Line Scan Camera 3DPIXA\n][184]\nMulti-Spectral Camera truePIXA\n][185]\nCorona II LED Line Scan Light\n][186]\n\n#### [Machine Vision Systems][187]\n\nMachine Vision Systems\n][188]\n\n#### [Advantech product][189]\n* [ INDUSTRIAL CAMERA ][190] Close INDUSTRIAL CAMERA Open INDUSTRIAL CAMERA\n* [AREA SCAN CAMERA ][191]\n* [INSPECTION CAMERA ][192]\n* [MACHINE VISION CAMERA ][193]\n* APPLICATION\nClose APPLICATION Open APPLICATION\n* [Medical Science ][194]\n* [Automotive ][195]\n* [Electronics ][196]\n* [Manufacturing ][197]\n* [Special Purpose Machine (SPM) ][198]\n* [Pharma ][199]\n* [Food/ Beverage ][200]\n* [ CONTACT ][201]\n* [ BLOG ][202]\n\n## About Us\n\nOne stop solution for all your industrial needs.\n\n## ABOUT US\n\n\u201c**Alpha Techsys Automation (Part of Basler Group)\u201c came to an existence to work as a buffer between\nmanufacturers and customers in the field of Industrial Automation.**Where regular supplier comes to\ntheir limits, we add value as a partner for you \u2013 from simple solutions to high end technology\nproduct solutions. We at Alpha TechSys (Part of Basler Group) summarized for you how to combine the\nindividual components to create an individual solution.We provide components, integration and\ntechnical consultation for organizations working in a variety of industries including automotive,\nprinting, Food-Beverages, pharmaceutical, bio-technology, renewable energy, research & development\ncenters.Alpha TechSys (Part of Basler Group) support team guarantees the qualified distribution and\nfirst level support for all types of customers.\n\n### About Us\n\nAlpha TechSys is technology leader in Machine Vision Automation Technology. In this area, Alpha\nTechsys Automation is consistently developing a role as a total solutions supplier with solutions\nfor Machine Vision Automation Technology.\n\n### Products\n\nBasler Camera\n][203]\nMachine vision Lense\n][204]\nChromasens camera\n][205]\nEuresys Products\n][206]\nMachine Vision Systems\n][207]\nMachine Vision Illumination\n][208]\nOPTO Telecentric Lenses\n][209]\nPuls Power Supply\n][210]\n\n### Contact\n\n## ALPHA TECHSYS AUTOMATION INDIA PVT LTD\n\nOffice No:- 303, Crystal Royals No. 39/11, Dalvi Nagar Katraj-Narhe Road, Ambegaon Bk, Katraj Pune\n-411046 Maharashtra, India\n* Tel.: +91-7620083094\n* Mail :info@alphatechsys.co.in\n\n### Social Media\n\n[ Facebook-f ][211] [ Twitter ][212] [ Linkedin-in ][213] [ Icon-instagram1 ][214]\n\n\u00a9 2026 | AlphaTechSys | All Rights Reserved\n* [Home ][215]\n\nAbout Us\n* [ABOUT US ][216]\n* STRENGTH\n* CLIENTS\n* CAREER\n* INDUSTRIES\nBASLER PRODUCTS\nCAMERA\n* [Area Scan Cameras ][217]\n* [Line Scan Cameras ][218]\n* [SWIR and UV Cameras ][219]\n* [3D Cameras ][220]\nLENSES\n* [Fixed Focal Lenses ][221]\n* [Telecentric Lenses ][222]\nAcquisition Cards\n* [Basler Frame grabbers ][223]\n* [PC cards ][224]\nSOFTWARE\n* [pylon vTools for Image Processing ][225]\n* [pylon AI for Image Analysis ][226]\n* [VisualApplets for Visual FPGA Programming ][227]\nOTHER PRODUCTS\n* [OPTO Telecentric Lenses ][228]\n* [Machine Vision Illumination ][229]\n* [Machine Vision Systems ][230]\n* [Machine Vision Lense ][231]\n* [SCHNEIDER-KREUZNACH Products ][232]\n* [Advantech product ][233]\n* [Optical Sorting Machine ][234]\n* [Puls Power Supply ][235]\nINDUSTRIAL CAMERA\n* [AREA SCAN CAMERA ][236]\n* [INSPECTION CAMERA ][237]\n* [MACHINE VISION CAMERA ][238]\nAPPLICATION\n* [Medical Science ][239]\n* [Automotive ][240]\n* [Electronics ][241]\n* [Manufacturing ][242]\n* [Special Purpose Machine (SPM) ][243]\n* [Pharma ][244]\n* [Food/ Beverage ][245]\n* [CONTACT US ][246]\n* [BLOG ][247]\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: https://alphatechsys.co.in/\n[3]: tel:+91-7620083094\n[4]: mailto:info@alphatechsys.co.in\n[5]: https://alphatechsys.co.in/\n[6]: https://alphatechsys.co.in/about-us/\n[7]: https://alphatechsys.co.in/strength/\n[8]: https://alphatechsys.co.in/clients/\n[9]: https://alphatechsys.co.in/career-2/\n[10]: https://alphatechsys.co.in/industries-