      "polished_summary": "ClydeHSI specializes in optical spectroscopy and hyperspectral imaging, offering high-performance instruments tailored for diverse applications such as food quality assessment, forensics, and pharmaceuticals. Their product range includes advanced hyperspectral cameras and imaging systems designed for research and industry, enabling precise analysis across various fields. With a commitment to innovation, ClydeHSI empowers users to explore and measure the spectral characteristics of materials effectively.",
      "audit_reasoning": "ClydeHSI specializes in optical spectroscopy and hyperspectral imaging, manufacturing advanced hyperspectral cameras and imaging systems directly for research and industry applications. Their products are specifically designed for spectral analysis, making them a relevant participant in the spectral sensor market.",
