          {
            "url": "https://www.haip-solutions.com/company/research-projects/dhynamite/",
            "text": "[Zum Inhalt wechseln][1]\n[ [Logo_V2_HAIP-07_weiss] ][2]\n* [ PRODUCTS ][3] Schlie\u00dfe PRODUCTS \u00d6ffne PRODUCTS\n\n## [Cameras][4]\n\n[ [Camera_Overview_Header] ][5]\n* [ RGB ][6]\n* [ VNIR (500 - 1000 nm) ][7]\n* [ NIR (700 - 1050 nm) ][8]\n* [ SWIR (900 - 1730 nm) ][9]\n\n## [Illumination][10]\n\n[ [HAIP Solutions Illumination Overview] ][11]\n* [ BlackBright VNIR LED Area ][12]\n* [ BlackBright VNIR LED Bar ][13]\n* [ BlackBright FMWIR Bar ][14]\n\n## [Software][15]\n\n[ [Software_Overview_Header] ][16]\n* [ BlackStudio ][17]\n* [ BlackIndustry On-Camera Classifier ][18]\n\n## [Accessories][19]\n\n[ [BlackIndustry_Station_Vorne_Hinten_thumbnail_header] ][20]\n* [ BlackIndustry Station ][21]\n* [ APPLICATIONS ][22] Schlie\u00dfe APPLICATIONS \u00d6ffne APPLICATIONS\n* [ VEGETATION ][23]\n* [ RECYCLING ][24]\n* [ FOOD INDUSTRY ][25]\n* [ GEOLOGY ][26]\n* [ ENVIRONMENTAL MONITORING ][27]\n[ [Hyperspectral Imaging Application Vegetation] ][28]\n[ [Hyperspectral Imaging Application Recycling] ][29]\n[ [Hyperspectral Imaging Application Food Industry] ][30]\n[ [Hyperspectral Imaging Application Geology] ][31]\n[ [Hyperspectral Imaging Application Environmental Monitoring] ][32]\n* [ LIBRARY ][33] Schlie\u00dfe LIBRARY \u00d6ffne LIBRARY\n* [ KNOWLEDGE BASE ][34]\n* [ APPLICATION NOTES ][35]\n* [ WHITE PAPERS ][36]\n* [ RESEARCH PUBLICATIONS ][37]\n* [ PRESS ][38]\n* [ NEWS ][39]\n* [ SUPPORT ][40]\n* [ COMPANY ][41] Schlie\u00dfe COMPANY \u00d6ffne COMPANY\n* [ TEAM ][42]\n* [ JOBS ][43]\n* [ SALES ][44]\n* [ RESEARCH PROJECTS ][45]\n* [PRODUCTS][46]\n* [CAMERAS][47]\n* [ILLUMINATION][48]\n* [SOFTWARE][49]\n* [ACCESSORIES][50]\n* [APPLICATIONS][51]\n* [VEGETATION][52]\n* [RECYCLING][53]\n* [FOOD INDUSTRY][54]\n* [GEOLOGY][55]\n* [ENVIRONMENTAL MONITORING][56]\n* [LIBRARY][57]\n* [KNOWLEDGE][58]\n* [APPLICATION NOTES][59]\n* [WHITE PAPERS][60]\n* [RESEARCH PUBLICATIONS][61]\n* [PRESS][62]\n* [SUPPORT][63]\n* [NEWS][64]\n* [COMPANY][65]\n* [TEAM][66]\n* [JOBS][67]\n* [SALES][68]\n* [RESEARCH PROJECTS][69]\n* [PRODUCTS][70]\n* [CAMERAS][71]\n* [ILLUMINATION][72]\n* [SOFTWARE][73]\n* [ACCESSORIES][74]\n* [APPLICATIONS][75]\n* [VEGETATION][76]\n* [RECYCLING][77]\n* [FOOD INDUSTRY][78]\n* [GEOLOGY][79]\n* [ENVIRONMENTAL MONITORING][80]\n* [LIBRARY][81]\n* [KNOWLEDGE][82]\n* [APPLICATION NOTES][83]\n* [WHITE PAPERS][84]\n* [RESEARCH PUBLICATIONS][85]\n* [PRESS][86]\n* [SUPPORT][87]\n* [NEWS][88]\n* [COMPANY][89]\n* [TEAM][90]\n* [JOBS][91]\n* [SALES][92]\n* [RESEARCH PROJECTS][93]\n[ Contact ][94]\n\n# Research Projects\n\nHyperspectral Imaging\n\n## DHYNAMite\n\n## Integrativer Pflanzenschutz durch Drohnen-basierte hyperspektrale Identifizierung von\n## Spinnmilbenbefallsherden und bedarfsgerechte N\u00fctzlingsapplikation im Freilandgurkenanbau\n\n## Integrated plant protection through drone-based hyperspectral identification of spider mite\n## infestation hotspots and demand-driven beneficial organism application in outdoor cucumber\n## cultivation\n\nIn our latest research project, HAIP Solutions collaborates with Katz Biotech, Weber Agrar Robotik\nGmbH and the Institute of Botany at Leibniz University Hannover to advance integrative and\nsustainable plant protection. The joint goal is to enable a demand-oriented and precise application\nof beneficial organisms as a biological alternative to chemical pesticides. By using hyperspectral\nimaging (HSI), pest infestation can be monitored automatically, infestation hotspots can be\nidentified early, and treatment success can be evaluated over time.\n\nThe project focuses specifically on detecting spider mite infestation in open-field cucumber\ncultivation. To ensure reliable forecasting models and infestation monitoring, consistent\nillumination conditions during data acquisition are essential. This makes atmospheric correction a\ncentral requirement when deploying hyperspectral imaging in the field.\n\nBy combining biological expertise with advanced sensing technologies, the project aims to reduce\nchemical pesticide use by at least 50%. The precision deployment of beneficial organisms such as\npredatory mites provides an ecological, highly specific, and sustainable plant protection strategy\naligned with the German National Bioeconomy Strategy.\n\n## Key Facts\n* **Project duration**: 08/2025 \u2013 07/2028\n* **Funding measure**: BMFTR \u2013 Bundesministerium f\u00fcr Forschung, Technologie und Raumfahrt\n* **Leading project management organization**: Projekttr\u00e4ger J\u00fclich (PtJ)\n* **Project partners**: Katz Biotech AG (KBAG), Weber Agrar Robotik GmbH \u2013 WEBARO (WAR), Leibniz\nUniversit\u00e4t \u2013 Institut f\u00fcr Botanik (LUH), HAIP Solutions GmbH\n\n## Involved HAIP Product\n\n[[Hyperspectral camera drone called BlackBird V2 manufactured by HAIP Solutions. Hyperspectral\nimaging systems and cameras]][95]\n\n### [BlackBird V2][96]\n\n500 - 1000 nm wavelength range\n\n[ Read More ][97]\n\n## Project Partners\n\n[Leibniz Universit\u00e4t und HAIP Solutions]\n\n## Other Research Projects\n\n[Research project Emsig by HAIP Solutions]\n\n### EMSig\n\nDevelopment of a hyperspectral measurement platform for pest symptom detection\n\n[ VIEW MORE ][98]\n[HAIP Solutions Joint research project SpectralAIge]\n\n### SpectralAlge\n\nAI-supported spectroscopic plastic ageing determination during mechanical recycling\n\n[ VIEW MORE ][99]\n\n### DeteKTiL\n\nDetection of plastic particles in food production\n\n[ VIEW MORE ][100]\n\n## Start with HSI Today!\n\n[ Contact Us ][101]\n\n## News\n\n[Blackstudio Product Brochure]\n\n## 17.04.2025\n\n## Say Hello to the BlackStudio software for Hyperspectral Imaging\n\nWe\u2019re thrilled to unveil the brand-new product brochure for BlackStudio, the ultimate software suite\ntailored \u2026\n\n[ View More ][102]\n[Machine Arrangement with the on-camera classifyer]\n\n## 10.04.2025\n\n## New On-Camera Classifier\n\nHAIP Solutions\u2018 On-Camera Classifier puts real-time machine learning directly into your\nhyperspectral camera. No external hardware. No delays. Just instant classification \u2026\n\n[ View More ][103]\n\n## 03.04.2025\n\n## LED-induced Fluorescence (LIF) Hyperspectral Imaging\n\nWe are excited to share that as part of the Spectral AIge research project, HAIP Solutions has\npioneered new approaches in fluorescence \u2026\n\n[ View More ][104]\n\n## Keep up with\n## the latest News.\n\n## Receive early access to new arrivals, sales, exclusive content, events and much more!\n\n## *By signing up, you will receive HAIP Solutions offers, promotions and other commercial messages.\n## You are also agreeing to HAIP Solutions's Privacy Policy. You may unsubscribe at any time.\n\n#### HAIP Solutions GmbH\n* [ +49 511 37352860 ][105]\n* [ info@haip-solutions.com ][106]\n* [ Escherstr. 23, 30159 Hannover ][107]\n\n#### Quicklinks\n* [ Products ][108]\n* [ Applications ][109]\n* [ Library ][110]\n* [ Support ][111]\n* [ Company ][112]\n* [ News ][113]\n\n#### Follow us\n* [ LinkedIn ][114]\n* [ Instagram ][115]\n* [ YouTube ][116]\n* [ Facebook ][117]\n\n[Privacy Policy][118]\n\n[Imprint][119]\n\n[Cookie Settings][120]\n\n## Get in touch with us!\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.haip-solutions.com\n[3]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/\n[4]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#cameras\n[5]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#cameras\n[6]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#rgb\n[7]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#vnir\n[8]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#nir\n[9]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#swir\n[10]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#illumination\n[11]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#illumination\n[12]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/blackbright-area/\n[13]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/blackbright-bar/\n[14]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/blackbright-fast-medium-wave-ir/\n[15]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#software\n[16]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#software\n[17]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/hyperspectral-imaging-software/\n[18]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/on-camera-classifier/\n[19]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/#accessories\n[20]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#accessories\n[21]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/blackindustry-station/\n[22]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/\n[23]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/vegetation/\n[24]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/recycling/\n[25]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/food-industry/\n[26]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/geology/\n[27]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/environmental-monitoring/\n[28]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/vegetation/\n[29]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/recycling/\n[30]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/food-industry/\n[31]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/geology/\n[32]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/environmental-monitoring/\n[33]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/library-applications/\n[34]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/library/knowledge-base/\n[35]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/library-applications/application-notes/\n[36]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/library-applications/white-papers/\n[37]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/library-applications/research-publications/\n[38]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/library/press/\n[39]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/news/\n[40]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/support/\n[41]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/company/\n[42]: https://ww