pplications/food-industry/\n[79]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/geology/\n[80]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/environmental-monitoring/\n[81]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hsi-library/\n[82]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hsi-library/what-is-hyperspectral-imaging/\n[83]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hsi-library/application-notes/\n["
