itoring/\n[57]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hsi-library/\n[58]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hsi-library/what-is-hyperspectral-imaging/\n[59]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hsi-library/application-notes/\n[60]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hsi-library/white-papers/\n[61]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hsi-library/research-publications/\n[62]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hsi-library/press/\n[63]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/support/\n[64]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/news/\n[65]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/company/\n[66]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/company/team/\n[67]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/company/jobs/\n[68]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/company/sales-and-distribution-partners/\n[69]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/company/research-projects/\n[70]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/\n[71]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/#cameras\n[72]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/#illumination\n[73]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/#software\n[74]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/#accessories\n[75]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/\n[76]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/vegetation/\n[77]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/recycling/\n[78]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/food-industry/\n[79]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/geology/\n[80]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/environmental-monitoring/\n[81]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hsi-library/\n[82]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hsi-library/what-is-hyperspectral-imaging/\n[83]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hsi-library/application-notes/\n[84]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hsi-library/white-papers/\n[85]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hsi-library/research-publications/\n[86]: https: