            "text": "[Zum Inhalt wechseln][1]\n[ [Logo_V2_HAIP-07_weiss] ][2]\n* [ PRODUCTS ][3] Schlie\u00dfe PRODUCTS \u00d6ffne PRODUCTS\n\n## [Cameras][4]\n\n[ [Camera_Overview_Header] ][5]\n* [ RGB ][6]\n* [ VNIR (500 - 1000 nm) ][7]\n* [ NIR (700 - 1050 nm) ][8]\n* [ SWIR (900 - 1730 nm) ][9]\n\n## [Illumination][10]\n\n[ [HAIP Solutions Illumination Overview] ][11]\n* [ BlackBright VNIR LED Area ][12]\n* [ BlackBright VNIR LED Bar ][13]\n* [ BlackBright FMWIR Bar ][14]\n\n## [Software][15]\n\n[ [Software_Overview_Header] ][16]\n* [ BlackStudio ][17]\n* [ BlackIndustry On-Camera Classifier ][18]\n\n## [Accessories][19]\n\n[ [BlackIndustry_Station_Vorne_Hinten_thumbnail_header] ][20]\n* [ BlackIndustry Station ][21]\n* [ APPLICATIONS ][22] Schlie\u00dfe APPLICATIONS \u00d6ffne APPLICATIONS\n* [ VEGETATION ][23]\n* [ RECYCLING ][24]\n* [ FOOD INDUSTRY ][25]\n* [ GEOLOGY ][26]\n* [ ENVIRONMENTAL MONITORING ][27]\n[ [Hyperspectral Imaging Application Vegetation] ][28]\n[ [Hyperspectral Imaging Application Recycling] ][29]\n[ [Hyperspectral Imaging Application Food Industry] ][30]\n[ [Hyperspectral Imaging Application Geology] ][31]\n[ [Hyperspectral Imaging Application Environmental Monitoring] ][32]\n* [ LIBRARY ][33] Schlie\u00dfe LIBRARY \u00d6ffne LIBRARY\n* [ KNOWLEDGE BASE ][34]\n* [ APPLICATION NOTES ][35]\n* [ WHITE PAPERS ][36]\n* [ RESEARCH PUBLICATIONS ][37]\n* [ PRESS ][38]\n* [ NEWS ][39]\n* [ SUPPORT ][40]\n* [ COMPANY ][41] Schlie\u00dfe COMPANY \u00d6ffne COMPANY\n* [ TEAM ][42]\n* [ JOBS ][43]\n* [ SALES ][44]\n* [ RESEARCH PROJECTS ][45]\n* [PRODUCTS][46]\n* [CAMERAS][47]\n* [ILLUMINATION][48]\n* [SOFTWARE][49]\n* [ACCESSORIES][50]\n* [APPLICATIONS][51]\n* [VEGETATION][52]\n* [RECYCLING][53]\n* [FOOD INDUSTRY][54]\n* [GEOLOGY][55]\n* [ENVIRONMENTAL MONITORING][56]\n* [LIBRARY][57]\n* [KNOWLEDGE][58]\n* [APPLICATION NOTES][59]\n* [WHITE PAPERS][60]\n* [RESEARCH PUBLICATIONS][61]\n* [PRESS][62]\n* [SUPPORT][63]\n* [NEWS][64]\n* [COMPANY][65]\n* [TEAM][66]\n* [JOBS][67]\n* [SALES][68]\n* [RESEARCH PROJECTS][69]\n* [PRODUCTS][70]\n* [CAMERAS][71]\n* [ILLUMINATION][72]\n* [SOFTWARE][73]\n* [ACCESSORIES][74]\n* [APPLICATIONS][75]\n* [VEGETATION][76]\n* [RECYCLING][77]\n* [FOOD INDUSTRY][78]\n* [GEOLOGY][79]\n* [ENVIRONMENTAL MONITORING][80]\n* [LIBRARY][81]\n* [KNOWLEDGE][82]\n* [APPLICATION NOTES][83]\n* [WHITE PAPERS][84]\n* [RESEARCH PUBLICATIONS][85]\n* [PRESS][86]\n* [SUPPORT][87]\n* [NEWS][88]\n* [COMPANY][89]\n* [TEAM][90]\n* [JOBS][91]\n* [SALES][92]\n* [RESEARCH PROJECTS][93]\n[ Contact ][94]\n\n# Research Projects\n\nHyperspectral Imaging\n\n## HyperFoil\n\n## Hyperspektralkamera unterst\u00fctzt selektive Laser-Entlackung von hinterleuchteten Folientr\u00e4gern\n\n## Hyperspectral camera-assisted selective laser ablation from blacklit film carriers\n\n##### **HyperFoil: Hyperspectral imaging for automated laser ablation of coated foils**\n\nHAIP Solutions is redefining quality assurance in laser processing of coated foils. As part of the\nHyperFoil research project, we are developing an innovative approach that combines hyperspectral\nimaging (HSI) with automated laser ablation by enabling precise material removal, real-time process\ncontrol, and greater design freedom in industrial manufacturing.\n\n##### **The Challenge: Inconsistent coatings and unreliable results**\n\nDecorative and functional foils are used across industries like automotive, electronics, and\nfurniture manufacturing, because these films serve both aesthetic and functional purposes. However,\nas design demands increase for finer structural details, sharper contours and greater customisation.\n\nTraditional laser ablation often struggles to deliver consistent results, because local variations\nin coating composition can lead to problems like uneven material removal or substrate damage,\nnegatively impacting product quality, production speed, and process reliability.\n\n##### **The Solution: Spectral sensing meets intelligent laser control**\n\nIn HyperFoil, a joint project with Fraunhofer IFAM, SiTec, Manikewicz, and HAIP Solutions, we are\ndeveloping a technology demonstrator for inline-capable, quality-assured laser ablation. At the core\nof this innovation is HAIP\u2019s hyperspectral imaging technology, enabling real-time, pixel-precise\ncoating analysis.\n\nKey benefits of the solution:\n* Real-time detection of coating thickness and material variations\n* AI-powered laser parameter adjustment for selective layer removal\n* On-camera machine learning for classification and anomaly detection\n* Custom illumination systems for consistent, high-fidelity imaging\n\nKey areas of expertise of the partners\n\n##### **HAIP Solutions technology **\n\nAs a technology leader in hyperspectral imaging for industrial applications, HAIP Solutions\nprovides:\n* BlackIndustry cameras with pushbroom technology for high-resolution SWIR imaging\n* Edge processing capabilities with real-time machine learning directly on the sensor\n* Integrated illumination systems designed for laser ablation environments\n* A robust platform for fully automated process optimisation and quality assurance\n\n**The result:** A formerly manual, lab-based process becomes an automated, inline-capable solution\nfor advanced manufacturing.\n\nLeft: Unregulated laser ablation using an IR laser. Center and right: Prototype HSI camera used by a\nrobot to scan surfaces so that grid cuts can be analysed. \u00a9 Fraunhofer IFAM\n\n##### **Shaping the future of industrial laser processing**\n\nHyperFoil demonstrates how photonics, AI, and spectral sensing can converge to unlock new\npossibilities in surface processing. This approach offers maximum precision and\nrepeatability, educed scrap and process downtime, and greater design flexibility for coated foils\nand complex surfaces. By integrating hyperspectral imaging into laser ablation workflows, HAIP\nSolutions is setting new standards in industrial quality assurance and digital manufacturing.\n\n## Key Facts\n* **Project duration**: 10/2025 \u2013 09/2027\n* **Funding measure:** KMU-Innovativ\n* **Funding authority**: BMFTR \u2013 Bundesministerium f\u00fcr Forschung, Technologie und Raumfahrt\n* **Leading project management organization**: VDI Technologiezentrum GmbH \u2013 Quantensysteme\n* **Project partners**: Fraunhofer IFAM, SiTec, Mankiewicz Gebr. & Co. (GmbH & Co. KG) and HAIP\nSolutions GmbH\n\n## Involved HAIP Products\n\n[[Hyperspectral camera called BlackIndustry SWIR 1.7 manufactured by HAIP Solutions]][95]\n\n### [BlackIndustry SWIR 1.7 Max][96]\n\n900 - 1730 nm wavelength range\n\n[ Read More ][97]\n[[Hyperspectral imaging software called BlackStudio by HAIP Solutions]][98]\n\n### [BlackStudio][99]\n\nHyperspectral imaging software\n\n[ Read More ][100]\n\n## Project Partners\n\n## Funded by\n\n## Other Research Projects\n\n### DHYNAmite\n\nIntegrated plant protection through drone-based hyperspectral technology\n\n[ VIEW MORE ][101]\n[Research project Emsig by HAIP Solutions]\n\n### EMSig\n\nDevelopment of a hyperspectral measurement platform for pest symptom detection\n\n[ VIEW MORE ][102]\n[HAIP Solutions Joint research project SpectralAIge]\n\n### SpectralAlge\n\nAI-supported spectroscopic plastic ageing determination during mechanical recycling\n\n[ VIEW MORE ][103]\n\n## Start with HSI Today!\n\n[ Contact Us ][104]\n\n## News\n\n[Blackstudio Product Brochure]\n\n## 17.04.2025\n\n## Say Hello to the BlackStudio software for Hyperspectral Imaging\n\nWe\u2019re thrilled to unveil the brand-new product brochure for BlackStudio, the ultimate software suite\ntailored \u2026\n\n[ View More ][105]\n[Machine Arrangement with the on-camera classifyer]\n\n## 10.04.2025\n\n## New On-Camera Classifier\n\nHAIP Solutions\u2018 On-Camera Classifier puts real-time machine learning directly into your\nhyperspectral camera. No external hardware. No delays. Just instant classification \u2026\n\n[ View More ][106]\n\n## 03.04.2025\n\n## LED-induced Fluorescence (LIF) Hyperspectral Imaging\n\nWe are excited to share that as part of the Spectral AIge research project, HAIP Solutions has\npioneered new approaches in fluorescence \u2026\n\n[ View More ][107]\n\n## Keep up with\n## the latest News.\n\n## Receive early access to new arrivals, sales, exclusive content, events and much more!\n\n## *By signing up, you will receive HAIP Solutions offers, promotions and other commercial messages.\n## You are also agreeing to HAIP Solutions's Privacy Policy. You may unsubscribe at any time.\n\n#### HAIP Solutions GmbH\n* [ +49 511 37352860 ][108]\n* [ info@haip-solutions.com ][109]\n* [ Escherstr. 23, 30159 Hannover ][110]\n\n#### Quicklinks\n* [ Products ][111]\n* [ Applications ][112]\n* [ Library ][113]\n* [ Support ][114]\n* [ Company ][115]\n* [ News ][116]\n\n#### Follow us\n* [ LinkedIn ][117]\n* [ Instagram ][118]\n* [ YouTube ][119]\n* [ Facebook ][120]\n\n[Privacy Policy][121]\n\n[Imprint][122]\n\n[Cookie Settings][123]\n\n## Get in touch with us!\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.haip-solutions.com\n[3]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/\n[4]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#cameras\n[5]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#cameras\n[6]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#rgb\n[7]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#vnir\n[8]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#nir\n[9]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#swir\n[10]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#illumination\n[11]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#illumination\n[12]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/blackbright-area/\n[13]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/blackbright-bar/\n[14]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/blackbright-fast-medium-wave-ir/\n[15]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#software\n[16]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#software\n[17]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/hyperspectral-imaging-software/\n[18]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/on-camera-classifier/\n[19]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/#accessories\n[20]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#accessories\n[21]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/blackindustry-station/\n[22]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/\n[23]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/vegetation/\n[24]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/recycling/\n[25]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/food-industry/\n[26]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/geology/\n[27]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/environmental-monitoring/\n[28]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/vegetation/\n[29]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/recycling/\n[30]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/food-industry/\n[31]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/geology/\n[32]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/environmental-monitoring/\n[33]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/library-applications/\n[34]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/library/knowledge-base/\n[35]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/library-applications/application-notes/\n[36]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/library-applications/white-papers/\n[37]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/library-applications/research-publications/\n[38]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/library/press/\n[39]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/news/\n[40]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/support/\n[41]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/company/\n[42]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/company/team/\n[43]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/company/jobs/\n[44]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/company/sales-and-distribution-partners/\n[45]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/company/research-projects/\n[46]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/\n[47]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/#cameras\n[48]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/#illumination\n[49]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/#software\n[50]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/#accessories\n[51]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-appli"
