AM][66]\n* [JOBS][67]\n* [SALES][68]\n* [RESEARCH PROJECTS][69]\n* [PRODUCTS][70]\n* [CAMERAS][71]\n* [ILLUMINATION][72]\n* [SOFTWARE][73]\n* [ACCESSORIES][74]\n* [APPLICATIONS][75]\n* [VEGETATION][76]\n* [RECYCLING][77]\n* [FOOD INDUSTRY][78]\n* [GEOLOGY][79]\n* [ENVIRONMENTAL MONITORING][80]\n* [LIBRARY][81]\n* [KNOWLEDGE][82]\n* [APPLICATION NOTES][83]\n* [WHITE PAPERS][84]\n* [RESEARCH PUBLICATIONS][85]\n* [PRESS][86]\n* [SUPPORT][87]\n* [NEWS][88]\n* [COMPANY][89]\n* [TEAM][90]\n* [JOBS][91]\n* [SALES][92]\n* [RESEARCH PROJECTS][93]\n[ Contact ][94]\n\n# Team\n\nHAIP Solutions\n\n## We are\n## HAIP Solutions\n\n## Since 2018, HAIP Solutions GmbH, a young tech company from Hanover (Germany), has been working in\n## the development of user-oriented hyperspectral imaging (HSI) camera solutions. Our products based\n## on spectral technology are used in the fields of plant breeding, agriculture and forestry, food\n## industry, recycling and geology. We strongly believe that spectral imaging can contribute to\n## making the world a more sustainable planet. We want to make it as easy and intuitive as possible\n## for the users of our products to be able to enjoy and use hyperspectral technology. Since the\n## start of our company, we have been working intensively with partners from various fields to put\n## the user at the centre of our solutions.\n\n## Tobias Kreklow\n\n## Co-Founder & CEO\n\n[ Linkedin-in ][95]\n\n## Milan R\u00e4dicker\n\n## Co-Founder & Lead Electrical Engineer\n\n[ Linkedin-in ][96]\n\n## Johannes Busch\n\n## Co-Founder & Lead Software Engineer\n\n[ Linkedin-in ][97]\n\n## Julius Rost\n\n## Administration & Finance\n\n[ Linkedin-in ][98]\n\n## Jane Baruth\n\n## Marketing & PR\n\n[ Linkedin-in ][99]\n\n## Antje Nowak\n\n## Technical Support & Sales\n\n[ Linkedin-in ][100]\n\n## S\u00f6nke S\u00fcdbeck\n\n## Software Engineer\n\n[ Linkedin-in ][101]\n\n## Jesse Scheumann\n\n## Software Engineer\n\n[ Linkedin-in ][102]\n\n## MAximilian Hachen\n\n## Software Engineer\n\n[ Linkedin-in ][103]\n\n## DR. Axel KuLcke\n\n## Scientific Advisor\n\n## Birger Bernhold\n\n## Electrical Engineer\n\n## Jan P\u00f6thig\n\n## Electrical Engineer\n\n## Nils Gresbrand\n\n## Head of Production\n\n[ Linkedin-in ][104]\n\n## Leroy Mattheis\n\n## Production\n\n## Hamed Ibrahim\n\n## Production\n\n## Asimo\n\n## Office Assistant\n\nYou can imagine being part of this great team? Do you also want to change the world? Then let\u2019s go!\n\nDevelop the newest and most innovative hyperspectral camera systems with us. We look forward to\nhearing from you!\n\n[ Job page ][105]\n\n## Company\n\n[HAIP Solutions jobs]\n\n## Jobs\n\nTake a look at our current job offers\n\n[ View More ][106]\n[HAIP Solutions sales and distribution partners]\n\n## Sales\n\nView our sales and distribution partners\n\n[ View More ][107]\n\n## Keep up with\n## the latest News.\n\n## Receive early access to new arrivals, sales, exclusive content, events and much more!\n\n## *By signing up, you will receive HAIP Solutions offers, promotions and other commercial messages.\n## You are also agreeing to HAIP Solutions's Privacy Policy. You may unsubscribe at any time.\n\n#### HAIP Solutions GmbH\n* [ +49 511 37352860 ][108]\n* [ info@haip-solutions.com ][109]\n* [ Escherstr. 23, 30159 Hannover ][110]\n\n#### Quicklinks\n* [ Products ][111]\n* [ Applications ][112]\n* [ Library ][113]\n* [ Support ][114]\n* [ Company ][115]\n* [ News ][116]\n\n#### Follow us\n* [ LinkedIn ][117]\n* [ Instagram ][118]\n* [ YouTube ][119]\n* [ Facebook ][120]\n\n[Privacy Policy][121]\n\n[Imprint][122]\n\n[Cookie Settings][123]\n\n## Get in touch with us!\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.haip-solutions.com\n[3]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/\n[4]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#cameras\n[5]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#cameras\n[6]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#rgb\n[7]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#vnir\n[8]: https://www.haip-sol