            "text": "[Zum Inhalt wechseln][1]\n[ [Logo_V2_HAIP-07_weiss] ][2]\n* [ PRODUCTS ][3] Schlie\u00dfe PRODUCTS \u00d6ffne PRODUCTS\n\n## [Cameras][4]\n\n[ [Camera_Overview_Header] ][5]\n* [ RGB ][6]\n* [ VNIR (500 - 1000 nm) ][7]\n* [ NIR (700 - 1050 nm) ][8]\n* [ SWIR (900 - 1730 nm) ][9]\n\n## [Illumination][10]\n\n[ [HAIP Solutions Illumination Overview] ][11]\n* [ BlackBright VNIR LED Area ][12]\n* [ BlackBright VNIR LED Bar ][13]\n* [ BlackBright FMWIR Bar ][14]\n\n## [Software][15]\n\n[ [Software_Overview_Header] ][16]\n* [ BlackStudio ][17]\n* [ BlackIndustry On-Camera Classifier ][18]\n\n## [Accessories][19]\n\n[ [BlackIndustry_Station_Vorne_Hinten_thumbnail_header] ][20]\n* [ BlackIndustry Station ][21]\n* [ APPLICATIONS ][22] Schlie\u00dfe APPLICATIONS \u00d6ffne APPLICATIONS\n* [ VEGETATION ][23]\n* [ RECYCLING ][24]\n* [ FOOD INDUSTRY ][25]\n* [ GEOLOGY ][26]\n* [ ENVIRONMENTAL MONITORING ][27]\n[ [Hyperspectral Imaging Application Vegetation] ][28]\n[ [Hyperspectral Imaging Application Recycling] ][29]\n[ [Hyperspectral Imaging Application Food Industry] ][30]\n[ [Hyperspectral Imaging Application Geology] ][31]\n[ [Hyperspectral Imaging Application Environmental Monitoring] ][32]\n* [ LIBRARY ][33] Schlie\u00dfe LIBRARY \u00d6ffne LIBRARY\n* [ KNOWLEDGE BASE ][34]\n* [ APPLICATION NOTES ][35]\n* [ WHITE PAPERS ][36]\n* [ RESEARCH PUBLICATIONS ][37]\n* [ PRESS ][38]\n* [ NEWS ][39]\n* [ SUPPORT ][40]\n* [ COMPANY ][41] Schlie\u00dfe COMPANY \u00d6ffne COMPANY\n* [ TEAM ][42]\n* [ JOBS ][43]\n* [ SALES ][44]\n* [ RESEARCH PROJECTS ][45]\n* [PRODUCTS][46]\n* [CAMERAS][47]\n* [ILLUMINATION][48]\n* [SOFTWARE][49]\n* [ACCESSORIES][50]\n* [APPLICATIONS][51]\n* [VEGETATION][52]\n* [RECYCLING][53]\n* [FOOD INDUSTRY][54]\n* [GEOLOGY][55]\n* [ENVIRONMENTAL MONITORING][56]\n* [LIBRARY][57]\n* [KNOWLEDGE][58]\n* [APPLICATION NOTES][59]\n* [WHITE PAPERS][60]\n* [RESEARCH PUBLICATIONS][61]\n* [PRESS][62]\n* [SUPPORT][63]\n* [NEWS][64]\n* [COMPANY][65]\n* [TEAM][66]\n* [JOBS][67]\n* [SALES][68]\n* [RESEARCH PROJECTS][69]\n* [PRODUCTS][70]\n* [CAMERAS][71]\n* [ILLUMINATION][72]\n* [SOFTWARE][73]\n* [ACCESSORIES][74]\n* [APPLICATIONS][75]\n* [VEGETATION][76]\n* [RECYCLING][77]\n* [FOOD INDUSTRY][78]\n* [GEOLOGY][79]\n* [ENVIRONMENTAL MONITORING][80]\n* [LIBRARY][81]\n* [KNOWLEDGE][82]\n* [APPLICATION NOTES][83]\n* [WHITE PAPERS][84]\n* [RESEARCH PUBLICATIONS][85]\n* [PRESS][86]\n* [SUPPORT][87]\n* [NEWS][88]\n* [COMPANY][89]\n* [TEAM][90]\n* [JOBS][91]\n* [SALES][92]\n* [RESEARCH PROJECTS][93]\n[ Contact ][94]\n\n# Jobs\n\nView open positions at HAIP Solutions\n\nHAIP Solutions\n\nSince 2018, HAIP Solutions GmbH, a young tech company from Hanover (Germany), has been working in\nthe development of user-oriented hyperspectral imaging (HSI) camera solutions.\nOur products based on spectral technology are used in the fields of plant breeding, agriculture and\nforestry, food industry, recycling and geology. We strongly believe that spectral imaging can\ncontribute to making the world a more sustainable planet.\n\nWe want to make it as easy and intuitive as possible for the users of our products to be able to\nenjoy and use hyperspectral technology. Since the start of our company, we have been working\nintensively with partners from various fields to put the user at the centre of our solutions.\n\n\u2013 Currently no open positions \u2013\n\nYou are welcome to send us initiative applications at any time.\n\nSend your application documents to: [contact@haip-solutions.com][95]\n\n[ Contact us ][96]\n\n## Company\n\n[HAIP Solutions Teamphoto in Hannover Hafven.]\n\n### Team\n\nGet to know our team at HAIP Solutions\n\n[ View More ][97]\n[HAIP Solutions sales and distribution partners]\n\n### Sales\n\nView our sales and distribution partners\n\n[ View More ][98]\n\n## Keep up with\n## the latest News.\n\n## Receive early access to new arrivals, sales, exclusive content, events and much more!\n\n## *By signing up, you will receive H