            "text": "[Zum Inhalt wechseln][1]\n[ [Logo_V2_HAIP-07_weiss] ][2]\n* [ PRODUCTS ][3] Schlie\u00dfe PRODUCTS \u00d6ffne PRODUCTS\n\n## [Cameras][4]\n\n[ [Camera_Overview_Header] ][5]\n* [ RGB ][6]\n* [ VNIR (500 - 1000 nm) ][7]\n* [ NIR (700 - 1050 nm) ][8]\n* [ SWIR (900 - 1730 nm) ][9]\n\n## [Illumination][10]\n\n[ [HAIP Solutions Illumination Overview] ][11]\n* [ BlackBright VNIR LED Area ][12]\n* [ BlackBright VNIR LED Bar ][13]\n* [ BlackBright FMWIR Bar ][14]\n\n## [Software][15]\n\n[ [Software_Overview_Header] ][16]\n* [ BlackStudio ][17]\n* [ BlackIndustry On-Camera Classifier ][18]\n\n## [Accessories][19]\n\n[ [BlackIndustry_Station_Vorne_Hinten_thumbnail_header] ][20]\n* [ BlackIndustry Station ][21]\n* [ APPLICATIONS ][22] Schlie\u00dfe APPLICATIONS \u00d6ffne APPLICATIONS\n* [ VEGETATION ][23]\n* [ RECYCLING ][24]\n* [ FOOD INDUSTRY ][25]\n* [ GEOLOGY ][26]\n* [ ENVIRONMENTAL MONITORING ][27]\n[ [Hyperspectral Imaging Application Vegetation] ][28]\n[ [Hyperspectral Imaging Application Recycling] ][29]\n[ [Hyperspectral Imaging Application Food Industry] ][30]\n[ [Hyperspectral Imaging Application Geology] ][31]\n[ [Hyperspectral Imaging Application Environmental Monitoring] ][32]\n* [ LIBRARY ][33] Schlie\u00dfe LIBRARY \u00d6ffne LIBRARY\n* [ KNOWLEDGE BASE ][34]\n* [ APPLICATION NOTES ][35]\n* [ WHITE PAPERS ][36]\n* [ RESEARCH PUBLICATIONS ][37]\n* [ PRESS ][38]\n* [ NEWS ][39]\n* [ SUPPORT ][40]\n* [ COMPANY ][41] Schlie\u00dfe COMPANY \u00d6ffne COMPANY\n* [ TEAM ][42]\n* [ JOBS ][43]\n* [ SALES ][44]\n* [ RESEARCH PROJECTS ][45]\n* [PRODUCTS][46]\n* [CAMERAS][47]\n* [ILLUMINATION][48]\n* [SOFTWARE][49]\n* [ACCESSORIES][50]\n* [APPLICATIONS][51]\n* [VEGETATION][52]\n* [RECYCLING][53]\n* [FOOD INDUSTRY][54]\n* [GEOLOGY][55]\n* [ENVIRONMENTAL MONITORING][56]\n* [LIBRARY][57]\n* [KNOWLEDGE][58]\n* [APPLICATION NOTES][59]\n* [WHITE PAPERS][60]\n* [RESEARCH PUBLICATIONS][61]\n* [PRESS][62]\n* [SUPPORT][63]\n* [NEWS][64]\n* [COMPANY][65]\n* [TEAM][66]\n* [JOBS][67]\n* [SALES][68]\n* [RESEARCH PROJECTS][69]\n* [PRODUCTS][70]\n* [CAMERAS][71]\n* [ILLUMINATION][72]\n* [SOFTWARE][73]\n* [ACCESSORIES][74]\n* [APPLICATIONS][75]\n* [VEGETATION][76]\n* [RECYCLING][77]\n* [FOOD INDUSTRY][78]\n* [GEOLOGY][79]\n* [ENVIRONMENTAL MONITORING][80]\n* [LIBRARY][81]\n* [KNOWLEDGE][82]\n* [APPLICATION NOTES][83]\n* [WHITE PAPERS][84]\n* [RESEARCH PUBLICATIONS][85]\n* [PRESS][86]\n* [SUPPORT][87]\n* [NEWS][88]\n* [COMPANY][89]\n* [TEAM][90]\n* [JOBS][91]\n* [SALES][92]\n* [RESEARCH PROJECTS][93]\n[ Contact ][94]\n\n# Sales & Distribution Partners\n\n## HAIP Solutions\n\nHAIP Solutions GmbH focuses on the development and production of camera systems in the fields of\nagriculture and forestry, food industry, geology and recycling. Our sales partners ensure the\ndistribution of our products in the international environment.\n\nFor the European region, our customers can order directly from us. Outside Europe, you will find a\nsmall selection of regional partners below. If your region is not listed or if you are interested in\ndistribution in your region, feel free to contact us directly with your enquiry. We will answer your\nquestions and help you to find the right distribution partner.\n\n[ Contact Us ][95]\n\n## View Our International Partners\n\n[International Sales Partners HAIP Solutions] [\n\nEurope\n\n][96] [\n\nAsia\n\n][97]\n\n## Asia\n\n**PhenoTrait Technology Co., Ltd.** is a supplier of scientific research equipment and system\nsolution provider for the field of plant phenotype and agricultural sciences and distributes our\nproducts in China.\n\nPhenoTrait Technology Co., Ltd.\nE-112B\nNo.10 Jiancaicheng East Rd. Haidian District, 100096\nBeijing, China\n\n[+86-10-8292 8854][98]\n[info@phenotrait.com][99]\n[www.phenotrait.com][100]\n\n**Beijing Biopute Technology Co., Ltd.** mainly offers scientific research instruments and system\nsolutions for the plant, food, ecology and environmental industry and distributes our products in\nChina.\n\nBeijing Biopute Technology Co.,Ltd\nRm. 6038, 6040 and 6042, 5F, No.1, CAU Int. Pioneer Park, No.10,\nTianxiu Road, Haidian, Beijing, P.R. China\n\n[+86-10-82794912][101]\n[biopute@126.com][102]\n[www.bjbiopute.cn][103]\n\n**KLV Co., Ltd**. is a known distributor of light sources, optical devices and optical systems in\nJapan and are responsible for the distribution of our products in Japan. KLV has contributed to the\ndevelopment of optical technology in many fields including medical, biological, semiconductor,\nagricultural, environmental and food science for the past 40 years in Japan.\n\nKLV Co.,Ltd\n1-1 kanda-ogawa-machi, chiyoda-ku,\n\nTokyo 101-0052, Japan\n\n[+81-80-6573-9878][104]\n[yamamoto@klv.co.jp][105]\n[www.klv.co.jp][106]\n\n**Wonwoo Systems** is a technological company with engineering basis that distributes scientific and\nindustrial instruments. Wonwoo has specialized in products related to optical, temperature, and\nmeasuring equipment. Wonwoo was established in March 2000 and had the for last 20 years, multiple\nclients of big and small companies, universities and research institutes.\n\nWonwoo Systems Co.,Ltd\nSantevill 106-209, #719, Shindaebang, Dongjak\n\nSeoul, Korea, 156-759\n\n[+82-2-3289-1290][107]\n[sales@wonwoosystem.co.kr][108]\n\n[www.wonwoosystem.co.kr][109]\n\n[Viewsitec logo]\n\n**Viewsitec**, a spin-off of the original HongKe intelligent perception and optoelectronic business,\nstands out as a premier provider in this field. Their focus is to assist customers across diverse\nindustries in enhancing production quality and efficiency. Viewsitec offers a range of solutions,\nincluding visual inspection and recognition, image acquisition, FPGA image processing, and\noptoelectric detection, for applications like industrial inspection, intelligent manufacturing,\nintelligent transportation, and medical care.\n\nViewsitec Technology Co., Ltd\nFloor 1-7, Building T6, PCI Park, No.30 Kaitai Avenue, Huangpu District,\n\nGuangzhou (510700), China\n\n[400-999-3848][110]\n\n[sales@viewsitec.com][111]\n\n[https://viewsitec.com/][112]\n\n## Europe\n\n**Iberoptics Sistemas \u00d3pticos S.L.** is a distributor of photonic and imaging components and systems\nfor scientific and industrial applications, with strong presence in the machine vision market. With\npresence in Portugal and Spain, we also serve Spanish speaking countries of America.\n\nIberoptics Sistemas \u00d3pticos S.L.\nCamino de Hormigueras 124-4, 3\u00baI\n28031 \u2013 Madrid, Spain\n\n[+34-913-854-395][113]\n\n[info@iberoptics.com][114]\n\n[www.iberoptics.com][115]\n\n**PHOT\u2019Innov** is a strong experienced distributor of photonic and imaging components and solution\nfor scientific & industrial applications. We have developed over the last years, a strong knowledge\nin hyperspectral imaging to support our customer locally.\n\nPHOT\u2019Innov SAS\n1 Avenue Neil Armstrong\n33700 Merignac, FRANCE\n\n[+33 785 834 647][116]\n[contact@photinnov.fr][117]\n[www.photinnov.fr][118]\n\n**EC Test Systems** from Poland specializes in providing measurement, diagnostic and simulation\nsolutions in the field of vibrations and acoustics, as well as thermal imaging, high-speed and\nhyperspectral cameras.\n\nEC TEST Systems Sp. z o.o.\nul. Ciep\u0142ownicza 28\n31-574 Krakow\n\n[+48 12 627 77 77][119]\n[biuro@ects.pl][120]\n[www.ects.pl][121]\n\n## Company\n\n[HAIP Solutions Teamphoto in Hannover Hafven.]\n\n## Team\n\nGet to know our team at HAIP Solutions\n\n[ View More ][122]\n[HAIP Solutions jobs]\n\n## Jobs\n\nTake a look at our current job offers\n\n[ View More ][123]\n\n## Keep up with\n## the latest News.\n\n## Receive early access to new arrivals, sales, exclusive content, events and much more!\n\n## *By signing up, you will receive HAIP Solutions offers, promotions and other commercial messages.\n## You are also agreeing to HAIP Solutions's Privacy Policy. You may unsubscribe at any time.\n\n#### HAIP Solutions GmbH\n* [ +49 511 37352860 ][124]\n* [ info@haip-solutions.com ][125]\n* [ Escherstr. 23, 30159 Hannover ][126]\n\n#### Quicklinks\n* [ Products ][127]\n* [ Applications ][128]\n* [ Library ][129]\n* [ Support ][130]\n* [ Company ][131]\n* [ News ][132]\n\n#### Follow us\n* [ LinkedIn ][133]\n* [ Instagram ][134]\n* [ YouTube ][135]\n* [ Facebook ][136]\n\n[Privacy Policy][137]\n\n[Imprint][138]\n\n[Cookie Settings][139]\n\n## Get in touch with us!\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.haip-solutions.com\n[3]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/\n[4]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#cameras\n[5]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#cameras\n[6]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#rgb\n[7]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#vnir\n[8]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#nir\n[9]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#swir\n[10]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#illumination\n[11]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#illumination\n[12]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/blackbright-area/\n[13]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/blackbright-bar/\n[14]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/blackbright-fast-medium-wave-ir/\n[15]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#software\n[16]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#software\n[17]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/hyperspectral-imaging-software/\n[18]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/on-camera-classifier/\n[19]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/#accessories\n[20]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/products/#accessories\n[21]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/blackindustry-station/\n[22]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/\n[23]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/vegetation/\n[24]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/recycling/\n[25]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/food-industry/\n[26]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/geology/\n[27]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/environmental-monitoring/\n[28]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/vegetation/\n[29]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/recycling/\n[30]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/food-industry/\n[31]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/geology/\n[32]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/environmental-monitoring/\n[33]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/library-applications/\n[34]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/library/knowledge-base/\n[35]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/library-applications/application-notes/\n[36]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/library-applications/white-papers/\n[37]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/library-applications/research-publications/\n[38]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/library/press/\n[39]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/news/\n[40]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/support/\n[41]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/company/\n[42]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/company/team/\n[43]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/company/jobs/\n[44]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/company/sales-and-distribution-partners/\n[45]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/company/research-projects/\n[46]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/\n[47]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/#cameras\n[48]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/#illumination\n[49]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/#software\n[50]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-cameras/#accessories\n[51]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/\n[52]: https://www.haip-solutions.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/vegetation/\n[53]: https://www