. Our vision is to capture the highest-precision hyperspectral images at the fastest\npossible speeds without compromising between speed and accuracy. Step by step, we are bringing\ncutting-edge hyperspectral imaging solutions to life.\n\nHypergram provides state-of-the-art hyperspectral cameras and machine vision AI software solutions\ntailored for the automated machinery manufacturing sector.\n\nThank you.\n\nMin H. Kim\n\n## Hyperspectral Camera & AI Software Solution\n\n## HYPERGRAM\n\nHypergram Inc. provides a combined solution that consists of industry-level hyperspectral video\ncamera hardware and advanced spectral image analysis software. The name of our company is derived\nfrom combining these two words: hyper- from hyperspectral camera and -gram from machine vision AI\nprogram. Our unified solution can speed up the existing hyperspectral imaging solution and make it\nwork more accurately in detecting and classifying target objects through the automation machinery\nmanufacturing pipeline. Our machine vision solution will improve non-destructive and automated\ninspection in the manufacturing, food, recycling, and biomedical industries. Our team is dedicated\nto revolutionizing the way businesses conduct quality control and inspection processes. With\ncutting-edge technology and a passion for innovation, we aim to set new standards in the machine\nvision industry.\n\n## CI Concept\n\n[ci_symbol.png]\n\nOur company\u2019s logo symbolizes the energy of light refracted through a prism, depicting the\ntransition from short to long wavelengths. The fusion of two prisms, spiraling together, represents\nthe integration of innovative technologies: hyperspectral imaging and AI software solution in the\nautomation machinery manufactoring while also forming the initial \"H\" of Hypergram. This logo\nembodies our vision of \"Beyond Human Visibility,\" presenting new possibilities that go beyond the\nlimits of human sight in industrial machine vision applications.\n\n## H