      "polished_summary": "Imec Int is the world's largest independent research and innovation center specializing in nanoelectronics and digital technology, dedicated to advancing cutting-edge technologies. The company offers a range of services, including semiconductor manufacturing, research and development, education and workforce development, and advanced chip design, targeting businesses, industrial partners, startups, and individuals in various industries such as healthcare, automotive, agritech, energy, and telecommunications.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Imec Int is a leading research and innovation center specializing in nanoelectronics and digital technology, which includes the development of semiconductor technologies and sensing systems. Their focus on advanced chip design and semiconductor manufacturing directly aligns with the spectral sensor market.",
