            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Home] ][2]\n\n## Header navigation\n* [Join us][3]\n* [About us][4]\n* [Download][5]\n* [FAQ][6]\n* [News & Events][7]\n* [Contact][8]\n\nAsia (the rest) | English\n\n##### Switzerland\n* [German][9]\n* [English][10]\n* [Fran\u00e7ais][11]\n\n##### Europe\n* [English][12]\n* [German][13]\n* [Fran\u00e7ais][14]\n\n##### Czech Republic\n* [\u010cesky][15]\n* [English][16]\n\n##### USA & Americas\n* [English][17]\n\n##### Central & South America\n* [English][18]\n\n##### China\n* [\u7b80\u4f53\u4e2d\u6587][19]\n\n##### Asia (the rest)\n* [English][20]\n\n##### Africa & Middle East\n* [English][21]\n\nIs the selected language correct? Yes\n\n##### CHF\n* [CHF][22]\n* [EUR][23]\n* [USD][24]\n\n## User account menu\n* [Login][25]\n\n## Favourites\n* [Favourites][26]\n\nToggle search form\nSearch\n\n## Main navigation\n* [Sensor shop][27]\n  * [Sensor Finder & Shop][28]\n  * [Temperature][29]\n  * [Flow][30]\n  * [Humidity][31]\n  * [Conductivity][32]\n  * [Bio][33]\n  * [Force][34]\n  * [Surface Strain][35]\n  * [Torque][36]\n  * [Density & Viscosity][37]\n  * [Quality][38]\n* [Micro-Heaters][39]\n* [IR-Emitters][40]\n* [Customized Sensors][41]\n  * [Development & Technology Partner][42]\n  * [Technology & Sensor Overview][43]\n  * [Silicon technology][44]\n  * [OEM & Sensor Integration Solutions][45]\n  * [Production Process][46]\n  * [Special sensor characteristics & customization][47]\n  * [Quality][48]\n* [Industries][49]\n  * [Heating, Ventilation & Air Conditioning][50]\n  * [Automotive & Transportation][51]\n  * [E-mobility & Fuel Cell][52]\n  * [Space][53]\n  * [Optics & Laser, 5G, Telecommunication][54]\n  * [IOT and Process Control][55]\n  * [Renewable energy][56]\n  * [Medical Devices][57]\n  * [Bioprocessing][58]\n  * [Preventive Maintenance][59]\n* |\n* [DNA/RNA Extraction][60]\n\n## Favourites\n* [Favourites][61]\n\nToggle search form\n\n## Main navigation (mobile)\n* [Sensor shop][62]\n  * [Sensor Finder & Shop][63]\n  * [Temperature][64]\n  * [Flow][65]\n  * [Humidity][66]\n  * [Conductivity][67]\n  * [Bio][68]\n  * [Force][69]\n  * [Surface Strain][70]\n  * [Torque][71]\n  * [Density & Viscosity][72]\n  * [Quality][73]\n* [Micro-Heaters][74]\n* [IR-Emitters][75]\n* [Customized Sensors][76]\n  * [Development & Technology Partner][77]\n  * [Technology & Sensor Overview][78]\n  * [Silicon technology][79]\n  * [OEM & Sensor Integration Solutions][80]\n  * [Production Process][81]\n  * [Special sensor characteristics & customization][82]\n  * [Quality][83]\n* [Industries][84]\n  * [Heating, Ventilation & Air Conditioning][85]\n  * [Automotive & Transportation][86]\n  * [E-mobility & Fuel Cell][87]\n  * [Space][88]\n  * [Optics & Laser, 5G, Telecommunication][89]\n  * [IOT and Process Control][90]\n  * [Renewable energy][91]\n  * [Medical Devices][92]\n  * [Bioprocessing][93]\n  * [Preventive Maintenance][94]\n* |\n* [DNA/RNA Extraction][95]\n\n## Header navigation (mobile)\n* [Join us][96]\n* [About us][97]\n* [Download][98]\n* [FAQ][99]\n* [News & Events][100]\n* [Contact][101]\n\n## User account menu (mobile)\n* [Login][102]\n\nAsia (the rest) | English\n\n##### Switzerland\n* [German][103]\n* [English][104]\n* [Fran\u00e7ais][105]\n\n##### Europe\n* [English][106]\n* [German][107]\n* [Fran\u00e7ais][108]\n\n##### Czech Republic\n* [\u010cesky][109]\n* [English][110]\n\n##### USA & Americas\n* [English][111]\n\n##### Central & South America\n* [English][112]\n\n##### China\n* [\u7b80\u4f53\u4e2d\u6587][113]\n\n##### Asia (the rest)\n* [English][114]\n\n##### Africa & Middle East\n* [English][115]\n\nIs the selected language correct? Yes\n\n##### CHF\n* [CHF][116]\n* [EUR][117]\n* [USD][118]\n\nToggle search form\nSearch\n\n# Cryo-temperature sensor\n\nNEW\n\nReliable, cost-saving measurement at cryogenic conditions\n\n[Read more][119]\n[Cryosensor for liquid hydrogen]\n\n# High-performance temperature sensing\n\nNEW\n\nComponent overmolding in electronics - the solution for demanding applications\n\n[Find out more][120]\n[Cable lug]\n\n# WHITEPAPER: DEW POINT MONITORING\n\nout now\n\nPrecise Dew Point Measurement\nat Low Humidity\n\n[Download][121]\n[Dew point monitoring]\n\n# FDS.A Double gas flow sensor\n\nwith decoupled heater and temperature element\nfor high sensitivity at low flow rates\n\n[Read more][122]\n[iST_product_flow_FDS.A]\n\n# Precision conductivity measurement made easy\n\nHigh-performance sensors for high, medium, and low conductivity measurement \u00a0- applicable across\nvarious industries\n\n[Read more][123]\n[Conductivty sensor for flow cel]\n\n# Your partner and manufacturer\n\nof physical, chemical and biological sensors\n\n[sensors][124]\n[iST_Headquater]\nPrevious Next\n\nAt Innovative Sensor Technology IST AG we specialize in the\u00a0 development and manufacturing of\ntemperature sensors, thermal mass flow sensors, humidity sensors, conductivity sensors and\nbiosensors.\n\nIn addition to our standard products, we offer sensor adaptations to individual, customer-specific\napplication needs - right up to the joint development of new technologies. iST-sensors are\ncharacterized by their accuracy and consistency in various measurement conditions. They are used in\nmeasuring instruments for various applications, such as med-tech, process control, automation, EVs,\u00a0\naerospace, test and measurement or biotechnology.\n\n## Product Finder\n\n\u00a0The product finder helps you to narrow down the search for the right sensor, heater or IR-emitter.\nStart by selecting the product group.\u00a0The shop features a small selection of our most popular\nstandardized sensors. It offers the possibility to order small quantities. Should you require larger\nquantities of sensors or don't find what you are looking for, please [contact us][125].\n\n### [Temperature ][126]\n\n[\nImage\n[iST_Temperature_Sensors]\n][127]\n\n### [Flow ][128]\n\n[\nImage\n[iST_Flow_Sensors]\n][129]\n\n### [Force ][130]\n\n[\nImage\n[iST_Force_Sensors]\n][131]\n\n### [Humidity ][132]\n\n[\nImage\n[iST_Humidity_Sensors]\n][133]\n\n### [Conductivity ][134]\n\n[\nImage\n[iST_Conductivity_Sensors]\n][135]\n\n### [Bio ][136]\n\n[\nImage\n[iST_Biosensors]\n][137]\n\n### [Micro Heaters ][138]\n\n[\nImage\n[iST_Micro_Heaters]\n][139]\n\n### [Infrared Emitters ][140]\n\n[\nImage\n[iST_IR_Emitters]\n][141]\n[Start search][142]\n\n> Quality, wide product range and possibility of customizations\n> \n> Answer from customer satisfaction survey 2024\n\n## New arrivals\n\niST introduced novelties in all sensor categories at this year's Sensor+Test\u00a0 in Nuremberg. For\nthose who were unable to attend the fair can look them up on our novelties page.\n\n\u00a0\n\n\u00a0\n\n[View our novelties][143]\n[Visit FAQ page][144]\n[20 millimeters and sensors]\n\n### Minimized to the max\n\nHow many sensors fit into one centimeter?\n\nMeeting the demand for faster performance and lower power consumption in electronic devices iST's\nportfolio of miniaturized RTDs is growing. Meet our smalles sensor generation.\n\n[Read more][145]\n[Moisture in oil whitepaper]\n\n### Moisture in Oil\n\nWHITE PAPER\n\nContinuous monitoring of moisture in oil is key to running preventive maintenance economically and /\nor to trigger automated counter-measures within the monitored system.\n\n[Download Whitepaper][146]\n[Flyer Emission monitoring]\n\n### Sensors for Emission Monitoring\n\nSUSTAINABILITY\n\nWith ever stricter environmental regulations and ambitious pollution reduction targets the demand\nfor reliable and robust gas analyzers is rapidly growing. Learn which of iST's reliable and robust\nsensors and modules are an indispensible ingredient of many air quality monitoring systems and\nanalyzers.\n\n[Read more][147]\n[HiRel Sensors for Space applications]\n\n### Sensors for Outer Space\n\nESCC qualified\n\nWe not only offer the only Hi-Rel ESCC-certified thin-film platinum temperature sensors but also\nhold the ESCC qualification for the wire extensions.\u00a0All iST Space sensors are available both as\nflight models (FM) and engineering models (EM) and are also suitable for other High Reliability\n(Hi-Rel) applications in the aerospace or automotive industries.\n\n[Download Flyer][148]\n\n> Creativity is inventing new things. Innovation is doing new things\n> \n> Theodore Levitt\n\n## Product highlights\n\n### Micro-Heaters\n\nFor precise, reliable and cost-efficient heating of solids, liquids and gases: our micro heaters are\ncustom-built to fit your application's requirements.\n\n[Read more][149]\n\n### Thermal infrared emitters\n\nThermal infrared emitters for gas analysis, material detection &\u00a0spectroscopy are used in numerous\napplications across a wide range of industries.\n\n[Read more][150]\n\n### Nucleic Acid Extraction\n\nSpin Filter, Magnetic Beads, Smart Modified Surface or Polymer Mediated Enrichment: Automated or\nmanual, find the right extraction technology and platform.\n\n[Read more][151]\n\n## Our expertise\n\nOur advanced expertise is driven by the challenge of being at the cutting edge of the industry. We\ncontinuously improve existing technologies by working closely with customers to find optimal sensor\nsolutions for specific application requirements and by collaborating with a wide network of\npartners, including institutes and universities.\n\n### Tailor-made sensor solutions\n\nWe develop customized sensors, from minor modifications of standard sensors to complete new product\ndevelopment to meet the requirements of your application.\n\n### Flexible quantities and fast production\n\nWe produce various quantities of sensors in short development and production times.\n\n### Development and consultation\n\nAs a technology partner, we offer sensor technology development and consulting in our\nstate-of-the-art facilities.\n\n### Support\n\nOur experts offer support from vision through development to after-sales services.\n\n### Wide product range\n\nWe develop and manufacture sensors that are customizable across a wide range of products.\n\n### Partnership\n\nWe work closely with our customers to find the optimal sensor solution that meets the exact needs of\ntheir application.\n\n> I am very satisfied with iST and have known the company for over 20 years since I founded my\n> company.\n> \n> Answer from the Customer Satisfaction Survey 2021\n\n## Customized Sensors\n\nWhile you can find our standard sensors using the sensor finder above, contact us for a sensor\nsolution tailored to your application requirements.\n\n[Learn more][152]\n[Quality Assurance]\nQuality assurance\n\nAs an ISO 9001:2015 (quality) and ISO 14001:2015 (environment) certified company, our processes are\ndesigned around our customer\u2019s needs. Our highly trained and empowered employees as well as our\nquality management system form the foundation and essential framework for establishing standards,\ncommunicating them, and consistently integrating them into daily work.\n\n[More about IST-Quality][153]\n\n## What our employees say about working at iST\n\n[Employee IST AG Andrea R\u00fcegg]\n\niST has always encouraged and supported me in my endeavours. I have been able to further develop\nmyself, take on new tasks and responsibilities and I am proud and grateful to be part of this great\nteam.\n\nAndrea R\u00fcegg\nAssistant to the CEO\n@iST since 2001\n\n### Your supplier and partner\n\nfor physical, chemical and biological sensors\n\n## Subscribe Newsletter\n* Stay updated and informed about our latest product developments\n* [Subscribe now][154]\n\n## Footer main menu\n* [iST Group:][155]\n* [Infrasolid][156]\n* [iST Innuscreen][157]\n* [iST Jobst][158]\n* [iST Senstech][159]\n* [Sensors][160]\n* [Quality][161]\n* [Contact][162]\n* [Downloads][163]\n* [Jobs][164]\n* [Frequently asked questions][165]\n* [Industries][166]\n* [Whistleblower system human & environment][167]\n\n## Our Shops\n* [Sensor Finder & Shop][168]\n* [Customized solutions][169]\n* [DNA & RNA Extraction Kits][170]\n\n## Footer copyright menu\n* [Sitemap][171]\n* [Terms][172]\n* [Privacy][173]\n* [Login][174]\n* [Imprint][175]\n\n## Find us from:\n* [Xing][176]\n* [LinkedIn][177]\n* [Facebook][178]\n* [Youtube][179]\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: /en\n[3]: /en/join-us\n[4]: /en/about-us\n[5]: /en/download\n[6]: /en/faq\n[7]: /en/news-events\n[8]: /en/contact-us\n[9]: /de/ist-homepage-innovative-sensor-technology?istr=1&currency=CHF\n[10]: /en/homepage-ist-innovative-sensor-technology?istr=1&currency=CHF\n[11]: /fr/homepage?istr=1&currency=CHF\n[12]: /en/homepage-ist-innovative-sensor-technology?istr=257&currency=EUR\n[13]: /de/ist-homepage-innovative-sensor-techno"
          }
        ]
