      "company_function": "manufacturer",
      "company_summary": "Light Guide Optics Pvt. Ltd., established in 1997 and certified ISO 9001:2015, specializes in the design and manufacture of high precision conventional and non-conventional optics, as well as opto-mechanical systems. The company offers a range of products and services, including precision optical components, opto-mechanical system design, and optical system integration, catering to industries such as defence, medical OEM, atomic research, and laser and photonics. With a focus on meeting the needs of research institutions and industries requiring precision optics, Light Guide Optics is committed to delivering high-quality solutions tailored to customer specifications.",
