        "crawl_text": "Light Guide Optics Pvt. Ltd. ISO 9001:2015 certified India ISO 9001:2015 ISO 14001:2015 Speed and precision in completing jobs Commitment to zero defect manufacturing Strong engineering background ISO 9001:2015 ISO 14001:2015 43-A, Pologround Industrial Estate INDORE 452015 (M.P.) INDIA India Pan-India LightGuide\n\nToggle navigation\n\nHOME\n\nAbout Us\n\nPRODUCTS\n\nDefence\n\nMedical OEM\n\nAtomic Research\n\nLaser and Photonics\n\nCOMPANY POLICY\n\nRECRUITMENTS\n\nCONTACT US\n\nWelcome back to Light Guide\n\nOptics Technology is a progressively dynamic scenario. Customers\u2019 needs become more specialized as the application of this technology in the field of research and industry become more widespread. Light Guide, is an endeavor to meet these expectations by offering total opto-mechanical solution.\n\nWe are always available to help you design a component to meet your specific requirements. Small volume production is our core strength. We look forward to be a partners in your development and prototyping activity.\n\nLight Guide, looks forward to assist you by providing\n\nPrecision optical components\n\nOpto-mechanical components\n\nOptical Instruments\n\nOpto-mechanical system design\n\nPrecision mechanical machining\n\nOptical system integration\n\nAbout us\n\nLight Guide Optics Pvt.\nLtd. is an ISO 9001:2015 company, established in 1997 to\ncater requirement of precision optics of domestic as well as\nexport market. Light Guide is backed by a strong\nengineering business group, engaged in multifarious activities\nlike paper manufacturing, heavy machine manufacturing and mechanical\nengineering consultancy.\n\nLight Guide is well equipped to design and\nmanufacture high precision conventional and non-conventional\noptics as small as 2mm to as large as 1200mm. Plane, spherical,\ncylindrical and aspheric surfaces can be fabricated. We can\nprocess a variety of optical materials like various optical\nglasses, fused silica, Silicon carbide, crystals like quartz,\ncalcite, KTP, KDP, LiNbO3, ZnS, ZnSe and metals like stainless\nsteel, copper, brass, nickel etc. A milestone was achieved\nwhen we developed in-house, process of polishing metal optics,\nnot achieved by any other industry in India, till date. The\nprocess was upgraded to polish Large Aperture Metal Mirrors.\nOur 500mm diameter Gold Coated Metal Mirror for high power\nCO2 laser application is the largest of its kind in India.\nWe have produced a number of metal mirrors for beam deviation,\nbeam focusing, collimation and resonator applications since\nthen.\n\nOpto-mechanical system design is the thrust area for our\nnew developmental activities. System design, design optimization\nand product realization is possible due to a well-equipped\nmechanical and electroplating facility. The collaborative\nefforts of our designs, optics and mechanical workshop have\nresulted into design and production of world-class instruments\nlike Radiation Resistant Macroscope for Nuclear Application.\nWe have developed various instruments like interferometers,\nbeam expanders, telescopes, special purpose microscopes etc.\n\nThe production activity is well supported by test facility.\nOptics test lab is equipped with various optical instruments\nlike autocollimators, collimators, beam expanders, optical\nbench, centering microscope, lasers, interferometers etc.\nMost of these instruments were developed in-house.\n\nLight Guide is a professionally managed\ncompany, headed by Siddhartha Dhawale. We have a hard working\nand talented team, well trained in their discipline, for any\ncritical and demanding job.\n\nIn last eight years, demand of various R&amp;D institutes\nand Universities have been catered, which includes CAT (Indore),\nBARC (Mumbai), TIFR (Mumbai), LASTEC (Delhi), IPR (Gandhi\nNagar), CVRDE (Avadi), Pune University, Indore University,\nCalcutta University. Some well-known industries where laser\nmachining is being done (like ancillaries of Maruti Udyog\nLtd.) are our regular customers for Gold Coated Copper Mirrors\nfor CO2 Laser application\n\nDevelopment is an ongoing\nprocess at Light Guide . Some of our ongoing\nactivities are:\n\n1. Design and manufacture\nof high precision mirror mounts for large mirrors.\n\n2. Design and manufacture of Radiation Resistant Scanning Type\nVertical Periscope for Hot Cell application.\n\n3. Process development for making lightweight telescope mirrors\nby glass fusion.\n\n4. Design and development of collector for LIDAR.\n\n5. Machine vision instruments for mechanical shop-floor.\n\nThe unmatched strength\nof Light Guide is their speed and precision\nto complete a job in stipulated time. The determination to offer\nbest services to the customer is a commitment of Light\nGuide .\n\n95%\n\nWeb Design & Development\n\n80%\n\nDigital Marketing\n\n60%\n\nBusiness Development\n\n85%\n\n-->\n\nPRODUCTS\n-->\n\nDefence\n\nMedical OEM\n\nAtomic research\n\nLaser and photonics\n\n4000\n\nHappy Clients\n\n200\n\nModern Websites\n\nWINNING AWARDS\n\n24/7\n\nFast Support\n\nThemeum\n\nIntroducing Shortcode generator for Helix V2 based templates #helixframework #joomla http://bit.ly/1qlgwav\n\nIntroducing Shortcode generator for Helix V2 based templates #helixframework #joomla http://bit.ly/1qlgwav\n\nIntroducing Shortcode generator for Helix V2 based templates #helixframework #joomla http://bit.ly/1qlgwav\n\nCOMPANY POLICY\n-->\n\nWe the management and employees' of Light Guide Optics Pvt. Ltd., are committed to manufacture all defined product with zero defect and minimum waste generation enabling them to meet defined requirement of the customer.\n\nOur pursuit for the excellence is for increasing confidence level and satisfaction of our customers and meeting their rising expectations by way of training to all employees and building team work.\n\nWe, are also committed to continual improvement in the manufacturing process and systems, thereby achieving the defined Quality Objectives from time to time.\n\nLoad More\n-->\n\nContact Us\n\nWe are just a click away. Please fill up this form to send your queries and suggestions and we will get back to you promptly regarding your request.\n\n&nbsp\n\n&nbsp\n\n&nbsp\n\nYour message has been sent successfully.\n\nSorry, error occured this time sending your message.\n\nSend Now\n\nLight Guide Optics Pvt. Ltd.\n\nAddress: 43-A, Pologround Industrial Estate INDORE 452015 (M.P.) INDIA\n\nPhone: +91-731-2422257\n\nTelefax: +91-731-2422257\n\nEmail: mail@lightguide.org\n\nWebsite: lightguide.co.in\n\nZED Gold\n\nISO 9001:2015\n\nISO 14001:2015\n\n-->\n\nLight Guide Optics Pvt Ltd &copy; 2024. All Rights Reserved. lightguide.co.in LightGuide\n\nToggle navigation\n\nHOME\n\nAbout Us\n\nPRODUCTS\n\nDefence\n\nMedical OEM\n\nAtomic Research\n\nLaser and Photonics\n\nCOMPANY POLICY\n\nRECRUITMENTS\n\nCONTACT US\n\nWelcome back to Light Guide\n\nOptics Technology is a progressively dynamic scenario. Customers\u2019 needs become more specialized as the application of this technology in the field of research and industry become more widespread. Light Guide, is an endeavor to meet these expectations by offering total opto-mechanical solution.\n\nWe are always available to help you design a component to meet your specific requirements. Small volume production is our core strength. We look forward to be a partners in your development and prototyping activity.\n\nLight Guide, looks forward to assist you by providing\n\nPrecision optical components\n\nOpto-mechanical components\n\nOptical Instruments\n\nOpto-mechanical system design\n\nPrecision mechanical machining\n\nOptical system integration\n\nAbout us\n\nLight Guide Optics Pvt.\nLtd. is an ISO 9001:2015 company, established in 1997 to\ncater requirement of precision optics of domestic as well as\nexport market. Light Guide is backed by a strong\nengineering business group, engaged in multifarious activities\nlike paper manufacturing, heavy machine manufacturing and mechanical\nengineering consultancy.\n\nLight Guide is well equipped to design and\nmanufacture high precision conventional and non-conventional\noptics as small as 2mm to as large as 1200mm. Plane, spherical,\ncylindrical and aspheric surfaces can be fabricated. We can\nprocess a variety of optical materials like various optical\nglasses, fused silica, Silicon carbide, crystals like quartz,\ncalcite, KTP, KDP, LiNbO3, ZnS, ZnSe and metals like stainless\nsteel, copper, brass, nickel etc. A milestone was achieved\nwhen we developed in-house, process of polishing metal optics,\nnot achieved by any other industry in India, till date. The\nprocess was upgraded to polish Large Aperture Metal Mirrors.\nOur 500mm diameter Gold Coated Metal Mirror for high power\nCO2 laser application is the largest of its kind in India.\nWe have produced a number of metal mirrors for beam deviation,\nbeam focusing, collimation and resonator applications since\nthen.\n\nOpto-mechanical system design is the thrust area for our\nnew developmental activities. System design, design optimization\nand product realization is possible due to a well-equipped\nmechanical and electroplating facility. The collaborative\nefforts of our designs, optics and mechanical workshop have\nresulted into design and production of world-class instruments\nlike Radiation Resistant Macroscope for Nuclear Application.\nWe have developed various instruments like interferometers,\nbeam expanders, telescopes, special purpose microscopes etc.\n\nThe production activity is well supported by test facility.\nOptics test lab is equipped with various optical instruments\nlike autocollimators, collimators, beam expanders, optical\nbench, centering microscope, lasers, interferometers etc.\nMost of these instruments were developed in-house.\n\nLight Guide is a professionally managed\ncompany, headed by Siddhartha Dhawale. We have a hard working\nand talented team, well trained in their discipline, for any\ncritical and demanding job.\n\nIn last eight years, demand of various R&amp;D institutes\nand Universities have been catered, which includes CAT (Indore),\nBARC (Mumbai), TIFR (Mumbai), LASTEC (Delhi), IPR (Gandhi\nNagar), CVRDE (Avadi), Pune University, Indore University,\nCalcutta University. Some well-known industries where laser\nmachining is being done (like ancillaries of Maruti Udyog\nLtd.) are our regular customers for Gold Coated Copper Mirrors\nfor CO2 Laser application\n\nDevelopment is an ongoing\nprocess at Light Guide . Some of our ongoing\nactivities are:\n\n1. Design and manufacture\nof high precision mirror mounts for large mirrors.\n\n2. Design and manufacture of Radiation Resistant Scanning Type\nVertical Periscope for Hot Cell application.\n\n3. Process development for making lightweight telescope mirrors\nby glass fusion.\n\n4. Design and development of collector for LIDAR.\n\n5. Machine vision instruments for mechanical shop-floor.\n\nThe unmatched strength\nof Light Guide is their speed and precision\nto complete a job in stipulated time. The determination to offer\nbest services to the customer is a commitment of Light\nGuide .\n\n95%\n\nWeb Design & Development\n\n80%\n\nDigital Marketing\n\n60%\n\nBusiness Development\n\n85%\n\n-->\n\nPRODUCTS\n-->\n\nDefence\n\nMedical OEM\n\nAtomic research\n\nLaser and photonics\n\n4000\n\nHappy Clients\n\n200\n\nModern Websites\n\nWINNING AWARDS\n\n24/7\n\nFast Support\n\nThemeum\n\nIntroducing Shortcode generator for Helix V2 based templates #helixframework #joomla http://bit.ly/1qlgwav\n\nIntroducing Shortcode generator for Helix V2 based templates #helixframework #joomla http://bit.ly/1qlgwav\n\nIntroducing Shortcode generator for Helix V2 based templates #helixframework #joomla http://bit.ly/1qlgwav\n\nCOMPANY POLICY\n-->\n\nWe the management and employees' of Light Guide Optics Pvt. Ltd., are committed to manufacture all defined product with zero defect and minimum waste generation enabling them to meet defined requirement o