      "key_products": "Precision Optical Components, Opto-Mechanical Components, Optical Instruments, Optical System Integration",
      "polished_summary": "Light Guide Optics Pvt. Ltd., established in 1997 and certified ISO 9001:2015, specializes in the design and manufacture of high precision conventional and non-conventional optics, as well as opto-mechanical systems. The company offers a range of products and services, including precision optical components, opto-mechanical system design, and optical system integration, catering to industries such as defence, medical OEM, atomic research, and laser and photonics. With a focus on meeting the needs of research institutions and industries requiring precision optics, Light Guide Optics is committed to delivering high-quality solutions tailored to customer specifications.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Light Guide Optics Pvt. Ltd. designs and manufactures precision optical components and opto-mechanical systems, which are directly applicable to the spectral sensor market. Their focus on high precision optics for applications in defense, medical OEM, and atomic research indicates a strong relevance to the target market.",
