      "key_products": "Arduino UNO R3; 3D Printing Service; Laser Cutting Service; PCB Manufacturing Service; Custom Battery Pack",
      "polished_summary": "Robu is a leading online store in India specializing in electronics components, robotics, and 3D printing services. The company offers a diverse range of products, including development boards like the Arduino UNO R3, custom 3D printing, laser cutting, PCB manufacturing, and tailored battery packs, catering to electronics enthusiasts, hobbyists, students, and businesses in need of innovative solutions. With a commitment to quality and customer service, Robu serves various industries, including electronics and robotics.",
