rocessing of your personal information.\n\nSubmit\nThanks for submitting the form.\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Laminar\nAll rights reserved.\n[Privacy policy][36]\n[Terms & Conditions][37]\n**Formerly**\n\n[1]: https://runlaminar.com/press/laminar-named-a-2026-world-economic-forum-technology-pioneer\n[2]: /about\n[3]: /careers\n[4]: /in-the-news\n[5]: /solutions/clean-in-place\n[6]: /solutions/product-changeover-optimization\n[7]: /solutions/batch-optimization\n[8]: /solutions/real-time-quality-analysis\n[9]: /industries/food-beverage\n[10]: /industries/flavor-fragrance\n[11]: /industries/breweries\n[12]: /industries/health-beauty\n[13]: /industries/consumer-packaged-goods-cpg\n[14]: /key-specs\n[15]: /how-it-works\n[16]: https://na2.hubs.ly/H02wNqt0\n[17]: /case-studies\n[18]: /resource-center\n[19]: /blog\n[20]: /contact\n[21]: /case-studies/unilever-laminar-clean-in-place-optimization\n[22]: #\n[23]: /case-studies/transforming-cip-for-a-global-beverage-leader\n[24]: /case-studies/unilever-laminar-clean-in-place-optimization\n[25]: /case-studies/fine-chemicals-company-saves-80-000-per-year\n[26]: /\n[27]: https://app.runlaminar.com/\n[28]: /about\n[29]: /blog\n[30]: /in-the-news\n[31]: /tech/deployment\n[32]: /frequently-asked-questions\n[33]: /careers\n[34]: mailto:hello@runlaminar.com\n[35]: tel:6177417384\n[36]: /legal/privacy-policy\n[37]: /legal/terms-conditions"
