      "key_products": "Clean-in-Place Optimization, Product Changeover Optimization, Batch & Line Optimization, Real-time Quality Analysis",
      "polished_summary": "Runlaminar specializes in advanced spectral sensors and machine learning solutions designed to optimize manufacturing processes, particularly within the food and beverage industry. Their core offerings include AI-powered solutions for Clean-in-Place (CIP) optimization, product changeover efficiency, batch and line optimization, and real-time quality analysis, all aimed at enhancing operational efficiency, reducing waste, and ensuring product consistency. With a focus on delivering substantial savings and improved performance, Runlaminar serves a diverse range of sectors including food and beverage, flavor and fragrance, brewing, health and beauty, and consumer packaged goods.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Runlaminar specializes in advanced spectral sensors specifically designed for optimizing manufacturing processes, particularly in the food and beverage industry. Their products, such as Clean-in-Place (CIP) Optimization and real-time quality analysis, directly align with the spectral sensor market.",
