      "polished_summary": "Titan Eye+ is a prominent optical retail chain in India, specializing in a diverse array of eyewear products such as eyeglasses, sunglasses, contact lenses, and hearing aids. Committed to enhancing vision and hearing health, the company offers comprehensive services including eye and hearing tests, catering to the general public and individuals with specific vision or hearing needs. With a focus on quality and customization, Titan Eye+ aims to provide accessible solutions for all customers.",
