      "website": "wyvern.space",
      "is_seed": false,
      "company_function": "vendor",
      "company_summary": "Wyvern is a high-resolution hyperspectral imagery company dedicated to providing organizations with detailed environmental data to support smarter, more sustainable decision-making. Its core offerings include advanced hyperspectral imagery, free open data for research and validation, and a growing archive library of historical imagery, catering to industries such as agriculture, energy, mining, and forestry. By leveraging cutting-edge satellite technology, Wyvern aims to enhance accessibility to critical data for a better understanding of our planet.",
      "operational_presence": "Not stated on website",
