          {
            "url": "https://www.wyvern.space/product",
            "text": "Instructions\nTo make this component work follow these steps:\n1. Remove the delete-this-class class from the navbar14_component div. This will change the\npositioning of the navbar to fixed.\n2. Add the navbar-on-page class to the page-wrapper class. This will ensure that the navbar is\ncentered on the page.\n3. Add the max-width-full class to the main-wrapper class. This will ensure all sections inside of\nthe main wrapper are full-wdith.\n[Products][1]\n[Hyperspectral imagery][2][\nArchive\n][3][\nOpen Data\n][4]\n[Technology][5]\n[Industries][6]\n[Agriculture][7][Peace and security][8][Forestry and ESG][9][Energy][10][Mining][11]\nCompany\n[About us][12][Join us][13]\nResources\n[Resource library][14][Knowledge centre][15][\nKnowledge Centre\n][16][\nProduct Guide\n][17][\nOpen Data\n][18][Product guide][19][Open data][20]\n[Partners][21]\nContact Us\n][22][\nOrder imagery\n][23]\n\n# See the full spectrum\n\nHyperspectral imagery reveals the chemical and physical properties of the Earth\u2019s surface in\nunprecedented detail.\n\n[Order imagery][24][\nContact us\n][25]\n\n## Insights in\n## every pixel\n\nHyperspectral sensors capture material-level information and subtle environmental changes that other\nsensors miss. Our exceptional imagery offers a true view of ground conditions and greater confidence\noperating in complex, fast-changing environments.\n\nWe offer multiple ways to access our high-resolution hyperspectral imagery:\n\n## Flexible access to our images\n\nWe\u2019re on a mission to make high-quality hyperspectral imagery widely accessible. We offer multiple\nways to get started from on-demand imaging to free, open data.\n\n### Satellite tasking\n\nOn-demand hyperspectral imaging tailored to specific times, locations, and spectral requirements.\nChoose from standard and premium tasking for new imagery collection.\n\n### Assured capacity\n\nPre-reserved imaging capacity for high-priority and emergency areas of interest. Guarantee\nconsistent, uninterrupted collection during competitive imaging seasons.\n\n### The archive library\n\nA growing collection of historical hyperspectral imagery for testing, trend analysis, and model\ntraining. Our archive contains global imagery from 2023 onwards.\n\n### Open data\n\nFree, unrestricted access to 100+ high-resolution images from our constellation. Test and validate\nnew applications, accelerate product development, and explore the potential of hyperspectral\nimagery.\n\n## Insights in\n## every pixel\n\nHyperspectral sensors capture material-level information and subtle environmental changes that other\nsensors miss. Our exceptional imagery offers a true view of ground conditions and greater confidence\noperating in complex, fast-changing environments.\n\nWe offer multiple ways to access our high-resolution hyperspectral imagery:\n\n### On-demand tasking\n\nHyperspectral imaging tailored to specific times and locations. Choose from standard and premium\ntasking for new imagery collection.\n\n### Assured capacity\n\nPre-reserved imaging capacity for high-priority and emergency areas of interest. Guarantee\nconsistent, uninterrupted collection during competitive imaging seasons.\n\n### Archive library\n\nA growing collection of historical hyperspectral imagery for testing, trend analysis, and model\ntraining. Order single images or subscribe\u2014no tasking necessary.\n\n### Free open data\n\nFree access to 100+ high-resolution images from our constellation. Test new applications, accelerate\nproduct development, and explore the potential of hyperspectral.\n\n### Order imagery\n\nContact our orders team\n\n][26][\n\nOrder via API\n\n][27][\n\nExplore Archive Library\n\n][28][\n\nExplore Open Data\n\n][29]\n\n### Canadian government user?\n\nOrder imagery through our NMSO\n\n][30]\n\n## The difference is in the detail\n\nMultispectral imagery only captures a few broad spectral bands\u2014not enough to see the underlying\nchemistry of a target. Hyperspectral imagery shows you what matters.\n\nHyperspectral\nRGB\n\n### Precise material identification\n\nIdentify materials by composition, ensuring accuracy when it\u2019s most important.\n\n### Earlier change\n### detection\n\nSpot and mitigate potential risks before they have widespread impact.\n\n### Greater certainty, more confidence\n\nReduce the need for additional tasking by capturing more information per scene, lower validation\ncosts, and act with confidence.\n\n## Decision-grade data\n\n5.3 ground sampling distance at nadir\n\nUp to 31 spectral bands in VNIR range\n\n16-30 nm spectral resolution\n\nOptimized signal-to-noise ratio\n\nSame-day tasking available\n\nDelivery in hours, not days\n\nExplore our imagery\n][31]\n\n## Designed for easy integration\n\nOur industry leading hyperspectral satellite imagery is pre-processed and compatible with major GIS\nand ML tools for fast integration into your existing workflows.\n\nLooking for insights? We deliver decision-ready analytics and reporting products through our\npartners.\n\nExplore our partners\n][32]\nImportant:\nIf you rename this component, remember to update the classes in the HTML embed named\nlayout423_hover-content. Background colors for cards are controlled by selecting the card element\nand editing via the Interactions tab.\n\n## Explore the possibilities\n\nOur high-resolution hyperspectral imagery gives critical industries the clarity to make smarter,\nfaster, more sustainable decisions.\n\nDiscover applications\n][33]\n\n### Agriculture\n\nClassify crops with precision, detect disease early, and accurately forecast yields.\n\nLearn more\n][34][\n\n### Peace and security\n\nEnhance detection, identification, and monitoring in complex environments.\n\nLearn more\n][35][\n\n### Forestry and ESG\n\nMap species, monitor forest health, and stop threats before they become widespread.\n\nLearn more\n][36][\n\n### Energy\n\nRapidly map and analyze resources, reduce infrastructure downtime, and speed remediation.\n\nLearn more\n][37][\n\n### Mining\n\nReduce costs and improve safety from early exploration to post\u2011closure rehabilitation.\n\nLearn more\n][38]\n\n### Pelican narrows wildfire\n\nColour-infrared imagery of the Pelican Narrows wildfires in Saskatchewan showing active fire fronts\nwith thick smoke plumes spreading downwind across the surrounding landscape. Taken with\nDragonette-003 on 2025-05-31 at 17:38:10 UTC.\n\n### Alberta canola fields\n\nAn image of canola fields in Alberta showing expansive lime-green fields characteristic of canola\nprior to peak yellow flowering. Taken with Dragonette-003 on 2025-07-15 at 18:22:20 UTC.\n\n### Jasper wildfire post-burn\n\nA post-burn CIR image over Jasper showing the extent of burned areas as dark, charred scars\ncontrasted against surrounding unburned vegetation. Taken with Dragonette-001 on 2024-08-08 at\n17:14:53 UTC.\n\n### Olympic Dam mine\n\nA PCA visualization over the Olympic Dam mine highlighting distinct surface material patterns across\nthe mining complex and surrounding terrain. Taken with Dragonette-004 on 2025-09-02 at 01:43:55 UTC.\n\n## Get the hyperspectral advantage\n\nAnd bring a new level of clarity to your operations.\n[Order imagery][39][\nContact us\n][40]\nProducts\n[Hyperspectral imagery][41][Archive][42][Open Data][43]\nIndustries\n[Agriculture][44][Peace and security][45][Forestry and ESG][46][Energy][47][Mining][48]\nCompany\n[Our technology][49][Our partners][50][About us][51][Join us][52][Contact us][53]\nSubscribe\nJoin our newsletter to stay up to date on all things Wyvern.\nFirst name\nLast name\nEmail\nBy subscribing you agree to with our [Privacy Policy][54] and provide consent to receive updates\nfrom our company.\nThank you! You are now subscribed!\nOops! Something went wrong while submitting the form.\n\u00a9 2026 Wyvern Inc. All rights reserved.\n[Privacy Policy][55]\n][56][\n][57][\n][58][\n][59][\n][60]\nWe use cookies to enhance your experience.\nLearn more\n][61][Accept][62]\n][63]\n\n[1]: /product\n[2]: /product\n[3]: https://archive.wyvern.space/\n[4]: https://opendata.wyvern.space/#/?.language=en\n[5]: /technology\n[6]: /industries\n[7]: /industries/agriculture\n[8]: /industries/peace-and-security\n[9]: /industries/forestry\n[10]: /industries/energy\n[11]: /industries/mining\n[12]: /company/about-us\n[13]: /company/join-us\n[14]: /blog\n[15]: https://knowledge.wyvern.space/\n[16]: https://knowledge.wyvern.space/\n[17]: https://guide.wyvern.space/\n[18]: https://opendata.wyvern.space/#/?.language=en\n[19]: https://guide.wyvern.space/\n[20]: https://opendata.wyvern.space/#/?.language=en\n[21]: /partners\n[22]: /contact\n[23]: mailto:orders@wyvern.space?body=Hello,%0D%0A%0D%0AI'm interested in tasking imagery with the f\nollowing parameters:%0D%0A%0D%0AArea of interest (location and size):%0D%0ATime of interest (date ra\nnge):%0D%0ASingle capture or multiple collections:%0D%0ABudget:\n[24]: mailto:orders@wyvern.space?body=Hello,%0D%0A%0D%0AI'm interested in tasking imagery with the f\nollowing parameters:%0D%0A%0D%0AArea of interest (location and size):%0D%0ATime of interest (date ra\nnge):%0D%0ASingle capture or multiple collections:%0D%0ABudget:\n[25]: /contact\n[26]: mailto:sales@wyvern.space\n[27]: https://docs.sandbox.wyvern.space/\n[28]: https://archive.wyvern.space/\n[29]: https://opendata.wyvern.space/#/?.language=en\n[30]: https://canadabuys.canada.ca/en/tender-opportunities/contract-history/ws3790065711-cw2292348-a\ncm157726209-001\n[31]: https://opendata.wyvern.space/#/?.language=en\n[32]: /partners\n[33]: /industries\n[34]: /industries/agriculture\n[35]: /industries/peace-and-security\n[36]: /industries/forestry\n[37]: /industries/energy\n[38]: /industries/mining\n[39]: mailto:orders@wyvern.space?body=Hello,%0D%0A%0D%0AI'm interested in tasking imagery with the f\nollowing parameters:%0D%0A%0D%0AArea of interest (location and size):%0D%0ATime of interest (date ra\nnge):%0D%0ASingle capture or multiple collections:%0D%0ABudget:\n[40]: /contact\n[41]: /product\n[42]: https://archive.wyvern.space/\n[43]: https://opendata.wyvern.space/#/?.language=en\n[44]: /industries/agriculture\n[45]: /industries/peace-and-security\n[46]: /industries/forestry\n[47]: /industries/energy\n[48]: /industries/mining\n[49]: /technology\n[50]: /partners\n[51]: /company/about-us\n[52]: /company/join-us\n[53]: /contact\n[54]: #\n[55]: /privacy-policy\n[56]: #\n[57]: #\n[58]: #\n[59]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/wyvern-space/?originalSubdomain=ca\n[60]: #\n[61]: /privacy-policy\n[62]: #\n[63]: #"
