      "key_products": "Hyperspectral Imagery, Open Data, Archive Library",
      "polished_summary": "Wyvern is a high-resolution hyperspectral imagery company dedicated to providing organizations with detailed environmental data to support smarter, more sustainable decision-making. Its core offerings include advanced hyperspectral imagery, free open data for research and validation, and a growing archive library of historical imagery, catering to industries such as agriculture, energy, mining, and forestry. By leveraging cutting-edge satellite technology, Wyvern aims to enhance accessibility to critical data for a better understanding of our planet.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Wyvern manufactures and provides high-resolution hyperspectral imagery, which is directly relevant to the spectral sensor market. Their offerings support various industries such as agriculture, energy, mining, and forestry, indicating a strong alignment with the target market.",
