            "text": "[ [Zbotic Logo][Zbotic Logo] [Zbotic Logo][Zbotic Logo] ][1]\n[ ][2]\n[ My Account ][3]\nLogin Register\n\nOTP *\n\nUsername or email *\n\nPassword *\n\n[Lost password?][4]\n\nRemember Me\n\nLog in\n\nLogin With OTP Login With WhatsApp\nResend OTP (00:30)\n\nEmail address *\n\nPassword *\n\nFirst Name\n\nEmail *\n\nYour personal data will be used to support your experience throughout this website, to manage access\nto your account, and for other purposes described in our [privacy policy][5].\n\nOTP *\n\nRegister\n\nResend OTP (00:30)\n[ 0 ][6] 0\n[ 0 My Wishlist ][7]\n\n[View Wishlist][8] [Add all to cart][9]\n\n[ 0 ][10] 0\n[ 0 Shopping Cart ][11]\n[Shopping cart (0)][12]\nSubtotal: \u20b90.00\n\n[View cart][13][Checkout][14]\n\n[ [Zbotic Logo][Zbotic Logo] ][15]\nSearch input Search\n* [Home][16]\n* [Shop][17]\n* [Sale][18]\n* [3D Print Service][19]\n* [PCB Service][20]\n* [B2B][21]\n* [Blogs][22]\n* [Contact Us][23]\n[ Facebook ][24] [ Twitter ][25] [ Instagram ][26] [ Linkedin ][27] [ YouTube ][28]\n[ Facebook ][29] [ Twitter ][30] [ Instagram ][31] [ Linkedin ][32] [ YouTube ][33]\n[ [Zbotic Logo][Zbotic Logo] ][34]\nSearch input Search\n* [Home][35]\n* [Shop][36]\n* [Sale][37]\n* [3D Print Service][38]\n* [PCB Service][39]\n* [B2B][40]\n* [Blogs][41]\n* [Contact Us][42]\n[ Facebook ][43] [ Twitter ][44] [ Instagram ][45] [ Linkedin ][46] [ YouTube ][47]\n[ [Zbotic Logo][Zbotic Logo] [Zbotic Logo][Zbotic Logo] ][48]\n[ 0 ][49] 0\n[ 0 My Wishlist ][50]\n\n[View Wishlist][51] [Add all to cart][52]\n\n[ 0 ][53] 0\n[ 0 Shopping Cart ][54]\n[Shopping cart (0)][55]\nSubtotal: \u20b90.00\n\n[View cart][56][Checkout][57]\n\nProducts search\nEst. 2018 | Moxie Supply Pvt Ltd\n\n# Powering India's\n# Innovation Ecosystem\n\nFrom a small workshop in Pune to India's trusted electronics partner \u2014 we're building the future of\nhardware, one component at a time.\n\n[Explore Products][58] [Contact Us][59]\nOrders Delivered\nProducts\nHappy Customers\nYears of Trust\nOur Story\n\n## From Passion to Platform\n\nZbotic was born from a simple observation \u2014 engineering students and hobbyists in India struggled to\nfind quality electronic components at fair prices. What started as a passion project in 2018 has\ngrown into one of India's most trusted platforms for electronics, robotics, and automation\ncomponents.\n\nToday, Zbotic serves engineers, educators, startups, and enterprises across India. We stock over\n15,000 products \u2014 from basic resistors to advanced development boards \u2014 all backed by genuine\nquality assurance and lightning-fast delivery.\n\nWhat We Do\n\n## Complete Electronics Solutions\n\nFrom components to custom manufacturing, we provide everything you need to bring your electronics\nprojects to life.\n\n### Electronic Components\n\n15,000+ components from Arduino to sensors, development boards to power modules. Everything for your\nnext project.\n\n[Browse Components \u2192][60]\n\n### PCB Manufacturing\n\nCustom PCB fabrication from prototype to production, with assembly services. Starting at just \u20b9149.\n\n[Get PCB Quote \u2192][61]\n\n### 3D Printing\n\nFDM, SLA, and SLS 3D printing for custom enclosures, prototypes, and mechanical parts.\n\n[Start 3D Print \u2192][62]\n\n### B2B & Bulk Supply\n\nWholesale pricing for institutions, labs, and manufacturers across India. Dedicated account manager\nincluded.\n\n[Enquire Now \u2192][63]\nWhy Zbotic\n\n## The Zbotic Advantage\n\nWe go beyond just selling components. Here's why thousands of engineers and businesses choose\nZbotic.\n\n#### Genuine Products\n\nEvery component tested and verified. No counterfeits, ever.\n\n#### Pan-India Delivery\n\nFast shipping to every pincode. Free above \u20b9999.\n\n#### GST Invoice\n\nProper tax invoices for all orders. ITC-compliant billing.\n\n#### Expert Support\n\nDedicated technical support team. Call us toll-free.\n\n#### Secure Payments\n\nMultiple payment options. 100% secure checkout.\n\n#### Easy Returns\n\nHassle-free return policy. Customer satisfaction guaranteed.\n\nOur Purpose\n\n## Mission & Vision\n\nWhat drives us every day and where we're headed.\n\n### Our Mission\n\nTo democratize access to quality electronics and empower every innovator in India \u2014 from students\nbuilding their first robot to enterprises scaling production.\n\n### Our Vision\n\nTo become India's most trusted and comprehensive electronics ecosystem, where every idea finds the\ncomponents, services, and support it needs to become reality.\n\n## Ready to Build\n## Something Amazing?\n\nBrowse 15,000+ products or get in touch with our team.\n\n[Shop Now][64] [Contact Us][65]\n[ Facebook ][66] [ Twitter ][67] [ Instagram ][68] [ Pinterest ][69] [ Linkedin ][70] [ Youtube\n][71]\n\nGet the latest deals and more.\n\n[ [Download on Google Play][Google Play Download Android App Logo Png Transparent Medium.png] ][72]\n[ [Download on the App Store][Download On The App Store Apple Logo Png Transparent Medium.png] ][73]\n\n### Call us: 020 69134444 / 1800 209 0998\n\nMonday - Saturday 09:30 AM - 06:00 PM\nFor Technical Supports Email: [[email protected]][74]\nFor Sales / Enquiries Email: [[email protected]][75]\n* [\n\n### My Account\n\n][76]\n* [\n\n### Cart\n\n][77]\n* [\n\n### Wishlist\n\n][78]\n* [\n\n### Checkout\n\n][79]\n* [\n\n### My Orders\n\n][80]\n* [\n\n### Track Order\n\n][81]\n* [\n\n### My Account\n\n][82]\n* [\n\n### Information\n\n][83]\n* [\n\n### FAQs\n\n][84]\n* [\n\n### Blogs\n\n][85]\n* [\n\n### Career\n\n][86]\n* [\n\n### About Us\n\n][87]\n* [\n\n### Contact Us\n\n][88]\n* [\n\n### Payment Options\n\n][89]\n* [\n\n### Policies\n\n][90]\n* [\n\n### Privacy Policy\n\n][91]\n* [\n\n### Terms & Conditions\n\n][92]\n* [\n\n### GST Input Tax Credit\n\n][93]\n* [\n\n### Shipping Return Policy\n\n][94]\n* [\n\n### E-Waste Collection Points\n\n][95]\n* [\n\n### Our Sitemap\n\n][96]\n\n\u00a9 [Zbotic.in][97] is registered trademark of **Moxie Supply Pvt Ltd** \u201