Drone Frame 1]\n* [ETF X2300 Heavy lift Industry Drone Frame]\n\n# EFT X2300 large capacity 4-axis industry drone with 100 kg load carrying capacity\n\nShare: [ Facebook ][74] [ Twitter ][75] [ Tumblr ][76] [ Linkedin ][77] [ Houzz ][78] [ Vk ][79] [\nPinterest ][80] [ Whatsapp ][81]\n[ Add to wishlist ][82]\n[ Add to compare ][83]\n\n#### Quick Overview:\n* ****Product Name: EFT X2300 large capacity 4-axis industry drone with 100 kg load carrying\ncapacity****\n* Industrial-grade heavy-lift drone frame with 2317mm wheelbase\n* Foldable, durable design built for high payload and tough environments\n* Compatible with high-capacity batteries and heavy-duty power systems\n\nBrand: [ EFT ][84] SKU: AI8014\nCategory: [Drone Frame and Accessories][85]\n\n\u20b9288,020.25 (\u20b9274,305.00 + GST)\n\nPurchase this product now and earn **5,487** Zbotic Points!\nEFT X2300 large capacity 4-axis industry drone with 100 kg load carrying capacity quantity\nAdd to cart\n[Description][86]\n[Additional information][87]\n[Warranty][88]\n[COO][89]\n\n## **EFT X2300 large capacity 4-axis industry drone with 100 kg load carrying capacity**\n\n## Description:\n\nThe EFT X2300 Heavy-Lift Industrial Drone Frame is engineered for demanding aerial applications that\nrequire strength, stability, and reliability. With its large 2317mm wheelbase and rugged\nconstruction, this frame is ideal for industrial operations such as surveying, agriculture, mapping,\nand heavy payload delivery.\n\nBuilt with durability in mind, the EFT X2300 features a robust structure, foldable design for easy\ntransport, and support for high-capacity batteries. Its wide operating temperature range and\nheavy-duty components make it suitable for harsh environments and long-duration missions.\n\n### **Key Features**\n* Heavy-duty frame designed for industrial and heavy-lift drone applications\n* Large 2317mm wheelbase for enhanced stability and payload capacity\n* Foldable design for convenient transport and storage\n* Supports high-current battery systems with 500A/QS10 plug\n* Durable construction with 60mm arm diameter for extra strength\n* Wide operating temperature range suitable for outdoor environments\n* Spacious battery compartment for high-capacity batteries\n\n### **Specifications**\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nParameter \u2502Details\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nWheelbase \u25022317 mm\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nFrame Weight \u250218 kg\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nFolded Size \u25021146 \u00d7 1146 \u00d7 846 mm\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nUnfolded Size \u25021758 \u00d7 1758 \u00d7 846 mm\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500