3 1PCS\n\nShare: [ Facebook ][65] [ Twitter ][66] [ Tumblr ][67] [ Linkedin ][68] [ Houzz ][69] [ Vk ][70] [\nPinterest ][71] [ Whatsapp ][72]\n[ Add to wishlist ][73]\n[ Add to compare ][74]\n\n#### **Quick Overview:**\n* **Product Name: RunCam 5.8 GHz Antenna \u2013 MMCX-L \u2013 1PCS**\n* Frequency Range 5.5-6.0 GHz\n* Get 2.8dBi\n* Axial ratio <1.0\n\nBrand: [ RunCam ][75] SKU: AI8253\nCategory: [FPV Antennas and Trans-Receivers][76]\n\n\u20b9759.92 (\u20b9644.00 + GST)\n\nPurchase this product now and earn **13** Zbotic Points!\nRunCam 5.8 GHz Antenna - MMCX-L - 1PCS quantity\nAdd to cart\n[Description][77]\n[Additional information][78]\n[COO][79]\n\n## **RunCam 5.8 GHz Antenna \u2013 MMCX-L \u2013 1PCS**\n\n## **Description:**\n\nThe \u201cRunCam 5.8 GHz Antenna \u2013 MMCX-L \u2013 1PCS\u201d is a high-performance antenna designed for optimal\nsignal transmission in FPV (First Person View) applications. With its MMCX-L connector, it ensures a\nsecure and reliable connection to your camera or transmitter. This antenna operates on the 5.8 GHz\nfrequency band, offering excellent range and clarity for your video feed. Its compact and\nlightweight design makes it perfect for drone racing or aerial photography, allowing for easy\ninstallation without adding significant weight. The antenna\u2019s durable construction ensures\nresilience against the rigors of outdoor use, while its sleek design enhances the overall aesthetic\nof your setup. Upgrade your FPV experience with the RunCam 5.8 GHz Antenna for improved performance\nand reliability on your flights!\n\n## **Features:**\n* **Frequency Band:** Operates on the 5.8 GHz frequency for enhanced video transmission.\n* **Connector Type:** MMCX-L connector for secure and easy connection to compatible devices.\n* **Lightweight Design:** Minimal weight allows for seamless integration into various FPV setups\nwithout compromising flight performance.\n* **Durable Construction:** Built to withstand outdoor conditions, ensuring longevity and\nreliability during use.\n* **Compact Size:** Streamlined design for easy installation and improved aesthetics on your drone\nor camera.\n* **Improved Signal Quality:** Designed to enhance signal range and clarity, reducing interference\nfor a better FPV experience.\n* **Versatile Compatibility:** Suitable for a wide range of FPV cameras and transmitters, making it\na great addition to any setup.\n\n## Specification:\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nFrequency \u25025.5-6.0 GHz\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nGain: \u25022.8dBi\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nAxial Ratio \u2502&lt;1.0\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nConnector: \u2502MMCX-L\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nStanding Wave Ratio\u2502&lt;1.1 (on 5.8GHz)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2