peration mode**: 2D, 3D, Cold start, Warm start, Hot start\n\nBrand: [ Generic ][78] SKU: AI8266\nCategory: [GPS Modules][79]\n\n\u20b9836.85 (\u20b9797.00 + GST)\n\nPurchase this product now and earn **16** Zbotic Points!\nModule GPS Neo-M8L quantity\nAdd to cart\n[Description][80]\n[Additional information][81]\n[COO][82]\n\n## Module GPS Neo-M8L\n\n## **Description: **\n\n**The Neo-M8L GPS module** is a high-quality GPS module that uses **the Neo-M8L u-blox** chip, which\nprovides powerful GPS signal acquisition, high accuracy, and stable performance. With advanced\ntechnology, the Neo-M8L provides location tracking with an accuracy of up to several meters, meeting\nthe needs of applications that require precise location information such as positioning systems,\ntrackers, and IoT projects.\n\nThis GPS module is capable of powerful operation in a variety of environments and supports multiple\ncommunication modes such as **UART, SPI**, making it easy to integrate into electronics, Arduino,\nRaspberry Pi and ESP32 projects.\n\n## **Specifications:**\n* **GPS chip**: u-blox Neo-M8L\n* **GPS Signal Frequency**: 1575.42 MHz (L1)\n* **Accuracy**: Up to 2.5m (Variation may depend on environmental conditions)\n* **Communication**: UART, SPI\n* **Working Voltage**: 3.3V \u2013 5V\n* **Power Consumption**: 22mA (Normal Operating Mode)\n* **Operating Temperature**: -40\u00b0C to +85\u00b0C\n* **Operation mode**: 2D, 3D, Cold start, Warm start, Hot start\n* **Supports GPS, GLONASS, Galileo, BeiDou**: Ensures high accuracy and flexibility in the use of\nglobal satellite systems.\n\n## **Application:**\n1. **GPS Navigation System**:\n* Use in navigation applications for automobiles, motorcycles, or other vehicles.\n2. **IoT (Internet of Things) Project**:\n* Easily integrate into IoT devices such as measurement devices, sensors, or projects that\nrequire networking and location tracking.\n3. **Tracking and Monitoring System**:\n* Application in security surveillance systems, item tracking devices, animals or vehicles.\n4. **Robots and drones**:\n* Use in automated control systems, robots, or drones to determine precise positions in space.\n5. **Real-time Application**:\n* Applications that require real-time and location updates such as delivery services, fleet\nmanagement, or services that require location sharing.\n6. **Mobile and Wearable:**\n* Provides precise positioning for wearables or mobile devices that need GPS tracking.\n\n## **Datasheet:**\n\n[[download 4][download 4]][83]\n\n## **Package Includes:**\n\n1xModule GPS Neo-M8L\n\n**Also in GPS Modules:**\n[Here3+ GPS receiver with iStand][84][Holybro H-RTK F9P Ultralight][85][Jiyi CAN HUB-12 (Tracking\nDevice)][86][JIYI GPS Module for K++ V2 Flight Controller][87]\n**Related Articles:**\n[ [Drone Light Show: Synchronized LED Flight Formation][Drone Light Show: Synchronized LED Flight\nFormation]\n\nDrone Light Show: Synchronized LED Flight Formation\n\nTable of Contents Understanding Drone Light Show Key Components and Requirements Step-by-Step Setup\nGuide Configuration and Optimisation Practical...\n\nRead More \u2192\n][88][ [Mini Drone Build: 3-Inch Toothpick Quad for Beginners][Mini Drone Build: 3-Inch Toothpick\nQuad for Beginners]\n\nMini Drone Build: 3-Inch Toothpick Quad for Beginners\n\nMini Drone Build: Complete Beginner's Guide to a 3-Inch Toothpick Quad The 3-inch toothpick quad is\narguably the...\n\nRead More \u2192\n][89][ [Best Budget FPV Goggles in India: Skyzone vs BetaFPV vs Eachine (2025 Buying Guide)][Best\nBudget FPV Goggles in India: Skyzone vs BetaFPV vs Eachine (2025 Buying Guide)]\n\nBest Budget FPV Goggles in India: Skyzone vs BetaFPV vs Eachine (2025 Buying Guide)\n\nIf you are stepping into the world of FPV (First Person View) drone flying, one of the most...\n\nRead More \u2192\n][90]\n\n### Technical Specifications\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSKU \u