tled design 2 8]\n* [Untitled design 1 5]\n\n# RunCam Phoenix 2 SP V3\n\nShare: [ Facebook ][67] [ Twitter ][68] [ Tumblr ][69] [ Linkedin ][70] [ Houzz ][71] [ Vk ][72] [\nPinterest ][73] [ Whatsapp ][74]\n[ Add to wishlist ][75]\n[ Add to compare ][76]\n\n#### **Quick Overview:**\n* **Product Name:** RunCam Phoenix 2 SP V3\n* Image Sensor: 1/2.8\u2033 Starlight COMS Sensor\n* Horizontal Resolution: 1500TVL\n* Screen Format: 4:3 16:9\n* Mirror/Flip Available\n* Signal System: NTSC/PAL\n* Shutter Rolling: Shutter\n\nBrand: [ RunCam ][77] SKU: AI8251\nCategory: [FPV Cameras][78]\n\n\u20b93,246.18 (\u20b92,751.00 + GST)\n\nPurchase this product now and earn **56** Zbotic Points!\nRunCam Phoenix 2 SP V3 quantity\nAdd to cart\n[Description][79]\n[Additional information][80]\n[COO][81]\n\n## **RunCam Phoenix 2 SP V3**\n\n## **Description:**\n\nThe **RunCam Phoenix 2 SP V3** is an advanced FPV camera designed for serious drone enthusiasts\nseeking exceptional image quality and performance. Featuring a high-sensitivity 4:3 CMOS sensor,\nthis camera excels in diverse lighting conditions, delivering vibrant colors and sharp details\nwhether you\u2019re flying during the day or in low-light environments. The Phoenix 2 SP V3 is\nspecifically engineered for enhanced low-light performance, making it ideal for evening flights or\nchallenging lighting scenarios. Its compact and lightweight design ensures easy integration with\nvarious drone setups, maintaining optimal flight dynamics. [[phoenix 2 SP 01][phoenix 2 SP 01]][82]\n\n## **Features:**\n* **High-Sensitivity 4:3 CMOS Sensor**: Provides excellent image quality with vibrant colors and\nsharp details in various lighting conditions.\n* **Enhanced Low-Light Performance**: Optimized for improved visibility during evening and low-light\nflights.\n* **Wide Dynamic Range**: Captures details in both bright and dark areas for balanced exposure.\n* **Compact and Lightweight Design**: Easy to integrate into different drone configurations without\naffecting aerodynamics.\n* **Multiple Resolutions and Frame Rates**: Offers flexibility to accommodate various flying styles,\nfrom racing to casual filming.\n* **Customizable OSD (On-Screen Display)**: Displays real-time flight data, improving situational\nawareness for pilots.\n* **Durable Construction**: Built to withstand the rigors of outdoor use, ensuring longevity and\nreliability.\n* **Low Latency**: Ensures a smooth and responsive FPV experience, crucial for competitive flying.\n* **Wide Voltage Compatibility**: Works with a range of power sources, enhancing versatility across\ndifferent setups.\n* **Flexible Mounting Options**: Compatible with various drone frames, making installation easy and\nconvenient.\n\n## **Specification:**\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nImage Sensor \u25021/2.8\u2033 Starlight COMS Sensor\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nHorizontal Resolution (TVL)\u25021500TVL\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nScreen Format \u25024:3 16:9\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u25