ENS FOV D: 160\u00b0 H:125\u00b0 V:97\u00b0\n* Screen Format: 4:3/Widescreen Switchable\n\nBrand: [ RunCam ][77] SKU: AI8247\nCategory: [FPV Cameras][78]\n\n\u20b96,750.78 (\u20b95,721.00 + GST)\n\nPurchase this product now and earn **115** Zbotic Points!\nRunCam Racer Nano 4 quantity\nAdd to cart\n[Description][79]\n[Additional information][80]\n[COO][81]\n\n## **RunCam Racer Nano 4**\n\n## **Description:**\n\nThe RunCam Racer Nano 4 is a compact and lightweight FPV camera designed for high-performance racing\ndrones. Weighing just 7 grams, it delivers impressive video quality with a resolution of 1200 TVL\nand a wide dynamic range, ensuring clear footage in various lighting conditions. Its 1/3-inch CMOS\nsensor captures vibrant colors and sharp details, making it ideal for competitive racing. The Racer\nNano 4 features a low latency of just 20 ms, allowing for quick response times that are crucial\nduring fast-paced maneuvers. Its durable build and user-friendly interface make it easy to set up,\nwhile the adjustable field of view offers versatility for different racing styles. With support for\n16:9 and 4:3 aspect ratios, it caters to a wide range of pilot preferences.\n\n## **Features:**\n* **Compact Design**: Weighs only 7 grams, making it ideal for racing drones and minimizing added\nweight.\n* **High Resolution**: Offers 1200 TVL for sharp, clear video quality, ensuring excellent visibility\nduring races.\n* **Wide Dynamic Range**: Enhances performance in varying lighting conditions, allowing for clearer\nimages in both bright and dim environments.\n* **Low Latency**: Features a latency of just 20 ms, providing quick response times for competitive\nracing.\n* **Adjustable Field of View (FOV)**: Supports multiple FOV settings (e.g., 150\u00b0, 120\u00b0, 90\u00b0) for\ncustomizable viewing angles.\n* **Aspect Ratio Options**: Allows users to choose between 16:9 and 4:3 aspect ratios to fit their\npreferences.\n* **Durable Build**: Designed to withstand the rigors of FPV racing, ensuring reliability and\nlongevity.\n* **User-Friendly Interface**: Easy setup and configuration, making it accessible for both beginners\nand experienced pilots.\n* **Flexible Power Supply**: Compatible with a wide range of voltage inputs (5V-20V), offering\nversatility in different setups.\n* **On-Screen Display (OSD) Support**: Compatible with OSD systems to display telemetry data on the\nscreen.\n\n## Specification:\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nmage Sensor \u2502Super WDR CMOS Sensor\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nHorizontal Resolution (TVL)\u25021200TVL\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nLENS FOV D \u2502160\u00b0 H:125\u00b0 V:97\u00b0\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nScreen Format \u25024:3/Widescreen Switchable\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u