grading components in existing setups\n\nThis product is ideal for electronics enthusiasts, engineers, and students.\n\n**Technical Tip:** Always verify voltage and current requirements before connecting to your circuit.\nCheck datasheets for detailed specifications and pin configurations.\n\n### Shipping & Delivery\n* **Free shipping** on orders above \u20b9999 across India\n* Dispatched within **1-3 business days**\n* Expected delivery: **3-7 business days** depending on location\n* Secure packaging to ensure safe transit of electronic components\n* **Genuine RunCam product** sourced from authorized channels\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nWeight\u25020.2782 kg\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Country Of Origin:** China\n\n## Reviews\n\nThere are no reviews yet.\n\nOnly logged in customers who have purchased this product may leave a review.\n\n## Related products\n\nIn stock\n\n[Svg%3E][Untitled Design 7 1 300x300.png]\n[Walksnails Avatar VRX + Avatar HD Nano Kit V3][Walksnails Avatar VRX + Avatar HD Nano Kit V3] ][88]\nQuick View\n\n## [Walksnails Avatar VRX + Avatar HD Nano Kit V3][89]\n\nSKU: AI7990 \u20b962,034.96 (\u20b952,572.00 + GST) [Add to cart][90] [ Add to Compare ][91]\n\nIn stock\n\n[ [2.8mm Camera - High Definition 1200TVL FPV 2.8mm Lens Aircraft Camera (without stand )][2.8mm\nCamera - High Definition 1200TVL FPV 2.8mm Lens Aircraft Camera (without stand )] ][92] Quick View\n\n## [High Definition 1200TVL FPV 2.8mm Lens Aircraft Camera (without stand )][93]\n\nSKU: AI7085 \u20b91,123.36 (\u20b9952.00 + GST) [Add to cart][94] [ Add to Compare ][95]\n\nIn stock\n\n[kpx49epb][kpx49epb]\n[Readytosky 1000TVL 90 Degree COMS Camera][Readytosky 1000TVL 90 Degree COMS Camera] ][96] Quick\nView\n\n## [Readytosky 1000TVL 90 Degree COMS Camera][97]\n\nSKU: AI4589 \u20b9905.06 (\u20b9767.00 + GST) [Add to cart][98] [ Add to Com