experiments.\n\n**Common use cases:**\n* Integrating into a custom electronics project\n* Learning and experimenting with circuits\n* Replacing or upgrading components in existing setups\n\nThis product is ideal for electronics enthusiasts, engineers, and students.\n\n**Technical Tip:** Always verify voltage and current requirements before connecting to your circuit.\nCheck datasheets for detailed specifications and pin configurations.\n\n### Shipping & Delivery\n* **Free shipping** on orders above \u20b9999 across India\n* Dispatched within **1-3 business days**\n* Expected delivery: **3-7 business days** depending on location\n* Secure packaging to ensure safe transit of electronic components\n* **Genuine RunCam product** sourced from authorized channels\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nWeight\u25020.052 kg\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Country Of Origin:** China\n\n## Reviews\n\nThere are no reviews yet.\n\nOnly logged in customers who have purchased this product may leave a review.\n\n## Related products\n\nIn stock\n\n[ [DJI O4 Air Unit][DJI O4 Air Unit] ][86] Quick View\n\n## [DJI O4 Air Unit][87]\n\nSKU: AI7240 \u20b920,995.80 (\u20b919,996.00 + GST) [Add to cart][88] [ Add to Compare ][89]\n\nAvailable on backorder\n\nBackorder\n[Nebula Pro Vista Kit (12cm Black)][Nebula Pro Vista Kit (12cm Black)] ][90] Quick View\n\n## [Nebula Pro Vista Kit (12cm Black)][91]\n\nSKU: AI7994 \u20b921,579.23 (\u20b920,551.65 + GST) [Add to cart][92] [ Add to Compare ][93]\n\nIn stock\n\n[ [Siyi Mk15 - AI5390-removebg-preview][Siyi Mk15 - AI5390-removebg-preview] ][94] Quick View\n\n## [SIYI MK15 IP67 FPV Camera A][95]\n\nSKU: AI5390 \u20b94,776.64 (\u20b94,048.00 + GST) [Add to cart][96] [ Add to Compare ][97]\n\nIn stock\n\n[ [Walksnails Avatar VRX + Avatar HD Nano Kit V3][Walksnails Avatar VRX + Avatar HD Nano Kit V3]\n][98] Quick View\n\n## [Walksn