attery Charging Protection Module (Type C)\n\nRated **4.54** out of 5 based on 65 customer ratings\n[(65 customer reviews)][67]\nShare: [ Facebook ][68] [ Twitter ][69] [ Tumblr ][70] [ Linkedin ][71] [ Houzz ][72] [ Vk ][73] [\nPinterest ][74] [ Whatsapp ][75]\n[ Add to wishlist ][76]\n[ Add to compare ][77]\n\nInput interface: Type C\n\nCurrent Protection: Yes\n\nCharging mode: Linear charging.\n\nCurrent: 1A adjustable.\n\nCharge precision: 1.5%.\n\nInput voltage: 4.5V-5.5V.\n\nFull charge voltage: 4.2V.\n\nBrand: [ Generic ][78] SKU: AI0501\nCategory: [Battery Protection Board][79]\nTags: [Battery][80], [Battery Protection][81], [BMS][82], [Buy Online India][83], [Zbotic][84]\n\n\u20b919.47 (\u20b916.50 + GST)\n\nPurchase this product now and earn **1** Zbotic Point!\nTP4056 Battery Charging Protection Module (Type C) quantity\nAdd to cart\n[Description][85]\n[Additional information][86]\n[Warranty][87]\n[COO][88]\n\n**TP4056 Battery Charging Protection Module**\n\nThe TP4056 1A Li-Ion Battery Charging Board with Type-C and Current Protection is a compact and\nefficient charging module designed for single-cell 3.7V lithium-ion (Li-Ion) batteries, such as\n16550 cells, that lack their own built-in protection circuit. Powered by the TP4056 charging IC and\nthe DW01 battery protection IC, this module provides a 1A charging current and automatically stops\ncharging once the battery is fully charged.\n\nThe module also features built-in protection to safeguard the battery. If the voltage drops below\n2.4V, the protection IC disconnects the load to prevent over-discharging. Additionally, the\nprotection circuit guards against over-voltage and reverse polarity connections. In the event of\nincorrect wiring, the module typically sacrifices itself to protect the battery. However, always\ndouble-check your connections before use to ensure safe operation.\n\n##### **Using the module:**\n1. Connect Type C cable for power, or 5V DC to pads marked IN+ and IN- on the left-hand side of the\nmodule\n2. Connect cell to charge to B+/B- pads on the right-hand side of the module.\n3. A load (something for the battery to power) can be connected to the OUT+/OUT- pads on the\nright-hand side\n4. Important! Disconnect load when charging\n5. The red LED indicates charging in progress, the green LED indicates charging has finished.\n6. Never charge your battery at a rate greater than 1C.\n\n##### **NOTE:**\n\n1. Ampere meter can only be connected to a 5v input end of the module.\n2. It is better than the charging current is 37% of the battery capacity. If you charge the battery\nof 1000mAh, a current of 400mAh is enough.\n3. The connection wire should not be too thick.\n4. Make sure the connect point is good.\n5. If the input voltage is too high, like 5.2v, the current will be less than 1000mA, it is normal.\nIt is protection function, auto-subtract the charging current to avoid burn damage to the chip.\n6. NO Reverse polarity.\n\n**Features **\n1. Led indicator: Red is charging Green is fully charged.\n2. Current Protection: Yes\n3. Inversed polarity: NO.\n4. Use mature charging chip TP4056 for simple peripheral circuits, good protection performance, and\nhigh charging accuracy.\n5. Fully machinery automated processing, all patch parts manufacturing.\n\n##### Specification\n* **Input interface: Type C**\n* **Current Protection: Yes**\n* **Charging mode: Linear charging.**\n* **Current: 1A adjustable.**\n* **Charge precision: 1.5%.**\n* **Input voltage: 4.5V-5.5V.**\n* **Full charge voltage: 4.2V.**\n\n**Package Includes **\n* 1 x TP4056 1A Li-ion Lithium Battery Charging Module With Current Protection \u2013 Type C\n\nVideo\n\n**Tags:** [Battery][89] [Battery Protection][90] [BMS][91] [Buy Online India][92] [Zbotic][93]\n**Also in Battery Protection Board:**\n[1S 3.7V 7.5A 5MOS BMS Li- ion 18650 Battery Protection Board][94][XH-M603 Charging Control Module\nwith LED Display][95][4S 5A BMS NMC18650 Lithium Battery Protection Board][96][PCB BMS 6 Series 22V\n18650 Lithium Battery Protection Board][97]\n**Related Articles:**\n[ [Battery Discharge Curve: Understanding Voltage Profiles][Battery Discharge Curve: Understanding\nVoltage Profiles]\n\nBattery Discharge Curve: Understanding Voltage Profiles\n\nThe battery discharge curve is a graph of cell voltage versus capacity (mAh) or time during\ndischarge at...\n\nRead More \u2192\n][98][ [Power Bank DIY: Build 20000mAh Pack with 18650 Cells][Power Bank DIY: Build 20000mAh Pack\nwith 18650 Cells]\n\nPower Bank DIY: Build 20000mAh Pack with 18650 Cells\n\nTable of Contents Why Build Your Own Power Bank? Calculating the Capacity You Need Choosing the\nRight 18650...\n\nRead More \u2192\n][99][ [LTC4054 Solar Charger IC: Single Cell LiPo Charge Circuit][LTC4054 Solar Charger IC: Single\nCell LiPo Charge Circuit]\n\nLTC4054 Solar Charger IC: Single Cell LiPo Charge Circuit\n\nLTC4054 Solar Charger IC: Single Cell LiPo Charge Circuit If you are building a solar-powered IoT\ndevice, a...\n\nRead More \u2192\n][100]\n\n### Technical Specifications\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nModel \u2502TP4056\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nConnector Type\u2502Type-C\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSKU \u2502AI0501\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nWeight \u25020.0 kg\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nAvailability \u2502In Stock\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n### Applications & Use Cases\n\nThe TP4056 Battery Charging Protection Module (Type C) is a versatile battery protection board used\nacross a wide range of applications including lithium battery pack protection, power bank builds,\ne-bike battery management, solar energy storage, and UPS systems.\n\n**Common use cases:**\n* Building a custom lithium battery pack\n* Adding overcharge/overdischarge protection\n* Creating a DIY power bank\n\nThis product is ideal for battery pack builders and power electronics engineers.\n\n**Technical Tip:** BMS boards prevent overcharge, overdischarge, overcurrent, and short circuit.\nMatch cell count (S) and max current rating to your battery pack.\n\n### Shipping & Delivery\n* **Free shipping** on orders above \u20b9999 across India\n* Dispatched within **1-3 business days**\n* Expected delivery: **3-7 business days** depending on location\n* Secure packaging to ensure safe transit of electronic components\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nWeight \u25020.0 kg\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nDimensions\u25022.5 \u00d7 2.0 \u00d7 0.6 cm\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**15 Days Warranty**\n\nPlease note that this item is only covered by a standard supplier warranty against manufacturing\ndefects for a period of 15days from the time of delivery. It is important to understand that only\nmanufacturing defects are covered under this warranty, and any other issues will not be considered\nfor reimbursement or replacement. We strongly advise inspecting the product upon delivery to ensure\nit meets your expectations. In case of any manufacturing defects, we guarantee reimbursement or\nreplacement.\n\n##### **What voids warranty:**\n\nIf the product is subject to misuse, tampering, static discharge, accident, water or fire damage,\nuse of chemicals & soldered or altered in any way.\n\n**Tags:** [Battery][101] [Battery Protection][102] [BMS][103] [Buy Online India][104] [Zbotic][105]\n**Also in Battery Protection Board:**\n[XH-M603 Charging Control Module with LED Display][106][4S 10A BMS For LFP With Balancing\n12.8V][107][3S 11.1V 10A 18650 Lithium Battery Overcharge And Over-current Protection Board-Good\nQuality][108][4S 5A BMS NMC18650 Lithium Battery Protection Board][109]\n**Related Articles:**\n[ [E-Scooter Battery: 36V and 48V Pack Building][E-Scooter Battery: 36V and 48V Pack Building]\n\nE-Scooter Battery: 36V and 48V Pack Building\n\nTable of ContentsE-Scooter Battery Specifications 36V vs 48V Pack Design Cell Selection for\nE-Scooters BMS Requirements for High...\n\nRead More \u2192\n][110][ [Battery Internal Resistance: Testing and Understanding It][Battery Internal Resistance:\nTesting and Understanding It]\n\nBattery Internal Resistance: Testing and Understanding It\n\nTable of Contents What is Battery Internal Resistance? Why Internal Resistance Matters for Your\nProjects How to Measure...\n\nRead More \u2192\n][111][ [Battery Holder vs Connector: Best Approach for Your Projects][Battery Holder vs Connector:\nBest Approach for Your Projects]\n\nBattery Holder vs Connector: Best Approach for Your Projects\n\nBattery Holder vs Connector: Best Approach for Your Projects Every electronics project needs power,\nand how you connect...\n\nRead More \u2192\n][112]\n**Country Of Origin:** China\n\n## 65 reviews for TP4056 Battery Charging Protection Module (Type C)\n1. [Avatar of Raghav Pandey][Avatar of Raghav Pandey]\nRated **3** out of 5\n\n**Raghav Pandey ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 April 8, 2022\n\nAverage TP4056 Battery Charging Protection. Works but efficiency could be better. Adequate for\nbasic projects.\n2. [Avatar of Sahil Arora][Avatar of Sahil Arora]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Sahil Arora ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 May 14, 2022\n\nExcellent TP4056 Battery Charging Protection! Output is stable and reliable. Perfect for my\nelectronics project.\n3. [Avatar of Aditi Gupta][Avatar of Aditi Gupta]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Aditi Gupta ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 July 4, 2022\n\nExcellent TP4056 Battery Charging Protection! Output is stable and reliable. Perfect for my\nelectronics project.\n4. [Avatar of Prosenjit][Avatar of Prosenjit]\nRated **4** out of 5\n\n**Prosenjit ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 September 18, 2022\n\nGood\n5. [Avatar of Parth Pandey][Avatar of Parth Pandey]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Parth Pandey ** \u2013 September 26, 2022\n\nBought multiple units of this TP4056 Battery Charging Protection. All consistent quality. Zbotic\nis reliable.\n6. [Avatar of Ankur Choudhury][Avatar of Ankur Choudhury]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Ankur Choudhury ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 October 28, 2022\n\nGreat TP4056 Battery Charging Protection. Voltage is rock solid under varying loads. Highly\nrecommended.\n7. [Avatar of Sachin Singh][Avatar of Sachin Singh]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Sachin Singh ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 November 18, 2022\n\nLess price than others\n8. [Avatar of Sanjay Divekar][Avatar of Sanjay Divekar]\nRated **4** out of 5\n\n**Sanjay Divekar ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 January 11, 2023\n\nWhat is the output voltage? Not mentioned anywhere. 5v Or 4.2v\n* [Avatar of Website Support][Avatar of Website Support]\n\n**Website Support ** \u2013"
