ased on 17 customer ratings\n[(17 customer reviews)][66]\nShare: [ Facebook ][67] [ Twitter ][68] [ Tumblr ][69] [ Linkedin ][70] [ Houzz ][71] [ Vk ][72] [\nPinterest ][73] [ Whatsapp ][74]\n[ Add to wishlist ][75]\n[ Add to compare ][76]\n\n#### ** Quick Overview **\n* Calibrated directly in Degree Celsius (Centigrade)\n* Linear at 10.0 mV/\u00b0C scale factor\n* 0.5\u00b0C accuracy guarantee-able (at a25\u00b0C)\n* Suitable for remote applications\n* Low cost due to wafer-level trimming\n* Operates from 4 to 30 volts\n* Less than 60 mA current drain\n* Low self-heating, 0.08\u00b0C in still air\n* Non-linearity only 0.25\u00b0C typical\n\nBrand: [ Generic ][77] SKU: AI0375\nCategory: [Sensor ICs][78]\nTags: [LM35][79], [Temperature Sensor][80]\n\n\u20b929.26 (\u20b924.80 + GST)\n\nPurchase this product now and earn **1** Zbotic Point!\nLM35 Temperature Sensors quantity\nAdd to cart\n[Description][81]\n[Additional information][82]\n[Warranty][83]\n[COO][84]\n\n### **Product Description:**\n\n**LM35 Temperature Sensors**\n\nThe LM35 is an integrated analog temperature sensor that provides an output directly proportional to\nthe temperature in degrees Celsius. It offers accurate temperature measurements without the need for\nexternal calibration or trimming. With its low output impedance, linear response, and precise\ncalibration, the LM35 simplifies integration with readout or control circuits.\n\nNo additional components are required to interface the LM35 with an ADC, as its output is linear at\na rate of 10mV per degree Celsius. It can be directly connected to any 10-bit or 12-bit ADC.\nHowever, for 8-bit ADCs like the ADC0808 or ADC0804, an amplifier is needed to detect temperature\nchanges as small as 1\u00b0C.\n\nThe LM35 can also be easily interfaced with an Arduino, and its temperature output can be used with\na comparator circuit for over-temperature detection or connected to a relay for temperature control\napplications.\n\nThe LM35 operates across a wide temperature range, from \u221255\u00b0C to 150\u00b0C, while the LM35C version is\nrated for \u221240\u00b0C to 110\u00b0C, with improved accuracy in the lower temperature range. The LM35 series is\navailable in hermetic TO-Transistor packages, while the LM35C, LM35CA, and LM35D versions come in\nplastic TO-92 packages. The LM35D is also available in an 8-lead surface-mount small-outline package\nor a plastic TO-220 package.\n\n### **Features:**\n* Calibrated directly in Degree Celsius (Centigrade)\n* Linear at 10.0 mV/\u00b0C scale factor\n* 0.5\u00b0C accuracy guarantee-able (at a25\u00b0C)\n* Suitable for remote applications\n* Low cost due to wafer-level trimming\n* Operates from 4 to 30 volts\n* Less than 60 mA current drain\n* Low self-heating, 0.08\u00b0C in still air\n* Non-linearity only 0.25\u00b0C typical\n* Low impedance output, 0.1\u2126for 1 mA load\n\n### **Specification:**\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPackage/Case \u2502TO-92-3\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nMounting Type \u2502Through Hole\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSensor Type \u2502Temperature Sensor\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nOutput Type \u2502Analog Voltage\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nMaximum Supply Voltage (V)\u250230\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nMinimum Supply Voltage (V)\u25024\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nOperating Temperature (\u00b0C)\u2502-55 to 150\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n### **Application:**\n* Measuring temperature of a particular environment\n* Providing thermal shut down for a circuit/component\n* Monitoring battery temperature\n* Measuring temperatures for HVAC applications\n* Industrial process temperature control\n\n### **Package Include:**\n* 1 x LM35 TO-92-3 Board Mount Temperature Sensor IC.\n\n### Attachments:\n\n#### [ [PDF Logo 1 medium][PDF Logo 1 medium]][85]\n\n( \u2b9d click to download )\n\n**Tags:** [LM35][86] [Temperature Sensor][87]\n**Related Articles:**\n[ [LDR Light Sensor: Automatic Night Lamp Circuit with Arduino][LDR Light Sensor: Automatic Night\nLamp Circuit with Arduino]\n\nLDR Light Sensor: A