Driver IC1][L9110S Motor Control Driver IC1]\n\n# L9110S Motor Control Driver Chip\n\nRated **4.42** out of 5 based on 12 customer ratings\n[(12 customer reviews)][65]\nShare: [ Facebook ][66] [ Twitter ][67] [ Tumblr ][68] [ Linkedin ][69] [ Houzz ][70] [ Vk ][71] [\nPinterest ][72] [ Whatsapp ][73]\n[ Add to wishlist ][74]\n[ Add to compare ][75]\n\n**QUICK OVERVIEW**\n1. 800mA continuous current output capability per channel;\n2. Lower saturation voltage;\n3. TTL / CMOS output level compatible, and can be directly connected to the CPU;\n4. Output built-in clamp diodes for inductive load;\n5. Integrated control and drive into a monolithic IC;\n6. With pin high-voltage protection function;\n7. Operating temperature: 0 \u2103 -80 \u2103\n\nBrand: [ Generic ][76] SKU: AI0473\nCategory: [Motor and Display Driver ICs][77]\nTags: [Buy Online India][78], [Zbotic][79]\n\n\u20b911.92 (\u20b910.10 + GST)\n\nPurchase this product now and earn **1** Zbotic Point!\nL9110S Motor Control Driver Chip quantity\nAdd to cart\n[Description][80]\n[Additional information][81]\n[Warranty][82]\n[COO][83]\n\n**L9110S Motor Control Driver Chip**\n\nThe L9110 is an integrated ASIC motor driver chip that combines a two-channel push-pull power\namplifier circuit into a single monolithic IC. This design reduces the need for peripheral\ncomponents, lowering costs and improving overall reliability.\n\nThe L9110 features two TTL/CMOS-compatible input channels with strong noise immunity, and each\noutput can drive a motor in both forward and reverse directions. It has a high current-driving\ncapability, with each channel supporting 750 to 800mA of continuous current, and a peak current\ncapacity of up to 1.5 to 2.0A. Additionally, it boasts a low output saturation voltage and includes\nbuilt-in clamp diodes to protect against current spikes from inductive loads, ensuring safe\noperation.\n\nThis chip is ideal for driving DC motors, stepper motors, relays, and switching power tubes, making\nit a popular choice for applications in toy car motor drives, stepper motor control, and power\nswitching circuits.\n\n**Features**\n\nLow quiescent current;\n\nWide supply voltage range: 2.5V-12V;\n\n800mA continuous current output capability per channel;\n\nLower saturation voltage;\n\nTTL / CMOS output level compatible, and can be directly connected to the CPU;\n\nOutput built-in clamp diodes for inductive load;\n\nIntegrated control and drive into a monolithic IC;\n\nWith pin high-voltage protection function;\n\nOperating temperature: 0 \u2103 -80 \u2103\n\n**Package Includes**\n\n1 x L9110s Motor Control Driver Chip\n\n**Tags:** [Buy Online India][84] [Zbotic][85]\n**Related Articles:**\n[ [VNH5019 Motor Driver Shield: Pololu High Current Arduino Guide][VNH5019 Motor Driver Shield:\nPololu High Current Arduino Guide]\n\nVNH5019 Motor Driver Shield: Pololu High Current Arduino Guide\n\nTable of ContentsWhat Is the VNH5019 Motor Driver Shield?Key Specifications and FeaturesHardware\nSetup and WiringInstalling the Pololu LibraryBasic...\n\nRead More \u2192\n][86][ [Closed Loop Stepper Motor: When Encoder Feedback Matters][Closed Loop Stepper Motor: When\nEncoder Feedback Matters]\n\nClosed Loop Stepper Motor: When Encoder Feedback Matters\n\nStepper motors are celebrated for their simplicity: send pulses, get predictable rotation. No\nfeedback required. But this simplicity...\n\nRead More \u2192\n][87][ [Stepper Motor Resonance & Vibration: Diagnosis & Damping Tips][Stepper Motor Resonance &\nVibration: Diagnosis & Damping Tips]\n\nStepper Motor Resonance & Vibration: Diagnosis & Damping Tips\n\nIf your CNC machine, 3D printer, or robotic arm makes an alarming buzz or skips steps at certain...\n\nRead More \u2192\n][88]\n\n### Technical Specifications\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nModel \u2502L9110S\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500