t ][78]\n[ Add to compare ][79]\n\n#### ** Quick Overview **\n* * Voltage Supply: 2.2 V ~ 5.5 V (for RTC).\n* Time Format: HH: MM: SS (12/24 hr).\n* 1 Hz output pin SQW.\n* Date Format: YY-MM-DD-dd.\n* DS 3231 based RTC with 2032 Battery Holder.\n\nBrand: [ Generic ][80] SKU: AI0379\nCategory: [RTC Module][81]\nTags: [AT24C32][82], [DS3231][83], [Real Time Clock][84], [RTC Memory Module][85], [RTC Module][86]\n\n\u20b9287.92 (\u20b9244.00 + GST)\n\nPurchase this product now and earn **5** Zbotic Points!\nDS3231 RTC Memory Module Precise Real Time Clock I2C-AT24C32 quantity\nAdd to cart\n[Description][87]\n[Additional information][88]\n[Warranty][89]\n[COO][90]\n\n### **Description:**\n\n**DS3231 RTC Memory Module Precise Real Time Clock I2C-AT24C32**\n\nThe DS3231 RTC Memory Module with I2C interface and integrated AT24C32 offers a low-cost, highly\naccurate real-time clock (RTC) solution. Equipped with a temperature-compensated crystal oscillator\n(TCXO) and a crystal, this module ensures precise timekeeping and improves long-term accuracy by\nminimizing component count during production.\n\nThis RTC module keeps track of seconds, minutes, hours, days, dates, months, and years. It\nautomatically adjusts for months with fewer than 31 days and accounts for leap years. The clock can\noperate in either 24-hour format or 12-hour format with AM/PM indication. It also features two\nconfigurable alarm clocks and a calendar with a square wave output. Data is transferred via a\nbidirectional I2C bus, providing efficient communication with the system.\n\nThe DS3231 includes a precision temperature-compensated voltage reference and comparator circuit\nthat monitors the VCC status, detecting power failures and triggering a reset output if necessary.\nIt can also automatically switch to backup power in the event of a failure. Additionally, a /RST pin\nallows for manual reset generation.\n\nIn terms of additional functionality, the DS3231 incorporates a highly accurate digital temperature\nsensor, accessible via the same I2C interface. The temperature sensor has an accuracy of \u00b13\u00b0C. The\nmodule also features an on-chip power supply control circuit, which manages both primary and backup\npower sources (such as a low-voltage battery). If the main power fails, the device continues to\nprovide accurate time and temperature data without interruption. When the main power returns or\nreaches the proper voltage range, the built-in reset function ensures a smooth system restart.\n\n### Connection Diagram:\n\n#### **[[Generic Ds3231Sm Rtc 1][Generic Ds3231Sm Rtc 1]][91]**\n\n### **Wiring Specification:**\n* SCL : A5\n* SDA : A4\n* VCC : 5V\n* GND : GND\n\n### **Features:**\n* Two Time-of-Day Alarms.\n* Digital Temp Sensor Output.\n* Register for Aging Trim.\n* DS3231 RTC with 2032 Battery Holder.\n* Highly Accurate RTC Completely Manages All Timekeeping Functions.\n* Real-Time Clock Counts Seconds, Minutes, Hours, Date of the Month, Month, Day of the Week, and\nYear, with Leap-Year Compensation Valid Up to 2100.\n* Configurable I2C device Address for AT24C02 using SMD jumpers on PCB (A0, A1, A2).\n* Programmable Square-Wave Output Signal.\n* Battery-Backup Input for Continuous Timekeeping.\n* Low Power Operation Extends Battery-Backup Run Time.\n\n### **Specification : **\n* Voltage Supply: 2.2 V ~ 5.5 V (for RTC).\n* Time Format: HH: MM: SS (12/24 hr).\n* 1 Hz output pin SQW.\n* Date Format: YY-MM-DD-dd.\n* DS 3231 based RTC with 2032 Battery Holder.\n\n### **Package Includes:**\n* 1 x DS3231 RTC Memory Module\n\n#### Datasheet:\n\n[[PDF Definition - What is a PDF document?][PDF Definition - What is a PDF document?]][92]\n\n#### Tutorial:\n\n**Note: **Battery is not included with module.\n\n**Tags:** [AT24C32][93] [DS3231][94] [Real Time Clock][95] [RTC Memory Module][96] [RTC Module][97]\n**Also in RTC Module:**\n[PCF8563 RTC Board For Raspberry Pi Real Time Clock Module-Blue][98][PCF8563 PCF8563T 8563 IIC Real\nTime Clock RTC Module][99][Tiny RTC Real Time Clock DS1307 I2C IIC Module for Arduino][100][DS1307\nRTC I2C Module AT24C32 without Battery][101]\n\n### Technical Specifications\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nModel \u2502DS3231\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nInterface / Protocol\u2502I2C\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSKU \u2502AI0379\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nWeight \u25020.01 kg\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nAvailability \u2502In Stock\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n### Applications & Use Cases\n\nThe DS3231 RTC Memory Module Precise Real Time Clock I2C-AT24C32 is a versatile rtc module used\nacross a wide range of applications including electronics projects, DIY builds, prototyping, and\neducational experiments.\n\n**Common use cases:**\n* Integrating into a custom electronics project\n* Learning and experimenting with circuits\n* Replacing or upgrading components in existing setups\n\nThis product is ideal for electronics enthusiasts, engineers, and students.\n\n**Technical Tip:** Always verify voltage and current requirements before connecting to your circuit.\nCheck datasheets for detailed specifications and pin confi