] [\nPinterest ][71] [ Whatsapp ][72]\n[ Add to wishlist ][73]\n[ Add to compare ][74]\n\n1 channel relay board\n\nOperating Voltage 5V\n\nMax Current: 20mA\n\nRelay Contact Current Capacity at AC250V: 10A.\n\nRelay Contact Current Capacity at DC5V: 10A\n\nPower supply indicator lamp\n\nControl indicator lamp\n\nTriode drive, increasing relay coil\n\nBrand: [ Generic ][75] SKU: AI0018\nCategory: [Relay Modules][76]\nTags: [1 Channel Relay][77], [1 Channel Relay Module][78], [Relay][79], [Relay Module][80]\n\n\u20b952.98 (\u20b944.90 + GST)\n\nPurchase this product now and earn **1** Zbotic Point!\n5V 1 Channel Relay Module quantity\nAdd to cart\n[Description][81]\n[Additional information][82]\n[Warranty][83]\n[COO][84]\n\nThis is the **5V** variant of the 5V 1 Channel Relay Module in Relay Modules. Available at \u20b952.98\n(\u20b944.90 + GST) with free shipping across India.\n\n**5V 1 Channel Relay Module**\n\nThe 1-channel relay board operates at 5V and offers a simple solution for controlling 240V power\nappliances directly from microcontrollers and other control systems. It\u2019s an ideal choice for\nswitching devices like lights and fans.\n\nEquipped with a high-quality relay, the board can handle a maximum load of 10A at 120V or 7A at 240V\nAC, and 7A at 24V DC. The relay\u2019s connections\u2014Common (C), Normally Open (NO), and Normally Closed\n(NC)\u2014are easily accessible via 3-pin screw terminals, allowing for straightforward setup and\ndisconnection.\n\nFor improved usability, the board features indicators for power and relay status, which simplify the\ndebugging process. Additionally, power input and relay control signals are conveniently available\nthrough header pins on the board, providing flexibility for integration into existing systems.\n\n**Features **\n* 5 V relay can be used for home automation configured with micro-controller.\n* High voltage handling capacity of 220v ac with full protection\n* Led indication of relay functioning\n* One normally closed contact and one normally open contact\n* High impedance controller pin\n* Pull-down circuit for avoidance of malfunction\n* Indicator for Relay output status\n* Can Be controlled various appliances & other Equipment With Large current.\n* Standard TTL Level logic controlled (AVR, Arduino, 8051, PIC, ARM)\n* The module is compliant with international safety standards, control and load areas isolation\ntrenches.\n\n**Specification:**\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSwitching Voltage (VDC)\u250230@10A\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nLength (mm): \u250238\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nWidth (mm): \u250226\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nHeight (mm): \u250218\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nWeight (g): \u250213\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n**Package Includes**\n\n1 x 5V 1 Channel Relay Module\n\n**Tags:** [1 Channel Relay][85] [1 Channel Relay Module][86] [Relay][87] [Relay Module][88]\n**Also in Relay Modules:**\n[5V 1 Channel Bluetooth, Relay Module Things, Smart Home Remote, Control Switch][89][6 Channel 24V\nRelay Module Solid State Low Level SSR DC Control 250V 2A with Resistive Fuse][90][4 Channel 24V\nRelay Module Solid State Low Level SSR DC Control 250V 2A with Resistive Fuse][91][XY-LJ02 6-30V\nMicro USB, Digital LCD Display Time, Delay Relay Module, Control Timer Switch, Trigger Cycle\nTiming][92]\n**Related Articles:**\n[ [Tasmota Firmware: Flash Smart Plugs and Sensors for IoT][Tasmota Firmware: Flash Smart Plugs and\nSensors for IoT]\n\nTasmota Firmware: Flash Smart Plugs and Sensors for IoT\n\nFlashing Tasmota firmware on smart plugs and IoT sensors is the single most impactful thing you can\ndo...\n\nRead More \u2192\n][93][ [IoT Street Light Controller: Smart City Lighting][IoT Street Light Controller: Smart City\nLighting]\n\nIoT Street Light Controller: Smart City Lighting\n\nTable of Contents Smart Street Lighting Overview Light Sensors and Controllers Hardware Design for\nOutdoor Use Wireless Network...\n\nRead More \u2192\n][94][ [Azure IoT Hub with ESP32: Microsoft Cloud Integration Guide][Azure IoT Hub with ESP32:\nMicrosoft Cloud Integration Guide]\n\nAzure IoT Hub with ESP32: Microsoft Cloud Integration Guide\n\nThe Azure IoT Hub ESP32 tutorial space has grown dramatically as Indian engineering teams and\nstartups look beyond...\n\nRead More \u2192\n][95]\n\n### Technical Specifications\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nOperating Voltage\u25025V\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nChannels \u25021-channel\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSKU \u2502AI0018\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nWeight \u25020.02 kg\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nAvailability \u2502In Stock\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n### Applications & Use Cases\n\nThe 5V 1 Channel Relay Module is a versatile relay modules used across a wide range of applications\nincluding home automation, industrial control, IoT projects, Arduino/Raspberry Pi interfacing, and\nmotor control.\n\n**Common use cases:**\n* Switching high-voltage AC appliances with a microcontroller\n* Building a smart home relay board\n* Automating irrigation pumps in agriculture\n\nThis product is ideal for electronics engineers, IoT developers, and automation hobbyists.\n\n**Technical Tip:** Use optocoupler-isolated relay modules to protect your microcontroller. Match\nrelay coil voltage to your MCU logic level (3.3V or 5V).\n\n### Shipping & Delivery\n* **Free shipping** on orders above \u20b9999 across India\n* Dispatched within **1-3 business days**\n* Expected delivery: **3-7 business days** depending on location\n* Secure packaging to ensure safe transit of electronic components\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nWeight \u25020.02 kg\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nDimensions\u25024 \u00d7 4 \u00d7 3 cm\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**15 Days Warranty**\n\nPlease note that this item is only covered by a standard supplier warranty against manufacturing\ndefects for a period of 15days from the time of delivery. It is important to understand that only\nmanufacturing defects are covered under this warranty, and any other issues will not be considered\nfor reimbursement or replacement. We strongly advise inspecting the product upon delivery to ensure\nit meets your expectations. In case of any manufacturing defects, we guarantee reimbursement or\nreplacement.\n\n##### **What voids warranty:**\n\nIf the product is subject to misuse, tampering, static discharge, accident, water or fire damage,\nuse of chemicals & soldered or altered in any way.\n\n**Tags:** [1 Channel Relay][96] [1 Channel Relay Module][97] [Relay][98] [Relay Module][99]\n**Also in Relay Modules:**\n[5V Modbus RTU 1Channel Relay Module Input Optocoupler Isolation RS485 MCU for Arduino][100][8\nChannel 12V Relay Module Solid State Low Level SSR DC Control 240V 2A with Resistive Fuse][101][6\nChannel 5V Relay Module Solid State High Level SSR DC Control 250V 2A with Resistive Fuse][102][2\nChannel 12V Relay Module Solid State High Level SSR DC Control 240V 2A with Resistive][103]\n**Related Articles:**\n[ [IoT Fleet Management: GPS Tracking for Delivery Vehicles][IoT Fleet Management: GPS Tracking for\nDelivery Vehicles]\n\nIoT Fleet Management: GPS Tracking for Delivery Vehicles\n\nTable of Contents Introduction and Overview Hardware Components Required GPS Module Integration with\nESP32 Cloud Platform Setup Real-Time...\n\nRead More \u2192\n][104][ [ESP32 Provisioning App: Configure WiFi Without Hardcoding][ESP32 Provisioning App:\nConfigure WiFi Without Hardcoding]\n\nESP32 Provisioning App: Configure WiFi Without Hardcoding\n\nIf you've ever built an ESP32 project, you know the frustration of hardcoding WiFi credentials into\nyour firmware....\n\nRead More \u2192\n][105][ [Best ESP32 Development Boards in India (2026 Buyer\u2019s Guide)][Best ESP32 Development Boards\nin India (2026 Buyer\u2019s Guide)]\n\nBest ESP32 Development Boards in India (2026 Buyer\u2019s Guide)\n\nChoosing the right ESP32 development board can feel overwhelming when there are dozens of variants\navailable in India...\n\nRead More \u2192\n][106]\n**Country Of Origin:** China\n\n## 30 reviews for 5V 1 Channel Relay Module\n1. [Avatar of Tejas Mukherjee][Avatar of Tejas Mukherjee]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Tejas Mukherjee ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 July 20, 2020\n\nOutstanding quality! This 5V 1 Channel Relay has been running 24/7 for months without a single\nfailure.\n2. [Avatar of Nandini Gupta][Avatar of Nandini Gupta]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Nandini Gupta ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 January 30, 2021\n\nPerfect 5V 1 Channel Relay for my IoT project. Controlling appliances remotely works flawlessly.\n3. [Avatar of Manish Mittal][Avatar of Manish Mittal]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Manish Mittal ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 March 1, 2021\n\nGreat 5V 1 Channel Relay. Easy to integrate with NodeMCU for WiFi-based control.\n4. [Avatar of MANISH SINGH][Avatar of MANISH SINGH]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**MANISH SINGH ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 May 8, 2021\n\nGood product and usable\n5. [Avatar of Tech Projector][Avatar of Tech Projector]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Tech Projector ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 May 15, 2021\n6. [Avatar of Amitava Dutta][Avatar of Amitava Dutta]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Amitava Dutta ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 June 5, 2021\n7. [Avatar of Shruti Mishra][Avatar of Shruti Mishra]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Shruti Mishra ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 November 26, 2021\n\nSuperb 5V 1 Channel Relay! Using it to control my garden irrigation system. Very dependable.\n8. [Avatar of Anil Kapoor][Avatar of Anil Kapoor]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Anil Kapoor ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 September 7, 2022\n\nVery satisfied. My smart home system runs on these 5V 1 Channel Relay modules. Totally reliable.\n9. [Avatar of Jai Bhandari][Avatar of Jai Bhandari]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Jai Bhandari ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 October 14, 2022\n\nPerfect 5V 1 Channel Relay for my IoT projec