of 5 based on 16 customer ratings\n[(16 customer reviews)][64]\nShare: [ Facebook ][65] [ Twitter ][66] [ Tumblr ][67] [ Linkedin ][68] [ Houzz ][69] [ Vk ][70] [\nPinterest ][71] [ Whatsapp ][72]\n[ Add to wishlist ][73]\n[ Add to compare ][74]\n\n**QUICK OVERVIEW**\n* Pin count: 20\n* Max. number of GPIOs (I/O):16\n* External interrupt pins: 16\n* Timer CAPCOM channels: 7\n* Timer complementary outputs: 2\n* A/D converter channels: 5\n* High-sink I/Os: 12\n* Low-density Flash program memory (byte): 8K\n\nBrand: [ Generic ][75] SKU: AI0490\nCategory: [Microcontroller ICs][76]\nTags: [Microcontroller][77], [Semiconductor IC][78], [STM8S003F3P6][79]\n\n\u20b9\u03367\u03360\u0336.\u03368\u03360\u0336 Original price was: \u20b970.80.\u20b956.64Current price is: \u20b956.64. (\u20b948.00 + GST)\n\nPurchase this product now and earn **1** Zbotic Point!\nSTM8S003F3P6 IC quantity\nAdd to cart\n[Description][80]\n[Additional information][81]\n[Warranty][82]\n[COO][83]\n\n**Product Description**\n\nThe STM8S003F3 value line 8-bit microcontrollers feature 8 Kbytes of Flash program memory and\nintegrated true data EEPROM. Classified as low-density devices within the STM8S microcontroller\nfamily (referenced in RM0016), the STM8S003F3 offers a blend of performance, reliability, and\ncost-efficiency.\n\nThese microcontrollers are both powerful and resilient, equipped with a true data EEPROM capable of\nenduring up to 100,000 write/erase cycles. With an advanced core and peripherals running at a 16 MHz\nclock frequency, robust I/O pins, and features such as independent watchdogs with separate clock\nsources and a clock security system, the STM8S003F3 ensures reliable operation. Additionally, system\ncosts are minimized thanks to its high level of integration, which includes internal clock\noscillators, watchdogs, and brown-out reset functionality.\n\n**Features **\n* Pin count: 20\n* Max. number of GPIOs (I/O):16\n* External interrupt pins: 16\n* Timer CAPCOM channels: 7\n* Timer complementary outputs: 2\n* A/D converter channels: 5\n* High-sink I/Os: 12\n* Low-density Flash program memory (byte): 8K\n* RAM (byte): 1K\n* True data EEPROM (byte): 128\n* Peripheral set: Multi purpose timer (TIM1), SPI, I2C, UART, Window WDG, independent WDG, ADC, PWM\ntimer (TIM2), 8-bit timer (TIM4)\n\n**Package Includes**\n* 1 x STM8S003F3P6 IC\n\n**Tags:** [Microcontroller][84] [Semiconductor IC][85] [STM8S003F3P6][86]\n**Also in Microcontroller ICs:**\n[ATMEGA328P U-KR][87][GD32F103C8T6 Minimum System Board Microcomputer STM32 ARM Core\nBoard][88][ATmega328P U-TH Microcontroller][89][ATMEGA8515-16PU MICROCHIP][90]\n\n### Technical Specifications\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nModel \u2502STM8S003F3P6\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSKU \u2502AI0490\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nWeight \u25020.0 kg\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nAvailability\u2502In Stock\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n### Applications & Use Cases\n\nThe STM8S003F3P6 IC is a versatile microcontroller ics used across a wide range of applications\nincluding electronics projects, DIY builds, prototyping, and educational experiments.\n\n**Common use cases:**\n* Integrating into a custom electronics project\n* Learning and experimenting with circuits\n* Replacing or upgrading components in existing setups\n\nThis product is ideal for electronics enthusiasts, engineers, and students.\n\n**Technical Tip:** Always verify voltage and current requirements before connecting to your circuit.\nCheck datasheets for detailed specifications and pin configurations.\n\n### Shipping & Delivery\n* **Free shipping** on orders above \u20b9999 across India\n* Dispatched within **1-3 business days**\n* Expected delivery: **3-7 business days** depending on location\n* Secure packaging to ensure safe transit of electronic components\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nWeight\u25020.0 kg\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**15 Days Warranty**\n\nPlease note that this item is only covered by a standard supplier warranty against manufacturing\ndefects for a period of 15days from the time of delivery. It is important to understand that only\nmanufacturing defects are covered under this warranty, and any other issues will not be considered\nfor reimbursement or replacement. We strongly advise inspecting the product upon delivery to ensure\nit meets your expectations. In case of any manufacturing defects, we guarantee reimbursement or\nreplacement.\n\n##### **What voids warranty:**\n\nIf the product is subject to misuse, tampering, static discharge, accident, water or fire damage,\nuse of chemicals & soldered or altered in any way.\n\n**Tags:** [Microcontroller][91] [Semiconductor IC][92] [STM8S003F3P6][93]\n**Also in Microcontroller ICs:**\n[GD32F103C8T6 Minimum System Board Microcomputer STM32 ARM Core Board][94][ATMEGA8515-16PU\nMICROCHIP][95][ATmega328P U-TH Microcontroller][96][ATmega328P-U Microcontroller][97]\n**Country Of Origin:** China\n\n## 16 reviews for STM8S003F3P6 IC\n1. [Avatar of Darshan Garg][Avatar of Darshan Garg]\nRated **3** out of 5\n\n**Darshan Garg ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 March 20, 2022\n\nAverage STM8S003F3P6 IC. Most are good quality but found a few out-of-spec pieces.\n2. [Avatar of Tejas Thakur][Avatar of Tejas Thakur]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Tejas Thakur ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 March 21, 2022\n\nThis STM8S003F3P6 IC is essential for any electronics lab. Good quality components.\n3. [Avatar of Deepika Kapoor][Avatar of Deepika Kapoor]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Deepika Kapoor ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 April 4, 2022\n\nExcellent STM8S003F3P6 IC! Values are accurate and quality is great. Perfect for my projects.\n4. [Avatar of Vidya Arora][Avatar of Vidya Arora]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Vidya Arora ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 May 18, 2022\n\nSuperb STM8S003F3P6 IC! Using these in all my circuit designs. Never had a failure.\n5. [Avatar of Gauri Dhillon][Avatar of Gauri Dhillon]\nRated **4** out of 5\n\n**Gauri Dhillon ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 June 3, 2022\n\nNice STM8S003F3P6 IC. Values are accurate. Good assortment for hobby projects.\n6. [Avatar of Suresh Parekh][Avatar of Suresh Parekh]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Suresh Parekh ** \u2013 January 6, 2023\n\nThis STM8S003F3P6 IC is essential for any electronics lab. Good quality components.\n7. [Avatar of Gauri Tiwari][Avatar of Gauri Tiwari]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Gauri Tiwari ** \u2013 October 6, 2023\n\nExcellent STM8S003F3P6 IC! Values are accurate and quality is great. Perfect for my projects.\n8. [Avatar of Sandhya Dave][Avatar of Sandhya Dave]\nRated **4** out of 5\n\n**Sandhya Dave ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 October 7, 2023\n\nNice STM8S003F3P6 IC. Values are accurate. Good assortment for hobby projects.\n9. [Avatar of Tanvi Sen][Avatar of Tanvi Sen]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Tanvi Sen ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 October 16, 2023\n\nSuperb STM8S003F3P6 IC! Using these in all my circuit designs. Never had a failure.\n10. [Avatar of Siddharth Chauhan][Avatar of Siddharth Chauhan]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Siddharth Chauhan ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 March 7, 2024\n\nLove this STM8S003F3P6 IC. Great variety and all components are genuine. Highly recommended.\n11. [Avatar of Sonali Ghosh][Avatar of Sonali Ghosh]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Sonali Ghosh ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 May 10, 2024\n\nOutstanding quality! This STM8S003F3P6 IC is well sorted and labeled. Very convenient.\n12. [Avatar of Shruti Chauhan][Avatar of Shruti Chauhan]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Shruti Chauhan ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 June 7, 2024\n\nOutstanding quality! This STM8S003F3P6 IC is well sorted and labeled. Very convenient.\n13. [Avatar of Tanya Chatterjee][Avatar of Tanya Chatterjee]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Tanya Chatterjee ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 September 3, 2024\n\nThis STM8S003F3P6 IC saved me multiple trips to the electronics market. Everything I need in one\npack.\n14. [Avatar of Nakul Sen][Avatar of Nakul Sen]\nRated **3** out of 5\n\n**Nakul Sen ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 December 8, 2024\n\nAverage STM8S003F3P6 IC. Most are good quality but found a few out-of-spec pieces.\n15. [Avatar of Tanvi Singh][Avatar of Tanvi Singh]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Tanvi Singh ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 May 11, 2025\n\nSuperb STM8S003F3P6 IC! Using these in all my circuit designs. Never had a failure.\n16. [Avatar of Neeraj Choudhury][Avatar of Neeraj Choudhury]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Neeraj Choudhury ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 June 18, 2025\n\nSuperb STM8S003F3P6 IC! Using these in all my circuit designs. Never had a failure.\n\nOnly logged in customers who have purchased this product may leave a review.\n\n## Related products\n\nIn stock\n\n[ [WeMos LOLIN32 V1.0.0 based on ESP32 Rev1 Wifi Bluetooth Board][WeMos LOLIN32 V1.0.0 based on\nESP32 Rev1 Wifi Bluetooth Board] ][98] Quick View\n\n## [WeMos LOLIN32 V1.0.0 based on ESP32 Rev1 Wifi Bluetooth Board][99]\n\nSKU: AI1361 \u20b9554.60 (\u20b9470.00 + GST) [Add to cart][100] [ Add to Compare ][101]\n\nIn stock\n\n[ [ESP8266/ ESP-12F Module/ Serial WiFi Witty Cloud Development Board + Mini NodeMCU][ESP8266/\nESP-12F Module/ Serial WiFi Witty Cloud Development Board + Mini NodeMCU] ][102] Quick View\n\n## [ESP8266/ ESP-12F Module/ Serial WiFi Witty Cl