            "text": "[ [Zbotic Logo][Zbotic Logo] [Zbotic Logo][Zbotic Logo] ][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [Shop][3]\n* [Sale][4]\n* [3D Print Service][5]\n* [PCB Service][6]\n* [B2B][7]\n* [Blogs][8]\n* [Contact Us][9]\n[ ][10]\n[ 0 ][11] 0\n\n[View Wishlist][12] [Add all to cart][13]\n\n[ 0 ][14] 0\n[ 0 Shopping Cart ][15]\n[Shopping cart (0)][16]\nSubtotal: \u20b90.00\n\n[View cart][17][Checkout][18]\n* [Shop][19]\n* [About Us][20]\n* [Contact Us][21]\n* [Reseller][22]\n* [Blogs][23]\n\n020 69134444\n1800 209 0998\n[[email protected]][24]\nHelp Desk\n[ Facebook ][25] [ Twitter ][26] [ Instagram ][27] [ Linkedin ][28] [ YouTube ][29]\n[ [Zbotic Logo][Zbotic Logo] [Zbotic Logo][Zbotic Logo] ][30]\nSearch input Search\n[ ][31]\n[ 0 ][32] 0\n\n[View Wishlist][33] [Add all to cart][34]\n\n[ 0 ][35] 0\n[ 0 Shopping Cart ][36]\n[Shopping cart (0)][37]\nSubtotal: \u20b90.00\n\n[View cart][38][Checkout][39]\n\nAll departments\n* [3D Print Service][40]\n* [3D Printer][41]\n* [Batteries & Chargers][42]\n* [Development Boards][43]\n* [Drone Parts][44]\n* [EBike parts][45]\n* [Sensor Modules][46]\n* [Electronic Components][47]\n* [Electronic Modules][48]\n* [IoT and Wireless][49]\n* [Mechanical Parts and Workbench Tools][50]\n* [Motors & Drivers & Pumps & Actuators][51]\n* [DIY and Robot Kits][52]\n* Show more\n* [Home][53]\n* [Shop][54]\n* [Sale][55]\n* [3D Print Service][56]\n* [PCB Service][57]\n* [B2B][58]\n* [Blogs][59]\n* [Contact Us][60]\n[Home][61] [IoT and Wireless][62] [Other ESP WIFI Modules][63] [Return to previous page][64]\nSale 8%\n[ [Nodemcu Board - AI0182..4] ][65]\n[ [AI0182..3] ][66]\n[ [AI0182..2] ][67]\n* [Nodemcu Board - AI0182..4][Nodemcu Board - AI0182..4]\n* [AI0182..3][AI0182..3]\n* [AI0182..2][AI0182..2]\n\n# NodeMcu ESP8266 V3 Lua CH340 WiFi Development Board\n\nRated **4.69** out of 5 based on 35 customer ratings\n[(35 customer reviews)][68]\nShare: [ Facebook ][69] [ Twitter ][70] [ Tumblr ][71] [ Linkedin ][72] [ Houzz ][73] [ Vk ][74] [\nPinterest ][75] [ Whatsapp ][76]\n[ Add to wishlist ][77]\n[ Add to compare ][78]\n\n#### ** Quick Overview **\n* Power Input: 4.5V ~ 9V (10VMAX), USB-powered\n* Transfer Rate: 110-460800bps\n* Support UART / GPIO data communication interface\n* Support Smart Link Smart Networking\n* Working temperature: -40\u00b0C ~ 125\u00b0C\n* Drive Type: Dual high-power H-bridge\n* Don\u2019t need to download resetting\n* A great set of tools to develop ESP8266\n* Flash size: 4MByte\n* Lowest cost WI-FI\n\nBrand: [ Generic ][79] SKU: AI0182\nCategory: [Other ESP WIFI Modules][80]\nTags: [Buy Online India][81], [Development Board][82], [ESP Module][83], [ESP8266][84], [ESP8266\nSeries][85], [ESP8266 WiFi Module][86], [IoT][87], [Microcontroller][88], [NodeMCU][89], [WiFi][90],\n[WiFi Module][91], [Wireless][92], [Zbotic][93]\n\n\u20b9\u03362\u03360\u03360\u0336.\u03366\u03360\u0336 Original price was: \u20b9200.60.\u20b9184.08Current price is: \u20b9184.08. (\u20b9156.00 + GST)\n\nPurchase this product now and earn **4** Zbotic Points!\nNodeMcu ESP8266 V3 Lua CH340 WiFi Development Board quantity\nAdd to cart\n[Description][94]\n[Additional information][95]\n[Warranty][96]\n[COO][97]\n\n### **Product Description:**\n\n**NodeMcu ESP8266 V3 Lua CH340 WiFi Development Board**\n\nIntroducing the revolutionary NodeMcu ESP8266 V3 Lua CH340 Wifi Dev. Board! This cutting-edge,\nlow-cost WiFi technology uses a modern, high-level and mature LUA-based programming. It has all the\nresources on board and I/O pins you need to enhance your existing Arduino projects or any\ndevelopment board with ease.\n\nYou can use modern Internet development tools such as Node.js with the built-in API of NodeMCU to\nput your idea on the fast track immediately. NodeMCU is built on the mature ESP8266 technology and\nleverages the abundant resources available on the web.\n\nNodeMCU has ESP-12 based serial WiFi integrated on board, which provides GPIO, PWM, ADC, I2C and\n1-WIRE resources at your fingertips. It also has a built-in USB-TTL serial with a super reliable\nindustrial strength CH340 for superior stability on all supported platforms. This module is one of\nthe most affordable wifi-modules in the market. V3 or Version3 is the latest version of this module.\nThis tutorial will help you to connect all the versions of ESP8266 NodeMcu, i.e V1, V2 or V3.\n\n1.Arduino-like hardware IO \u2013 An advanced API for hardware IO, which can dramatically\nreduce the redundant work for configuring and manipulating hardware. You can code like Arduino, but\ninteractively in Lua script.\n2.Nodejs style network API \u2013 An event-driven API for network applications, which enables developers\nto write code for a 5mm5mm sized MCU in Nodejs style. It greatly speeds up your IOT application\ndevelopment process.\nDevelopment Kit \u2013 The Development Kit based on ESP8266 integrates GPIO, PWM, IIC, 1-Wire and ADC all\non one board. It powers your development in the fastest way with NodeMCU Firmware!\nThe NodeMcu is an open-source firmware and development kit that helps you to prototype your\nIoT product with a few lines of Lua script. It integrates GPIO, PWM, IIC, 1- Wire and ADC\nall on one board based on ESP8266.\n\n### **Features:**\n* Uses CH340G.\n* Wireless 802.11 b/g/n standard\n* WiFi at 2.4GHz, support WPA / WPA2 security mode\n* Support STA/AP/STA AP three operating modes\n* Built-in TCP/IP protocol stack to support multiple TCP Client connections (5 MAX)\n* Support UART / GPIO data communication interface\n* Remote firmware upgrade (OTA)\n* Support Smart Link Smart Networking\n* ESP8266 has IO Pin\n* Don\u2019t need to download resetting\n* A great set of tools to develop ESP8266\n* Lowest cost WI-FI\n* FOR Arduino like hardware IO\n* Greatly speed up your IOT application developing process\n* Open-source, Interactive, Programmable, Low cost, Simple, Smart, WI-FI enabled\n* WI-FI MCU ESP8266 integrated and easy to prototyping development kit.\n* We provide the best platform for IoT application development at the lowest cost.\n* NodeMCU has built-in USB-TTL serial with super reliable industrial strength CH340G for superior\nstability on all supported platforms.\n* Advanced API for hardware IO, which can dramatically reduce the redundant work for configuring and\nmanipulating hardware.\n* Event-driven API for network applications, which facilitates developers writing code running on a\n5mm*5mm sized MCU in Nodejs style.\n\n### **Specification:**\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nDrive Type \u2502Dual high-power H-bridge\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPower Input(V) \u25024.5 to 9\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nCommunication Interface Voltage(V)\u25023.3\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nFlash size(MB) \u25024\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nOperating Temperature Range (\u00b0C): \u2502-40 to 125\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nTransfer Rate(Kbps) \u2502110 to 460800\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nAD0 \u25021 channel ADC\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nLength (mm): \u250258\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nWidth (mm) \u250231\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2