1][XH-W3001 AC 220V 120W\nDigital Microcomputer Thermostat Switch-Zbotic1]\n* [XH-W3001 AC 220V 120W Digital Microcomputer Thermostat Switch-Zbotic2][XH-W3001 AC 220V 120W\nDigital Microcomputer Thermostat Switch-Zbotic2]\n* [favjstkm]\n\n# XH-W3001 AC 220V 1500W Digital Microcomputer Thermostat Switch\n\nRated **4.70** out of 5 based on 37 customer ratings\n[(37 customer reviews)][69]\nShare: [ Facebook ][70] [ Twitter ][71] [ Tumblr ][72] [ Linkedin ][73] [ Houzz ][74] [ Vk ][75] [\nPinterest ][76] [ Whatsapp ][77]\n[ Add to wishlist ][78]\n[ Add to compare ][79]\n\nOutput type: AC Output (AC 220V 1500W).\n\nTemperature setting upper and lower limits.\n\nSimple operation, suitable for seafood machines.\n\nTemperature Measuring Range: -50~110\u00b0C.\n\nTemperature Control Range: -50~110\u00b0C.\n\nControl Accuracy: Upto 0.1\u2103.\n\nBrand: [ Generic ][80] SKU: AI0153\nCategory: [Temperature & Humidity Sensor][81]\nTags: [Digital Temperature Controller][82], [Microcomputer Thermostat Switch][83], [Temperature\nController][84], [Thermostat Switch][85]\n\n\u20b9159.30 (\u20b9135.00 + GST)\n\nPurchase this product now and earn **3** Zbotic Points!\nXH-W3001 AC 220V 1500W Digital Microcomputer Thermostat Switch quantity\nAdd to cart\n[Description][86]\n[Additional information][87]\n[Warranty][88]\n[COO][89]\n\nThis is the **220V** variant of the XH-W3001 AC 220V 1500W Digital Microcomputer Thermostat Switch\nin Temperature & Humidity Sensor. Available at \u20b9159.30 (\u20b9135.00 + GST) with free shipping across\nIndia.\n\n**XH-W3001 AC 220V 1500W Digital Microcomputer Thermostat Switch**\n\nDiscover the XH-W3001 AC 220V 1500W Digital Microcomputer Thermostat Switch, your dependable choice\nfor temperature control and management at an exceptional value. This digital thermostat offers\nprecise temperature measurement and control, ensuring superior performance across various\napplications.\n\nBoasting a high temperature control accuracy of 0.1\u2103 and a broad temperature range from -50\u2103 to\n110\u2103, the XH-W3001 thermostat switch is versatile and precise for multiple temperature-dependent\ntasks.\n\nFeaturing a vivid LED display, the XH-W3001 facilitates effortless monitoring of temperature levels,\noffering immediate feedback on any temperature fluctuations. Its user-centric design ensures swift\nand easy installation or integration into industrial control equipment panels, enhancing your\nworkflow and productivity.\n\nThe XH-W3001 is equipped with a robust 1M probe made of stainless steel, ensuring it is waterproof\nand rust-resistant for sustained performance. Moreover, all sensitive components are encased in an\nABS flame retardant shell, providing safety and resilience against environmental elements.\n\nThe thermostat switch includes user-friendly button functions for straightforward operation. Press\nthe UP button to reveal the start temperature setting, and adjust the temperature using the UP or\nDOWN buttons. The DOWN button ceases temperature control, and a prolonged press sets the stop\ntemperature value effortlessly.\n\nElevate your temperature control system with the XH-W3001 Digital Microcomputer Thermostat Switch\nand experience accurate, dependable temperature regulation for your needs.\n\n###### **Button Functions:**\n1. Press UP to show the start temperature button.\n2. On Long press of the UP button, the display starts flashing, then press the UP or DOWN button Set\nthe beginning of the temperature value\n3. Press Down the display button to stop temperature.\n4. On the Long press of the Down button, the display starts flashing, then press the Up or Down\nbutton Set to stop the temperature value.\n\n**Features**\n* Easy to install\n* Output type: Direct Output\n* Output capacity: MAX 10Aemperature measurement, display; refrigeration, heating control\n* Temperature setting upper and lower limits\n* Simple operation, suitable for seafood machines.\n* Upper key: The start temperature is displayed in one press, and long press to set start\ntemperature.\n* Lower key: The stop temperature is displayed in one press, and long press to set stop temperature.\n\n**Specifications:**\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nModel No. \u2502XH-W3001\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nOperating Voltage (V) \u2502110~220\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nRated Power (W) \u25021500\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nRated Current (mA) \u250210 Amp Max.\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nMeasurement Input \u2502NTC10K\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nTemp. Measuring Range (\u00b0C) \u2502-50 ~ 110\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u