yzg][mj0y5yzg]\n* [j2djtfgm][j2djtfgm]\n\n# RS232 to TTL Serial Port Converter DB9 MAX3232 Connector Module\n\nRated **4.64** out of 5 based on 22 customer ratings\n[(22 customer reviews)][71]\nShare: [ Facebook ][72] [ Twitter ][73] [ Tumblr ][74] [ Linkedin ][75] [ Houzz ][76] [ Vk ][77] [\nPinterest ][78] [ Whatsapp ][79]\n[ Add to wishlist ][80]\n[ Add to compare ][81]\n\n#### **Quick Overview:**\n* IC Chip: MAX3232\n* Operating Voltage: 3.3-5.5V\n* It can be used to program STC MCU, NXP MCU, Renesas MCU, STM32 MCU, N -2EC MCU\n* Pre-assembled compact size board\n* Suitable for use with most microcontrollers\n* Operates up to 250 kbit/s\n\nBrand: [ Generic ][82] SKU: AI0014\nCategory: [USB Interface Module][83]\nTags: [Conversion Board][84], [Converter][85], [MAX3232][86], [RS232 Female][87], [RS232 to TTL][88]\n\n\u20b9\u03365\u03363\u0336.\u03361\u03360\u0336 Original price was: \u20b953.10.\u20b947.08Current price is: \u20b947.08. (\u20b939.90 + GST)\n\nPurchase this product now and earn **1** Zbotic Point!\nRS232 to TTL Serial Port Converter DB9 MAX3232 Connector Module quantity\nAdd to cart\n[Description][89]\n[Additional information][90]\n[Warranty][91]\n[COO][92]\n\n### **RS232 to TTL Serial Port Converter DB9 MAX3232 Connector Module**\n\nThis **RS232 to TTL Serial Interface Module** features the **MAX3232 transceiver integrated circuit\n(IC)**, enabling efficient serial communication between **TTL** and **RS232** ports through\nessential electrical signal conversion.\n\nTypically, the board includes a **DB9 connector** on one end and **four header pins with jumper\ncables** on the other. The **jumper cables** allow easy connections to a **breadboard or\nmicrocontroller project**, while the **DB9 connects directly to a computer\u2019s COM port**.\n\nThe **MAX3232CSE IC** comes in a **16-pin narrow SO package**, operating within a **voltage range of\n3.0 V to 5.5 V**. It includes **two receivers and two transmitters**, with a **maximum guaranteed\ndata rate of 120 kbps**. The circuitry requires **four 0.1\u00b5F charge-pump support capacitors** and is\ncompatible with the well-known **MAX3232 IC pins**. This module connects to systems with **UART**,\nmaking it suitable for use with **ATMEL** and **PIC microcontrollers**.\n\nOur **MAX3232 RS232 Serial Port to TTL Converter Module** features a **DB9 connector** and\n**supports 5V TTL connections**. It can be used to **expand the serial port capabilities of\nmicrocontroller modules**, as well as **connect to devices such as DVD players, routers, and hard\ndrives**.\n\nSimplify your serial communication needs with our **RS232 to TTL Serial Interface Module**,\nfeaturing the integrated **MAX3232 transceiver IC** for seamless project integration.\n\n### **Features:**\n* **Integration of MAX3232 transceiver IC** for efficient signal conversion\n* **Sturdy DB9 connector** for direct connection to computer COM ports\n* **Convenient jumper cables with header pins** for easy integration into breadboards or\nmicrocontroller projects\n* **Supports a wide voltage range of 3.0V to 5.5V**, making it compatible with various setups\n* **Maximum data rate of 120 kbps** for swift communication\n* **Compact design** for space-saving installation\n* **Ideal for a range of applications** including radio modification, device flashing, GPS systems,\nand more\n* **Compatible with popular microcontroller platforms** such as ATMEL, PIC, STC MCU, NXP MCU,\nRenesas MCU, STM32 MCU, and N-2EC MCU\n\nUpgrade your serial communication setup with our **reliable RS232 to TTL Serial Interface Module**.\nWhether you\u2019re a hobbyist or a professional, this module offers **versatility and performance** to\nmeet your project requirements.\n\n### **Specifications:**\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\n**Width (mm):** \u250232\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\