00\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n### Applications & Use Cases\n\nThe RFID Reader/Writer RC522 SPI S50 with RFID Card and Tag is a versatile rfid card, tags & reader\nused across a wide range of applications including electronics projects, DIY builds, prototyping,\nand educational experiments.\n\n**Common use cases:**\n* Integrating into a custom electronics project\n* Learning and experimenting with circuits\n* Replacing or upgrading components in existing setups\n\nThis product is ideal for electronics enthusiasts, engineers, and students.\n\n**Technical Tip:** Always verify voltage and current requirements before connecting to your circuit.\nCheck datasheets for detailed specifications and pin configurations.\n\n### Shipping & Delivery\n* **Free shipping** on orders above \u20b9999 across India\n* Dispatched within **1-3 business days**\n* Expected delivery: **3-7 business days** depending on location\n* Secure packaging to ensure safe transit of electronic components\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nWeight \u25020.02 kg\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nDimensions\u25023 \u00d7 4 \u00d7 2 cm\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**15 Days Warranty**\n\nPlease note that this item is only covered by a standard supplier warranty against manufacturing\ndefects for a period of 15days from the time of delivery. It is important to understand that only\nmanufacturing defects are covered under this warranty, and any other issues will not be considered\nfor reimbursement or replacement. We strongly advise inspecting the product upon delivery to ensure\nit meets your expectations. In case of any manufacturing defects, we guarantee reimbursement or\nreplacement.\n\n##### **What voids warranty:**\n\nIf the product is subject to misuse, tampering, static discharge, accident, water or fire damage,\nuse of chemicals & soldered or altered in any way.\n\n**Tags:** [Radio Frequency Module][95] [RFID][96] [RFID Card Reader][97] [RFID Cards][98]\n**Also in RFID card, Tags & Reader:**\n[125KHz RFID Card \u2013(Pack of 5)][99][RDM6300 125KHz EM4100 RFID Card ID Reader Module][100][JT308\n125KHz USB Proximity Sensor Smart RFID ID Card Reader][101]\n**Country Of Origin:** China\n\n## 27 reviews for RFID Reader/Writer RC522 SPI S50 with RFID Card and Tag\n1. [Avatar of Sachin Chopra][Avatar of Sachin Chopra]\nRated **4** out of 5\n\n**Sachin Chopra ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 February 9, 2020\n\nGood RFID Reader/Writer RC522 SPI S50 with. Range is decent. Antenna orientation matters for\nbest performance.\n2. [Avatar of Nitin Tiwari][Avatar of Nitin Tiwari]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Nitin Tiwari ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 August 7, 2020\n\nThis RFID Reader/Writer RC522 SPI S50 with works perfectly for my wireless project. Easy to pair\nand use.\n3. [Avatar of Ashutosh Awasthi][Avatar of Ashutosh Awasthi]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Ashutosh Awasthi ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 February 12, 2021\n\nGood product\n4. [Avatar of Advik Kulkarni][Avatar of Advik Kulkarni]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Advik Kulkarni ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 March 15, 2021\n\nSuperb RFID Reader/Writer RC522 SPI S50 with! Using it in my asset tracking project. GPS\naccuracy is great.\n5. [Avatar of Kartik Naidu][Avatar of Kartik Naidu]\nRated **4** out of 5\n\n**Kartik Naidu ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 March 22, 2021\n\nNice RFID Reader/Writer RC522 SPI S50 with. Works well with the library examples. Good for\nprototyping.\n6. [Avatar of Tech Projector][Avatar of Tech Projector]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Tech Projector ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 May 15, 2021\n7. [Avatar of Advik Chopra][Avatar of Advik Chopra]\nRated **4** out of 5\n\n**Advik Chopra ** \u2013 June 17, 2021\n\nNice RFID Reader/Writer RC522 SPI S50 with. Works well with the library examples. Good for\nprototyping.\n8. [Avatar of Sunil Dhillon][Avatar of Sunil Dhillon]\nRated **4** out of 5\n\n**Sunil Dhillon ** \u2013 July 6, 2021\n\nDecent RFID Reader/Writer RC522 SPI S50 with. Connection is stable indoors. Outdoor range\nslightly less than expected.\n9. [Avatar of Deepika Batra][Avatar of Deepika Batra]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Deepika Batra ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 October 24, 2021\n\nExcellent RFID Reader/Writer RC522 SPI S50 with! Range is impressive and connection is stable.\n10. [Avatar of Anirudh Bhat][Avatar of Anirudh Bhat]\nRated **5** out of 5\n\n**Anirudh Bhat ** *(verified owner)* \u2013 November 28, 2021\n\nThis RFID Reader/Writer RC522 SPI S50 with is reliable and consistent. Using it for long-range\ndata transfer.\n11. [A"
