t Acrylic Arduino Case - AI0045..2]\n* [AI0045][AI0045]\n* [AI0045..1][AI0045..1]\n* [AI0045..3][AI0045..3]\n\n# Transparent Acrylic Case For Arduino UNO R3\n\nRated **4.45** out of 5 based on 29 customer ratings\n[(29 customer reviews)][67]\nShare: [ Facebook ][68] [ Twitter ][69] [ Tumblr ][70] [ Linkedin ][71] [ Houzz ][72] [ Vk ][73] [\nPinterest ][74] [ Whatsapp ][75]\n[ Add to wishlist ][76]\n[ Add to compare ][77]\n\n#### ** Quick Overview **\n* Protective case of Arduino Uno.\n* Color: Transparent.\n* Fastened by eight screws.\n* Made by high grade acrylic.\n* Provides excellent protection, with fashion appearance.\n* Unique design for Uno with pin leakage, which provides easy connection to other components.\n\nBrand: [ Arduino ][78] SKU: AI0045\nCategory: [Case for Arduino][79]\nTags: [Acrylic Case][80], [Arduino][81], [Arduino UNO Case][82], [Buy Online India][83],\n[Zbotic][84]\n\n\u20b9\u03367\u03369\u0336.\u03367\u03367\u0336 Original price was: \u20b979.77.\u20b938.23Current price is: \u20b938.23. (\u20b932.40 + GST)\n\nPurchase this product now and earn **1** Zbotic Point!\nTransparent Acrylic Case For Arduino UNO R3 quantity\nAdd to cart\n[Description][85]\n[Additional information][86]\n[Warranty][87]\n[COO][88]\n\nThis is the **Transparent** variant of the Transparent Acrylic Case For Arduino UNO R3 in Case for\nArduino. Available at \u20b9\u03367\u03369\u0336.\u03367\u03367\u0336 Original price was: \u20b979.77.\u20b938.23Current price is: \u20b938.23. (\u20b932.40 +\nGST) with free shipping across India.\n\n### **Description:**\n\nThe Transparent Acrylic Case / Shell / Enclosure / Gloss Box for Arduino Uno R3 is made from\nhigh-grade acrylic, offering excellent protection for your projects. This uniquely designed\nenclosure allows easy connections to other components and matches the original dimensions of the\nArduino Uno R3.\n\nThis transparent acrylic case provides an ideal combination of protection and visibility for your\nmicrocontroller projects. Crafted from clear acrylic, it shields against dust, static, and physical\ndamage while allowing you to see the inner workings of your setup. With easy access to ports and\npins, you can connect and troubleshoot without needing to disassemble everything. The assembly\nprocess is straightforward for quick setup, and ventilation holes help maintain optimal operating\nconditions. Whether you\u2019re a hobbyist, educator, or enthusiast, this case is a practical solution to\nprotect and showcase your Arduino Uno R3 creations.\n\n**Note: The UNO R3 module is not included.**\n\n### **Features:**\n* Material: A grade acrylic sheet.\n* For Arduino UNO R3 Development Board only.\n* With screw copper pillar and installation instructions.\n* To protect your little computer against damages, dust and scratches Clear Top and Bottom.\n* This case provides easy access to all ports.\n* It requires no tools for easy assembly and disassembly.\n* Simply Clicks Together Enclosure.\n\n### **Package Includes:**\n* 1 x Transparent Acrylic Case For Arduino UNO R3\n\n### Video:\n\n**Tags:** [Acrylic Case][89] [Arduino][90] [Arduino UNO Case][91] [Buy Online India][92]\n[Zbotic][93]\n**Related Articles:**\n[ [Arduino PWM Tutorial: Analogwrite, Frequency & Duty Cycle][Arduino PWM Tutorial: Analogwrite,\nFrequency & Duty Cycle]\n\nArduino PWM Tutorial: Analogwrite, Frequency & Duty Cycle\n\nPulse Width Modulation (PWM) is one of the most powerful techniques in the Arduino programmer's\ntoolbox. Whether you...\n\nRead More \u2192\n][94][ [Arduino Infrared Remote Decoding: Control Anything with TV Remote][Arduino Infrared Remote\nDecoding: Control Anything with TV Remote]\n\nArduino Infrared Remote Decoding: Control Anything with TV Remote\n\nOne of the most satisfying Arduino projects for beginners and intermediates alike is learning to\narduino ir remote...\n\nRead More \u2192\n][95][ [Arduino Crypto: Secure Communication with AES Encryption][Arduino Crypto: Secure\nCommunication with AES Encryption]\n\nArduino Crypto: Secure Communication with AES Encryption\n\nAs IoT devices proliferate in homes, factories, and healthcare, securing the data they transmit is\nno longer optional....\n\nRead More \u2192\n][96]\n\n### Technical Specifications\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nBrand \u2502Arduino\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nColor \u2502Transparent\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSKU \u2502AI0045\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nWeight \u25020.04 kg\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nAvailability\u2502In Stock\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n### Applications & Use Cases\n\nThe Transparent Acrylic Case For Arduino UNO R3 is a versatile case for arduino used across a wide\nrange of applications including electronics projects, DIY builds, prototyping, and educational\nexperiments.\n\n**Common use cases:**\n* Integrating into a custom electronics project\n* Learning and experimenting with circuits\n* Replacing or upgrading components in existing setups\n\nThis product is ideal for electronics enthusiasts, engineers, and students.\n\n**Technical Tip:** Always verify voltage and current requirements before connecting to your circuit.\nCheck datasheets for detailed specifications and pin configurations.\n\n### Shipping & Delivery\n* **Free shipping** on orders above \u20b9999 across 