red Obstacle Avoidance Sensor Module]\n* [IR Infrared Obstacle Avoidance Sensor Module]\n* [IR Infrared Obstacle Avoidance Sensor Module][IR Infrared Obstacle Avoidance Sensor Module]\n\n# IR Infrared Obstacle Avoidance Sensor Module\n\nRated **4.56** out of 5 based on 34 customer ratings\n[(34 customer reviews)][66]\nShare: [ Facebook ][67] [ Twitter ][68] [ Tumblr ][69] [ Linkedin ][70] [ Houzz ][71] [ Vk ][72] [\nPinterest ][73] [ Whatsapp ][74]\n[ Add to wishlist ][75]\n[ Add to compare ][76]\n\n### Quick Overview\n* Detection Distance: 2cm to 30cm\n* Detection Angle: 35\u00b0\n* Comparator Chip: LM393\n* Operating Voltage: 3.3V to 5V\n* Output Signal: Digital (Low-level signal)\n* Dimensions: Compact size for easy integration into projects\n\nBrand: [ Generic ][77] SKU: AI0074\nCategory: [PIR / IR and Optical Sensor][78]\nTags: [Infrared Sensor][79], [IR Sensor][80], [IR Sensor Module][81]\n\n\u20b9\u03362\u03365\u0336.\u03364\u03369\u0336 Original price was: \u20b925.49.\u20b924.78Current price is: \u20b924.78. (\u20b921.00 + GST)\n\nOut of Stock\n[Description][82]\n[Additional information][83]\n[Warranty][84]\n[COO][85]\n\nThis is the **Red** variant of the IR Infrared Obstacle Avoidance Sensor Module in PIR / IR and\nOptical Sensor. Available at \u20b9\u03362\u03365\u0336.\u03364\u03369\u0336 Original price was: \u20b925.49.\u20b924.78Current price is: \u20b924.78.\n(\u20b921.00 + GST) with free shipping across India.\n\n### Product Description\n\n**IR Infrared Obstacle Avoidance Sensor Module**\n* Elevate your projects with the IR Infrared Obstacle Avoidance Sensor Module, designed to detect\nobstacles and enhance the performance of your devices. Utilizing infrared technology, this module\naccurately identifies obstacles in its surroundings, making it an essential element for robotics,\nautomation, and interactive projects.\n\n**Features:**\n* **Efficient Detection:** Equipped with a pair of infrared transmitting and receiving tubes, the\nmodule accurately detects obstacles by analyzing reflected infrared waves.\n* **User-Friendly Interface:** Featuring a 3-wire interface with VCC, GND, and OUTPUT pins, the\nmodule is easy to connect and compatible with voltage levels ranging from 3.3V to 5V.\n* **Onboard Comparator Circuitry:** The onboard comparator circuitry efficiently processes data,\nproviding reliable obstacle detection and ensuring seamless integration with microcontroller\nsystems.\n* **Adjustable Detection Range:** With an onboard preset knob, users can fine-tune the detection\nrange within an effective distance range of 2cm to 80cm, allowing for precise obstacle detection.\n* **Visual Feedback:** The module features a green indicator LED that illuminates upon obstacle\ndetection, providing clear visual feedback to users.\n* **Compact Design:** Boasting a compact design with 3mm screw holes for easy mounting, the module\nis suitable for various applications and project configurations.\n\n**Specifications:**\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nMain Chip \u2502LM393\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nOperating Voltage (VDC) \u25023.6 ~ 5\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nAverage Current Consumption (mA)\u25020.06\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u250