ase for Raspberry Pi 3 Model B \u2013 Red/White is\navailable at Zbotic with fast shipping across India.\n\n### Official Raspberry Pi Case \u2013 Product description:\n\nThe all-new Raspberry Pi 3 Official Case in Red/White is a five-part enclosure specifically designed\nfor the Raspberry Pi 3 Model B and B+. This official case from the Raspberry Pi Foundation offers a\nstylish and protective housing for your device.\n\nFeaturing a removable lid for easy access to the camera and display ports, along with removable side\npanels for convenient access to the GPIO port, this case is both functional and user-friendly.\nCrafted from high-quality ABS plastic, it showcases the iconic strawberry red and white colors of\nRaspberry Pi.\n\nThe sleek and minimalist design not only complements the Raspberry Pi aesthetic but also ensures\neasy access to all essential ports, including HDMI, USB, and the microSD card slot. Its\nsnap-together assembly allows for effortless setup and disassembly, providing convenient access to\nthe Raspberry Pi\u2019s internals when needed.\n\nStrategically placed ventilation holes enhance airflow and dissipate heat efficiently, helping\nmaintain optimal operating temperatures for the Raspberry Pi. The case also includes a built-in slot\nfor attaching the Raspberry Pi Camera Module, facilitating seamless integration for imaging\nprojects.\n\nRubber feet provide stability and prevent slipping, ensuring that your Raspberry Pi remains securely\nin place on any surface. Additionally, the case allows visibility of the Raspberry Pi\u2019s activity\nLED, enabling you to monitor its status at a glance.\n\nOverall, the Official Case for Raspberry Pi 3 Model B in Red/White combines functionality, style,\nand ease of use, making it the perfect choice for housing and protecting your Raspberry Pi while\nadding a touch of flair to your setup.\n\n##### **NOTE:- Raspberry Pi Board is Not Included.**\n\n### **Features **\n* The optional clip-on lid provides protection but can be removed if using a HAT\n* All primary ports (including microSD) accessible\n* Removable side plate allows access to those wonderful GPIO pins\n* Snug and secure fit protect your Pi while looking great!\n* Anti-slip feet keep your Raspberry Pi stable\n* Power and activity lights still visible through the end of the case\n* Dimensions: 98 x 72 x 26 (LxWxH) mm.\n\n### **Specification:**\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nCompatibility \u2502Designed specifically for Raspberry Pi 3 Model B\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nMaterial \u2502High-quality ABS plastic\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\