00\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n### **Package Includes**\n* 1 x Official Case for Raspberry Pi 3 Model B \u2013 Red/White\n\n## Official Case for Raspberry Pi 3 Model B \u2013 Red/White Overview\n\nThe Official Case for Raspberry Pi 3 Model B \u2013 Red/White is a five-part ABS plastic enclosure\ndesigned specifically to house the Raspberry Pi 3 Model B and B+ boards. It protects your device\u2019s\ncircuitry and ports while showcasing the iconic red and white Raspberry Pi colours, with convenient\ncutouts for camera, display and GPIO connections.\n\n## Key Features of Official Case for Raspberry Pi 3 Model B \u2013 Red/White\n* High-quality ABS construction for durability and heat tolerance\n* Five-part design with removable lid and side panels for easy access\n* Built-in light pipes channel power and activity LEDs to the case top\n* Precision cutouts for camera and display ribbon connectors\n* Iconic strawberry red and white finish for authentic styling\n* Fast shipping from Zbotic across India within 24 hours\n\n## Applications and Use Cases\n* Building a compact home media centre with protected Pi hardware\n* Classroom and workshop environments for student learning projects\n* Prototyping robotics and IoT devices with accessible GPIO headers\n* Deploying digital signage or kiosks in retail and exhibition spaces\n* Running headless servers or network appliances in office setups\n\n## How to Use Official Case for Raspberry Pi 3 Model B \u2013 Red/White\n\nPlace your Raspberry Pi 3 Model B or B+ onto the base plate, slide on the side panels to expose or\ncover USB, Ethernet and GPIO ports, align the ribbon cables through the lid\u2019s channels, then snap on\nthe top cover. Ensure the light pipes sit over the board\u2019s LEDs so power and activity indicators\nremain visible.\n\n## Why Buy from Zbotic?\n* **Genuine Products:** All items sourced from authorized distributors\n* **Fast Shipping:** Orders ship within 24 hours with tracking (non backordered products)\n* **Free Shipping:** Free delivery on qualifying orders\n* **COD Available:** Cash on Delivery, UPI, cards, net banking\n* **Technical Support:** Expert help for setup and troubleshooting\n* **Easy Returns:** Hassle-free replacement for defective products\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### Is the case compatible with Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+?\n\nYes, the Official Case supports both Raspberry Pi 3 Model B and B+ boards, providing identical\ncutouts for ports and LEDs.\n\n### Do I need any tools to assemble the case?\n\nNo tools are required. The five-piece ABS shell clips together by hand, allowing quick assembly and\ndisassembly for maintenance or upgrades.\n\n### Can I see the power/activity LEDs through the case?\n\nAbsolutely. The case includes built-in light pipes that channel the board\u2019s green ACT and red PWR\nLEDs to the top of the enclosure for clear status indication.\n\n**Tags:** [Buy Online India][94] [Raspberry Pi][95] [Raspberry Pi 3][96] [Raspberry Pi 3 Case][97]\n[Raspberry Pi Case][98] [Single Board Computer][99] [Zbotic][100]\n**Also in Raspberry Pi Case:**\n[Aluminum Grid Grooved Case for Raspberry Pi 4][101][Raspberry Pi 4 Black Compact ABS\nCase][102][Acrylic Case Suitable for Raspberry Pi4 and 3.5 inch LCD][103][New High Quality\nTransparent ABS Case for Raspberry Pi 3/3+ with Slot for Cooling Fan & GPIO][104]\n**Related Articles:**\n[ [Raspberry Pi YOLO: Real-Time Object Detection][Raspberry Pi YOLO: Real-Time Object Detection]\n\nRaspberry Pi YOLO: Real-Time Object Detection\n\nTable of Contents Introduction and Use Cases Hardware Requirements Softwa