ulse Module - Heart Rate Pulse Sensor Module]\n* [Heart Rate Pulse Sensor Module][Heart Rate Pulse Sensor Module]\n* [Heart Rate Pulse Sensor Module]\n* [Heart Rate Pulse Sensor Module]\n\n# Heart Rate Pulse Sensor Module\n\nRated **4.63** out of 5 based on 19 customer ratings\n[(19 customer reviews)][66]\nShare: [ Facebook ][67] [ Twitter ][68] [ Tumblr ][69] [ Linkedin ][70] [ Houzz ][71] [ Vk ][72] [\nPinterest ][73] [ Whatsapp ][74]\n[ Add to wishlist ][75]\n[ Add to compare ][76]\n\n#### ** Quick Overview:**\n* **Product Name:** Heart Rate Pulse Sensor Module\n* Operating voltage: 5V\n* Operating current: 4mA\n* Pulse Sensor Board\n* 24-inch Color-Coded Cable with Standard Male Headers\n* Ear Clip for Earlobe Heart Rate Measurement\n* Velcro Finger Strap\n* Transparent Stickers to Protect Sensor\n\nBrand: [ Generic ][77] SKU: AI0050\nCategory: [Biometric/ECG/EMG Sensor][78]\nTags: [ECG][79], [EKG][80], [Heart Beat Sensor][81], [Heart Rate Sensor][82]\n\n\u20b9\u03361\u03366\u03361\u0336.\u03366\u03366\u0336 Original price was: \u20b9161.66.\u20b9134.52Current price is: \u20b9134.52. (\u20b9114.00 + GST)\n\nPurchase this product now and earn **3** Zbotic Points!\nHeart Rate Pulse Sensor Module quantity\nAdd to cart\n[Description][83]\n[Additional information][84]\n[Warranty][85]\n[COO][86]\n\n## **Heart Rate Pulse Sensor Module**\n\n## description:\n\nIntroducing the **Heart Rate Pulse Sensor Module**, a versatile tool for easily integrating heart\nrate data into your electronic projects. Whether you\u2019re a student, artist, athlete, maker, or\ndeveloper, this sensor provides a plug-and-play solution for obtaining real-time heart rate\nreadings.\n\nDesigned for simplicity, the Pulse Sensor Module combines a straightforward optical sensor with\nadvanced amplification and noise cancellation circuitry. This design ensures quick and reliable\npulse readings, making it perfect for a variety of applications.\n\nWith its user-friendly design and reliable performance, the Heart Rate Pulse Sensor Module is\nperfect for educational projects, fitness applications, interactive art installations, and more.\nUnlock the potential of heart rate data in your projects with this innovative sensor module.\n\n## **Pulse Sensor Arduino Hookup:**\n\n*Connect the sensor\u2019s power supply pins to the Arduino board supply pin as Red \u2013 5V, Black \u2013 GND\nand Purple \u2013 A0 (analog input 0) its over. This Analog input reading can be displayed in the serial\nterminal of Arduino IDE or it can be drawn as the pulse by using Processing IDE.*\n\n[AI0050][AI0050]\n\n**Note: This Product comes with attached cable or with detachable cable we will ship it randomly\naccording to the availability from supplier**\n\n## **Features:**\n* Plug-and-Play Design: Comes with a color-coded cable featuring standard male header connectors,\nallowing for easy integration with Arduino or breadboard projects without the need for soldering.\n* Versatile Mounting Options: The sensor features three holes around the edge, enabling convenient\nsewing into various materials or attaching to different surfaces.\n* Visualization Software: Includes visualization software (created in Processing) for instant\nmonitoring of sensor output and troubleshooting.\n* Operating Voltage: 5V\n* Operating Current: 4mA\n* Components Included: Pulse Sensor Board, 24-inch Color-Coded Cable with Standard Male Headers, Ear\nClip for Earlobe Heart Rate Measurement, Velcro Finger Strap, Transparent Stickers for Sensor\nProtection\n\n## **Specifications:**\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u