entification and organization in your projects.\n* **High-Quality Construction:** Crafted from durable materials, these jumper wires are built to\nwithstand repeated use, offering reliable performance in the long run.\n* **Flexible and Detachable:** The flexible design allows for easy detachment and customization\naccording to your project requirements, ensuring hassle-free prototyping.\n* **Easy Installation:** Simply plug and play \u2013 no soldering required. Effortlessly connect\ncomponents on breadboards or other electronic circuits for seamless operation.\n* **Wide Range of Applications:** Ideal for electronic projects, PCB development, computer\nmotherboard repairs, and more. A popular choice among hobbyists, students, and professionals\nalike.\n* **Dimensions:** Each wire measures 10cm (100mm) in length, providing ample flexibility for various\ncircuit configurations.\n* **Weight:** Weighing just 45g, these lightweight jumper wires are convenient to handle and\ntransport.\n* **Reusable:** Designed for durability and reusability, these jumper wires offer cost-effective\nsolutions for your electronic projects.\n\nElevate your prototyping experience with the convenience and reliability of these 10CM Female To\nFemale Breadboard Jumper Wires. Whether you\u2019re a seasoned electronics enthusiast or a novice\nhobbyist, these cables are essential tools for your toolkit.\n\n### Specification:\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nQuantity \u250240 pieces\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nLength \u250210cm\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2