0\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n**Package Includes**\n\n1 x Counter-Clockwise (CCW) HD Propellers 1045(10X4.5)\n\n1 x Clockwise (CW) HD Propellers 1045(10X4.5)\n\nA Set of prop Reducers\n\n## Counter Rotating Propeller 1045/1045R For Quadrotor- Overview\n\nThe Counter Rotating Propeller 1045/1045R For Quadrotor-(Black) is a matched CW (clockwise) and CCW\n(counter-clockwise) propeller set designed for 10\u2033 class multirotors. With a 4.5\u2033 pitch and durable\nplastic construction, it delivers balanced thrust for stable flight on quadcopters, hexacopters and\noctocopters.\n\n## Key Features of Counter Rotating Propeller 1045/1045R For Quadrotor-\n* 10\u2033 (254 mm) length with 4.5\u2033 (114.3 mm) pitch for efficient lift and maneuverability\n* Lightweight 14 g construction minimizes inertia for quick throttle response\n* Includes multiple diameter fixture rings to fit 6 mm shafts and common prop adapters\n* Durable black plastic resists impacts and retains blade integrity in rough landings\n* Sold as matched CW/CCW pairs to eliminate torque imbalance on multirotor frames\n* **Genuine product, fast shipping from Zbotic** to ensure prompt delivery across India\n\n## Applications and Use Cases\n* Upgrading stock 10\u2033 props on racing and freestyle quadcopters\n* Balancing thrust on hexacopters by alternating CW and CCW blades\n* Building custom octocopter rigs with matched pusher/puller configurations\n* Replacing damaged propellers after crashes or hard landings\n* DIY aerial photography drones requiring smooth, vibration-free flight\n\n## How to Use Counter Rotating Propeller 1045/1045R For Quadrotor-\n\nAttach the 1045 propellers to your brushless motors by choosing the correct CW or CCW blade\norientation\u2014clockwise blades on motors spinning clockwise and vice versa. Slide the appropriate\nfixture ring onto the 6 mm shaft, secure with the propeller adapter, and tighten the lock nut.\nAlways balance props before first flight to ensure smooth operation and reduce motor strain.\n\n## Why Buy from Zbotic?\n* **Genuine Products:** All items sourced from authorized distributors\n* **Fast Shipping:** Orders ship within 24 hours with tracking (non backordered products)\n* **Free Shipping:** Free delivery on qualifying orders\n* **COD Available:** Cash on Delivery, UPI, cards, net banking\n* **Technical Support:** Expert help for setup and troubleshooting\n* **Easy Returns:** Hassle-free replacement for defective products\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### How do I identify the CW and CCW propeller?\n\nCW and CCW blades have opposite blade angles\u2014look for the blade tilt direction when holding the hub:\nclockwise props tilt forward when spun clockwise. The packaging also labels each blade set for easy\nidentification.\n\n### Will these props fit my 6 mm shaft motor?\n\nYes. The set includes multiple diameter fixture rings that adapt the 6 mm hub bore to common prop\nadaptor sizes, ensuring a snug fit on most brushless motor shafts.\n\n### Can I purchase a single propeller instead of a pair?\n\nNo. These counter rotating propellers are sold only as matched CW/CCW pairs to maintain balanced\nthrust and torque compensation on multirotor setups.\n\n**Tags:** [Buy Online India][96] [Drone][97] [Hexacopter Propeller][98] [Multirotor][99] [Octocopter\nPropeller][100] [Propeller][101] [Quadcopter Propeller][102] [Quadrotor][103] [Zbotic][104]\n**Also in 8 inch to 10 inch:**\n[T Motor MF2211 Propeller- 1 Pair][105][GEMFAN Propellers 8045(8X4.5) Carbon Nylon DJI Black\n1CW+1CCW-1pair][106][1045 2 blades Carbon Fiber Propeller CW&CCW For DJI][107][9450 2 blades Self\nLock Propeller CW & CCW Color White][108]\n\n### Technical Specifications\n\n\u2500\