        "website": "https://www.cbinsights.com",
        "industries": "Corporate Venture Capital; Sales & Business Development; M&A; Venture Capital; Product Strategy; Corporate Strategy; GenAI Strategy; Innovation; Market Research & Intelligence; Digital & IT Strategy; Technology; Financial Services; Healthcare; Consumer & Retail; Professional Services; Tech; Insurance; Industrials",
        "products": "Strategy Terminal; Mobile app; Browser Extension; ChatCBI\u2122; Company Analysis; Strategy Terminal; Mobile app; Browser Extension; Market Analytics and Visualizations; CB Insights Platform; Market Analytics and Visualizations; Technology Search Engine; GenAI Instant Insights; API & Data Feeds; Market Analytics and Visualizations",
        "certifications": "SOC 2; GDPR",
        "distributors": "",
        "customers": "",
        "partnerships": "",
        "crawl_text": "CB Insights, Inc. North America SOC 2 GDPR Predictive analytics Machine learning Data science Comprehensive data on private companies Advanced predictive analytics capabilities Strong client base including Fortune 500 companies GDPR New York, NY, USA United States CB Insights tracks over 12 million companies and provides predictive intelligence data. The platform is trusted by leading companies including all five FAANG companies and 86% of software companies. Launched new features for predictive AI tools including ChatCBI and intelligent watchlists. Expanding predictive analytics capabilities Enhancing data integration with AI and machine learning Competition from other data analytics platforms Maintaining data privacy and security Growing demand for predictive analytics in various industries Expansion into new markets and sectors CB Insights is a leader in the predictive intelligence space, serving a diverse range of industries and clients. Increasing reliance on data-driven decision making Expansion of AI and machine learning technologies New this month: Discover top leaders with powerful new people search. Enrich your AI agents with our\ndata via MCP, now with native support for Copilot and Excel. [ Learn more \u2192 ][1]\n\n[ Skip to content][2]\n[ [CB Insights Logo] ][3]\n[ AI & Agents ][4]\n\n### Tools\n* [\nStrategy Terminal\n\nPredictive AI web app for company discovery, analysis, and tracking\n\n][5]\n* [\nMobile app\n\nPredictive AI on your phone\n\n][6]\n* [\nBrowser Extension\n\nAnalyzes companies (and more) while you view their website\n\n][7]\n\n### Agents\n* [\nTeam of Agents\n\nAvailable for company scouting, due diligence, new business acquisition, M&A, and more. In our\nStrategy Terminal or standalone.\n\n][8]\n\n### Key Features\n* [\nChatCBI\u2122\n\nStrategy LLM powered with our predictive data and analysis \u2014 the most powerful way to use our\ntools\n\n][9]\n* [\nCompany Analysis\n\nSet of agents to analyze companies and their investor and commercial relationships\n\n][10]\n* [\nCompany profiles \u2014 12M+\n\nPredictive intelligence data. Double verified.\n\n][11]\n* [\nTech market rankings \u2014 1,600+ markets\n\nRanks market entrants. Compare win reasons, execution, funding, and more.\n\n][12]\n* [\nIntelligent Watchlists and Alerts\n\nInsight before you ask\n\n][13]\n\n### Security\n* [\nSecurity and privacy\n\nSOC 2, GDPR, and more. No training on your data.\n\n][14]\n\n[ Data ][15]\n\n### Predictive\n* [\nMosaic Score\n\nHealth and growth potential \u2014 with sub-scores on growth, financial strength, industry health, and\nmanagement team strength\n\n][16]\n* [\nCommercial Maturity\n\nAbility to compete and partner\n\n][17]\n* [\nExit Probability\n\nBroken out by IPO and M&A\n\n][18]\n* [\nCustomer Sentiment\n\nClient satisfaction scores and likelihood to renew\n\n][19]\n* [\nTech market rankings \u2014 1,600+ markets\n\nRanks, scores, and compares entrants\n\n][20]\n* [\nBusiness relationships \u2014 customer, partner, vendor\n\nReveals strategy and sales opps\n\n][21]\n\n### Financial\n* [\nFunding and valuations\n\nComprehensive history for companies and investors\n\n][22]\n* [\nPrivate company revenues\n\nSourced direct from startups and public and non-public sources\n\n][23]\n* [\nPublic company financials\n\nEarnings, stock performance, financials, and more\n\n][24]\n\n### Research\n* [\nAdvanced human-led research\n\nExpert analyst team covering key industries and tech\n\n][25]\n\n### Foundational\n* [\nTaxonomies\n\nCompetitor, market, business model, and more\n\n][26]\n* [\nFirmographics \u2014 12M+ private companies\n\nHard-to-find data from startups, customers, and investors \u2014 plus public and non-public sources\nworldwide\n\n][27]\n* [\nMedia and patents\n\nTracking and historical database\n\n][28]\n* [\nTranscripts \u2014 analyst briefings, startup customer interviews\n\nStraight to the source. Includes briefing materials.\n\n][29]\n\n[ MCP & Integrations ][30]\n* [\nMCP integration\n\nConnect our data to your LLM\n\n][31]\n* [\nDeveloper Portal\n\nStart building today\n\n][32]\n* [\nAPI & data feeds\n\nDouble-verified, continually refreshed\n\n][33]\n* [\nMicrosoft 365 Copilot\n\nA pre-built connector to bring our data to life in Copilot and Copilot agents\n\n][34]\n* [\nSnowflake\n\nAccessible in Snowflake and optimized for use with AI\n\n][35]\n* [\nSalesforce CRM\n\nAdd CB Insights data to Salesforce records and agents\n\n][36]\n* [\nA2A & MCP support\n\nMake your AI smarter with our data and tools\n\n][37]\n[ Solutions ][38]\n* [\nCorporate venture capital\n][39]\n* [\nSales & biz dev\n][40]\n* [\nM&A\n][41]\n* [\nVenture capital\n][42]\n* [\nProduct strategy\n][43]\n* [\nCorporate strategy\n][44]\n* [\nGenAI strategy\n][45]\n* [\nInnovation\n][46]\n* [\nMarket research & intelligence\n][47]\n* [\nDigital & IT strategy\n][48]\n[ Research ][49]\n* [\nRecent research\n][50]\n* [\nPredictive signal trackers\n][51]\n* [\nAI research hub\n][52]\n* [\nDigital asset hub\n][53]\n* [\nResearch webinars\n][54]\n* [\nAgentic commerce market map\n][55]\n* [\nAI 100 market map\n][56]\n* [\nNewsletter\n][57]\n* [\nRequest a briefing\n][58]\n* [\nAbout us\n][59]\n[Pricing][60]\n[Contact sales][61] [Log in][62] [Start free trial][63]\nAI & Agents\n\n### Tools\n* [\nStrategy Terminal\n\nPredictive AI web app for company discovery, analysis, and tracking\n\n][64]\n* [\nMobile app\n\nPredictive AI on your phone\n\n][65]\n* [\nBrowser Extension\n\nAnalyzes companies (and more) while you view their website\n\n][66]\n\n### Agents\n* [\nTeam of Agents\n\nAvailable for company scouting, due diligence, new business acquisition, M&A, and more. In our\nStrategy Terminal or standalone.\n\n][67]\n\n### Key Features\n* [\nChatCBI\u2122\n\nStrategy LLM powered with our predictive data and analysis \u2014 the most powerful way to use our\ntools\n\n][68]\n* [\nCompany Analysis\n\nSet of agents to analyze companies and their investor and commerc