0]\n* [\nAI 100 market map\n][111]\n* [\nNewsletter\n][112]\n* [\nRequest a briefing\n][113]\n* [\nAbout us\n][114]\n[Pricing][115]\n[Start free trial][116] [Contact sales][117] [Log in][118]\n\n# Predictive intelligence on private companies\n\nHow corporate strategy and deal teams see opportunity \u2013 before the market does\n\nTrusted by the world\u2019s leading companies\n\n[Fortune 500 Icon]\n**10** largest\nbusinesses\n[Cases Icon]\n**All** of\nthe Big 4\n[Fortune 500 Icon]\n**86%** of software\ncompanies\n[Cloud Icon]\n**4** largest\ncloud providers\n[Fortune 500 Icon]\n**26 of 30** largest\nbanks\n[Pills Icon]\n**4** largest pharma\ncompanies\n[Fortune 500 Icon]\n**All 5** FAANG\ncompanies\n[Chat Icon]\n**3** largest\nU.S. telcos\n\n### Most strategy and deal teams still use reactive intelligence \u2014 and it costs them\n\n### Predictive intelligence gives strategy and deal teams what they\u2019ve always wanted: a head start\n\n## The system corporate strategy and deal teams use to move first\n\nCB Insights continuously monitors millions of private companies, markets, and competitive signals \u2014\nusing AI to surface early insight that informs the deals, partnerships, and moves you make next.\n\n[System]\n\n### Shape direction before the\n### market forces your hand\n\nPredictive Intelligence reveals early market and competitive shifts, giving you time to choose the\nmove \u2014 instead of inheriting one.\n\n[Shape Screenshot]\n\n### See competitors\u2019 moves while\n### they\u2019re still forming\n\nEarly signals reveal how competitors are shifting focus, forming partnerships, and placing strategic\nbets, so you can respond deliberately \u2014 or neutralize moves before they take hold.\n\n[Competitors Screenshot]\n\n### Win the M&A, investment, and partnership\n### opportunities that define your growth\n\nEarly clarity on direction, targets, and timing lets you act with conviction \u2014 securing the\nopportunities that fit your goals before the market crowds in.\n\n[M&A Screenshot]\n\n## Win more. Win bigger.\n\nThis is the impact of seeing the right next move early.\n\nOur customers out-execute competitors:\n\n2.8x\n\nmore acquisitions\n\nmore investments\n\n4.5x\n\nmore partnerships\n\nThose moves compound into growth:\n\n25%\n\nlarger deal size\n\n10-20%\n\nmore new pipeline\n\n70%\n\nfaster revenue growth than peers\n\n\u201cReal-time visibility into every emerging tech market.\u201d\n\n[Microsoft]\n\n\u201cIn a matter of minutes, we created a target list and screened 6 M&A targets for a big meeting. Our\nclient acquired one of them 3 months later.\u201d\n\nBig 4 Global Consultant\n\n\u201cI can find and validate the best clients, 10x faster than before.\u201d\n\nMajor Professional Services Company\n\n\u201cA market leader in helping companies find investment.\u201d\n\nTOP TEN GLOBAL VC\n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s happening, why it matters, and what you need to do next.\u201d\n\n[Wells Fargo]\n\n\u201cHelps us to compress our time to decision.\u201d\n\n[ADP]\n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s happening, why it matters, and what you need to do next.\u201d\n\n[Wells Fargo]\n\n\u201cHelps us to compress our time to decision.\u201d\n\n[ADP]\n\n\u201cCB Insights surfaced a company that was disrupting its market, and \u2014 a key detail \u2014 that it was\nbacked by two very wealthy local investors. This led directly to a $100m+ deal.\u201d\n\nMajor Global Telco\n\n\u201cWe review twice as many companies now with the confidence that we have a full view of the market.\u201d\n\n[Cedars]\n\n\u201cWe\u2019ve taken the guesswork out of innovation.\u201d\n\n[3M]\n\n\u201cWith their proprietary business relationship data, we uncovered and won a $100M deal that would\nhave been invisible without CB Insights.\u201d\n\nBig 3 Cloud Leader\n\n\u201cAllows us to move at speed.\u201d\n\n[Haleon]\n\n\u201cCB Insights proprietary benchmarking data alone helped me prioritize a market, find an\nup-and-coming AI company, qualify and close a $120 million opportunity.\u201d\n\nAnother Big 3 Cloud Leader\n\n\u201cWe\u2019ve taken the guesswork out of innovation.\u201d\n\n[3M]\n\n\u201cWith their proprietary business relationship data, we uncovered and won a $100M deal that would\nhave been invisible without CB Insights.\u201d\n\nBig 3 Cloud Leader\n\n\u201cAllows us to move at speed.\u201d\n\n[Haleon]\n\n\u201cCB Insights proprietary benchmarking data alone helped me prioritize a market, find an\nup-and-coming AI company, qualify and close a $120 million opportunity.\u201d\n\nAnother Big 3 Cloud Leader\n\n## The ultimate platform for sourcing\n\nComprehensive data and tools to spot the private companies that matter \u2014 first.\n* STRATEGIZE\n* LONGLIST\n* SHORTLIST\n* ENGAGE\n* MONITOR\n* ### Comprehensive data on 12M companies and 1600+ markets, plus visual maps\n\n[Strategize]\n* ### The best taxonomies, funding and revenue data\n\n[Longlist]\n* ### Predictive scoring and AI analysis to zoom in\n\n[Shortlist]\n* ### Smart briefings and scouting reports to engage\n\n[Engage]\n* ### Intelligent watchlists and competitor monitoring\n\n[Monitor]\n\n## The system that makes predic"
