            "text": "* [Technology Vendors][1]\n* [Recent Research][2]\n* [Newsletter][3]\n* [Media Support][4]\n* [Login][5]\n[[CB Insights]][6]\n* Who We Serve\n* Function\n* [Corporate Strategy][7]\n* [Corporate Venture Capital][8]\n* [Venture Capital][9]\n* [IT][10]\n* [Corporate Innovation][11]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### How VCs Use CB Insights\n\n[Go to the video gallery \u2192][12]\n* Industries\n* [Consumer & Retail][13]\n* [Tech][14]\n* [Insurance][15]\n* [Healthcare][16]\n* [Industrials][17]\n* [Financial Services][18]\n* [Professional Services][19]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Professional Services\n\n[Learn More\u2192][20]\n* [Success Stories][21]\n* How We Help\n* [Understand Tech Markets][22]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][23]\n* [Determine Tech Strategy][24]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors & Partners][25]\n* [Turbocharge Digital Transformation][26]\n* What We Offer\n* Platform\n* [Overview][27]\n* [Technology Search Engine][28]\n* [Market Analytics and Visualizations][29]\n* [Team Management and Collaboration][30]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Platform Overview\n\n[Learn More\u2192][31]\n* [Data][32]\n* [Research][33]\n* [Personal Briefing][34]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][35]\n* [Public Equity Data][36]\n* [Buyer Interview Transcripts][37]\n* [Analyst Briefings][38]\n* [API & Data Feeds][39]\n* Integrations\n* [Overview][40]\n* [Chrome and Edge][41]\n* [Salesforce][42]\n* [Affinity][43]\n* [Microsoft Excel][44]\n* [Google Sheets][45]\n* [Microsoft Teams][46]\n* [Slack][47]\n* [Google Slides][48]\n* [App Partners][49]\n* [Browser Extension][50]\n* [Pricing][51]\n* About Us\n* [Overview][52]\n* Our teams\n* [Business Development][53]\n* [Engineering][54]\n* [Operations][55]\n* [Product][56]\n* [See all \u2192][57]\n* [Open Jobs][58]\n\nLoading...\n\n[Ideel company logo]\n\n# Ideel\n\nUnclaimed\n[ideel.com][59]\n* [Overview & Products][60]\n* [Financials][61]\n* [People][62]\n* [Alternatives & Competitors][63]\n\n## Founded Year\n\n2006\n\n## Stage\n\nAcquired | Acquired\n\n## Total Raised\n\n$106.8M\n\n## Valuation\n\n$0000 View\n\n## About Ideel\n\nIdeel is a members-only real-time shopping community primarily targeting women. It aims to offer its\nmembers authentic luxury items at preferential prices along with weekly giveaways which have a\nsurprise start time and last 7 hours (in most cases). Per the company, the discounts on the goods\ncan be as much as 80%. Ideel offers limited-time sale events that feature brands in fashion, home\nand beauty and its products include designer accessories, apparel, and home goods. Ideel's events\nall start at 11AM EST and its sales last 36 hours, or until items are sold out. Each time a new sale\nstarts its members are notified by email, SMS, Facebook and Twitter.\n\n## Headquarters Location\n\n620 8th Ave 45th Floor\n\nNew York, New York, 10018,\n\nUnited States\n\n646-745-1000\n\nLoading...\n\nLoading...\n\n## Expert Collections containing Ideel\n\nExpert Collections are analyst-curated lists that highlight the companies you need to know in the\nmost important technology spaces.\n\nIdeel is included in **1 Expert Collection,** including **E-Commerce**.\n\n# E-Commerce\n\n11,526 items\n\nCompanies that sell goods online (B2C), or enable the selling of goods online via tech solutions\n(B2B).\n\nLearn more by requesting a demo\n\n## Latest Ideel News\n\n[DIY Fashion, Flash sale bubble, Coach eyes Chinese men, Macy\u2019s online surge, Remembering Tommy\nNutter][64]\n\nOct 24, 2023\n\nBy \"Do-it-yourself Web sites are making it easy for fashion buffs to design and order custom\noutfits: all you need is an Internet connection and a credit card. But are the sites any good? Can\ndesign-your-own jeans rival designer jeans? Is the shoe of your dreams mere mouse clicks away?\" \"An\nannouncement of a partnership with Vente-Privee... will be the third in a rash of investment in the\nlatest fashion fad that began at the end of April with Ideeli's raising $40 million of Series C\nfunding, which was followed Tuesday by Gilt Groupe's raising $168 million... And you know what they\nsay: three examples of anything is a trend. Welcome to the new internet investment bubble:\nshopping!\" \"The company [is] eager to capitalise on men's untapped enthusiasm for its products in\nChina... Coach said men account for 45 per cent of spending on handbags and luxury accessories in\nmainland China, whereas they make up only 25 per cent of spending across Asia and just 15 per cent\nworldwide. \"[Macy's] jumped the most in a year after boosting its 2011 profit forecast... sales in\nthe first quarter exceeded its expectations as online revenue jumped 38 percent and spring fashion\nsold strongly. Consumers have ramped up spending as the job market has improved.\"\n\nJul 26, 2023\n[Winter Wears Market 2023 Featuring Industry Growth, Prominent Competitors and Future Growth by\n2030][65]\nAug 19, 2021\n[They Were Among the Most Successful Companies in America. But Where Are They Now?][66]\nAug 30, 2020\n[2020 Online Fashion Retail Market Applications Overview 2020-2026: by Upstream and Downstream\nAnalysis Forecast to 2026 With Top Key Players- Costco, Ideel, ATG Stores.com, Eastern Mountain\nSports, Target, Backcountry.com, Gap, CustomInk, IKEA, L Brands, Amazon, Macy\u2019s, Walmart, Academy\nSports + Outdoors, Factory Green, Best Buy, and J.C. Penney][67]\nApr 30, 2018\n[For A Limited Time Only: How Companies Can Use Data To Create A Sense Of Urgency][68]\nLearn more by requesting a demo\n\n### Ideel Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\n* When was Ideel founded?\n\nIdeel was founded in 2006.\n* Where is Ideel's headquarters?\n\nIdeel's headquarters is located at 620 8th Ave, New York.\n* What is Ideel's latest funding round?\n\nIdeel's latest funding round is Acquired.\n* How much did Ideel raise?\n\nIdeel raised a total of $106.8M.\n* Who are the investors of Ideel?\n\nInvestors of Ideel include Groupon, StarVest Partners, HPS Investment Partners, Cue Ball Capital,\nTribeca Venture Partners and 8 more.\n* Who are Ideel's competitors?\n\nCompetitors of Ideel include Zulily, Privalia, Gilt, Choxi.com, LivingSocial and 7 more.\n\nLoading...\n\n## Compare Ideel to Competitors\n\n[BuyWithMe Logo]\n[BuyWithMe][69]\n\nBuyWithMe operates as a social shopping network. It offers a daily deal from local merchants. It\nfocuses on providing marketing solutions using group buying mechanisms and social media. The company\nwas founded in 2009 and is based in New York, New York.\n\n[Rue La La Logo]\n[Rue La La][70]\n\nRueLaLa is an invitation-only destination for private sale Boutiques that open daily and stay open\nonly for a short time. Users can invite friends and discover sought-after brands in fashion,\naccessories, footwear, home, travel, wine, gourmet food, local services, and more.\n\n[Veepee][71]\n\nVeepee is a company focused on e-commerce, operating in the flash sales sector and providing a\nplatform for private sales events where consumers can purchase items from various brands. Veepee\nprimarily serves the online retail sector, facilitating inventory management for over 7,000 brands.\nIt was founded in 2001 and is based in La Plaine Saint-Denis, France.\n\n[BrandOff Logo]\n[BrandOff][72]\n\nBrandOff specializes in the resale of pre-owned luxury goods across various sectors including\nfashion, accessories, and watches. The company offers designer items such as handbags, clothing, and\nfine jewelry, all verified for authenticity. BrandOff primarily caters to the luxury resale market,\nproviding consumers with access to products at potentially lower prices. It was founded in 1993 and\nis based in Ishikawa, Japan.\n\n[HuiMin][73]\n\nHuiMin is a service industry platform that focuses on supply chain solutions within the retail\nsector. The company provides a digital retail platform that integrates online and offline resources,\nutilizing a 'network + entity + community' model for the retail industry's upgrade and integration.\nHuiMin serves the retail industry with solutions for supply chain management, product upgrading, and\ncommunity benefit store services. It was founded in 2013 and is based in Beijing, Beijing.\n\n[Wish Logo]\n[Wish][74]\n\nWish offers a mobile e-commerce platform that specializes in consumer goods across various\ncategories. The company offers a selection of products with a focus on cost savings, featuring\nfrequent discounts, flat-rate shipping in select markets, and a money-back guarantee. Wish primarily\nserves the general consumer market, providing an accessible shopping experience for a diverse range\nof products. It was founded in 2010 and is based in San Francisco, California. In April 2024, Wish\nwas acquired by Qoo10.\n\nLoading...\n\n[CB Insights]\n498 Seventh Avenue 12th floor\nNew York, NY 10018[info@cbinsights.com][75]\n[212 292 3148][76]\n\nFollow Us On Social\n\n[[Twitter]][77][[Linkedin]][78][[Facebook]][79]\n\n### [About][80]\n* [About Us][81]\n* [Upcoming Webinars][82]\n* [Contact Us][83]\n\n### [How We Help][84]\n* [Understand Tech Markets][85]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][86]\n* [Create Tech Strategy][87]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors][88]\n* [Digital Transformation][89]\n\n### [What We Offer][90]\n* [Platform][91]\n* [Data][92]\n* [Research Overview][93]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][94]\n* [Pricing][95]\n\n### [Popular Research][96]\n* [AI 100][97]\n* [Fintech 100][98]\n* [Digital Health 50][99]\n* [Tech Trends 2024][100]\n* [Generative AI Predictions][101]\n* [Unicorn Tracker][102]\n* [VC Glossary][103]\n* [Company List Applications][104]\n* [CB Insights Website Terms of Use][105]\n* [Privacy Policy][106]\n* [Do Not Sell My Info][107]\n* [Partnership][108]\n\nCopyright 2026 CB Information Services, Inc. All rights reserved.\n\nCBI websites generally use certain cookies to enable better interactions with our sites and\nservices. Use of these cookies, which may be stored on your device, permits us to improve and\ncustomize your experience. You can read more about your cookie choices at [our privacy policy][109].\nBy continuing to use this site you are consenting to these choices.\n\nI ACCEPT\nI DO NOT ACCEPT\n\n[1]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/technology-vendors/\n[2]: https://www.cbinsights.com/research/\n[3]: https://www.cbinsights.com/newsletter/\n[4]: https://www.cbinsights.com/media-support/\n[5]: https://www.cbinsights.com/login\n[6]: https://www.cbinsights.com\n[7]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-strategy/\n[8]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-venture-capital/\n[9]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/venture-capital/\n[10]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/head-of-it/\n[11]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-innovation/\n[12]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-vcs-use-cb-insights/\n[13]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/consumer/\n[14]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/tech/\n[15]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/insurance/\n[16]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/healthcare/\n[17]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/industrials/\n[18]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/financial-services/\n[19]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/professional-services/\n[20]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/professional-services/\n[21]: https://www.cbinsights.com/resources/case-studies/\n[22]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/understand-tech-markets/\n[23]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/competitor-strategy/\n[24]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/create-tech-strategy/\n[25]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/find-tech-vendors/\n[26]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/digital-transformation/\n[27]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/platform/\n[28]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/technology-search-engine/\n[29]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/market-analytics-and-visualizations/\n[30]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/team-management-and-collaboration/\n[31]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/platform/\n[32]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/data/\n[33]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/research/\n[34]: https://www.cbinsights.com/learn/personal-briefing/\n[35]: https://www.cbinsights.com/lea"
