            "text": "* [Technology Vendors][1]\n* [Recent Research][2]\n* [Newsletter][3]\n* [Media Support][4]\n* [Login][5]\n[[CB Insights]][6]\n* Who We Serve\n* Function\n* [Corporate Strategy][7]\n* [Corporate Venture Capital][8]\n* [Venture Capital][9]\n* [IT][10]\n* [Corporate Innovation][11]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### How VCs Use CB Insights\n\n[Go to the video gallery \u2192][12]\n* Industries\n* [Consumer & Retail][13]\n* [Tech][14]\n* [Insurance][15]\n* [Healthcare][16]\n* [Industrials][17]\n* [Financial Services][18]\n* [Professional Services][19]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Professional Services\n\n[Learn More\u2192][20]\n* [Success Stories][21]\n* How We Help\n* [Understand Tech Markets][22]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][23]\n* [Determine Tech Strategy][24]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors & Partners][25]\n* [Turbocharge Digital Transformation][26]\n* What We Offer\n* Platform\n* [Overview][27]\n* [Technology Search Engine][28]\n* [Market Analytics and Visualizations][29]\n* [Team Management and Collaboration][30]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Platform Overview\n\n[Learn More\u2192][31]\n* [Data][32]\n* [Research][33]\n* [Personal Briefing][34]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][35]\n* [Public Equity Data][36]\n* [Buyer Interview Transcripts][37]\n* [Analyst Briefings][38]\n* [API & Data Feeds][39]\n* Integrations\n* [Overview][40]\n* [Chrome and Edge][41]\n* [Salesforce][42]\n* [Affinity][43]\n* [Microsoft Excel][44]\n* [Google Sheets][45]\n* [Microsoft Teams][46]\n* [Slack][47]\n* [Google Slides][48]\n* [App Partners][49]\n* [Browser Extension][50]\n* [Pricing][51]\n* About Us\n* [Overview][52]\n* Our teams\n* [Business Development][53]\n* [Engineering][54]\n* [Operations][55]\n* [Product][56]\n* [See all \u2192][57]\n* [Open Jobs][58]\n\nLoading...\n\n[Brightside Academy company logo]\n\n# Brightside Academy\n\nUnclaimed\n[brightsideacademy.com][59]\n* [Overview & Products][60]\n* [Financials][61]\n* [People][62]\n* [Alternatives & Competitors][63]\n\n## Founded Year\n\n1992\n\n## Stage\n\nLoan | Alive\n\n## Total Raised\n\n$12.64M\n\n## Last Raised\n\n$3.5M | 6 yrs ago\n\n## About Brightside Academy\n\nBrightside Academy is a provider of early childhood education and child care services, operating\nwithin the education sector. The company offers an early education curriculum, child care for\ninfants and young children, preschool programs, before and after school supervision, and summer camp\nexperiences. Brightside Academy serves families seeking support for children from infancy through\nage 12. It was founded in 1992 and is based in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania.\n\n## Headquarters Location\n\n707 Grant Street Gulf Tower 15th Floor\n\nPittsburgh, Pennsylvania, 15219,\n\nUnited States\n\n412-201-5501\n\nLoading...\n\nLoading...\n\n## Latest Brightside Academy News\n\n[Brightside Academy Welcomes Passionate, Long-Tenured Healthcare Executive as New Chief Operating\nOfficer][64]\n\nApr 4, 2024\n\nBrightside Academy, the leading and oldest child care organization in Philadelphia and Pittsburgh,\nhas announced that Toya Cornelious has been hired as its new Chief Operating Officer. Cornelious\nbrings more than 15 years of experience as a healthcare executive to Brightside Academy....\n\nOct 8, 2021\n[Brightside Academy, An Early Childhood Education Provider In Ohio, Has Built Its Employee Rewards\nProgram On Waves Enterprise Blockchain Technology][65]\nOct 8, 2021\n[Brightside Academy, an early childhood education provider in Ohio, has built its employee rewards\nprogram on Waves Enterprise blockchain technology][66]\nLearn more by requesting a demo\n\n### Brightside Academy Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\n* When was Brightside Academy founded?\n\nBrightside Academy was founded in 1992.\n* Where is Brightside Academy's headquarters?\n\nBrightside Academy's headquarters is located at 707 Grant Street, Pittsburgh.\n* What is Brightside Academy's latest funding round?\n\nBrightside Academy's latest funding round is Loan.\n* How much did Brightside Academy raise?\n\nBrightside Academy raised a total of $12.64M.\n* Who are the investors of Brightside Academy?\n\nInvestors of Brightside Academy include Paycheck Protection Program, Western Pennsylvania\nAdventure Capital Fund, SJF Ventures, Mid-Atlantic Venture Funds, LLR Partners and 3 more.\n* Who are Brightside Academy's competitors?\n\nCompetitors of Brightside Academy include Discovery Point and 7 more.\n\nLoading...\n\n## Compare Brightside Academy to Competitors\n\n[The Goddard School][67]\n\nThe Goddard School focuses on early childhood education and operates within the daycare and\npreschool industry. The company offers a curriculum for infants to kindergarten-aged children,\nemphasizing play-based learning and STEAM (science, technology, engineering, arts, and mathematics)\nenrichment. The Goddard School serves families seeking early education and childcare services. It\nwas founded in 1988 and is based in King Of Prussia, Pennsylvania.\n\n[Cadence Education Logo]\n[Cadence Education][68]\n\nCadence Education specializes in early childhood and private elementary education within the\neducation sector. The company offers a range of programs including infant care, toddler care,\npreschool, pre-kindergarten, private kindergarten, and elementary education. Cadence Education\nprimarily serves families seeking early education and care for their children. It was founded in\n1992 and is based in Scottsdale, Arizona.\n\n[Excelligence Learning Logo]\n[Excelligence Learning][69]\n\nExcelligence Learning operates in the childhood education industry, providing various educational\nclassroom services and products. The company offers a range of classroom products and services aimed\nat supporting the social, emotional, cognitive, and physical development of young learners.\nExcelligence serves early childhood and elementary education sectors with its educational products.\nIt was founded in 1985 and is based in Monterey, California.\n\n[Rainbow Early Education][70]\n\nRainbow Early Education provides early childhood education and daycare services for various age\ngroups. The company includes programs such as infant care, toddler programs, preschool,\nprekindergarten, kindergarten, before and after school care, and summer break programs. These\nservices are available for children from 6 weeks to 12 years old. Rainbow Early Education was\nformerly known as Rainbow Child Development. It is based in Troy, Michigan.\n\n[A Discovery Education][71]\n\nA Discovery Education focuses on early childhood education services for children aged 0-6 years and\ntheir families, operating within the education sector. The company offers a range of educational\nprograms and services designed to support cognitive and emotional development in young children, as\nwell as providing training and resources for parents and educators. These services aim to lay a\nstrong foundation for children's future learning and development. It was founded in 2007 and is\nbased in Xi'an, Shaanxi.\n\n[EasyFolios][72]\n\nEasyFolios focuses on providing software services in the education sector, specifically for early\nchildhood centers. Its main offerings include online enrollment, touchless attendance, and digital\ndaily reports, all aimed at connecting parents, teachers, and students. The company primarily serves\nthe education technology industry. It was founded in 2004 and is based in Seattle, Washington.\n\nLoading...\n\n[CB Insights]\n498 Seventh Avenue 12th floor\nNew York, NY 10018[info@cbinsights.com][73]\n[212 292 3148][74]\n\nFollow Us On Social\n\n[[Twitter]][75][[Linkedin]][76][[Facebook]][77]\n\n### [About][78]\n* [About Us][79]\n* [Upcoming Webinars][80]\n* [Contact Us][81]\n\n### [How We Help][82]\n* [Understand Tech Markets][83]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][84]\n* [Create Tech Strategy][85]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors][86]\n* [Digital Transformation][87]\n\n### [What We Offer][88]\n* [Platform][89]\n* [Data][90]\n* [Research Overview][91]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][92]\n* [Pricing][93]\n\n### [Popular Research][94]\n* [AI 100][95]\n* [Fintech 100][96]\n* [Digital Health 50][97]\n* [Tech Trends 2024][98]\n* [Generative AI Predictions][99]\n* [Unicorn Tracker][100]\n* [VC Glossary][101]\n* [Company List Applications][102]\n* [CB Insights Website Terms of Use][103]\n* [Privacy Policy][104]\n* [Do Not Sell My Info][105]\n* [Partnership][106]\n\nCopyright 2026 CB Information Services, Inc. All rights reserved.\n\nCBI websites generally use certain cookies to enable better interactions with our sites and\nservices. Use of these cookies, which may be stored on your device, permits us to improve and\ncustomize your experience. You can read more about your cookie choices at [our privacy policy][107].\nBy continuing to use this site you are consenting to these choices.\n\nI ACCEPT\nI DO NOT ACCEPT\n\n[1]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/technology-vendors/\n[2]: https://www.cbinsights.com/research/\n[3]: https://www.cbinsights.com/newsletter/\n[4]: https://www.cbinsights.com/media-support/\n[5]: https://www.cbinsights.com/login\n[6]: https://www.cbinsights.com\n[7]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-strategy/\n[8]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-venture-capital/\n[9]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/venture-capital/\n[10]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/head-of-it/\n[11]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-innovation/\n[12]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-vcs-use-cb-insights/\n[13]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/consumer/\n[14]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/tech/\n[15]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/insurance/\n[16]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/healthcare/\n[17]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/industrials/\n[18]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/financial-services/\n[19]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/professional-services/\n[20]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/professional-services/\n[21]: https://www.cbinsights.com/resources/case-studies/\n[22]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/understand-tech-markets/\n[23]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/competitor-strategy/\n[24]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/create-tech-strategy/\n[25]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/find-tech-vendors/\n[26]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/digital-transformation/\n[27]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/platform/\n[28]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/technology-search-engine/\n[29]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/market-analytics-and-visualizations/\n[30]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/team-management-and-collaboration/\n[31]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/platform/\n[32]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/data/\n[33]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/research/\n[34]: https://www.cbinsights.com/learn/personal-briefing/\n[35]: https://www.cbinsights.com/learn/instant-insights/\n[36]: https://www.cbinsights.com/learn/public-company-data/\n[37]: https://www.cbinsights.com/learn/buyer-interviews\n[38]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/technology-vendors//\n[39]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/api/\n[40]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/\n[41]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/chrome-and-edge-extension/\n[42]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/salesforce-integration/\n[43]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/affinity-integration/\n[44]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/microsoft-excel/\n[45]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/google-sheets/\n[46]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/microsoft-teams/\n[47]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/slack/\n[48]: h