            "text": "* [Technology Vendors][1]\n* [Recent Research][2]\n* [Newsletter][3]\n* [Media Support][4]\n* [Login][5]\n[[CB Insights]][6]\n* Who We Serve\n* Function\n* [Corporate Strategy][7]\n* [Corporate Venture Capital][8]\n* [Venture Capital][9]\n* [IT][10]\n* [Corporate Innovation][11]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### How VCs Use CB Insights\n\n[Go to the video gallery \u2192][12]\n* Industries\n* [Consumer & Retail][13]\n* [Tech][14]\n* [Insurance][15]\n* [Healthcare][16]\n* [Industrials][17]\n* [Financial Services][18]\n* [Professional Services][19]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Professional Services\n\n[Learn More\u2192][20]\n* [Success Stories][21]\n* How We Help\n* [Understand Tech Markets][22]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][23]\n* [Determine Tech Strategy][24]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors & Partners][25]\n* [Turbocharge Digital Transformation][26]\n* What We Offer\n* Platform\n* [Overview][27]\n* [Technology Search Engine][28]\n* [Market Analytics and Visualizations][29]\n* [Team Management and Collaboration][30]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Platform Overview\n\n[Learn More\u2192][31]\n* [Data][32]\n* [Research][33]\n* [Personal Briefing][34]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][35]\n* [Public Equity Data][36]\n* [Buyer Interview Transcripts][37]\n* [Analyst Briefings][38]\n* [API & Data Feeds][39]\n* Integrations\n* [Overview][40]\n* [Chrome and Edge][41]\n* [Salesforce][42]\n* [Affinity][43]\n* [Microsoft Excel][44]\n* [Google Sheets][45]\n* [Microsoft Teams][46]\n* [Slack][47]\n* [Google Slides][48]\n* [App Partners][49]\n* [Browser Extension][50]\n* [Pricing][51]\n* About Us\n* [Overview][52]\n* Our teams\n* [Business Development][53]\n* [Engineering][54]\n* [Operations][55]\n* [Product][56]\n* [See all \u2192][57]\n* [Open Jobs][58]\n\nLoading...\n\n[2Wire company logo]\n\n# 2Wire\n\nUnclaimed\n[2wire.com][59]\n* [Overview & Products][60]\n* [Financials][61]\n* [People][62]\n* [Alternatives & Competitors][63]\n\n## Founded Year\n\n1998\n\n## Stage\n\nAcquired | Acquired\n\n## Total Raised\n\n$169.4M\n\n## Valuation\n\n$0000 View\n\n## About 2Wire\n\n2Wire specializes in broadband solutions and operates within the telecommunications sector. It\noffers a range of products, including residential gateways, multi-service media platforms, and\nremote management systems designed to provide user experiences in connected homes. It was founded in\n1998 and is based in San Jose, California. On 20-Oct-2010, 2Wire was acquired by Arris Global.\n\n## Headquarters Location\n\n1704 Automation Parkway\n\nSan Jose, California, 95131,\n\nUnited States\n\n408-428-9500\n\nLoading...\n\nLoading...\n\n## 2Wire Patents\n\n2Wire has filed 29 patents.\n\nThe 3 most popular patent topics include:\n* geolocation\n* global positioning system\n* irrigation\n\n[patents chart]\nView Patents Chart\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\nApplica\u2502Gran\u2502Title \u2502Related Topics \u2502Sta\ntion \u2502t \u2502 \u2502 \u2502tus\nDate \u2502Date\u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\n2/4/202\u250212/2\u2502[Irrigation subsystem and method for \u2502Irrigation, Queueing theory, Global \u2502Gra\n1 \u25027/20\u2502locating a decoder unit in an irrigation \u2502Positioning System, Geolocation, \u2502nt\n\u250222 \u2502system][64] \u2502Wireless locating \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nApplication \u25022/4/2021\nDate \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nGrant Date \u250212/27/2022\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nTitle \u2502[Irrigation subsystem and method for locating a decoder unit in an irrigation\n\u2502system][65]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nRelated Topics \u2502Irrigation, Queueing theory, Global Positioning System, Geolocation, Wireless\n\u2502locating\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nStatus \u2502Grant\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nLearn more by requesting a demo\n\n## Latest 2Wire News\n\n[Follow us on X Follow us on RSS Follow us on Facebook Follow us on LinkedIn 2Wire buys Kenati, to\nextend broadband service platform][66]\n\nMar 28, 2025\n\nMatt Marshall 2Wire , a San Jose, Calif. provider of broadband service products for companies\nserving consumers, said it has acquired Kenati Technologies , a home networking software maker, for\nan undisclosed amount 2Wire, a decade old company that has raised around $200 million from investors\nsuch as Venrock Associates, Oak Investment Partners and Dell Ventures, is mulling a public offering\nnext year. 2Wire said Kenati\u2019s technology will help it better server telecom operators as it works\nwith them to sell digital media services to consumers. Daily insights on business use cases with VB\nDaily If you want to impress your boss, VB Daily has you covered. We give you the inside scoop on\nwhat companies are doing with generative AI, from regulatory shifts to practical deployments, so you\ncan share insights for maximum ROI. Subscribe Now\n\nMay 29, 2019\n[Significant Patent Win for TQ Delta][67]\nLearn more by requesting a demo\n\n### 2Wire Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\n* When was 2Wire founded?\n\n2Wire was founded in 1998.\n* Where is 2Wire's headquarters?\n\n2Wire's headquarters is located at 1704 Automation Parkway, San Jose.\n* What is 2Wire's latest funding round?\n\n2Wire's latest funding round is Acquired.\n* How much did 2Wire raise?\n\n2Wire raised a total of $169.4M.\n* Who are the investors of 2Wire?\n\nInvestors of 2Wire include Pace, Meritech Capital Partners, Notable Capital, Oak Investment\nPartners, Venrock and 11 more.\n* Who are 2Wire's competitors?\n\nCompetitors of 2Wire include Surfnet and 5 more.\n\nLoading...\n\n## Compare 2Wire to Competitors\n\n[i3 Broadband Logo]\n[i3 Broadband][68]\n\ni3 Broadband offers fiber-optic internet and communication services, providing residential and\nbusiness customers with internet, television, and phone services. The company serves residential,\nbusiness, and entertainment sectors. i3 Broadband was formerly known as iTV-3. It was founded in\n1994 and is based in East Peoria, Illinois.\n\n[SatelliteInternet.com][69]\n\nSatelliteInternet.com provides information and guidance on satellite internet solutions across\nvarious sectors. The company offers reviews, comparisons, and guides to assist consumers in\nselecting a satellite internet provider for rural living, travel, or business. SatelliteInternet.com\nserves individuals and businesses seeking internet access in remote or underserved areas. It was\nfounded in 2003 and is based in Draper, Utah.\n\n[Elio Networks][70]\n\nElio Networks operates within the telecommunications industry, providing dedicated internet access,\nbroadband solutions, and fibre connectivity to the business sector. The company serves organizations\nwith different sizes and requirements. Elio Networks was formerly known as hostireland.com. It was\nfounded in 1998 and is based in Dublin 2, Ireland. In April 2022, Elio Networks was acquired by\nDigital 9 Infrastructure at a valuation of $65M.\n\n[Altafiber Logo]\n[Altafiber][71]\n\nAltafiber is a company that operates in the telecommunications and energy sectors. The company\nprovides a range of services including high-speed internet, television, home phone services, and\nenergy solutions. Its primary customers are residential and business sectors. It was founded in 1873\nand is based in Cincinnati, Ohio.\n\n[Broadband Development Group Logo]\n[Broadband Development Group][72]\n\nBroadband Development Group provides Internet access in the telecommunications sector. Their\nofferings include broadband services for residential and business subscribers in Multi-Tenant Units,\nutilizing LAN technology for connectivity. It is based in Little Rock, Arkansas.\n\n[Telenor Fiber][73]\n\nTelenor Fiber specializes in providing high-speed fiber broadband services. They offer various fiber\ninternet packages with symmetrical upload and download speeds, including standard fiber and hybrid\nfiber options, and enhanced security features. Telenor Fiber's services cater to private households\nand businesses seeking reliable internet connectivity. It was founded in 2022 and is based in\nFornebu, Norway. Telenor Fiber operates as a subsidiary of Telenor.\n\nLoading...\n\n[CB Insights]\n498 Seventh Avenue 12th floor\nNew York, NY 10018[info@cbinsights.com][74]\n[212 292 3148][75]\n\nFollow Us On Social\n\n[[Twitter]][76][[Linkedin]][77][[Facebook]][78]\n\n### [About][79]\n* [About Us][80]\n* [Upcoming Webinars][81]\n* [Contact Us][82]\n\n### [How We Help][83]\n* [Understand Tech Markets][84]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][85]\n* [Create Tech Strategy][86]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors][87]\n* [Digital Transformation][88]\n\n### [What We Offer][89]\n* [Platform][90]\n* [Data][91]\n* [Research Overview][92]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][93]\n* [Pricing][94]\n\n### [Popular Research][95]\n* [AI 100][96]\n* [Fintech 100][97]\n* [Digital Health 50][98]\n* [Tech Trends 2024][99]\n* [Generative AI Predictions][100]\n* [Unicorn Tracker][101]\n* [VC Glossary][102]\n* [Company List Applications][103]\n* [CB Insights Website Terms of Use][104]\n* [Privacy Policy][105]\n* [Do Not Sell My Info][106]\n* [Partnership][107]\n\nCopyright 2026 CB Information Services, Inc. All rights reserved.\n\nCBI websites generally use certain cookies to enable better interactions with our sites and\nservices. Use of these cookies, which may be stored on your device, permits us to improve and\ncustomize your experience. You can read more about your cookie choices at [our privacy policy][108].\nBy continuing to use this site you are consenting to these choices.\n\nI ACCEPT\nI DO NOT ACCEPT\n\n[1]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/technology-vendors/\n[2]: https://www.cbinsights.com/research/\n[3]: https://www.cbinsights.com/newsletter/\n[4]: https://www.cbinsights.com/media-support/\n[5]: https://www.cbinsights.com/login\n[6]: https://www.cbinsights.com\n[7]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-strategy/\n[8]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-venture-capital/\n[9]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/venture-capital/\n[10]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/head-of-it/\n[11]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-innovation/\n[12]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-vcs-use-cb-insights/\n[13]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/consumer/\n[14]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/tech/\n[15]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/insurance/\n[16]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/healthcare/\n[17]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/industrials/\n[18]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/financial-services/\n[19]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/professional-services/\n[20]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/professional-services/\n[21]: https://www.cbinsights.com/resources/case-studies/\n[22]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/understand-tech-markets/\n[23]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/competitor-strategy/\n[24]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/create-tech-strategy/\n[25]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/find-tech-vendors/\n[26]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/digital-transformation/\n[27]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/platform/\n[28]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/technology-search-engine/\n[29]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/market-analytics-and-visualizations/\n[30]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/team-management-and-collaboration/\n[31]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/platform/\n[32]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/data/\n[33]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/research/\n[34]: https://www.cbinsights.com/learn/personal-briefing/\n[35]: https://www.cbinsights.com/learn/instant-insights/\n[36]: htt"
