\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nStatus \u2502Grant\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nLearn more by requesting a demo\n\n## Latest 4INFO News\n\n[Cross-platform and Mobile Advertising Market 2022 Assessment and Key Insights Analyzed Till\n2028][66]\n\nFeb 3, 2022\n\nCross-platform and Mobile Advertising Market 2022 Assessment and Key Insights Analyzed Till 2028\nFuture Market Insights (FMI) as of late distributed a market report named \u2018Cross-Platform and Mobile\nAdvertising Market \u2013 Global Industry Analysis 2013-2017 and Opportunity Assessment 2018-2028.\u2019 The\ncross-platform and versatile promoting market is assuming a significant part in the advertising\nbusiness in view of the expanding infiltration of the Internet, internationally. Organizations of\ncross-platform and mobile advertising platform are working with web-based media platforms like\nFacebook, Instagram, and a lot more to give the promotion of items and administrations. In addition,\ninternet business sites are additionally promoting advertisements of various customers and brands to\nthe client, which thus supporting the cross-platform and mobile advertising market. The worldwide\ncross-platform and mobile advertising market is assessed to grow at a CAGR of more than 21% during\nthe estimate time frame. This heavenly development in the worldwide cross-platform and versatile\nadvertising business sector can be credited to the worldwide promoting industry with rising\nglobalization and digitalization. What\u2019s more, with innovative headways in investigation,\ncross-platform and versatile promoting firms can offer different modified answers for their\ncustomers. These are the variables that are driving the cross-platform and versatile advertising\nmarket. The South Asia locale is relied upon to hold a noticeable portion of the cross-platform and\nversatile promoting market when contrasted with different districts. The set up cross-platform and\nmobile promoting platform suppliers in the market are giving imaginative cross-platform and\nversatile advertising platform for various businesses like retail, car, IT and Telecom, fabricating,\namong others. Future Market Insights has divided the worldwide cross-platform and mobile promoting\nmarket notice type, platform, end client, vertical, and locale. By promotion type, the market is\nsectioned into search, local media, show, video, SMS, and sound. The cross-platform and versatile\nadvertising market in a few nations is assuming a fundamental and significant part by offering\nnumerous promoting administrations in pretty much every space. Based on end client, the\ncross-platform and versatile promoting market is sectioned into little and medium undertakings and\nenormous endeavors. The huge endeavors sub-fragment is relied upon to hold a conspicuous piece of\nthe pie all through the gauge time frame. Notwithstanding, the little and medium endeavors\nsub-portion is relied upon to keep on tracking down new areas of utilizations of cross-platform and\nversatile advertising in various locales. This is relied upon to empower the cross-platform and\nmobile promoting business sector to record the noticeable development rate during the conjecture\ntime frame. Expansion in the quantity of publicists Expanding spending on innovative work for\nlooking through new regions is a key variable driving the cross-platform and mobile promoting\nmarket. Also, quick urbanization and the expanding spending on advanced promoting is relied upon to\nset out potential development open doors for the cross-platform and mobile advertising market during\nthe figure time frame. Cutthroat Landscape A portion of the key merchants that are shrouded in this\nreport named cross-platform and versatile promoting incorporates, Facebook Inc., Google, Inc., SAP\nSE, Apple, Inc., Microsoft Corporation, Verizon Digital Media Services, Inc., Amobee, Inc.\n(SingTel), 4INFO, AdColony, and Inmobi. Get a Sample Copy of the Report @\nhttps://www.futuremarketinsights.com/reports/sample/rep-gb-9006\n\nJan 7, 2020\n[Cadent Acquires 4INFO, Enhances Its TV Advertising Solution][67]\nJan 4, 2020\n[Cadent Buys Identity And Media Solutions Company 4INFO][68]\nJan 3, 2020\n[Cadent Acquires 4INFO, Expands Cross-Screen TV Capabilities for National Advertisers][69]\nJan 3, 2020\n[Cadent Acquires 4INFO][70]\nLearn more by requesting a demo\n\n### 4INFO Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\n* When was 4INFO founded?\n\n4INFO was founded in 2004.\n* Where is 4INFO's headquarters?\n\n4INFO's headquarters is located at 155 Bovet Rd., San Mateo.\n* What is 4INFO's latest funding round?\n\n4INFO's latest funding round is Acquired.\n* How much did 4INFO raise?\n\n4INFO raised a total of $78.78M.\n* Who are the investors of 4INFO?\n\nInvestors of 4INFO include Cadent, Threshold Ventures, U.S. Venture Partners, TEGNA, Mezzanine\nManagement and 12 more.\n* Who are 4INFO's competitors?\n\nCompetitors of 4INFO include Just Dial and 8 more.\n\nLoading...\n\n## Compare 4INFO to Competitors\n\n[Kgb Logo]\n[Kgb][71]\n\nKgb is a company that provides directory assistance, information services, and customer care support\nacross various industries. Their offerings include directory assistance services, call completion,\nand information services such as movie listings and train schedules, for user inquiries through\nmultiple platforms. Kgb serves sectors such as telecommunications, cable, utilities, government, and\nhealth care with customer care and call center operations. It was founded in 1992 and is based in\nNew York, New York.\n\n[Local Marketers Logo]\n[Local Marketers][72]\n\nLocal Marketers is a marketing firm that provides go-to-market strategies across various business\nsectors. They offer services such as brand image development, marketing plan creation, and\nomnichannel marketing execution. The company serves businesses that need marketing support. It was\nfounded in 2005 and is based in Seattle, Washington.\n\n[Whitepages Logo]\n[Whitepages][73]\n\nWhitepages is a company that provides contact information and public records, operating within the\ninformation services sector. Its offerings include tools for people search, reverse phone and\naddress lookup, and background checks, which help individuals and businesses find and verify contact\ndetails and personal information. Whitepages has a clientele that includes consumers seeking\npersonal contact information and businesses requiring data for identity verification and customer\nconnection. It was founded in 1997 and is based in Seattle, Washington.\n\n[SearchUnify][74]\n\nSearchUnify is a unified cognitive platform operating in the technology sector. The company offers a\nsuite of AI-powered products that enhance enterprise search, provide insights, and improve customer\nsupport and self-service. These products are primarily used in sectors such as banking, e-commerce,\neducation, healthcare, and manufacturing. It is based in Mountain View, California.\n\n[99Pandit][75]\n\n99Pandit is an online platform that connects users with pandits for Hindu puja services. The company\noffers puja services including marriage ceremonies, housewarming rituals, and various religious\nobservances, all bookable through their website. 99Pandit serves individuals and families seeking to\nengage in spiritual and religious practices. It is based in Jaipur, India.\n\n[Handy Online Solutions][76]\n\nHandy Online Solutions aims to use data and internet/mobile technologies to improve interactions\nbetween white-collar and blue-collar workers in India. The company offers platforms that support\nengagements and workforce management. It primarily serves the human resource industry. The company\nwas founded in 2015 and is based in Thane, India.\n\nLoading...\n\n[CB Insights]\n498 Seventh Avenue 12th floor\nNew York, NY 10018[info@cbinsights.com][77]\n[212 292 3148][78]\n\nFollow Us On Social\n\n[[Twitter]][79][[Linkedin]][80][[Facebook]][81]\n\n### "
