            "text": "* [Technology Vendors][1]\n* [Recent Research][2]\n* [Newsletter][3]\n* [Media Support][4]\n* [Login][5]\n[[CB Insights]][6]\n* Who We Serve\n* Function\n* [Corporate Strategy][7]\n* [Corporate Venture Capital][8]\n* [Venture Capital][9]\n* [IT][10]\n* [Corporate Innovation][11]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### How VCs Use CB Insights\n\n[Go to the video gallery \u2192][12]\n* Industries\n* [Consumer & Retail][13]\n* [Tech][14]\n* [Insurance][15]\n* [Healthcare][16]\n* [Industrials][17]\n* [Financial Services][18]\n* [Professional Services][19]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Professional Services\n\n[Learn More\u2192][20]\n* [Success Stories][21]\n* How We Help\n* [Understand Tech Markets][22]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][23]\n* [Determine Tech Strategy][24]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors & Partners][25]\n* [Turbocharge Digital Transformation][26]\n* What We Offer\n* Platform\n* [Overview][27]\n* [Technology Search Engine][28]\n* [Market Analytics and Visualizations][29]\n* [Team Management and Collaboration][30]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Platform Overview\n\n[Learn More\u2192][31]\n* [Data][32]\n* [Research][33]\n* [Personal Briefing][34]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][35]\n* [Public Equity Data][36]\n* [Buyer Interview Transcripts][37]\n* [Analyst Briefings][38]\n* [API & Data Feeds][39]\n* Integrations\n* [Overview][40]\n* [Chrome and Edge][41]\n* [Salesforce][42]\n* [Affinity][43]\n* [Microsoft Excel][44]\n* [Google Sheets][45]\n* [Microsoft Teams][46]\n* [Slack][47]\n* [Google Slides][48]\n* [App Partners][49]\n* [Browser Extension][50]\n* [Pricing][51]\n* About Us\n* [Overview][52]\n* Our teams\n* [Business Development][53]\n* [Engineering][54]\n* [Operations][55]\n* [Product][56]\n* [See all \u2192][57]\n* [Open Jobs][58]\n\nLoading...\n\n[Coupons.com company logo]\n\n# Coupons.com\n\nUnclaimed\n[coupons.com][59]\n* [Overview & Products][60]\n* [People][61]\n* [Alternatives & Competitors][62]\n\n## About Coupons.com\n\nCoupons.com is a consumer savings platform in the digital coupon distribution industry. The company\nprovides online promo codes and printable coupons that offer discounts on a wide range of products\nand services. Coupons.com caters to various sectors, including apparel, electronics, household\nitems, food and restaurants, and travel. It is based in Mountain View, California.\n\n## Headquarters Location\n\nMountain View, California,\n\nUnited States\n\nLoading...\n\nLoading...\n\n## Latest Coupons.com News\n\n[Coupons.com Launches \u2018The Clip\u2019, an Editorial Magazine Where Stories Meet Savings][63]\n\nMar 20, 2026\n\nCoupons.com Launches \u2018The Clip\u2019, an Editorial Magazine Where Stories Meet Savings Atlanta, GEORGIA,\nMarch 19, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) \u2014 Coupons.com today announced the launch of a new resource on its\nwebsite to help Americans shop better, save money, and feel good while doing so. Going beyond a\nstandard deals feed, The Clip by Coupons.com is an online magazine that bridges the gap between\nfinding deals and the human stories behind the savings. The Clip by Coupons.com There\u2019s a reason\nthere are TV shows that showcase people who go to extreme lengths to save money. They offer a view\ninto what compels people to save, and often reveal that it doesn\u2019t just come down to necessity. And\nwhile most people don\u2019t go to such extremes as those you see on TV, the drive to save money is\nuniversal, and behind the savings are real stories. The Clip will showcase some of these stories\nwhile also offering a different perspective by taking readers inside the team that brings these\nsavings to millions of US shoppers. As AI and automated content take over the internet, The Clip\nwill show the human side of Coupons.com. The magazine will pull back the curtain on the global team,\nwhich spans Atlanta, London, Kuala Lumpur, and Rio de Janeiro, who manually verify codes and\nresearch retailers. Here are the types of content readers can expect: Honest takes and stories\nrelated to saving money, including a look at how the company\u2019s own Managing Director uses coupons in\nhis daily life. Features like \u201cA Day in the Life of a Coupons.com Editor\u201d showing the rigorous\nprocess behind verifying the offers users see on the site. Practical advice on becoming a \u201csavings\nguru\u201d without going to extremes. \u201cWith the launch of The Clip, we look forward to giving loyal\nCoupons.com users \u2013 some of whom have been with us for more than 25 years \u2013 a look behind the scenes\nand providing them with valuable insights they can\u2019t find elsewhere,\u201d says Alexander Ketter,\nManaging Director at Coupons.com. Coupons.com continues to evolve Since its acquisition by Atolls in\n2023, Coupons.com has expanded its focus beyond printable and digital coupons to include cashback\noffers at thousands of online retailers. The Clip serves as the narrative hub for this evolution,\nensuring that as the technology changes, the human connection remains. \u201cWe want to earn our users\u2019\ntrust in a whole new way,\u201d says Kat Keener, Senior Editor at Coupons.com. \u201cThe Clip is where we\nbring our personalities to the table, showing the faces of the people working hard every day to help\nyou save.\u201d The new section of the Coupons.com website can be found at\nhttps://www.coupons.com/the-clip/ . About Coupons.com Coupons.com is your go-to destination for all\nthings savings. We provide shoppers with the best ways to save, including online and in-store\ncoupons for thousands of your favorite stores. We also offer cashback, so you can get rewarded every\ntime you shop with us. Our goal is to help you make smarter shopping decisions and save the most\nmoney every time you check out! Founded in 1998, Coupons.com is today part of Atolls, where it\ncontinues to build on its more than 25-year legacy. Press Inquiries\n\nMar 19, 2026\n[Coupons.com Launches \u2018The Clip\u2019, an Editorial Magazine Where Stories Meet Savings][64]\nMar 19, 2026\n[Coupons.com Launches \u2018The Clip', an Editorial Magazine Where Stories Meet Savings][65]\nFeb 19, 2026\n['\uc7a5\ubc14\uad6c\ub2c8 \ubb3c\uac00\uc548\uc815' \uf9e1\ub300\ud1b5\ub839 \uba54\uc2dc\uc9c0\uc5d0\u2026\ud560\uc778\uc804 \ub098\uc120 \uc720\ud1b5\uac00][66]\nJan 26, 2026\n[Coupons.com Reveals the Most and Least Expensive US Cities to Live in for 2026][67]\nLearn more by requesting a demo\n\n### Coupons.com Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\n* Where is Coupons.com's headquarters?\n\nCoupons.com's headquarters is located at Mountain View.\n* Who are Coupons.com's competitors?\n\nCompetitors of Coupons.com include LoZo and 4 more.\n\nLoading...\n\n## Compare Coupons.com to Competitors\n\n[UltimateCoupons][68]\n\nUltimateCoupons is a digital platform specializing in the distribution of coupons and promotional\ncodes within the e-commerce sector. The company aggregates and provides access to a wide range of\ndiscounts and deals for various online retailers and services. UltimateCoupons serves a diverse\ncustomer base, including individual consumers looking to save money on online purchases across\nmultiple categories such as clothing, electronics, and home goods. It was founded in 1999 and is\nbased in El Segundo, California.\n\n[CouponerStore.com][69]\n\nCouponerStore.com is an online platform that aggregates and offers coupons, promo codes, and deals\nfor a variety of brands and merchants. The company provides a centralized location for consumers to\nfind discounts on products and services across multiple categories. CouponerStore.com primarily\nserves the ecommerce industry by facilitating savings for online shoppers. It is based in Houston,\nTexas.\n\n[Saveomania][70]\n\nSaveomania is a digital platform that aggregates coupons and promo codes from various online\nretailers. The company provides discount codes, including percentage off and free shipping, for\nconsumers seeking deals in sectors such as entertainment, food & beverage, electronics, and fashion.\nIt is based in Houston, Texas.\n\n[ShowMeTheCoupon][71]\n\nShowMeTheCoupon is a platform that specializes in aggregating and providing online coupons, promo\ncodes, and discount offers. The company facilitates consumer savings by offering a variety of deals,\nincluding free shipping, from numerous online retailers and affiliate networks. ShowMeTheCoupon's\nservice includes a system for rating and ranking coupons to ensure users have access to the best\ncurrent deals while expired offers are deprioritized. It was founded in 2010 and is based in Los\nAltos, California.\n\n[Cobonzy.com][72]\n\nCobonzy.com is a digital platform focused on the online marketplace for coupons and promotional\ncodes. The company provides a service allowing users to register to access digital coupons for their\npurchases. While primarily serving individual consumers, it operates within the broader e-commerce\nand digital savings industry. It was founded in 2013 and is based in Amman, Jordan.\n\n[Sobeys][73]\n\nSobeys is a supermarket chain that provides food products and grocery retail services. The company\noffers groceries, including fresh produce, meats, and baked goods, as well as pharmacy services and\nonline grocery shopping. Sobeys engages in sustainability initiatives and community support\nprograms. It was founded in 1907 and is based in Stellarton, Nova Scotia. Sobeys operates as a\nsubsidiary of Empire Company.\n\nLoading...\n\n[CB Insights]\n498 Seventh Avenue 12th floor\nNew York, NY 10018[info@cbinsights.com][74]\n[212 292 3148][75]\n\nFollow Us On Social\n\n[[Twitter]][76][[Linkedin]][77][[Facebook]][78]\n\n### [About][79]\n* [About Us][80]\n* [Upcoming Webinars][81]\n* [Contact Us][82]\n\n### [How We Help][83]\n* [Understand Tech Markets][84]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][85]\n* [Create Tech Strategy][86]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors][87]\n* [Digital Transformation][88]\n\n### [What We Offer][89]\n* [Platform][90]\n* [Data][91]\n* [Research Overview][92]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][93]\n* [Pricing][94]\n\n### [Popular Research][95]\n* [AI 100][96]\n* [Fintech 100][97]\n* [Digital Health 50][98]\n* [Tech Trends 2024][99]\n* [Generative AI Predictions][100]\n* [Unicorn Tracker][101]\n* [VC Glossary][102]\n* [Company List Applications][103]\n* [CB Insights Website Terms of Use][104]\n* [Privacy Policy][105]\n* [Do Not Sell My Info][106]\n* [Partnership][107]\n\nCopyright 2026 CB Information Services, Inc. All rights reserved.\n\nCBI websites generally use certain cookies to enable better interactions with our sites and\nservices. Use of these cookies, which may be stored on your device, permits us to improve and\ncustomize your experience. You can read more about your cookie choices at [our privacy policy][108].\nBy continuing to use this site you are consenting to these choices.\n\nI ACCEPT\nI DO NOT ACCEPT\n\n[1]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/technology-vendors/\n[2]: https://www.cbinsights.com/research/\n[3]: https://www.cbinsights.com/newsletter/\n[4]: https://www.cbinsights.com/media-support/\n[5]: https://www.cbinsights.com/login\n[6]: https://www.cbinsights.com\n[7]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-strategy/\n[8]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-venture-capital/\n[9]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/venture-capital/\n[10]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/head-of-it/\n[11]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-innovation/\n[12]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-vcs-use-cb-insights/\n[13]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/consumer/\n[14]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/tech/\n[15]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/insurance/\n[16]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/healthcare/\n[17]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/industrials/\n[18]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/financial-services/\n[19]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/professional-services/\n[20]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/professional-services/\n[21]: https://www.cbinsights.com/resources/case-studies/\n[22]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/understand-tech-markets/\n[23]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/competitor-strategy/\n[24]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/create-tech-strategy/\n[25]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/find-tech-vendors/\n[26]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/digital-transformation/\n[27]: https://www."
