            "text": "* [Technology Vendors][1]\n* [Recent Research][2]\n* [Newsletter][3]\n* [Media Support][4]\n* [Login][5]\n[[CB Insights]][6]\n* Who We Serve\n* Function\n* [Corporate Strategy][7]\n* [Corporate Venture Capital][8]\n* [Venture Capital][9]\n* [IT][10]\n* [Corporate Innovation][11]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### How VCs Use CB Insights\n\n[Go to the video gallery \u2192][12]\n* Industries\n* [Consumer & Retail][13]\n* [Tech][14]\n* [Insurance][15]\n* [Healthcare][16]\n* [Industrials][17]\n* [Financial Services][18]\n* [Professional Services][19]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Professional Services\n\n[Learn More\u2192][20]\n* [Success Stories][21]\n* How We Help\n* [Understand Tech Markets][22]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][23]\n* [Determine Tech Strategy][24]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors & Partners][25]\n* [Turbocharge Digital Transformation][26]\n* What We Offer\n* Platform\n* [Overview][27]\n* [Technology Search Engine][28]\n* [Market Analytics and Visualizations][29]\n* [Team Management and Collaboration][30]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Platform Overview\n\n[Learn More\u2192][31]\n* [Data][32]\n* [Research][33]\n* [Personal Briefing][34]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][35]\n* [Public Equity Data][36]\n* [Buyer Interview Transcripts][37]\n* [Analyst Briefings][38]\n* [API & Data Feeds][39]\n* Integrations\n* [Overview][40]\n* [Chrome and Edge][41]\n* [Salesforce][42]\n* [Affinity][43]\n* [Microsoft Excel][44]\n* [Google Sheets][45]\n* [Microsoft Teams][46]\n* [Slack][47]\n* [Google Slides][48]\n* [App Partners][49]\n* [Browser Extension][50]\n* [Pricing][51]\n* About Us\n* [Overview][52]\n* Our teams\n* [Business Development][53]\n* [Engineering][54]\n* [Operations][55]\n* [Product][56]\n* [See all \u2192][57]\n* [Open Jobs][58]\n\nLoading...\n\n# Adchemy\n\nUnclaimed\n[adchemy.com][59]\n* [Overview & Products][60]\n* [Financials][61]\n* [People][62]\n* [Alternatives & Competitors][63]\n\n## Founded Year\n\n2004\n\n## Stage\n\nAcquired | Acquired\n\n## Total Raised\n\n$119.28M\n\n## About Adchemy\n\nAdchemy offers advertisers the ability to leverage consumer intent to create digital advertising\nexperiences. Adchemy IntentMap technology allows advertisers to simplify paid search campaigns,\nimprove ad relevance, and grow their business. It was founded in 2004 and is based in Foster City,\nCalifornia. It was acquired by Walmart.\n\n## Headquarters Location\n\n1001 E Hillsdale Blvd 7th Floor\n\nFoster City, California, 94404,\n\nUnited States\n\n877-232-4369\n\nLoading...\n\nLoading...\n\n## Expert Collections containing Adchemy\n\nExpert Collections are analyst-curated lists that highlight the companies you need to know in the\nmost important technology spaces.\n\nAdchemy is included in **1 Expert Collection,** including **Ad Tech**.\n\n# Ad Tech\n\n4,236 items\n\nCompanies offering tech-enabled marketing and advertising services.\n\nLearn more by requesting a demo\n\n## Adchemy Patents\n\nAdchemy has filed 15 patents.\n\n[patents chart]\nView Patents Chart\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\nApplic\u2502Gran\u2502Title \u2502Related Topics \u2502Sta\nation \u2502t \u2502 \u2502 \u2502tus\nDate \u2502Date\u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\n10/30/\u25029/3/\u2502[System and method for generating\u2502Internet advertising methods, Promotion and \u2502Gra\n2006 \u25022013\u2502optimized bids for advertisement \u2502marketing communications, Financial ratios, \u2502nt\n\u2502 \u2502keywords][64] \u2502Military computers, Product management \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nApplication\u250210/30/2006\nDate \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nGrant Date \u25029/3/2013\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nTitle \u2502[System and method for generating optimized bids for advertisement keywords][65]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nRelated \u2502Internet advertising methods, Promotion and marketing communications, Financial ratios,\nTopics \u2502Military computers, Product management\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nStatus \u2502Grant\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nLearn more by requesting a demo\n\n## Latest Adchemy News\n\n[This Document From Walmart\u2019s Adtech Acquisition Shows How Top Managers Got Rich While Employees Got\nNothing][66]\n\nMay 28, 2014\n\nAdchemy Murthy Nukala We recently told you about the anger among former employees of Adchemy, a\nCalifornia adtech startup recently acquired by @WalmartLabs , the digital marketing unit of Walmart.\nThe former staff are mad because Walmart reportedly bought the company for $30-$40 million, far\nbelow the $120 million in total that investors had put into it. (Walmart has previously said that\ndeal price is inaccurate. ) This has left all employees' stock options worth zero dollars \u2014 even\nthough many employees had bought common stock in Adchemy with their own money. Sources told us that\nsome staff, after working at Adchemy for years, had bought \"six figures\" of Adchemy stock with their\nown cash. Now those shares are worthless. All the money in the deal went to investors, who held\npreferred shares, and even those investors received only a fraction of what they had put in. So it\nwould seem that in this deal, everybody loses. Well, not everybody. This section of the deal's\nclosing documents, sent to Business Insider by a source who was allowed to view it, show that six\ntop executives including Adchemy CEO Murthy Nukala all did well in the deal. Nukala will get $2.4\nmillion in total golden parachute compensation. Three executives will get $1.9 million. Two others\nwill get $1.1 million and $780,000, respectively. The payments are all multiples of their regular\nsalaries at Adchemy: Business Insider It is, of course, not uncommon for managers to get larger\nrewards than their employees when they sell their companies. The issue here is that Adchemy\nemployees (and investors) lost their own cash in the company's stock, but their bosses have been\ngiven extra compensation in the deal. We asked Walmart and Nukala for comment but did not\nimmediately hear back.\n\nMay 27, 2014\n[Some Employees Are Furious At Management Payouts In Walmart\u2019s Big Adtech Acquisition (WMT)][67]\nMay 6, 2014\n[WalmartLabs buys Adchemy as retail giant strives to catch Amazon][68]\nMay 6, 2014\n[Walmart\u2019s Mysterious Adtech Acquisition Has Tongues Wagging Over The Price (WMT)][69]\nMay 6, 2014\n[Wal-Mart Stores, Inc. (WMT) acquires ad-tech company Adchemy][70]\nLearn more by requesting a demo\n\n### Adchemy Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\n* When was Adchemy founded?\n\nAdchemy was founded in 2004.\n* Where is Adchemy's headquarters?\n\nAdchemy's headquarters is located at 1001 E Hillsdale Blvd, Foster City.\n* What is Adchemy's latest funding round?\n\nAdchemy's latest funding round is Acquired.\n* How much did Adchemy raise?\n\nAdchemy raised a total of $119.28M.\n* Who are the investors of Adchemy?\n\nInvestors of Adchemy include Walmart Labs, ESO Fund, August Capital, Mayfield, Microsoft and 4\nmore.\n* Who are Adchemy's competitors?\n\nCompetitors of Adchemy include Kontera and 1 more.\n\nLoading...\n\n## Compare Adchemy to Competitors\n\n[Engine Logo]\n[Engine][71]\n\nEngine is a company that provides embedded financial marketplace solutions within the financial\ntechnology sector. It has a platform that allows for real-time financial product recommendations and\nenables comparisons with various consumer touchpoints. The company serves the financial services\nindustry and provides tools for partner networks to access platform capabilities and analytics for\nconsumer engagement. Engine was formerly known as Even Financial. It was founded in 2014 and is\nbased in New York, New York. Engine operates as a subsidiary of MoneyLion and ValueStream Ventures.\n\n[Otto Insurance][72]\n\nOtto Insurance is a digital insurance marketplace focused on auto, home, and pet insurance. The\ncompany provides a platform for users to compare and obtain insurance quotes. Otto Insurance serves\nindividual consumers seeking to secure coverage and insurance professionals looking for lead\ngeneration solutions. It is based in Miami Beach, Florida.\n\n[Vibrant Media Logo]\n[Vibrant Media][73]\n\nVibrant Media provides AI-powered digital marketing and social media management. The company offers\nservices including automated content creation, social media engagement, and SEO optimization.\nVibrant Media serves a variety of clients who utilize AI for marketing purposes. It was founded in\n2000 and is based in New York, New York.\n\n[ComparaOnline Logo]\n[ComparaOnline][74]\n\nComparaOnline enables consumers to find and compare insurance and financial products. Its site helps\nits users make thoughtful and well-informed decisions through its search and comparison engines. It\nprovides access to a wide range of products, including auto insurance, travel insurance, consortium\nfinance, and credit cards. It was founded in 2009 and is based in Santiago, Chile.\n\n[HelloSafe][75]\n\nHelloSafe is a company that provides comparison tools for insurance and personal finance products.\nThe company offers a platform where users can compare different financial products such as insurance\npolicies, loans, and savings accounts without sharing personal information. It was founded in 2020\nand is based in Montreal, Canada.\n\n[RateHub Logo]\n[RateHub][76]\n\nRateHub is a financial services company that compares various financial products including\nmortgages, credit cards, insurance, and banking products. The company has a platform for consumers\nto compare rates and terms from different financial institutions. It was founded in 2010 and is\nbased in Toronto, Ontario.\n\nLoading...\n\n[CB Insights]\n498 Seventh Avenue 12th floor\nNew York, NY 10018[info@cbinsights.com][77]\n[212 292 3148][78]\n\nFollow Us On Social\n\n[[Twitter]][79][[Linkedin]][80][[Facebook]][81]\n\n### [About][82]\n* [About Us][83]\n* [Upcoming Webinars][84]\n* [Contact Us][85]\n\n### [How We Help][86]\n* [Understand Tech Markets][87]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][88]\n* [Create Tech Strategy][89]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors][90]\n* [Digital Transformation][91]\n\n### [What We Offer][92]\n* [Platform][93]\n* [Data][94]\n* [Research Overview][95]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][96]\n* [Pricing][97]\n\n### [Popular Research][98]\n* [AI 100][99]\n* [Fintech 100][100]\n* [Digital Health 50][101]\n* [Tech Trends 2024][102]\n* [Generative AI Predictions][103]\n* [Unicorn Tracker][104]\n* [VC Glossary][105]\n* [Company List Applications][106]\n* [CB Insights Website Terms of Use][107]\n* [Privacy Policy][108]\n* [Do Not Sell My Info][109]\n* [Partnership][110]\n\nCopyright 2026 CB Information Services, Inc. All rights reserved.\n\nCBI websites generally use certain cookies to enable better interactions with our sites and\nservices. Use of these cookies, which may be stored on your device, permits us to improve and\ncustomize your experience. You can read more about your cookie choices at [our privacy policy][111].\nBy continuing to use this site you are consenting to these choices.\n\nI ACCEPT\nI DO NOT ACCEPT\n\n[1]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/technology-vendors/\n[2]: https://www.cbinsights.com/research/\n[3]: https://www.cbinsights.com/newsletter/\n[4]: https://www.cbinsights.com/media-support/\n[5]: https://www.cbinsights.com/login\n[6]: https://www.cbinsights.com\n[7]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-strategy/\n[8]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-venture-capital/\n[9]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/venture-capital/\n[10]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/head-of-it/\n[11]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-innovation/\n[12]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-vcs-use-cb-insights/\n[13]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/consumer/\n[14]: http"
