            "text": "* [Technology Vendors][1]\n* [Recent Research][2]\n* [Newsletter][3]\n* [Media Support][4]\n* [Login][5]\n[[CB Insights]][6]\n* Who We Serve\n* Function\n* [Corporate Strategy][7]\n* [Corporate Venture Capital][8]\n* [Venture Capital][9]\n* [IT][10]\n* [Corporate Innovation][11]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### How VCs Use CB Insights\n\n[Go to the video gallery \u2192][12]\n* Industries\n* [Consumer & Retail][13]\n* [Tech][14]\n* [Insurance][15]\n* [Healthcare][16]\n* [Industrials][17]\n* [Financial Services][18]\n* [Professional Services][19]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Professional Services\n\n[Learn More\u2192][20]\n* [Success Stories][21]\n* How We Help\n* [Understand Tech Markets][22]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][23]\n* [Determine Tech Strategy][24]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors & Partners][25]\n* [Turbocharge Digital Transformation][26]\n* What We Offer\n* Platform\n* [Overview][27]\n* [Technology Search Engine][28]\n* [Market Analytics and Visualizations][29]\n* [Team Management and Collaboration][30]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Platform Overview\n\n[Learn More\u2192][31]\n* [Data][32]\n* [Research][33]\n* [Personal Briefing][34]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][35]\n* [Public Equity Data][36]\n* [Buyer Interview Transcripts][37]\n* [Analyst Briefings][38]\n* [API & Data Feeds][39]\n* Integrations\n* [Overview][40]\n* [Chrome and Edge][41]\n* [Salesforce][42]\n* [Affinity][43]\n* [Microsoft Excel][44]\n* [Google Sheets][45]\n* [Microsoft Teams][46]\n* [Slack][47]\n* [Google Slides][48]\n* [App Partners][49]\n* [Browser Extension][50]\n* [Pricing][51]\n* About Us\n* [Overview][52]\n* Our teams\n* [Business Development][53]\n* [Engineering][54]\n* [Operations][55]\n* [Product][56]\n* [See all \u2192][57]\n* [Open Jobs][58]\n\nLoading...\n\n[Allyes company logo]\n\n# Allyes\n\nUnclaimed\n[allyes.com][59]\n* [Overview & Products][60]\n* [Financials][61]\n* [People][62]\n\n## Founded Year\n\n1998\n\n## Stage\n\nPrivate Equity | Alive\n\n## About Allyes\n\nAllyes runs an internet marketing company. It provides online advertising services, which cover\nintegrated digital marketing solutions, online media planning and buying, extended producer\nresponsibility (EPR), tracking and data mining, and performance-based marketing solutions. It was\nfounded in 1998 and is based in Shanghai, China.\n\n## Headquarters Location\n\n1018 Chang Ning Road 21st Floor Cloud Nine Plaza\n\nShanghai, Shanghai, 200042,\n\nChina\n\n86-021-3372 8866\n\nLoading...\n\nLoading...\n\n## Expert Collections containing Allyes\n\nExpert Collections are analyst-curated lists that highlight the companies you need to know in the\nmost important technology spaces.\n\nAllyes is included in **1 Expert Collection,** including **Ad Tech**.\n\n# Ad Tech\n\n4,236 items\n\nCompanies offering tech-enabled marketing and advertising services.\n\nLearn more by requesting a demo\n\n## Latest Allyes News\n\n[Silver Lake Acquires Majority Stake in Allyes, China's Leading Digital Marketing Solutions Provider\n-- SHANGHAI, July 30 /PRNewswire-Asia/ --][63]\n\nAug 12, 2015\n\nSilver Lake Acquires Majority Stake in Allyes, China's Leading Digital Marketing Solutions Provider\n-- SHANGHAI, July 30 /PRNewswire-Asia/ -- Silver Lake Acquires Majority Stake in Allyes, China's\nLeading Digital Marketing Solutions Provider SHANGHAI, July 30 /PRNewswire-Asia/ -- Silver Lake, the\nglobal leader inprivate investments in technology and technology-enabled industries, todayannounced\nthat it has entered into an agreement to acquire a majority stake inAllyes Online Media Holding Ltd.\n(\"Allyes\"), China's leading digital marketingsolutions provider, making it one of the largest\nprivate equity investments inChina this year. Allyes is a subsidiary of Focus Media Holding\nLimited(Nasdaq: FMCN ), China's leading digital media group. Through its digital marketing platform,\nAllyes provides online advertisingagency services, advertising networks, performance marketing,\nadvertisingtechnology solutions and online market research to leading global brands suchas Sony,\nPepsi and Chrysler and leading Chinese companies such as ChinaMerchants Bank and Taobao. Allyes has\nbuilt a leading market position by capitalizing on the robustdevelopment of the online advertising\nmarket in China, which is driven bystrong economic growth and a rapid increase in Internet\npenetration. Accordingto iResearch, the market size of China's online advertising industry\nreachedover RMB 20.7 billion in 2009, up 21.9% from 2008. \"We are delighted to welcome Silver Lake\nas our majority shareholder andstrategic partner,\" said David Zhu, CEO of Allyes. \"Allyes looks\nforward toleveraging Silver Lake's deep technology background and exceptional insightsin the global\ndigital market as we continue to grow and innovate our businessstrategies. \" \"We are impressed with\nAllyes' success over the last 12 years and lookforward to partnering with its high caliber team,\"\nsaid Dr. Eric Chen,Managing Director at Silver Lake. \"We are optimistic about Allyes' future\nandbelieve that the company is well-positioned to leverage the growth trends andcontinue to develop\nas a leader in digital marketing. As Silver Lake's largestinvestment in a Chinese company to date,\nAllyes is a strong and complementaryaddition to our global portfolio of leading technology and\ntechnology-enabledbusinesses. \" Latham & Watkins and FangDa Law Partners are advising Allyes on\nthistransaction. Kirkland & Ellis, Jun He Law Offices and PricewaterhouseCoopers areadvising Silver\nLake on this transaction. About Allyes Established in 1998, Allyes is the largest online media\nservice providerin China that offers a complete suite of digital marketing solutions and apioneer in\nChinese Internet advertising technology. Allyes provides itscustomers with comprehensive and\nprofessional services through Allyes'proprietary suite, AdForward, a software application which has\nbeenindependently certified and registered in China. AdForward products includeonline ad-publishing,\ncreative production, tracking, targeting and performanceanalysis and have been used by hundreds of\ncommercial websites and ad agencies,maintaining a leading position in the Internet advertising\napplication field.Allyes' mission is to become the worldwide industry leader in helping webmedia\nowners materialize and increase their online marketing value andimproving efficiency and\neffectiveness of advertisers' media spending.Headquartered in Shanghai, China, Allyes has branch\noffices in Beijing,Shenzhen, Guangzhou and Chengdu. For more information, please visit\nhttp://www.allyes.com . About Silver Lake Silver Lake is the global leader in private investments in\ntechnology andtechnology-enabled industries. Silver Lake invests with the strategic andoperational\ninsights of an experienced industry participant. The firm has over90 investment professionals\nlocated in New York, Menlo Park, San Francisco,London, Hong Kong and Tokyo and manages over $14\nbillion across large cap andmiddle market private investment strategies as well as a credit\ninvestmentstrategy. Its portfolio includes or has included technology industry leaderssuch as\nAmeritrade, Avago, Avaya, Business Objects, Flextronics, Gartner,Gerson Lehrman Group, Instinet,\nIntelsat, Interactive Data Corporation, IPCSystems, MCI, Mercury Payment Systems, the NASDAQ OMX\nGroup, NetScout, NXP,Sabre, Seagate Technology, Serena Software, Skype, SunGard Data Systems,Thomson\nand UGS. For more information, please visit http://www.silverlake.com . SOURCE Silver Lake and\nAllyes RELATED LINKS\n\nLearn more by requesting a demo\n\n### Allyes Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\n* When was Allyes founded?\n\nAllyes was founded in 1998.\n* Where is Allyes's headquarters?\n\nAllyes's headquarters is located at 1018 Chang Ning Road , Shanghai.\n* What is Allyes's latest funding round?\n\nAllyes's latest funding round is Private Equity.\n* Who are the investors of Allyes?\n\nInvestors of Allyes include Vision Knight Capital, Silver Lake and Oak Investment Partners.\n\nLoading...\n\nLoading...\n\n[CB Insights]\n498 Seventh Avenue 12th floor\nNew York, NY 10018[info@cbinsights.com][64]\n[212 292 3148][65]\n\nFollow Us On Social\n\n[[Twitter]][66][[Linkedin]][67][[Facebook]][68]\n\n### [About][69]\n* [About Us][70]\n* [Upcoming Webinars][71]\n* [Contact Us][72]\n\n### [How We Help][73]\n* [Understand Tech Markets][74]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][75]\n* [Create Tech Strategy][76]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors][77]\n* [Digital Transformation][78]\n\n### [What We Offer][79]\n* [Platform][80]\n* [Data][81]\n* [Research Overview][82]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][83]\n* [Pricing][84]\n\n### [Popular Research][85]\n* [AI 100][86]\n* [Fintech 100][87]\n* [Digital Health 50][88]\n* [Tech Trends 2024][89]\n* [Generative AI Predictions][90]\n* [Unicorn Tracker][91]\n* [VC Glossary][92]\n* [Company List Applications][93]\n* [CB Insights Website Terms of Use][94]\n* [Privacy Policy][95]\n* [Do Not Sell My Info][96]\n* [Partnership][97]\n\nCopyright 2026 CB Information Services, Inc. All rights reserved.\n\nCBI websites generally use certain cookies to enable better interactions with our sites and\nservices. Use of these cookies, which may be stored on your device, permits us to improve and\ncustomize your experience. You can read more about your cookie choices at [our privacy policy][98].\nBy continuing to use this site you are consenting to these choices.\n\nI ACCEPT\nI DO NOT ACCEPT\n\n[1]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/technology-vendors/\n[2]: https://www.cbinsights.com/research/\n[3]: https://www.cbinsights.com/newsletter/\n[4]: https://www.cbinsights.com/media-support/\n[5]: https://www.cbinsights.com/login\n[6]: https://www.cbinsights.com\n[7]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-strategy/\n[8]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-venture-capital/\n[9]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/venture-capital/\n[10]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/head-of-it/\n[11]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-innovation/\n[12]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-vcs-use-cb-insights/\n[13]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/consumer/\n[14]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/tech/\n[15]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/insurance/\n[16]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/healthcare/\n[17]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/industrials/\n[18]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/financial-services/\n[19]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/professional-services/\n[20]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/professional-services/\n[21]: https://www.cbinsights.com/resources/case-studies/\n[22]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/understand-tech-markets/\n[23]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/competitor-strategy/\n[24]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/create-tech-strategy/\n[25]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/find-tech-vendors/\n[26]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/digital-transformation/\n[27]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/platform/\n[28]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/technology-search-engine/\n[29]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/market-analytics-and-visualizations/\n[30]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/team-management-and-collaboration/\n[31]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/platform/\n[32]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/data/\n[33]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/research/\n[34]: https://www.cbinsights.com/learn/personal-briefing/\n[35]: https://www.cbinsights.com/learn/instant-insights/\n[36]: https://www.cbinsights.com/learn/public-company-data/\n[37]: https://www.cbinsights.com/learn/buyer-interviews\n[38]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/technology-vendors//\n[39]