            "text": "* [Technology Vendors][1]\n* [Recent Research][2]\n* [Newsletter][3]\n* [Media Support][4]\n* [Login][5]\n[[CB Insights]][6]\n* Who We Serve\n* Function\n* [Corporate Strategy][7]\n* [Corporate Venture Capital][8]\n* [Venture Capital][9]\n* [IT][10]\n* [Corporate Innovation][11]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### How VCs Use CB Insights\n\n[Go to the video gallery \u2192][12]\n* Industries\n* [Consumer & Retail][13]\n* [Tech][14]\n* [Insurance][15]\n* [Healthcare][16]\n* [Industrials][17]\n* [Financial Services][18]\n* [Professional Services][19]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Professional Services\n\n[Learn More\u2192][20]\n* [Success Stories][21]\n* How We Help\n* [Understand Tech Markets][22]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][23]\n* [Determine Tech Strategy][24]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors & Partners][25]\n* [Turbocharge Digital Transformation][26]\n* What We Offer\n* Platform\n* [Overview][27]\n* [Technology Search Engine][28]\n* [Market Analytics and Visualizations][29]\n* [Team Management and Collaboration][30]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Platform Overview\n\n[Learn More\u2192][31]\n* [Data][32]\n* [Research][33]\n* [Personal Briefing][34]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][35]\n* [Public Equity Data][36]\n* [Buyer Interview Transcripts][37]\n* [Analyst Briefings][38]\n* [API & Data Feeds][39]\n* Integrations\n* [Overview][40]\n* [Chrome and Edge][41]\n* [Salesforce][42]\n* [Affinity][43]\n* [Microsoft Excel][44]\n* [Google Sheets][45]\n* [Microsoft Teams][46]\n* [Slack][47]\n* [Google Slides][48]\n* [App Partners][49]\n* [Browser Extension][50]\n* [Pricing][51]\n* About Us\n* [Overview][52]\n* Our teams\n* [Business Development][53]\n* [Engineering][54]\n* [Operations][55]\n* [Product][56]\n* [See all \u2192][57]\n* [Open Jobs][58]\n\nLoading...\n\n[Xanthus Pharmaceuticals company logo]\n\n# Xanthus Pharmaceuticals\n\nUnclaimed\n[xanthus.com][59]\n* [Overview & Products][60]\n* [Financials][61]\n* [People][62]\n* [Alternatives & Competitors][63]\n\n## Founded Year\n\n2001\n\n## Stage\n\nAcquired | Acquired\n\n## Total Raised\n\n$62.8M\n\n## Valuation\n\n$0000 View\n\n## About Xanthus Pharmaceuticals\n\nXanthus Pharmaceuticals, Inc. is developing a portfolio of novel, clinical-stage, small-molecule\ntherapeutic candidates through a management team whose accomplished track record encompasses all\naspects of drug development, from discovery through regulatory approval and commercialisation. The\nCompany is applying its expertise to advance its current pipeline to address significant unmet\nmedical need in oncology and autoimmune diseases. Xanthus is headquartered in Cambridge,\nMassachusetts with an additional facility in Montreal, Quebec.\n\n## Headquarters Location\n\n300 Technology Square\n\nCambridge, Massachusetts, 02139,\n\nUnited States\n\n617-225-0522\n\nLoading...\n\nLoading...\n\n### Xanthus Pharmaceuticals Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\n* When was Xanthus Pharmaceuticals founded?\n\nXanthus Pharmaceuticals was founded in 2001.\n* Where is Xanthus Pharmaceuticals's headquarters?\n\nXanthus Pharmaceuticals's headquarters is located at 300 Technology Square, Cambridge.\n* What is Xanthus Pharmaceuticals's latest funding round?\n\nXanthus Pharmaceuticals's latest funding round is Acquired.\n* How much did Xanthus Pharmaceuticals raise?\n\nXanthus Pharmaceuticals raised a total of $62.8M.\n* Who are the investors of Xanthus Pharmaceuticals?\n\nInvestors of Xanthus Pharmaceuticals include Sarossa Capital, Oxford Bioscience Partners, Yasuda\nEnterprise Development, abrdn, CDIB Capital Group and 9 more.\n* Who are Xanthus Pharmaceuticals's competitors?\n\nCompetitors of Xanthus Pharmaceuticals include Astria Therapeutics, Evotec, Constellation\nPharmaceuticals, Kiadis Pharma, Actinobac Biomed and 7 more.\n\nLoading...\n\n## Compare Xanthus Pharmaceuticals to Competitors\n\n[United Biomedical][64]\n\nUnited Biomedical is a biopharmaceutical organization that develops diagnostics and\nimmunotherapeutics for health conditions. The company develops vaccines, proteins, antibodies,\nspecialty injectables, and small molecules aimed at preventing and treating diseases in neurology,\nimmunology, and infectious diseases for human and animal health. United Biomedical serves the\nbiopharmaceutical industry with contract manufacturing services. It was founded in 1985 and is based\nin Hauppauge, New York.\n\n[AnaMar Medical Logo]\n[AnaMar Medical][65]\n\nAnaMar Medical is a biotechnology company focused on developing a medicine for the treatment of\nfibrotic diseases. Their main product, AM1476, is a 5-HT2B receptor antagonist intended to address\norgan scarring. The company is advancing AM1476 towards Phase II clinical trials, following\npreclinical and Phase I studies. It was founded in 1998 and is based in Sweden.\n\n[MuriGen][66]\n\nMuriGen provides a portfolio of novel drugs. The company's biology-based technology involves a\nfunctional analysis of an entire mammalian genome to locate novel therapeutic entry points to treat\ndisease. It primarily serves the healthcare sector. The company was founded in 2003 and is based in\nBundoora, Australia.\n\n[Intarcia Therapeutics Logo]\n[Intarcia Therapeutics][67]\n\nIntarcia Therapeutics is a biotechnology company that focuses on chronic disease management. The\ncompany's offerings include treatment and prevention strategies for chronic diseases. Intarcia\nTherapeutics serves the healthcare and medical research sectors. It was founded in 1997 and is based\nin Boston, Massachusetts.\n\n[Ancora Pharmaceuticals][68]\n\nAncora Pharmaceuticals is a company focused on glycobiology within the pharmaceutical industry. The\ncompany's main offerings include the development of synthetic carbohydrates, which are used in the\ncreation of vaccines. It was founded in 2001 and is based in Woburn, Massachusetts.\n\n[SBIO Pte][69]\n\nSBIO is focused on the discovery and development of small molecule oncology drugs.\n\nLoading...\n\n[CB Insights]\n498 Seventh Avenue 12th floor\nNew York, NY 10018[info@cbinsights.com][70]\n[212 292 3148][71]\n\nFollow Us On Social\n\n[[Twitter]][72][[Linkedin]][73][[Facebook]][74]\n\n### [About][75]\n* [About Us][76]\n* [Upcoming Webinars][77]\n* [Contact Us][78]\n\n### [How We Help][79]\n* [Understand Tech Markets][80]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][81]\n* [Create Tech Strategy][82]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors][83]\n* [Digital Transformation][84]\n\n### [What We Offer][85]\n* [Platform][86]\n* [Data][87]\n* [Research Overview][88]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][89]\n* [Pricing][90]\n\n### [Popular Research][91]\n* [AI 100][92]\n* [Fintech 100][93]\n* [Digital Health 50][94]\n* [Tech Trends 2024][95]\n* [Generative AI Predictions][96]\n* [Unicorn Tracker][97]\n* [VC Glossary][98]\n* [Company List Applications][99]\n* [CB Insights Website Terms of Use][100]\n* [Privacy Policy][101]\n* [Do Not Sell My Info][102]\n* [Partnership][103]\n\nCopyright 2026 CB Information Services, Inc. All rights reserved.\n\nCBI websites generally use certain cookies to enable better interactions with our sites and\nservices. Use of these cookies, which may be stored on your device, permits us to improve and\ncustomize your experience. You can read more about your cookie choices at [our privacy policy][104].\nBy continuing to use this site you are consenting to these choices.\n\nI ACCEPT\nI DO NOT ACCEPT\n\n[1]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/technology-vendors/\n[2]: https://www.cbinsights.com/research/\n[3]: https://www.cbinsights.com/newsletter/\n[4]: https://www.cbinsights.com/media-support/\n[5]: https://www.cbinsights.com/login\n[6]: https://www.cbinsights.com\n[7]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-strategy/\n[8]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-venture-capital/\n[9]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/venture-capital/\n[10]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/head-of-it/\n[11]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/func