      "company_summary": "JustWatch is a comprehensive streaming guide that helps users discover where to watch movies, TV shows, and sports across various platforms. By offering personalized recommendations and a unified search feature, it simplifies the streaming experience, allowing users to create a consolidated watchlist that spans multiple services. Targeting entertainment enthusiasts, JustWatch aims to enhance the way viewers access and enjoy their favorite content.",
      "operational_presence": "Markets mentioned on website: India, UK",
      "data_sources": "discovery=bing_html | enrichment=smart_crawl | fetch=ddgs_extract_fallback | page=https://justwatch.com/",
      "_crawl": {
