        "crawl_text": "[\n[JustWatch] PRO\n][1]\n[Home][2][New][3][Popular][4][ Lists ][5][Sports][6][guide][7]\nSign In\n\n# Your streaming guide for movies, TV shows & sports\n\nFind where to stream new, popular & upcoming entertainment with JustWatch.\n\nDiscover Movies & TV shows\nFeatures\n\nStreaming services on JustWatch\n\n[[Netflix]][8][[Amazon Prime Video]][9][[Apple TV]][10][[JioHotstar]][11][[Apple TV\nStore]][12][[Crunchyroll]][13][[Zee5]][14][[MLS on Apple TV]][15][[MUBI]][16][[Sony\nLiv]][17][[GuideDoc]][18][[Netflix Kids]][19][[Sun Nxt]][20][ See all ][21]\n[[Netflix]][22][[Amazon Prime Video]][23][[Apple TV]][24][[JioHotstar]][25][ See all ][26]\n[global-hero]\n[\n\nAll in one place\n\n## The complete streaming guide\n\nGet personal recommendations for all your favorite streaming services. We\u2019ll show you where to watch\nmovies, TV shows & sports.\n\n][27]\n\nOne search\n\n## Every platform in one search\n\nNever go back-and-forth between streaming services again to see if a movie or TV show is available.\nWe\u2019ve got you covered with one search.\n\n[\n\nOne watchlist\n\n## Combine all your watchlists\n\nCreate a single watchlist with every movie and TV show you want to watch \u2013 covering every streaming\nservice in one list across all your devices.\n\n][28]\n\n## Browse new, popular and upcoming movies & TV shows\n\n## Top 10 movies this week\n\nCheck out this week\u2019s most popular movies and find out where to watch them.\n\n[See more][29]\n\n## Top 10 movies this week\n\n1\n[[Euphoria]][30]\n2\n[[Voicemails for Isabelle]][31]\n3\n[[The Sheep Detectives]][32]\n4\n[[Now & Later]][33]\n5\n[[Welcome to the Jungle]][34]\n6\n[[Blast]][35]\n7\n[[365 dni]][36]\n8\n[[Bugso]][37]\n9\n[[Sapio]][38]\n10\n[[Obsession]][39]\n\n## Top 10 TV shows this week\n\nExplore this week\u2019s most popular TV shows and find out where to stream them.\n\n[See more][40]\n\n## Top 10 TV shows this week\n\n1\n[[House of the Dragon]][41]\n2\n[[Widow's Bay]][42]\n3\