's Bay\n\n[IMDB]\n8.3 (33k)\n\nA skeptical mayor leads the superstitious residents of a cursed New England island.\n\n[\nMore info\n][57]\n[Widow's Bay]\n\n## Free Movies & Shows to Watch\n\nFind fan-favorite movies & shows you can watch for free right now\n\n[See more][58]\n\n## Free Movies & Shows to Watch\n\n[[H\u00e4xan]][59]\n[[Petticoat Junction]][60]\n[[Carmen & Lola]][61]\n[[Barefoot]][62]\n[[House of the Dragon]][63]\n[[Gullak]][64]\n[[Game of Thrones]][65]\n[[A Knight of the Seven Kingdoms]][66]\n[[Jujutsu Kaisen]][67]\n[[Classroom of the Elite]][68]\n\n## New movies\n\nTake a look at every new movie that recently became available on streaming services.\n\n[See all new movies][69][See more][70]\n\n## New movies\n\n[[Kantara]][71]\n[[Host]][72]\n[[Hare Rama Hare Krishna]][73]\n[[Busco novia]][74]\n[[UglyDolls]][75]\n[[EVANGELION: DEATH (TRUE)\u00b2]][76]\n[[Trevor Noah: I Wish You Would]][77]\n[[Shandar]][78]\n\n## Top 10 Comedy movies & TV shows\n\nExplore this week\u2019s most popular Comedy movies & TV shows streaming right now.\n\n[See more][79]\n\n## Top 10 Comedy movies & TV shows\n\n1\n[[Widow's Bay]][80]\n2\n[[India's Got Latent]][81]\n3\n[[Gram Chikitsalay]][82]\n4\n[[Mastram]][83]\n5\n[[Voicemails for Isabelle]][84]\n6\n[[The Sheep Detectives]][85]\n7\n[[Avatar the Last Airbender]][86]\n8\n[[Welcome to the Jungle]][87]\n9\n[[Resort]][88]\n10\n[[Teach You a Lesson]][89]\n\n## Top 10 Drama movies & TV shows\n\nExplore this week\u2019s most popular Drama movies & TV shows streaming right now.\n\n[See more][90]\n\n## Top 10 Drama movies & TV shows\n\n1\n[[House of the Dragon]][91]\n2\n[[Widow's Bay]][92]\n3\n[[Gram Chikitsalay]][93]\n4\n[[Mastram]][94]\n5\n[[FROM]][95]\n6\n[[Euphoria]][96]\n7\n[[Euphoria]][97]\n8\n[[Off Campus]][98]\n9\n[[Voicemails for Isabelle]][99]\n10\n[[Avatar the Last Airbender]][100]\n\n## Top 10 Horror movies & TV shows\n\nExplore this week\u2019s most popular Horror movies & TV shows streaming right now.\n\n[See more][101]\n\n## Top 10 Horror movies & TV shows\n\n1\n[[Widow's Bay]][102]\n2\n[[FROM]][103]\n3\n[[Obsession]][104]\n4\n[[Gantz]][105]\n5\n[[Nightmares & Shadows]][106]\n6\n[[A Cure for Wellness]][107]\n7\n[[Sin]][108]\n8\n[[Shingeki no Kyojin]][109]\n9\n[[Bhooth Bangla]][110]\n10\n[[Succubus]][111]\n\n## New TV Shows\n\n## FROM\n\nUnravel the mystery of a nightmarish town in middle America that traps all those who enter. As the\nunwilling residents fight to keep a sense of normalcy and search for a way out, they must also\nsurvive the threats of the surrounding forest \u2013 including the terrifying creatures that come out\nwhen the sun goes down.\n\n[\nMore info\n][112]\n[FROM]\n\n## Welcome to Wrexham\n\nDocumentary series tracking the dreams and worries of Wrexham, a working-class town in North Wales,\nUK, as two Hollywood stars (Rob McElhenney and Ryan Reynolds) take ownership of the town\u2019s historic\nyet struggling football club.\n\n[\nMore info\n][113]\n[Welcome to Wrexham]\n\n## New TV Shows\n\nTake a look at every new TV show that recently became available on streaming services.\n\n[See all new TV shows][114][See more][115]\n\n## New TV Shows\n\n[[undefined - Season undefined]][116]\n[[undefined - Season undefined]][117]\n[[undefined - Season undefined]][118]\n[[undefined - Season undefined]][119]\n[[undefined - Season undefined]][120]\n[[undefined - Season undefined]][121]\n[[undefined - Season undefined]][122]\n[[undefined - Season undefined]][123]\n[[undefined - Season undefined]][124]\n[[undefined - Season undefined]][125]\n[[undefined - Season undefined]][126]\n[[undefined - Season undefined]][127]\n[[undefined - Season undefined]][128]\n[[undefined - Season undefined]][129]\n[[undefined - Season undefined]][130]\n[[undefined - Season undefined]][131]\n[[undefined - Season undefined]][132]\n[[undefined - Season undefined]][133]\n[[undefined - Season undefined]][134]\n[[undefined - Season undefined]][135]\n[[undefined - Season undefined]][136]\n[[undefined - Se