        "crawl_text": "Moviefone Media LLC [[Moviefone santa logo]][1]\nTrending\n['Shrek 5' Teaser Trailer][2]\n['Supergirl' Trailer][3]\n['Masters of the Universe' Trailer][4]\n['Spider-Man: Brand New Day' Trailer][5]\n[Movies][6][TV Shows][7][Streaming][8][In Theaters][9][Coming Soon][10][Movie Charts][11][TV Show\nCharts][12][Showtimes][13][Highlights][14][News][15][Celebrities][16][What to Watch][17][New\nTrailers][18][Movie Theaters][19][Movie Reviews][20][Videos][21][Moviefone TV][22][Made In\nHollywood][23]\n[[The Sheep Detectives]The Sheep Detectives][24][[Project Hail Mary]Project Hail Mary][25][[Good\nLuck, Have Fun, Don't Die]Good Luck, Have Fun, Don't Die][26][[undertone]undertone][27][[Avatar:\nFire and Ash]Avatar: Fire and Ash][28][[Widow's Bay]Widow's Bay][29][[Cape Fear]Cape Fear][30][[The\nBear]The Bear][31][[I Will Find You]I Will Find You][32][[FROM]FROM][33]\n[Highlights][34]\n[Mortal Kombat II - Martyn Ford and Joe Taslim Exclusive Interviews ]\nMortal Kombat II\n[The Devil Wears Prada 2 - Grab Your Friends Clip]\nThe Devil Wears Prada 2\n[Ice Age: Boiling Point - Official Teaser]\nIce Age: Boiling Point\n[By Any Means - Official Poster]\nBy Any Means\n[The Devil Wears Prada 2 - He Hired Me Last Night Clip]\nThe Devil Wears Prada 2\n[Whalefall - Austin Abrams as Jay Gardiner with Diving Suit]\nWhalefall\n[Imperfect Women - Kerry Washington & Leslie Odom Jr. Exclusive Interview]\nImperfect Women\n[House of the Dragon Season 3 - Steve Toussaint as Lord Corlys Velaryon Character Poster]\nHouse of the Dragon\n[The Dinosaurs Season 1 - Ankylosaurus vs. T-Rex Clip]\nThe Dinosaurs\n[Stranger Things - David Harbour at the Exclusive FYSEE Event]\nStranger Things\n[Margo's Got Money Troubles Season 1 - Unforgettable Nonverbal Acting Clip]\nMargo's Got Money Troubles\n[The Furious - Xie Miao at the LA Special Screening]\nThe Furious\n[Euphoria Season 3 - Saddle Up Clip]\nEuphoria\n[The Invite - Official Poster]\nThe Invite\n\n# Hello, And Welcome To Moviefone\n\n## About Us\n\n[Moviefone][35] celebrates the magic of movies with millions of monthly visitors online, mobile &\nsocial, while providing [showtimes][36], tickets and [what-to-watch][37] on any screen. The\nnostalgic movie brand which was the preeminent go-to website and app for movie editorial and theater\nshowtimes in the early days of the internet, has expanded its reach with original content across\nbroadcast TV ([Made In Hollywood][38] & [Moviefone TV][39]), digital media ([Moviefone's\nUnscripted][40]), streaming via its 24/7 Live TV network (Made In Hollywood powered by Moviefone\navailable on The Roku Channel), and now theater screens (Screenvision's Front + Center). The\nintegration of these media assets offers a 360\u00b0 solution for advertising, studio, broadcast, and\nstreaming partners on multiple platforms. Moviefone shares the secrets of filmmaking with movie fans\neverywhere, from script-to-screen, on-camera and behind the scenes.\n\n## Follow Us on Social Media\n\n[Facebook][41][X][42][Instagram][43][YouTube][44][LinkedIn][45][Reddit][46][TikTok][47][Newsletter][\n48][Widgets][49]\n\n## Follow Moviefone\n\n[Facebook][50][X][51][Instagram][52][YouTube][53][LinkedIn][54][Reddit][55][TikTok][56][Newsletter][\n57][Widgets][58]\n\n## [Latest Trailers][59]\n\n['Motor City' Trailer]1:59\n'Motor City' Trailer\n][60]\n['23000 Lives' Trailer]1:53\n'23000 Lives' Trailer\n][61]\n['The Weight' Trailer]2:16\n'The Weight' Trailer\n][62]\n['Wet Hot American Summer' 25th Anniversary Release Trailer]37s\n'Wet Hot American Summer' 25th Anniversary Release Trailer\n][63]\n['Your Mother Your Mother Your Mother' Teaser]1:02\n'Your Mother Your Mother Your Mother' Teaser\n][64]\n\n## Movie and TV Reviews\n\n[[The Invite poster]][65]\nThe Invite\n][66][Movie Review][67]\n[[Supergirl poster]][68]\nSupergirl\n][69][Movie Review][70]\n[[Leviticus poster]][71]\nLeviticus\n][72][Movie Review][73]\n\n## [Top Movies][74]\n\n[[The Sheep Detectives poster]][75]\nThe Sheep D