      "company_function": "vendor",
      "company_summary": "NCERT (National Council of Educational Research and Training) is an autonomous organization established by the Government of India, dedicated to enhancing the quality of school education. It provides a range of educational materials, including free digital textbooks for classes 1 to 12 aligned with the National Curriculum Framework, and offers teacher training programs aimed at improving pedagogical skills. Targeting students, schools, and educational institutions, NCERT plays a pivotal role in shaping educational standards across the country.",
