      "key_products": "Textbooks",
      "polished_summary": "NCERT (National Council of Educational Research and Training) is an autonomous organization established by the Government of India, dedicated to enhancing the quality of school education. It provides a range of educational materials, including free digital textbooks for classes 1 to 12 aligned with the National Curriculum Framework, and offers teacher training programs aimed at improving pedagogical skills. Targeting students, schools, and educational institutions, NCERT plays a pivotal role in shaping educational standards across the country.",
      "audit_reasoning": "NCERT is focused on educational materials and teacher training, which does not align with the spectral sensor market. They do not manufacture, supply, or provide services related to spectral sensors.",
