      "polished_summary": "Corning Incorporated is a leading innovator in materials science, specializing in the development and manufacturing of highly engineered products across various sectors, including optical communications, mobile consumer electronics, and life sciences. The company is renowned for its advanced technologies, such as Corning\u00ae Gorilla\u00ae Glass and display glass, and is committed to driving sustainable growth and delivering long-term value to its stakeholders through a focus on innovation and operational excellence.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Corning Incorporated is a leading innovator in materials science and manufactures products that are relevant to the spectral sensor market, particularly in optical communications and advanced optics. Their expertise in materials and optical technologies positions them as a significant player in this field.",
