        "crawl_text": "Si-Ware Systems Cairo, Al Q\u0101hirah, Egypt Cairo, Al Q\u0101hirah, Egypt Egypt Homepage\n\nSkip to content\n\nSi-Ware Systems Homepage\n\nHome\nJobs\nPhotos\n\nCompany website\n\nSi-Ware Systems Homepage\n\nHome Jobs Photos\nCompany website\n\nSi-Ware Systems Homepage\n\nHome\n\nJobs\n\nPhotos\n\nCompany website\n\nSi-Ware Systems Homepage\n\nLooking for a great career?\nWe&#x27;re seeking top-tier contributors.\n\nABOUT US\nSi-Ware Systems is the creator of the world\u2019s smallest FT-NIR spectrometer\u2014pushing the boundaries of miniaturized sensing technology. Our founders are seasoned entrepreneurs backed by seasoned investors. Our growing team is made up of a range of enthusiastic colleagues who thrive in a fast-paced and challenging environment. Together, we\u2019re enabling customers to get instant, accurate insights wherever and whenever they need them.\nSeeking top-tier talent to join our team:\nYou will be surrounded by smart, hard-working and caring people.\nYou will work in a professional and friendly environment.\nYou will feel proud of the work you do every day.\nYou will experience a truly supportive team culture.\nYou will be part of a unique, dynamic, and cutting-edge company.\nYou will have the chance to make a difference and positively affect lives.\n\nOUR VALUES\n\nInnovation\n\nCustomer Satisfaction\n\nCommitment\n\nTeamwork\n\nInitiation &amp; Proactivity\n\nContinuous Improvement\n\nJOIN US\nCURRENT OPENINGS\n\nShow filters\n\nAll languages\n\nEnglish\n\n4 jobs\nShare\n\nAll languages\n\nEnglish\n\n4 jobs\nShare\n\nElectronics Engineering Summer Intern (3 Tracks)\nHybrid\nCairo , Al Q\u0101hirah , Egypt Sensor Systems Technology\nView job\n\nView job\n\nHardware Compliance Engineer (Part time)\nOn-site, Hybrid\nCairo , Al Q\u0101hirah , Egypt Sensor Systems Technology\nView job\n\nView job\n\nMEMS Development Engineer\nOn-site\nCairo , Al Q\u0101hirah , Egypt Optics &amp; Microsystems Technologies\nView job\n\nView job\n\nSystem Graduate Internship\nOn-site\nCairo , Al Q\u0101hirah , Egypt Sensor Systems Technology\nView job\n\nView job [Skip to content][1]\n[[Si-Ware Systems logo]Si-Ware SystemsHomepage][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* [Jobs][4]\n* [Photos][5]\n* [][6]\n* [][7]\n* [][8]\n* [Company website][9]\n[[Si-Ware Systems logo]Si-Ware SystemsHomepage][10]\n[Home][11][Jobs][12][Photos][13][][14][][15][][16]\n[Company website][17]\n[Si-Ware Systems logo]Si-Ware SystemsHomepage\n* Home\n* Jobs\n* Photos\n* Company website\n[Si-Ware Systems logo]Si-Ware SystemsHomepage\n\n# Looking for a great career?\n\n#### We're seeking top-tier contributors.\n\n## ABOUT US\n\nSi-Ware Systems is the creator of the world\u2019s smallest FT-NIR spectrometer\u2014pushing the boundaries of\nminiaturized sensing technology. Our founders are seasoned entrepreneurs backed by seasoned\ninvestors. Our growing team is made up of a range of enthusiastic colleagues who thrive in a\nfast-paced and challenging environment. Together, we\u2019re enabling customers to get instant, accurate\ninsights wherever and whenever they need them.\n\n**Seeking top-tier talent to join our team:**\n* You will be surrounded by smart, hard-working and caring people.\n* You will work in a professional and friendly environment.\n* You will feel proud of the work you do every day.\n* You will experience a truly supportive team culture.\n* You will be part of a unique, dynamic, and cutting-edge company.\n* You will have the chance to make a difference and positively affect lives.\n\n## OUR VALUES\n\n### Innovation\n\n### Customer Satisfaction\n\n### Commitment\n\n### Teamwork\n\n### Initiation & Proactivity\n\n### Continuous Improvement\n\n## JOIN US\n\n#### CURRENT OPENINGS\n\nShow filters\nAll languages\n* English\n4 jobs\nShare\nAll languages\n* English\n4 jobs\nShare\n[Electronics Engineering Summer Intern (3 Tracks)][18]\nHybrid\n* Cairo, Al Q\u0101hirah, Egypt\nSensor Systems Technology\n[View job][19]\n[View job][20]\n[Hardwar