 Technology\n[View job][22]\n[View job][23]\n[MEMS Development Engineer][24]\nOn-site\n* Cairo, Al Q\u0101hirah, Egypt\nOptics & Microsystems Technologies\n[View job][25]\n[View job][26]\n[System Graduate Internship][27]\nOn-site\n* Cairo, Al Q\u0101hirah, Egypt\nSensor Systems Technology\n[View job][28]\n[View job][29]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: /\n[3]: /#text-cfe8f405\n[4]: /#jobs-b25e0ef0\n[5]: /\n[6]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/si-ware-systems/\n[7]: https://www.facebook.com/SiWareSystems?ref=br_tf\n[8]: https://twitter.com/siwaresystems\n[9]: https://www.si-ware.com\n[10]: /\n[11]: /#text-cfe8f405\n[12]: /#jobs-b25e0ef0\n[13]: /\n[14]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/si-ware-systems/\n[15]: https://www.facebook.com/SiWareSystems?ref=br_tf\n[16]: https://twitter.com/siwaresystems\n[17]: https://www.si-ware.com\n[18]: /o/electronics-engineering-summer-intern-3-tracks\n[19]: /o/electronics-engineering-summer-intern-3-tracks\n[20]: /o/electronics-engineering-summer-intern-3-tracks\n[21]: /o/hardware-compliance-engineer-part-time\n[22]: /o/hardware-compliance-engineer-part-time\n[23]: /o/hardware-compliance-engineer-part-time\n[24]: /o/mems-development-engineer-1\n[25]: /o/mems-development-engineer-1\n[26]: /o/mems-development-engineer-1\n[27]: /o/system-graduate-internship\n[28]: /o/system-graduate-internship\n[29]: /o/system-graduate-internship"
