      "key_products": "FT-NIR Spectrometer",
      "polished_summary": "Si-Ware Systems is a pioneering company specializing in miniaturized sensing technology, renowned for creating the world\u2019s smallest FT-NIR spectrometer. This innovative product enables customers to obtain instant and accurate insights, catering to a diverse range of industries that require precise analytical capabilities. With a team of experienced entrepreneurs and enthusiastic professionals, Si-Ware Systems is committed to pushing the boundaries of sensing technology to meet the evolving needs of its clients.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Si-Ware Systems manufactures the world's smallest FT-NIR spectrometer, which is a direct product for the spectral sensor market. Their focus on miniaturized sensing technology aligns perfectly with the target market's requirements.",
