      "is_seed": false,
      "company_function": "vendor",
      "company_summary": "Geospatial World is the media and public relations division of Geospatial Media & Communications, dedicated to advancing knowledge for sustainability through geospatial technology and space infrastructure. The company offers a range of products and services, including flagship events like the Geospatial World Forum and GeoSmart India, as well as consulting services and media platforms that cater to industry professionals, policymakers, and organizations across various sectors such as government, environmental conservation, and real estate.",
      "operational_presence": "## Knowledge Sharing ## Our platform serves as a beacon for the geospatial industry, elevating innovation through diverse ## channels by spotlighting transfo...",
