            "url": "https://geospatialworld.net",
            "text": "Geospatial World: Advancing Knowledge for Sustainability\n\nGW CONSULTING\n\nGW EVENTS\n\nABOUT US\n\nVision\n\nMaking a Difference through Geospatial Knowledge and Space Infrastructure in World Economy and Society.\n\nOur Mission\n\nAdvancing Knowledge for Sustainability\n\nApproach\n\nEvangelism, Advocacy, Facilitation, and Amplification of adoption of space and geospatial technology across mainstream industries, and thereby improving Productivity, Efficiency, Transparency, and Compliance, and contributing to \u2018Sustainability of Everything\u2019 at national, regional, and global levels\n\nVision\n\nMaking a Difference through Space Infrastructure and Geospatial Knowledge in World Economy and Society\n\nOur Mission\n\nAdvancing Knowledge for Sustainability\u200b\n\nApproach\n\nEvangelism, Advocacy, Facilitation, and Amplification of adoption of space and geospatial technology across mainstream industries, and thereby improving Productivity, Efficiency, Transparency, and Compliance, and contributing to \u2018Sustainability of Everything\u2019 at national, regional, and global levels.\n\n100+\n\nTrusted Professionals\n\n50+\n\nIndustry Reports\n\n27+\n\nYears of Expertise\n\n10+\n\nAnnual Events\n\nOur Divisions\n\nEVENTS\n\nA thought leadership platform offering market directions, collaborative opportunities, business development interface amongst policy makers, users, technology providers, and mainstream leadership.\n\nProducts &amp; Services\n\nFlagship Events : Geospatial World Forum, GeoSmart India\n\nBusiness : GeoBuiz Summit\n\nPolicy : GeoGov Summit, Geospatial Artha Summit\n\nThematic : Indo-Pacific GeoIntelligence, AEC Forum\n\nDISCOVER OUR EVENTS\n\nCONSULTING\n\nA knowledge platform enhancing policies, processes, and practices of geospatial and space technologies through undertaking market research, socio-economic analysis, and consulting services.\n\nProducts &amp; Services\n\nSyndicate Reports\n\nGeospatial Resource Platform\n\nConsulting Services\n\nPolicy and Strategy Advocacy\n\nDISCOVER KNOWLEDGE HUB\n\nCOMMUNICATIONS\n\nA pre-eminent source of quality information, insights and analysis of contemporary global geospatial technology trends and business directions.\n\nProducts &amp; Services\n\nGW Prime Live\n\nGW Media Website\n\nEXPLORE GW PRIME\n\nEVENTS\n\nA thought leadership platform offering market directions, collaborative opportunities, business development interface amongst policy makers, users, technology providers, and mainstream leadership.\n\nProducts &amp; Services\n\nFlagship Events : Geospatial World Forum, GeoSmart India\n\nBusiness : GeoBuiz Summit\n\nPolicy : GeoGov Summit, Geospatial Artha Summit\n\nThematic : Indo-Pacific GeoIntelligence, AEC Forum\n\nDISCOVER OUR EVENTS\n\nCONSULTING\n\nA knowledge platform enhancing policies, processes, and practices of geospatial and space technologies through undertaking market research, socio-economic analysis, and consulting services.\n\nProducts &amp; Services\n\nSyndicate Reports\n\nGeospatial Resource Platform\n\nConsulting Services\n\nPolicy and Strategy Advocacy\n\nDISCOVER KNOWLEDGE HUB\n\nOur Partners\n\nIndustry Focus\n\nGeospatial Knowledge Infrastructure\n\nGeospatial Knowledge Infrastructure provides a blueprint to integrate digital economies, societies and citizens with geospatial approaches, data and technologies and in doing so, deliver the location-based knowledge, services and automation expected in the 4IR age.\n\nArchitecture Engineering and Construction (AEC)\n\nThe integration of geospatial and engineering solutions, including Building Information Modelling (BIM), offers a comprehensive context for the AEC industry. At Geospatial World, our team of consultants, which includes architects, engineers, and urban planners, advise leading AEC firms with market intelligence on technology maturity, digital transformation and the adoption of data-driven models. Through strategic guidance and innovative solutions, we empower the AEC industry to enhance efficiency, precision, and overall project outcomes with the use of technology.\n\nLocation and Business Intelligence\n\nLocation forms a major component of all data collected today, and with increased investment in geolocation infrastructure, it is set to be the cornerstone of Business Intelligence. Today, advanced analytics reveal rich insights that were previously unattainable in sectors such as banking, financial services and insurance, real estate, supply chain and logistics, etc. At Geospatial World, we harness our expertise with location systems and industry relationships, along with rigorous data analysis, to bring actionable intelligence to our partners. Through consulting services and events, we provide the necessary insights to help organizations leverage location data for improved decision-making and strategic planning.\n\nAutonomy and Robotics\n\nGeospatial World is at the forefront of communicating the value of the digital revolution by integrating geospatial elements into all aspects of data generation. Through our consulting services and thought leadership events, we provide insights into how vast amounts of big data, leveraged by Machine Learning algorithms, can deliver intelligent, smart solutions. These advancements drive innovation across various sectors, including mobility, targeted marketing, traffic management, and agriculture.\n\nEnvironmental, Social and Governance (ESG)\n\nESG frameworks have become essential at local, regional, national, and global levels covering a broad spectrum of issues, including environmental conservation, social equity, climate change mitigation, ethical business practices, and sustainable development. Geospatial technologies play a vital role in the ESG landscape by providing location intelligence, enhancing the accuracy and effectiveness of sustainability and social impact initiatives. Through our ESG unit, Geospatial World offers consulting services and hosts events to guide organizations in integrating geospatial solutions into their ESG strategies. We empower the development community and other stakeholders to make informed, data-driven decisions for a more sustainable and equitable future.\n\nGeospatial Knowledge Infrastructure\n\nArchitecture, Engineering and Construction\n\nLocation and Business Intelligence\n\nAutonomy and Robotics\n\nEnvironmental, Social and Governance\n\nGeospatial Knowledge Infrastructure\n\nGeospatial Knowledge Infrastructure\nGeospatial Knowledge Infrastructure provides a blueprint\nto integrate digital economies, societies and citizens\nwith geospatial approaches, data and technologies\nand in doing so, deliver the location-based knowledge,\nservices and automation expected in the 4IR age.\n\nArchitecture, Engineering and Construction\n\nArchitecture Engineering and Construction (AEC)\nThe integration of geospatial and engineering solutions, including Building Information Modelling (BIM), offers a comprehensive context for the AEC industry. At Geospatial World, our team of consultants, which includes architects, engineers, and urban planners, advise leading AEC firms with market intelligence on technology maturity, digital transformation and the adoption of data-driven models. Through strategic guidance and innovative solutions, we empower the AEC industry to enhance efficiency, precision, and overall project outcomes with the use of technology.\n\nLocation and Business Intelligence\n\nLocation and Business Intelligence\nLocation forms a major component of all data collected today, and with increased investment in geolocation infrastructure, it is set to be the cornerstone of Business Intelligence. Today, advanced analytics reveal rich insights that were previously unattainable in sectors such as banking, financial services and insurance, real estate, supply chain and logistics, etc. At Geospatial World, we harness our expertise with location systems and industry relationships, along with rigorous data analysis, to bring actionable intelligence to our partners. Through consulting services and events, we provide the necessary insights to help organizations leverage location data for improved decision-making and strategic planning.\n\nAutonomy and Robotics\n\nAutonomy and Robotics\nGeospatial World is at the forefront of communicating the value of the digital revolution by integrating geospatial elements into all aspects of data generation. Through our consulting services and thought leadership events, we provide insights into how vast amounts of big data, leveraged by Machine Learning algorithms, can deliver intelligent, smart solutions. These advancements drive innovation across various sectors, including mobility, targeted marketing, traffic management, and agriculture.\n\nEnvironmental, Social and Governance\n\nEnvironmental, Social and Governance (ESG)\nESG frameworks have become essential at local, regional, national, and global levels covering a broad spectrum of issues, including environmental conservation, social equity, climate change mitigation, ethical business practices, and sustainable development. Geospatial technologies play a vital role in the ESG landscape by providing location intelligence, enhancing the accuracy and effectiveness of sustainability and social impact initiatives. Through our ESG unit, Geospatial World offers consulting services and hosts events to guide organizations in integrating geospatial solutions into their ESG strategies. We empower the development community and other stakeholders to make informed, data-driven decisions for a more sustainable and equitable future.\n\nOur Impact\n\nGeospatial World is a FORCE MULTIPLIER in advancing geospatial knowledge for the sustainability of everything through its events, consulting, and communications divisions. With holistic offerings, our impact speaks for itself.\n\nKnowledge Sharing\n\nOur platform serves as a beacon for the geospatial industry, elevating innovation through diverse channels by spotlighting transformative advancements via conferences, webinars, market research reports, and interviews, thereby catalysing progress and unlocking new growth opportunities across the sector.\n\nStrategic Collaborations\n\nWe engineer high-impact networking ecosystems where visionary leaders connect to form game-changing collaborations, fostering strategic alliances and partnerships through curated opportunities that propel the geospatial industry toward sustained innovation and growth.\n\nMarket Intelligence for Competitive Edge\n\nWe empower industry leaders to navigate the evolving geospatial landscape by providing deep, actionable insights, to drive the adoption of next-generation technologies and ensure a cutting-edge advantage in an increasingly competitive environment.\n\nInfluential Policy Advocacy\n\nWe shape the future of geospatial technologies by proactively advocating evidence-driven policies that integrate space and geospatial advancements into national and international frameworks, driving impactful policy changes and championing strategic global industry growth.\n\nBusiness Foresight and Market Development\n\nOur forward-looking analysis decodes the geospatial sector's potential, guiding informed investment and strategic decisions, ensuring sustainable growth and market leadership.\n\nGlobal Community Building\n\nBy initiating critical dialogues and sharing cutting-edge developments, we underscore the indispensable role of geospatial technology in modern life and cultivate a thriving global geospatial community, connecting thought leaders, innovators, and stakeholders across the globe.\n\nHOW CAN WE HELP YOU MAP YOUR WAY TO SUCCESS\n\nLET US KNOW!\n\nAbout Us\n\nOur People\n\nDownload Media Kit\n\nDownload Logo Suite\n\nPress\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nContact Us\n\nFacebook-f\n\nTwitter\n\nYoutube\n\nLinkedin\n\nInstagram\n\n\u00a9 Geospatial Media and Communications. All Rights Reserved.\u200b"
