          {
            "url": "https://www.geospatialworld.net/about/people.html",
            "text": "# One Team\n\nThe Geospatial World family includes a bouquet of dedicated professionals from different\ndisciplines. From domain experts, editors, researchers to visualizers, we have a diverse team that\nbrings in immense value to the organization. We appreciate and honour the contributions of each and\nevery person associated with Geospatial World and endeavor to build an atmosphere of happiness and\ngrowth. Here\u2019s what we look like\u2026\n\n#### Arup Dasgupta\n\n#### Akanksha Tyagi\n\n#### Anshu Garg\n\n#### Ankur Kumar\n\nSearch Engine Optimizer Analyst\n\n#### Ankur Vyas\n\n#### Archita Shaktawat\n\nResearch Associate\n\n#### Abhishek Verma\n\n#### Ananya Negi\n\n#### Amit Roshan\n\n#### Akaash S\n\n#### Bhagwati Negi\n\n#### Braj Mohan\n\n#### Brittany Donald\n\n#### Dr Rajeshree Dutta Kumar\n\n#### Gaurav Kaushik\n\n#### Himanshu Gupta\n\n#### Harmeet Singh\n\n#### Ishant Sintoria\n\n#### Kamal Saini\n\n#### Kajal\n\n#### Manoj Kumar\n\n#### Maitreyee Chauhan\n\n#### Mukesh Sharma\n\n#### Namita Rawat\n\n#### Navneet Kaushik\n\n#### Neeraj Budhari\n\n#### Palak Chaurasia\n\n#### Pradeep Singh\n\n#### Piyush Pandey\n\n#### Prince Mittal\n\n#### Ravneet Kaur\n\n#### Rahul Shankaran\n\n#### Subhash Kumar\n\n#### Samarth Hans\n\n#### Sofia Lahan\n\n#### Saloni Jain\n\n#### Sachin Awana\n\n#### Shreya Rawat\n\n#### Shweta Singh\n\n#### Swetha Rao\n\n#### Syed Raza\n\n#### Sonal Kumar\n\n#### Sanchita Biswas\n\n#### Tarun Kumar\n\n#### Titas Roy\n\n#### Vishnu Pratap Singh\n\n#### Vijay Kumar Singh\n\n#### Vivek Anand\n\n#### Yatindar Mohan Srivastava\n\nSr. Manager Finance\n\n#### Yash Agarwal\n\nExecutive- Event Operations\n\n#### Yugansh Agrawal\n\n#### Devendra\n\n#### Gambheer Singh\n\nAdministrative Support\n\n#### Ganesh Singh\n\nDriver\n\n#### Jhamman Singh\n\nSupport Staff\n\n#### Kishan Pal\n\nElectrician\n\n#### Kundan Singh\n\nDriver\n\n#### Narendra\n\n#### Nasir Sekh\n\nAdministrative Support\n\n#### Rohit Kumar\n\n#### Sonu Kumar\n\nAdministration Support\n\n## Consulting Editor\n\n#### Mark Reichardt\n\nSenior Consultant- Geospatial Policy and Technology\n\n## Executive Management\n\n**Sanjay Kumar**\n\nFounder & CEO\n\n**Lt Gen AKS Chandele (Retd)**\n\nPresident- Defence, Internal & Public Safety\n\n**Annu Negi**\n\nSr. Vice President - GW Events\n\n**Ananya Narain**\n\nVP-Commercial Consulting\n\n[Jon Gustafson]\n**Jon Gustafson**\n\nVice President - Americas\n\n[Bert Klaassens]\n**Bert Klaassens**\n\nVice President - Europe\n\n[Vaishali Dixit]\n**Vaishali Dixit**\n\nRegional Director - Americas\n\n[Shipra Garg]\n**Shipra Garg**\n\nChief Financial officer\n\n## Life @ Geospatial World\n\n## Our Openings\n\nWe are a dynamic knowledge centric organisation with a distinctly human approach. Our people reflect\nthis ethos, and are passionate about technology and the future, and their role in sustainable human\ndevelopment. Whether you are a research analyst, consultant, business developer, journalist, or an\noperations expert, we probably have a place for you in our family. You may send us your resum\u00e9 along\nwith a cover letter to [[email protected]][1] or apply using the link given below.\n\n### SENIOR\n### ANALYST\n\n**Position Available** [Apply][2]\n\n### REGIONAL SALES\n### MANAGER\n\n**Position Available** [Apply][3]\n\n### SOCIAL MEDIA\n### MANAGER\n\n**Position Available** [Apply][4]\n\n[1]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#8ee6fccee9ebe1fdfeeffae7efe2f9e1fce2eaa0e0ebfa\n[2]: careers.html\n[3]: careers.html\n[4]: careers.html"
          },
          {
            "url": "https://geospatialworld.net/about-us",
            "text": "[ GW CONSULTING ][1]\n[ GW EVENTS ][2]\n[ GW MEDIA ][3]\n[ ABOUT US ][4]\nSearch\n[ Login ][5]\n[ Logout ][6]\n[ My Profile ][7]\n[ Subscribe/Trial ][8]\n* [Prime Stories][9]\n* [Special Features][10]\n* [Technology & Innovation][11]\n* [Business & Industry Trends][12]\n* [India][13]\n* [Interview][14]\n* [Opinion][15]\n* [Case Study][16]\n* [AEC][17]\n* [Business Intelligence][18]\n* [National Mapping][19]\n* [Sustainable Development][20]\n* [Agriculture][21]\n* [Defense & Security][22]\n* [Video][23]\n* [Podcast][24]\n* [Prime Stories][25]\n* [Special Features][26]\n* [Technology & Innovation][27]\n* [Business & Industry Trends][28]\n* [India][29]\n* [Interview][30]\n* [Opinion][31]\n* [Case Study][32]\n* [AEC][33]\n* [Business Intelligence][34]\n* [National Mapping][35]\n* [Sustainable Development][36]\n* [Agriculture][37]\n* [Defense & Security][38]\n* [Video][39]\n* [Podcast][40]\n* [GIS][41]\n* [GNSS][42]\n* [EOS][43]\n* [LiDAR][44]\n* [Location & BI][45]\n* [AEC][46]\n* [Autonomous][47]\n* [Sustainable Development][48]\n* [More][49]\n* [News][50]\n* [Articles][51]\n* [Blogs][52]\n* [Hall of Fame][53]\n* [Videos][54]\n* [Events][55]\n* [Newsletter][56]\n* [GIS][57]\n* [GNSS][58]\n* [EOS][59]\n* [LiDAR][60]\n* [Location & BI][61]\n* [AEC][62]\n* [Autonomous][63]\n* [Sustainable Development][64]\n* [More][65]\n* [News][66]\n* [Articles][67]\n* [Blogs][68]\n* [Hall of Fame][69]\n* [Videos][70]\n* [Events][71]\n* [Newsletter][72]\n[Home][73] About Us\n\n# About Us\n\n**Who we are?**\n\nGeospatial World is the media and public relations arm of [Geospatial Media & Communications][74].\n\nOur offerings through multiple channels \u2014 online, video, print magazine, social media, and custom\ncontent creation and marketingstrategies \u2014 bring out the latest on technology trends and analysis,\nviews of experts and advocacy on policy issues. Expert authors, guest contributors from across the\nspectrum and an advisory board of top thought leaders give us an exceptional grip on the industry.\n\n**[www.geospatialworld.net][75]**\n\nWith an average of 135,000+ visitors per month, [www.geospatialworld.net][76] is easily the number\none media platform in geospatial domain; and is a reliable source of information for professionals\nin 150+ countries. The website, which integrates text, graphics and video elements, is an\ninteractive medium for geospatial industry stakeholders to connect through several innovative\nfeatures, including news, videos, guest blogs, case studies, articles, interviews, business listings\nand events.\n\n**220,000+ Page views per month**\n**135,000+ Visitors per month**\n**150,000+ Sessions per month**\n\n**[Geospatial World magazine][77]**\n\nConsidered as the voice of the global geospatial industry, the bi-monthly geospatial World Magazine\nbrings the latest technology trends and analysis from across the world, presents views of experts\nthrough columns and interviews, advocates on policy issues and captures the dynamics of the industry\nthrough comprehensive articles, infographics and case studies.\n\n**75,000+ Readership**\n\n**16,000+ Print Subscribers**\n**10,000+ Digital Downloads**\n\n**[Geospatial World videos][78]**\n\nLaunched in 2015, our video platform is growing every day. Today, it is the only professional\nquality video platform in the geospatial domain. The platform offers daily news updates, interviews,\nproduct launches, special features, panel discussions and event coverage in snackable, short and\nlong format.\n\n**15,000+ Subscribers **\n**6,000+ Average views per day**\n**2 mins Avg. watch time**\n\n**[Geospatial World Webinars][79]**\n\nGeospatial World Webinars are an excellent way to interact with your prospective client base about\nyour latest software, hardware, data or service. It offers the offers the right platform for a\ncompany to invest in, to reach out to wide audience, and connect and convert the prospects into\nclients.\n\n**600+ Average Registration **\n**25 of 45 Mins. Average time Present**\n\n**Custom marketing content**\n\nOur expert team of writers and content creators is at your disposal. We can create content \u2014 blogs,\ntechnology articles, case studies, promotional videos, newsletters and even magazines \u2014 as per your\nrequirement. All you have to do is share your ideas and reference material and we will take of the\nrest.\n\nFor further information contact Vaishali Dixit at [[email protected]][80]\n\n[ ][81]\n* [ About Us ][82]\n* [ Our People ][83]\n* [ Download Media Kit ][84]\n* [ Download Logo Suite ][85]\n* [ Press ][86]\n* [ Privacy Policy ][87]\n* [ Contact Us ][88]\n[ Facebook-f ][89] [ Twitter ][90] [ Youtube ][91] [ Linkedin ][92] [ Instagram ][93]\n\n\u00a9 Geospatial Media and Communications. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[1]: /consulting/\n[2]: /events/\n[3]: /media/\n[4]: /about/\n[5]: https://www.geospatialworld.net/login\n[6]: http://www.geospatialworld.net/logout/\n[7]: https://www.geospatialworld.net/profile/\n[8]: https://www.geospatialworld.net/subscribe/\n[9]: https://www.geospatialworld.net/prime-stories/\n[10]: https://www.geospatialworld.net/special-features/\n[11]: https://www.geospatialworld.net/technology-and-innovation/\n[12]: https://www.geospatialworld.net/business-and-industry-trends/\n[13]: https://geospatialworld.net/artha/\n[14]: https://www.geospatialworld.net/interview\n[15]: https://www.geospatialworld.net/opinion/\n[16]: https://www.geospatialworld.net/case-study/\n[17]: https://www.geospatialworld.net/case-study/architecture-engineering-and-construction/\n[18]: https://www.geospatialworld.net/case-study/business-intelligence/\n[19]: https://www.geospatialworld.net/case-study/national-mapping/\n[20]: https://www.geospatialworld.net/case-study/sustainable-development/\n[21]: https://www.geospatialworld.net/case-study/agriculture/\n[22]: https://www.geospatialworld.net/case-study/defense-security/\n[23]: https://www.geospatialworld.net/videos/?utm_source=top-menu-move