      "key_products": "Geospatial World Forum; GeoSmart India; GeoBuiz Summit; Syndicate Reports; Geospatial Resource Platform; Consulting Services; Policy and Strategy Advocacy; GW Prime Live; GW Media Website",
      "polished_summary": "Geospatial World is the media and public relations division of Geospatial Media & Communications, dedicated to advancing knowledge for sustainability through geospatial technology and space infrastructure. The company offers a range of products and services, including flagship events like the Geospatial World Forum and GeoSmart India, as well as consulting services and media platforms that cater to industry professionals, policymakers, and organizations across various sectors such as government, environmental conservation, and real estate.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Geospatial World primarily operates as a media and consulting company focused on geospatial technology and does not manufacture, design, or develop spectral sensors or related products directly for the target market. Their offerings are centered around events, consulting, and media rather than direct involvement in spectral sensor technology.",
