      "company_summary": "MTEC is a nonprofit organization dedicated to advancing medical technology development for both military and civilian health improvement. It offers a range of services, including funding opportunities, collaboration on research and prototypes, and guidance through government processes, targeting innovators, service providers, businesses, federal agencies, and healthcare investors in the healthcare and defense sectors.",
