            "url": "https://mtec-sc.org/about",
            "text": "[[MTEC Logo]MTEC][1]\n[Focus Areas][2]\n\n## Who we serve\n\n[Solicitations][3][Patents][4]\n\n## About Us\n\n[ Explore][5]\n[Join MTEC][6]\n[Log In][7]\n\n# Advancing Medical Innovation\n\nAt MTEC, we advance the rapid deployment of innovative medical technologies that improve the health\nof the military and civilians.\n\n[Advancing Medical Innovation]\n\n## Who Are We?\n\nMTEC is a nonprofit that funds medical technology development. We operate under a government-awarded\nOther Transaction Agreement (OTA)\u2014a flexible contracting vehicle that allows us to move faster,\ncollaborate more freely, and engage a broader range of innovators.\n\nWe drive military-civilian partnerships and foster collaboration within an extensive ecosystem of\nsmall and large businesses, federal agencies, academic institutions, and more. We rapidly deploy\nfunding and drive innovative medical technologies that improve military and civilian health\nglobally.\n\n[Check out our Focus Areas][8]\n\n## MTEC by the Numbers\n\nFiDollarSign\n\n1.5B\n\nFederal funding\n\nGrGroup\n\n750+\n\nMTEC Members\n\nFiDollarSign\n\n1.2B\n\nFollow-on Funding\n\nFiFileText\n\n384\n\nProjects Awarded\n\nGiHoneycomb\n\n150\n\nProducts in Pipeline\n\n## MTEC Members\n\nSpanning over 20 countries, our membership base includes small and large corporations, investors,\nacademic institutions, and nonprofits.\n\nOur corporate members also include a team of trusted service providers. These subject matter experts\nhelp you navigate the complexities of the healthcare ecosystem and increase the likelihood of your\ncommercial success.\n\n[Explore Our Member Directory][9]\n[MTEC Members]\n\n## Our Global Presence\n\n[Our Global Presence]\n\n## MTEC Leadership\n\n[Shawn-Headshot.jpg]\n\n### Dr. Shawn J. Green\n\nPresident\n\n[Shawn.Green@mtec-sc.org][10]\n\n[AiFillLinkedin][11]\n[Lauren Palestrini HS 2025.jpg]\n\n### Dr. Lauren Palestrini\n\nChief Science Officer\n\n[Lauren.Palestrini@mtec-sc.org][12]\n\n[AiFillLinkedin][13]\n[TOM Headshot.png]\n\n### Tom Shemanski\n\nChief Financial Officer & Treasurer\n\n[AiFillLinkedin][14]\n[Christopher-Steele-Headshot.png]\n\n### Dr. Chris Steele\n\nChief Business Development\n\n[Chris.Steele@mtec-sc.org][15]\n\n[AiFillLinkedin][16]\n[Elaine HS for website formatted.png]\n\n### Elaine Sumera\n\nChief Operating Officer\n\n[Elaine.Sumera@mtec-sc.org][17]\n\n[AiFillLinkedin][18]\n\n## MTEC Team\n\n[mb hs.png]\n\n### Madison Bell\n\nMarketing & Communications\n\n[madison.bell@mtec-sc.org][19]\n\n[AiFillLinkedin][20]\n[Chuck Hutti Headshot.png]\n\n### Dr. Chuck Hutti\n\nSenior Technical Program Manager\n\n[chuck.hutti@mtec-sc.org][21]\n\n[AiFillLinkedin][22]\n[criag Headshots for Website 245x341.png]\n\n### Craig Lebo\n\nDirector of Contracting and Compliance\n\n[Kim Olsen HS 2025.jpg]\n\n### Kim Olsen\n\nMember Relations Manager\n\n[Kim.Olsen@mtec-sc.org][23]\n\n[AiFillLinkedin][24]\n[Richard-Satcher.jpg]\n\n### Rick Satcher\n\nEducational\n\n[Rick.Satcher@mtec-sc.org][25]\n\n[AiFillLinkedin][26]\n\n## MTEC Strategic Advisors\n\n[Donna-Boston (1).jpg]\n\n### Donna Boston\n\nSenior Advisor\n\n[Bill Howell HS 2025.jpg]\n\n### Bill Howell\n\nPresident Emeritus\n\n[MTEC-George-Ludwig (1).png]\n\n### Dr. George V. Ludwig\n\nSenior Advisor\n\n[Ron HS 2025.jpg]\n\n### Dr. Ron Poropatich\n\nSenior Advisor\n\n[mei Headshots for Website 245x341.png]\n\n### Mei Sun, PhD, MBA\n\nDirector, Research Operations\n\n[Mei.Sun@mtec-sc.org][27]\n\n[Stuart-Tyner-Headshot (1).png]\n\n### Dr. Stuart Tyner\n\nSenior Advisor\n\n## MTEC Academic Advisory Council (MAAC)\n\n[Dr. Erin Rothwell headshot for website.png]\n\n### Dr. Erin Rothwell\n\nChair\n\nUniversity of Utah\n\n[AiFillLinkedin][28]\n[Dr. Sofia Matta for website.png]\n\n### Dr. Sofia Matta\n\nVice Chair\n\nMGB / Home Base\n\n[AiFillLinkedin][29]\n[Dr. Vik Bebarta for website.png]\n\n### Dr. Vik Bebarta\n\nUniversity of Colorado\n\n[AiFillLinkedin][30]\n[7c6e52cff03aa8ee12eb353280bf83bd6108cb22-246x341.jpg]\n\n### Dr. Ron Poropatich\n\nUniversity of Pittsburgh\n\n[AiFillLinkedin][31]\n\n## MTEC Board of Directors\n\n[Ellen-Embrey.jpg]\n\n### Ellen Embrey\n\nChair\n\nStratitia\n\n[Mike-Black.jpg]\n\n### Mike Black\n\nAccelerMED\n\nAt Large Board Representative\n\n[Michael-Brown.jpg]\n\n### Michael Brown\n\nGE HealthCare Technology & Innovation Center\n\nAt Large Board Representative\n\n[708d8d0307f3ee51e90639c22315aeee20aa142e-246x341.jpg]\n\n### Dr. James F. Cummings\n\nVaxart\n\nAt Large Board Representative\n\n[b586ada55112961f36c2b69efad8ea556b8efe58-246x341.jpg]\n\n### Dr. Ross Donaldson\n\nCritical Innovations\n\nAt Large Board Representative\n\n[Christopher-Hlubb.png]\n\n### Christopher Hlubb\n\nAgrilogics Group\n\nSmall Business Representative\n\n[fbfaf1fd70f333d6a6719520cb5e7e8e485b5f3b-246x341.jpg]\n\n### Amy Salzhauer\n\nGood Growth Capital Ventures\n\nAt Large Board Representative\n\nJOIN OUR MAILING LIST\n\n## Stay Connected with MTEC\n\nKeep up with active and upcoming solicitations, MTEC news and other valuable information.\n\n[[MTEC Logo]MTEC][32]\n[For federal\nagencies][33]\n[Focus Areas][34][Technology Showcase][35][Member Directory][36][Events][37]\n[For innovators and\nservice providers][38]\n[Member Directory][39][Submitting Proposals][40][Active Solicitations][41][How to Join][42]\n[For healthcare\ninvestors][43]\n[Technology Showcase][44][How to Join][45]\n[About\nMTEC][46]\n[Who We Are][47][Capabilities][48][Events][49][Resources][50][Contact Us][51]\n\nThe Internal Revenue Service has recognized MTEC as a charitable organization which is exempt under\nInternal Revenue Code Section 501(c)(3).\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2025\n\n[Linkedin][52][Privacy Policy][53][Terms of Use][54][Consent Preferences][55]\n\nPowered by [Berkeley FIT][56]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /focus-areas\n[3]: /solicitations\n[4]: /patents\n[5]: /search/members\n[6]: /join\n[7]: /auth/login\n[8]: https://mtec-sc.org/focus-areas\n[9]: https://mtec-sc.org/search/members\n[10]: mailto: Shawn.Green@mtec-sc.org\n[11]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/shawngreen/\n[12]: mailto: Lauren.Palestrini@mtec-sc.org\n[13]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/lauren-palestrini-phd-a53b958/\n[14]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/tomshemanski/\n[15]: mailto: Chris.Steele@mtec-sc.org\n[16]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/ct-steele/\n[17]: mailto:Elaine.Sumera@mtec-sc.org\n[18]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/madelaine-sumera/\n[19]: mailto:madison.bell@mtec-sc.org\n[20]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/madisonbell7/\n[21]: mailto: chuck.hutti@mtec-sc.org\n[22]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/chuck-hutti/\n[23]: mailto: Kim.Olsen@mtec-sc.org\n[24]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/kimeolsen/\n[25]: mailto: Rick.Satcher@mtec-sc.org\n[26]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/ricksatcher/\n[27]: mailto:Mei.Sun@mtec-sc.org\n[28]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/erin-rothwell-491a2a30/\n[29]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/sofia-matta-md/\n[30]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/vikbebarta/\n[31]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/ronald-poropatich-md-ms-b4409817/\n[32]: /\n[33]: /federal-agencies\n[34]: /focus-areas\n[35]: /technology-showcase\n[36]: /search/members\n[37]: /events\n[38]: /innovators\n[39]: /search/members\n[40]: /proposal-submit\n[41]: /search/solicitations?prod_mtec_solicitations%5BrefinementList%5D%5Bstatus%5D%5B0%5D=active\n[42]: /join\n[43]: /healthcare-investors\n[44]: /technology-showcase\n[45]: /join\n[46]: /about\n[47]: /about\n[48]: /capabilities\n[49]: /events\n[50]: /resources\n[51]: /contact\n[52]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/medical-technology-enterprise-consortium\n[53]: /privacy-policy\n[54]: /terms-of-use\n[55]: #\n[56]: https://berkeleyfit.com"
