            "url": "https://mtec-sc.org/contact",
            "text": "[[MTEC Logo]MTEC][1]\n[Focus Areas][2]\n\n## Who we serve\n\n[Solicitations][3][Patents][4]\n\n## About Us\n\n[ Explore][5]\n[Join MTEC][6]\n[Log In][7]\n\nANY QUESTIONS?\n\n# Contact Us\n\nWe're here to help. Please fill out the form below or email us at [support@mtec-sc.org][8] and we'll\nget back to you as soon as possible.\n\nFull Name\nEmail\nMessage\nSend\n[[MTEC Logo]MTEC][9]\n[For federal\nagencies][10]\n[Focus Areas][11][Technology Showcase][12][Member Directory][13][Events][14]\n[For innovators and\nservice providers][15]\n[Member Directory][16][Submitting Proposals][17][Active Solicitations][18][How to Join][19]\n[For healthcare\ninvestors][20]\n[Technology Showcase][21][How to Join][22]\n[About\nMTEC][23]\n[Who We Are][24][Capabilities][25][Events][26][Resources][27][Contact Us][28]\n\nThe Internal Revenue Service has recognized MTEC as a charitable organization which is exempt under\nInternal Revenue Code Section 501(c)(3).\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2025\n\n[Linkedin][29][Privacy Policy][30][Terms of Use][31][Consent Preferences][32]\n\nPowered by [Berkeley FIT][33]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /focus-areas\n[3]: /solicitations\n[4]: /patents\n[5]: /search/members\n[6]: /join\n[7]: /auth/login\n[8]: mailto:support@mtec-sc.org\n[9]: /\n[10]: /federal-agencies\n[11]: /focus-areas\n[12]: /technology-showcase\n[13]: /search/members\n[14]: /events\n[15]: /innovators\n[16]: /search/members\n[17]: /proposal-submit\n[18]: /search/solicitations?prod_mtec_solicitations%5BrefinementList%5D%5Bstatus%5D%5B0%5D=active\n[19]: /join\n[20]: /healthcare-investors\n[21]: /technology-showcase\n[22]: /join\n[23]: /about\n[24]: /about\n[25]: /capabilities\n[26]: /events\n[27]: /resources\n[28]: /contact\n[29]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/medical-technology-enterprise-consortium\n[30]: /privacy-policy\n[31]: /terms-of-use\n[32]: #\n[33]: https://berkeleyfit.com"
