      "company_function": "vendor",
      "company_summary": "Neonscience operates the National Ecological Observatory Network (NEON), providing comprehensive ecological data and resources to support research and education in environmental science. The company specializes in data collection through advanced observational systems and biorepositories, catering to researchers, educators, and institutions focused on understanding and addressing ecological challenges. Through its extensive data portal and collaborative initiatives, Neonscience fosters innovation and community engagement in ecological research.",
