      "polished_summary": "Neonscience operates the National Ecological Observatory Network (NEON), providing comprehensive ecological data and resources to support research and education in environmental science. The company specializes in data collection through advanced observational systems and biorepositories, catering to researchers, educators, and institutions focused on understanding and addressing ecological challenges. Through its extensive data portal and collaborative initiatives, Neonscience fosters innovation and community engagement in ecological research.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Neonscience operates the National Ecological Observatory Network, focusing on ecological data collection and research support rather than manufacturing or developing spectral sensors or related products. Their activities do not align with the target market of spectral sensors.",
      "audit_score": 1,
      "audit_completed": true,
      "audit_timestamp": "2026-06-28T13:17:07Z"
    },
