earn more ][101]\n\n## PATHOLOGY\n\nDiscover ASI\u2019s Digital Pathology Portfolio with Scanner-Agnostic capabilities for H&E and IHC,\u00a0\nand\u00a0Tissue matching with FISH Specimens.\n\n[ Learn more ][102]\n\n## Applied Spectral\n## Imaging Solution\n\nASI\u2019s comprehensive suite of computer-aided solutions for digital cytogenetics and pathology, cater\nto the unique demands of brightfield, fluorescence, and spectral imaging and analysis. With a\nsteadfast focus on delivering advanced diagnostics and user-centric solutions, ASI stands at the\nforefront of technology in karyotyping, IHC and FISH imaging and analysis.\n\n## Who We Are\n\nApplied Spectral Imaging (ASI) boasts a three-decade legacy of innovation in biomedical imaging,\ndelivering cutting-edge diagnostic solutions to pathology and cytogenetic laboratories.\n\n\nAs a global leader with a network of distribution partners in over 80 countries, ASI values\nlong-term, personalized customer relationships, **because every diagnosis counts**.\n\n## Our Partners\n\n[logo-montefiore]\n[cleveland-clinic]\n[duke-pathology]\n[3]\n[4]\n[5]\n[6]\n[7]\n[8]\n[9]\n[11]\n[17]\n[19]\n[20]\n[21]\n[22]\n[24]\n[25]\n[27]\n[28]\n[26]\n[18]\n[16]\n[15]\n[14]\n[13]\n[2]\n[8]\n[7]\n[6]\n[5]\n[4]\n[3]\n[2]\n[1]\n[Website - customer logo (3)]\n[Website - customer logo (5)]\n\n## Events\n\nJune 13, 2026 \u2013\nJune 16, 2026\nGothenburg, Sweden\n\n### [ESHG | European Human Genetics Conference][103]\n\nCome & Visit Us | Booth #246\n[ Read more ][104]\nAugust 1, 2026 \u2013\nAugust 5, 2026\nTexas, USA\n\n### [CGC Cancer Genomics Consortium Annual Meeting][105]\n\nCome & Meet Us!\n[ Read more ][106]\nSeptember 12, 2026 \u2013\nSeptember 16, 2026\nStockholm, Sweden\n\n### [ECP | European Congress of Pathology][107]\n\nCome & Meet Us\n[ Read more ][108]\n\n## ASI Blog\n\n23/01/2025\n\n### [Transitioning Towards \u201cAll-in-One\u201d Integrative Solutions for Pathology and Cytogenetics][109]\n\n[ Learn more ][110]\n03/12/2024\n\n### [Integrated Digital Diagnostic Systems in Cytogenetics][111]\n\n[ Learn more ][112]\n06/11/2024\n\n### [Leveraging Virtualization and Cloud Computing for Enhanced Cytogenetics][113]\n\n[ Learn more ][114]\n\n## Quotes & Testimonials\n\nDigital FISH analysis provides more efficient and accurate results and better patient care in\ncomparison to traditional FISH methods.\nAnguiano A, Wang BT, Wang SR, Boyar FZ, Mahon LW, Naggar MM, Kohn PH, Haddadin MH, Sulcova V, Sbeiti\nAH, Ayad MS, White BJ, Strom CMMolecular Cytogenetics\nThe ASI Slide Loader and Metaphase Finder runs overnight and provides a gallery of digital metaphase\nimages ready for analysis, eliminating the time to ascertain analyzable metaphases and reducing the\nanalysis time, ultimately increasing technologist productivity, compared to traditional methods\nbased on microscopy.\nPersaud T, Bambach R, Schmidt R, Brenholz PJournal of the Association of Genetic Technologists\nAs an early adopter of the PD-L1 immunostaining methodology, our group quickly recognized the inter\n- and intra-observer variability in scoring and interpretation of the stain, especially when there\nis non-uniform staining among tumor regions. We have been very pleased with the added confidence\nthat HiPath Pro provides us in improving accuracy and precision of interpretation.\nDr. Lija JosephLowell General Hospital\n[ [logo spectral imaging] ][115]\n\n**SIGN UP\n**to get tips, news, and more.\n\nEmail\nSubscribe\n\nBy clicking Subscribe, I agree to the Applied Spectral Imaging Terms & Conditions & Privacy Policy\nand understand that I may opt out of Applied Spectral Imaging subscriptions at any time.\n* [About ASI][116]\n* [ASI Technology][117]\n* [Global Distributors][118]\n* Probes\n  * [Order Probe Kit][119]\n  * [Order Chromosome Paints][120]\n* [Contact Us][121]\n* [About ASI][122]\n* [ASI Technology][123]\n* [Global Distributors][124]\n* Probes\n  * [Order Probe Kit][125]\n  * [Order Chromosome Paints][126]\n* [Contact Us][