   * [WEETECH][88]\n  * * Environmental & Analysis\n    * [Alicat][89]\n    * [Avo Photonics][90]\n    * [Crowcon][91]\n    * [Deep Trekker][92]\n    * [HWM Global][93]\n    * [Minicam Group][94]\n    * [Nuvonic][95]\n    * [Ocean Optics][96]\n    * [Palintest][97]\n    * [SENSIT][98]\n    * [Sensitron][99]\n    * [Sensorex][100]\n  * * Healthcare\n    * [Arcmed][101]\n    * [CenTrak][102]\n    * [IZI Medical][103]\n    * [Keeler][104]\n    * [Longer][105]\n    * [Medicel][106]\n    * [MST][107]\n    * [NovaBone][108]\n    * [PeriGen][109]\n    * [Riester][110]\n    * [Rovers][111]\n    * [SSG][112]\n    * [SunTech][113]\n    * [TSI Group][114]\n    * [Volk Optical][115]\n* [Our People][116]\n  * [Our Commitment][117]\n  * [Our Culture][118]\n  * [Well-being][119]\n  * [Career at Halma][120]\n    * [Explore Internship Opportunities][121]\n    * [Become a Halma Future Leader][122]\n    * [Current Openings][123]\n* [Our Impact][124]\n* [Investors ][125]\n* [News][126]\n[Play Video][127]\n\n## Welcome To Halma India\n\nWe are a global group of life-saving technology companies.\n\nOur purpose is to grow a safer, cleaner, healthier future for everyone, every day.\n\nSince 2008, Halma has been operating in India to provide innovative products and services, including\nniche technologies that are helping solve many of the key problems - from water pollution to chronic\nillnesses.\u00a0\n\n[Find out who we are][128]\n[Play Video][129]\n\n## Our People\n\n### Experience the world of possibilities at Halma\n\nOur people enrich our diverse global businesses with rich knowledge, experience and passion and\nenjoy a culture that enables them to be who they really are.\n\nFind out what makes Halma such an exciting and rewarding place to work.\n\n[Find out more][130]\n\n### News\n* 16 Jan 2026 [For the 3rd year in a row, Halma India receives \u2018Great Place To Work\u2019 certification\n  ][131]\n* 20 Jan 2025 [Halma India receives \u2018Great Place To Work\u2019 certification for the second year in a\n  row][132]\n* 09 Oct 2024 [Monitoring eye health across communities in India ][133]\n* 22 Aug 2024 [Halma India\u2019s annual Reward and Recognition 2024 brings individuals and teams from 24\n  Halma companies together][134]\n* 10 Jul 2024 [Introducing Veiga: A World-class Fire Alarm and Detection System, Made in India, Made\n  for India][135]\n* 01 Jul 2024 [Halma India\u2019s new CSR initiative promotes a healthy community][136]\n\n## Quick links\n* [Who we are][137]\n* [How we grow][138]\n* [Our Companies][139]\n* [Our People][140]\n* [Investors][141]\n* [News][142]\n* [Contact Us][143]\n\n## Contact us\n* **Registered Office:**\n  Prestige Shantiniketan,\n  Gate No. 2, Tower C, 7th Floor,\n  Whitefield Main Road,\n  Mahadevapura, Bengaluru\n  Karnataka 560 048, India.\n  \n  [Tel: +91 80 6747 5300][144]\n  Email:\u00a0[[email\u00a0protected]][145]\n\nConnect with us\n* [LinkedIn][146]\n* [YouTube][147]\n\n## Annual Report 2025\n\n[Download pdf of report now][148]\n\n## Sign Up\n\nStay informed on news and events from Halma.\n\n[Subscribe][149]\n\nConnect with us\n* [LinkedIn][150]\n* [YouTube][151]\n* [Disclaimer][152]\n* [Privacy][153]\n* [Accessibility][154]\n* [Cookie Notice][155]\n* [Cookie settings][156]\n* [Site Map][157]\n* [Standard [Halma India]\n* [Investors ][1]\n* [News][2]\n[\nIndia\n][3]\n* [Global][4]\n* [China][5]\n* [India][6]\n* [Who we are][7]\n* [How we grow][8]\n* [Our Companies][9]\n  * Safety\n  * [Advanced][10]\n  * [Ampac][11]\n  * [Apollo][12]\n  * [AVIRE][13]\n  * [BEA][14]\n  * [Cosasco][15]\n  * [FFE][16]\n  * [FirePro][17]\n  * [Firetrace][18]\n  * [Fortress Safety][19]\n  * [Lazer Safe][20]\n  * [MK Test][21]\n  * [Navtech Radar][22]\n  * [Orama][23]\n  * [OsecoElfab][24]\n  * [Sentric Safety Group][25]\n  * [Sofis][26]\n  * [WEETECH][27]\n  * Environmental & Analysis\n  * [Alicat][28]\n  * [Avo Photonics][29]\n  * [Crowcon][30]\n  * [Deep Trekker][31]\n  * [HWM Global][32]\n  * [Minicam Group][33]\n  * [Nuvo