meter\u2014pushing the boundaries of\nminiaturized sensing technology. Our founders are seasoned entrepreneurs backed by seasoned\ninvestors. Our growing team is made up of a range of enthusiastic colleagues who thrive in a\nfast-paced and challenging environment. Together, we\u2019re enabling customers to get instant, accurate\ninsights wherever and whenever they need them.\n\n**Seeking top-tier talent to join our team:**\n* You will be surrounded by smart, hard-working and caring people.\n* You will work in a professional and friendly environment.\n* You will feel proud of the work you do every day.\n* You will experience a truly supportive team culture.\n* You will be part of a unique, dynamic, and cutting-edge company.\n* You will have the chance to make a difference and positively affect lives.\n\n## OUR VALUES\n\n### Innovation\n\n### Customer Satisfaction\n\n### Commitment\n\n### Teamwork\n\n### Initiation & Proactivity\n\n### Continuous Improvement\n\n## JOIN US\n\n#### CURRENT OPENINGS\n\nShow filters\nAll languages\n* English\n4 jobs\nShare\nAll languages\n* English\n4 jobs\nShare\n[Electronics Engineering Summer Intern (3 Tracks)][18]\nHybrid\n* Cairo, Al Q\u0101hirah, Egypt\nSensor Systems Technology\n[View job][19]\n[View job][20]\n[Hardware Compliance Engineer (Part time)][21]\nOn-site, Hybrid\n* Cairo, Al Q\u0101hirah, Egypt\nSensor Systems Technology\n[View job][22]\n[View job][23]\n[MEMS Development Engineer][24]\nOn-site\n* Cairo, Al Q\u0101hirah, Egypt\nOptics & Microsystems Technologies\n[View job][25]\n[View job][26]\n[System Graduate Internship][27]\nOn-site\n* Cairo, Al Q\u0101hirah, Egypt\nSensor Systems Technology\n[View job][28]\n[View job][29]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: /\n[3]: /#text-cfe8f405\n[4]: /#jobs-b25e0ef0\n[5]: /\n[6]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/si-ware-systems/\n[7]: https://www.facebook.com/SiWareSystems?ref=br_tf\n[8]: https://twitter.com/siwaresystems\n[9]: https://www.si-ware.com\n[10]: /\n[11]: /#text-cfe8f405\n[12]: /#jo