        "crawl_text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[ [Specim Logo] ][2]\n* [Technology][3]\n* [Applications][4]\n* [Products][5]\n  * [Specim RETEX][6]\n  * [SpecimONE][7]\n  * [Spectrographs][8]\n  * [Hyperspectral Cameras][9]\n  * [Airborne systems][10]\n  * [Geology systems][11]\n  * [Hyperspectral imaging software][12]\n  * [Accessories][13]\n* [Services][14]\n  * [Recalibration Service][15]\n* [Library][16]\n* [Company][17]\n  * [About us][18]\n  * [Contact][19]\n  * [Distributors][20]\n  * [Careers][21]\n  * [Quality][22]\n  * [Press][23]\n* [Support][24]\n* [News][25]\n* [Contact us][26]\n* [Specim Community][27]\n* [CN][28]\n* Search for:\nHome Page[admin][29]2026-06-09T09:56:58+03:00\n\n## SPECTRAL IMAGING\n## MADE EASY\n\n# World-leading hyperspectral imaging cameras and systems\n# for industry, OEM, integrators, research & airborne users\n\n[Laboratory hyperspectral imaging]\n\n## LABORATORY\n\n[Inline hyperspectral imaging]\n\n## INLINE\n\n[Field hyperspectral imaging]\n\n## FIELD\n\n[Airborne hyperspectral imaging]\n\n## UAV\n\n[SWIR hyperspectral imaging lab sets]\n\n#### SPECIAL OFFER!\n\n#### Get a SWIR hyperspectral imaging lab set\n#### now for a special discount\n\nOffer valid until 30 September 2026\n\n[LEARN MORE][30]\n[Specim RETEX - AI-powered hyperspectral textile recognition solution]\n\n#### Specim RETEX\n\n#### AI-powered hyperspectral textile recognition solution\n\n#### Now Available!\n\n#### **SPECTRAL IMAGING PLATFORM**\n\n#### Create industrial sorting and inspection solutions faster, cheaper, and easier than ever!\n\n[SpecimONE spectral imaging platform]\n\n# WHAT IS HYPERSPECTRAL IMAGING?\n\nHyperspectral imaging is a powerful technology that can reliably identify and sort objects with\nsimilar looks but different chemical compositions, which is impossible with conventional imaging\nsystems.\n\n[LEARN MORE][31]\n\n# WHY HYPERSPECTRAL IMAGING?\n\nHyperspectral imaging is a highly accurate research tool and a powerful machine vision technology\nfor various applications to improve processes, increase quality, and reduce waste.\n\n[LEARN MORE][32]\n\n# REVEALING THE INVISIBLE\n\n[Hyperspectral imaging][33] is an entirely non-destructive, highly accurate, and fast way to\nidentify different materials or define their properties. Since every material and compound reacts\nwith light differently, the reflectance measurements result in unique spectral signatures that\nidentify different materials, similar to fingerprints.\n\n[TUTORIALS][34]\n\n# CHANGING THE WAY WE SEE THE WORLD\n\n[HUMAN EYE / RGB][HYPERSPECTRAL]\n\nHyperspectral imaging has been done inside Pharao\u2019s tomb, under the ice, flying over an ancient\nRoman city. It is used extensively in research and industry to identify, locate, sort, and quantify\ndifferent materials that are invisible to the human eye.\n\n[CASE STUDIES][35]\n[Guide to selecting hyperspectral instruments.]\n\n## GUIDE TO SELECTING HYPERSPECTRAL INSTRUMENTS\n\n**DOWNLOAD THE GUIDE AND YOU\u2019LL LEARN ABOUT:**\n* Main quality attributes to consider when selecting an instrument for hyperspectral application\n* Illumination requirements\n* Light collection efficiency\n\n[DOWNLOAD GUIDE][36]\n\n#### Specim, Spectral Imaging Ltd.\n\nElektroniikkatie 13, FI-90590, Oulu, Finland\n\nPhone: [+358104244400][37]\n\nEmail: [info@specim.com][38]\n\n[Press][39]\n\n[Privacy Notice][40]\n\n[Whistleblow Channel][41]\n\n[****][42]\n\n#### [**SIGN UP FOR OUR NEWSLETTER**][43]\n\n#### Follow us\n\n[Page load link][44]\n[ Go to Top ][45]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.specim.com/\n[3]: https://www.specim.com/technology/\n[4]: https://www.specim.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/\n[5]: https://www.specim.com/products/\n[6]: https://www.specim.com/retex/\n[7]: https://www.specim.com/specimone/\n[8]: https://www.specim.com/spectrographs/\n[9]: https://www.specim.com/hyperspectral-cameras/\n[10]: https://www.specim.com/airborne/\n[11]: https://www.specim.com/products/sisurock/\n[12]: http