t are invisible to the human eye.\n\n[CASE STUDIES][35]\n[Guide to selecting hyperspectral instruments.]\n\n## GUIDE TO SELECTING HYPERSPECTRAL INSTRUMENTS\n\n**DOWNLOAD THE GUIDE AND YOU\u2019LL LEARN ABOUT:**\n* Main quality attributes to consider when selecting an instrument for hyperspectral application\n* Illumination requirements\n* Light collection efficiency\n\n[DOWNLOAD GUIDE][36]\n\n#### Specim, Spectral Imaging Ltd.\n\nElektroniikkatie 13, FI-90590, Oulu, Finland\n\nPhone: [+358104244400][37]\n\nEmail: [info@specim.com][38]\n\n[Press][39]\n\n[Privacy Notice][40]\n\n[Whistleblow Channel][41]\n\n[****][42]\n\n#### [**SIGN UP FOR OUR NEWSLETTER**][43]\n\n#### Follow us\n\n[Page load link][44]\n[ Go to Top ][45]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.specim.com/\n[3]: https://www.specim.com/technology/\n[4]: https://www.specim.com/hyperspectral-imaging-applications/\n[5]: https://www.specim.com/products/\n[6]: https://www.specim.com/retex/\n[7]: https://www.specim.com/specimone/\n[8]: https://www.specim.com/spectrographs/\n[9]: https://www.specim.com/hyperspectral-cameras/\n[10]: https://www.specim.com/airborne/\n[11]: https://www.specim.com/products/sisurock/\n[12]: https://www.specim.com/software/\n[13]: https://www.specim.com/accessories/\n[14]: #\n[15]: https://www.specim.com/recalibration-service/\n[16]: https://www.specim.com/library/\n[17]: https://www.specim.com/company/about-us/\n[18]: https://www.specim.com/company/about-us/\n[19]: https://www.specim.com/company/contact/\n[20]: https://www.specim.com/company/distributors/\n[21]: https://www.specim.com/careers/\n[22]: https://www.specim.com/company/quality/\n[23]: https://www.specim.com/company/press/\n[24]: https://www.specim.com/support/\n[25]: https://www.specim.com/news-blog/\n[26]: https://www.specim.com/company/contact/\n[27]: https://specim.my.site.com/community\n[28]: https://www.specim.com/cn/\n[29]: https://www.specim.com/author/admin/\n[30]: https://www.specim.com/swir-lab-sets-campaign/\n[31]