RODUCTS][78]\n    * [NIRONE Sensor X][79]\n    * [NIRONE Sensor S][80]\n  * [Scanner Platform][81]\n    * [NIRONE Scanner][82]\n    * [LabScanner][83]\n    * [LabScanner Plus][84]\n    * [Liquid Scanner][85]\n    * [Software/App][86]\n  * [TECHNOLOGY][87]\n* [APPLICATIONS][88]\n  * [Product Conformity][89]\n    * [Pharma Security][90]\n    * [Brand Protection / Anti-counterfeiting][91]\n  * [Circular Economy][92]\n    * [Textile][93]\n    * [Plastic][94]\n  * [OEM][95]\n* COMPANY\n  * [About us][96]\n  * [ESG][97]\n  * [Partners][98]\n  * [News][99]\n* [Order now][100]\n* [SUPPORT][101]\n\n## **WHAT **WE DO\n\n## We analyze and identify materials on the spot - anywhere, anytime.\n\nWe are on a mission to add value to people's everyday lives with our technological innovations. We\nare constantly looking for ways to help our customers solve global problems - ecological and social\naspects are the drivers of our actions.\n\n## **NIRONE ** Scanner Platform\n\n### **Application ** Pharma Security\n\nFraudulent drugs harm or kill millions around the world. Our NIRONE solution identifies fake\npharmaceuticals within seconds.\n[ Learn more ][102]\n\n### **Application ** Product Conformity / Anti-counterfeiting\n\nWith our digital material recognition solution, original articles can be tracked and verified within\nseconds, without altering or damaging the product.\n[ Learn more ][103]\n\n### **Application ** Textile\n\nNIR technology can be applied to textile recycling enabling more efficient sorting with portable\nhand-held or built-in scanners.\n[ Learn more ][104]\n\n### **Application ** Plastic\n\nMiniaturized and affordable NIR sensors and scanners identify plastics and help sort them more\naccurately.\n[ Learn more ][105]\n\n## **NIRONE ** SENSOR\n\nOur Near Infrared spectroscopy sensor is innovative, small, robust, inexpensive and intelligent to\nbring measurements from laboratories to field use.\n\n[ Read more ][106]\n\n## **TECHNOLOGY**\n\nOur miniaturized, portable and cost-effective solution enables fast, accurate and non-destructive\nmeasurements, taking this technology to the next level.\n\n[ Read more ][107]\n[ ][108] [ Linkedin ][109] [ Facebook ][110]\n* m-u-t GmbH Wei\u00dfkirchener Str. 2-6 61449 Steinbach Germany\n* [ sales@spectralengines.com ][111]\n* m-u-t GmbH Wei\u00dfkirchener Str. 2-6 61449 Steinbach Germany\n* [ sales@spectralengines.com ][112]\n\n\u00a9 **m-u-t GmbH** | ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.\n* [ Privacy Policy ][113]\n* [ Imprint ][114]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://spectralengines.com/\n[3]: #\n[4]: https://spectralengines.com/nirone-sensor-x/\n[5]: https://spectralengines.com/nirone-sensor-s/\n[6]: https://spectralengines.com/scanner-platform/\n[7]: https://spectralengines.com/nirone-scanner/\n[8]: https://spectralengines.com/labscanner/\n[9]: https://spectralengines.com/labscanner-plus/\n[10]: https://spectralengines.com/liquid-scanner/\n[11]: https://spectralengines.com/software-app/\n[12]: https://spectralengines.com/technology/\n[13]: https://spectralengines.com/applications/\n[14]: https://spectralengines.com/applications/product-conformity/\n[15]: https://spectralengines.com/applications/product-conformity/\n[16]: https://spectralengin [Skip to content][1]\n* [HOME][2]\n* PRODUCTS & SOLUTIONS\n  * [PRODUCTS][3]\n    * [NIRONE Sensor X][4]\n    * [NIRONE Sensor S][5]\n  * [Scanner Platform][6]\n    * [NIRONE Scanner][7]\n    * [LabScanner][8]\n    * [LabScanner Plus][9]\n    * [Liquid Scanner][10]\n    * [Software/App][11]\n  * [TECHNOLOGY][12]\n* [APPLICATIONS][13]\n  * [Product Conformity][14]\n    * [Pharma Security][15]\n    * [Brand Protection / Anti-counterfeiting][16]\n  * [Circular Economy][17]\n    * [Textile][18]\n    * [Plastic][19]\n  * [OEM][20]\n* COMPANY\n  * [About us][21]\n  * [ESG][22]\n  * [Partners][23]\n  * [News][24]\n* [Order now][25]\n* [SUPPORT][26]\n* [HOME][27]\n* PRODUCTS & SOLUTIONS\n  * [PRODUCTS][28]\n    * [NIRONE Sensor X][29]\n    * [NIRONE Sensor S][30]\n  * [Scanne