ntly looking for ways to help our customers solve global problems - ecological and social\naspects are the drivers of our actions.\n\n## **NIRONE ** Scanner Platform\n\n### **Application ** Pharma Security\n\nFraudulent drugs harm or kill millions around the world. Our NIRONE solution identifies fake\npharmaceuticals within seconds.\n[ Learn more ][102]\n\n### **Application ** Product Conformity / Anti-counterfeiting\n\nWith our digital material recognition solution, original articles can be tracked and verified within\nseconds, without altering or damaging the product.\n[ Learn more ][103]\n\n### **Application ** Textile\n\nNIR technology can be applied to textile recycling enabling more efficient sorting with portable\nhand-held or built-in scanners.\n[ Learn more ][104]\n\n### **Application ** Plastic\n\nMiniaturized and affordable NIR sensors and scanners identify plastics and help sort them more\naccurately.\n[ Learn more ][105]\n\n## **NIRONE ** SENSOR\n\nOur Near Infrared spectroscopy sensor is innovative, small, robust, inexpensive and intelligent to\nbring measurements from laboratories to field use.\n\n[ Read more ][106]\n\n## **TECHNOLOGY**\n\nOur miniaturized, portable and cost-effective solution enables fast, accurate and non-destructive\nmeasurements, taking this technology to the next level.\n\n[ Read more ][107]\n[ ][108] [ Linkedin ][109] [ Facebook ][110]\n* m-u-t GmbH Wei\u00dfkirchener Str. 2-6 61449 Steinbach Germany\n* [ sales@spectralengines.com ][111]\n* m-u-t GmbH Wei\u00dfkirchener Str. 2-6 61449 Steinbach Germany\n* [ sales@spectralengines.com ][112]\n\n\u00a9 **m-u-t GmbH** | ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.\n* [ Privacy Policy ][113]\n* [ Imprint ][114]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://spectralengines.com/\n[3]: #\n[4]: https://spectralengines.com/nirone-sensor-x/\n[5]: https://spectralengines.com/nirone-sensor-s/\n[6]: https://spectralengines.com/scanner-platform/\n[7]: https://spectralengines.com/nirone-scanner/\n[8]: https://spectralengines.com/lab