        "crawl_text": "* [ 1-858-675-7404][1]\n* [ Email Us][2]\n* [ Support][3]\n[[Surface Optics Corporation]][4]\n* [Products][5]\n  * [\n    Lab Reflectometers\n    ][6]\n    * [SOC-100 HDR][7]\n    * [SOC-210 Bidirectional Reflectometer][8]\n  * [\n    410 Series Reflectometers\n    ][9]\n    * [SOC-410 DHR Reflectometer][10]\n    * [410-VIS-IR Reflectometer][11]\n    * [410-Solar Reflectometer][12]\n    * [410-Solar-i Reflectometer][13]\n    * [ET-10 Emissometer][14]\n    * [ET-100 Emissometer][15]\n    * [410-LIDAR Reflectometer][16]\n    * [Custom SOC410 Reflectometers][17]\n    * [Accessories & Maintenance][18]\n  * [\n    Spectral Imaging Systems\n    ][19]\n    * [710 Series Hyperspectral Cameras][20]\n    * [LightShift Multispectral Video][21]\n    * [DuoChrome-SM][22]\n    * [SOC-750 Midwave Infrared][23]\n    * [SOC-760 VNIR-SWIR][24]\n    * [Spectral Imaging Resources][25]\n* [Services][26]\n  * [\n    Optical Properties Measurement Services\n    ][27]\n    * [Spectral Reflectance (HDR)][28]\n    * [Emissivity][29]\n    * [BSDF / Scatter][30]\n    * [Transmittance Measurements][31]\n    * [ASTM Testing][32]\n    * [Solar Reflectance (SRI/TSR)][33]\n    * [Absorptance & Thermal Emittance][34]\n    * [Optical Properties Measurements Database][35]\n  * [\n    Vacuum Deposition Coatings\n    ][36]\n    * [Low Observable / Stealth][37]\n    * [Large Area][38]\n    * [Roll-to-Roll][39]\n    * [Diamond-Like Carbon][40]\n    * [Vacuum Deposited Gold (VDG)][41]\n    * [Anti-Reflection (AR)][42]\n    * [Vacuum Deposited Aluminum (VDA)][43]\n    * [Spaceflight and Thermal Control][44]\n    * [High Reflectance][45]\n  * [\n    Electro-Optics Engineering\n    ][46]\n    * [SBIR / STTR][47]\n* [Applications][48]\n  * [\n    Space\n    ][49]\n  * [\n    Defense\n    ][50]\n  * [\n    [Photovoltaic solar panel in desert]\n    Solar Energy\n    ][51]\n  * [\n    Green Building\n    ][52]\n  * [\n    Agriculture\n    ][53]\n* [News][54]\n  * [Blog][55]\n  * [Publications][56]\n* [About Us][57]\n  * [Our Company][58]\n  * [Company History][59]\n  * [Facilities][60]\n  * [Careers][61]\n  * [Our Team][62]\n  * [International Distributors][63]\n\n# Trusted for 50 Years in Optical Properties Characterization\n\nSurface Optics offers a single engineering and manufacturing source for solutions requiring the\napplication, characterization, or control of the optical properties of surfaces.\n\nFounded in 1977 to provide optical property measurement services, today Surface Optics Corporation\n(SOC) specializes in advanced imaging systems, scientific instruments and thin film vacuum coatings\nfor surface engineering.\n\nSOC is pioneering innovative solutions for our research, aerospace, defense, semiconductor,\nautomotive, and energy customers worldwide.\u00a0\n\n[Services][64]\n[Products][65]\n\n### **Hyperspectral and Multispectral Imaging Systems**\n\nThe SOC-710 hyperspectral imaging system stands out with its unique internal line-scanning design,\nmaking it the most versatile hyperspectral imaging system for researchers available.\n\n### **Advanced Goniometers and Scattering Measurement Services**\n\nThe SOC-210 BDR automates BRDF/BTDF measurements for surfaces, paints, coatings, liquids, and\nparticles, covering a spectral range from 0.35 to 14\u03bcm with interchangeable sources, spectral\nbandpass filters, and detectors for maximum versatility.\n\n### **Vacuum Deposition Coatings\n### and Thin-Film**\n\nOur coatings lab offers large chambers and clean rooms, a custom job environment, one-of-a-kind\ncoating hardware, significant space program heritage, and on-site world-class metrology.\u00a0\n\n### **Optical Properties\n### Measurements Lab**\n\n\u00a0The Optical Properties Measurements Lab at Surface Optics is a leading supplier of reflectance,\nBRDF, transmittance, solar absorptance and emittance testing services.\n\n### **Portable Reflectometers\n### & Emissometers**\n\nPrecise solar reflectance, absorptance, and thermal emittance measurements, offering benchtop-level\naccuracy in a user-friendly handheld design. A touchscreen interface streamlines calibration, sample\nidentification, and data display.\n\n### [Advanced Goniometers and Scattering Measurement Services][66]\n\nThe SOC-210 BDR automates BRDF/BTDF measurements for surfaces, paints, coatings, liquids, and\nparticles, covering a spectral range from 0.35 to 14\u03bcm with interchangeable sources, spectral\nbandpass filters, and detectors for maximum versatility.\n\n### Vacuum Deposition Coatings\n### and Thin-Film\n\nOur coatings lab offers large chambers and clean rooms, a custom job environment, one-of-a-kind\ncoating hardware, significant space program heritage, and on-site world-class metrology.\u00a0\n\n### Optical Properties Measurements Lab\n\n\u00a0The Optical Properties Measurements Lab at Surface Optics is a leading supplier of reflectance,\nBRDF, transmittance, solar absorptance and emittance testing services.\n\n### [Portable Reflectometers\n### & Emissometers][67]\n\nPrecise solar reflectance, absorptance, and thermal emittance measurements, offering benchtop-level\naccuracy in a user-friendly handheld design. A touchscreen interface streamlines * [ 1-858-675-7404][1]\n* [ Email Us][2]\n* [ Support][3]\n[[Surface Optics Corporation]][4]\n* [Products][5]\n  * [\n    Lab Reflectometers\n    ][6]\n    * [SOC-100 HDR][7]\n    * [SOC-210 Bidirectional Reflectometer][8]\n  * [\n    410 Series Reflectometers\n    ][9]\n    * [SOC-410 DHR Reflectometer][10]\n    * [410-VIS-IR Reflectometer][11]\n    * [410-Solar Reflectometer][12]\n    * [410-Solar-i Reflectometer][13]\n    * [ET-10 Emissometer][14]\n    * [ET-100 Emissometer][15]\n    * [410-LIDAR Reflectometer][16]\n    * [Custom SOC410 Reflectometers][17]\n    * [Accessories & Maintenance][18]\n  * [\n    Spectral Imaging Systems\n    ][19]\n    * [710 Series Hyperspectral Cameras][20]\n    * [LightShift Multispectral Video][21]\n    * [DuoChrome-SM][22]\n    * [SOC-750 Midwave Infrared][23]\n    * [SOC-760 VNIR-SWIR][24]\n    * [Spectral Imaging Resources][25]\n* [Services][26]\n  * [\n    Optical Properties Measurement Services\n    ][27]\n    * [Spectral Reflectance (HDR)][28]\n    * [Emissivity][29]\n    * [BSDF / Scatter][30]\n    * [Transmittance Measurements][31]\n    * [ASTM Testing][32]\n    * [Solar Reflectance (SRI/TSR)][33]\n    * [Absorptance & Thermal Emittance][34]\n    * [Optical Properties Measurements Database][35]\n  * [\n    Vacuum Deposition Coatings\n    ][36]\n    * [Low Observable / Stealth][37]\n    * [Large Area][38]\n    * [Roll-to-Roll][39]\n    * [Diamond-Like Carbon][40]\n    * [Vacuum Deposited Gold (VDG)][41]\n    * [Anti-Reflection (AR)][42]\n    * [Vacuum Deposited Aluminum (VDA)][43]\n    * [Spaceflight and Thermal Control][44]\n    * [High Reflectance][45]\n  * [\n    Electro-Optics Engineering\n    ][46]\n    * [SBIR / STTR][47]\n* [Applications][48]\n  * [\n    Space\n    ][49]\n  * [\n    Defense\n    ][50]\n  * [\n    [Photovoltaic solar panel in desert]\n    Solar Energy\n    ][51]\n  * [\n    Green Building\n    ][52]\n  * [\n    Agriculture\n    ][53]\n* [News][54]\n  * [Blog][55]\n  * [Publications][56]\n* [About Us][57]\n  * [Our Company][58]\n  * [Company History][59]\n  * [Facilities][60]\n  * [Careers][61]\n  * [Our Team][62]\n  * [International Distributors][63]\n\n# Trusted for 50 Years in Optical Properties Characterization\n\nSurface Optics offers a single engineering and manufacturing source for solutions requiring the\napplication, characterization, or control of the optical properties of surfaces.\n\nFounded in 1977 to provide optical property measurement services, today Surface Optics Corporation\n(SOC) specializes in advanced imaging systems, scientific instruments and thin film vacuum coatings\nfor surface engineering.\n\nSOC is pioneering innovative solutions for our research, aerospace, defense, semiconductor,\nautomotive, and energy customers worldwide.\u00a0\n\n[Services][64]\n[Products][65]\n\n### **Hyperspectral and Multispectral Imaging Systems**\n\nThe SOC-710 hyperspectral imaging system stands out with its unique internal line-scanning design,\nmaking it the most versatile hyperspectral imaging system for researchers available.\n\n### **Advanced Goniometers and Scattering Measurement Services**\n\nThe SOC-210 BDR automates BRDF/BTDF measurements for surfaces, paints, coatings, liquids, and\nparticles, covering a spectral range from 0.35 to 14\u03bcm with interchangeable sources, spectral\nbandpass filters, and detectors for maximum versatility.\n\n### **Vacuum Deposition Coatings\n### and Thin-Film**\n\nOur coatings lab offers large chambers and clean rooms, a custom job environment, one-of-a-kind\ncoating hardware, significant space program heritage, and on-site world-class metrology.\u00a0\n\n### **Optical Properties\n### Measurements Lab**\n\n\u00a0The Optical Properties Measurements Lab at Surface Optics is a leading supplier of reflectance,\nBRDF, transmittance, solar absorptance and emittance testing services.\n\n### **Portable Reflectometers\n### & Emissometers**\n\nPrecise solar reflectance, absorptance, and thermal emittance measurements, offering benchtop-level\naccuracy in a user-friendly handheld design. A touchscreen interface streamlines calibration, sample\nidentification, and data display.\n\n### [Advanced Goniometers and Scattering Measurement Services][66]\n\nThe SOC-210 BDR automates BRDF/BTDF measurements for surfaces, paints, coatings, liquids, and\nparticles, covering a spectral range from 0.35 to 14\u03bcm with interchangeable sources, spectral\nbandpass filters, and detectors for maximum versatility.\n\n### Vacuum Deposition Coatings\n### and Thin-Film\n\nOur coatings lab offers large chambers and clean rooms, a custom job environment, one-of-a-kind\ncoating hardware, significant space program heritage, and on-site world-class metrology.\u00a0\n\n### Optical Properties Measurements Lab\n\n\u00a0The Optical Properties Measurements Lab at Surface Optics is a leading supplier of reflectance,\nBRDF, transmittance, solar absorptance and emittance testing services.\n\n### [Portable Reflectometers\n### & Emissometers][67]\n\nPrecise solar reflectance, absorptance, and thermal emittance measurements, offering benchtop-level\naccuracy in a user-friendly handheld design. A touchscreen interface streamlines calibration, sample\nidentification, and data display.\n\n### [Hyperspectral and Multispectral Imaging Systems][68]\n\nThe SOC710 hyperspectral camera stands out with its unique internal line-scanning design, making it\nthe most versatile hyperspectral imaging system for researchers available.\n\nOver 45 years as the leaders in optical properties characterization\n\nSurface Optics Corporation offers a single engineering and manufacturing source for solutions\nrequiring the application, characterization, or control of the optical properties of surfaces.\n\nFounded in 1977 to provide optical property measurement services, today Surface Optics Corporation\n(SOC) specializes in advanced imaging systems, scientific instruments and thin film vacuum coatings\nfor surface engineering. SOC is pioneering innovative solutions for our research, aerospace,\ndefense, semiconductor, automotive, and energy customers worldwide.\u00a0\n\n[**LEARN MORE ABOUT SOC**][69]\n\n[SOC_Customer_Sandia_National_Lab_Logo][SOC_Customer_NorthropGrumman_Logo][SOC_Customer_Boeing_logo]\n[mit-lincoln-laboratory][SOC_Customer_GE-logo][SOC_Customer_ESA][SOC_Customer_LosAlamos_Logo][SOC_Cu\nstomer_HP_Logo][SOC_Customer_Leidos_Logo][SOC_Customer_John_Hopkins_Logo][SOC_Customers_NASA_Logo][S\nOC_Customer_RDECOM_Logo][SOC_Customer_Lockheed_Martin_logo][SOC_Customer_3M_Logo][SOC_Customer_Gener\nal_Atomics_Logo][SOC_Customer_UCONN_Logo][SOC_Customer_Naval_Research_Laboratory_Logo]\n\nOur Services\n\n## Industry-leading optical measurement, engineering and thin film coating services\n* [\n  [Electro-Optics Engineering