gh-Reflective Coatings][90]\n    * [Dichroic Coatings][91]\n    * [Broadband Dielectric Coated Mirrors][92]\n    * [Narrowband Dielectric Coated Mirrors][93]\n    * [Beam Splitter Coatings][94]\n    * [Polarizing Coatings][95]\n    * [Dielectric Coated Gratings][96]\n    * [Edge Pass Filter Coatings][97]\n    * [Rugate Filter Coatings][98]\n  * [Metallic Coatings][99]\n    * [Metallic Mirror Coatings][100]\n    * [Aluminum Mirror Coatings][101]\n    * [Silver Mirror Coatings][102]\n    * [Gold Metallic Mirror Coatings][103]\n    * [Copper Mirror Coatings][104]\n    * [Enhanced Metal Coatings][105]\n    * [Protective Metal Optical Coatings][106]\n    * [Electroplated Coatings][107]\n    * [Conductive Optical Coatings][108]\n    * [Metallic Nanoparticle Coatings][109]\n    * [Metallic Thin Film Solar Coatings][110]\n    * [Metallic Coatings for Aerospace][111]\n  * [Filter Coatings][112]\n    * [Bandpass Filter Coatings][113]\n    * [Longpass Filter Coatings][114]\n    * [Shortpass Filter Coatings][115]\n    * [Dichroic Filter Coatings][116]\n    * [Neutral Density Filter Coatings][117]\n    * [Notch Filter Coatings][118]\n    * [UV, Visible, IR Filter Coatings][119]\n    * [Polarizing Filter Coatings][120]\n    * [Multi-Band Optical Filter Coatings][121]\n* [Facilities][122]\n  * [Coating Plant][123]\n* [About Us][124]\n* [Blog][125]\n* [Contact Us][126]\n\n# Welcome to India's leading Optics Manufacturing Company\n\nWe are a pioneer in manufacturing and supplying [Optical Lenses][127], Optical Filters, Optical\nMirrors, Optical Prisms, Optical Windows Diffusers, [BeamSplitters][128], [Telecentric Lenses][129],\nand Opto-Mechanical Products & Systems. Check out our product list to make sure you get the right\nproduct at economical prices.\n\n#### \u25cf Optical Lenses\n\nWhether you\u2019re looking to have a simple lens or you want a lens that is suitable for complex\nsystems. As one of the best optics manufacturers & suppliers in India, Accurate Optics is ready to\nserve you an array of optical lenses.\n\n#### \u25cf Optical Filters\n\nAccurate Optics, one of India\u2019s leading optics manufacturers & suppliers, is ready to serve you with\na comprehensive product range. We offer [optical filters][130] \u2013 bandpass filters for selective\npassage of ranges, long pass filters capable of blocking unwanted shorter wavelengths, and short\npass filters capable of blocking unwanted longer wavelengths.\n\n#### \u25cf Optical Mirrors\n\nWant to get your hands on the correct type of optical mirror? We are here to offer you a wide range\nof optical mirrors from flat to copper to focusing to IR and much more.\n\n#### \u25cf Optical Prisms\n\nAs the best optics manufacturing company in India, Accurate Optics is ready to provide you with\nprisms designed with high-grade optical glass materials. Our right-angle prism and other prisms are\npreferred in the optical communication industry.\n\n#### \u25cf Beamsplitters\n\nAccurate Optics is ready to provide you with prisms designed with high-grade optics. As one of the\nbest optics manufacturers & suppliers in India, we use high-grade materials to build beam splitters\nthat split the incident beam of light into two parts. At accurate optics, we use the latest\ntechnologies and techniques to make sure our customers\u2019 needs are satisfied with optical glass\nmaterials. Our right-angle prism and other prisms are preferred in the optical communication\nindustry.\n\n#### \u25cf Parallel Plates & Wedge\n\nWith the help of precise and cutting-edge technologies, our team is known to offer customized\nsolutions to our clients. As the best optics manufacturing company in India, we offer [parallel\nplates and wedges][131] such as Quartz Wedge, Fused Silica Wedge, Wedge windows, and Wedge prism to\ncater to the needs of our clients.\n\n#### \u25cf Windows & Diffusers\n\nAs one of the best optics manufacturers & suppliers in India, we are leaders in supplying [windows\nand diffusers][132] to millions of people. We offer optical windows to help you view the interior of\nthe equipment. Additionally, we supply UV IR diffusers that are made for UV and IR reflectance.\n\n#### \u25cf Imaging Telecentric Lenses\n\nLastly, we offer imaging telecentric lenses built with high quality and top-notch materials. Our\nextensive selection of lenses includes achromatic lenses or aspheric lenses.\n\n### Contact The Best Optics Manufacturers & Supplie"
      }
