        "crawl_text": "About Company\nSince its inception in 1989 we have maintained our focus on the Photonics, bringing best products and services in Indian market from all over the world.\nApart from sales and service business, we are also evolving as a major system integrator in the niche photonics technology.\nProducts\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tServing the Photonics fraternity since 1989\u2026\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tMAKE IN INDIA - FIBER OPTICS EDUCATIONAL KIT\nDesigned and Developed by Advanced Photonics, India\nLearning Basics of Fiber Optics through Experiments Theory to Lab to Applications\nThis kit has been designed by our engineers based on their experience while performing fiber optic related experiments during their post graduate programme in photonics. Unlike most of the project kits available in market, these experiments are not simply plug-in or turn-key type where students just need to vary inputs and record corresponding outputs to plot a graph \u2026.. About Company\nSince its inception in 1989 we have maintained our focus on the Photonics, bringing best products and services in Indian market from all over the world.\nApart from sales and service business, we are also evolving as a major system integrator in the niche photonics technology.\nProducts\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tServing the Photonics fraternity since 1989\u2026\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tMAKE IN INDIA - FIBER OPTICS EDUCATIONAL KIT\nDesigned and Developed by Advanced Photonics, India\nLearning Basics of Fiber Optics through Experiments Theory to Lab to Applications\nThis kit has been designed by our engineers based on their experience while performing fiber optic related experiments during their post graduate programme in photonics. Unlike most of the project kits available in market, these experiments are not simply plug-in or turn-key type where students just need to vary inputs and record corresponding outputs to plot a graph \u2026.. advancedphotonicsindia.com About Company\nSince its inception in 1989 we have maintained our focus on the Photonics, bringing best products and services in Indian market from all over the world.\nApart from sales and service business, we are also evolving as a major system integrator in the niche photonics technology.\nProducts\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tServing the Photonics fraternity since 1989\u2026\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tMAKE IN INDIA - FIBER OPTICS EDUCATIONAL KIT\nDesigned and Developed by Advanced Photonics, India\nLearning Basics of Fiber Optics through Experiments Theory to Lab to Applications\nThis kit has been designed by our engineers based on their experience while performing fiber optic related experiments during their post graduate programme in photonics. Unlike most of the project kits available in market, these experiments are not simply plug-in or turn-key type where students just need to vary inputs and record corresponding outputs to plot a graph \u2026.. About Company\nSince its inception in 1989 we have maintained our focus on the Photonics, bringing best products and services in Indian market from all over the world.\nApart from sales and service business, we are also evolving as a major system integrator in the niche photonics technology.\nProducts\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tServing the Photonics fraternity since 1989\u2026\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tMAKE IN INDIA - FIBER OPTICS EDUCATIONAL KIT\nDesigned and Developed by Advanced Photonics, India\nLearning Basics of Fiber Optics through Experiments Theory to Lab to Applications\nThis kit has been designed by our engineers based on their experience while performing fiber optic related experiments during their post graduate programme in photonics. Unlike most of the project kits available in market, these experiments are not simply plug-in or turn-key type where students just need to vary inputs and record corresponding outputs to plot a graph \u2026.."
