        "crawl_text": "[[agate-sensors-logo]][1]\n* [ Technology ][2]\n* [ Applications ][3]\n* [ About ][4]\n* [ News & Insights ][5]\n[ CONTACT ][6]\n* [ Technology ][7]\n* [ Applications ][8]\n* [ About ][9]\n* [ News & Insights ][10]\n[ CONTACT ][11]\n[as_hero_logo_01]\n\n# The World, Decoded.\n\nHidden information, revealed. Critical insights, delivered.\nUltra-miniaturized hyperspectral intelligence, software-defined and built to go anywhere.\n\n## From defence and autonomous systems to the next generation of intelligent devices, Agate Sensors\u2122\n## delivers the world's first software-defined hyperspectral platform. Lab-grade, chip-scale,\n## mass-manufacturable, and built to unlock entirely new layers of insight across industries.\n\n## Engineered to bring hyperspectral intelligence from the lab to the world.\n\n[Section3_homepage_agatesensors_update]\n* REVOLUTIONARY MINIATURIZATION\n  Lab-grade hyperspectral precision, previously confined to costly, complex, and bulky scientific\n  instruments \u2014 now delivered on a single chip.\n* SOFTWARE-DEFINED\n  One chipset, many applications. Programmable sensing that adapts, evolves, and continuously learns\n  \u2014 driven by AI after it ships.\n* MASS-MANUFACTURABLE\n  Material-agnostic and built on mainstream semiconductor processes \u2014 hyperspectral sensing designed\n  for volume, cost efficiency, and scale.\n* SOLID-STATE. ENGINEERED FOR DEMANDING ENVIRONMENTS\n  No filters, no gratings, no moving parts \u2014 durable, compact, and built to perform where\n  conventional hyperspectral systems cannot.\n[ OUR TECHNOLOGY ][12]\n\n## Beyond data. Instant understanding.\n\n### Defence\n\nSee First. Decide First. Act First.\n\nDetect concealed threats, read spectral signatures, and extend classification range \u2014 achieve\ndecisive advantage where conventional systems fall short.\n\n[ LEARN MORE ][13]\n\n### Imaging\n\nWhat Cameras See Has Just Changed. Forever.\n\nCapture material composition, reveal hidden information, and deliver color accuracy beyond RGB. The\nimaging capability no conventional sensor can match.\n\n[ LEARN MORE ][14]\n\n### Wearables\n\nBuilt to Read the Human Condition.\n\nThree wavelengths were never enough. Hyperspectral sensing delivers accurate vitals, continuous\nblood pressure monitoring, and new biomarker sensing in a single chip.\n\n[ LEARN MORE ][15]\n\n## The next frontier.\n\nFrom automotive and medical to industrial and robotics, the next applications for hyperspectral\nsensing\u00a0are already coming into view.\n\n[ EXPLORE THE POSSIBILITIES ][16]\n[robot_agate_mockup]\n\n## Our latest news & insights\n\n### Meet the Agate Sensors Team at Industry Events in May and June\n\n[ Events ][17]\n28.04.2026\n\n### See You at Mobile World Congress 2026\n\n[ Events ][18]\n25.02.2026\n\n### Agate Sensors wins Swedish Defence Agency Innovation Contract\n\n[ Defence ][19] [ Announcements ][20]\n4.11.2025\n\n### Meet the Agate Sensors Team at Industry Events This Season\n\n[ Events ][21]\n28.10.2025\n[ READ ALL ][22]\n\n### Bring lab-grade hyperspectral intelligence to your next product.\n\nAcross defence, advanced imaging, and wearables,\nour team is ready to discuss what this means for your product roadmap.\n[ BOOK A BRIEFING ][23]\n\n## Stay Connected with Agate Sensors\n\nReceive updates about our breakthrough hyperspectral imaging technology, product developments, and\nexclusive insights delivered straight to your inbox.\n[agate-sensors-logo]\nJoin us as we revolutionize spectral intelligence.\nSITEMAP\n* [ Technology ][24]\n* [ Applications ][25]\n* [ About ][26]\n* [ News & Insights ][27]\n* [ Company Information ][28]\n* [ Media Bank ][29]\n\n[AGATE SENSORS OY\nTiet\u00e4j\u00e4ntie 2 ][30]\n[02130 Espoo ][31]\n[Finland][32]\n\nCopyright Agate Sensors 2026\u00a0- All rights reserved\n* [Cookie Policy][33]\n* [Privacy Policy][34]\n\n[1]: //agatesensors.com?hsLang=en\n[2]: https://www.agatesensors.com/technology\n[3]: https://www.agatesensors.com/applications\n[4]: https://www.agatesensors.com/about\n[5]: https://www.agatesensors.com/blog\n[6]: https://www.agatesensors.com/company?hsLang=en\n[7]: https://www.agatesensors.com/technology\n[8]: https://www.agatesensors.com/applications\n[9]: https://www.agatesensors.com/about\n[10]: https://www.agatesensors.com/blog\n[11]: https://www.agatesensors.com/company?hsLang=en\n[12]: https://www.agatesensors.com/technology?hsLang=en\n[13]: https://www.agatesensors.com/applications?hsLang=en#defence-section\n[14]: https://www.agatesensors.com/applications?hsLang=en#advanced-imaging-section\n[15]: https://www.agatesensors.com/applications?hsLang=en#wearables-section\n[16]: https://www.agatesensors.com/applications?hsLang=en#beyond-section\n[17]: https://www.agatesensors.com/blog/tag/events?hsLang=en\n[18]: https://www.agatesensors.com/blog/tag/events?hsLang=en\n[19]: https://www.agatesensors.com/blog/tag/defence?hsLang=en\n[20]: https://www.agatesensors.com/blog/tag/announcements?hsLang=en\n[21]: https://www.agatesensors.com/blog/tag/events?hsLang=en\n[22]: https://www.agatesensors.com/blog?hsLang=en\n[23]: https://www.agatesensors.com/book-a-briefing?hsLang=en\n[24]: https://www.agatesensors.com/techno [[agate-sensors-logo]][1]\n* [ Technology ][2]\n* [ Applications ][3]\n* [ About ][4]\n* [ News & Insights ][5]\n[ CONTACT ][6]\n* [ Technology ][7]\n* [ Applications ][8]\n* [ About ][9]\n* [ News & Insights ][10]\n[ CONTACT ][11]\n[as_hero_logo_01]\n\n# The World, Decoded.\n\nHidden information, revealed. Critical insights, delivered.\nUltra-miniaturized hyperspectral intelligence, software-defined and built to go anywhere.\n\n## From defence and autonomous systems to the next generation of intelligent devices, Agate Sensors\u2122\n## delivers the world's first software-defined hyperspectral platform. Lab-grade, chip-scale,\n## mass-manufacturable, and built to unlock entirely new layers of insight across industries.\n\n## Engineered to bring hyperspectral intelligence from the lab to the world.\n\n[Section3_homepage_agatesensors_update]\n* REVOLUTIONARY MINIATURIZATION\n  Lab-grade hyperspectral precision, previously confined to costly, complex, and bulky scientific\n  instruments \u2014 now delivered on a single chip.\n* SOFTWARE-DEFINED\n  One chipset, many applications. Programmable sensing that adapts, evolves, and continuously learns\n  \u2014 driven by AI after it ships.\n* MASS-MANUFACTURABLE\n  Material-agnostic and built on mainstream semiconductor processes \u2014 hyperspectral sensing designed\n  for volume, cost efficiency, and scale.\n* SOLID-STATE. ENGINEERED FOR DEMANDING ENVIRONMENTS\n  No filters, no gratings, no moving parts \u2014 durable, compact, and built to perform where\n  conventional hyperspectral systems cannot.\n[ OUR TECHNOLOGY ][12]\n\n## Beyond data. Instant understanding.\n\n### Defence\n\nSee First. Decide First. Act First.\n\nDetect concealed threats, read spectral signatures, and extend classification range \u2014 achieve\ndecisive advantage where conventional systems fall short.\n\n[ LEARN MORE ][13]\n\n### Imaging\n\nWhat Cameras See Has Just Changed. Forever.\n\nCapture material composition, reveal hidden information, and deliver color accuracy beyond RGB. The\nimaging capability no conventional sensor can match.\n\n[ LEARN MORE ][14]\n\n### Wearables\n\nBuilt to Read the Human Condition.\n\nThree wavelengths were never enough. Hyperspectral sensing delivers accurate vitals, continuous\nblood pressure monitoring, and new biomarker sensing in a single chip.\n\n[ LEARN MORE ][15]\n\n## The next frontier.\n\nFrom automotive and medical to industrial and robotics, the next applications for hyperspectral\nsensing\u00a0are already coming into view.\n\n[ EXPLORE THE POSSIBILITIES ][16]\n[robot_agate_mockup]\n\n## Our latest news & insights\n\n### Meet the Agate Sensors Team at Industry Events in May and June\n\n[ Events ][17]\n28.04.2026\n\n### See You at Mobile World Congress 2026\n\n[ Events ][18]\n25.02.2026\n\n### Agate Sensors wins Swedish Defence Agency Innovation Contract\n\n[ Defence ][19] [ Announcements ][20]\n4.11.2025\n\n### Meet the Agate Sensors Team at Industry Events This Season\n\n[ Events ][21]\n28.10.2025\n[ READ ALL ][22]\n\n### Bring lab-grade hyperspectral intelligence to your next product.\n\nAcross defence, advanced imaging, and wearables,\nour team is ready to discuss what this means for your product roadmap.\n[ BOOK A BRIEFING ][23]\n\n## Stay Connected with Agate Sensors\n\nReceive updates about our breakthrough hyperspectral imaging technology, product developments, and\nexclusive insights delivered straight to your inbox.\n[agate-sensors-logo]\nJoin us as we revolutionize spectral intelligence.\nSITEMAP\n* [ Technology ][24]\n* [ Applications ][25]\n* [ About ][26]\n* [ News & Insights ][27]\n* [ Company Information ][28]\n* [ Media Bank ][29]\n\n[AGATE SENSORS OY\nTiet\u00e4j\u00e4ntie 2 ][30]\n[02130 Espoo ][31]\n[Finland][32]\n\nCopyright Agate Sensors 2026\u00a0- All rights reserved\n* [Cookie Policy][33]\n* [Privacy Policy][34]\n\n[1]: //agatesensors.com?hsLang=en\n[2]: https://www.agatesensors.com/technology\n[3]: https://www.agatesensors.com/applications\n[4]: https://www.agatesensors.com/about\n[5]: https://www.agatesensors.com/blog\n[6]: https://www.agatesensors.com/company?hsLang=en\n[7]: https://www.agatesensors.com/technology\n[8]: https://www.agatesensors.com/applications\n[9]: https://www.agatesensors.com/about\n[10]: https://www.agatesensors.com/blog\n[11]: https://www.agatesensors.com/company?hsLang=en\n[12]: https://www.agatesensors.com/technology?hsLang=en\n[13]: https://www.agatesensors.com/applications?hsLang=en#defence-section\n[14]: https://www.agatesensors.com/applications?hsLang=en#advanced-imaging-section\n[15]: https://www.agatesensors.com/applications?hsLang=en#wearables-section\n[16]: https://www.agatesensors.com/applications?hsLang=en#beyond-section\n[17]: https://www.agatesensors.com/blog/tag/events?hsLang=en\n[18]: https://www.agatesensors.com/blog/tag/events?hsLang=en\n[19]: https://www.agatesensors.com/blog/tag/defence?hsLang=en\n[20]: https://www.agatesensors.com/blog/tag/announcements?hsLang=en\n[21]: https://www.agatesensors.com/blog/tag/events?hsLang=en\n[22]: https://www.agatesensors.com/blog?hsLang=en\n[23]: https://www.agatesensors.com/book-a-briefing?hsLang=en\n[24]: https://www.agatesensors.com/technology?hsLang=en\n[25]: https://www.agatesensors.com/applications?hsLang=en\n[26]: https://www.agatesensors.com/about?hsLang=en\n[27]: https://www.agatesensors.com/blog?hsLang=en\n[28]: https://www.agatesensors.com/company?hsLang=en\n[29]: https://www.agatesensors.com/media-bank?hsLang=en\n[30]: https://agatesensors.hs-sites-eu1.com/company?hsLang=en\n[31]: https://agatesensors.hs-sites-eu1.com/company?hsLang=en\n[32]: https://agatesensors.hs-sites-eu1.com/company?hsLang=en\n[33]: https://www.agatesensors.com/cookie-policy?hsLang=en\n[34]: https://www.agatesensors.com/privacy-policy?hsLang=en agatesensors.com [[agate-sensors-logo]][1]\n* [ Technology ][2]\n* [ Applications ][3]\n* [ About ][4]\n* [ News & Insights ][5]\n[ CONTACT ][6]\n* [ Technology ][7]\n* [ Applications ][8]\n* [ About ][9]\n* [ News & Insights ][10]\n[ CONTACT ][11]\n[as_hero_logo_01]\n\n# The World, Decoded.\n\nHidden information, revealed. Critical insights, delivered.\nUltra-miniaturized hyperspectral intelligence, software-defined and built to go anywhere.\n\n## From defence and autonomous systems to the next generation of intelligent devices, Agate Sensors\u2122\n## delivers the world's first software-defined hyperspectral platform. Lab-grade, chip-scale,\n## mass-manufacturable, and built to unlock entirely new layers of insight across industries.\n\n## Engineered to bring hyperspectral intelligence from the lab to the world.\n\n[Section3_homepage_agatesensors_update]\n* REVOLUTIONARY MINIATURIZATION\n  Lab-grade hyperspectral precision, previously confined to costly, compl