        "crawl_text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[[Amphenol Sensors]][2][Markets][3][Solutions][4][Brands][5][About][6]\n[Contact][7]\n\nAmphenol Sensors\n\n# The world's most diverse\n# sensor portfolio.\n\nAmphenol Sensors brings together 25 sensing brands. Start here, find the brand that fits your\napplication, then go straight to their experts.\n\n[Explore our solutions ][8][Meet the brands][9]\n[[NovaSensor]][10][[All Sensors]][11][[Kaye]][12][[Telaire]][13][[Thermometrics]][14][[Exa\nThermometrics]][15][[Piher]][16][[Protimeter]][17][[SGX Sensortech]][18][[SSI\nTechnologies]][19][[Wilcoxon Sensing\nTechnologies]][20][[i2s]][21][[Piezo]][22][[Accumetrics]][23][[Endevco]][24][[IMI\nSensors]][25][[Larson Davis]][26][[The Modal Shop]][27][[PCB\nPiezotronics]][28][[Temposonics]][29][[Airmar]][30][[LID]][31][[MSI]][32][[Marport]][33][[Rochester\nSensors]][34][[NovaSensor]][35][[All\nSensors]][36][[Kaye]][37][[Telaire]][38][[Thermometrics]][39][[Exa\nThermometrics]][40][[Piher]][41][[Protimeter]][42][[SGX Sensortech]][43][[SSI\nTechnologies]][44][[Wilcoxon Sensing\nTechnologies]][45][[i2s]][46][[Piezo]][47][[Accumetrics]][48][[Endevco]][49][[IMI\nSensors]][50][[Larson Davis]][51][[The Modal Shop]][52][[PCB\nPiezotronics]][53][[Temposonics]][54][[Airmar]][55][[LID]][56][[MSI]][57][[Marport]][58][[Rochester\nSensors]][59]\n\nWhat we solve\n\n## Sensing solutions, end to end.\n\nPressure pulses in a turbine. CO\u2082 ppm in a hospital ward. Coolant temperature inside an EV battery\npack. Across 17 solution families, our brands turn the messy analog world into clean, reliable\nsignals \u2014 engineered to outlast the systems they serve.\n\n[\n\n### Pressure\n\nAbsolute, gauge and differential pressure across MEMS and bonded technologies.\n\n][60][\n\n### Temperature\n\nNTC, RTD, thermopile and silicon temperature sensors.\n\n][61][\n\n### Combined Pressure & Temperature\n\nSingle-package combined-mode P&T sensors for hydrogen, hydraulic and HVAC.\n\n][62][\n\n### Vibration & Acoustics\n\nAccelerometers, sound level meters and dynamic measurement.\n\n][63][\n\n### Position\n\nContactless Hall-effect, magnetostrictive and rotary position sensing.\n\n][64][\n\n### Level & Quality\n\nUltrasonic and capacitive fluid level and concentration sensing.\n\n][65][\n\n### Gas & Moisture\n\nNDIR, electrochemical and pellistor gas sensors plus moisture detection.\n\n][66][\n\n### Ultrasonic\n\nUltrasonic transducers for marine, industrial and fluid sensing.\n\n][67][\n\n### Telemetry\n\nWireless rotating-shaft telemetry and condition monitoring.\n\n][68][\n\n### Tire Pressure Monitoring (TPMS)\n\nDirect TPMS sensors for passenger vehicles and commercial fleets.\n\n][69][\n\n### Passive Entry Passive Start (PEPS)\n\nLow-frequency antenna sensors for keyless entry systems.\n\n][70][\n\n### Thermal Validation\n\nWireless thermal mapping and validation for GxP processes.\n\n][71][\n\n### Current\n\nContactless current sensing for power, motor and battery systems.\n\n][72][\n\n### Tilt (Inclination)\n\nInclination and tilt sensing for off-road, construction and industrial equipment.\n\n][73][\n\n### Speed\n\nSpeed and rotation sensing for transmission, motor and powertrain systems.\n\n][74][\n\n### Moisture Meters\n\nHandheld and fixed moisture measurement instruments.\n\n][75][\n\n### Commercial Fishing Solutions\n\nSonar and net-monitoring sensors for commercial fishing.\n\n][76]\n\nWhere we work\n\n## From orbit to operating room.\n\n[All markets ][77]\n[[Automotive]\n\n### Automotive\n\n][78][[Heavy Equipment & Off-Road]\n\n### Heavy Equipment & Off-Road\n\n][79][[Medical]\n\n### Medical\n\n][80][[Data Center]\n\n### Data Center\n\n][81][[HVACR]\n\n### HVACR\n\n][82][[Military]\n\n### Military\n\n][83][[Commercial Aerospace]\n\n### Commercial Aerospace\n\n][84][[Electric Vertical Take-off & Landing]\n\n### Electric Vertical Take-off & Landing\n\n][85]\n[See all markets ][86]\n\nOur brands\n\n## 25 brands.\n\nEach brand brings decades of focused expertise in a specific sensing discipline. Together, they form\nthe broadest sensor portfolio anywhere.\n\n[\n[Amphenol Advanced Sensors logo]\n\nThe umbrella brand that holds Thermometrics, NovaSensor, Telaire, Protimeter, and Kaye.\n\n][87][\n[NovaSensor logo]\n\nMEMS piezoresistive pressure die and packaged sensors for OEM custom integration.\n\n][88][\n[All Sensors logo]\n\nUltra-low-pressure piezoresistive MEMS sensors with patented dual-die board-level technology.\n\n][89][\n[Kaye logo]\n\nThermal validation, calibration and environmental monitoring for GxP-regulated life sciences.\n\n][90][\n[Telaire logo]\n\nNDIR CO\u2082, humidity-temperature, VOC and particulate sensors for indoor air-quality applications.\n\n][91][\n[Thermometrics logo]\n\nNTC and PTC thermistors, RTDs, thermocouples and custom temperature sensor assemblies.\n\n][92][\n[Exa Thermometrics logo]\n\nNTC thermistors and custom temperature assemblies for high-volume OEM applications.\n\n][93][\n[Piher logo]\n\nContactless position, speed, tilt and current sensors for harsh-environment applications.\n\n][94][\n[Protimeter logo]\n\nMoisture meters, hygrometers and humidity instruments for restoration and building diagnostics.\n\n][95][\n[SGX Sensortech logo]\n\nIndustrial gas detec [Skip to main content][1]\n[[Amphenol Sensors]][2][Markets][3][Solutions][4][Brands][5][About][6]\n[Contact][7]\n\nAmphenol Sensors\n\n# The world's most diverse\n# sensor portfolio.\n\nAmphenol Sensors brings together 25 sensing brands. Start here, find the brand that fits your\napplication, then go straight to their experts.\n\n[Explore our solutions ][8][Meet the brands][9]\n[[NovaSensor]][10][[All Sensors]][11][[Kaye]][12][[Telaire]][13][[Thermometrics]][14][[Exa\nThermometrics]][15][[Piher]][16][[Protimeter]][17][[SGX Sensortech]][18][[SSI\nTechnologies]][19][[Wilcoxon Sensing\nTechnologies]][20][[i2s]][21][[Piezo]][22][[Accumetrics]][23][[Endevco]][24][[IMI\nSensors]][25][[Larson Davis]][26][[The Modal Shop]][27][[PCB\nPiezotronics]][28][[Temposonics]][29][[Airmar]][30][[LID]][31][[MSI]][32][[Marport]][33][[Rochester\nSensors]][34][[NovaSensor]][35][[All\nSensors]][36][[Kaye]][37][[Telaire]][38][[Thermometrics]][39][[Exa\nThermometrics]][40][[Piher]][41][[Protimeter]][42][[SGX Sensortech]][43][[SSI\nTechnologies]][44][[Wilcoxon Sensing\nTechnologies]][45][[i2s]][46][[Piezo]][47][[Accumetrics]][48][[Endevco]][49][[IMI\nSensors]][50][[Larson Davis]][51][[The Modal Shop]][52][[PCB\nPiezotronics]][53][[Temposonics]][54][[Airmar]][55][[LID]][56][[MSI]][57][[Marport]][58][[Rochester\nSensors]][59]\n\nWhat we solve\n\n## Sensing solutions, end to end.\n\nPressure pulses in a turbine. CO\u2082 ppm in a hospital ward. Coolant temperature inside an EV battery\npack. Across 17 solution families, our brands turn the messy analog world into clean, reliable\nsignals \u2014 engineered to outlast the systems they serve.\n\n[\n\n### Pressure\n\nAbsolute, gauge and differential pressure across MEMS and bonded technologies.\n\n][60][\n\n### Temperature\n\nNTC, RTD, thermopile and silicon temperature sensors.\n\n][61][\n\n### Combined Pressure & Temperature\n\nSingle-package combined-mode P&T sensors for hydrogen, hydraulic and HVAC.\n\n][62][\n\n### Vibration & Acoustics\n\nAccelerometers, sound level meters and dynamic measurement.\n\n][63][\n\n### Position\n\nContactless Hall-effect, magnetostrictive and rotary position sensing.\n\n][64][\n\n### Level & Quality\n\nUltrasonic and capacitive fluid level and concentration sensing.\n\n][65][\n\n### Gas & Moisture\n\nNDIR, electrochemical and pellistor gas sensors plus moisture detection.\n\n][66][\n\n### Ultrasonic\n\nUltrasonic transducers for marine, industrial and fluid sensing.\n\n][67][\n\n### Telemetry\n\nWireless rotating-shaft telemetry and condition monitoring.\n\n][68][\n\n### Tire Pressure Monitoring (TPMS)\n\nDirect TPMS sensors for passenger vehicles and commercial fleets.\n\n][69][\n\n### Passive Entry Passive Start (PEPS)\n\nLow-frequency antenna sensors for keyless entry systems.\n\n][70][\n\n### Thermal Validation\n\nWireless thermal mapping and validation for GxP processes.\n\n][71][\n\n### Current\n\nContactless current sensing for power, motor and battery systems.\n\n][72][\n\n### Tilt (Inclination)\n\nInclination and tilt sensing for off-road, construction and industrial equipment.\n\n][73][\n\n### Speed\n\nSpeed and rotation sensing for transmission, motor and powertrain systems.\n\n][74][\n\n### Moisture Meters\n\nHandheld and fixed moisture measurement instruments.\n\n][75][\n\n### Commercial Fishing Solutions\n\nSonar and net-monitoring sensors for commercial fishing.\n\n][76]\n\nWhere we work\n\n## From orbit to operating room.\n\n[All markets ][77]\n[[Automotive]\n\n### Automotive\n\n][78][[Heavy Equipment & Off-Road]\n\n### Heavy Equipment & Off-Road\n\n][79][[Medical]\n\n### Medical\n\n][80][[Data Center]\n\n### Data Center\n\n][81][[HVACR]\n\n### HVACR\n\n][82][[Military]\n\n### Military\n\n][83][[Commercial Aerospace]\n\n### Commercial Aerospace\n\n][84][[Electric Vertical Take-off & Landing]\n\n### Electric Vertical Take-off & Landing\n\n][85]\n[See all markets ][86]\n\nOur brands\n\n## 25 brands.\n\nEach brand brings decades of focused expertise in a specific sensing discipline. Together, they form\nthe broadest sensor portfolio anywhere.\n\n[\n[Amphenol Advanced Sensors logo]\n\nThe umbrella brand that holds Thermometrics, NovaSensor, Telaire, Protimeter, and Kaye.\n\n][87][\n[NovaSensor logo]\n\nMEMS piezoresistive pressure die and packaged sensors for OEM custom integration.\n\n][88][\n[All Sensors logo]\n\nUltra-low-pressure piezoresistive MEMS sensors with patented dual-die board-level technology.\n\n][89][\n[Kaye logo]\n\nThermal validation, calibration and environmental monitoring for GxP-regulated life sciences.\n\n][90][\n[Telaire logo]\n\nNDIR CO\u2082, humidity-temperature, VOC and particulate sensors for indoor air-quality applications.\n\n][91][\n[Thermometrics logo]\n\nNTC and PTC thermistors, RTDs, thermocouples and custom temperature sensor assemblies.\n\n][92][\n[Exa Thermometrics logo]\n\nNTC thermistors and custom temperature assemblies for high-volume OEM applications.\n\n][93][\n[Piher logo]\n\nContactless position, speed, tilt and current sensors for harsh-environment applications.\n\n][94][\n[Protimeter logo]\n\nMoisture meters, hygrometers and humidity instruments for restoration and building diagnostics.\n\n][95][\n[SGX Sensortech logo]\n\nIndustrial gas detection sensors across infrared, electrochemical, pellistor, PID, metal-oxide and\noxygen technologies.\n\n][96][\n[SSI Technologies logo]\n\nUltrasonic level and fluid-quality, piezoresistive pressure, and magnetic speed and position sensors\nfor OEMs.\n\n][97][\n[Wilcoxon Sensing Technologies logo]\n\nIndustrial accelerometers, hydrophones and 4\u201320 mA transmitters for predictive maintenance and naval\napplications.\n\n][98][\n[i2s logo]\n\nStainless-steel pressure and combined pressure\u2013temperature sensors for harsh fluid systems.\n\n][99][\n[Piezo logo]\n\nPiezoelectric ceramics, single crystals and composites for custom ultrasonic transducers.\n\n][100][\n[Accumetrics logo]\n\nWireless rotor telemetry for measurements on rotating shafts and moving machinery.\n\n][101][\n[Endevco logo]\n\nPrecision accelerometers and dynamic pressure sensors for the most extreme test environments.\n\n][102][\n[IMI Sensors logo]\n\nIndustrial vibration sensors, transmitters and switches for plant-floor predictive maintenance.\n\n][103][\n[Larson Davis logo]\n\nSound level meters, dosimeters and acoustic measurement systems for occupational, environmental and\naudiometric work.\n\n][104][\n[The Modal Shop logo]\n\nSensor calibration, modal excitation and structural-test solutions for vibration and acoustic\nlaboratories.\n\n][105][\n[PCB Piezotronics logo]\n\nPiezoelectric and MEMS sensors and instrumentation for vibration, shock, pressure, force and\nacoustic test.\n\n][106][\n[Temposonics logo]\n\nMagnetostrictive linear position sensors and liquid-level transmitters for industrial and process\napplications.\n\n][107][\n[Airmar logo]\n\nUltrasonic transducers for marine sensing, weather instrumentation and industrial flow and level.\n\n][108][\n[LID logo]\n\nWireless automotive sensing \u2014 tire-pressure monitoring, passive entry/start, immobilization and\ntelematics.\n\n][109][\n[MSI logo]\n\nPiezocomposite sonar transducers and arrays for defense and commercial underwater acoustics.\n\n][110][\n[Marport logo]\n\nWireless acoustic catch-monitoring sensors and sonar "
