        "crawl_text": "New this month: Discover top leaders with powerful new people search. Enrich your AI agents with our\ndata via MCP, now with native support for Copilot and Excel. [ Learn more \u2192 ][1]\n\n[ Skip to content][2]\n[ [CB Insights Logo] ][3]\n[ AI & Agents ][4]\n\n### Tools\n* [\n  Strategy Terminal\n  \n  Predictive AI web app for company discovery, analysis, and tracking\n  \n  ][5]\n* [\n  Mobile app\n  \n  Predictive AI on your phone\n  \n  ][6]\n* [\n  Browser Extension\n  \n  Analyzes companies (and more) while you view their website\n  \n  ][7]\n\n### Agents\n* [\n  Team of Agents\n  \n  Available for company scouting, due diligence, new business acquisition, M&A, and more. In our\n  Strategy Terminal or standalone.\n  \n  ][8]\n\n### Key Features\n* [\n  ChatCBI\u2122\n  \n  Strategy LLM powered with our predictive data and analysis \u2014 the most powerful way to use our\n  tools\n  \n  ][9]\n* [\n  Company Analysis\n  \n  Set of agents to analyze companies and their investor and commercial relationships\n  \n  ][10]\n* [\n  Company profiles \u2014 12M+\n  \n  Predictive intelligence data. Double verified.\n  \n  ][11]\n* [\n  Tech market rankings \u2014 1,600+ markets\n  \n  Ranks market entrants. Compare win reasons, execution, funding, and more.\n  \n  ][12]\n* [\n  Intelligent Watchlists and Alerts\n  \n  Insight before you ask\n  \n  ][13]\n\n### Security\n* [\n  Security and privacy\n  \n  SOC 2, GDPR, and more. No training on your data.\n  \n  ][14]\n\n[ Data ][15]\n\n### Predictive\n* [\n  Mosaic Score\n  \n  Health and growth potential \u2014 with sub-scores on growth, financial strength, industry health, and\n  management team strength\n  \n  ][16]\n* [\n  Commercial Maturity\n  \n  Ability to compete and partner\n  \n  ][17]\n* [\n  Exit Probability\n  \n  Broken out by IPO and M&A\n  \n  ][18]\n* [\n  Customer Sentiment\n  \n  Client satisfaction scores and likelihood to renew\n  \n  ][19]\n* [\n  Tech market rankings \u2014 1,600+ markets\n  \n  Ranks, scores, and compares entrants\n  \n  ][20]\n* [\n  Business relationships \u2014 customer, partner, vendor\n  \n  Reveals strategy and sales opps\n  \n  ][21]\n\n### Financial\n* [\n  Funding and valuations\n  \n  Comprehensive history for companies and investors\n  \n  ][22]\n* [\n  Private company revenues\n  \n  Sourced direct from startups and public and non-public sources\n  \n  ][23]\n* [\n  Public company financials\n  \n  Earnings, stock performance, financials, and more\n  \n  ][24]\n\n### Research\n* [\n  Advanced human-led research\n  \n  Expert analyst team covering key industries and tech\n  \n  ][25]\n\n### Foundational\n* [\n  Taxonomies\n  \n  Competitor, market, business model, and more\n  \n  ][26]\n* [\n  Firmographics \u2014 12M+ private companies\n  \n  Hard-to-find data from startups, customers, and investors \u2014 plus public and non-public sources\n  worldwide\n  \n  ][27]\n* [\n  Media and patents\n  \n  Tracking and historical database\n  \n  ][28]\n* [\n  Transcripts \u2014 analyst briefings, startup customer interviews\n  \n  Straight to the source. Includes briefing materials.\n  \n  ][29]\n\n[ MCP & Integrations ][30]\n* [\n  MCP integration\n  \n  Connect our data to your LLM\n  \n  ][31]\n* [\n  Developer Portal\n  \n  Start building today\n  \n  ][32]\n* [\n  API & data feeds\n  \n  Double-verified, continually refreshed\n  \n  ][33]\n* [\n  Microsoft 365 Copilot\n  \n  A pre-built connector to bring our data to life in Copilot and Copilot agents\n  \n  ][34]\n* [\n  Snowflake\n  \n  Accessible in Snowflake and optimized for use with AI\n  \n  ][35]\n* [\n  Salesforce CRM\n  \n  Add CB Insights data to Salesforce records and agents\n  \n  ][36]\n* [\n  A2A & MCP support\n  \n  Make your AI smarter with our data and tools\n  \n  ][37]\n[ Solutions ][38]\n* [\n  Corporate venture capital\n  ][39]\n* [\n  Sales & biz dev\n  ][40]\n* [\n  M&A\n  ][41]\n* [\n  Venture capital\n  ][42]\n* [\n  Product strateg