        "crawl_text": "top of page\n[logo1E.jpg]\n\n# Where shopping is a pleasure!\n\nWhatsApp your Order\n\nWant to avoid the queue?\n\n\u00a0\n\nSend us or your order on WhatsApp and we'll keep it ready at the pick up counter.\u00a0\n\nTap to WhatsApp\n\n## What we sell\n\n[fruits square.PNG]\n\n### Fruits & Vegetables\n\n[Grocery square.PNG]\n\n### Grocery & Staples\n\n[Chicken Square.PNG]\n\n### Poultry\n\n[Fish Square.PNG]\n\n### Fish\n\n[Beef Square.PNG]\n\n### Meats\n\n[Cooked food.jpg]\n\n### Cooked Food\n\n[Dairy Square.jpg]\n\n### Dairy\n\n[Liquor square 2.PNG]\n\n### Liquor & Beverages\n\n[32.jpg]\n\n### Daily Essentials\n\n[Pet Food.jpg]\n\n### Pet Food\n\n[Tools and Hardware.jpg]\n\n### Tools & Harware\n\n[Kitchen Appliances.jpg]\n\n### Kitchen Appliances\n\n[Sports.jpg]\n\n### Sports Equipment, Toys & Games\n\n[Stationery square.PNG]\n\n### Stationery\n\n[Cookware.jpg]\n\n### Cookware, Crockery & Glassware\n\n## What our customers say\n\n## \"A lifesaver!\"\n\nA life saver in Porvorim! A tidy little import section, but the real gem is the fresh meats, and the\npre-cooked foods. There's really nothing you can't find; tools and BBQ grills included!\n\n## \"Helpful staff.\"\n\nWell stocked, neatly organised and helpful staff. The vegetables, meat and fish sections are\nexcellent. Fresh Goan speciality snacks, breads and cooked dishes. Also offers a wide variety of\nalcohol at fair prices, plus kitchenware and gardening tools. No discounts, but decent pricing\nconsidering the quality and ambience. Best supermarket in Porvorim by far!\n\n## \"I loved this place!\"\n\nVery convenient and nice super market, All kinds of daily products are available here. You can even\nget wine and beers here.\n\nI loved this place!\n\n## Contact us\n\nPhone\n\nPorvorim: [+91-7447780222][1]\n\nCandolim: [+91-7774001168][2]\n\nTaleigao: \u00a0[+91-8956857204][3]\n\nEmail\n\n[delfinosgoa@gmail.com][4]\n\nHours of Operation\n\nPorvorim: 7am - 10pm\n\nCandolim: 7am - 10pm\n\nTaleigao:\u00a0 \u00a07am - 10pm\n* [[White Facebook Icon]][5]\n* [[White Instagram Icon]][6]\n\nbottom of page\n\n[1]: tel:+91-7447780222\n[2]: tel:+91-7774001168\n[3]: tel:+91-8956857204\n[4]: mailto:delfinosgoa@gmail.com\n[5]: https://www.facebook.com/delfinosmegamart/\n[6]: https://www.instagram.com/delfinos_goa/ top of page\n[logo1E.jpg]\n\n# Where shopping is a pleasure!\n\nWhatsApp your Order\n\nWant to avoid the queue?\n\n\u00a0\n\nSend us or your order on WhatsApp and we'll keep it ready at the pick up counter.\u00a0\n\nTap to WhatsApp\n\n## What we sell\n\n[fruits square.PNG]\n\n### Fruits & Vegetables\n\n[Grocery square.PNG]\n\n### Grocery & Staples\n\n[Chicken Square.PNG]\n\n### Poultry\n\n[Fish Square.PNG]\n\n### Fish\n\n[Beef Square.PNG]\n\n### Meats\n\n[Cooked food.jpg]\n\n### Cooked Food\n\n[Dairy Square.jpg]\n\n### Dairy\n\n[Liquor square 2.PNG]\n\n### Liquor & Beverages\n\n[32.jpg]\n\n### Daily Essentials\n\n[Pet Food.jpg]\n\n### Pet Food\n\n[Tools and Hardware.jpg]\n\n### Tools & Harware\n\n[Kitchen Appliances.jpg]\n\n### Kitchen Appliances\n\n[Sports.jpg]\n\n### Sports Equipment, Toys & Games\n\n[Stationery square.PNG]\n\n### Stationery\n\n[Cookware.jpg]\n\n### Cookware, Crockery & Glassware\n\n## What our customers say\n\n## \"A lifesaver!\"\n\nA life saver in Porvorim! A tidy little import section, but the real gem is the fresh meats, and the\npre-cooked foods. There's really nothing you can't find; tools and BBQ grills included!\n\n## \"Helpful staff.\"\n\nWell stocked, neatly organised and helpful staff. The vegetables, meat and fish sections are\nexcellent. Fresh Goan speciality snacks, breads and cooked dishes. Also offers a wide variety of\nalcohol at fair prices, plus kitchenware and gardening tools. No discounts, but decent pricing\nconsidering the quality and ambience. Best supermarket in Porvorim by far!\n\n## \"I loved this place!\"\n\nVery convenient and nice super market, All kinds of daily products are available here. You can even\nget