 \n  ][73]\n  \n  See how the XLS-1 Ultrasonic Level Sensor can stand up to oil, harsh chemicals, shock, and\n  vibration.\n* [\n  \n  ### Fluidic Systems Brochure\n  \n  \n  ][74]\n  \n  Understand the many solutions that Gems\u2122 Solutions and Controls can provide for various\n  applications.\n* [\n  \n  ### LED SureSite\u00ae Product Guide\n  \n  \n  ][75]\n  \n  View the wide range of competitive advantages the LED SureSite\u00ae has to offer.\n* [\n  \n  ### 3600 Series Product Guide\n  \n  \n  ][76]\n  \n  Learn more about how solid-state pressure switches offer exceptional stability and configurability\n  in demanding applications.\n* [\n  \n  ### Medical Fluidic Handling Solutions\n  \n  \n  ][77]\n  \n  Download the fluid handling solutions brochure to see how Gems is partnering with some of the\n  world\u2019s leading medical device OEMs to deliver custom solutions for complex design challenges.\n\n* *\n\n## [About Gems Sensors & Controls][78]\n\nFor 60 years, Gems Sensors & Controls has designed and manufactured a broad range of liquid level,\nflow and pressure sensors, switches, miniature solenoid valves, and preassembled fluidic systems.\nGems is a division of Fortive Corporation, a Fortune 500 company with global presence.\n\nTo ensure rapid customer response, the company manufactures its products via three, fully equipped\nISO certified facilities located in North America, Europe, and Asia, shipping over\u00a05 million sensors\nannually. These facilities are further supported by a number of local sales, engineering and service\noffices.\n\nFind out why leading OEMs, including Siemens, BMW, Draeger, Manitou, and many others have placed\ntheir trust in Gems.\n\nContact us today for a free application assessment.\n\n[Capabilities][79] [Read More \u00bb][80]\n* [OEM Fluid Handling Solutions][81]\n* [Complete Standard Product Catalog][82]\n* [Design Engineering Services][83]\n* [Custom Solutions][84]\n* [3-D Models][85]\n* [How To Buy][86]\n\n## [Contact