        "crawl_text": "[ GW CONSULTING ][1]\n[ GW EVENTS ][2]\n[ ABOUT US ][3]\n\n## Vision\n\n## Making a Difference through Geospatial Knowledge and Space Infrastructure in World Economy and\n## Society.\n\n## Our Mission\n\n## Advancing Knowledge for Sustainability\n\n## Approach\n\n## Evangelism, Advocacy, Facilitation, and Amplification of adoption of space and geospatial\n## technology across mainstream industries, and thereby improving Productivity, Efficiency,\n## Transparency, and Compliance, and contributing to \u2018Sustainability of Everything\u2019 at national,\n## regional, and global levels\n\n## Vision\n\n## Making a Difference through Space Infrastructure and Geospatial Knowledge in World Economy and\n## Society\n\n## Our Mission\n\n## Advancing Knowledge for Sustainability\n\n## Approach\n\n## Evangelism, Advocacy, Facilitation, and Amplification of adoption of space and geospatial\n## technology across mainstream industries, and thereby improving Productivity, Efficiency,\n## Transparency, and Compliance, and contributing to **\u2018Sustainability of Everything\u2019** at national,\n## regional, and global levels.\n\n## 100+\n\n## Trusted Professionals\n\n## 50+\n\n## Industry Reports\n\n## 27+\n\n## Years of Expertise\n\n## 10+\n\n## Annual Events\n\nOur Divisions\n\n## EVENTS\n\n## A thought leadership platform offering market directions, collaborative opportunities, business\n## development interface amongst policy makers, users, technology providers, and mainstream\n## leadership.\n\n## Products & Services\n* **Flagship Events**: Geospatial World Forum, GeoSmart India\n* **Business**: GeoBuiz Summit\n* **Policy**: GeoGov Summit, Geospatial Artha Summit\n* **Thematic**: Indo-Pacific GeoIntelligence, AEC Forum\n\n[ DISCOVER OUR EVENTS ][4]\n\n## CONSULTING\n\n## A knowledge platform enhancing policies, processes, and practices of geospatial and space\n## technologies through undertaking market research, socio-economic analysis, and consulting\n## services.\n\n## Products & Services\n* Syndicate Reports\n* Geospatial Resource Platform\n* Consulting Services\n* Policy and Strategy Advocacy\n\n[ DISCOVER KNOWLEDGE HUB ][5]\n\n## COMMUNICATIONS\n\n## A pre-eminent source of quality information, insights and analysis of contemporary global\n## geospatial technology trends and business directions.\n\n## Products & Services\n* GW Prime Live\n* GW Media Website\n\n[ EXPLORE GW PRIME ][6]\n\n## EVENTS\n\n## A thought leadership platform offering market directions, collaborative opportunities, business\n## development interface amongst policy makers, users, technology providers, and mainstream\n## leadership.\n\n## Products & Services\n* **Flagship Events**: Geospatial World Forum, GeoSmart India\n* **Business**: GeoBuiz Summit\n* **Policy**: GeoGov Summit, Geospatial Artha Summit\n* **Thematic**: Indo-Pacific GeoIntelligence, AEC Forum\n\n[ DISCOVER OUR EVENTS ][7]\n\n## CONSULTING\n\n## A knowledge platform enhancing policies, processes, and practices of geospatial and space\n## technologies through undertaking market research, socio-economic analysis, and consulting\n## services.\n\n## Products & Services\n* Syndicate Reports\n* Geospatial Resource Platform\n* Consulting Services\n* Policy and Strategy Advocacy\n\n[ DISCOVER KNOWLEDGE HUB ][8]\nOur Partners\nIndustry Focus\nGeospatial Knowledge Infrastructure\n\n##### Geospatial Knowledge Infrastructure provides a blueprint to integrate digital economies,\n##### societies and citizens with geospatial approaches, data and technologies and in doing so,\n##### deliver the location-based knowledge, services and automation expected in the 4IR age.\n\nArchitecture Engineering and Construction (AEC)\n\n##### The integration of geospatial and engineering solutions, including Building Information\n##### Modelling (BIM), offers a comprehensive context for the AEC industry. At Geospatial World, our\n##### team of consultants, which includes architects, engineers, and urban planners, advise leading\n##### AEC firms with market intelligence on technology maturity, digital transformation and the\n##### adoption of data-driven models. Through strategic guidance and innovative solutions, we\n##### empower the AEC industry to enhance efficiency, precision, and overall project outcomes with\n##### the use of technology.\n\nLocation and Business Intelligence\n\n##### Location forms a major component of all data collected today, and with increased investment in\n##### geolocation infrastructure, it is set to be the cornerstone of Business Intelligence. Today,\n##### advanced analytics reveal rich insights that were previously unattainable in sectors such as\n##### banking, financial services and insurance, real estate, supply chain and logistics, etc. At\n##### Geospatial World, we harness our expertise with location systems and industry relationships,\n##### along with rigorous data analysis, to bring actionable intelligence to our partners. Through\n##### consulting services and events, we provide the necessary insights to help organizations\n##### leverage location data for improved decision-making and strategic planning.\n\nAutonomy and Robotics [ GW CONSULTING ][1]\n[ GW EVENTS ][2]\n[ ABOUT US ][3]\n\n## Vision\n\n## Making a Difference through Geospatial Knowledge and Space Infrastructure in World Economy and\n## Society.\n\n## Our Mission\n\n## Advancing Knowledge for Sustainability\n\n## Approach\n\n## Evangelism, Advocacy, Facilitation, and Amplification of adoption of space and geospatial\n## technology across mainstream industries, and thereby improving Productivity, Efficiency,\n## Transparency, and Compliance, and contributing to \u2018Sustainability of Everything\u2019 at national,\n## regional, and global levels\n\n## Vision\n\n## Making a Difference through Space Infrastructure and Geospatial Knowledge in World Economy and\n## Society\n\n## Our Mission\n\n## Advancing Knowledge for Sustainability\n\n## Approach\n\n## Evangelism, Advocacy, Facilitation, and Amplification of adoption of space and geospatial\n## technology across mainstream industries, and thereby improving Productivity, Efficiency,\n## Transparency, and Compliance, and contributing to **\u2018Sustainability of Everything\u2019** at national,\n## regional, and global levels.\n\n## 100+\n\n## Trusted Professionals\n\n## 50+\n\n## Industry Reports\n\n## 27+\n\n## Years of Expertise\n\n## 10+\n\n## Annual Events\n\nOur Divisions\n\n## EVENTS\n\n## A thought leadership platform offering market directions, collaborative opportunities, business\n## development interface amongst policy makers, users, technology providers, and mainstream\n## leadership.\n\n## Products & Services\n* **Flagship Events**: Geospatial World Forum, GeoSmart India\n* **Business**: GeoBuiz Summit\n* **Policy**: GeoGov Summit, Geospatial Artha Summit\n* **Thematic**: Indo-Pacific GeoIntelligence, AEC Forum\n\n[ DISCOVER OUR EVENTS ][4]\n\n## CONSULTING\n\n## A knowledge platform enhancing policies, processes, and practices of geospatial and space\n## technologies through undertaking market research, socio-economic analysis, and consulting\n## services.\n\n## Products & Services\n* Syndicate Reports\n* Geospatial Resource Platform\n* Consulting Services\n* Policy and Strategy Advocacy\n\n[ DISCOVER KNOWLEDGE HUB ][5]\n\n## COMMUNICATIONS\n\n## A pre-eminent source of quality information, insights and analysis of contemporary global\n## geospatial technology trends and business directions.\n\n## Products & Services\n* GW Prime Live\n* GW Media Website\n\n[ EXPLORE GW PRIME ][6]\n\n## EVENTS\n\n## A thought leadership platform offering market directions, collaborative opportunities, business\n## development interface amongst policy makers, users, technology providers, and mainstream\n## leadership.\n\n## Products & Services\n* **Flagship Events**: Geospatial World Forum, GeoSmart India\n* **Business**: GeoBuiz Summit\n* **Policy**: GeoGov Summit, Geospatial Artha Summit\n* **Thematic**: Indo-Pacific GeoIntelligence, AEC Forum\n\n[ DISCOVER OUR EVENTS ][7]\n\n## CONSULTING\n\n## A knowledge platform enhancing policies, processes, and practices of geospatial and space\n## technologies through undertaking market research, socio-economic analysis, and consulting\n## services.\n\n## Products & Services\n* Syndicate Reports\n* Geospatial Resource Platform\n* Consulting Services\n* Policy and Strategy Advocacy\n\n[ DISCOVER KNOWLEDGE HUB ][8]\nOur Partners\nIndustry Focus\nGeospatial Knowledge Infrastructure\n\n##### Geospatial Knowledge Infrastructure provides a blueprint to integrate digital economies,\n##### societies and citizens with geospatial approaches, data and technologies and in doing so,\n##### deliver the location-based knowledge, services and automation expected in the 4IR age.\n\nArchitecture Engineering and Construction (AEC)\n\n##### The integration of geospatial and engineering solutions, including Building Information\n##### Modelling (BIM), offers a comprehensive context for the AEC industry. At Geospatial World, our\n##### team of consultants, which includes architects, engineers, and urban planners, advise leading\n##### AEC firms with market intelligence on technology maturity, digital transformation and the\n##### adoption of data-driven models. Through strategic guidance and innovative solutions, we\n##### empower the AEC industry to enhance efficiency, precision, and overall project outcomes with\n##### the use of technology.\n\nLocation and Business Intelligence\n\n##### Location forms a major component of all data collected today, and with increased investment in\n##### geolocation infrastructure, it is set to be the cornerstone of Business Intelligence. Today,\n##### advanced analytics reveal rich insights that were previously unattainable in sectors such as\n##### banking, financial services and insurance, real estate, supply chain and logistics, etc. At\n##### Geospatial World, we harness our expertise with location systems and industry relationships,\n##### along with rigorous data analysis, to bring actionable intelligence to our partners. Through\n##### consulting services and events, we provide the necessary insights to help organizations\n##### leverage location data for improved decision-making and strategic planning.\n\nAutonomy and Robotics\n\n##### Geospatial World is at the forefront of communicating the value of the digital revolution by\n##### integrating geospatial elements into all aspects of data generation. Through our consulting\n##### services and thought leadership events, we provide insights into how vast amounts of big data,\n##### leveraged by Machine Learning algorithms, can deliver intelligent, smart solutions. These\n##### advancements drive innovation across various sectors, including mobility, targeted marketing,\n##### traffic management, and agriculture.\n\nEnvironmental, Social and Governance (ESG)\n\n##### ESG frameworks have become essential at local, regional, national, and global levels covering\n##### a broad spectrum of issues, including environmental conservation, social equity, climate\n##### change mitigation, ethical business practices, and sustainable development. Geospatial\n##### technologies play a vital role in the ESG landscape by providing location intelligence,\n##### enhancing the accuracy and effectiveness of sustainability and social impact initiatives.\n##### Through our ESG unit, Geospatial World offers consulting services and hosts events to guide\n##### organizations in integrating geospatial solutions into their ESG strategies. We empower the\n##### development community and other stakeholders to make informed, data-driven decisions for a\n##### more sustainable and equitable future.\n\n##### \u00a0\n\nGeospatial Knowledge Infrastructure\nArchitecture, Engineering and Construction\nLocation and Business Intelligence\nAutonomy and Robotics\nEnvironmental, Social and Governance\nGeospatial Knowledge Infrastructure\nGeospatial Knowledge Infrastructure\nGeospatial Knowledge Infrastructure provides a blueprint to integrate digital economies, societies\nand citizens with geospatial approaches, data and technologies and in doing so, deliver the\nlocation-based knowledge, services and automation expected in the 4IR age.\nArchitecture, Engineering and Construction\nArchitecture Engineering and Constructi"
