        "crawl_text": "top of page\n[\n][1]\n* [\n  \n  Company\n  \n  ][2]\n  * [Greetings][3]\n  * [About Us][4]\n  * [CI][5]\n  * [History][6]\n* [\n  \n  Technology\n  \n  ][7]\n  * [About HSI][8]\n  * [Spectral range][9]\n  * [Hypergram HSI][10]\n* [\n  \n  Applications\n  \n  ][11]\n  * [Semiconductor][12]\n  * [Display][13]\n  * [Electronics][14]\n  * [Battery][15]\n  * [Cosmetics][16]\n  * [Pharmaceutics][17]\n  * [Recycling][18]\n  * [Food Quality][19]\n  * [Agriculture][20]\n* [\n  \n  Careers\n  \n  ][21]\n  * [About our team][22]\n  * [Join our team][23]\n* [\n  \n  News\n  \n  ][24]\n* [\n  \n  Contact\n  \n  ][25]\n* More\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\n\n## Beyond\n## Human Visibility\n\n## in Automation Machinery Manufacturing\n\n## HYPERGRAM\n\n## Hyperspectral Imaging Solution\n\n## Hypergram Inc.\n\n##### Hypergram Inc. is a leading provider of next-generation machine vision solutions based on\n##### hyperspectral imaging technology capable of automatically detecting even invisible defects. We\n##### offer industrial-grade hyperspectral machine vision cameras and AI-based hyperspectral image\n##### analysis software solutions for non-destructive and automated inspections across industries\n##### such as manufacturing, food, recycling, and life sciences. Through hyperspectral imaging-based\n##### machine vision, Hypergram aims to automatically identify defects that are undetectable by the\n##### human eye or conventional cameras, capturing high-precision hyperspectral images at the\n##### fastest speeds and analyzing them with exceptional accuracy for industrial applications. With\n##### over 15 years of accumulated experience, knowledge, and passion in advanced imaging\n##### technologies, Hypergram is at the forefront of technological innovation in the machine vision\n##### industry. We specialize in providing cutting-edge hyperspectral cameras and autonomous defect\n##### detection AI software solutions, particularly for the automated machinery manufacturing\n##### sector. Our hyperspectral imaging technology is setting new standards of precision and\n##### efficiency, driving innovation across a wide range of industries.\n\n[Hypergram Wins AW 2026 Global Media Award, Named a Top 3 Most Promising New Technology by The Robot\nReport][Hypergram Wins AW 2026 Global Media Award, Named a Top 3 Most Promising New Technology by\nThe Robot Report]\n[\n\n## Hypergram Wins AW 2026 Global Media Award, Named a Top 3 Most Promising New Technology by The\n## Robot Report\n\n][26]\nHypergram Inc. received the AW 2026 Global Media Award at Automation World 2026 (AW 2026). Hypergram\nwas also recognized by The Robot Report (USA) as a \"Top 3\" most promising new technology,\nhighlighting strong interest in its hyperspectral inspection approach. At AW 2026, Hypergram\npresented its upcoming new hyperspectral camera and showcased a live demo of real-time\nspectrum-based classification of moving objects. Visitors saw how spectral signatures can\ndistinguish and lab\n[Hypergram Exhibits at CES 2026, Demonstrating Hyperspectral Imaging Technology][Hypergram Exhibits\nat CES 2026, Demonstrating Hyperspectral Imaging Technology]\n[\n\n## Hypergram Exhibits at CES 2026, Demonstrating Hyperspectral Imaging Technology\n\n][27]\nHypergram is exhibiting at CES 2026 in Las Vegas, showcasing its hyperspectral imaging technology\nfor AI-based industrial inspection. At the exhibition, Hypergram is presenting a live prototype\ndemonstration of HG VNIR Pro , highlighting scan-free, full-frame spectral capture and its potential\nto analyze material characteristics beyond conventional vision systems. Through its participation at\nCES 2026, Hypergram aims to engage with industry partners and continue advancing its\n[Hypergram Selected for the 2025 TIPS Startup Commercialization Program][Hypergram Selected for the\n2025 TIPS Startup Commercialization Program]\n[\n\n## Hypergram Selected for the 2025 TIPS Startup Commercialization Program\n\n][28]\nHypergram Inc. has been selected for the 2025 TIPS (Tech Incubator Program for Startup Korea)\nStartup Commercialization Program,...\n[Hypergram Inc. Accredited for a Research Institute by the Ministry of Science and ICT][Hypergram\nInc. Accredited for a Research Institute by the Ministry of Science and ICT]\n[\n\n## Hypergram Inc. Accredited for a Research Institute by the Ministry of Science and ICT\n\n][29]\nHypergram Inc., a developer of high-performance hyperspectral imaging technologies for industrial\nautomation, has officially been...\n\nT306, KAIST Truth Hall\n193, Munji-ro, Yuseong-gu, Daejeon\nSouth Korea\n\n+82.42.867.3990\n\n[info@hypergraminc.com][30]\n* [[LinkedIn]][31]\n\n\u00a92023 - 2025 by Hypergram Inc.\n\nbottom of page\n\n[1]: https://www.hypergraminc.com\n[2]: https://www.hypergraminc.com/company\n[3]: https://www.hypergraminc.com/company\n[4]: https://www.hypergraminc.com/company\n[5]: https://www.hypergraminc.com/company\n[6]: https://www.hypergraminc.com/company\n[7]: https://www.hypergraminc.com/technology\n[8]: https://www.hypergraminc.com/technology\n[9]: https://www.hypergraminc.com/technology\n[10]: https://www. top of page\n[\n][1]\n* [\n  \n  Company\n  \n  ][2]\n  * [Greetings][3]\n  * [About Us][4]\n  * [CI][5]\n  * [History][6]\n* [\n  \n  Technology\n  \n  ][7]\n  * [About HSI][8]\n  * [Spectral range][9]\n  * [Hypergram HSI][10]\n* [\n  \n  Applications\n  \n  ][11]\n  * [Semiconductor][12]\n  * [Display][13]\n  * [Electronics][14]\n  * [Battery][15]\n  * [Cosmetics][16]\n  * [Pharmaceutics][17]\n  * [Recycling][18]\n  * [Food Quality][19]\n  * [Agriculture][20]\n* [\n  \n  Careers\n  \n  ][21]\n  * [About our team][22]\n  * [Join our team][23]\n* [\n  \n  News\n  \n  ][24]\n* [\n  \n  Contact\n  \n  ][25]\n* More\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\n\n## Beyond\n## Human Visibility\n\n## in Automation Machinery Manufacturing\n\n## HYPERGRAM\n\n## Hyperspectral Imaging Solution\n\n## Hypergram Inc.\n\n