        "crawl_text": "[Skip to content][1]\n\n## Main Navigation\n\n[HyperSpectral][2][[HyperSpectral]][3]\n* [Industries][4]\n  * [Health Care][5]\n  * [Food Safety][6]\n* [Platform][7]\n* [Solutions][8]\n* [Investors][9]\n* [Partners][10]\n  * [University Research Partner Program][11]\n  * [Spectroscopy Device Manufacturer Partner Program][12]\n  * [Data Partner Program][13]\n* [News][14]\n* [About][15]\n* [Careers][16]\n* [Login][17]\n* [Contact][18]\n* [Industries][19]\n  * [Health Care][20]\n  * [Food Safety][21]\n* [Platform][22]\n* [Solutions][23]\n* [Investors][24]\n* [Partners][25]\n  * [University Research Partner Program][26]\n  * [Spectroscopy Device Manufacturer Partner Program][27]\n  * [Data Partner Program][28]\n* [News][29]\n* [About][30]\n* [Careers][31]\n* [Login][32]\n* [Contact][33]\n[Login][34][Contact][35]\n\n# Illuminating Invisible Threats\n\n#### The world\u2019s first artificial intelligence-powered spectral data platform\n\n[Get in Touch][36]\n\n## Real-Time Intelligence for What Matters Most\n\nHyperSpectral\u2019s technology combines the power of physics-based spectral data and advanced AI to\ndeliver rapid, reliable insights in health care and food safety, enabling confident decision-making\nthat protects lives, reduces costs, and safeguards global health.\n\n[Explore Our Platform][37]\n\n## SpecAI\u2122: Transforming One Industry at a Time\n\nOur first-of-its-kind platform is turning hard scientific data into actionable intelligence,\ndelivering accurate results on deadly infections in minutes, stopping foodborne illness before it\nspreads, ensuring manufacturing quality by uncovering defects, and safeguarding national security by\nverifying chip integrity.\n\n### [Health Care][38]\n\nOur technology is revolutionizing health care by delivering real-time, accurate diagnostics on\nantibiotic resistant-infections like MRSA and deadly diseases like tuberculosis. With rapid results\nand seamless integration, we are improving outcomes and transforming patient care.\n\n### [Food Safety][39]\n\nOur platform is redefining food safety by detecting contamination risks early and preventing\noutbreaks before they happen. With rapid, simultaneous testing and real-time results, we are helping\nto protect public health and global food systems.\n\n### Quality Control\n\nOur platform is revolutionizing quality control by detecting unique spectral signatures to ensure\nthe authenticity and integrity of products. By verifying provenance and sourcing \u2014 and detecting\nadulteration \u2014 we help maintain the highest standards of quality.\n\n### Manufacturing\n\nOur platform is transforming manufacturing through data-driven insights that ensure the\nauthenticity, quality, and integrity of materials and products across diverse industries, empowering\nmanufacturers to maintain the highest standards while reducing defects and costs.\n\n### Environment\n\nOur technology is advancing environmental monitoring through real-time data on microplastic\ncontamination in water and detecting harmful greenhouse gas emissions, empowering industries and\ngovernments to reduce pollution, mitigate risks, and safeguard natural resources.\n\n### Defense\n\nOur platform is enhancing defense capabilities by offering precise, rapid threat detection and\nanalysis. With advanced AI-driven insights, we empower defense teams to identify risks, ensure\nmission success, and protect lives with unparalleled accuracy and speed.\n\n[Explore Our Industries][40]\n\n## One Platform, Limitless Potential\n\nOur technology brings physics-based spectral data and advanced AI together in a single,\nhardware-agnostic platform that adapts across industries. By turning hard scientific data into\nactionable intelligence, our platform expands the boundaries of what AI can do in the physical world\n\u2014 and what you can achieve in yours. Backed by decades of expertise in AI, spectral science, and\nsoftware development, our team is ready to show how SpecAI\u2122 can work for you.\n\n[More About Us][41]\n\n> The advances in the past couple of years in artificial intelligence are allowing us to reimagine\n> the age-old technology of spectroscopy for our digital era. We are excited to demonstrate that our\n> technology not only works but is faster and cheaper than traditional methods.\n> \n> **Matt Theurer**\n> HyperSpectral Co-Founder & CEO\n\n[View our Leadership][42]\n\n## Recent News\n\n[View All News Articles][43]\n[[HyperSpectral BPR Logo]][44]\n\n### [HyperSpectral Earns 2025 Frost & Sullivan Technology Innovation Leadership Recognition for\n### AI-Powered Spectral Intelligence][45]\n\n[[MassRobotics logo]][46]\n\n### [MassRobotics Announces 5th Cohort of Healthcare Robotics Startup Catalyst Program][47]\n\n[[Photo of Rob Donofrio]][48]\n\n### [HyperSpectral Appoints Dr. Rob Donofrio as Chief Life Science Officer to Accelerate Adoption of\n### Spectral Intelligence Platform Across Life Sciences, MedTech & Public Health ][49]\n\n## Interested in\n## Partnering With Us?\n\n[Get in Touch][50]\n[HyperSpectral][51]\nDecoding Scientific Data for a Safer World\n[The Netty Awards: Prism Awards Winner]\n\u00a9 2026 HyperSpectral. [Terms and [Skip to content][1]\n\n## Main Navigation\n\n[HyperSpectral][2][[HyperSpectral]][3]\n* [Industries][4]\n  * [Health Care][5]\n  * [Food Safety][6]\n* [Platform][7]\n* [Solutions][8]\n* [Investors][9]\n* [Partners][10]\n  * [University Research Partner Program][11]\n  * [Spectroscopy Device Manufacturer Partner Program][12]\n  * [Data Partner Program][13]\n* [News][14]\n* [About][15]\n* [Careers][16]\n* [Login][17]\n* [Contact][18]\n* [Industries][19]\n  * [Health Care][20]\n  * [Food Safety][21]\n* [Platform][22]\n* [Solutions][23]\n* [Investors][24]\n* [Partners][25]\n  * [University Research Partner Program][26]\n  * [Spectroscopy Device Manufacturer Partner Program][27]\n  * [Data Partner Program][28]\n* [News][29]\n* [About][30]\n* [Careers][31]\n* [Login][32]\n* [Contact][33]\n[Login][34][Contact][35]\n\n# Illuminating Invisible Threats\n\n#### The world\u2019s first artificial intelligence-powered spectral data platform\n\n[Get in Touch][36]\n\n## Real-Time Intelligence for What Matters Most\n\nHyperSpectral\u2019s technology combines the power of physics-based spectral data and advanced AI to\ndeliver rapid, reliable insights in health care and food safety, enabling confident decision-making\nthat protects lives, reduces costs, and safeguards global health.\n\n[Explore Our Platform][37]\n\n## SpecAI\u2122: Transforming One Industry at a Time\n\nOur first-of-its-kind platform is turning hard scientific data into actionable intelligence,\ndelivering accurate results on deadly infections in minutes, stopping foodborne illness before it\nspreads, ensuring manufacturing quality by uncovering defects, and safeguarding national security by\nverifying chip integrity.\n\n### [Health Care][38]\n\nOur technology is revolutionizing health care by delivering real-time, accurate diagnostics on\nantibiotic resistant-infections like MRSA and deadly diseases like tuberculosis. With rapid results\nand seamless integration, we are improving outcomes and transforming patient care.\n\n### [Food Safety][39]\n\nOur platform is redefining food safety by detecting contamination risks early and preventing\noutbreaks before they happen. With rapid, simultaneous testing and real-time results, we are helping\nto protect public health and global food systems.\n\n### Quality Control\n\nOur platform is revolutionizing quality control by detecting unique spectral signatures to ensure\nthe authenticity and integrity of products. By verifying provenance and sourcing \u2014 and detecting\nadulteration \u2014 we help maintain the highest standards of quality.\n\n### Manufacturing\n\nOur platform is transforming manufacturing through data-driven insights that ensure the\nauthenticity, quality, and integrity of materials and products across diverse industries, empowering\nmanufacturers to maintain the highest standards while reducing defects and costs.\n\n### Environment\n\nOur technology is advancing environmental monitoring through real-time data on microplastic\ncontamination in water and detecting harmful greenhouse gas emissions, empowering industries and\ngovernments to reduce pollution, mitigate risks, and safeguard natural resources.\n\n### Defense\n\nOur platform is enhancing defense capabilities by offering precise, rapid threat detection and\nanalysis. With advanced AI-driven insights, we empower defense teams to identify risks, ensure\nmission success, and protect lives with unparalleled accuracy and speed.\n\n[Explore Our Industries][40]\n\n## One Platform, Limitless Potential\n\nOur technology brings physics-based spectral data and advanced AI together in a single,\nhardware-agnostic platform that adapts across industries. By turning hard scientific data into\nactionable intelligence, our platform expands the boundaries of what AI can do in the physical world\n\u2014 and what you can achieve in yours. Backed by decades of expertise in AI, spectral science, and\nsoftware development, our team is ready to show how SpecAI\u2122 can work for you.\n\n[More About Us][41]\n\n> The advances in the past couple of years in artificial intelligence are allowing us to reimagine\n> the age-old technology of spectroscopy for our digital era. We are excited to demonstrate that our\n> technology not only works but is faster and cheaper than traditional methods.\n> \n> **Matt Theurer**\n> HyperSpectral Co-Founder & CEO\n\n[View our Leadership][42]\n\n## Recent News\n\n[View All News Articles][43]\n[[HyperSpectral BPR Logo]][44]\n\n### [HyperSpectral Earns 2025 Frost & Sullivan Technology Innovation Leadership Recognition for\n### AI-Powered Spectral Intelligence][45]\n\n[[MassRobotics logo]][46]\n\n### [MassRobotics Announces 5th Cohort of Healthcare Robotics Startup Catalyst Program][47]\n\n[[Photo of Rob Donofrio]][48]\n\n### [HyperSpectral Appoints Dr. Rob Donofrio as Chief Life Science Officer to Accelerate Adoption of\n### Spectral Intelligence Platform Across Life Sciences, MedTech & Public Health ][49]\n\n## Interested in\n## Partnering With Us?\n\n[Get in Touch][50]\n[HyperSpectral][51]\nDecoding Scientific Data for a Safer World\n[The Netty Awards: Prism Awards Winner]\n\u00a9 2026 HyperSpectral. [Terms and Conditions][52]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: /\n[3]: /\n[4]: /industries/\n[5]: /industries/health-care\n[6]: /industries/food-safety\n[7]: /platform\n[8]: /solutions\n[9]: /investor-relations\n[10]: /partners/\n[11]: /partners/university-research\n[12]: /partners/spectroscopy-device-manufacturer\n[13]: /partners/data-partner\n[14]: /news\n[15]: /about\n[16]: https://jobs.lever.co/hyperspectral\n[17]: https://platform.hyperspectral.ai/login\n[18]: /contact\n[19]: #\n[20]: /industries/health-care\n[21]: /industries/food-safety\n[22]: /platform\n[23]: /solutions\n[24]: /investor-relations\n[25]: #\n[26]: /partners/university-research\n[27]: /partners/spectroscopy-device-manufacturer\n[28]: /partners/data-partner\n[29]: /news\n[30]: /about\n[31]: /careers\n[32]: https://platform.hyperspectral.ai/login\n[33]: /contact\n[34]: https://platform.hyperspectral.ai/login\n[35]: /contact\n[36]: /contact\n[37]: /platform\n[38]: /industries/health-care/\n[39]: /industries/food-safety/\n[40]: /industries/\n[41]: /about\n[42]: /about\n[43]: /news\n[44]: /hyperspectral-earns-2025-frost-sullivan-technology-innovation-leadership-recognition-for-ai-p\nowered-spectral-intelligence\n[45]: /hyperspectral-earns-2025-frost-sullivan-technology-innovation-leadership-recognition-for-ai-p\nowered-spectral-intelligence\n[46]: /massrobotics-announces-5th-cohort-of-healthcare-robotics-startup-catalyst-program\n[47]: /massrobotics-announces-5th-cohort-of-healthcare-robotics-startup-catalyst-program\n[48]: /hyperspectral-appoints-dr-rob-donofrio-as-chief-life-science-officer-to-accelerate-adoption-o\nf-spectral-intelligence-platfor