\n## How it works\n\nThe platform re-checks the accuracy of collected statistics, restores missing data, and estimates\nindexes which are not provided in official sources.\n[Data Collection]\nData Collection\n[Data Cleaning]\nData Cleaning\n[Building Predictive Models]\nBuilding Predictive Models\n[Data Visualization]\nData Visualization\n[Data\u2014driving Decision Making]\nData\u2014driving Decision Making\n[Image]\nGlobal scale\n\n## Worldwide coverage and local approach\n\nTo ensure our customers have the most accurate information, IndexBox checks daily for statistical\nupdates from official sources around the world.\n6 Billion\nDatasets updated monthly\n10,000+\nproducts according to HS codes\n200\ncountries split by region\n100+\ndata sources checked daily\n\n## Platform Pricing\n\nPremium Subscription\n\nNew plans: save with annual billing 30% off\nMonthly\nAnnually\n30% off\n\nPrice per month. Billed Annually.\nAuto-renewal. Cancel Anytime.\nTaxes may apply at checkout.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n          \u2502Limited Time Offer   \u2502-                   \u2502Most popular         \u2502-                    \n          \u2502Starter              \u2502Smart               \u2502Business             \u2502Enterprise           \n          \u2502$200                 \u2502$500                \u2502$700                 \u2502$800                 \n          \u2502/                    \u2502/                   