        "crawl_text": "Toggle navigation [\n[logo] [logo]\n][1]\n* [HOME][2]\n* [About Us][3]\n* [PRODUCTS][4]\n  * [Defence][5]\n  * [Medical OEM][6]\n  * [Atomic Research][7]\n  * [Laser and Photonics][8]\n* [COMPANY POLICY][9]\n* [RECRUITMENTS][10]\n* [CONTACT US][11]\n\n## Welcome back to Light Guide\n\nOptics Technology is a progressively dynamic scenario. Customers\u2019 needs become more specialized as\nthe application of this technology in the field of research and industry become more widespread.\nLight Guide, is an endeavor to meet these expectations by offering total opto-mechanical solution.\n\nWe are always available to help you design a component to meet your specific requirements. Small\nvolume production is our core strength. We look forward to be a partners in your development and\nprototyping activity.\n\n**\n\nLight Guide, looks forward to assist you by providing\n\n**\n* Precision optical components\n* Opto-mechanical components\n* Optical Instruments\n* Opto-mechanical system design\n* Precision mechanical machining\n* Optical system integration\n\n## About us\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nLight Guide Optics Pvt. Ltd. is an ISO 9001:2015 company, established in 1997 to cater requirement  \nof precision optics of domestic as well as export market. **Light Guide** is backed by a strong     \nengineering business group, engaged in multifarious activities like paper manufacturing, heavy      \nmachine manufacturing and mechanical engineering consultancy.                                       \n                                                                                                    \n**Light Guide** is well equipped to design and manufacture high precision conventional and          \nnon-conventional optics as small as 2mm to as large as 1200mm. Plane, spherical, cylindrical and    \naspheric surfaces can be fabricated. We can process a variety of optical materials like various     \noptical glasses, fused silica, Silicon carbide, crystals like quartz, calcite, KTP, KDP, LiNbO3,    \nZnS, ZnSe and metals like stainless steel, copper, brass, nickel etc. A milestone was achieved when \nwe developed in-house, process of polishing metal optics, not achieved by any other industry in     \nIndia, till date. The process was upgraded to polish Large Aperture Metal Mirrors. Our 500mm        \ndiameter Gold Coated Metal Mirror for high power CO2 laser application is the largest of its kind in\nIndia. We have produced a number of metal mirrors for beam deviation, beam focusing, collimation and\nresonator applications since then.                                                                  \n                                                                                                    \nOpto-mechanical system design is the thrust area for our new developmental activities. System       \ndesign, design optimization and product realization is possible due to a well-equipped mechanical   \nand electroplating facility. The collaborative efforts of our designs, optics and mechanical        \nworkshop have resulted into design and production of world-class instruments like Radiation         \nResistant Macroscope for Nuclear Application. We have developed various instruments like            \ninterferometers, beam expanders, telescopes, special purpose microscopes etc.                       \n                                                                                                    \nThe production activity is well supported by test facility. Optics test lab is equipped with various\noptical instruments like autocollimators, collimators, beam expanders, optical bench, centering     \nmicroscope, lasers, interferometers etc. Most of these instruments were developed in-house.         \n                                                                                                    \n**Light Guide** is a professionally managed company, headed by Siddhartha Dhawale. We have a hard   \nworking and talented team, well trained in their discipline, for any critical and demanding job.    \n                                                                                                    \nIn last eight years, demand of various R&D institutes and Universities have been catered, which     \nincludes CAT (Indore), BARC (Mumbai), TIFR (Mumbai), LASTEC (Delhi), IPR (Gandhi Nagar), CVRDE      \n(Avadi), Pune University, Indore University, Calcutta University. Some well-known industries where  \nlaser machining is being done (like ancillaries of Maruti Udyog Ltd.) are our regular customers for \nGold Coated Copper Mirrors for CO2 Laser application                                                \n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nDevelopment is an ongoing process at** Light Guide**. Some of our ongoing activities are:           \n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n1. Design and manufacture Toggle navigation [\n[logo] [logo]\n][1]\n* [HOME][2]\n* [About Us][3]\n* [PRODUCTS][4]\n  * [Defence][5]\n  * [Medical OEM][6]\n  * [Atomic Research][7]\n  * [Laser and Photonics][8]\n* [COMPANY POLICY][9]\n* [RECRUITMENTS][10]\n* [CONTACT US][11]\n\n## Welcome back to Light Guide\n\nOptics Technology is a progressively dynamic scenario. Customers\u2019 needs become more specialized as\nthe application of this technology in the field of research and industry become more widespread.\nLight Guide, is an endeavor to meet these expectations by offering total opto-mechanical solution.\n\nWe are always available to help you design a component to meet your specific requirements. Small\nvolume production is our core strength. We look forward to be a partners in your development and\nprototyping activity.\n\n**\n\nLight Guide, looks forward to assist you by providing\n\n**\n* Precision optical components\n* Opto-mechanical components\n* Optical Instruments\n* Opto-mechanical system design\n* Precision mechanical machining\n* Optical system integration\n\n## About us\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u250