        "crawl_text": "[ info@novacomponent.com ][1]\nPrecision Optical Components Manufacturer\n[ [Nova Component] [Nova Component] ][2] [Home][3]\n[ Products ][4]\nAll Categories\n[View All Products][5] [Aspherical Lens][6] [Ball Lens][7] [Cylindrical Lens][8] [Hemispherical\nLens][9] [Infrared Optics][10] [Laser Diode Module][11] [Laser Optics][12] [Optical Assembly][13]\n[Optical Design][14] [Optical Filter][15] [Optical Mirror][16] [Optical Prism][17] [Optical\nReticle][18] [Optical Window][19] [Polarization Optics][20] [Special Optics][21] [Spherical\nLens][22]\n[ Applications ][23]\nAll Applications\n[View All Applications][24] [Aerospace & Defense][25] [Automotive][26] [Industrial Automation][27]\n[Laser Processing][28] [Medical & Healthcare][29] [Optical Communication][30] [Scientific\nResearch][31] [Semiconductor][32]\n[Resources][33] [About Us][34] [Contact][35]\n[Get Quote][36]\n[Home][37] [Products][38] [Applications][39] [About Us][40] [Contact][41] [Get Quote][42]\nPrecision Optical Components Manufacturer\n\n# Precision Optical\n# Components\n# for Industry Leaders\n\nNova Component delivers high-precision optical lenses, prisms, mirrors, filters, and custom optical\nsolutions for aerospace, medical, laser, and research applications.\n\n[ Explore Products ][43] [Contact Us][44]\n89+\nStandard Products\n17\nCategories\n\u03bb/10\nSurface Accuracy\n600mm\nMax. Diameter\n\n## Why Choose Nova Component\n\nWe combine cutting-edge technology with decades of expertise to deliver optical components that meet\nthe most demanding specifications.\n\n### Premium Quality\n\nISO 9001 certified manufacturing with strict quality control at every stage of production.\n\n### Expert Team\n\nOptical engineers and manufacturing specialists with deep expertise in design, fabrication, and\ntesting.\n\n### Global Delivery\n\nServing customers in over 50 countries worldwide with reliable international shipping.\n\n### Fast Turnaround\n\nQuick prototyping and efficient production schedules to meet your tight deadlines.\n\n## All Product Categories\n\nBrowse our comprehensive range of precision optical components\n\n[ View All Products ][45]\n[\n[Optical Prism]\nO\n12 Products\n\n### Optical Prism\n\nHigh-precision prisms including right angle, pentagonal, dove, and roof prisms for beam deviation\nand image manipulation.\n\nView Products\n][46] [\n[Infrared Optics]\nI\n12 Products\n\n### Infrared Optics\n\nSpecialized infrared optics including germanium, silicon, ZnSe, CaF2, and sapphire components for\n3-12\u03bcm applications.\n\nView Products\n][47] [\n[Spherical Lens]\nS\n11 Products\n\n### Spherical Lens\n\nPrecision spherical lenses including biconvex, biconcave, plano-convex, plano-concave, and meniscus\nlenses for various optical applications.\n\nView Products\n][48] [\n[Ball Lens]\nB\n8 Products\n\n### Ball Lens\n\nBall lenses for fiber coupling, endoscopy, bar code scanning, and optical measurement.\n\nView Products\n][49] [\n[Cylindrical Lens]\nC\n7 Products\n\n### Cylindrical Lens\n\nCylindrical lenses for beam shaping, laser scanning, and optical systems requiring linear focusing.\n\nView Products\n][50] [\n[Optical Assembly]\nO\n7 Products\n\n### Optical Assembly\n\nCustom optical assemblies and pre-processed components for integrated optical systems.\n\nView Products\n][51] [\n[Optical Filter]\nO\n5 Products\n\n### Optical Filter\n\nBandpass, longpass, shortpass, and neutral density filters for wavelength selection and light\ncontrol.\n\nView Products\n][52] [\n[Laser Diode Module]\nL\n4 Products\n\n### Laser Diode Module\n\nHigh-quality laser diode modules for industrial, medical, alignment, and measurement applications.\n\nView Products\n][53] [\n[Polarization Optics]\nP\n4 Products\n\n### Polarization Optics\n\nHigh-performance polarizing and non-polarizing beamsplitter cubes for laser and polarization\ncontrol.\n\nView Products\n][54] [\n[Optical Window]\nO\n4 Products\n\n### Optical Window\n\nPrecision optical windows including BK7, quartz, sapphire, and fused silica for protective and\noptical applications.\n\nView Products\n][55] [\n[Optical Mirror]\nO\n4 Products\n\n### Optical Mirror\n\nDielectric and metal mirrors with high reflectivity for laser systems and optical instruments.\n\nView Products\n][56] [\n[Hemispherical Lens]\nH\n4 Products\n\n### Hemispherical Lens\n\nHemispherical and dome lenses for optical sensors, detectors, and specialized applications.\n\nView Products\n][57] [\n[Laser Optics]\nL\n3 Products\n\n### Laser Optics\n\nLaser-grade optical components including Powell lenses, Axicons, and laser collimating/focusing\nlenses.\n\nView Products\n][58] [\n[Aspherical Lens]\nA\n3 Products\n\n### Aspherical Lens\n\nHigh-precision aspheric lenses for thermal imaging, laser focusing, and complex optical systems.\n\nView Products\n][59] [\n[Optical Design]\nO\n1 Products\n\n### Optical Design\n\nProfessional optical system architecture design services from concept to production-ready\nspecifications.\n\nView Products\n][60] [\n[Optical Reticle]\nO\n0 Products\n\n### Optical Reticle\n\nHigh-precision reticles, crosshairs, and scale patterns for sighting systems and optical\nmeasurement.\n\nView Products\n][61] [\n[Special Optics]\nS\n0 Products\n\n### S [ info@novacomponent.com ][1]\nPrecision Optical Components Manufacturer\n[ [Nova Component] [Nova Component] ][2] [Home][3]\n[ Products ][4]\nAll Categories\n[View All Products][5] [Aspherical Lens][6] [Ball Lens][7] [Cylindrical Lens][8] [Hemispherical\nLens][9] [Infrared Optics][10] [Laser Diode Module][11] [Laser Optics][12] [Optical Assembly][13]\n[Optical Design][14] [Optical Filter][15] [Optical Mirror][16] [Optical Prism][17] [Optical\nReticle][18] [Optical Window][19] [Polarization Optics][20] [Special Optics][21] [Spherical\nLens][22]\n[ Applications ][23]\nAll Applications\n[View All Applications][24] [Aerospace & Defense][25] [Automotive][26] [Industrial Automation][27]\n[Laser Processing][28] [Medical & He