us\n\n[\ue089][22]\n\n#### [Who we are][23]\n\nA Quebec-based company specializing in the design and manufacture of advanced imaging technologies\n\n[\uf0c0][24]\n\n#### [Team][25]\n\nPhysicists, optical, electronic, and mechanical engineers, developers, technicians, and visionaries.\n\n[\uf234][26]\n\n#### [Careers][27]\n\nEverybody is welcome to bring new inventions at Photon etc.\n\n[\uf59f][28]\n\n#### [Distributors][29]\n\nAn international distribution network capable of responding quickly to requests in their respective\nregions.\n\nTechnologies\n\n[\uf75b][30]\n\n#### [Hyperspectral Imaging][31]\n\nA non-destructive testing technique that utilizes the electromagnetic spectrum.\n\n[\uf7c0][32]\n\n#### [Infrared Imaging][33]\n\nPowerful technology that captures images outside the visible light spectrum\n\n[\ue037][34]\n\n#### [Special Projects][35]\n\nDevelopment and innovation in imaging systems.\n\nEtc.\n\n[\uf1ea][36]\n\n#### [News][37]\n\nCheck out the latest news, innovations, and announcements from Photon etc.\n\n[\uf073][38]\n\n#### [Events][39]\n\nFollow our conferences, scientific exhibitions, and participation in international events.\n\n[\ue076][40]\n\n#### [Contact][41]\n\nPlease contact our team with any questions, requests for information, or collaboration\nopportunities.\n\n[][42]\n\nLife Sciences\n\n#### [Cardiovascular & Neurological Research][43]\n\n#### [Preclinical Drug Discovery & Pharmacokinetics][44]\n\n#### [Advanced Materials & Nanosensor Development][45]\n\n#### [Oncology & Surgical Guidance][46]\n\n[][47]\n\nMaterials Science\n\n#### [Semiconductors & Optoelectronics ][48]\n\n#### [Photovoltaics & Solar Materials][49]\n\n#### [Nanomaterials and Thin-Films][50]\n\n#### [Optical Metrology and Spectroscopy][51]\n\n[][52]\n\nIndustrial\n\n#### [Waste & Recycling][53]\n\n#### [Defence & Security][54]\n\n#### [Mining & Geology][55]\n\n#### [Agri-food][56]\n\n# A Growing Spectrum of Solutions\n\n[][57]\n\n## Life Sciences\n\n[][58]\n\n## Materials Science\n\n[][59]\n\n## Industrial\n\n### Who we are\n\n$\n\nPhoton etc. is a pioneer in the conception and manufacture of hyperspectral and infrared imaging\nsystems. Through our innovations, we facilitate access to a previously invisible universe for\nacademics and industry.\n\n\uf0eb\n\n#### Since 2003\n\n### Renowned expertise\n\nPhoton etc. is a team passionate about science, technology and people, our gathering of innovators\nfuels a dynamic and effervescent environment, where trust and freedom of action motivate a proactive\nand collective commitment.\n\nDeep technological know-how combined with unbridled creativity enables our team to tackle society\u2019s\nbiggest challenges in an environment defined by rigour and innovation.\n\n[Special Projects][60]\n[Infrared Imaging][61]\n[Hyperspectral Imaging][62]\n\n#### Learn more about Photon etc.\n\nEveryone is invited to bring new ideas to Photon etc. We want to be the bridge between high\ntechnology and the world\u2019s needs.\n\n[About us][63]\n\n## Expertise\n\nLeveraging its expertise in visible and infrared hyperspectral imaging, Photon etc. develops\ninfrared cameras and lenses, hyperspectral imaging systems, preclinical imagers, as well as laser\nsources and tunable filters. Renowned for its know-how in complete systems integration, the company\nsupports research and industry wi [][1]\n* [About us][2]\n* [Applications][3]\n* [Products][4]\n* [Resources][5]\n* [FR][6]\n[Contact][7]\n* [About us][8]\n* [Applications][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Resources][11]\n* [FR][12]\n\nSpectroscopy & Tunable Filters\n\n#### Plate Reader\n\nDedicated short-wave infrared plate reader\n\n#### Superconitnuum Filter\n\nState-of-the-art non-dispersive tunable bandpass filter\n\nSoftware & Customization\n\n#### Special Projects\n\nCustom solutions for a variety of applications\n\n#### PHySpec Software\n\nDesigned to control the full range of Photon instruments, etc.\n\nPreclinical\n\n#### Bioluminescence Imaging\n\nDesigne