to tackle society\u2019s\nbiggest challenges in an environment defined by rigour and innovation.\n\n[Special Projects][60]\n[Infrared Imaging][61]\n[Hyperspectral Imaging][62]\n\n#### Learn more about Photon etc.\n\nEveryone is invited to bring new ideas to Photon etc. We want to be the bridge between high\ntechnology and the world\u2019s needs.\n\n[About us][63]\n\n## Expertise\n\nLeveraging its expertise in visible and infrared hyperspectral imaging, Photon etc. develops\ninfrared cameras and lenses, hyperspectral imaging systems, preclinical imagers, as well as laser\nsources and tunable filters. Renowned for its know-how in complete systems integration, the company\nsupports research and industry with cutting-edge solutions.\n\nIts technologies are used in a wide range of fields, including small animal imaging, solar cell\ncharacterization, nanotechnology, and industrial sorting. Researchers and industrial partners trust\nPhoton etc. for accurate analysis and to accelerate innovation, whether it\u2019s developing new\nmaterials, exploring living tissue, or optimizing manufacturing processes.\n\n##### Spectroscopy & Tunable Filters\n\n[Plate Reader][64]\n\n[Superconitnuum Filter][65]\n\n##### Preclinical\n\n[Bioluminescence Imaging][66]\n\n[NIR-I & NIR-II Imaging][67]\n\n##### Cameras\n\n[SWIR Cameras][68]\n\n[eSWIR Cameras][69]\n\n##### Hyperspectral Imaging\n\n[Linescan Cameras][70]\n\n[Area Spectral Imaging][71]\n\n[Microscopy][72]\n\n##### Software & Customization\n\n[Special Projects][73]\n\n[PHySpec Software][74]\n\nDiscover the universeof the invisible\n\n## [ Food Quality / Safety ][75]\n\n## [ Forensics ][76]\n\n## [ Fluorescence-Guided Surgery (FGS) ][77]\n\n## [ Core scanning ][78]\n\n## [ Organic PV ][79]\n\n## Limitless potential for application\n\n### Life Sciences\n\n[Cardiovascular & Neurological Research][80]\n[Preclinical Drug Discovery & Pharmacokinetics][81]\n[Advanced Materials & Nanosensor Development][82]\n[Oncology & Surgical Guidance][83]