        "crawl_text": "Pixxel | Hyperspectral Imaging for Earth Observation\nPRODUCTS\n[Hyperspectral imagery][1][Earth Observation Studio][2]\nSOLUTIONS\n[Agriculture][3][Energy][4][Environment][5][Forestry][6][Mining][7][Government][8][\nView all\n][9]\nRESOURCES\n[knowledge hub\n][10][Newsroom][11][Earth Day Challenge\n][12][Hyperspectral Academy][13][webinars\n][14][events\n][15]\nCOMPANY\n[About Us][16][The Shakuntala Initiative][17][Team][18][Careers][19]\n[PARTNERS][20]\nSUPPORt\n[Contact Us\n][21][Customer Support][22]\n[order imagery][23]\n[\nLogin\n][24]\n\n## Dive into our imagery\n\nExplore Pixxel imagery, access various datasets, and uncover tailor-made insights.\n\n[\nEnter the aurora platform\n][25]\n\n## LATEST ON PIXXEL\n\n[\n\n### Hyperspectral Intelligence in Agriculture\n\n][26]\n2026-06-16\n[\n\n### The Hyperspectral Advantage for Defense and Intelligence\n\n][27]\n2026-04-30\n[\n\n### Hyperspectral Imaging for Fire Assessment\n\n][28]\n2026-02-15\n[\n\n### Six Months in Orbit: Firefly Status Check!\n\n][29]\n2025-08-20\n[\n\n### Pixxel Awarded NRO Strategic Commercial Enhancements Contract for Hyperspectral Remote Sensing\n### Capabilities\n\n][30]\n2026-05-05\n[\n\n### Pixxel to Launch India\u2019s First Orbital Data Centre Satellite, Powered by Sarvam\n\n][31]\n2026-05-04\n[\n\n### Pixxel Space and Cosmoserve Join Forces to Advance Space Debris Removal\n\n][32]\n2026-03-31\n[\n\n### Pixxel and NSG UP42 Partner to Expand Hyperspectral Earth Observation Capabilities in Saudi\n### Arabia\n\n][33]\n2026-03-16\n[Button Text][34]\n\n## Seeing The\n## Unseen\n\nPixxel is on a mission to build a health monitor for the planet and track critical changes across\nland, oceans, and atmosphere before they escalate. From developing advanced hyperspectral satellites\nto transforming raw imagery into powerful insights, Pixxel brings together every layer of Earth\nobservation.\n\nBy unlocking data beyond the reach of traditional systems, we aim to change how we respond to\nchallenges like climate change, pollution and declining biodiversity.\n\n[Pixxel is on a mission to build a health monitor for the planet and track critical changes across\nland, oceans and atmosphere before they escalate.]\nENTERING A NEW CHAPTER\n\n## The Firefly Constellation\n## Is Now in Orbit!\n\n[Satellite 1]\n[Satellite 2]\n[Satellite 3]\n**Firefly is Pixxel\u2019s first commercial constellation, featuring six satellites designed for\nhigh-resolution, high-frequency hyperspectral imaging on a global scale.**\nAll six Firefly satellites were successfully launched in 2025 and are now operating in orbit,\ncapturing high-fidelity spectral data across diverse environmental indicators.\n\nTogether, they mark the completion of the first phase of the constellation and an important step\ntoward Pixxel\u2019s mission of building a health monitor for the planet.\n[\nREAD MORE\n][35]\n\n## Next Generation Earth Observation With \u00a0\n## Aurora by Pixxel\n\nAurora, Pixxel\u2019s in-house Earth observation studio, brings remote sensing within reach. Its no-code\nplatform simplifies satellite data analysis, while a growing library of ready-to-use models and\nindices makes exploration and application easier than ever. By removing traditional barriers, Aurora\nhelps users turn Earth Observation data into real-world impact.\n\n[\ngo to the aurora platform\n][36]\n\n## Data-driven Insights For Every Sector\n\nFrom environmental shifts to agricultural productivity, energy efficiency, and sustainable mining,\nthe world\u2019s most complex challenges demand clearer answers. Pixxel\u2019s hyperspectral data offers a\nricher view of the planet, helping industries make smarter decisions, optimise resources, and\nstrengthen resilience where it matters most.\n\n### Agriculture\n\nEarly stress detection\n\nCrop species classification\n\nCrop yield prediction\n\nSoil nutrient analysis\n\n[\nKnow more\n][37]\n\n### Energy\n\nOil spill detection\n\nPipeline monitoring\n\nVessel tracking\n\nHydrocarbon estimation\n\n[\nKnow more\n][38]\n\n### Government\n\nPlan urban infrastructure\n\nMap road networks\n\nNatural disaster response\n\nNatural resource planning\n\n[\nKnow more\n][39]\n\n### Environment\n\nHabitat mapping\n\nPollution & stress level quantification\n\nCarbon sequestration\n\nVegetation detection\n\n[\nKnow more\n][40]\n\n### Forestry\n\nTree species classification\n\nEarly vegetation stress detection\n\nAbove-ground biomass estimation\n\nForest fire detection and mitigation\n\n[\nKnow more\n][41]\n\n### Mining\n\nMineral detection\n\u200d\n\nMine site closure\n\nIllegal mining prevention\n\nEnvironmental compliance\n\n[\nKnow more\n][42]\n\n## Turn Satellite Data\n## Into Action With Pixxel\n\nAccess cutting-edge hyperspectral imagery and intuitive analytics to move faster, solve complex\nchallenges, and drive smarter outcomes.\n\n[\nexplore possibilities\n][43]\n\n## Knowledge Hub\n\nDiscover how Pixxel\u2019s Earth Observation solutions drive real-world impact.\n\nJune 16, 2026\n|\nBlog\n\n### Hyperspectral Intelligence in Agriculture\n\n[Read more][44]\n[\nRead more\n][45]\nApril 30, 2026\n|\nStorymaps\n\n### The Hyperspectral Advantage for Defense and Intelligence\n\n[Read more][46]\n[\nRead more\n][47]\nFebruary 15, 2026\n|\nStorymaps\n\n### Hyperspectral Im Pixxel | Hyperspectral Imaging for Earth Observation\nPRODUCTS\n[Hyperspectral imagery][1][Earth Observation Studio][2]\nSOLUTIONS\n[Agriculture][3][Energy][4][Environment][5][Forestry][6][Mining][7][Government][8][\nView all\n][9]\nRESOURCES\n[knowledge hub\n][10][Newsroom][11][Earth Day Challenge\n][12][Hyperspectral Academy][13][webinars\n][14][events\n][15]\nCOMPANY\n[About Us][16][The Shakuntala Initiative][17][Team][18][Careers][19]\n[PARTNERS][20]\nSUPPORt\n[Contact Us\n][21][Customer Support][22]\n[order imagery][23]\n[\nLogin\n][24]\n\n## Dive into our imagery\n\nExplore Pixxel imagery, access various datasets, and uncover tailor-made insights.\n\n[\nEnter the aurora platform\n][25]\n\n## LATEST ON PIXXEL\n\n[\n\n### Hyperspectral Intelligence in Agriculture\n\n][26]\n2026-06-16\n[\n\n### The Hyperspectral Advantage for Defense and Intelligence\n\n][27]\n2026-04-30\n[\n\n### Hyperspectral Imaging for Fire Assessment\n\n][28]\n2026-02-15\n[\n\n### Six Months in Orbit: Firefly Status Check!\n\n][29]\n2025-08-20\n[\n\n### Pixxel Awarded NRO Strategic Commercial Enhancements Contract for Hyperspectral Remote Sensing\n### Capabilities\n\n][30]\n2026-05-05\n[\n\n### Pixxel to Launch India\u2019s First Orbital Data Centre Satellite, Powered by Sarvam\n\n][31]\n2026-05-04\n[\n\n### Pixxel Space and Cosmoserve Join Forces to Advance Space Debris Removal\n\n][32]\n2026-03-31\n[\n\n### Pixxel and NSG UP42 Partner to Expand Hyperspectral Earth Observation Capabilities in Saudi\n### Arabia\n\n][33]\n2026-03-16\n[Button Text][34]\n\n## Seeing The\n## Unseen\n\nPixxel is on a mission to build a health monitor for the planet and track critical changes across\nland, oceans, and atmosphere before they escalate. From developing advanced hyperspectral satellites\nto transforming raw imagery into powerful insights, Pixxel brings together every layer of Earth\nobservation.\n\nBy unlocking data beyond the reach of traditional systems, we aim to change how we respond to\nchallenges like climate change, pollution and declining biodiversity.\n\n[Pixxel is on a mission to build a health monitor for the planet and track critical changes across\nland, oceans and atmosphere before they escalate.]\nENTERING A NEW CHAPTER\n\n## The Firefly Constellation\n## Is Now in Orbit!\n\n[Satellite 1]\n[Satellite 2]\n[Satellite 3]\n**Firefly is Pixxel\u2019s first commercial constellation, featuring six satellites designed for\nhigh-resolution, high-frequency hyperspectral imaging on a global scale.**\nAll six Firefly satellites were successfully launched in 2025 and are now operating in orbit,\ncapturing high-fidelity spectral data across diverse environmental indicators.\n\nTogether, they mark the completion of the first phase of the constellation and an important step\ntoward Pixxel\u2019s mission of building a health monitor for the planet.\n[\nREAD MORE\n][35]\n\n## Next Generation Earth Observation With \u00a0\n## Aurora by Pixxel\n\nAurora, Pixxel\u2019s in-house Earth observation studio, brings remote sensing within reach. Its no-code\nplatform simplifies satellite data analysis, while a growing library of ready-to-use models and\nindices makes exploration and application easier than ever. By removing traditional barriers, Aurora\nhelps users turn Earth Observation data into real-world impact.\n\n[\ngo to the aurora platform\n][36]\n\n## Data-driven Insights For Every Sector\n\nFrom environmental shifts to agricultural productivity, energy efficiency, and sustainable mining,\nthe world\u2019s most complex challenges demand clearer answers. Pixxel\u2019s hyperspectral data offers a\nricher view of the planet, helping industries make smarter decisions, optimise resources, and\nstrengthen resilience where it matters most.\n\n### Agriculture\n\nEarly stress detection\n\nCrop species classification\n\nCrop yield prediction\n\nSoil nutrient analysis\n\n[\nKnow more\n][37]\n\n### Energy\n\nOil spill detection\n\nPipeline monitoring\n\nVessel tracking\n\nHydrocarbon estimation\n\n[\nKnow more\n][38]\n\n### Government\n\nPlan urban infrastructure\n\nMap road networks\n\nNatural disaster response\n\nNatural resource planning\n\n[\nKnow more\n][39]\n\n### Environment\n\nHabitat mapping\n\nPollution & stress level quantification\n\nCarbon sequestration\n\nVegetation detection\n\n[\nKnow more\n][40]\n\n### Forestry\n\nTree species classification\n\nEarly vegetation stress detection\n\nAbove-ground biomass estimation\n\nForest fire detection and mitigation\n\n[\nKnow more\n][41]\n\n### Mining\n\nMineral detection\n\u200d\n\nMine site closure\n\nIllegal mining prevention\n\nEnvironmental compliance\n\n[\nKnow more\n][42]\n\n## Turn Satellite Data\n## Into Action With Pixxel\n\nAccess cutting-edge hyperspectral imagery and intuitive analytics to move faster, solve complex\nchallenges, and drive smarter outcomes.\n\n[\nexplore possibilities\n][43]\n\n## Knowledge Hub\n\nDiscover how Pixxel\u2019s Earth Observation solutions drive real-world impact.\n\nJune 16, 2026\n|\nBlog\n\n### Hyperspectral Intelligence in Agriculture\n\n[Read more][44]\n[\nRead more\n][45]\nApril 30, 2026\n|\nStorymaps\n\n### The Hyperspectral Advantage for Defense and Intelligence\n\n[Read more][46]\n[\nRead more\n][47]\nFebruary 15, 2026\n|\nStorymaps\n\n### Hyperspectral Imaging for Fire Assessment\n\n[Read more][48]\n[\nRead more\n][49]\n[\nview all\n][50]\n\nSee what others miss.\nAct when it matters.\n\n[\nget in touch\n][51]\n[\n[X icon]\n][52][\n][53][\n[YouTube icon]\n][54][\n[Instagram icon]\n][55]\nPRODUCTS\n[Hyperspectral Imagery][56][Earth Observation Studio][57]\nSOLUTIONS\n[agriculture][58][energy][59][environment][60][forestry][61][government][62][mining][63]\nRESOURCES\n[knowledge hub][64][Newsroom][65][Hyperspectral Academy][66][webinars][67][events][68]\nCOMPANY\n[about us][69][The Shakuntala Initiative][70][team][71][careers][72]\nPARTNERS\n[Partner Ecosystem][73][Partner Portal][74]\nSUPPORT\n[support services][75][Support Portal][76]\nRETURNS\n[fY 21-22][77][fY 22-23][78][fY 23-24][79][fY 24-25][80]\nLOGINS\n[aurora][81]\n[\u00a9 2025 Pixxel, All rights reserved.][82]\n[Privacy Policy][83][ Aurora and Orderdesk][84][Sitemap][85]\n[Built at Parallel][86]\nIframe is blocked. Accept cookies to load it.\nPreferences\nAccept All\nPreferences\nManage Consent Preferences\nEssentials\nAlways active\n\nNecessary for the site to function. Always On.\n\nProvider name\n[Privacy Policy][87]\nName\nTracker Name\nDescription\n\nTracker description\n\n**Type**\n\nTracker type\n\n**Retention:**\n\nTracker retention\n\nNo trackers detected for this category.\n\nNo providers detected for this category.\n\nAnalyti