  Email(Required)\n    Phone\n    Company\n    Message\n    CAPTCHA\n* * Search Search\n\n# A World Leader in Precision Optics\n\nWith over 65 years of experience in the manufacturing of optical components, thin film coatings and\nassemblies, Precision Optical is a world leader in the production of precision optics for the most\ndemanding applications.\n\n[About Us][92] [Contact Us][93]\n\n## A World Leader in Precision Optics\n\nWith over 65 years of experience in the manufacturing of optical components, thin film coatings and\nassemblies, Precision Optical is a world leader in the production of precision optics for the most\ndemanding applications.\n\n[Coatings][94] [Contact Us][95]\n\n## A World Leader in Precision Optics\n\nWith over 65 years of experience in the manufacturing of optical components, thin film coatings and\nassemblies, Precision Optical is a world leader in the production of precision optics for the most\ndemanding applications.\n\n[Metrology Services][96] [Contact Us][97]\n\n## A World Leader in Precision Optics\n\nWith over 65 years of experience in the manufacturing of optical components, thin film coatings and\nassemblies, Precision Optical is a world leader in the production of precision optics for the most\ndemanding applications.\n\n[Custom Prisms][98] [Contact Us][99]\n\n## A World Leader in Precision Optics\n\nWith over 65 years of experience in the manufacturing of optical components, thin film coatings and\nassemblies, Precision Optical is a world leader in the production of precision optics for the most\ndemanding applications.\n\n[Optical Polishing][100] [Contact Us][101]\n\n## A World Leader in Precision Optics\n\nWith over 65 years of experience in the manufacturing of optical components, thin film coatings and\nassemblies, Precision Optical is a world leader in the production of precision optics for the most\ndemanding applications.\n\n[Large Optical Flats][102] [Contact Us][103]\n\n## A World Leader in Precision Optics\n\nWith over 65 years of experience in the manufacturing of optical components, thin film coatings and\nassemblies, Precision Optical is a world leader in the production of precision optics for the most\ndemanding applications.\n\n[CNC Machining Services][104] [Contact Us][105]\n\u276e \u276f\n\n## Products & Services\n\n### Custom Prisms\n\nSince the company\u2019s founding in 1959, Precision Optical has specialized in manufacturing custom\noptical components for the most demanding applications.\n\n[Learn More][106]\n\n### Corner Cube Retroreflectors\n\nWe are pleased to offer a wide variety of retroreflectors at competitive prices and lead times and\nare able to accommodate the most demanding requirements.\n\n[Learn More][107]\n\n### Alignment Cubes\n\nPrecision Optical offers standard and custom sized optical alignment prisms with precision angles in\nseveral glass types as well as stainless steel.\n\n[Learn More][108]\n\n### Optical Flats\n\nWith nearly 35 continuous polishing laps, Precision Optical has the capacity to handle the most\ndemanding requirements for optical flats, mirrors, and windows.\n\n[Learn More][109]\n\n### Catalog Optics\n\nAlong with our amazingly precise alignment cubes which are requested throughout the world, Precision\nOptical now offers catalog corner cubes, porro prisms, right angle prisms, and penta prisms.\n\n[Learn More][110]\n\n### Thin-Film Coatings\n\nPrecision Optical specializes in supplying precision thin film coatings for the UV, visible and near\nIR spectral regions. We offer a wide variety of coating designs from prototypes to large volume\norders.\n\n[Learn More][111]\n\n### Assembly & Integration\n\nWe meet the most critical alignment specifications. Our expert technicians produce excellent optical\nalignment and environmental resistance.\n\n[Learn More][112]\n\n### Engineering\n\nOur engineers use state-of-the-art technology to provide effective solutions for the most critical\noptical design requirements.\n\n[Learn More][113]\n\n## Industries We Serve\n\n### Defense & Security\n\nPrecision Optical understands the significance and importance of high quality optics for Defense\napplications, as can be seen in our rich history of Defense program involvement.\n\n[Defense & Security][114]\n\n### Astronomy & Aerospace\n\nPrecision Optical is proud to support the aerospace industry and its efforts in continuing the study\nand exploration of the universe.\n\n[Astronomy & Aerospace][115]\n"
