        "crawl_text": "[[Ross Optical | Specialty Optics in Stock]][1]\n\n[ITAR Registered][2] l [ISO 9001:2015][3] l 915-595-5417 l l [[Request a Custom Quote]][4]\n* [Capabilities][5]\n  * [Custom Optics][6]\n  * [Micro Optics][7]\n  * [Engineering][8]\n  * [Materials Selection][9]\n  * [Optical Fabrication][10]\n  * [Coatings][11]\n  * [Assembly][12]\n  * [Inspection][13]\n  * [Inventory Management][14]\n* [Catalog][15]\n  * [Micro Optic][16]\n    * [Micro Prisms][17]\n    * [Micro Achromats][18]\n    * [Micro Plano Convex Lenses][19]\n    * [Micro Plano Concave Lenses][20]\n    * [Micro Bi-Convex Lenses][21]\n  * [Simple Lenses][22]\n    * [Plano Convex][23]\n    * [Bi-Convex][24]\n    * [Plano Concave][25]\n    * [Bi-Concave][26]\n    * [Fused Silica Lenses][27]\n    * [Ball Lenses][28]\n    * [Aspherical Lenses][29]\n    * [Precision Molded Aspherical Lenses][30]\n  * [Cylindrical Lenses][31]\n    * [Positive Cylinder][32]\n    * [Negative Cylinder][33]\n    * [Rod Lens][34]\n  * [Doublets & Triplets][35]\n    * [Std. Achromats][36]\n    * [Precision Aplanats][37]\n    * [Negative Achromats][38]\n    * [Laser Achromats][39]\n    * [Steinheil Triplets][40]\n  * [Dome Lenses][41]\n  * [Windows][42]\n    * [BK7 Precision][43]\n    * [BK7 Standard][44]\n    * [Fused Silica][45]\n    * [Sapphire][46]\n    * [Infrared][47]\n  * [Mirrors][48]\n    * [Round Mirrors][49]\n    * [Square Mirrors][50]\n    * [Elliptical Mirrors][51]\n  * [Prisms][52]\n    * [Right Angle][53]\n    * [Equilateral][54]\n    * [Dove][55]\n    * [Amici][56]\n    * [Wedge][57]\n    * [Penta][58]\n    * [Retroreflectors][59]\n    * [Micro Prisms][60]\n  * [Beamsplitters][61]\n    * [Plate Beamsplitters][62]\n    * [Cube Bleamsplitters][63]\n  * [Waveplates][64]\n    * [Zero Order][65]\n    * [True Zero Order][66]\n    * [Low Order][67]\n    * [Ring Holders][68]\n  * [Band Pass Filters][69]\n  * [Color Glass Filters][70]\n  * [Polarizers][71]\n    * [Glan-Taylor][72]\n    * [Glan Laser][73]\n    * [Glan-Thompson][74]\n    * [Wollaston][75]\n    * [Rochon][76]\n  * [Large Optics (100mm+ dia)][77]\n  * [Lens Cleaning Tissue][78]\n* [Endoscope Testing Equipment][79]\n* [About][80]\n  * [Our History][81]\n  * [Our Team][82]\n  * [Careers][83]\n  * [News & Events][84]\n* [Contact Us][85]\n  * [General Request][86]\n  * [Custom Optical RFQ][87]\n  * [Free System Review][88]\n* [Resources][89]\n  * [Downloads][90]\n  * [Fundamentals of Optics E-Book ][91]\n  * [4f Optical Configuration E-Book][92]\n  * [Case Studies][93]\n  * [Optical Dictionary][94]\n  * [Rolyn Part Match][95]\n  * [Optical Calculator App][96]\n* [Blog][97]\n\n# ROSS OPTICAL\n# part of the Precision Optics Family\n\nOptical Components for Any Niche\n\n[Precision-optics-r]\nCHECK OUT **OUR SPECIALTY OPTICS & OPTICAL ASSEMBLIES**\n\n# Standard Optics\n\nQuick and cost effective, we stock lenses others don\u2019t. Our specialty catalogs offer micro optics\ndown to 1.0 mm\u00a0and other hard-to-find optics. We source from 21 overseas vendors so you don't have\nto.\n\n[[Learn More]][98]\n\n# Custom Optics\n\nRoss Optical is a top-ranking supplier for OEMs in medical devices, automation, and other\nindustries. We provide custom optics and assemblies, from design to fabrication, coating, and\nassembly.\n\n[[Learn More]][99]\n\n# Complex Assemblies\n\nRoss has helped companies simplify complex assemblies, saving money and improving quality. Our ITAR\nregistered facility offers white room assembly and inspection to your specification.\n\n[[Learn More]][100]\n\n# Micro Optics\n\nRoss Optical produces micro lenses with diameters from sub-millimeter to 6.0 mm. \u00a0We work with each\ncustomer to provide the micro optics lenses and other components that meet their requirements.\n\n[[Learn More]][101]\n\n# Aspherical Lenses\n\nTechnologies from mobile phone cameras to medical devices demand smaller, lighter, and\nhigher-performing optical systems. Aspheres can help reduce the cost, weight, and complexity of\nthese systems.\n\n[[Learn More]][102]\n\n# Doublets & Triplets\n\nAchromats cancel both chromatic and spherical aberrations.\u00a0Ross has one of the largest selections of\nstandard and custom achromats available in the industry.\n\n\n[[Learn More]][103]\n\n# ROSS PARTNERS TO **IMPROVE YOUR PRODUCTS**\n\nYour product performance depends on a reliable partner. From small volume standard optics for\nproduct development to OEM contract assemblies, Ross Optical improves your time to market and\nproduct performance.\u00a0\n\nCustomers like you are more competitive when they partner with Ross Optical for:\u00a0\n\n**Sourcing:**\u00a0Whether it\u2019s a stock item sourced from one of our 21 optical manufacturing partners\naround the world, or custom manufactured at our U.S. facility, we deliver the right optical solution\nat the cost and quality your product demands.\u00a0\n\n**Inventory:**\u00a0We manage your optics inventory to help you improve profits and cash flow and avoid\nsupply chain headaches.\n\n**Inspection:**\u00a0From spot to 100% inspection, customers tell us our quality control is even better\nthan theirs!\u00a0\n\n**Design:** Complete optical/mechanical design and engineering when you need it. We can help with\neverything fr [[Ross Optical | Specialty Optics in Stock]][1]\n\n[ITAR Registered][2] l [ISO 9001:2015][3] l 915-595-5417 l l [[Request a Custom Quote]][4]\n* [Capabilities][5]\n  * [Custom Optics][6]\n  * [Micro Optics][7]\n  * [Engineering][8]\n  * [Materials Selection][9]\n  * [Optical Fabrication][10]\n  * [Coatings][11]\n  * [Assembly][12]\n  * [Inspection][13]\n  * [Inventory Management][14]\n* [Catalog][15]\n  * [Micro Optic][16]\n    * [Micro Prisms][17]\n    * [Micro Achromats][18]\n    * [Micro Plano Convex Lenses][19]\n    * [Micro Plano Concave Lenses][20]\n    * [Micro Bi-Convex Lenses][21]\n  * [Simple Lenses][22]\n    * [Plano Convex][23]\n    * [Bi-Convex][24]\n    * [Plano Concave][25]\n    * [Bi-Concave][26]\n    * [Fused Silica Len