        "crawl_text": "Search\nMI(EN)\n* Products\n* Solutions\n* Technical Service\n* Learning Centre\n* About us\n* Partners\n* [Contact us][1]\n* [Media Centre][2]\n* [Software][3]\n* [Instruction manuals][4]\n* [Blog][5]\n* # Measure Colour, Light, and Display Performance with Confidence\n  \n  Industry-leading solutions designed for precision, consistency, and reliable quality control\n  \n  [Explore Measurement Solutions][6]\n* CL-700A: A New Standard in Light Measurement\n  \n  High-precision spectral analysis designed for lighting professionals and researchers\n  \n  [View Product Details][7]\n  [CL-700A_Stadium_image_home_page_banner_2026]\n* Achieve Consistent Deep Black\n  \n  Analyse blackness, jetness, and undertone for reliable colour control and quality assurance.\n  \n  [Quantify the Nuances of Deep Black][8]\n* Simultaneous Colour and Gloss Measurement\n  \n  Evaluate colour and gloss together to increase efficiency and eliminate measurement\n  inconsistencies.\n  \n  [Discover the Benefit of 2-in-1 Spectrophotometers][9]\n\n## Welcome to Konica Minolta Sensing Europe\n\nI am interested in...\nI am looking for...\n[][10]\n[Get my instrument calibrated][11][Get in contact with us][12][Our events][13]\n\n##### Measuring Instruments from Konica Minolta Sensing\n\nFind an instrument for your measurement needs, whether measuring the colour of plastic parts, the\ncolour and gloss of a coating, the Lux values of a lighting installation or the colour and\nbrightness of a television.\n\nEach of our products is presented with key facts, specifications and a range of purpose designed\naccessories that enable you to achieve the most accurate and repeatable measurement data.\n\n[View our Products][14]\n[Spectrophotometers with different geometries]\n[CM-25cG Measuring Automotive Interior Leather]\n\n##### Find Measurement Solutions by Industry\n\nOur expert teams have implemented thousands of successful measuring instruments in a diverse range\nof industries ensuring that our customers can benefit from accurate and traceable data that can help\nthem to improve quality, reduce waste and cut costs.\n\nHere you can find solutions and example applications specific to your industry and sample types. Our\nteam will help you to find the right solution for your requirements.\n\n[Solutions by Industry][15]\n\n##### Instrument Service and Maintenance\n\nOur local service centres and field service technicians perform maintenance, repairs and traceable\ncalibration for Konica Minolta measuring instruments to ensure that customers measure traceable data\nall year round with a minimum of downtime.\n\nWe have a number of OEM certified facilities throughout Europe and the ability to offer ISO 17025\ncertifications at our main European Service Centre.\n\n[Maintenance and Calibration][16]\n[\n][17]\n\n### Latest news\n\n[\n\n##### Anniversary: 20 Years of Sensing\n\n11 May 2026\n\nFor two decades, local support and aftersales expertise has helped tens of thousands of customers to\nimprove the appearance quality & functionality of their products with repeatable measurements and\ntraceable data.\n][18]\n[\n[Radiant_vision_systems_merge_companies_web_page_2026]\n\n##### Expanding Global Sensing Solutions\n\n06 May 2026\n\nRadiant Vision Systems Merges with Konica Minolta Sensing Americas\n][19]\n[\n[Firmware_homepage_banner_01]\n\n##### Launch Proprietary Computer Colour Matching Software\n\n02 Apr 2026\n\nWe are launching a new Colour Matching Software this summer!\n][20]\n[All News][21]\n\n## Konica Minolta's business services\n\n[\n[Digital Workplace]\n\nDigital Workplace\n\nIn support of an \u2018Intelligent Connected Workplace\u2019, Konica Minolta offers cloud, IT, managed print\nand video solution services for remote working, collaboration, workflow management and automation\nand security.\n\n][22]\n[\n[Professional Printing]\n\nProfessional Printing\n\nInnovative digital printing and inkjet solutions to expand your business\n\n][23]\n[\n[Healthcare]\n\nHealthcare\n\nContributing to the advancement of healthcare by promoting medical diagnostic imaging solutions\ncentered on X-ray, ultrasound, and medical information technologies, and by providing genetic\ndiagnostics and pharmaceutical services.\n\n][24]\n[\n[Measuring Instruments]\n\nMeasuring Instruments\n\nWe offer measuring instruments that make full use of our advanced optical technology to quantify\nlight and color with high reliability, and high value-added products and solutions for numerical\ncontrol of those properties.\n\n][25]\n[\n[Textile Printers]\n\nTextile Printers\n\nKonica Minolta's Nassenger Series Inkjet Textile Printing System has been gaining popularity as an\ninnovative printing system that meets the growing demand in industry for short-run production with\nenhanced design capability.\n\n][26]\n[\n[Materials & Components]\n\nMaterials & Components\n\nWe contribute to the advancement of input/output in industrial digitalization by offering the\nmaterials and components that are essential for a supply chain based on technology we have\naccumulated over the years.\n\n][27]\n[\n[Imaging IoT]\n\nImaging IoT\n\nKonica Minolta contributes to the achievement Search\nMI(EN)\n* Products\n* Solutions\n* Technical Service\n* Learning Centre\n* About us\n* Partners\n* [Contact us][1]\n* [Media Centre][2]\n* [Software][3]\n* [Instruction manuals][4]\n* [Blog][5]\n* # Measure Colour, Light, and Display Performance with Confidence\n  \n  Industry-leading solutions designed for precision, consistency, and reliable quality control\n  \n  [Explore Measurement Solutions][6]\n* CL-700A: A New Standard in Light Measurement\n  \n  High-precision spectral analysis designed for lighting professionals and researchers\n  \n  [View Product Details][7]\n  [CL-700A_Stadium_image_home_page_banner_2026]\n* Achieve Consistent Deep Black\n  \n  Analyse blackness, jetness, and undertone for reliable colour control and quality assurance.\n  \n  [Quantify the Nuances of Deep Black][8]\n* Simultaneous Colour and Gloss Measurement\n  \n  Evaluate colour and gloss together to increase efficiency and eliminate measurement\n  inconsistencies.\n  \n  [Discover the Benefit of 2-in-1 Spectrophotometers][9]\n\n## Welcome to Konica Minolta Sensing Europe\n\nI am interested in...\nI am looking for...\n[][10]\n[Get my instrument calibrated][11][Get in contact with us][12][Our events][13]\n\n##### Measuring Instruments from Konica Minolta Sensing\n\nFind an instrument for your measurement needs, whether measuring the colour of plastic parts, the\ncolour and gloss of a coating, the Lux values of a lighting installation or the colour and\nbrightness of a television.\n\nEach of our products is presented with key facts, specifications and a range of purpose designed\naccessories that enable you to achieve the most accurate and repeatable measurement data.\n\n[View our Products][14]\n[Spectrophotometers with different geometries]\n[CM-25cG Measuring Automotive Interior Leather]\n\n##### Find Measurement Solutions by Industry\n\nOur expert teams have implemented thousands of successful measuring instruments in a diverse range\nof industries ensuring that our customers can benefit from accurate and traceable data that can help\nthem to improve quality, reduce waste and cut costs.\n\nHere you can find solutions and example applications specific to your industry and sample types. Our\nteam will help you to find the right solution for your requirements.\n\n[Solutions by Industry][15]\n\n##### Instrument Service and Maintenance\n\nOur local service centres and field service technicians perform maintenance, repairs and traceable\ncalibration for Konica Minolta measuring instruments to ensure that customers measure traceable data\nall year round with a minimum of downtime.\n\nWe have a number of OEM certified facilities throughout Europe and the ability to offer ISO 17025\ncertifications at our main European Service Centre.\n\n[Maintenance and Calibration][16]\n[\n][17]\n\n### Latest news\n\n[\n\n##### Anniversary: 20 Years of Sensing\n\n11 May 2026\n\nFor two decades, local support and aftersales expertise has helped tens of thousands of customers to\nimprove the appearance quality & functionality of their products with repeatable measurements and\ntraceable data.\n][18]\n[\n[Radiant_vision_systems_merge_companies_web_page_2026]\n\n##### Expanding Global Sensing Solutions\n\n06 May 2026\n\nRadiant Vision Systems Merges with Konica Minolta Sensing Americas\n][19]\n[\n[Firmware_homepage_banner_01]\n\n##### Launch Proprietary Computer Colour Matching Software\n\n02 Apr 2026\n\nWe are launching a new Colour Matching Software this summer!\n][20]\n[All News][21]\n\n## Konica Minolta's business services\n\n[\n[Digital Workplace]\n\nDigital Workplace\n\nIn support of an \u2018Intelligent Connected Workplace\u2019, Konica Minolta offers cloud, IT, managed print\nand video solution services for remote working, collaboration, workflow management and automation\nand security.\n\n][22]\n[\n[Professional Printing]\n\nProfessional Printing\n\nInnovative digital printing and inkjet solutions to expand your business\n\n][23]\n[\n[Healthcare]\n\nHealthcare\n\nContributing to the advancement of healthcare by promoting medical diagnostic imaging solutions\ncentered on X-ray, ultrasound, and medical information technologies, and by providing genetic\ndiagnostics and pharmaceutical services.\n\n][24]\n[\n[Measuring Instruments]\n\nMeasuring Instruments\n\nWe offer measuring instruments that make full use of our advanced optical technology to quantify\nlight and color with high reliability, and high value-added products and solutions for numerical\ncontrol of those properties.\n\n][25]\n[\n[Textile Printers]\n\nTextile Printers\n\nKonica Minolta's Nassenger Series Inkjet Textile Printing System has been gaining popularity as an\ninnovative printing system that meets the growing demand in industry for short-run production with\nenhanced design capability.\n\n][26]\n[\n[Materials & Components]\n\nMaterials & Components\n\nWe contribute to the advancement of input/output in industrial digitalization by offering the\nmaterials and components that are essential for a supply chain based on technology we have\naccumulated over the years.\n\n][27]\n[\n[Imaging IoT]\n\nImaging IoT\n\nKonica Minolta contributes to the achievement of a safe and secure society to solve problems caused\nby labor shortages and aging of the population. We accomplish this by using our original imaging\nIoT/AI technology to provide no-contact and remote solutions in real-time.\n\n][28]\n[\n[Planetarium]\n\nPlanetarium\n\nA comprehensive manufacturer of planetariums. Konica Minolta Planetarium has engaged in the\ndevelopment and manufacturing of optical and digital planetarium equipment, and LED domes, as well\nas content production, sales, and distribution.\n\n][29]\n\nProduct Category\n\n[Colour Measurement][30][Gloss and Appearance Measurement][31][Light Cabinets][32][Light and Display\nMeasurement][33][Hyperspectral Imaging][34][Vision Quality Control][35][Graphic Arts][36]\n\nCorporate Information\n\n[About us][37][Where to buy][38][News][39][Newsletter subscription][40][Events][41]\n\nGlobal Information\n\n[Corporate Information][42][Company Overview][43][Business Units][44][Sustainability][45][Investor\nRelations][46][Research & Development][47]\n[Solutions per Industry][48][Service & Maintenance][49][Learn about Colour & Light][50][Download\nCatalogues][51]\n\nKonica Minolta Sensing Europe B.V.\n\nUK United Kingdom - 9 Webster Court, Westbrook Crescent, Gemini Business Park \u2013 WA5 8WD Warrington \u2013\nVAT No. GB883345500\n\n[Terms of Use][52]|\n\n[Privacy Policy][53]|\n\n[Imprint][54]|\n\nCookie settings|\n\n[EU Data Act][55]\n\n\u00a92026 Konica Minolta Sensing Europe B.V.\n\n[1]: /mi-en/contact\n[2]: /mi-en/media-centre\n[3]: https://www.konicaminolta.com/instruments/download/software/index.html\n[4]: https:/