        "crawl_text": "DRAG\n[[Sensorix]][1]\n\nAt Sensorix Automation, we specialize in providing high-quality sensors and control solutions to\nindustries across India. As authorized Channel Partners of global brands like SICK and Adel System,\nwe bring world-class technology to the Indian market. Our technical expertise and commitment to\ncustomer satisfaction make us the preferred choice for businesses seeking automation excellence.\n\n[[Sensorix Automation]][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Products][5]\n  * [Sick][6]\n  * [Adel System ][7]\n  * [Lenze][8]\n  * [Cables & Connector][9]\n  * [STS][10]\n  * [HTP][11]\n  * [Seg Lektra][12]\n* [Our Partners][13]\n* [Contact Us][14]\n* +91 9028039494\n* info@sensorixautomation.com\n[[Sensorix Automation]][15]\n* [Home][16]\n* [About Us][17]\n* [Products][18]\n  * [Sick][19]\n  * [Adel System ][20]\n  * [Lenze][21]\n  * [Cables & Connector][22]\n  * [Process Sensors][23]\n  * [Vision System][24]\n* [Our Partner][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\n[ Download Brochure ][27] [icon]\n[img]\n[img]\n[ [img] ][28]\n20 years of experience\nABOUT US\n\n## Why Choose Sensorix Automation\n\nWith over 20 years of experience in sensing and control solutions, Sensorix Automation is your\ntrusted partner for industrial automation products from globally recognized brands like SICK and\nAdel System. Our solutions help optimize manufacturing operations, enhance process accuracy, and\nensure reliable automation performance across industries.\n\n[img]\n\n#### Advanced Sensing Solutions\n\nHigh-precision sensors from world-class brands ensuring accuracy and reliability.\n\n[img]\n\n#### Industrial Automation Expertise\n\nExpertise in automating manufacturing processes with efficient and scalable systems.\n\n[img]\n\n#### Reliable Customer Support\n\nDedicated technical assistance and after-sales support for hassle-free operations.\n\n[ Discover More ][29]\n\n## Official Channel Partners in India\n\nAuthorized Channel Partner for **SICK**, **Adel System**, **LENZE**, **STS**, **HTP** and **SGM\nLEKTRA**\n\n[SICK Sensor Technology Partner]\n[Adel System Authorized Partner]\n[LENZE Automation Partner]\n[STS Sensor Technology]\n[HTP Industrial Connectors]\n[SGM Lektra Automation]\nServices We\u2019re Offering\n\n## Key Products & Solutions\n\n[[SICK Sensors]][30]\n\n### [SICK][31]\n\nAdvanced sensor solutions for factory, logistics, and process automation applications.\n\n[Read More ][32]\n[[STS Sensors]][33]\n\n### [STS][34]\n\nHigh-precision sensor solutions for industrial and submersible automation applications.\n\n[Read More ][35]\n[[Adel System Power Supply]][36]\n\n### [Adel System Power Supply][37]\n\nReliable power supply and backup solutions for industrial automation systems.\n\n[Read More ][38]\n[[SGM Lektra]][39]\n\n### [SGM Lektra][40]\n\nProcess and water management sensor solutions for accurate and reliable automation.\n\n[Read More ][41]\n[[HTP Connectors]][42]\n\n### [HTP Connectors][43]\n\nIndustrial connector solutions designed for reliable automation and connectivity.\n\n[Read More ][44]\n[[Lenze Drives]][45]\n\n### [Lenze][46]\n\nDrive, motion, and automation solutions for modern industrial systems.\n\n[Read More ][47]\nIndustries We Serve\n\n## Industry Applications\n\nOur solutions serve automotive, pharmaceuticals, food & beverage, and more industries efficiently.\n\n[Automotive]\n\n### Automotive\n\nAutomation solutions for efficient assembly and manufacturing processes.\n\n[Pharmaceuticals]\n\n### Pharmaceuticals\n\nAutomation ensures precision, safety, and efficiency in production processes.\n\n[Food & Beverage]\n\n### Food & Beverage\n\nAdvanced automation for safe, efficient food processing operations daily.\n\n[Logistics & Mobility]\n\n### Logistics & Mobility\n\nOptimizing supply chain and transport with smart automation solutions.\n\n[Electronics]\n\n### Electronics\n\nAutomation streamlines assembly lines and ensures quality in electronics.\n\n[Machine & Motion]\n\n### Machine & Motion\n\nPrecise automation solutions for machinery, robotics, and motion systems.\n\n[Consumer Goods]\n\n### Consumer Goods\n\nAutomation for packaging, labeling, and efficient product handling.\n\n[img]\n[img]\nWHY CHOOSE US\n\n## We Make Different Solutions For You\n\nWe revolutionize enterprises with cutting-edge technology and strategic digital solutions. Our\nmission is to empower businesses by elevating their online visibility and fostering audience\nengagement through customized digital services.\n\n[img]\n[img]\n\n#### Official Partnerships\n\nWe are the authorized Channel Partners for SICK and Adel System in India, guaranteeing genuine\nproducts and support.\n\n[img]\n\n#### Expertise You Can Trust\n\nBacked by decades of expertise, we deliver customized end-to-end automation solutions for your\nindustry needs.\n\n[img]\n\n#### Comprehensive Support\n\nFrom selection to after-sales service, we guarantee seamless integration and peak performance for\nevery product.\n\n[img]\n\n#### Nationwide Reach\n\nProviding exceptional service and prompt delivery across India, ensuring client satisfaction with\nevery solution.\n\n[ Unlock Your Full Potential ][48]\n[ [Call Us] ][49]\n[WhatsApp]\n\n##### Hi there! \ud83d\udc4b\n\n\u00d7\n\nFill ou DRAG\n[[Sensorix]][1]\n\nAt Sensorix Automation, we specialize in providing high-quality sensors and control solutions to\nindustries across India. As authorized Channel Partners of global brands like SICK and Adel System,\nwe bring world-class technology to the Indian market. Our technical expertise and commitment to\ncustomer satisfaction make us the preferred choice for businesses seeking automation excellence.\n\n[[Sensorix Automation]][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Products][5]\n  * [Sick][6]\n  * [Adel System ][7]\n  * [Lenze][8]\n  * [Cables & Connector][9]\n  * [STS][10]\n  * [HTP][11]\n  * [Seg Lektra][12]\n* [Our Partners][13]\n* [Contact Us][14]\n* +91 9028039494\n* info@sensorixautomation.com\n[[Sensorix Automation]][15]\n* [Home][16]\n* [About Us][17]\n* [Products][18]\n  * [Sick][19]\n  * [Adel System ][20]\n  * [Lenze][21]\n  * [Cables & Connector][22]\n  * [Process Sensors][23]\n  * [Vision System][24]\n* [Our Partner][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\n[ Download Brochure ][27] [icon]\n[img]\n[img]\n[ [img] ][28]\n20 years of experience\nABOUT US\n\n## Why Choose Sensorix Automation\n\nWith over 20 years of experience in sensing and control solutions, Sensorix Automation is your\ntrusted partner for industrial automation products from globally recognized brands like SICK and\nAdel System. Our solutions help optimize manufacturing operations, enhance process accuracy, and\nensure reliable automation performance across industries.\n\n[img]\n\n#### Advanced Sensing Solutions\n\nHigh-precision sensors from world-class brands ensuring accuracy and reliability.\n\n[img]\n\n#### Industrial Automation Expertise\n\nExpertise in automating manufacturing processes with efficient and scalable systems.\n\n[img]\n\n#### Reliable Customer Support\n\nDedicated technical assistance and after-sales support for hassle-free operations.\n\n[ Discover More ][29]\n\n## Official Channel Partners in India\n\nAuthorized Channel Partner for **SICK**, **Adel System**, **LENZE**, **STS**, **HTP** and **SGM\nLEKTRA**\n\n[SICK Sensor Technology Partner]\n[Adel System Authorized Partner]\n[LENZE Automation Partner]\n[STS Sensor Technology]\n[HTP Industrial Connectors]\n[SGM Lektra Automation]\nServices We\u2019re Offering\n\n## Key Products & Solutions\n\n[[SICK Sensors]][30]\n\n### [SICK][31]\n\nAdvanced sensor solutions for factory, logistics, and process automation applications.\n\n[Read More ][32]\n[[STS Sensors]][33]\n\n### [STS][34]\n\nHigh-precision sensor solutions for industrial and submersible automation applications.\n\n[Read More ][35]\n[[Adel System Power Supply]][36]\n\n### [Adel System Power Supply][37]\n\nReliable power supply and backup solutions for industrial automation systems.\n\n[Read More ][38]\n[[SGM Lektra]][39]\n\n### [SGM Lektra][40]\n\nProcess and water management sensor solutions for accurate and reliable automation.\n\n[Read More ][41]\n[[HTP Connectors]][42]\n\n### [HTP Connectors][43]\n\nIndustrial connector solutions designed for reliable automation and connectivity.\n\n[Read More ][44]\n[[Lenze Drives]][45]\n\n### [Lenze][46]\n\nDrive, motion, and automation solutions for modern industrial systems.\n\n[Read More ][47]\nIndustries We Serve\n\n## Industry Applications\n\nOur solutions serve automotive, pharmaceuticals, food & beverage, and more industries efficiently.\n\n[Automotive]\n\n### Automotive\n\nAutomation solutions for efficient assembly and manufacturing processes.\n\n[Pharmaceuticals]\n\n### Pharmaceuticals\n\nAutomation ensures precision, safety, and efficiency in production processes.\n\n[Food & Beverage]\n\n### Food & Beverage\n\nAdvanced automation for safe, efficient food processing operations daily.\n\n[Logistics & Mobility]\n\n### Logistics & Mobility\n\nOptimizing supply chain and transport with smart automation solutions.\n\n[Electronics]\n\n### Electronics\n\nAutomation streamlines assembly lines and ensures quality in electronics.\n\n[Machine & Motion]\n\n### Machine & Motion\n\nPrecise automation solutions for machinery, robotics, and motion systems.\n\n[Consumer Goods]\n\n### Consumer Goods\n\nAutomation for packaging, labeling, and efficient product handling.\n\n[img]\n[img]\nWHY CHOOSE US\n\n## We Make Different Solutions For You\n\nWe revolutionize enterprises with cutting-edge technology and strategic digital solutions. Our\nmission is to empower businesses by elevating their online visibility and fostering audience\nengagement through customized digital services.\n\n[img]\n[img]\n\n#### Official Partnerships\n\nWe are the authorized Channel Partners for SICK and Adel System in India, guaranteeing genuine\nproducts and support.\n\n[img]\n\n#### Expertise You Can Trust\n\nBacked by decades of expertise, we deliver customized end-to-end automation solutions for your\nindustry needs.\n\n[img]\n\n#### Comprehensive Support\n\nFrom selection to after-sales service, we guarantee seamless integration and peak performance for\nevery product.\n\n[img]\n\n#### Nationwide Reach\n\nProviding exceptional service and prompt delivery across India, ensuring client satisfaction with\nevery solution.\n\n[ Unlock Your Full Potential ][48]\n[ [Call Us] ][49]\n[WhatsApp]\n\n##### Hi there! \ud83d\udc4b\n\n\u00d7\n\nFill out the form below to start a conversation with us on WhatsApp.\n\nYour Name\nMobile Number\nService\nStart Chat\n\n##### Hi there! \ud83d\udc4b\n\n\u00d7\n\nFill out the form below to start a conversation with us on WhatsApp.\n\nYour Name\nMobile Number\nService\nStart Chat\nOur Location\nPune\n[ Pressure Transmitter ][50]\n[ Radar Level Sensor ][51]\n[ Level Switch ][52]\n[ Photoelectric Sensor ][53]\n[ Rotary Encoder ][54]\n[ Machine Vision Camera ][55]\n[ Ultrasonic Sensors ][56]\n[ VFD Drive ][57]\n[ Servo Motors ][58]\n[ Servo Controller ][59]\n[ Sensor Cable ][60]\n[ Linear Transducer ][61]\n[ Industrial Power Supply ][62]\n[ Safety Area Sensor ][63]\n[ Safety Light Curtain ][64]\nIndia\n[ Pressure Transmitter ][65]\n[ Radar Level Sensor ][66]\n[ Level Switch ][67]\n[ Rotary Encoder ][68]\n[ Machine Vision Camera ][69]\n[ VFD Drive ][70]\n[ Servo Motors ][71]\n[ Servo Controller ][72]\n[ Sensor Cable ][73]\n[ Linear Transducer ][74]\n[ Industrial Power Supply ][75]\n\n### Registered Office\n\n[img]\n\n[+91 9028039494][76]\n\n[+91 9175650232 ][77]\n\n[img]\n\n[info@sensorixautomation.com][78]\n\n[pravin@sensorixautomation.com][79]\n\n[sales@sensorixautomation.com ][80]\n\n[img]\n\n** **403, Crystal Royal No. 39/11 Dalvi Nagar Katraj-Narhe Road, Ambegaon Bk, Katraj,Pune,\nMaharashtra 411046, India\n\n\n### Branch office & Warehouse\n\n[img]\n\n[+91 9028039494][81]\n\n[+91 9175650232 ][82]\n\n[img]\n\n[info@sensorixautomation.com][83]\n\n[pravin@sensorixautomation.c