n    * [Testimonials][55]\n    * [Spec News][56]\n    * [Careers][57]\n    * [Social Media][58]\n    * [Trade Shows][59]\n    * [Press Releases][60]\n* [ Resource Center ][61]\n  * * [Document Library][62]\n    * [Video Library][63]\n    * [Tech Support][64]\n    * [SpecConnect Plans][65]\n    * [Software][66]\n    * [Firmware][67]\n    * [Station Recertification][68]\n    * [If Plants Could Talk][69]\n    * [FAQ's][70]\n* [ Contact Us ][71]\n  * * [Warranty/Returns][72]\n    * [Shipping][73]\n    * [Terms of Use][74]\n    * [Privacy Policy][75]\n    * [Conflict Minerals Policy][76]\nGo\nGo\n[[FieldScout Cell Phone Holder]][77]\n\n# NEW!\u00a0 fieldscout cell phone holder for soil meters\u00a0\u00a0\n\n## Model 6050\n\n**The FieldScout\u00ae cell phone holder offers better data visualization while taking measurements at\nthe course or the field.**\n\nTired of reaching into your pocket after reading VWC or soil compaction? Our phone holder is\ndesigned to put the power of the FieldScout mobile app where it belongs... right in front of you.\nVisualize your data and interact with the current session on your connected phone, completely\nhands-free so you can focus on your data collection.\n* Designed to install securely on **FieldScout TDR 350** or **SC 950** soil meters\n* Using the FieldScout mobile app while taking measurements is now easier and more powerful\n* Cell phone mount includes a quick release and allows phone to be secured at the desired viewing\n  angle\n\n[Details][78][Quick Start Guide][79][Brochure][80]\n\n### This Product Is An Accessory For:\n\n[View All][81]\n[[FIELDSCOUT TDR 350 SOIL MOISTURE METER (CASE INCLUDED)]][82]\n[Doc Green Recommended]\nWatchDog Weather Stations\u00a0\u25bc\n\n### WatchDog Weather Stations\n\nTrack environmental conditions, view data on mobile device or computer, run reports and set weather\nalerts.\n\n[WatchDog Weather Stations]\n[View More Products][83]\n[[3000 SERIES - WATCHDOG WIRELESS ET WEATHER STATION (LTE-CAT4) (TEMP, RH, RAIN, WIND, SOLAR\nRADIATION/ET, +1 PORT)]][84]\n[**3000 SERIES - WATCHDOG WIRELESS ET WEATHER STATION (LTE-CAT4) (TEMP, RH, RAIN, WIND, SOLAR\nRADIATION/ET, +1 PORT)**][85]\n*Item #: 3250C4*\n[[3000 SERIES - WATCHDOG WIRELESS TEMP/RH STATION (LTE-M) (TEMP, RH, +2 PORT)]][86]\n[**3000 SERIES - WATCHDOG WIRELESS TEMP/RH STATION (LTE-M) (TEMP, RH, +2 PORT)**][87]\n*Item #: 3210MU*\n[[3000 SERIES - WATCHDOG WIRELESS ET WEATHER STATION (LTE-CAT4) (TEMP, RH, RAIN, WIND, SOLAR\nRADIATION/ET, +5 PORTS)]][88]\n[**3000 SERIES - WATCHDOG WIRELESS ET WEATHER STATION (LTE-CAT4) (TEMP, RH, RAIN, WIND, SOLAR\nRADIATION/ET, +1 PORT)**][89]\n*Item #: 3550C4*\n[[2000 SERIES - WATCHDOG 2475 MINI PLANT GROWTH STATION]][90]\n[**2000 SERIES - WATCHDOG 2475 MINI PLANT GROWTH STATION**][91]\n*Item #: 3686WDS*\n[[3000 SERIES - WATCHDOG WIRELESS ET WEATHER STATION (DATA RECORDER - NO MODEM) (TEMP, RH, RAIN,\nWIND, SOLAR RADIATION/ET, +1 PORT)]][92]\n[**3000 SERIES - WATCHDOG WIRELESS ET WEATHER STATION (DATA RECORDER - NO MODEM) (TEMP, RH, RAIN,\nWIND, SOLAR RADIATION/ET, +1 PORT)**][93]\n*Item #: 3250DR*\nFieldScout Soil Meters\u00a0\u25bc\n\n### FieldScout Soil Meters\n\nSpot-check VWC%, EC and Temperat **Javascript is disabled on your browser.**\nTo view this site, you must enable JavaScript or upgrade to a JavaScript-capable browser.\nGROW SMARTER WITH SPECTRUM ~ Doc Green\n[[Spectrum Technologies, Inc.]][1]\n* ##### Site Settings\n  \n  Select a Language English French Spanish German Japanese Korean Portuguese Chinese\n* [ Quick Order ][2]\n* [ Login ][3]\n* |\n* [ Sign Up ][4]\n[ 0 ][5]\n[ Your cart is empty ][6]\n* [ Home ][7]\n* [ Products ][8]\n  * * [Weather Monitoring][9]\n      * [Weather Stations][10]\n        * [4000 Series Mini Stations][11]\n        * [3000 Series Full Stations][12]\n        * [LoRa Wireless Stations][13]\n        * [2000 Series Mini Stations][14]\n        * [1000 Series Micro Stations][15]\n        * [A Series Data Loggers][16]\n        * [B Series 