rared Optical Filters are designed to meet both Indian as\nwell as international quality norms. We have a huge business network that is spread in every nook\nand corner of the world. Moreover, serving quality products have also enabled us in acquiring strong\nfoothold in the market of U.S.A., U.K., Australia, Brazil and Canada.\n\n[Know More][85]\n\n### [Vision][86]\n\nUniversal Optics envisions becoming a globally recognized name synonymous with precision optics\ncomponents, driven by technological advancements, customer-centric approach, and a passion for\nexcellence.\n\n### [Mission][87]\n\nOur mission is to provide cutting-edge precision optics components that empower our customers to\nexcel in their respective industries. We are committed to delivering the highest quality products\nand services while fostering a culture of continuous improvement and customer satisfaction.\n\n### [Core Values][88]\n\nQuality: We maintain uncompromising quality standards in our products, ensuring optimal performance,\ndurability, and reliability for our customers. Integrity: Upholding the highest ethical standards in\nall our operations, we foster trust and transpa * [9897152595][1] / [9837039970][2]\n* [info@universaloptics.co.in][3] / [uniopt@hotmail.com][4]\nFollow us on:\n* [Home Page][5]\n* [About Us][6]\n  * [Company Overview][7]\n  * [Vision & Mission][8]\n  * [Founder's Message][9]\n  * [Proprietor's Message][10]\n  * [Our Certification][11]\n* [Products][12]\n  * #### [Lenses][13]\n  * [Plano Convex Lens][14]\n  * [Double Convex Lens][15]\n  * [Plano Concave Lens][16]\n  * [Double Concave Lens][17]\n  * [Positive Meniscus Lens][18]\n  * [Negative Meniscus Lens][19]\n  * [Plano Convex Cylindrical Lens][20]\n  * [Plano Concave Cylindrical Lens][21]\n  * [Positive Achromatic Lens][22]\n  * [Negative Achromatic Lens][23]\n  * [Cylindrical Achromatics Lens][24]\n  * #### [Prisms][25]\n  * [Right Angle Prisms][26]\n  * [Dove Prisms][27]\n  * [Penta Prisms][28]\n  * [Equilatera