        "crawl_text": "[Skip to content][1]\n* [ Register ][2]\n* [Login][3]\n* [ Basket 0 items - \u00a30.00 ][4]\n* [ Quote][5]\n* [ Search ][6]\n[currency flag GBP] [currency flag EUR] [currency flag USD]\n[[currency flag select GBP]][7] [[currency flag select EUR]][8] [[currency flag select USD]][9]\n[ [UQG Optics] ][10]\n\nSuppliers of Custom and Stock Optics\n\n[ \u00a0\u00a0+44 (0) 1223 420329 ][11]\n\n[ \u00a0\u00a0sales@uqgoptics.com ][12]\n* [Custom][13]\n* [Products][14]\n  * [Optical Windows][15]\n  * [Technical Glasses][16]\n  * [Laboratory][17]\n  * [Optical Filters][18]\n  * [Optical Lenses][19]\n  * [Optical Mirrors][20]\n  * [Optical Prisms][21]\n* [Services][22]\n  * [Optical Assembly][23]\n  * [Glass Dicing][24]\n  * [Glass Polishing & Lapping][25]\n  * [Glass Grinding & Cutting Services][26]\n  * [Optical Coatings][27]\n  * [Custom Optical Components][28]\n* [Optical Components][29]\n* [Materials][30]\n* [Quality][31]\n  * [ISO Quality Statement][32]\n  * [Testing and Quality Control][33]\n  * [RoHS and REACH Compliance][34]\n  * [Cyber Essentials Certified][35]\n  * [JOSCAR Accredited][36]\n* [About][37]\n  * [History][38]\n  * [UQG Team][39]\n  * [R&D Optics][40]\n  * [OEM Optics][41]\n  * [Our Charity][42]\n* [Industries][43]\n  * [Defence & Aerospace][44]\n  * [Electronics & Optoelectronics][45]\n  * [Engineering & Industrial Manufacturing][46]\n  * [Entertainment & Design Lighting][47]\n  * [Instrumentation][48]\n  * [Medical][49]\n  * [Oil & Gas][50]\n  * [University & Research Centers][51]\n* [Blog][52]\n* [Contact][53]\n  * [Customer Support][54]\n\nUQG Optics is based in the heart of the Cambridge Scientific community. With over 70 years supplying\nhigh quality Optics, Optical Components and Technical Glasses to Science and Industry.\n\n# Custom Made & Stock Optics\n\n### Optical Components & Glasses\n\n[View Products][55]\n[Get in touch][56]\n\n**UQG Optics is an independent UK optical company, supplying custom made optical components and a\nstandard stock range. Supplied in OEM/Production, batch runs and R&D quantities. We have an in-house\nmanufacturing facility and a team sourcing optical products from certified suppliers around the\nworld, delivering high quality competitive products.**\n\nAll products supplied are certified and fully inspected by our quality control and metrology\ndepartment.\n\nWe supply globally, direct to over 50 countries from our site in Cambridge in the UK. Please contact\nour sales team who will offer you a rapid response to your enquiries, as well as free technical\nadvice.\n\n[Optics for OEMs][57] \u00a0 [Optics for R&D][58]\n\n[about us][59]\n\n## [**Optical Components**][60]\n\nPrecision custom optics for your specific design needs. Whether for R&D projects or OEMs, our\noptical engineers provide world-class expertise with a collaborative approach. We provide custom\noptical solutions across optical windows, filters, lenses, prisms, and technical glasses.\n\n\u00a0\n\n[Browse Custom][61]\n\n## **Optical Services and Capabilities**\u00a0\n\nUQG have extensive production capabilities offering a range of services to our customers optical\ncomponents, materials and glasses.\n\n[services][62]\n* [\n  [Opitcal Components Assembly][Opitcal Components Assembly]\n  \n  ## Optical Assembly Services\n  \n  ][63]\n* [\n  [Glass Dicing Services][Glass Dicing Services]\n  \n  ## Glass Dicing\n  \n  ][64]\n* [\n  [Glass Polishing and Lapping Services][Glass Polishing and Lapping Services]\n  \n  ## Glass Polishing & Lapping\n  \n  ][65]\n* [\n  [Optical Glass Grinding and Cutting][Optical Glass Grinding and Cutting]\n  \n  ## Glass Grinding & Cutting Services\n  \n  ][66]\n* [\n  [Optical Coatings Services][Optical Coatings Services]\n  \n  ## Optical Coatings\n  \n  ][67]\n* [\n  [Optical Components Made to Custom Specifications][Optical Components Made to Custom\n  Specifications]\n  \n  ## Custom Optical Components\n  \n  ][68]\n\n## Product Ranges\n\nPlease use the menu below to explore our custom and stock range of optical products and components.\n* [\n  [Custom Optical Windows][Custom Optical Windows]\n  \n  ## Optical Windows\n  \n  ][69]\n* [\n  [Custom Technical Glasses Products][Custom Technical Glasses Products]\n  \n  ## Technical Glasses\n  \n  ][70]\n* [\n  [Laboratory Custom Optical Components][Laboratory Custom Optical Components]\n  \n  ## Laboratory\n  \n  ][71]\n* [\n  [Custom Optical Filters][Custom Optical Filters]\n  \n  ## Optical Filters\n  \n  ][72]\n* [\n  [Custom Optical Lenses][Custom Optical Lenses]\n  \n  ## Optical Lenses\n  \n  ][73]\n* [\n  [Custom Optical Mirrors][Custom Optical Mirrors]\n  \n  ## Optical Mirrors\n  \n  ][74]\n* [\n  [Custom Optical Prisms][Custom Optical Prisms]\n  \n  ## Optical Prisms\n  \n  ][75]\n\n## News & Information\n\nThe latest news and insights from the UQG Optics team.\n\n[ [Designing optical filters for spectroscopy][Designing optical filters for spectroscopy] ][76]\n\n### [Key Parameters to Consider When Designing Optical Filters for Spectroscopy][77]\n\n[ Read more][78]\n[ [step-by-step-guide-to-choosing-the-right-window][step-by-step-guide-to-choosing-the-right-window]\n][79]\n\n### [A Step-by-Step Guide to Choosing the Right Optical Window for Y [Skip to content][1]\n* [ Register ][2]\n* [Login][3]\n* [ Basket 0 items - \u00a30.00 ][4]\n* [ Quote][5]\n* [ Search ][6]\n[currency flag GBP] [currency flag EUR] [currency flag USD]\n[[currency flag select GBP]][7] [[currency flag select EUR]][8] [[currency flag select USD]][9]\n[ [UQG Optics] ][10]\n\nSuppliers of Custom and Stock Optics\n\n[ \u00a0\u00a0+44 (0) 1223 420329 ][11]\n\n[ \u00a0\u00a0sales@uqgoptics.com ][12]\n* [Custom][13]\n* [Products][14]\n  * [Optical Windows][15]\n  * [Technical Glasses][16]\n  * [Laboratory][17]\n  * [Optical Filters][18]\n  * [Optical Lenses][19]\n  * [Optical Mirrors][20]\n  * [Optical Prisms][21]\n* [Services][22]\n  * [Optical Assembly][23]\n  * [Glass Dicing][24]\n  * [Glass Polishing & Lapping][25]\n  * [Glass Grinding & Cutting Services][26]\n  * [Optical Coatings][27]\n  * [Custom Optical Components][28]\n* [Optical Components][29]\n* [Materials][30]\n* [Quality][31]\n  * [ISO Quality Statement][32]\n  * [Testing and Quality Control][33]\n  * [RoHS and REACH Compliance][34]\n  * [Cyber Essentials Certified][35]\n  * [JOSCAR Accredited][36]\n* [About][37]\n  * [History][38]\n  * [UQG Team][39]\n  * [R&D Optics][40]\n  * [OEM Optics][41]\n  * [Our Charity][42]\n* [Industries][43]\n  * [Defence & Aerospace][44]\n  * [Electronics & Optoelectronics][45]\n  * [Engineering & Industrial Manufacturing][46]\n  * [Entertainment & Design Lighting][47]\n  * [Instrumentation][48]\n  * [Medical][49]\n  * [Oil & Gas][50]\n  * [University & Research Centers][51]\n* [Blog][52]\n* [Contact][53]\n  * [Customer Support][54]\n\nUQG Optics is based in the heart of the Cambridge Scientific community. With over 70 years supplying\nhigh quality Optics, Optical Components and Technical Glasses to Science and Industry.\n\n# Custom Made & Stock Optics\n\n### Optical Components & Glasses\n\n[View Products][55]\n[Get in touch][56]\n\n**UQG Optics is an independent UK optical company, supplying custom made optical components and a\nstandard stock range. Supplied in OEM/Production, batch runs and R&D quantities. We have an in-house\nmanufacturing facility and a team sourcing optical products from certified suppliers around the\nworld, delivering high quality competitive products.**\n\nAll products supplied are certified and fully inspected by our quality control and metrology\ndepartment.\n\nWe supply globally, direct to over 50 countries from our site in Cambridge in the UK. Please contact\nour sales team who will offer you a rapid response to your enquiries, as well as free technical\nadvice.\n\n[Optics for OEMs][57] \u00a0 [Optics for R&D][58]\n\n[about us][59]\n\n## [**Optical Components**][60]\n\nPrecision custom optics for your specific design needs. Whether for R&D projects or OEMs, our\noptical engineers provide world-class expertise with a collaborative approach. We provide custom\noptical solutions across optical windows, filters, lenses, prisms, and technical glasses.\n\n\u00a0\n\n[Browse Custom][61]\n\n## **Optical Services and Capabilities**\u00a0\n\nUQG have extensive production capabilities offering a range of services to our customers optical\ncomponents, materials and glasses.\n\n[services][62]\n* [\n  [Opitcal Components Assembly][Opitcal Components Assembly]\n  \n  ## Optical Assembly Services\n  \n  ][63]\n* [\n  [Glass Dicing Services][Glass Dicing Services]\n  \n  ## Glass Dicing\n  \n  ][64]\n* [\n  [Glass Polishing and Lapping Services][Glass Polishing and Lapping Services]\n  \n  ## Glass Polishing & Lapping\n  \n  ][65]\n* [\n  [Optical Glass Grinding and Cutting][Optical Glass Grinding and Cutting]\n  \n  ## Glass Grinding & Cutting Services\n  \n  ][66]\n* [\n  [Optical Coatings Services][Optical Coatings Services]\n  \n  ## Optical Coatings\n  \n  ][67]\n* [\n  [Optical Components Made to Custom Specifications][Optical Components Made to Custom\n  Specifications]\n  \n  ## Custom Optical Components\n  \n  ][68]\n\n## Product Ranges\n\nPlease use the menu below to explore our custom and stock range of optical products and components.\n* [\n  [Custom Optical Windows][Custom Optical Windows]\n  \n  ## Optical Windows\n  \n  ][69]\n* [\n  [Custom Technical Glasses Products][Custom Technical Glasses Products]\n  \n  ## Technical Glasses\n  \n  ][70]\n* [\n  [Laboratory Custom Optical Components][Laboratory Custom Optical Components]\n  \n  ## Laboratory\n  \n  ][71]\n* [\n  [Custom Optical Filters][Custom Optical Filters]\n  \n  ## Optical Filters\n  \n  ][72]\n* [\n  [Custom Optical Lenses][Custom Optical Lenses]\n  \n  ## Optical Lenses\n  \n  ][73]\n* [\n  [Custom Optical Mirrors][Custom Optical Mirrors]\n  \n  ## Optical Mirrors\n  \n  ][74]\n* [\n  [Custom Optical Prisms][Custom Optical Prisms]\n  \n  ## Optical Prisms\n  \n  ][75]\n\n## News & Information\n\nThe latest news and insights from the UQG Optics team.\n\n[ [Designing optical filters for spectroscopy][Designing optical filters for spectroscopy] ][76]\n\n### [Key Parameters to Consider When Designing Optical Filters for Spectroscopy][77]\n\n[ Read more][78]\n[ [step-by-step-guide-to-choosing-the-right-window][step-by-step-guide-to-choosing-the-right-window]\n][79]\n\n### [A Step-by-Step Guide to Choosing the Right Optical Window for Your Project][80]\n\n[ Read more][81]\n[ [Why Chalcogenide is the new go to][Why Chalcogenide is the new go to] ][82]\n\n### [Why Chalcogenide Is the New Go\u2011To Material for Infrared Optics][83]\n\n[ Read more][84]\n\n[See all][85]\n\nWelcome to **UQG Optics**! It looks like you are visiting from the US. Select your preferred\ncurrency below to see appropriate pricing. [Contact us][86] for additional support or to discuss\nspecific requirements.\n\n[[currency flag select]][87] [[currency flag select]][88] [[currency flag select]][89]\n\nWelcome to **UQG Optics**! It looks like you are visiting from outside the UK. Select your preferred\ncurrency below to see appropriate pricing. [Contact us][90] for additional support or to discuss\nspecific requirements.\n\n[[currency flag select]][91] [[currency flag select]][92] [[currency flag select]][93]\n\n### Give us a call...\n\nIf you cannot find what you are looking for, please contact us\n\n[+00 44 (0) 1223 420329][94]\u00a0\u00a0|\u00a0\u00a0[info@uqgoptics.com][95]\u00a0\u00a0|\u00a0\u00a0[sales@uqgoptics.com][96]\n\n**UQG Ltd\n**The Norman Industrial Estate\n99 \u2013 101 Cambridge Road\nMilton, Cambridge CB24 6AT\nEngland\n\nEmail\u00a0[info@uqgoptics.com][97]\nEmail\u00a0[sales@uqgoptics.com][98]\nTel +44 (0) 1223 420329\nFax +44 (0) 1223 420506\n\n[\u00a0\u00a0Join our newsletter][99]\n* [Delivery Prices][100]\n* [Returns Policy][101]\n* [Privacy Policy][102]\n* [Terms & Conditions][103]\n* [Cookie Policy][104]\n\nFollow us..