        "crawl_text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[ [Vision Optics Logo] [Vision Optics Logo] [Vision Optics Logo] ][2]\nSearch for:\n* [Home][3]\n* [About][4]\n* [Products][5]\n  * [Lenses][6]\n  * [Prisms][7]\n  * [Optical Filters][8]\n  * [Mirrors][9]\n  * [Beamsplitters][10]\n  * [Optical Assemblies][11]\n* [Technologies][12]\n* [Resources][13]\n  * [Light Reading][14]\n  * [Case Studies][15]\n* [News][16]\n* [Contact][17]\n* [Home][18]\n* [About][19]\n* [Products][20]\n  * [Lenses][21]\n  * [Prisms][22]\n  * [Optical Filters][23]\n  * [Mirrors][24]\n  * [Beamsplitters][25]\n  * [Optical Assemblies][26]\n* [Technologies][27]\n* [Resources][28]\n  * [Light Reading][29]\n  * [Case Studies][30]\n* [News][31]\n* [Contact][32]\nSearch for:\nLoading...\n* # Welcome To Vision Optics\nHome[Vision Optics][33]2024-08-24T08:39:40+00:00\n[[arrow]][34]\n\n### **Welcome to Vision Optics. We specialise in supplying high quality optical components: lenses,\n### mirrors, prisms, filters and optical design services including custom optics and assemblies.**\n\n#### QUALITY\n\nWe offer the finest surface finishes, superior coatings and exceptional accuracy. As manufacturers\nof high performing stereo microscopes, we understand the importance of high quality optical\ncomponents.\n\n#### COMPETITIVE PRICING\n\nOur industry knowledge and innovative manufacturing processes enable us offer high quality optical\ncomponents at competitive prices, even for custom-built components and small trial orders.\n\n#### EXPERTISE & SERVICE\n\nAs a global company with expertise in the optics industry, we can support your business and provide\nan exceptional one-to-one customer service; giving the performance you require and exceeding your\nexpectations.\n\n### DEDICATED OPTICS DIVISION\n\nVision Engineering has developed extensive experience and infrastructure to support our business\nrequirement for high quality optics. The formation of a dedicated Vision Optics division enables\ncustomers to benefit from our expertise in quality optics \u2013 while at the same time benefiting from\nexceptional pricing.\n\nVision Engineering has offices throughout Europe, North America and Asia to ensure the highest level\nof quality and customer service are attained, wherever you are located.\n\n## Contact Us\n\nTo request a quote or for further information.\n\n[Contact Us][35]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2025 Vision Engineering Ltd\n\nISO 9001:2015 Quality Management\n\nGB EORI Number 211325814000\n\n#### Products\n* [ Lenses][36]\n* [ Prisms][37]\n* [ Optical Filters][38]\n* [ Mirrors][39]\n* [ Beamsplitters][40]\n* [ Optical Assemblies][41]\n\n#### USEFUL LINKS\n* [ Sitemap][42]\n* [ News][43]\n* [ Case Studies][44]\n* [ Light Reading][45]\n* [ FAQs][46]\n\n#### Contact UK\n\nThe Freeman Building, Send, Woking, Surrey, GU23 7ER.\n\n\n#### Contact USA\n\n570 Danbury Road, New Milford, CT 06776, USA\n* [Privacy Policy][47]\n* [Terms of Use][48]\n* [Cookies][49]\n\n[Page load link][50]\n\nWe are using cookies to give you the best experience on our website.\n\nYou can find out more about which cookies we are using or switch them off in settings.\n\nAccept Reject\nClose GDPR Cookie Settings\n* Privacy Overview\n* Strictly Necessary Cookies\n* Cookie Policy\n[Powered by\u00a0 GDPR Cookie Compliance][51]\nPrivacy Overview\n\nThis website uses cookies so that we can provide you with the best user experience possible. Cookie\ninformation is stored in your browser and performs functions such as recognising you when you return\nto our website and helping our team to understand which sections of the website you find most\ninteresting and useful.\n\n\u00a0\n\nStrictly Necessary Cookies\n\nStrictly Necessary Cookie should be enabled at all times so that we can save your preferences for\ncookie settings.\n\nEnable or Disable Cookies Enabled Disabled\nCookie Policy\n\nMore information about our [Cookie Policy][52]\n\nEnable All Save Settings\n[ Go to Top ][53]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.vopti