        "crawl_text": "Instructions\nTo make this component work follow these steps:\n1. Remove the delete-this-class class from the navbar14_component div. This will change the\n   positioning of the navbar to fixed.\n2. Add the navbar-on-page class to the page-wrapper class. This will ensure that the navbar is\n   centered on the page.\n3. Add the max-width-full class to the main-wrapper class. This will ensure all sections inside of\n   the main wrapper are full-wdith.\n[Products][1]\n[Hyperspectral imagery][2][\nArchive\n][3][\nOpen Data\n][4]\n[Technology][5]\n[Industries][6]\n[Agriculture][7][Peace and security][8][Forestry and ESG][9][Energy][10][Mining][11]\nCompany\n[About us][12][Join us][13]\nResources\n[Resource library][14][Knowledge centre][15][\nKnowledge Centre\n][16][\nProduct Guide\n][17][\nOpen Data\n][18][Product guide][19][Open data][20]\n[Partners][21]\n[\nContact Us\n][22][\nOrder imagery\n][23]\n\n# Beyond vision. Into spectral intelligence.\n\n# See every detail, solve any problem.\n\nReveal critical information, track changes quickly, and transform the way you respond\u2014powered by the\nhighest-resolution hyperspectral imaging.\n\n[Explore our imagery][24][\nTalk to sales\n][25]\n\n# Beyond vision. Into spectral intelligence.\n\n# See every detail, solve any problem.\n\nReveal critical information, track changes quickly, and transform the way you respond\u2014powered by the\nhighest-resolution hyperspectral imaging.\n\n[Explore our imagery][26][\nTalk to sales\n][27]\nImportant:\nIf you rename this component, remember to update the classes in the HTML embed named\nlayout423_hover-content. Background colors for cards are controlled by selecting the card element\nand editing via the Interactions tab.\nApplications\n\n## Data for decisive action\n\nOur hyperspectral imagery is helping vital industries reduce risk, optimize resources, and unlock\nsolutions to the world\u2019s toughest challenges.\n\n[\n\n### Agriculture\n\nClassify crops with precision, detect disease early, and accurately forecast yields.\n\nLearn more\n][28][\n\n### Peace and security\n\nEnhance detection, identification, and monitoring in complex environments.\n\nLearn more\n][29][\n\n### Forestry and ESG\n\nMap species, monitor forest health, and stop threats before they become widespread.\n\nLearn more\n][30][\n\n### Energy\n\nRapidly map and analyze resources, reduce infrastructure downtime, and speed remediation.\n\nLearn more\n][31][\n\n### Mining\n\nReduce costs and improve safety from early exploration to post\u2011closure rehabilitation.\n\nLearn more\n][32]\nOur Technology\n\n## Unprecedented precision\n\nWyvern\u2019s hyperspectral imaging identifies materials and detect subtle environmental shifts with\nincredible accuracy.\n\nIndustry-leading 5.3 metres ground sampling distance at nadir\n\n31-band VNIR imagery\n\nResearch-grade calibration and atmospheric correction\n\nFrequent revisit with global, 5-satellite coverage\n\nFlexible tasking capabilities\n\n[\nExplore our imagery\n][33]\nThe Wyvern Advantage\n\n## We\u2019re up for the task\n\nWyvern launched the world\u2019s first commercial hyperspectral satellites in 2023, making the\nhighest-resolution hyperspectral imaging available at scale.\n\n### Our products\n\n### Our company\n\n### Our technology\n\n### Delivering commercial data now\n\nWe\u2019re the only commercial provider with a \u00a0ready-to-task constellation, and ample imagery available\nthrough our growing archive and open data program.\n\n[\nExplore Our imagery\n][34]\nImage credit: AAC Clyde Space\n\n### Hyperspectral for all\n\nWe focus solely on making the highest-quality hyperspectral imaging accessible and easy to use,\nempowering more people to build a sustainable future.\n\n[\nExplore Our company\n][35]\nImage credit: Loft Orbital\n\n### Trusted worldwide\n\nProudly Canadian, organizations depend on us for steady partnership, and reliable, secure data\nthat\u2019s proving its value across the planet.\n\n[\nExplore Our technology\n][36]\n\n## Trusted by teams shaping the future\n\nCompany news\n\n## The latest from wyvern\n\n[\nView all\n][37]\n[\n\n### Dragonete-004 hyperspectral intelligence from Orbit\n\nnews\nNov 6, 2025\n][38]\n[\n\n### Wyvern and Nara Space partner to expand access to hyperspectral data across Asia\n\nnews\nSep 29, 2025\n][39]\n[\n\n### Open Data Program feature: Harmful algal bloom detection with Wyvern hyperspectral imagery\n\nInsight\nJun 23, 2025\n][40]\n[\n\n### Celebrating Earth Day at Wyvern\n\nNews\nApr 22, 2025\n][41]\n[\n\n### Dragonete-004 hyperspectral intelligence from Orbit\n\nnews\nNov 6, 2025\n][42]\n[\n\n### Wyvern and Nara Space partner to expand access to hyperspectral data across Asia\n\nnews\nSep 29, 2025\n][43]\n[\nView all\n][44]\n[\n\n### Hyperspectral imaging for military surveillance: airborne vs satellite\n\nInsights\nJun 25, 2026\n][45][\n\n### Hyperspectral imaging for military surveillance: airborne vs satellite\n\nInsights\nJun 25, 2026\n][46]\n[\n\n### Wyvern selected for NASA satellite data program\n\nNews\nJun 23, 2026\n][47][\n\n### Wyvern selected for NASA satellite data program\n\nNews\nJun 23, 2026\n][48]\n[\n\n### Sighting the Dark Fleet: Hyperspectral\u2019s Role in Securing Safer Seas\n\nNews\nJun 2, 2026\n][49][\n\n### Sighting the Dark F Instructions\nTo make this component work follow these steps:\n1. Remove the delete-this-class class from the navbar14_component div. This will change the\n   positioning of the navbar to fixed.\n2. Add the navbar-on-page class to the page-wrapper class. This will ensure that the navbar is\n   centered on the page.\n3. Add the max-width-full class to the main-wrapper class. This will ensure all sections inside of\n   the main wrapper are full-wdith.\n[Products][1]\n[Hyperspectral imagery][2][\nArchive\n][3][\nOpen Data\n][4]\n[Technology][5]\n[Industries][6]\n[Agriculture][7][Peace and security][8][Forestry and ESG][9][Energy][10][Mining][11]\nCompany\n[About us][12][Join us][13]\nResources\n[Resource library][14][Knowledge centre][15][\nKnowledge Centre\n][16][\nProduct Guide\n][17][\nOpen Data\n][18][Product guide][19][Open data][20]\n[Partners][21]\n[\nContact Us\n][22][\nOrder imagery\n][23]\n\n# Beyond vision. Into spectral intelligence.\n\n# See every detail, solve any problem.\n\nReveal critical information, track changes quickly, and transform the way you respond\u2014powered by the\nhighest-resolution hyperspectral imaging.\n\n[Explore our imagery][24][\nTalk to sales\n][25]\n\n# Beyond vision. Into spectral intelligence.\n\n# See every detail, solve any problem.\n\nReveal critical information, track changes quickly, and transform the way you respond\u2014powered by the\nhighest-resolution hyperspectral imaging.\n\n[Explore our imagery][26][\nTalk to sales\n][27]\nImportant:\nIf you rename this component, remember to update the classes in the HTML embed named\nlayout423_hover-content. Background colors for cards are controlled by selecting the card element\nand editing via the Interactions tab.\nApplications\n\n## Data for decisive action\n\nOur hyperspectral imagery is helping vital industries reduce risk, optimize resources, and unlock\nsolutions to the world\u2019s toughest challenges.\n\n[\n\n### Agriculture\n\nClassify crops with precision, detect disease early, and accurately forecast yields.\n\nLearn more\n][28][\n\n### Peace and security\n\nEnhance detection, identification, and monitoring in complex environments.\n\nLearn more\n][29][\n\n### Forestry and ESG\n\nMap species, monitor forest health, and stop threats before they become widespread.\n\nLearn more\n][30][\n\n### Energy\n\nRapidly map and analyze resources, reduce infrastructure downtime, and speed remediation.\n\nLearn more\n][31][\n\n### Mining\n\nReduce costs and improve safety from early exploration to post\u2011closure rehabilitation.\n\nLearn more\n][32]\nOur Technology\n\n## Unprecedented precision\n\nWyvern\u2019s hyperspectral imaging identifies materials and detect subtle environmental shifts with\nincredible accuracy.\n\nIndustry-leading 5.3 metres ground sampling distance at nadir\n\n31-band VNIR imagery\n\nResearch-grade calibration and atmospheric correction\n\nFrequent revisit with global, 5-satellite coverage\n\nFlexible tasking capabilities\n\n[\nExplore our imagery\n][33]\nThe Wyvern Advantage\n\n## We\u2019re up for the task\n\nWyvern launched the world\u2019s first commercial hyperspectral satellites in 2023, making the\nhighest-resolution hyperspectral imaging available at scale.\n\n### Our products\n\n### Our company\n\n### Our technology\n\n### Delivering commercial data now\n\nWe\u2019re the only commercial provider with a \u00a0ready-to-task constellation, and ample imagery available\nthrough our growing archive and open data program.\n\n[\nExplore Our imagery\n][34]\nImage credit: AAC Clyde Space\n\n### Hyperspectral for all\n\nWe focus solely on making the highest-quality hyperspectral imaging accessible and easy to use,\nempowering more people to build a sustainable future.\n\n[\nExplore Our company\n][35]\nImage credit: Loft Orbital\n\n### Trusted worldwide\n\nProudly Canadian, organizations depend on us for steady partnership, and reliable, secure data\nthat\u2019s proving its value across the planet.\n\n[\nExplore Our technology\n][36]\n\n## Trusted by teams shaping the future\n\nCompany news\n\n## The latest from wyvern\n\n[\nView all\n][37]\n[\n\n### Dragonete-004 hyperspectral intelligence from Orbit\n\nnews\nNov 6, 2025\n][38]\n[\n\n### Wyvern and Nara Space partner to expand access to hyperspectral data across Asia\n\nnews\nSep 29, 2025\n][39]\n[\n\n### Open Data Program feature: Harmful algal bloom detection with Wyvern hyperspectral imagery\n\nInsight\nJun 23, 2025\n][40]\n[\n\n### Celebrating Earth Day at Wyvern\n\nNews\nApr 22, 2025\n][41]\n[\n\n### Dragonete-004 hyperspectral intelligence from Orbit\n\nnews\nNov 6, 2025\n][42]\n[\n\n### Wyvern and Nara Space partner to expand access to hyperspectral data across Asia\n\nnews\nSep 29, 2025\n][43]\n[\nView all\n][44]\n[\n\n### Hyperspectral imaging for military surveillance: airborne vs satellite\n\nInsights\nJun 25, 2026\n][45][\n\n### Hyperspectral imaging for military surveillance: airborne vs satellite\n\nInsights\nJun 25, 2026\n][46]\n[\n\n### Wyvern selected for NASA satellite data program\n\nNews\nJun 23, 2026\n][47][\n\n### Wyvern selected for NASA satellite data program\n\nNews\nJun 23, 2026\n][48]\n[\n\n### Sighting the Dark Fleet: Hyperspectral\u2019s Role in Securing Safer Seas\n\nNews\nJun 2, 2026\n][49][\n\n### Sighting the Dark Fleet: Hyperspectral\u2019s Role in Securing Safer Seas\n\nNews\nJun 2, 2026\n][50]\n[\n\n### Seeing What Others Can\u2019t: How Hyperspectral Data Is Changing Maritime Domain Awareness\n\nInsights\nApr 14, 2026\n][51][\n\n### Seeing What Others Can\u2019t: How Hyperspectral Data Is Changing Maritime Domain Awareness\n\nInsights\nApr 14, 2026\n][52]\n[\n\n### Rosette: A Name With a Bigger Meaning\n\nNews\nMar 8, 2026\n][53][\n\n### Rosette: A Name With a Bigger Meaning\n\nNews\nMar 8, 2026\n][54]\n[\n\n### Announcing a strategic investment in Wyvern from NordSpace\n\nNews\nFeb 26, 2026\n][55][\n\n### Announcing a strategic investment in Wyvern from NordSpace\n\nNews\nFeb 26, 2026\n][56]\n[\n\n### What We Learned Talking to Mining Operators About Reclamation\n\nInsights\nFeb 13, 2026\n][57][\n\n### What We Learned Talking to Mining Operators About Reclamation\n\nInsights\nFeb 13, 2026\n][58]\n[\n\n### Hyperspectral Precision Agriculture: Fertilizer Optimization and Yield Forecasting by Wyvern x\n### Messium\n\nWhitepaper\nFeb 1, 2026\n][59][\n\n### Hyperspectral Precision Agriculture: Fertilizer Optimization and Yield Forecasting by Wyvern x\n### Messium\n\nWhitepaper\nFeb 1, 2026\n][60]\nAccessible knowledge\n\n## Hyperspectral Resources\n\n[\n\n### Knowledge centre\n\nExplore our open information base for working with Wyvern hyperspectral imagery.\n\n][61]\n[\n\nHyperspectral basics\n\n][62][\n\nTutorials and code\n\n][63][\n\nHyperspectral index library\n\n][64]\n[\n\n### Product guide\n\nGet detailed specs for our range of hyperspectral data products.\n\n][65][\n\n### Open data Program\n\nDiscover and experiment with free hyperspectral imagery from our constellation.\n\n][66]\nProducts\n[Hyperspectral imagery][67][Archive][68][Open Data][69]\nIndustries\n[Agriculture][70][Peace and security][71][Forestry and ESG][72][Energy][73][Mining][74]\nCompany\n[Our technology][75][Our partners][76][About us][77][Join us][78][Contact us][79]\nSubscribe\nJoin our newsletter to stay up to date on all things Wyvern.\nFirst name\nLast name\nEmail\nBy subscribing you agree to with our [Privacy Policy][80] and p"
